window.KijiDictationReadingManifest={"schemaVersion":1,"questions":{"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:099deea388f7be7d077529cc4f60796417acda7d6d24532c27fd7a1b365f8218","timelineVersion":"sha256:c8daf8462623e95d1e03d96838a34aa68836161286aba05bc2f9b2fb79f5e425","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html"],"batch":"2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:question","text":"一番：大学で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b2b21f825979d9a915c49dbc3a70150b91965a115a1a4cd44ba5ac4bffb0f0cb","audioVersion":"sha256:099deea388f7be7d077529cc4f60796417acda7d6d24532c27fd7a1b365f8218","timelineVersion":"sha256:c8daf8462623e95d1e03d96838a34aa68836161286aba05bc2f9b2fb79f5e425","start":3.64,"end":13.94,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-0","text":"青木さん、何見てるの？","textVersion":"sha256:ffc09476c164a618dd45b9188e8537af6182f39a5a2807e037fa3eb75fbd7535","audioVersion":"sha256:099deea388f7be7d077529cc4f60796417acda7d6d24532c27fd7a1b365f8218","timelineVersion":"sha256:c8daf8462623e95d1e03d96838a34aa68836161286aba05bc2f9b2fb79f5e425","start":15.28,"end":17.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-1","text":"ああ、これ？アパートの情報が載ってる雑誌。今アパートを探してるんだ。そういえば、山田君って最近引越ししたんだよね。どうやって部屋探したの？","textVersion":"sha256:e8f25a9e9a7f12dfe3655d5c1a483ca81d773812513fffcd1cfa7296cae1b63e","audioVersion":"sha256:099deea388f7be7d077529cc4f60796417acda7d6d24532c27fd7a1b365f8218","timelineVersion":"sha256:c8daf8462623e95d1e03d96838a34aa68836161286aba05bc2f9b2fb79f5e425","start":18.1,"end":32.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-2","text":"そうだな。もちろん、不動産屋にも行ったんだけど、不動産屋に行く前に、家賃とか日当たりとか、気になる条件をノートに書き出して、整理してみたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:29966bb4f63b17992bd5e788330c8d15995e12a1607cc621ea8a3ba46f32ff82","audioVersion":"sha256:099deea388f7be7d077529cc4f60796417acda7d6d24532c27fd7a1b365f8218","timelineVersion":"sha256:c8daf8462623e95d1e03d96838a34aa68836161286aba05bc2f9b2fb79f5e425","start":33.16,"end":44.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-3","text":"それは一応やったんだけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:dc09bd31d9f4f5c6255e5e1743a64f5d14d28933fe721f9f5df29cf449bc4cd0","audioVersion":"sha256:099deea388f7be7d077529cc4f60796417acda7d6d24532c27fd7a1b365f8218","timelineVersion":"sha256:c8daf8462623e95d1e03d96838a34aa68836161286aba05bc2f9b2fb79f5e425","start":44.66,"end":46.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-4","text":"そうなんだ。あと、住みたい町に実際に行ってみるといいよ。運がよければ、歩いているうちに良さそうなアパートが見つかるかもしれないし。住みたい町はもう決まってるの？","textVersion":"sha256:7e9c522d66df9032b918528177daef2be6e7cf91babb7ede9058428490bd3d73","audioVersion":"sha256:099deea388f7be7d077529cc4f60796417acda7d6d24532c27fd7a1b365f8218","timelineVersion":"sha256:c8daf8462623e95d1e03d96838a34aa68836161286aba05bc2f9b2fb79f5e425","start":46.72,"end":60.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-5","text":"うん、一応候補あるの。今日はもう授業ないし、これからちょっと行ってみよう。","textVersion":"sha256:7dbab91c8da0b9064e7af736ef770081cfd69a80fc188a167c70f86ab7c7397a","audioVersion":"sha256:099deea388f7be7d077529cc4f60796417acda7d6d24532c27fd7a1b365f8218","timelineVersion":"sha256:c8daf8462623e95d1e03d96838a34aa68836161286aba05bc2f9b2fb79f5e425","start":60.2,"end":67.02,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"5f7006079900041e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html"],"batch":"2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:question","text":"二番：女の人が友達と話しています。女の人は地震に備えて何をしておけばいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:4c63d6d1ef491c2a6d5804039e1da2397bb37752804832d4f336565af527112d","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":3.64,"end":13.94,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-0","text":"この間の地震、かなり揺れて怖かったね。地震が来た時のために、何かしとかなくちゃって思ってるんだけど、実際にどういうことをすればいいのかな。","textVersion":"sha256:9b6381d9bf892d72bf66486b3bf219e693672b57287539cec945415319f2fc79","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":15.44,"end":27.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-1","text":"やっぱり怖いのは家具が倒れることだから、本棚とか背の高い家具があったら、かべに固定したほうがいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a44eb87933d96da484feb3247129781991519f6e9be91f926b5563fba3e116e9","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":27.48,"end":36.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-2","text":"ああ、でも、うちの家具みんな背が低いから、それは大丈夫かな。","textVersion":"sha256:d3012192c6b6941cebea0448fb3ebc6cea3acf80644bc2378fea4f9267936f37","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":36.24,"end":42.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-3","text":"そっか。あ、それから、避難用のセットがある？すぐ持ち出せるように水や食べ物の入れた袋は必ず用意しといたほうがいいって、テレビで言ってたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:62b8b00498f72045af05b7994b64f14e0e10ca63f2d137bb809b812a698cce1c","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":42.92,"end":54.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-4","text":"あ、それは持ってないな。どこで売ってるの？","textVersion":"sha256:6ae9b1e05791e4029c61089f0227e8784d3e57e975b2fb0399a19effb2e45094","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":54.34,"end":58.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-5","text":"デパートとかにあるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:25a3353d37c8b43cf35e9bd93b0846bcd112f6650bf440baa4f51ebb5e69b73a","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":58.32,"end":59.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-6","text":"じゃ、探してみる。","textVersion":"sha256:43f7e835e958b7429d3c7473960016cc76dc26eca761133bd4e4af7b77e05ceb","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":60,"end":61.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-7","text":"あとは、うちの人と話し合って、家族の避難場所を決めておいたほうがいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a0fb5d8c8e219fa0a0c40fd69c3ef4d4c702e006141de9b82077a193517228e5","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":61.5,"end":67.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-8","text":"あ、でも、今は家族は皆海外に住んでるから、それは関係ないかな。いろいろありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:5b21a2871f3d253ae300c18464e92a37d54d1cc3c7fe3c6f65c37bb3fd40c370","audioVersion":"sha256:6d96a0f76b1e6ac5cc9cb745f3b684496275a960c123a14b6411191f79dfe115","timelineVersion":"sha256:52d01cc828dc9b9a4bd21b68c6f7a0101e917b87b9399bc84cb32caf5b13d070","start":67.42,"end":75.82,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"5f7006079900041e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6f2a9ca3d5eeccc5974cd0cbc1056e151d2a39c4056d7c8b5796624eb28dd651","timelineVersion":"sha256:df3945e3ce193927a8c8e6057286fda8f045d3b9c3843955264cff3929903a35","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html"],"batch":"2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:question","text":"三番：電話で病院の診察の予約をしようと思っています。今日の午後の診察を予約するには、どの番号を押せばいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:39f6ad1cbf1cba95793f97612d366f0c35f5d784563280681483839b58ce79b7","audioVersion":"sha256:6f2a9ca3d5eeccc5974cd0cbc1056e151d2a39c4056d7c8b5796624eb28dd651","timelineVersion":"sha256:df3945e3ce193927a8c8e6057286fda8f045d3b9c3843955264cff3929903a35","start":4.9,"end":16.4,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-0","text":"山川病院自動予約システムです。","textVersion":"sha256:931fcb745d6f9ba7506fb5e2a986530c70751bb3f0bb0b23b9e96e9c8519d9ce","audioVersion":"sha256:6f2a9ca3d5eeccc5974cd0cbc1056e151d2a39c4056d7c8b5796624eb28dd651","timelineVersion":"sha256:df3945e3ce193927a8c8e6057286fda8f045d3b9c3843955264cff3929903a35","start":18.04,"end":21.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-1","text":"最初にご希望のお日にちを４桁の番号でご入力ください。","textVersion":"sha256:c3bf451a77c72e9349746da4fdbc5aabe40091157e70f2e037997d9b5878061d","audioVersion":"sha256:6f2a9ca3d5eeccc5974cd0cbc1056e151d2a39c4056d7c8b5796624eb28dd651","timelineVersion":"sha256:df3945e3ce193927a8c8e6057286fda8f045d3b9c3843955264cff3929903a35","start":21.52,"end":26.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-2","text":"五月三日なら0503となります。","textVersion":"sha256:0f41e06b6ca1601557283db7ea1348b82c9a829f7e5c682bf25572d0edf04542","audioVersion":"sha256:6f2a9ca3d5eeccc5974cd0cbc1056e151d2a39c4056d7c8b5796624eb28dd651","timelineVersion":"sha256:df3945e3ce193927a8c8e6057286fda8f045d3b9c3843955264cff3929903a35","start":27.84,"end":32.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-3","text":"ただし、本日の診察をご希望の方は日にちではなく、0001とご入力ください。","textVersion":"sha256:e2131bb42c61bee6077c0b363eaa87e5fe7d9ed9c9a798ad9aa6a7e4285a268b","audioVersion":"sha256:6f2a9ca3d5eeccc5974cd0cbc1056e151d2a39c4056d7c8b5796624eb28dd651","timelineVersion":"sha256:df3945e3ce193927a8c8e6057286fda8f045d3b9c3843955264cff3929903a35","start":33.66,"end":42.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-4","text":"次に、午前中をご希望なら、続けて01、午後なら02、特にご希望のない方は09と入力してください。","textVersion":"sha256:70b1a19b5068589475f82c34d17c6e9231f065fc924a463801e593ddee678bd7","audioVersion":"sha256:6f2a9ca3d5eeccc5974cd0cbc1056e151d2a39c4056d7c8b5796624eb28dd651","timelineVersion":"sha256:df3945e3ce193927a8c8e6057286fda8f045d3b9c3843955264cff3929903a35","start":44.2,"end":58.3,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"5f7006079900041e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html"],"batch":"2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:question","text":"四番：会社で女の人が男の人と電話で話しています。女の人は同僚の田中さんにどんなメモを書きますか。","textVersion":"sha256:cdc5ef9f8134510907c8487e579cf3390666c1be886f285864f1ff0b27c1901c","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","start":3.6,"end":17.16,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-0","text":"はい、富士出版です。","textVersion":"sha256:bc8db75858a0ea4e2e28c780e309edec4c6730d2e89888b50ab15bac472dd92c","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","start":17.16,"end":20.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-1","text":"お世話になっております。桜印刷の山川ですが、田中さんはいらっしゃいますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0712a4cd97fda6b64ce7900d8dfbd1ae7e1e76cf2044d4050fa16e1b3f9256ee","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","start":20.92,"end":26.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-2","text":"お世話になっております。あいにく田中は席をはずしておりまして、２時からミーティングがあるので、その前には戻る予定ですが。","textVersion":"sha256:40de863970086f821592d490f8bdfad92452b475134f38c9a4997567997a3b43","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","start":26.56,"end":36.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-3","text":"そうですか。実は先ほど、私が留守の間、田中さんからお電話をいただいたようで、明日の会議の件だと伝言があったんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:a9a7ee035136eef0ad5ebdb99b9b589d0282aa705d3ee32e3a362e182403545f","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","start":36.36,"end":45.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-4","text":"そうですか。では、田中が戻り次第、山川さんに折り返しお電話差し上げるよう伝えましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:247f465821cff9054fca2db718295d1047a2767e2dac09b997d2643cef3eed63","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","start":45.8,"end":53.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-5","text":"お願いできますか。","textVersion":"sha256:59770cb29fbf293077d57c91a05696b10584b721534067fd776c6380a1ae1264","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","start":53.88,"end":54.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-6","text":"はい、かしこまりました。","textVersion":"sha256:79dc43467548e6a157566610423880f2bab1218765d4c3294744b2353f642cda","audioVersion":"sha256:ef21f77746dbe4ea1ad9e2d43eb5fdf31d9fcc1743a34557bb511df2e76fed7e","timelineVersion":"sha256:711637b43b6745232762dfe880943b966b791f6b78f1a4a8efbfaa3764bf176f","start":55.12,"end":56.76,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"5f7006079900041e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html"],"batch":"2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:question","text":"五番：大学で男の学生と先生が話しています。学生はこの後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:a8ba226362197bb286c7ccd4c96246439d08424e971b6b91926ccee07156fa0c","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":3.52,"end":15.12,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-0","text":"先生、先日お渡しした論文の件なんですが、見ていただけましたでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6c9ac0252a67af29615c5aa6f919cdcb73ec879d8db425aa83e650f931dec84","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":15.12,"end":23.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-1","text":"うん、よくかけてましたよ。いくつかの字の間違いがあったのと、参考文献の書き方にちょっと気になる点がありましたけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:e075b38de43714fa5df471f2f84335581dfbe9b810297284eda05727c3d49c4f","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":23.44,"end":33.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-2","text":"あ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:688cc368fcc4633fa24fcf881503ca3e1c2828cc1d9b031049dde142f0b7a0b7","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":33.3,"end":34.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-3","text":"あとは、このグラフの値、これで正しいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:f4354f5f91baaf6b1231e35a0ffe2c1cff7a96365789a641cc60316c7f3085d6","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":34.58,"end":40.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-4","text":"えーと、あ、すみません。直したはずだったんですが、古いほうのデータです。","textVersion":"sha256:0dd26950083ed1432ceece99ca72796411df0392880c7d4409e4dc729223c709","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":40.96,"end":49.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-5","text":"大事なところだから、まずはここだけなおして、すぐ見せてください。","textVersion":"sha256:c8e6efe1cd299ecd14acdf0a3ff0893c19c033fa3582145bc128b0aa34dbafbb","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":49.2,"end":54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-6","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":54,"end":55.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-7","text":"あ、それから、今年から提出部数が３部になったから、忘れないでね。","textVersion":"sha256:fe4bfbe1b621582d8e530d5217a912ed9c23f1a374c70f9fa52db70bfac8ddd0","audioVersion":"sha256:8d161d7559d9dadb57e1e1f2ca3aadd1cd90dc12180994d208abafc1be9d91fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:76338e8d438348aafcd478116da2a0bd44cf42590f161bb7ce4bb88386d4e259","start":55.76,"end":61.74,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"5f7006079900041e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:question","text":"一番：大学で女の学生と男の学生が話しています。女の学生はこの後何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:58c4844b56b270f06c662778de7a9556ecc50a7a9a13780a83ecabe8a33b56bf","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":3.9,"end":14.06,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-0","text":"ねえ、経済学のレポート、もう書いた？","textVersion":"sha256:27537fd71c4146ab459afae1c1bea788d1018b303b0dc4ab15052d4a5e8a537f","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":15.86,"end":19.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-1","text":"ううん、まだ途中。","textVersion":"sha256:3a07281dc5293d2acff5b00702981a82cbca411a7627eaed82ce5333c54c52bf","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":19.24,"end":21.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-2","text":"来週の水曜日だよね、締め切り。私、レポートの参考資料が見つからなくて、困ってるんだ。インターネットでちょっと調べてみたんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:d5e22745300d8d2d1ad81251848a4f48516391ef65129ec7c607926a3e43bfc9","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":21.49,"end":32.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-3","text":"僕が先生の言ってた経済学入門って本、買ったよ。最初は僕もインターネットで調べて書こうと思ってたんだけど、やっぱりうまく書けそうになくて。","textVersion":"sha256:a52951c7341016c8cbd04badd065261d0634d85bce34ea2f2a11338bd4d17890","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":32.24,"end":42.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-4","text":"それ、今持ってる？","textVersion":"sha256:cad23f940fff61864aa8d32b4a489bb69b4d51674d84bc6223797690b6c8250a","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":43.28,"end":45.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-5","text":"うん、持ってるよ。これ。","textVersion":"sha256:5e6024c45da210171dc37500f359b566ad3ea2a44892e6862832b01340434c73","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":45.08,"end":48.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-6","text":"ねえ、悪いんだけど、一日だけ借りられない？","textVersion":"sha256:2960b40af0e55552eafdfb2f06e89ac7cdb151a567c322e8821f416a52b853ae","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":49.14,"end":52.53,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-7","text":"あー、今日、僕もこれ見ながらレポート書くつもりだからこの本、図書館にあったから、借りたら。","textVersion":"sha256:9927edc2dd3c181587b4ef514e185bd05273a0cd8654a7390d1cbce54620cf17","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":52.69,"end":60.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-8","text":"そっか、行ってみる。","textVersion":"sha256:fcefb2bc2bccdcc4ead7b0d06efc2a0d1545301e536176688d24a7a33d791da5","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":61.08,"end":62.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-9","text":"うん。授業のノートもけっこう参考になったよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6d6ce9fd3dc651ca7db6e4a41cbd87de810dad4ad1be2134c4edbfc9e9bf5de8","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":62.77,"end":66.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-10","text":"うん、そうだね。わたしも、ノートは見てみたんだ。ありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:1c4080d3df3111717a365eae6919d1aba4502dbb548996379c60e1bb84cdd605","audioVersion":"sha256:e1ae833c95350fcff146b2b8187b16ce805efa8f5e4e86bd0d360f4b0f9d9d96","timelineVersion":"sha256:e440d61f7e9419f2eef007a34aa08e9cf71ae3f7cac12e526c6ffa0019fe18bf","start":66.9,"end":71.99,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"491bd900360eea0b"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:question","text":"二番：会社で男の人と女の人が出張について話しています。女の人はこの後何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:1d95cd941e9b3e5dc68a3cc323a850407502e1dfa3ed5baf1b1f160fb84305c5","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":4.04,"end":15.26,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-0","text":"出張はもう来週だなぁ。出張に持っていく新製品のサンプル、届いた？","textVersion":"sha256:2296c9cb2f20efab023e936eab7d3baa2d23cb586d26f74247d7561fc307540e","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":17.19,"end":23.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-1","text":"いいえ、それがまだなんです。今週中には届くことになっておりますが。","textVersion":"sha256:31e29217f9841fa50f9330e45a408edc46f3a45ab00c45e70b446a8d417c8192","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":23.61,"end":29.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-2","text":"うーん、それじゃ、不安だなぁ。もう一度工場に電話して確認入れといて。","textVersion":"sha256:b38fae1cd968461fe63dbbd249bb78e6f54f6df01067ee97e3dee6e35e87b2f3","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":29.76,"end":35.27,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":35.36,"end":35.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-4","text":"それから、製品紹介の資料。前回は分かりにくいって言われた部分があったじゃない？あそこ、直した？","textVersion":"sha256:7938d709c41354f41cac0a7b5465d133d091b60a677ce267a1e3f691bd0e2d47","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":36.06,"end":43.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-5","text":"はい、修正して机の所に置いておきました。今度はお客様に好印象を持っていただけると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:67350b33a09550a17635f4343270d67088fb0f3848bbd9448a3a27f6a6472c63","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":43.51,"end":51.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-6","text":"あっ、そう。ありがとう。後で見ておくよ。飛行機のチケットは取れてるよね。","textVersion":"sha256:486d8ccbee068e68862e37cf3c12865065e7843f10bd7ca512429213e1d2e78c","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":51.76,"end":56.77,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-7","text":"はい、予約してあります。","textVersion":"sha256:e4b3f79bb2de16016707bcf577a103a89edc8ddfa62518175c8820b85a77ffe2","audioVersion":"sha256:a79d13d0feb4a77ac7a609a56b7477e7a96c478451f1aac26efeaa6c0277ccab","timelineVersion":"sha256:36f32c3a15199a4f8ced2dafb825785b432e9fcdceca634764d58377be53aa6f","start":57.09,"end":58.59,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"491bd900360eea0b"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:question","text":"三番：電話で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこの後どうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:cb2bb2e582f6d91f86633087081861a558fd37de2db94497dfbc292588e1bb3b","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":3.74,"end":13.55,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-0","text":"はい、もしもし。","textVersion":"sha256:30b00b7238bf0aec2a6ea6afa3806078ed3641f25492df635e132a6e70ce2cfb","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":18.32,"end":19.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-1","text":"遅れてごめん。今、どこ？","textVersion":"sha256:8f4d357a55f1c4cc6ae71893652ff04fe9c55589b05c5326b373721e382dcc5a","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":20.3,"end":24.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-2","text":"映画館の前、でも、今日休みみたいだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a55964e21e4405f55eccb75cffa675a6482e0d040b9abf9682d0f578277d4ec2","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":24.5,"end":28.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-3","text":"えっ？","textVersion":"sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":28.82,"end":29.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-4","text":"どうしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:d349f3e1260f1706678d4c52d99a10cfc88afb95eb91d41b61fdb174807c8993","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":29.84,"end":30.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-5","text":"ごめん。調べとけばよかった。ええと、１０分ぐらい歩いたところにもう一つあるけど。","textVersion":"sha256:fddc041f2d3516cd600bb79db14e90378824aed4ec21c76bb5f354cd5331de6e","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":31.22,"end":37.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-6","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":37.78,"end":38.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-7","text":"そこはどうかなぁ。そこはやってると思うけど。","textVersion":"sha256:83d7437852e22d5743a7beeb1d2d03033a00cf61900eea6508d8f9f969e339f9","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":38.56,"end":41.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-8","text":"うん。分からないけど。とりあえず行ってみる？","textVersion":"sha256:c297f0e9106b3d3688d47e162b700d43d8bd4dfe469dc68642bdaf892b2b7d13","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":42.2,"end":46.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-9","text":"じゃ、さき行ってて。場所分かるよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ef03a2bc69553ca84702bb0a4d76c1d6bdfcc6fab33ea3cac5741a6a8ab5d651","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":46.72,"end":49.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-10","text":"えっ、分からないよ。ここで待ってる。","textVersion":"sha256:97122ff725b8c578093443300caedb2c6e96ec170538c81c8c313b966a2abec3","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":49.96,"end":53.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-11","text":"でも、寒いから。いつもの本屋に入ってて。","textVersion":"sha256:ecc826386012ad1da4a73eb829c54b497717feb625cbc788c0b67f86ae08d280","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":53.3,"end":57.09,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-12","text":"分かった。喫茶店の下のところだね。じゃ、後で。","textVersion":"sha256:e9fb667d62cc19baee9b6c7d387a057d4afbcdc5cc5c2a93cb5acccc61bf56f8","audioVersion":"sha256:89fc091c6bd94691117b64bac4944d8f39056e719496b1fb087fe00e3d6e3f50","timelineVersion":"sha256:a93251339ddd38fdcdbcf4c007ac07b6534ee564cc9804ab59d9071e8f8fd282","start":57.09,"end":62.48,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"491bd900360eea0b"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:question","text":"四番：お年寄りの介護施設で女の人が男の人に仕事の説明をしています。男の人はこれからまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:509c35fca40f19606acec6a5902482d03c56cff021b77384f807d06628007b39","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":4,"end":17.24,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-0","text":"おはようございます。本日はボランティアに参加していただいてありがとうございます。最初にお願いすることを簡単に説明しますね。","textVersion":"sha256:697804af4092434fef96133a5a88de3005f1cf9d8344ad50478ff0cc19423069","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":18.78,"end":29.37,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":29.7,"end":30.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-2","text":"今日は木村さんのお世話を手伝ってもらいます。木村さんは車椅子をお使いなので、部屋の移動の時には車椅子を押してください。","textVersion":"sha256:64ce88d3fe7b41b46c433855b53132b1d08b0a4d514512a3b22d777d751ede6d","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":30.92,"end":40.91,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":40.99,"end":41.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-4","text":"散歩がお好きなので、午後にでも一緒に庭に散歩に行ってください。","textVersion":"sha256:ed38eb67c04dafb9e35b6b44ce8318dc0bd60d4ffc9ed1389d7deda08c03fc91","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":42.14,"end":47.67,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-5","text":"はい、わかりました。あのう、車椅子を押すのはあまり慣れていないんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:7eeb6e78a70da1f545a83049a4255ce00d0eca1349da5be91d7808573fe5e33a","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":47.67,"end":54.65,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-6","text":"では、木村さんのところに行く前に練習しましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:a92b290ca528c860d78c68e8839f12f30488973ffa5ea63c535238bd002d3302","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":54.93,"end":58.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-7","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":59.05,"end":60,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-8","text":"それから、昼食の時は隣に座って食事のお手伝いをしてください。","textVersion":"sha256:cab5e014322e473ec0fd0f06ab163fb245fb9ee14513aeb15879771a5e482137","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":60.16,"end":65.97,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":66.13,"end":66.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-10","text":"それと、帰る前に一日の記録をこのファイルに書き込んでください。よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:36fce519acfe6c8a8b365b9e4802a20b4ffe5f90102cee573fe13873846db609","audioVersion":"sha256:a42fad9a9b05f404d00cd4317c75289ae642b359be83eecec4fe803c03248d4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8dda3f88a2db4e0bf5170ddc593f0f2858edcc7e1295d679164518a3b4f618c8","start":66.58,"end":74.56,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"491bd900360eea0b"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2010.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:question","text":"五番：会社で女の人と男の人が研修会について話しています。女の人は参加者リストをどのように直さなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:348e3b07e75b63b589bd2a1e6276e5644836d9d530a830fa4479659f5a8d4540","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":4.1,"end":17.82,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-0","text":"あのう、あしたの研修会の参加者リストのことなんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:a8477fce384f703d83cc9ad201151cbe7e348777a71000e4fb0ad7319e846eae","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":19.54,"end":24.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-1","text":"ああ、あれね、取り消しの人はいないんだけどね、今日参加を申し込んできた人がいたから、付け加えといてくれない？","textVersion":"sha256:d7730fbfbbfa99052888e9a1bd1a59f089408afe4abec9c146de2f3178660ee7","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":24.48,"end":33.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":33.26,"end":33.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-3","text":"それから、あのリスト、参加者に配るんだったよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ea36cef37ae0e9e8ec440026967b837640beb52f947c6f15fac34c42a5df100f","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":34,"end":37.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":37.66,"end":38.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-5","text":"プライバシーの問題があるから、メールアドレスは載せない方がいいんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:f06ebf6a830b0bf2b46468d4d317da7f4ffee524efedba8071bab6dbbe1ed029","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":38.44,"end":43.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-6","text":"ああ、それは今回全員から許可をいただいてます。","textVersion":"sha256:3b94d1061909c76ceb678bceb4daba49c5beba7580e537ee0181fa9db6b90472","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":43.38,"end":47.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-7","text":"ああ、そう。","textVersion":"sha256:7a3f1fb650f093cb9000fbda306eca4af1dfc922e952b4893eea3e73e1e6c7ef","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":47.3,"end":48.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-8","text":"はい。あのう、リストの順番は名前のアイウエオ順にしたほうがいいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:9e02170c9481a00bce813454ce7dc183c6cdc0ddc084e2f826d7143190431a2a","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":48.24,"end":54.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-9","text":"いや、それはいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:fc4e4228d17b6163b2a81a647a7448f08a0045e38913eaaf10962f0fa3d19040","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":54.84,"end":56.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-10","text":"はい、では打ちなおしてお持ちします。","textVersion":"sha256:ac363e08b7713d7fd50f6ff9d55c2ce06e8f0354ae745bad28108dcbab97b48a","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":56.44,"end":59.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-11","text":"じゃ、よろしく。","textVersion":"sha256:d36e24c2a5790122dbdfa7b1660860b83fca67276d72284692ff9767cbc7e615","audioVersion":"sha256:aaf1418980c98f072b05d1171f0975bfa8c295a754b262636a5de752aea1d65b","timelineVersion":"sha256:57186bfee0f2d0a017c93310154b6a6db852505d07b8ce4e59412bc8245065cd","start":59.6,"end":60.52,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"491bd900360eea0b"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:question","text":"一番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこれから何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b2e6960c8e8419bb4999316c03dbf31b640669dc8000664da9a98690074a7536","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":3.78,"end":13.48,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-0","text":"先輩、来週、海外出張なんですが、特に知っておいたほうがいいことってありますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4faaf049fbe22edf3bdc3f4919caa2d306e155297963ec0e1a9b21f159376169","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":13.6,"end":22.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-1","text":"会議の資料の準備はできてるんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:a2ec0d7f2b39652a3a2fbf1f3749639cf88ec89183f0384e66f0a59bbc0465ce","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":22.34,"end":25.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":25.62,"end":26.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-3","text":"会社のパンフレット、持った？","textVersion":"sha256:48586ad2c54fac9a5e8c8cad756c12d8065261b833f0b906fb637964524cc271","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":26.54,"end":29.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-4","text":"あっ、そうだ、うっかりしてました。","textVersion":"sha256:7f9bc69c4b7255462342a717f4ef3222f380f9d8fdf10fe790c53945d2329e8b","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":29.44,"end":32.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-5","text":"それと、名刺は多めに持って行ったほうがいいよ。前に足りなくなって、慌てて向こうでコピーしたことがあるから。","textVersion":"sha256:f3ea28a4474286c74c67131930ebde0f275e0492d0e22694ac36728fe891e548","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":32.2,"end":40.65,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-6","text":"あっ、それは、私も一度失敗したことがあるので、今回はばっちりです。","textVersion":"sha256:ca3b27c81ef656a0fa4b705e0b5048f667d0748038076e1909e455bc91fa68b0","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":40.65,"end":47.67,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-7","text":"後、電子辞書はもってたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:a3d52f42a16eb37b57365f91f7e17e3ee6f064843af47bfa308bab38295b9ea2","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":48.12,"end":50.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-8","text":"はい、大丈夫です。","textVersion":"sha256:4e2b71ef2567f33ec396dd5fdb278aaf38a4b3fc0dae6cbe6f4435bb117ab2d1","audioVersion":"sha256:5f06f17a17e034a3c4d41857a15226f5606d351243b04d92f5180d60424c26b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:9ea80a89d62065994469fae8a0072dcc9d27c62b4678cd858ee448339751dbe4","start":50.36,"end":51.95,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"73abf02acaf4549e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:question","text":"二番：大学で、女の学生と男の学生が話しています。男の学生は最初に何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f672ebbcd62b7196293ba6f11eac6e6ea93b9113f875fb05dc94f0ceaf721055","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":3.92,"end":16.1,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-0","text":"夏休み中、ゼミないけど、休みを間も、引き続きみんなで集まって勉強しない？先生は出張でいらっしゃらないから。ゼミの学生だけで、論文を読んだりしましょう？","textVersion":"sha256:fe5b8d6e4caca05d46986561db4690726b55aee983dd8d69ef364825438eb2d6","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":17.78,"end":31.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-1","text":"はい、ぜひ、みんなもやりたいって言ってました。ええーと、論文はどうしましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:5ff50be0951fca5c6570260e8d8f3b12a77b1ff7dade31f8e6c8a553191f63c9","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":31.1,"end":38.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-2","text":"まずは、先週先生が紹介してくださった論文を読みましょうよ。それでいいなら、私、もう持ってるから、大丈夫。","textVersion":"sha256:840efa27eb6f8ac1ab3efd6dd5d3db42234b45de8c818025d2420c3e01b644cc","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":38.78,"end":47.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-3","text":"コピーしたりするのは、僕、やります。","textVersion":"sha256:c40f802088695dc4d4499ab18af32959ecab72f0144255ebfa491bad4022e562","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":48.06,"end":50.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-4","text":"コピーは人数が決まってからでいいから、それより日程を調整して？","textVersion":"sha256:edfcc7803369a0a0b34ccb6720e01366fc553ad582a455deff1fba35acd96955","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":51.1,"end":57.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-5","text":"はい、分かりました。みんなにメールしてみます。","textVersion":"sha256:2c2d289b223b594b85fe9635079efc10775629a9da5c3a2789b3657b3898b342","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":57.18,"end":61.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-6","text":"うん、よろしく。で、日程が固まり次第、教室確保しておいてもらえる？","textVersion":"sha256:b6942ac0eda1147916cc109643c7a167dd26be323d6455a4c5cf8799916a2fee","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":61.16,"end":67.55,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-7","text":"はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:18d2ff50b951ddb3ce339017a80a9a6dc1c1ce5a19553206efead7a638dd54f4","audioVersion":"sha256:ef5fb838c6607935d05ff573b68958adf406eae1d0511894fbf78e48255182de","timelineVersion":"sha256:785c7f2c29605734c1cfee6cde0a21afc49fd24a53548c05eef27ed4be9b3a18","start":68.18,"end":69.27,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"73abf02acaf4549e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:question","text":"三番：男の先生と留学生が話しています。留学生はこの後、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:51e38dd6e8ac55367e0637ec20043d18ca6ef1e0b71ac23e7b9e76edb3c69ff9","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":4.4,"end":14.19,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-0","text":"この間、出してもらったスピーチコンテストの原稿だけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:e8f6e936fdbd49d6c9c527c0270ca56d1ca395c90149d8877774df3550e8fd38","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":16.14,"end":20.18,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-1","text":"あっ、はい、どうでしたか。","textVersion":"sha256:f0ad581d951a8cc8af3a789358564f0a3ca19711e5834cd126541af1580b0378","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":20.18,"end":22.84,"speaker":"学生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-2","text":"うん、「地球を守るためにできること」っていうテーマは面白いね。自分の経験から話し始めるのはなかなかいいと思うよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6e1dd10d56de448b3f52f836cde531d572d1094a7b1cc866d4592c044ba232c0","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":22.96,"end":32.71,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-3","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":32.71,"end":34.24,"speaker":"学生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-4","text":"でも、スピーチは五分だったよね。","textVersion":"sha256:33348d826084416204cf9e5e621d6f89a195b84c3415e038004314d50fa9572d","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":34.42,"end":37.76,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":37.76,"end":38.66,"speaker":"学生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-6","text":"じゃ、よほど早口で話さないと無理だよ。やっぱり長すぎるなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:ccdb989d5f6c4d3fd1553fc18b56a8b330104ceaae7fa1f29e44c0acd005c19e","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":38.68,"end":45.06,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-7","text":"ああ、そうですか。じゃ、書き直してみます。あのう、文法、自信なかったんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:d951b9e788fc28a5d92f8a5bef9b166c33bd3d82b88098cc2f9d8f125d527126","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":45.06,"end":52.92,"speaker":"学生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-8","text":"うん。特に、目に付く間違いなかったよ。まあ、少し硬い表現もあるけど。このぐらいはいいね。","textVersion":"sha256:35312a10a9249668ae0634b015ad4c57cc7d949e04cef74c8ed646ec9d46dc21","audioVersion":"sha256:02fa4a93cd9392ad8cf4c7bcb5b7a321d417ffdce1ed54a772c8f4d15e122451","timelineVersion":"sha256:fbeb425eb19397546f227e8d8d5b99041661ba2937b92c9a272d8d00f3fffede","start":52.98,"end":61.56,"speaker":"先生"}],"batchVersion":"73abf02acaf4549e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:question","text":"四番：映画館の窓口で、女の人は料金について聞いています。女の人は全部でいくら支払いますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a1cb69b344ec622da23692b3bb08539ab92ee8c82e7f422e8abe06bbf81a20c5","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":4.18,"end":15.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-0","text":"すみません、大人二人、子供二人なんですが、あのう、チケットで、いくらですか。","textVersion":"sha256:ec6666be9aa53e26c60ff577e6755fd0bd318eb46d2b441a65457fd5d483e404","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":16.14,"end":25.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-1","text":"大人が一枚千円、四歳以上、十五歳以下のお子様は大人の半額になります。","textVersion":"sha256:bca031123a0e9325ce1eadf20cc0102ec0a00735b177e5e8b2abe4d33f846c77","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":25.62,"end":33.35,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-2","text":"じゃあ、上の子は六歳だから、五百円ですね。下の子は三歳なので無料ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:f01f7cf2efed951982e7dab4d80e69adeccdf890359c51532cd0e5f4a0861d3b","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":33.35,"end":42.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-3","text":"はい、四歳未満のお子様でお席をご使用にならない場合はチケットは必要ございません。お席をお使いになる場合は子供料金をいただいております。","textVersion":"sha256:b929c990b9be735ea0362f51c4e94f73595739af9c806336e6cc998fd8ca1700","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":42.5,"end":55.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-4","text":"膝に乗せていればいいってことですね。","textVersion":"sha256:d66ac7136da981a628ef5af3f40f3ab9bfaed592620a950b2adf45d403ec4b32","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":55.72,"end":58.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-5","text":"はい、そうです。","textVersion":"sha256:28d6cd2968d2616b54c1b93972b2a9c22722832435e5f5f1263bb4cfe93e3d23","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":58.66,"end":60.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-6","text":"ずうっとだっこしているのはちょっとつらいかなあ。いいや、五百円だし、この子の分もお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:a49405eb867bcef213bd88c1c46b13b82b3204c52687d25df3cef5b7f16fe35e","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":60.54,"end":68.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-7","text":"はい。かしこまりました。では、チケットは全部で四枚ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:00a3070630a1efa7214639a1803557924e1c0abe7bb77e8bf77fac79dc20cc5a","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":68.52,"end":74.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-8","text":"はい。それは…","textVersion":"sha256:405907c6ea050bd9e65b457f3e1fe47252ec3b171dab143cb35256988e001651","audioVersion":"sha256:369bec11b6440270221a04edaab7b4374bb9b246e0a4c14c01e8a5e7e5eae21d","timelineVersion":"sha256:c10b66dacbbf3ee01d19215786507605fe3f3e762cd84e2b6906a5796f41a411","start":74.78,"end":76.02,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"73abf02acaf4549e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:question","text":"五番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:92c4961bb0cabac3f66e353e3f03cebe5d1f52c9501f8d9503fb889c62dc5fe3","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","start":3.8,"end":15.43,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-0","text":"あしたの東事務所との打ち合わせのことなんだけれど、僕、その前に別の会議が入ってて、少し遅れるかもしれないんだ。その時は、悪いけど、先に話を進めといてくれないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:723003ba44476743f7b14bcb39668c0a9c66f20e1c00c5d00f05e203899ab6a0","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","start":16.98,"end":30.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-1","text":"あっ、はい、この前の続きからということでよろしいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:93daa4379126f9e537681a1288aded8ad24e8589030c6ae1c5a4b8a19c090ee4","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","start":30.84,"end":35.85,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-2","text":"うん。メールで資料が届いてたんだけど、特に変更点なんかはなかったね。でも確認はしといて。","textVersion":"sha256:04489a7be5d3ab85e414a1258b90c4949a68dcf15a6e54c2a7e016820c18f879","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","start":35.85,"end":43.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-3","text":"えっ、私のところにはメール、届いてませんけど。","textVersion":"sha256:7db4b0add7cce5b59c75c70ed559e750b50e83a08b909f908db7ce464fa4fb2a","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","start":43.72,"end":48.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-4","text":"えっ、そうなの？じゃあ、急いで送るよ。","textVersion":"sha256:7ad38f5e7b4b3be1ab1bb7bcb5ced196dcd39d59aa24d1fff90c8c31ab0badcd","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","start":48.68,"end":52.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-5","text":"お願いします。すぐ見ておきますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:174bb2f6540f7664b411a33accbcff7da894690dd8d3c7fd162d97ec8f7cd229","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","start":52.62,"end":55.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-6","text":"そんなに遅くなることはないと思うけど。何かあったら、携帯のほうに連絡して。じゃよろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:5f53a2e8e3aaf58bb6d5f9b1c22b50921761ca9500d90a2964aeb219423e0cc9","audioVersion":"sha256:59715a10fb684975ffe34d003593358fac8d7a4240a3c3adc5e179b4eaa2efc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b604aa9a4ea1932e33afd2cdf3a3f59dffc5bf380823613d4fb1ae6677615b","start":55.3,"end":62.4,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"73abf02acaf4549e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:question","text":"一番：会社で、男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1ff44666b453bee2d9ee007bd4361ca93705c6484f58f3cd0f9aed91936b684c","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":4.04,"end":13.66,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-0","text":"田中さんが今月いっぱいで退職するから、みんなで何かプレゼントしようと思ってるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:b07d1094425ae46f08516153f499ee04c980bf10bddf797cd45731e26fb0c471","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":15.54,"end":20.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-1","text":"ああ、いいですね。何がいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:1486bd5d0e1bb1fc8f9892adebdcde9e8444b4201de368b80bb8ddfee0c66c48","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":21.1,"end":25.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-2","text":"何かリクエストがあるか聞いてみようと思ってるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:3e963c1a5ef9c807f01a868b87918619af8634b47e866f50753299b12eb0b097","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":25.5,"end":28.45,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-3","text":"田中さんって、何かほしいものないって、直接聞いてもいいですって言いそうですし。","textVersion":"sha256:096b37b4cc8205e0ff1cf222b481498c68259c04cee0fadab80ed11af64818dd","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":28.98,"end":35.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-4","text":"あっ、そうそう。この前、鍋のいいのがほしいとか言ってなかったっけ。料理教室に通い始めたからって。","textVersion":"sha256:f254c8d43621a463941f72d078193271170dc9715c7247ca16cc1f0cba436920","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":36.08,"end":43.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-5","text":"そうでしたね。","textVersion":"sha256:82b18c52bbcdb9cc44245a42eec0ed106aa3f55c405d90542952512554a3324c","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":44.29,"end":45.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-6","text":"ああ、でも、もう買っちゃったってこともあるから。それとなく本人に探ってみてよ。それでまだだったら、鍋にしようよ。","textVersion":"sha256:73cf6c1cc766fe205bef3d17f9ac328bf6177065102e8346ed2c9dc0fd328708","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":45.78,"end":54.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-7","text":"そうですね。今日のランチの時にでも〜。","textVersion":"sha256:9a2f6ca8a81787c32b29b954a3698623e50c1734374e7da3e9c5381c371456a9","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":54.24,"end":57.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-8","text":"うん、頼んだよ。プレゼント代はその後でみんなから集めて、もしお金が余ったら、それで当日花を買おう。","textVersion":"sha256:3f7ed4c929ef3ecf131a369c05c94bd5c844be54b27c07df8df8bc6b3c904ae1","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":57.38,"end":65.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-9","text":"はい、花の注文も私のほうでします。","textVersion":"sha256:85763edf9b16f3333afd766340642afceeb07b0c6cc9755d23f116ec4bee1df6","audioVersion":"sha256:6459dc54d8251a8932e1864ba7031f3d947edfd23de8ea7796e1b82b5d6c29a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1652dcc8ad99f630d8e903858a329b8d828e0f5fd1897e254e0e06b41a03c465","start":65.96,"end":69.2,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"7938b425147eaf98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:question","text":"二番：男の人がスポーツクラブに電話をしています。入会の申し込みの時、男の人は何を持って行かなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:6945f46119cdbcd2bcaa00984ed19ed593c82de0920735047b3ee6ed3e5b5053","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":3.96,"end":15.4,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0","text":"すみません、そちらのスポーツクラブに入会したいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:96a3475dca94acee5c587d01219c2e07d14f21630632bc7b634f4c2bb56d5689","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":17.24,"end":21.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-1","text":"はい、ありがとうございます。では、一度こちらにお越しいただくことになりますが。","textVersion":"sha256:7007fb275d54a9fe29cbf0499ce96ba28172f7949bd2c1075876262b3be86a85","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":21.06,"end":27.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":27.32,"end":27.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-3","text":"こちらに入会申込書がございますので、来ていただいたときに、ご記入をお願いいたします。申込書には写真が必要ですので、一枚お持ちください。","textVersion":"sha256:22faf3b061269b24694e31950175a8cc36e45f143de86df96f8b9dd4bb42a016","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":28.52,"end":40.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":40.24,"end":40.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-5","text":"それから、身分を証明できるものもお持ちいただけますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e529c9c375aae5594febec93c61eb18f673d432ddff1b23905e15c2b32798520","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":41.24,"end":45.27,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-6","text":"運転免許証でいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:070b57af2c6a21a463b46a0635603ccce2056c15af85f899bd5224fe17447ef9","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":45.54,"end":47.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-7","text":"はい、けっこうです。それから、申し込み時には入会金3000円をいただくことになっております。","textVersion":"sha256:cd62f865736b0f5095b2ba9d87f718d26b3bbd9393f4dbd942ba40680bbe107a","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":47.44,"end":55,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-8","text":"すみません。会員の紹介があれば、払わなくてもいいって聞いたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:0d188838ed4690ae67002622eb000f7766bc7ffb87f4984fe757b4ea61287a95","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":55.27,"end":60.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-9","text":"失礼いたしました。その場合は、申込書にその方のお名前を書いていただければけっこうです。","textVersion":"sha256:0d4df3a985a1ce0fa7fd9948c690f8c49e7d78dc5652cd287bda2f08fa503b73","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":60.6,"end":67.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-10","text":"分かりました。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:7af03e22e150440e83d60f0330e3d4f4576a96d293caf6cbafd1ad54eac82e62","audioVersion":"sha256:8acf10f3a156f176f21631b49cc7833309f766092b5fe0d718495a55ba9b2616","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e52060044915e533220a53557f77786f790a91d4ac2c20c6bea83a36b26245e","start":67.55,"end":69.9,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"7938b425147eaf98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:question","text":"三番：会社で、男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人は次に何を考えなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:ce7570e4555b13263cad02e8a3ddc7f5a2d38f0d514ecfb402197bf4e6c90b6a","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":4.62,"end":14.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-0","text":"部長、ペットボトル入りのお茶の新商品の件なんですが、今、ちょっとよろしいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:53d61ad12acaebcdc4bf5ef2ef769a14650b67d2cde7867d3eb77aeaa7443994","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":16.14,"end":22.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-1","text":"ええ、前回の会議で話した件ね。","textVersion":"sha256:d639b2ee519379c5bafa1cdd01355c5bc467d9f5eee4a32749058a68948e1206","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":23.18,"end":26.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-2","text":"はい。ペットボトルの形を通常の細長い形ではなく、コーヒーカップのような取っ手のついた形にできないかという話でしたので。","textVersion":"sha256:24d391042948bbb3638030cabac2812fb8de1e124a36de7690ee1ccb67a1a7cf","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":26.22,"end":36.25,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-3","text":"ええ。","textVersion":"sha256:30224d71f95afa967c387b6513d7bcc534c393cc15c36334b132286ff5d66c36","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":36.48,"end":37,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-4","text":"実際に作れるのか、ボトルのメーカーに問い合わせてみたところ、技術的には可能だそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:e63713f67be62fe68f917c3d2dbe225fa5b3410c9df939a1a1c38cc256f5f03a","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":37.38,"end":43.59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-5","text":"そう。お茶は商品の種類が多くて競争が激しいから、新しい形で特徴が出されれば面白いわね。で、開発にかかるコストは？","textVersion":"sha256:8b8d2d5ed47c7f0abed52aaf10b2ccb13229bbc5ede9fe1d61795a67e59cd7cf","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":43.86,"end":54.19,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-6","text":"予算内に収まりそうです。早速、ラベルの検討を始めたいと思いますが、よろしいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:d99636132e5434a4a16356f05e6ba04913c45e87119c80dae3cbad5d00b12dac","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":54.46,"end":60.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-7","text":"ちょっと待って。容器の形がこれまでとは違うから、自動販売機では売れないでしょうし、この形をいかすにはどうやって売ればいいか、それが問題ね。","textVersion":"sha256:a5115aaa094978f62020cdd9c4371cc1cd3ed6fb02afb75a40641a35670062c8","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":61.22,"end":72.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-8","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":73.08,"end":74.11,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-9","text":"次回のミーティングまでに、その点を検討しておいてもらえる？","textVersion":"sha256:4efe619caf076f0c5044d82047abcdb4bd7e1164108c104de06afad33db54236","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":74.33,"end":77.91,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-10","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:ad73cdf3a20773579671ec16ee83b59f64e39fe6b38ce2ff2e66507017d193a8","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f18815ef6512e935d58ffc20af5cc3505246a69aeb58c5c9b9f3846f7a4af9f","start":78.08,"end":78.9,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"7938b425147eaf98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c096a3ec5bc421c707508df63b01f8d45dbd7217b914ffc5a1d919961a6c5ea5","timelineVersion":"sha256:f56e108d7a63b899e7719ff90b0f34cb2ee4324d5c7937c86db8e938cc46315b","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:question","text":"四番：同じ会社の人から、留守番電話にメッセージが入っています。メッセージを聞いた人はこの後すぐ、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:e35c8c279ed71ccb208f35202f4f37f9d4c3a84854ab383c5d3ab1de20e6cbb6","audioVersion":"sha256:c096a3ec5bc421c707508df63b01f8d45dbd7217b914ffc5a1d919961a6c5ea5","timelineVersion":"sha256:f56e108d7a63b899e7719ff90b0f34cb2ee4324d5c7937c86db8e938cc46315b","start":3.68,"end":16.26,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0","text":"あのう、佐藤です。","textVersion":"sha256:beb9e3ae58ab74da33aa41d543494f35fd488a83eb55d2bef92049179130c104","audioVersion":"sha256:c096a3ec5bc421c707508df63b01f8d45dbd7217b914ffc5a1d919961a6c5ea5","timelineVersion":"sha256:f56e108d7a63b899e7719ff90b0f34cb2ee4324d5c7937c86db8e938cc46315b","start":19.94,"end":21.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-1","text":"お疲れ様です。","textVersion":"sha256:cfa4d40e2eb6acd36a22f8bd9a2d4847cf95720f8bc06aa5a2787eb41adf8e84","audioVersion":"sha256:c096a3ec5bc421c707508df63b01f8d45dbd7217b914ffc5a1d919961a6c5ea5","timelineVersion":"sha256:f56e108d7a63b899e7719ff90b0f34cb2ee4324d5c7937c86db8e938cc46315b","start":21.6,"end":22.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-2","text":"先ほど緑デパートの林さんから新商品の発売についての予定表を送ってほしいと連絡がありました。","textVersion":"sha256:d7eba7ec2d2151fbbd21f6bfac0dd8d380018313c3f3f6b0cf5abc7451971f3d","audioVersion":"sha256:c096a3ec5bc421c707508df63b01f8d45dbd7217b914ffc5a1d919961a6c5ea5","timelineVersion":"sha256:f56e108d7a63b899e7719ff90b0f34cb2ee4324d5c7937c86db8e938cc46315b","start":23.14,"end":32.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-3","text":"それで、私のほうから、メールで送付したんですが、再度ご連絡がありまして、何点か内容を確認したい箇所があるそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:0a66b5daeec2d665b2ad402a341dc7ae1dfe14f693446102186ad8a5233a6e67","audioVersion":"sha256:c096a3ec5bc421c707508df63b01f8d45dbd7217b914ffc5a1d919961a6c5ea5","timelineVersion":"sha256:f56e108d7a63b899e7719ff90b0f34cb2ee4324d5c7937c86db8e938cc46315b","start":32.18,"end":43.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-4","text":"外出するので、携帯のほうにかけてほしいとのことです。","textVersion":"sha256:405f00a4a4220af0142f8b86b6e002cce36b7096df6a675da67d3922c96eb621","audioVersion":"sha256:c096a3ec5bc421c707508df63b01f8d45dbd7217b914ffc5a1d919961a6c5ea5","timelineVersion":"sha256:f56e108d7a63b899e7719ff90b0f34cb2ee4324d5c7937c86db8e938cc46315b","start":44.08,"end":48.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-5","text":"林さん明日から海外出張だそうですので、至急お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:db00a0e103ce7928fec5c9d910251782b0db972c11971683db57f3dc1e3d8f3b","audioVersion":"sha256:c096a3ec5bc421c707508df63b01f8d45dbd7217b914ffc5a1d919961a6c5ea5","timelineVersion":"sha256:f56e108d7a63b899e7719ff90b0f34cb2ee4324d5c7937c86db8e938cc46315b","start":49.02,"end":54.2,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"7938b425147eaf98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:question","text":"五番：大学の実験室で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。女の学生はどの薬品の容器にラベルを貼りますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8749e82d8558aafc4ecc0de0be93a23b8a11f64cc1250e08f8364d9379bb48cb","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":4,"end":16.55,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-0","text":"鈴木さん、昨日作ってもらった四種類の薬品なんだけど、反応を見てくれた？","textVersion":"sha256:609c8523e87e8fedc5c381c1221d14664d2815ee66c31af11c4711302a210613","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":18.1,"end":23.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":24.15,"end":24.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-2","text":"四つのなかで一番いいのを次の実験で使いたいんだ。反応はどうだった？","textVersion":"sha256:7bbdff92c0b133e352e4fbb230dd1b3b575ac21155ac019928f0e00a47e77041","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":25.16,"end":30.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-3","text":"えっと、一番のは紫に、二番と三番は赤に、四番は薄い紫になりました。でも、三番は色が変わるまでに時間がかかって、四十五秒ぐらいでした。ほかは十秒以内に反応したんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:afbc14a2b38e30cb37a6750deb7ccc043c9575c9abdd16732d512f0b5ee26d4d","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":30.8,"end":51.35,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-4","text":"そうか。次の実験に使いたい薬品は赤く変化するものなんだけど、反応が早いもののほうがいいね。","textVersion":"sha256:7fa7e7a82c10061878a94595f44b1a78bbf2499b3a3db4c237bdeb79cfd6874e","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":51.5,"end":60.09,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-5","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":60.38,"end":61.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-6","text":"使うものにラベル、貼っといてね。","textVersion":"sha256:3d48e149edeb10e0420c536011cd5c56d3adcfe1b0785658fd0f226fe016c6d2","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":61.75,"end":63.57,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-7","text":"はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:18d2ff50b951ddb3ce339017a80a9a6dc1c1ce5a19553206efead7a638dd54f4","audioVersion":"sha256:ad93f202ee1189f74b26e414340181fb2c5803ba215137fefae74db47edf18ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:8202b34f90e3847fefc0a09243b8454d2b447d827be8b838b50facbfbd706a5f","start":63.82,"end":65.24,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"7938b425147eaf98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:question","text":"一番：大学の事務室で、男の学生と係りの人が話しています。男の学生は交流会当日何を出しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6af44d3f2acf15037a80de59c01100b6e462ebb5a269ba3db3f8cfb3042d0254","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","start":4.22,"end":16.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-0","text":"来月十日に開催される学生交流会に参加したいんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:9bdc0841fe25f9c8666e1f8a67b3f54033f15e8a84d2c2e1dda4d5b1421fea3d","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","start":18.44,"end":22.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-1","text":"はい、それでは、この申込用紙に記入してください。それから、参加費として500円お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:30a2735c8128854b235add3621b1754149fd5cf33534967520c243a8fc7545ac","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","start":22.84,"end":30.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-2","text":"申込書、これでいいですか。それから、500円っと。","textVersion":"sha256:9a7d28e8805b4e1073b3224315c40c985d30c76ead2e6e85e596a06c081a449d","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","start":31.34,"end":35.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-3","text":"はい、確かにお預かりしました。それでは、こちらが領収書です。これはチケットの代わりになりますので、会場へ入る際に必要になります。忘れずにお持ちくださいね。","textVersion":"sha256:cfe7b02fdfe5d64b29f24caf07d7e0af72836d0ec1693c0b57f4bd3c484c417a","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","start":35.62,"end":48.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","start":48.42,"end":49,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-5","text":"それから、交流会当日、参加者の紹介を載せた印刷物を配りますので。事前にこの用紙に簡単な自己紹介の文を書いて出してください。今月中にここに持ってきてくださいね。","textVersion":"sha256:029ae31d241d4022a75be85439ffd84c930d3c3f4db533484b1cbe697a98f105","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","start":49.2,"end":63.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-6","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:af0f7a91f702fd533696febf17ca22c8a20f6bd7d147fa62aee4199c91ab35d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0ab3e9ac855653d1bbecab48a0577b9ca9ed8e9620c303d3b117591a51b3e851","start":63.94,"end":65.22,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"853c1652e53e98da"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:question","text":"二番：家で、妹と兄が話しています。妹はこの後何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:0f5badfe779887c59d4262bf5f4688d8d4aa6730a0a078ffb021a43c0da7446a","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":4.12,"end":13.04,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-0","text":"お兄ちゃん、前相談してた会社に応募しようと思ってるんだけど。書類ちょっと見てくれない？","textVersion":"sha256:1d137c1e06bb13be3bc617b37fc8ced4db5eb800ea411628823acce13b257463","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":14.64,"end":21.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-1","text":"いいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:046bb772cd9e25f546af9c083d3f92d9cdec4d705af9945ea7a31a24b1126223","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":21.34,"end":21.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-2","text":"ええと、これが必要書類のリストなの。で、こっちが用意した書類。","textVersion":"sha256:e0a1bed0bd4b312b294b1a52d396fe479ae3547d2e165f8764898681c08a9124","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":22.62,"end":28.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-3","text":"リストのものが揃ってるか確認すればいいんだね。まず、履歴書、これだね。あっ、ここ印鑑が押してないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:b5bdba2245f1219adc7e7b26e50cce193634d2b707d0e819cebee89730182ac2","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":28.42,"end":38.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-4","text":"ああ、本当だ。押したつもりだったんだけど。今押しちゃうね。ん！これでよしっと。","textVersion":"sha256:20809f8bef6166e7294b04b8f0d7e952532b555206e4db7220da8b717eb7035a","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":38.64,"end":46.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-5","text":"で、次の書類は志望理由書。これか。これ、千字以内だよね。それにしてはちょっと短くないかな。もっとたくさん書かないと印象悪いよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f6bd1b12796a80d84d19330d06703cb9f16f7f5272b22c907977db81ddca8886","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":47.72,"end":59.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-6","text":"やっぱりそうか。分かった。","textVersion":"sha256:22fedd183eafacb9ac322d6848eb8e1fcb094298ee6a8e7df4700f4ee5562e86","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":60.02,"end":62.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-7","text":"で、健康診断の結果があって、あれ、成績証明書がないみたいだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:0baf157343b966e71d837be6e4db3d539a0bb5195f1ed2ad79fe519b8d6de72b","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":62.76,"end":69.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-8","text":"ああ、ごめん。成績証明書はこれ。さっきもらってきたところで、入れるのを忘れてた。","textVersion":"sha256:24a90ad62ac712e71be14e652b658b3f879aef3dfe4277b5b4a3c7e7ceaaad7a","audioVersion":"sha256:4411b1c8d0e2b8135371b7021b2ca3c3a826488247ad7cc9c710d5802f077bea","timelineVersion":"sha256:99d1a898ac88b00a0a93fc95eeb3a01943314c56a44467d2e4d022c0e4250a7a","start":69.38,"end":74.92,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"853c1652e53e98da"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:question","text":"三番：病院で女の人が患者の男の人に薬について説明しています。男の人は今日の夜、どの薬を塗らなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:569aed2943cc06346bfd7a6b06b7aa5012e4a9c2294dc1056ec95a731b8b108f","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","start":4.42,"end":18.28,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-0","text":"今日お出しするお薬、こちらになります。","textVersion":"sha256:bf786e01686932aef0f21db6abefed7c33ade2ec80480b8267e72df5b3b99df5","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","start":20.16,"end":21.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","start":22.16,"end":23.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-2","text":"ちょっと多いので、ご説明しますね。ええと、痒いうちは朝と夜。この黒い容器の薬を塗ってから、白いほうの薬を塗ってください。ただ、今日はもうこの黒いのは塗ってありますので今日の夜は塗らないで結構です。","textVersion":"sha256:12ed8fc26d34111a12c9a05f50e1c420b15c97c741ccca7a0a59654dcc373ff4","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","start":24.46,"end":43.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","start":44.18,"end":44.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-4","text":"それで、二三日して、痒くなくなったら、白いのをやめて、この小さい容器の薬に切り替えてください。","textVersion":"sha256:405a376438b52e45204b4bd42477fc65288ce6267077abb068db88a67d8063d4","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","start":45.18,"end":53.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-5","text":"黒いのは続けるんですね。","textVersion":"sha256:9286a5b6d6c25ca6c031e6e0f0bd57a7ccaf20019e2eb5a9bc371f89d412bafb","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","start":54.22,"end":56.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-6","text":"はい。二週間はやめないでください。","textVersion":"sha256:1b6d3b963d46599e0bae5ecfc2fefa071cc43344594fe36e25d2697c5c7376e5","audioVersion":"sha256:a08bbdfc7780ad8248c9495ca26df420fc6809561cd6a0ac7689489af689fec6","timelineVersion":"sha256:4cc02e4b79c7171be61528ac72d7ac8a544bb17814b4f8add384a484d7060c27","start":57.34,"end":59.36,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"853c1652e53e98da"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:question","text":"四番：大学で事務の人が説明しています。新入生は今日、何をしなければなりませんか。今日です。","textVersion":"sha256:4b0b901026f3bfb5fb107e9bec002cd4d4623ffe96baa333fd298f41affb5e24","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":4.38,"end":15.22,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-0","text":"ええ、これから新入生向けの説明会を実施します。","textVersion":"sha256:9f0fa4dae019a5693a50a29574df1088c3dc36c71c1b0d284ca2b2b1905c61bf","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":19.8,"end":23.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-1","text":"まず、学生カードですが、本日、この説明会の後、学生課でお渡しします。","textVersion":"sha256:57e68805b96b5e2a780cfcde8fd8050afd6bb1ad270da26bb1f0c001f5330991","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":24.3,"end":30.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-2","text":"このカードは出席確認に使うほか、図書館で本を借りる時にも使います。","textVersion":"sha256:d9e0a83c0963700cde8361771d51533c68b9483a3f7f31506bd320b04739988e","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":31.6,"end":37.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-3","text":"またこのカードがあれば、大学の中の店で教科書を買う時に割引が受けられます。","textVersion":"sha256:c8173fb056c7fb1ec7d6bb92a5ac2c0f1ee21e02177726fbe0f840d5188bb47e","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":38.94,"end":45.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-4","text":"学生生活の基本となるものですから、今日必ず受け取りに行ってください。","textVersion":"sha256:223a8285df794b4d77bb6712be3a5c4414c06194305c4bb4ae01bfb1e359c9e7","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":46.22,"end":51.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-5","text":"それから、明日以降授業の登録を受け付けます。","textVersion":"sha256:5942c119eb8676385d0837402a49723dc1f8bb248e929b7940dc279d7099c2fd","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":52.44,"end":56.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-6","text":"登録にはこの登録シートを使います。","textVersion":"sha256:4da8c3f625e1db26ca78049c22180dcc01f92daf88a3313f21677d914efe19f8","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":57.34,"end":61.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-7","text":"今から配ります。","textVersion":"sha256:ac93be578e58eeeadb6a9fc489d70c8993b6a6302db47bc0273a1f2e2ff7ff5b","audioVersion":"sha256:68e4b92072e851144716887a7245a57311df5b7ef20456a337900467052386d3","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9a778518b41c731c6ac666dbb0be655beb4969a5ecda020a8fdae74dd56642","start":61.62,"end":63,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"853c1652e53e98da"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:question","text":"五番：男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はレポートをどのように直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:9754539874520c4e83f952bfc9213c01a91c24f7d4a12812ff2395bd418a2ccd","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":3.96,"end":13.9,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-0","text":"先輩、このレポートをもうすぐ提出なんですけど、ちょっと見てくれませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:623e1e52ca7c1ded768ec73f1c0669be672f3b351e967ba721ef3b8269b1596c","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":15.62,"end":20.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-1","text":"うん、いいよ。「労働に対する意識・日本と世界各国の比較」、へえ、面白そうなタイトルだね。グラフもあってわかりやすいね。あれ、データ、ずいぶん古いけど、いいの？","textVersion":"sha256:908eee9a35b602dd10e5ea44fef9a9f8ce7461a1e292f174ae1b2f0c6937505b","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":21.08,"end":38.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-2","text":"それが調査が10年ごとにしか行われなくて、これでも最新なんです。","textVersion":"sha256:cf0171a14ab934006f126a04e8a785bc7a1a13b91114dd14ddb0fe0c41664cff","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":38.42,"end":43.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-3","text":"ふうん、じゃ、仕方ないね。うーん、なんか日本と世界各国の比較っていうタイトルのわりには、比較している国がアジアの3カ国だけっていうのは少なくないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:4e49902e88a60ff57ed14d424dcd3c11ec8f3433f2db08e21c30085d0a71468e","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":43.92,"end":58.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-4","text":"ああ、確かにそうですね。でも、今からデータ加えるのはちょっと時間ないな。","textVersion":"sha256:fcf985f565fdee9cfa0673bb8b61ffcc0cf51deaf609d769b32a4f943677f779","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":58.84,"end":64.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-5","text":"だったら、世界各国じゃなくて、アジアの国との比較にすれば？","textVersion":"sha256:c47d8c418ed98b7cfbee7721704d017aeb68793564c87443a2c6408a93267d15","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":64.82,"end":69.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-6","text":"そうですね。そうします。","textVersion":"sha256:04c4e4199d7bb67667bf3e9ba32a5e0dc386aa6d6236f8a5643e057d084213ad","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":69.98,"end":71.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-7","text":"ほかはこのままでいいんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:35d45b0f9e373b75078e23d46b3270b61099f81d09577ef149fc03b030a32ed7","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":72.04,"end":73.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-8","text":"そうですか。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:57e061b5dcae75732346cc6a2c134de0cc97d3e42af473f90f673ad6985b15a6","audioVersion":"sha256:3680652a89e54d7d677a0a29081e4a11401e255ec5abb5c1c3cf273d435b3294","timelineVersion":"sha256:b474301d3e0c01818ce59ed4d4e0405eeb5ce78f86c783b193429c8649923c9f","start":73.48,"end":75.98,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"853c1652e53e98da"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:fa107e52e5da93c5d7a928bdef2c39177238b4c0bdd2e0dd8a13ae25fe3fd7e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:10614eacd0ebbd6f25da24ec3ccbc37beb87377d80627d8c9a5c4871bf03a4a8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:question","text":"一番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:da12f314904b032ebf90583829cc117879854819a871734dbed2ee92b5c6f6a4","audioVersion":"sha256:fa107e52e5da93c5d7a928bdef2c39177238b4c0bdd2e0dd8a13ae25fe3fd7e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:10614eacd0ebbd6f25da24ec3ccbc37beb87377d80627d8c9a5c4871bf03a4a8","start":3.75,"end":14.42,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0","text":"この棚、ぜんぜん整理してないみたいだね。資料を探すの大変。","textVersion":"sha256:e9c3989176ad1870bb41a60311ae0b11599b04617936ba54a5cc783baac38de2","audioVersion":"sha256:fa107e52e5da93c5d7a928bdef2c39177238b4c0bdd2e0dd8a13ae25fe3fd7e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:10614eacd0ebbd6f25da24ec3ccbc37beb87377d80627d8c9a5c4871bf03a4a8","start":16.25,"end":21.55,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-1","text":"そういえば、1年ぐらい片付けてないかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:ad1b43ae2df8787c6b1b82eb79bab5ecb9015c504653b354495f8f8e164d4e2e","audioVersion":"sha256:fa107e52e5da93c5d7a928bdef2c39177238b4c0bdd2e0dd8a13ae25fe3fd7e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:10614eacd0ebbd6f25da24ec3ccbc37beb87377d80627d8c9a5c4871bf03a4a8","start":21.64,"end":25.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-2","text":"名前すらついてないファイルもあるし、きれいに並べないとね。あのう、悪いんだけど。整理、お願いしてもいい？","textVersion":"sha256:b31487d528d297acf585cdda34131b5f82e899131edbef248499222162e61d11","audioVersion":"sha256:fa107e52e5da93c5d7a928bdef2c39177238b4c0bdd2e0dd8a13ae25fe3fd7e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:10614eacd0ebbd6f25da24ec3ccbc37beb87377d80627d8c9a5c4871bf03a4a8","start":25.38,"end":33.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-3","text":"はい、わかりました。じゃあ、分類しないといけませんね。","textVersion":"sha256:66d2b6231a228f7ff15f7add7546ec2e282c24ff0e38e996be02f44278f9dff0","audioVersion":"sha256:fa107e52e5da93c5d7a928bdef2c39177238b4c0bdd2e0dd8a13ae25fe3fd7e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:10614eacd0ebbd6f25da24ec3ccbc37beb87377d80627d8c9a5c4871bf03a4a8","start":33.82,"end":37.69,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-4","text":"うん。でも、細かすぎると、かえって使いにくくなると思う。分類の仕方をみんなで話し合ったほうがいいかもしれないね。来週のミーティングで提案できるように、考えといてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:280e5d8d96eeb07872701f51220efd41903652b6378b2944c00311a12a771774","audioVersion":"sha256:fa107e52e5da93c5d7a928bdef2c39177238b4c0bdd2e0dd8a13ae25fe3fd7e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:10614eacd0ebbd6f25da24ec3ccbc37beb87377d80627d8c9a5c4871bf03a4a8","start":38,"end":50.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-5","text":"わかりました。じゃ、整理するのはその後ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:f1b60e59edc2beac9c976ed8cd5a7e26d87deec95cd262cbe82fe2cff3a2e8ff","audioVersion":"sha256:fa107e52e5da93c5d7a928bdef2c39177238b4c0bdd2e0dd8a13ae25fe3fd7e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:10614eacd0ebbd6f25da24ec3ccbc37beb87377d80627d8c9a5c4871bf03a4a8","start":50.98,"end":54.54,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a6ad12e0ab65cd86"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:question","text":"二番：電話で、料理教室の人と女の人が話しています。女の人は料理教室に何を持って行かなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f24344525575104c0be8273061cdb27765517d9a54ccb9687cc4fb156de60efc","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":5.13,"end":15.87,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0","text":"もしもし、若菜料理教室ですが…","textVersion":"sha256:9335ea377280a69c6477f7d6ae619997382f812b6fbb195bf6fda0848d7bacca","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":17.79,"end":20.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-1","text":"あっ、こんにちは。","textVersion":"sha256:1f37c680014c35a7b86752b77b2746ecf0d486d52f0ff1f28f4ae92b4fbe4908","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":20.52,"end":21.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-2","text":"この度は料理教室にお申し込みいただき、ありがとうございます。受講料のご入金の確認ができました。本日、会員証を発送いたしましたので、毎回お持ちください。","textVersion":"sha256:f4d5cd61ff4c5a550cd94812893b31148a72af3d31242cfea14d2be3dfc7f9e9","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":22.68,"end":33.59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-3","text":"あ、ありがとうございます。あのう、持ち物のことなんですが、それだけ持っていけばいいんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:23ec2aaac63aee966abaa29e02b4d33d6ded42bf9c6440915971234ee301979f","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":33.98,"end":40.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-4","text":"ええ、材料など、こちらで用意しております。","textVersion":"sha256:5c8c7e7ec24d8514a1b0b4c07c96c450f21fcbf3ea65c33f0abe9fdd18b8d9ae","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":41.22,"end":44.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-5","text":"あのう、包丁とかって…","textVersion":"sha256:1a1a3ce4026528a2f44cc0e4454a52a8b39ec1d95022c4f6df2b1f5b6c57257e","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":44.42,"end":46.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-6","text":"ええ、もちろんございます。エプロンもこちらで用意しておりますが、もしご自分のものをお使いになりたいようでしたら、どうぞお持ちください。","textVersion":"sha256:377267872cd51f19333a6035e327243686ca107873cd2859dceb1023ecf34711","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":46.36,"end":55.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-7","text":"ああ、はい。なんでも揃ってるんですね。会社からの帰りなので、助かります。","textVersion":"sha256:dcee2d569378da0a9e7834f60055f0a733c636bf44ea4e4a78b437514b2603ea","audioVersion":"sha256:5fbd0a0398fe376fc676f21835d7be7a251ae263ce9aabde602cd7921b28bd2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3b5db78217a53b8a0e6ffb58a8272b16ba9eeca92fb60cc98f28c044a7a919b","start":55.58,"end":61.3,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a6ad12e0ab65cd86"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:question","text":"三番：図書館で男の人と図書館の人が話しています。男の人はまず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:74bcb14ffff1090849f184874d34f48f4b8fe3fd5b2964d98a96f8bd22b8b568","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":4.2,"end":14.95,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-0","text":"あのう、ビジネス新時代という本、前に他の本と一緒に返したつもりなんですけど。返してないっていう連絡が来たんです。","textVersion":"sha256:1b32b3ceabfabf5245054c846df9db0b4d498cfb1fdb995a0a7a27c87a51d0fe","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":16.83,"end":25.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-1","text":"あっ、そうですか。ちょっと確認しますので、図書館カードをお借りしますね。ああ、ビジネス新時代ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:8ef598f35aa60f95bef0fd9845413d4ae1bf0186abb8dcc85fa90970c0ae5d39","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":25.42,"end":34.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":35.05,"end":35.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-3","text":"たしかに、戻って来てないみたいですね。こちらのミスということも考えられますので、ちょっとこちらでも確認してみます。すみませんが、ご自宅の方でももう一度お探しになってみてください。","textVersion":"sha256:ab780be265368bbf8e52da4d6f669943a3ef20551eebce6b234bf86b5ae5057e","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":35.71,"end":49.83,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":49.99,"end":50.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-5","text":"それで、もし探しても見つからないということになりますと、申し訳ないんですけど…","textVersion":"sha256:3e442d427c061ce0c6216a919ffcb363a94a83ffeca7f397405c2ebc67cf2a6f","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":50.73,"end":56.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-6","text":"あ、本の代金払うことになるんですね。","textVersion":"sha256:1276cb3f92aa6cb0e61d33feb1a85e753e5ff40588062d3197e28ffe97de1d17","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":56.54,"end":59.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-7","text":"あっ、いいえ。同じ本を買って返していただく決まりになってるんです。細かい手続きはその時あちらの相談カウンターでご説明します。","textVersion":"sha256:ecc1723d7a9b73e489b16b93ffc52c652e45c3afd5e3c0ffaffe54346c4e2291","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":59.89,"end":70.43,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-8","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:f3086de249d07075d5642affd70d9264cc121c5e8cb730e13a10ff3e22058424","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a41f3f89a8fcf13c8af00a487370b8d8092ce7d1621e4795925c65e55c69119","start":70.47,"end":70.84,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a6ad12e0ab65cd86"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:question","text":"四番：電話で、女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はポスターにどのような顔を描きますか。","textVersion":"sha256:cc273e85438d5bec0fea6040c87c4287a53517ecd965ef2fe95f8fa4d90072ed","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":4.75,"end":14.45,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0","text":"えーと、ポスターに描いてもらう絵の人の顔なんだけど、シンプルなのがいいと思うの。","textVersion":"sha256:ded8c4042ed8673aa3a8d3f86a36b5111614491ad6575021c0fcc25b24e0977c","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":16.38,"end":22.57,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-1","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":22.72,"end":23.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-2","text":"丸の中心にちっちゃい鼻と口があって…。","textVersion":"sha256:71be9bccddc11c2f3777dc61f715f4a05d3e40c1c19c22cfb9098db12bf73767","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":23.67,"end":27.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-3","text":"目は点みたいなのでいいの？","textVersion":"sha256:aca71fe12fcae69a6e4fb7a24ad78c2c2bb596e146be8a80840dfbc74bfcb1ef","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":27.63,"end":29.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-4","text":"うーん。点じゃ印象が薄いから、周りに丸を書き加えるといいと思うんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:8d55dd635ecb54bfa5eb6f8e28cf16769f5e3a36afcb8cc8c5b8dff8a01561e8","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":29.93,"end":36.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-5","text":"なるほど。","textVersion":"sha256:e6060d825a6076f13a47cc304d64491b431764116f93db22e8a3eb419858f2a8","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":36.3,"end":37.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-6","text":"それで、目の間隔が空いてると、虫っぽく見えちゃうでしょ？。","textVersion":"sha256:aaa37980a091906bb5df882613b5c95112f86d4872e36d55d82fb62a9fc9e83d","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":37.32,"end":41.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-7","text":"たしかにそうかもね。","textVersion":"sha256:1fe259f2e4070bc9c50e1562dbc214ab7343d0019ec96276353a9285804d9b09","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":41.37,"end":42.73,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-8","text":"そう、だから、寄せる感じで…","textVersion":"sha256:7f5be2e0c7d536e56c5dfd53ff201f318ca7e0b54e622b059f2b1207a013876c","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":42.77,"end":45.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-9","text":"わかった。","textVersion":"sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9","audioVersion":"sha256:08040effe8a2597b4d407a4097b38cd58d394cee353e9c440ebe170495f43c37","timelineVersion":"sha256:3f6b5b5535285af58f6bd978ac463fca59edfde8bea97036bb0f809358c2f6ca","start":45.17,"end":45.77,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a6ad12e0ab65cd86"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:question","text":"五番：市役所で女の学生と職員が話しています。女の学生はこの後、まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f5004f893ee7f8711964bdc9706e5228a6956e8bc3f5528c6142a37e7ce2a2d1","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":3.98,"end":15.1,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-0","text":"あのう、通訳ボランティアをしたいんですけど、申込書、書いてきたんですが、こちらでよろしいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:e7ceb1cf67c73bd53dc4cb71c398dad66dc9ee7da93092e9d6b96d65f60803ed","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":16.94,"end":24.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-1","text":"はい、ありがとうございます。ええと、ボランティアをされる方は活動に先立って、研修を受けていただくことになっております。実は、ちょうど今から研修がありますが、参加されますか。次の研修は二週間後ですので、改めてお越しいただいてもかまいませんが…。","textVersion":"sha256:6d291c7820c8df9eeebd9b38f312e18faf7a95a772eaa5afbbe0bb518f0dd926","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":24.29,"end":43.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-2","text":"今日受けられるんだったら、お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:e044f7b609f7948da40f1c35d13b55016fff0fd93b40a72a4a91205624b8276c","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":44.11,"end":46.45,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-3","text":"はい、大丈夫です。えー、それでは、申込書をちょっと確認させていただきますね。","textVersion":"sha256:63e87c7da44500461f2f5ddfb81c3c0014ba521566232f7d7260f73d1d31e9ef","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":46.9,"end":53.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":54.2,"end":54.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-5","text":"あっ、ここにボランティア可能な曜日を書いていただけますか。","textVersion":"sha256:16c46f84868f6e6dd24fe6a5145663be098ef495a7618d72543629846a18e30b","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":55.58,"end":59.75,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-6","text":"すみません。バイトを始めたばかりで、スケジュールがまだはっきりわからないんです。","textVersion":"sha256:33a6204094bea6d81b6fc08f8f84fb8d57cf48d2ff47d775e353b30eb4684de2","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":60.59,"end":66.21,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-7","text":"じゃあ、そこは後で記入するということでお預かりしときますね。近いうちに、都合のいい曜日お知らせください。","textVersion":"sha256:7188861ffb7872a3221a6a99ad66ba4acfd296438661bac9666495ebbcad2930","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":67.05,"end":74.99,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-8","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:34ebd4be672827dba70fce4013ea1e562109b689240993053dda05e503be53de","timelineVersion":"sha256:8409f484291ae18349f8f0961ad26284444d853501e1d00107e13aaf8f5cb986","start":75.1,"end":75.56,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a6ad12e0ab65cd86"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4959b1206f2770146be158c50cd657f1602f3555db752b4134315ac384804e43","timelineVersion":"sha256:f63f66f191df6b0242ccbef549077bd602b8ae22a91dc4d85dd8bfd9a2c781dd","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:question","text":"一番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人は打ち合わせに何を持っていきますか。","textVersion":"sha256:2b453f04927176831aba5a922d53470b9b623f2fa08f3b0afb7356822fe70c82","audioVersion":"sha256:4959b1206f2770146be158c50cd657f1602f3555db752b4134315ac384804e43","timelineVersion":"sha256:f63f66f191df6b0242ccbef549077bd602b8ae22a91dc4d85dd8bfd9a2c781dd","start":5.34,"end":13.7,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-0","text":"午後から、朝日商事との打ち合わせですよ。持っていくもの、準備できてますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8c4c96120e09312cc9112a8c90d81145dfaef57010467928f198a78ec9f2af28","audioVersion":"sha256:4959b1206f2770146be158c50cd657f1602f3555db752b4134315ac384804e43","timelineVersion":"sha256:f63f66f191df6b0242ccbef549077bd602b8ae22a91dc4d85dd8bfd9a2c781dd","start":17.68,"end":22.99,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-1","text":"はい。提案書とカタログと見積書でいいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:47e55ca649f9afda54e8b2c3f27d343e44ade593905e8af138bfda067eb8a758","audioVersion":"sha256:4959b1206f2770146be158c50cd657f1602f3555db752b4134315ac384804e43","timelineVersion":"sha256:f63f66f191df6b0242ccbef549077bd602b8ae22a91dc4d85dd8bfd9a2c781dd","start":23.2,"end":27.25,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-2","text":"うん、提案書はもちろん、カタログも渡しておきましょう。見積もりは、もう少し話を詰めたうえでのほうがいいんじゃないですか。","textVersion":"sha256:19ddc9a03d885198de4b082e33d5549fe795e12800df31e2d70bbf23f384bcff","audioVersion":"sha256:4959b1206f2770146be158c50cd657f1602f3555db752b4134315ac384804e43","timelineVersion":"sha256:f63f66f191df6b0242ccbef549077bd602b8ae22a91dc4d85dd8bfd9a2c781dd","start":27.36,"end":36.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-3","text":"そうですか。今の段階で出せる数字くらいは出しておいたほうがいいかと思いまして。","textVersion":"sha256:7e0a5672864fe799a0d580dcba8dd7db4ab82be7b9b138a64567d90f6d1ab3fd","audioVersion":"sha256:4959b1206f2770146be158c50cd657f1602f3555db752b4134315ac384804e43","timelineVersion":"sha256:f63f66f191df6b0242ccbef549077bd602b8ae22a91dc4d85dd8bfd9a2c781dd","start":36.78,"end":42.65,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-4","text":"うーん、お金が絡むことは慎重にしましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:251ea8da2b51fd84eba21956546d00d4f34a630220b1b8ebebc2b01ba7225a10","audioVersion":"sha256:4959b1206f2770146be158c50cd657f1602f3555db752b4134315ac384804e43","timelineVersion":"sha256:f63f66f191df6b0242ccbef549077bd602b8ae22a91dc4d85dd8bfd9a2c781dd","start":42.72,"end":46.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-5","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:4959b1206f2770146be158c50cd657f1602f3555db752b4134315ac384804e43","timelineVersion":"sha256:f63f66f191df6b0242ccbef549077bd602b8ae22a91dc4d85dd8bfd9a2c781dd","start":46.48,"end":48.84,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8cc3a632f8eceae6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:question","text":"二番：携帯電話で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこれからどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5ff1d9c11f909177a7b7ab1dc9dfbb42d9192e82ef6ef4b0c57e797589a01e96","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":3.5,"end":13.32,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-0","text":"もしもし。","textVersion":"sha256:0c170454ca9211753d46cef76f50406cf059a634dcb7bf1c19e4273b43ad7d04","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":15.24,"end":16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-1","text":"もしもし、鈴木さん、今どこ？僕、もうコンサートホールの前に着いてるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:edb6761f6bfd93924904723b1f65b55d03c067b53a60cb7d188006cc50b5e9a6","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":16.52,"end":21.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-2","text":"ごめん、電車が遅れてて、今やっと駅に着いたところなの。あと15分ぐらいかかる。","textVersion":"sha256:dc9eb508b06ad81e1fe5ea109cb93b1bd3635144d47df466b07ac7d434697365","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":21.68,"end":28.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-3","text":"わかった。チケット売り場の前あたりで待ってるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:53600d3554963bd1bec7445844dc3ab93367e0e4e48684134304b6841049e78c","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":29.14,"end":32.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-4","text":"悪いけど、先に入口の前で並んでてくれる？今日のコンサートは自由席だから、早く入らないといい席、とれないから。","textVersion":"sha256:9eeb5f71681672bcf5456dc1b49be62006d2852c454cbf46330dfab0215ded1b","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":32.46,"end":41.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-5","text":"でも、僕はチケット、持ってないから、入れないよ。二枚とも鈴木さんが持ってるじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:9754bb50802ec5d5e38b91ce9f00b52c59d9408b33a42e86684a92e7bbd66923","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":41.53,"end":46.81,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-6","text":"大丈夫。ホールが開いて、入場しはじめるまでには着けると思うから。","textVersion":"sha256:1e1d1c76202cb7a572d5f218a201801ed0afa868d80f5f8b3c24309d493b7498","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":47,"end":51.67,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-7","text":"わかった。","textVersion":"sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9","audioVersion":"sha256:5207253d8bf7f5bd6f9ea2f3e4b6496f6279467b55fe31352f5cdd1f4a6f50dc","timelineVersion":"sha256:e87b25ef229ed074d1a7780becc8ee80b4c0be7cae231746a836366c77a0a8da","start":51.93,"end":52.49,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8cc3a632f8eceae6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:question","text":"三番：大学で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:cea473c406ec02e4ac77a9df16cc4b7bed4225c6590a4efbf4373406fef910bc","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":3.5,"end":15.05,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0","text":"来月の勉強会、どうなった？","textVersion":"sha256:9217120b782a1eb6ab970d5fe123a7bc822cda8c0a276d9870ddaa68f64bbcc5","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":16.98,"end":18.99,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-1","text":"来月はいつもの部屋、使えないんだ。工事中で。で、図書館の会議室、借りといたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:73ed55cc6f6cf6b7ba1c9ac09d01f4c39cc9a9fc7d15a3cc167fdab34ca7187d","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":19.62,"end":26.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-2","text":"ああ、そうなんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:abf22c8684eb0c3e1a658c7fb70a59676adb6fb875042df9534d4dab57fc47f6","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":26.76,"end":27.77,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-3","text":"みんなにメール、回しといてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:2a6932cbb7116c1a2b76a4cb635027abc07426b779748f5c4285dd1e91c73485","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":27.98,"end":29.79,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-4","text":"うん、わかった。","textVersion":"sha256:7de8f5a994989a7f004655fa218278afa41de82ac208a18f1f420a3c794b3594","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":29.96,"end":30.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-5","text":"あっ、その前に進行役、一人決めなきゃ。それ、決めないと案内を出せないよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ce96f143ca22ef79efb7b0e8e1d8430b54dd3f1344d8374381409f6e7bfa66a3","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":31.32,"end":37.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-6","text":"ああ、まだやってない人、3人ぐらいいたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ef8c7b68fb51f9aab57be9f0d326b7c73108db40ea92cff4fe48d01febac8b94","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":37.76,"end":41.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-7","text":"うん、新しい会員リストをつくってあるから、それで確認してお願いしといて。","textVersion":"sha256:a2bfab25178b7071368bfac56c47c2faed1d29d56e89256127f91a18d059297d","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":41.26,"end":47.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-8","text":"オッケー。","textVersion":"sha256:97198fa51e119b23837e267e7e73c0c9843c8207188b180f1a89d1d3268f7fe8","audioVersion":"sha256:3006e6c8fd550aadab350bb6a10f76cf22b2727700c1a03c231480238c92a1ef","timelineVersion":"sha256:36aa8473cdb4cdd4c6946277c26e63846f89c012245dc6cf7ebffaefa2ce8c66","start":47.28,"end":47.8,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8cc3a632f8eceae6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:question","text":"四番：大学で係りの人が奨学金について話しています。学生は申請用紙のほかに、何を出さなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:bc085cff00dad6a94f8e5a5f166ac8a386b3a8a1e7ea5be2af7a69de8b7f619e","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":3.5,"end":15.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-0","text":"新入生のみなさん、ご入学おめでとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:0f084e92e7a3010065beb5fa00377816e2a061f4cfe5a4c53c4e649137901f31","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":17.44,"end":21.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1","text":"これから、奨学金の申請に必要な書類について説明をします。","textVersion":"sha256:ba52817052a4f8903d432b640a5e121250b9bb49f2e4a49a6a5915c15d572f09","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":22,"end":27.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-2","text":"えー、まず、今配った申請用紙を見てください。","textVersion":"sha256:83c8f5751c1cbc8b5f0169741bb32215a75257951b4b668b6aa51d0631998331","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":28.36,"end":32.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-3","text":"ここには名前と住所、申請する理由を書きます。","textVersion":"sha256:0fe78af181f0a6ce674543aec2a5246891f52882bd92155e53acf9423b54c1c7","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":33.7,"end":38.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-4","text":"申請理由は選考の際に重要なポイントになりますので、きちんと書いてください。","textVersion":"sha256:2bf9e2f64826f4feb168dc76022f33113fe11eed8767bb076056b58b7d581a6c","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":39.06,"end":45.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-5","text":"学生番号も必ず書いてください。","textVersion":"sha256:fca1fb7cbfc77d99e8e045df8877edad65a8a7c236861ba2600df1a152173820","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":46.38,"end":48.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-6","text":"番号は学生証に載っていますから、間違えないようにお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:1753c5e5f7eb270faac836bef42502d62c97433bbf131dd078226c11b17be591","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":49.2,"end":53.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-7","text":"それから、推薦書が必要です。","textVersion":"sha256:8ef794ffe657293a006f06469f528fa79a26ea36a24e49f6ee05ba43bfad6684","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":53.4,"end":57.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-8","text":"推薦書は担当の先生にお願いして書いてもらってください。","textVersion":"sha256:07bca74054159e2c88aa09bcb04c199ed125c84b301af2be836f0b016aba950e","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":58.32,"end":62.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-9","text":"通常は成績証明書も必要なのですが、みなさんにはすでに高校の時のものを出してもらってますから、今回改めて出す必要はありません。","textVersion":"sha256:17db0f4753ecdab0c1b33ed23208e6824163f4ef78c1196966805539a21b3e2c","audioVersion":"sha256:310191c58dfd7c07faef6331c3c76703b82f721253d79a1be83f75283a04322c","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b27bb339e9c642f5084fc7a003dbc2061fdb70cc46d64f2adff0aca8360773","start":63.36,"end":74.24,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8cc3a632f8eceae6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:question","text":"五番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人は今日これから何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:2ef44d949dd90c9a2de3066434f01a98c90e91760420d567581623301a718af0","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":3.5,"end":14.66,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-0","text":"部長、先日ご一緒した視察の報告書をまとめました。これなんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:a5722b063f3346e38355274f9ff9449ba988bc387c7b98642ea5300cd0293ec1","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":16.24,"end":22.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-1","text":"遅い時間までありがとう。あっ、言い忘れてたけど、ここの数字、後から変更が生じたのよ。","textVersion":"sha256:c591f93c41edbb580c1a42b0d1cc5f256b0e823da292e7f85fd0cf2d9f0a77df","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":22.6,"end":30.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-2","text":"そうですか。では、確認して新しいものを反映させておきます。","textVersion":"sha256:90796606aaab70b075d1a2a13d28da3d9cae2c39961e13f4abcdc70928d1387d","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":31.24,"end":35.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-3","text":"悪いわね。あっ、この報告書の電子ファイル、わたし宛に送ってって頼んでたと思うけど、修正も出たから、送るのは全部修正が済んでからにしてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:acfd2e1de0e5f30f48e13f0e013c81dbaec1d25b6762712f7f947413171ef03b","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":35.76,"end":46.21,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-4","text":"はい、わかりました。それから、これ、部長からお預かりしていた視察のときのメモですが。","textVersion":"sha256:6f3a59816318bacd5236410e076873dfb1089cc04550248ffe2c9042e4c7a8a5","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":46.45,"end":52.43,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-5","text":"まとめてくれたなら、もう要らないわね。個人情報もあるし、帰る前にシュレッダーにかけて、捨てておいてください。","textVersion":"sha256:aff4fbc85b2d02868c28e0345787be5b674c3fef2d8e95eb16e0b25929b6a201","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":52.68,"end":59.69,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-6","text":"承知しました。じゃあ、数字を修正しておきます。","textVersion":"sha256:516f1cce8f654733f6735f9982f1944cd062184f38ce84255b08372c9ae6bbf7","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":59.93,"end":63.33,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-7","text":"今日はもうこんな時間だし、あしたに回して。今晩報告書にじっくり目を通しておくわね。ほかにも修正が出るかもしれないから、印刷は全部確認したあとでお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:0ed67096dfdc28bfcc4a7df3c87514a1ba7029885b7bdd809de280be8c4e65ef","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":63.77,"end":76.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-8","text":"わかりました。では、今日はこれだけやったら失礼します。","textVersion":"sha256:6b0cf069535adaba4c038d8bcde07a77bb55c16f89c3c6e7e395fc26c21d3609","audioVersion":"sha256:79b4c028e7d2fc53b89ccb8cc990a045bc435304fe373b671896fed29d3293bb","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff810bc762a5a54bc43474be1ff4b945faa648aaf641325543bc3724e6bfb7c","start":77.13,"end":80.75,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8cc3a632f8eceae6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:028f646ee0a77babdd813a533675d4b6a1d56afe4d8f260efac9c11b07bd0f9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0c4863bab04e132271295742419db4b1081f62e0e7f914dd8d48a50d2e506c9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:question","text":"一番：大学で女の学生と男の学生が話しています。男の学生はこのあとまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:8506f0cd334c8997ccae271d0f44f14e49a889bfc71c052368165d28673522e0","audioVersion":"sha256:028f646ee0a77babdd813a533675d4b6a1d56afe4d8f260efac9c11b07bd0f9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0c4863bab04e132271295742419db4b1081f62e0e7f914dd8d48a50d2e506c9","start":3.96,"end":16.11,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0","text":"斉藤君、事務所に教室の使用願い出してくれた？","textVersion":"sha256:c5e5e9e6e8735bb729397fe8a5519c09662199e55b92831e53831442eaf367ad","audioVersion":"sha256:028f646ee0a77babdd813a533675d4b6a1d56afe4d8f260efac9c11b07bd0f9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0c4863bab04e132271295742419db4b1081f62e0e7f914dd8d48a50d2e506c9","start":17.72,"end":22.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-1","text":"え？使用願？なんだっけ？","textVersion":"sha256:85523b96dedcb34fa2c48987177a4680a04f3a4c48d564881d386906d800f6f3","audioVersion":"sha256:028f646ee0a77babdd813a533675d4b6a1d56afe4d8f260efac9c11b07bd0f9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0c4863bab04e132271295742419db4b1081f62e0e7f914dd8d48a50d2e506c9","start":22.4,"end":24.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-2","text":"ほら、来週のクラブのミーティングで使う教室よ。けっこう出席者多いから、大きい教室借りないと。","textVersion":"sha256:358da3d2ae3c16ae25a2eecb2dad5419c639410b1e9a59647c7c4941b3d39cf7","audioVersion":"sha256:028f646ee0a77babdd813a533675d4b6a1d56afe4d8f260efac9c11b07bd0f9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0c4863bab04e132271295742419db4b1081f62e0e7f914dd8d48a50d2e506c9","start":24.95,"end":32.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-3","text":"ごめんごめん、忘れるところだった。えーと、手続きって？","textVersion":"sha256:5244ad8c49b540fd893024abdd05c1861a5fb2835fcae6fe83efd4375607c5e0","audioVersion":"sha256:028f646ee0a77babdd813a533675d4b6a1d56afe4d8f260efac9c11b07bd0f9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0c4863bab04e132271295742419db4b1081f62e0e7f914dd8d48a50d2e506c9","start":32.61,"end":37.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-4","text":"事務所で用紙をもらってね。申し込む時は、先生のはんこもいるよ。それから斉藤君、新入生歓迎会の準備でお金立て替えてくれてたでしょう？その分返すから、レシートくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:0d6ee34155443057390c2de785b50f203696a5d1bce7d6772958dbb2afca7f96","audioVersion":"sha256:028f646ee0a77babdd813a533675d4b6a1d56afe4d8f260efac9c11b07bd0f9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0c4863bab04e132271295742419db4b1081f62e0e7f914dd8d48a50d2e506c9","start":37.73,"end":51.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-5","text":"今日は持ってないから、来週のミーティングの時、持ってくる。","textVersion":"sha256:644dc546001998ff86fefddfe83d8a47625665f652cdff7f69c53a559869f715","audioVersion":"sha256:028f646ee0a77babdd813a533675d4b6a1d56afe4d8f260efac9c11b07bd0f9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0c4863bab04e132271295742419db4b1081f62e0e7f914dd8d48a50d2e506c9","start":52.11,"end":55.22,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a060facd02d86c5a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:question","text":"二番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこのあと、まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5d1c045d15ab865fb44fec3da1108a749a8cde8c9c0a0f1aec3a1e1ef17cb52a","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","start":4.12,"end":13.79,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-0","text":"先輩、あの缶ジュースのデザイン、やり直しになりそうなんです。この間のプレゼン、部長の反応がよくなくて、今までのから、あまり変えないほうがいいんじゃないかって。予算の問題はクリアしたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:b432ef3bcd0bc39181d7532d96e787e6a9793bce1c4a5bf29085fa66f5f47423","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","start":17.84,"end":33.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-1","text":"新しいデザインの意味、ちゃんと部長に伝わったの？","textVersion":"sha256:2aff6cab6b40f12167a84a773d940911fed016944ead4718d1b7a421b97007f8","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","start":34.35,"end":37.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-2","text":"ええ、デザインに込めた意味とか、色の持つ意味とか、力を入れて説明したつもりです。","textVersion":"sha256:e3679547e987ff7f39e90258134d32e133eac625e131469d6520ba9164be1e39","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","start":37.72,"end":43.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-3","text":"うーん。客観的なデータは示した？","textVersion":"sha256:58cb9d3996eda86edc634684d1435575dfc556b7ca93d3c0c44f592877c58d70","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","start":44.3,"end":47.11,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-4","text":"あ、いえ、特には。","textVersion":"sha256:64a21df8e41bbbdd82665475f45f07c9fc4462c03faa167c4541592f049c8a9a","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","start":47.59,"end":49.43,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-5","text":"消費者の声も大事だから、好感度とか調べてみたら？具体的な数値があれば、説得力もあるし。それでもだめなら、またいちから新しくデザインし直すしかないけど。","textVersion":"sha256:0187ccfdfa6b940828d033a651652330618e36d2e24eaba022ed16c449a7810f","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","start":49.82,"end":60.75,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-6","text":"そうですね。至急取りかかります。","textVersion":"sha256:e39a71436d55dd4a623754918a1fc633b59167013d9881c4af0ade489b578ac2","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf40f2a4e8a5217bdac1dc814c5bea769d7d51a68419efcca2b0188d8d4bb06","timelineVersion":"sha256:6c32dd0b3576fddf19cb96993fc0a71891326c9627189efe1c158e9485ac7358","start":61.38,"end":63.98,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a060facd02d86c5a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:question","text":"三番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f65a7f4180d5f1e902207b828569b8d7fd4a027d4a95d89999a6c1928a2712a7","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":3.35,"end":12.65,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-0","text":"佐藤さん、この間お願いした社長の海外出張の件だけど、ちょっと日程変更が出ちゃったんだよね。飛行機の便を適当な時間に変更するようにって言われてるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:4deda43ba143a7bae1ba216541ff20369e9c8ac77a3836b282054b88678655b0","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":16.74,"end":28.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-1","text":"はい、どういう変更ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:1c10d4e7e71a6fb26dcd7f2d52de64d4cc243a4d7a089f9d61e60ecddf610543","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":29.26,"end":31.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-2","text":"社長は17日の午後に帰国する予定だったんだけど。その日の朝10時から日本で会議が入ったから、飛行機を前日の便にしてほしいんだって。16日は昼までしか予定が入っていないから、夕方以降の便だったら、大丈夫だよね。","textVersion":"sha256:3a23353ede7ba8f8051e438f549044a9830030dab7b31339f0d755d3ead6be93","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":31.67,"end":48.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-3","text":"はい。ホテルもキャンセルですね。","textVersion":"sha256:45ce94c575b9f7d6a3be6bc170b97be011e39a265c2b53cc83cda154a28da8ea","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":48.91,"end":51.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-4","text":"いや、最終日の宿泊をどうするかは、飛行機の時間次第だね。飛行機が深夜の出発だったら、それまで少しでもホテルで休まれたほうがいいんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:1a2b7b77dad02aa3e1013bb0856718e6c9ca457fff78bf79517dd931986beb8b","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":52.1,"end":62.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-5","text":"あっ、そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:dd054b5f6a62b146158ff34dee021ef22531afaa1e94321d316ebe48286ab451","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":64.12,"end":65.25,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-6","text":"じゃあ、帰国便が確定し次第、社長にご連絡して、ホテルで休まれるかどうか希望をお伺いして。","textVersion":"sha256:10f13bfe8ca05ab209433f1899adb691912e176b934a60dcb17e4949744e8831","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":65.78,"end":72.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-7","text":"はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:18d2ff50b951ddb3ce339017a80a9a6dc1c1ce5a19553206efead7a638dd54f4","audioVersion":"sha256:f64b7a3b333d5c429ce6bf0e056e535996f0daa3c8ecdb84f9db6ba0f1b47f6f","timelineVersion":"sha256:d70acbdda344522a8e6dda1ffd15d92571d1612776a460f48364d3d1d1944776","start":73.35,"end":74.72,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a060facd02d86c5a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:question","text":"四番：女の留学生と男の留学生が話しています。女の留学生はいらなくなったものをどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8b58efb2806f498ca86a30c3bab609b07183517565581974351607cb1d7f2629","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":3.5,"end":14.32,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-0","text":"いよいよ卒業だね。国に帰るんで、家具とか電気製品、いらなくなるんだけど、どうしたらいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:dfc34d3984486f74a9bd76d8a32d0acb1f122ac795b0d7d9d75bd2a6fbac9e7d","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":16.38,"end":23.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-1","text":"僕の場合は、アルバイト先の友達に譲るんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:ae9129bbcb3e50953b85eaa3d8e1964ed31b69e72d3d4064bf594fd2b8b85eb3","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":24.43,"end":27.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-2","text":"それはいいね。私のもまだ十分使えるから、捨てるのもったいなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:3e95a93fec2fc7656c1c5520d33f50ce77013db859f35fbb577b71370c62c7c7","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":27.93,"end":33.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-3","text":"この間、大学の掲示板で見たんだけど、先輩の家具を引き取って新入生にあげる活動をしているボランティア団体があるんだって。連絡すれば、取りに来てくれるから、そこに寄付すれば？","textVersion":"sha256:71fc7cb124eeb283cfb142cf0fef18d03f7f943b35dc93492430b78e1087bb02","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":33.62,"end":45.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-4","text":"へえ、いいね。","textVersion":"sha256:7681cf7db51fe81f3b3e7a7fa953f15e322000956c26eee8e2dbbfed4c4f02ea","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":45.54,"end":47.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-5","text":"それか、リサイクルショップに売るっていうのもいいよね。ああ、だけど、電気製品の古いのは買い取ってくれないかも。","textVersion":"sha256:dd45e002e7cd1dac1672f7ddc971a78bb5020dae82d6f53cb5a799e5698aa525","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":47.61,"end":55.39,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-6","text":"そうなんだ。あっ、インターネットでの販売はどう？写真載せて、買いたい人と直接やり取りするやつ。お店まで持っていく必要がないから、楽でいいかなって思ったんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:8fdff0ac7439fab34bfc041d4940df091d64180c83f58ed5103dbdc6559fe519","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":55.74,"end":69.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-7","text":"ああ、それは避けたほうがいいと思うよ。受け渡しとか、お金のこととか、トラブルもあるって聞くし。","textVersion":"sha256:2171ed6b3ea67308538f6a8f1f71ef48403570eeac8391375938d5c08f9bd498","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":69.54,"end":75.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-8","text":"そっか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6512789ed6959f2b08585c5a20526d51e9036dcbf9c8d6ea1f7db766be59607","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":76.29,"end":77.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-9","text":"やっぱり、新入生に喜んでもらうのがいいんじゃない。手間かかんないし。","textVersion":"sha256:0a5154cd71292f4e6c4620d54226666b3bfe23d25153b40341b8fe50ec7777cf","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":77.43,"end":81.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-10","text":"うん。じゃあ、そうしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:5db0f04dbe5b1db72e53693ead402d9ecdc3181d2db6890b10761311928127db","audioVersion":"sha256:9d9ce361b9ee1189e557c4f7b0b111f9b431923031998278e74c65c7edea4754","timelineVersion":"sha256:37a1d4846fb324feb1d8f282bf9dc116d3d06ea88eb7c8935a037f960aa61aa1","start":82.03,"end":83.9,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a060facd02d86c5a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:question","text":"五番：山口課長からの留守番電話のメッセージを聞いています。課長からのメッセージを聞いたあと、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:1126dc026d56a6db43fab10dda6c4cc0940e4d47909dfdeab2f38519c32b3507","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","start":3.5,"end":16.3,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-0","text":"あっ、もしもし、山口だけど、会社に電話したら、外出中ということだったんで、携帯のほうに連絡しました。","textVersion":"sha256:a9d0b56a28ec7e290ddcef322b9f3bbe4f54a7c3ca07fa00caf6eeefedbaee97","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","start":20.2,"end":28.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-1","text":"今大阪に向かってるところなんだけど、明日の会議で使う資料、会社に忘れちゃって。","textVersion":"sha256:6dc498d1b789da6a77b76ae5d841adae942d8a9b9f2b1f6fdfdc50bd1a4bac43","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","start":29.18,"end":35.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-2","text":"申し訳ないんだけど、資料の場所君しか分からないから、戻ったら、すぐに郵便局に行って速達で大阪のホテルに送ってほしいんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:3105a175cba844b009ba9735620b94826ec5f0213a87585ea3614480285a3475","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","start":36.08,"end":45.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-3","text":"で、郵便出す時、到着日時確認してくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:0dbffd09071addd7bb718839e166906cba96c949fae7b2fb26c7719bd411f12d","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","start":47.14,"end":50.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-4","text":"うん、とりあえず、これ聞いたら、折り返し僕のほうにかけてくれない？","textVersion":"sha256:cc0d55766d6fc614cbc9036c234965445b55933a0650882df57be3f281fd98d1","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","start":51.94,"end":56.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-5","text":"宛先も教えたいし。","textVersion":"sha256:f98acd6e5f58f8f0d790fcaeb7ece87ad3bb181b631036268576b056fa59b830","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","start":56.72,"end":58.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-6","text":"悪いけど、よろしく。","textVersion":"sha256:c7f709cf3edbbd775b2f30a1f77bb90579cd25f310877f5cfd0f29a91e23ae50","audioVersion":"sha256:0585fc74a0e73cf0d0addcf8018bd6caa61281e0d38bd8e39ce3421001b881c1","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b7ad4315c892c39f5fce55bc6acf178b0180a743d62b3248f4a1ae7b596f8b9","start":58.96,"end":60.06,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a060facd02d86c5a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:question","text":"一番：レストランで男の人が、アルバイトの女の人に仕事の説明をしています。女の人は、この後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:bb549d764618727c543163807da80c7af8163f5b783146c6e99c5ca2139daa67","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","start":3.28,"end":17.67,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0","text":"おはようございます。今日からよろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:b0aabc1da57eddefedd89effe307118e309544da7372bf04e94fc566f76560bc","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","start":17.67,"end":22.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-1","text":"よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:f45d7ffa6c147b3598ad14b10a7e34ad20a6bdfb0139c448e065cc8112c13fd1","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","start":23.04,"end":24.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-2","text":"仕事は、初めのうちは、主に調理場で皿洗いをしてもらいます。慣れてきたら、お客さんに料理を運んでもらいます。メニューはたくさんありますが、料理の名前は少しずつ覚えていけばいいから心配しないでください。","textVersion":"sha256:434cf3308fd44744cbe237efc0bccf88613a3513f46e6d400b663fa8b0470112","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","start":24.76,"end":40.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-3","text":"はい！","textVersion":"sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","start":41.52,"end":42.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-4","text":"えっと。。。今日は店の掃除から始めましょう。で、開店時間になったら、調理場に入って皿洗いを手伝ってもらいます。何かあったら聞いてください。","textVersion":"sha256:ce8a85572a06613471ea1d73b9f23b68985ee5ccbcb882cb5555bd89a94e6a69","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","start":42.5,"end":54.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","start":54.02,"end":54.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-6","text":"では、よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:c653c397f0ad86371572b94c115a1aadc314ebd0bfbf9013882d5a728eaa8ed7","audioVersion":"sha256:a26f808e1039592cd4181b4b10c04fc75f109a43d1a65db648db63d445d2f352","timelineVersion":"sha256:a47c642f1c024e438d68c603e2bb67ab9c439f9b626d0fd604139e0e18040572","start":54.92,"end":56.68,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"3f5f2e7b642774ed"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:eae6e5d996ce76f2cb401889412790322d643f4c8b6c2e8c7995d24e46e9f36a","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4e745383f35776426e367415bbc74cc64cf941e8886406aa3d4505383f116b4","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:question","text":"二番：会社で、女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はまず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:c20fe180028fc681386262330375d8bec29c34ac4e3e0af9ce7da538602685f6","audioVersion":"sha256:eae6e5d996ce76f2cb401889412790322d643f4c8b6c2e8c7995d24e46e9f36a","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4e745383f35776426e367415bbc74cc64cf941e8886406aa3d4505383f116b4","start":3.44,"end":14.66,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0","text":"課長。みどり工業から製造の依頼があった部品の件で、あちらの担当の方と話して参りました。","textVersion":"sha256:e2b815111f791632314d5ccf60266b056d3a130fb039749d374699c6da4b396b","audioVersion":"sha256:eae6e5d996ce76f2cb401889412790322d643f4c8b6c2e8c7995d24e46e9f36a","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4e745383f35776426e367415bbc74cc64cf941e8886406aa3d4505383f116b4","start":18.08,"end":25.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-1","text":"どうでしたか？話は上手く進みそうですか？","textVersion":"sha256:efa1fb725addcf44c580ceeb64259b80b453cd6c2786792f4ed4e8d36d32680b","audioVersion":"sha256:eae6e5d996ce76f2cb401889412790322d643f4c8b6c2e8c7995d24e46e9f36a","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4e745383f35776426e367415bbc74cc64cf941e8886406aa3d4505383f116b4","start":26.1,"end":29.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-2","text":"いえ・・・なかなか難しくて。まず、こちらが提示した価格と、あちらの予算とが合わないのが1番の問題でしょうか。それと、あちらが納品を希望している日と、こちらが納品できそうな日のスケジュールも今のところ、合っていません。","textVersion":"sha256:d65e45d8bd36b50b8d00a38220065e6bb5dd78d53bf4304bc482b4f1e267630a","audioVersion":"sha256:eae6e5d996ce76f2cb401889412790322d643f4c8b6c2e8c7995d24e46e9f36a","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4e745383f35776426e367415bbc74cc64cf941e8886406aa3d4505383f116b4","start":29.84,"end":47.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-3","text":"予算と日程ですか。それは、大きな問題ですね。日程に付いては明日以降会議を開いた上で調整しましょう。価格については、部長とも相談する必要がありますから、とりあえず、すぐに、今日の報告書を作ってください。細かい話はその後にしましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:08c52dfdda627e7a5b7de80c4a48399edec67471cf58e1bf0f7c5ad582d6d5a3","audioVersion":"sha256:eae6e5d996ce76f2cb401889412790322d643f4c8b6c2e8c7995d24e46e9f36a","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4e745383f35776426e367415bbc74cc64cf941e8886406aa3d4505383f116b4","start":48.5,"end":70.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-4","text":"はい、分かりました。あっ、でも部品のサンプルについては、担当の方の反応は良かったと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:06d32f7bcba542848bb070546579583a32fb326502ae786f4487d9a435617e90","audioVersion":"sha256:eae6e5d996ce76f2cb401889412790322d643f4c8b6c2e8c7995d24e46e9f36a","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4e745383f35776426e367415bbc74cc64cf941e8886406aa3d4505383f116b4","start":70.86,"end":78.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-5","text":"そう。それは良かった。","textVersion":"sha256:8c744fc46bf97b943b03f20612fb3a1bc7ec1c9e521282dee9a4582bb598a5f3","audioVersion":"sha256:eae6e5d996ce76f2cb401889412790322d643f4c8b6c2e8c7995d24e46e9f36a","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4e745383f35776426e367415bbc74cc64cf941e8886406aa3d4505383f116b4","start":78.88,"end":81.18,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"3f5f2e7b642774ed"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:question","text":"三番：先生が、学生に授業の課題について説明しています。学生は今週中に何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:502bd30bdef7d2f23522926975c5c3c95fc1304aff76778c0a4458654e1e909a","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":5.28,"end":15.06,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-0","text":"えー、この授業では、最後にグループ発表をしてもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:0d38c370785f058331b5de8049d1286f6750494bb6f24a890dd0b15884b3d5ea","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":17.28,"end":21.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-1","text":"関心を持ったテーマについて簡単な調査をしてそれをまとめてください。","textVersion":"sha256:fbddb67382b87448ecd4602f3ad06ad848acf62e946c9cec745b1fa123ab0a39","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":22.08,"end":27.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-2","text":"発表は最後の授業の日にします。","textVersion":"sha256:875bf88385703f29f2c5c54bbd550380d826b50998d4d160c198c0eadd11c74c","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":27.98,"end":30.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-3","text":"後2ヶ月ありますね。","textVersion":"sha256:a750db6b46670d9bf0c3e87bcc0cb8140dc82947589b8ca16ca042c49f26f2ed","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":31.34,"end":32.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-4","text":"えっと、グループはこの前の実習で決めたのと同じです。","textVersion":"sha256:7396cab826a64a5400fd6b251b6ece68aab612e93ea0d3bcbdcca1c9d9253552","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":33.58,"end":38.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-5","text":"覚えてるよね？","textVersion":"sha256:2d245b11a102213e7448ce1b0dff0a047ec2b5d652f395b2a18196b190cfd114","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":38.78,"end":39.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-6","text":"で、テーマだけど、早めに決めて、そうだなぁ……今週の終わりまでに僕のところに出してください。","textVersion":"sha256:67265bc0fae7bcb3c7371cd07258c9406f9d51188b053c93d9005938d110f219","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":41.36,"end":50.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-7","text":"発表資料は発表の1週間前までに提出してください。","textVersion":"sha256:5d5600eeeaed489a43be58a1026002f94ceb14a1aa4f20d4a53b6e44d12dcaf9","audioVersion":"sha256:710bc9810c76dc70cb8ab50a3277615f727c54cbf6ea07f9b1c59c875e6050c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:f444a0a6b3a8401105c6e32b6d91a1ef23ebc481084fc255e4d0fbadfc7f46c8","start":50.54,"end":54.7,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"3f5f2e7b642774ed"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:20c9400833b21e01f1072aa86f048982a1f49faa2765afc2441e6d352c634a2f","timelineVersion":"sha256:5a8ae87ab359fa9e34325ac540787231d0711337d4143421a5dafd9a5febe867","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:question","text":"四番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人は会場をどのようにしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d27c248a8e8dc48d0b861d7ec40b1ac22769071e40906d2ef230a2774a24ae74","audioVersion":"sha256:20c9400833b21e01f1072aa86f048982a1f49faa2765afc2441e6d352c634a2f","timelineVersion":"sha256:5a8ae87ab359fa9e34325ac540787231d0711337d4143421a5dafd9a5febe867","start":3.94,"end":13.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-0","text":"明日、朝9時からの研修会の会場なんだけど、会議室の椅子、並べ替えといてもらえますか？","textVersion":"sha256:c1514057c1c5bdfbdd19bbdc6e56cdec75ea710891e634f931f4d4e84c760283","audioVersion":"sha256:20c9400833b21e01f1072aa86f048982a1f49faa2765afc2441e6d352c634a2f","timelineVersion":"sha256:5a8ae87ab359fa9e34325ac540787231d0711337d4143421a5dafd9a5febe867","start":15.18,"end":22.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-1","text":"はい、分かりました。参加者は何人程度ですか？","textVersion":"sha256:b885384a4fbab3d2c66133de4cbfd456f1bc9ad3e55ddddc4f53675bb0f624cd","audioVersion":"sha256:20c9400833b21e01f1072aa86f048982a1f49faa2765afc2441e6d352c634a2f","timelineVersion":"sha256:5a8ae87ab359fa9e34325ac540787231d0711337d4143421a5dafd9a5febe867","start":22.58,"end":26.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-2","text":"えーっと、8人だったかな？","textVersion":"sha256:569d11aacdda76db7f9726717db1c5fe3fc670d7725cb8bc9c365c3e4eb4f2e7","audioVersion":"sha256:20c9400833b21e01f1072aa86f048982a1f49faa2765afc2441e6d352c634a2f","timelineVersion":"sha256:5a8ae87ab359fa9e34325ac540787231d0711337d4143421a5dafd9a5febe867","start":26.48,"end":28.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-3","text":"8人ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:42828d5541702d3dc93ba342d099320e340de3341fba8d196f4eb0e87cf319e0","audioVersion":"sha256:20c9400833b21e01f1072aa86f048982a1f49faa2765afc2441e6d352c634a2f","timelineVersion":"sha256:5a8ae87ab359fa9e34325ac540787231d0711337d4143421a5dafd9a5febe867","start":28.82,"end":30.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-4","text":"いつもは前を向いてスクリーンで資料を見せながらの講義形式だけど、明日は話し合いが中心だから、参加者同士顔がよく見えるようにしてもらえるとありがたいんだけど。机は全部横へ、やってもらって部屋の隅の方に。全員互いに顔が見えるようにお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:f8c27166fd3191fde71faefdd58c61df87dc087275e07e4663d09d6be8866468","audioVersion":"sha256:20c9400833b21e01f1072aa86f048982a1f49faa2765afc2441e6d352c634a2f","timelineVersion":"sha256:5a8ae87ab359fa9e34325ac540787231d0711337d4143421a5dafd9a5febe867","start":31.36,"end":52.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-5","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:20c9400833b21e01f1072aa86f048982a1f49faa2765afc2441e6d352c634a2f","timelineVersion":"sha256:5a8ae87ab359fa9e34325ac540787231d0711337d4143421a5dafd9a5febe867","start":52.92,"end":53.9,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"3f5f2e7b642774ed"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:question","text":"五番：市役所で男の職員と女の職員が話しています。女の職員は何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f10b87f56fa4b421b69393d8cf251e6620a2d02773c4b2ec8bd14f4ba694b322","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":3.74,"end":14,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-0","text":"去年OPENした市民相談室、あまり利用者が増えていないようだけど、まだみんなに知られてないのかな？","textVersion":"sha256:251f4383d39ed8e25256a986aa7ba649d35c9dbf3f005a4f944c68960219278f","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":15.44,"end":22.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-1","text":"そうですね。市のお知らせに案内を載せたりいろいろなところにポスターを貼ったりしてるんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:50562a96f82dc7afaa5aa88aa119de1d6e6202292e6de2b5d378275f0ec18f37","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":23.52,"end":30.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-2","text":"市のホームページには？","textVersion":"sha256:8d7de467b923f3dbed0613c0e6ee9c8a09b84f5eb19ae6145e35be00b97746b5","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":30.26,"end":31.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-3","text":"はい、もう出してます。","textVersion":"sha256:384a0497d08eda672755fff45d7fca92d6832eec4721e24190904555e602bef6","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":31.96,"end":33.77,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-4","text":"そう。うーん、市のお知らせだけじゃなくて、新聞や雑誌なんかにも出してみて？費用は出せるから。","textVersion":"sha256:f1498cf3d5e028625635342ae13d0be16b85589658f6ff3a24d37a67642508af","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":33.8,"end":42.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":42.44,"end":43.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-6","text":"利用者の反応はどうなの？確かアンケートを取ってたよね？","textVersion":"sha256:592e787de8dfe4690e4592e8cc81257fce6442f293aef92ca38fce82b4fb225d","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":43.36,"end":47.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-7","text":"ええ。経験豊富な相談員が担当してますから、アンケートでもいいアドバイスがもらえた、という回答が多かったです。","textVersion":"sha256:a239147b3204a51082892ede9dfb6020d1d5b387376345502f414081044727f6","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":47.04,"end":55.09,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-8","text":"そうか。そこはいいのか。じゃあ、さっき言った事お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:4ed02ba884b7901b6e6591e8d089b0ac263ab773759841c927d51f181509e875","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":55.1,"end":59.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-9","text":"はい。やっておきます。","textVersion":"sha256:efbf316589c020645ef427529baa1ca084b5d846106c9f510505c8a0dd19c5e6","audioVersion":"sha256:26cf97663b7507425aa526d2a88f9a7ad56ba74185b763643a781585ca976139","timelineVersion":"sha256:747b48bdc3f0b5aa58c674935981a5f309506e25c0acebf6acef7e692b6296a4","start":59.92,"end":61.68,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"3f5f2e7b642774ed"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:question","text":"一番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこれからまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:35bfab61a4e18c14b9cf748a014bb65aaf53371fb3c5a502eac2667f82f9ccee","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":4,"end":13.7,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-0","text":"木村さん、本社の社長がこちらに視察にいらっしゃる件なんだけど、予定が早まって来週になったこと、知ってる？","textVersion":"sha256:9f249417fa43ae1161fa5eb66c3f5876fb8008529561af36f032907366145cd5","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":15.06,"end":23.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-1","text":"はい、うかがっております。ホテルの予約は変更しておきました。会議室も変更してあります。","textVersion":"sha256:cf776c37680a4b4acd22361b5f338a8b8c96b30d553f7d58da94f48a13606c59","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":23.14,"end":30.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-2","text":"そうか。見学する工場への連絡も済んでるかな。","textVersion":"sha256:b99d336ff544388e2d464941df13eebcf00a5c4d8572834a022a2802a461e8e3","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":30.38,"end":34.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-3","text":"はい、済んでいます。ただ、資料の準備がなかなか...。","textVersion":"sha256:948e6f0c576ac657d718d314cfe7061df773c878753321d4ba3e8bebb9aa7763","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":34.28,"end":38.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-4","text":"えっ、間に合わせてよ。","textVersion":"sha256:886e50663fad490c1a87c6c97ec4c0b13b8cf8a9a48c695c8ba579528f7a6071","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":38.78,"end":41.01,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-5","text":"はい、急いでやります。あのう、お見えになるのは社長を含めて3人ということでよろしいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:425621ce9f6dcbee02989e20a600f6b9fd66dc0d3f27128a61ce72f995cdba70","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":41.01,"end":48.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-6","text":"ああ、聞いてない、4人になったんだよ、増えたんだ。あっ、泊まるところ、大丈夫？","textVersion":"sha256:bc7d681b4e8f5934ad1996aa979baeec8bc0fde93d10424356705850fa668eba","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":48.66,"end":56.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-7","text":"ああ、それはうかがっておりませんでしたので。","textVersion":"sha256:0bb793e834548074532b364b338603b49e125d731015c126b9b340bceac39ca4","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":56.4,"end":60.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-8","text":"そう。じゃ、先にそっちからやって。","textVersion":"sha256:4ffd3607818bf39e2b5b4e7c5ac48847d6d8a53df3b205f9f47633bea5eba1b7","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":60.2,"end":63.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:d789467c552901b27073c8ed0fe509e07fb77218fc5c29c73aad5bcf6c206930","timelineVersion":"sha256:6fa2b8e49297361021aaf4c2166183536ea8284facbd376245ede9a1bbe7643e","start":63.36,"end":63.96,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"f8f70e1e2972be6d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:question","text":"二番：大学で女の先生と男の学生が話しています。学生はアンケート調査の計画をどう変えますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a50f36aaf81d02a747790504092f7469b9a77679248b838fdc394f5b99a7fb88","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":5.36,"end":14.99,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-0","text":"卒業論文のアンケート調査の計画書、昨日、ざっと見てみたんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:5636b17fb62538cf0426e7edcecea627aeb8e2de0c38ba70ee13c3c062b1a459","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":14.99,"end":21.85,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":21.85,"end":22.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-2","text":"調査の対象者が20代の社会人っていうのは目の付け所はいいんだけど、男性が10人女性が10人って。","textVersion":"sha256:d0c654f06bbc6dcac9740103b260edf001f1acbd991157400979df716d8b37ea","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":22.62,"end":31.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-3","text":"すみません。社会人の知り合いがそのぐらいしかいなかったんで。","textVersion":"sha256:1def4ced491664aac2548f0dfe0d6a12d6d6af387b9e5867e8425ebfffd0b71a","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":31.66,"end":35.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-4","text":"質問のほうは内容も面白いし、項目数もけっこうあって、これでちゃんと調査すればいろんなことが明らかになると思うんだけど、残念よね。知っている人が少ないからといってこれじゃ分析のしようがないでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:7de9b29afbf997a7ad4d79d8cbf090b7d386fb5ea4c0288dee1f2010bf404c33","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":35.86,"end":50.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-5","text":"はあ。","textVersion":"sha256:fc10529e4cf91d4577a5481f160e85c048f3a9a0e0bf53b7652d3990580ac414","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":50.62,"end":51.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-6","text":"卒業した先輩にこたえてもらうとか、紹介してもらうとかしてこの点を解決してください。","textVersion":"sha256:45be7102642ff82e7c82d7f66005c512ff1f7faee68a0941d0ada0b98ffe01d7","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":51.46,"end":57.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-7","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:5afe254a360a0bd9d69e773567e47479a793ff604aa1acea7230731bdf1ed717","timelineVersion":"sha256:bddeab0f5b0d6f0fff9768988c070f0c0bfbbc4ee5c33a92b8c8aa4e972542c0","start":58.14,"end":58.96,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"f8f70e1e2972be6d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:916aa09d7793e6ab1657dd1fc6a87e1ae09a3a9a20feec2f039888649c9520ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:33e1a341f01920bbf4af131236b912028d76ef70d96e22caac0f2b39c821ec32","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:question","text":"三番：市民サークルで男の先生が話しています。メンバーは来週のサークルの活動日に何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e7de9cc22598e8d1c950aa8495a100c1b3db74bda3c3114b568818d3e322abc1","audioVersion":"sha256:916aa09d7793e6ab1657dd1fc6a87e1ae09a3a9a20feec2f039888649c9520ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:33e1a341f01920bbf4af131236b912028d76ef70d96e22caac0f2b39c821ec32","start":5.3,"end":14.64,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-0","text":"私たち手品サークルの発表会まであと1か月ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:fb1753e2e0c1a1f0c4a7e3e83f2c4c41a0331a3bf409b9d97472fa02e6edb5ef","audioVersion":"sha256:916aa09d7793e6ab1657dd1fc6a87e1ae09a3a9a20feec2f039888649c9520ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:33e1a341f01920bbf4af131236b912028d76ef70d96e22caac0f2b39c821ec32","start":16.48,"end":20.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-1","text":"その前の週にはリハーサルを行いますので、準備期間は実質あと3週間です。","textVersion":"sha256:3dfc922708d5aea1a42bbc3517796d80540ab41a0240e1dedf1de94bbc2d0c16","audioVersion":"sha256:916aa09d7793e6ab1657dd1fc6a87e1ae09a3a9a20feec2f039888649c9520ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:33e1a341f01920bbf4af131236b912028d76ef70d96e22caac0f2b39c821ec32","start":20.94,"end":27.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-2","text":"衣装は担当の佐藤さんが来週の活動日までに製作してくれます。","textVersion":"sha256:9e46c7700ffb4c1bf27f081ef9b3793a5483f0c7926b8676a0848514ae074984","audioVersion":"sha256:916aa09d7793e6ab1657dd1fc6a87e1ae09a3a9a20feec2f039888649c9520ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:33e1a341f01920bbf4af131236b912028d76ef70d96e22caac0f2b39c821ec32","start":28.22,"end":33.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-3","text":"来週の活動日なんですが、私は発表会の会場を見に行くので練習には来られません。","textVersion":"sha256:782a01c22282494ba860b93129691613ff7086f57614330e8086276bd185ab28","audioVersion":"sha256:916aa09d7793e6ab1657dd1fc6a87e1ae09a3a9a20feec2f039888649c9520ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:33e1a341f01920bbf4af131236b912028d76ef70d96e22caac0f2b39c821ec32","start":33.6,"end":40.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-4","text":"そのかわり、その日はプロとして手品をしている方を講師にお呼びしていますので、発表会の前に見せ方のコツなどを学びましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:d5af9a3a036cdfbe83757925fb6a4c6bfd3a3ebbcdad735a1913a8d6c3a1fa88","audioVersion":"sha256:916aa09d7793e6ab1657dd1fc6a87e1ae09a3a9a20feec2f039888649c9520ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:33e1a341f01920bbf4af131236b912028d76ef70d96e22caac0f2b39c821ec32","start":41.38,"end":50.78,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"f8f70e1e2972be6d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:question","text":"四番：大学の事務室で男の学生と事務の人が話しています。男の学生は駐車場を借りるために今日何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:5259d87c9810fe6ce919aacb871ac300604bf0363b8cd70a739fbedf2cd28ee8","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":3.42,"end":17.46,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-0","text":"あのう、すみません、駐車場の使用許可書の申請をしたいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:2e6c2a2c6e6a58dbe69e053bbe5cd4091b7cb03b8301cb8a97f83b62f796f8f3","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":19.06,"end":24.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-1","text":"学生用の駐車場のことですね。締め切りは今日なんで、今日中に手続きしてください。","textVersion":"sha256:a7dff1af8688118c483ae8f2cfdde368f5d3fc54f91e25938601354a96c016d1","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":24.34,"end":30.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-2","text":"そうですか。申し込みってこの窓口でできるんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:1009689d3ab4a2013ae648af0b92315624569559f820b4166cc291a9f9db071b","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":31.1,"end":35.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-3","text":"申し込みはウェブ上でするんです。大学のホームページを見ればすぐ分かりますから。","textVersion":"sha256:95927b74584c08fe33351c1c2b7e9db9f7d1a818c095fbeded6ea156dc397eee","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":35.06,"end":41.41,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":41.44,"end":41.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-5","text":"あっ、学内の駐車場を申請するには自宅と大学の距離とか色々条件があるのは知っていますか","textVersion":"sha256:6afa4dbcc78bd83e954ca39840cc72975b788f5da82a39d5758a37a1b9560fe8","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":42.2,"end":49.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-6","text":"はい、それは知ってるんですけど…あのう、うち、許可の範囲に入らないんですけど、最近研究で帰りが遅くなることも多くて車じゃないと本当に不便なんです。","textVersion":"sha256:088e212a003a0720555fd9d6dce24c03b1ca9aa4050696ee7594030ba926fa7c","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":49.98,"end":61.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-7","text":"そうですか。えーと、それでは先に申請をしておいて、追加で理由書を提出してもらえますか。書き方はなんでもいいので理由を書いて今日中に判を押して持ってきてください。","textVersion":"sha256:f507dec902d659dfc3b6df354b54248bf07640b37d8b45682abb81522a5701ba","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":62.24,"end":76.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-8","text":"今日印鑑持ってないんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:09b5d83d6cdf4f7e9574b0e6719450a55c0686647fbfae4cdef63155dbdd4a22","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":76.5,"end":78.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-9","text":"じゃ、明日で。","textVersion":"sha256:388af6dc6d19238c853b2d0a3f0eab6c76df22aeb8f104b579ec0fb734cf855c","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":78.74,"end":80.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-10","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:bfe7e368b999ef4358e34966829b8f8a87983d222afe5ce77e1a27d111696ffa","timelineVersion":"sha256:7f7701a1613ea78b737d2f570f55d54f9dc0a94bf938688984d271bc50f69ac5","start":80.3,"end":80.92,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"f8f70e1e2972be6d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:question","text":"五番：会社で男の社員と部長が新商品について話しています。男の社員はこのあと何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:4c403164cbc8551992b8840202716fcab0bd5db04e03fba7617cbc9c9aab1a01","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":3.64,"end":15.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-0","text":"小山部長、こちら新しく開発したお弁当の試作品なんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:fccfc3e72907c7ed7b6ce36a8f73efe17e52fa449898f58f150c323bd60c4516","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":17.2,"end":22.41,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-1","text":"うん。あっ、結構ボリュームがあるけど、ターゲットは？","textVersion":"sha256:b640134c37daac0254df02b2e58a945466aa958f3123a1b042dc6ff987435bfb","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":22.42,"end":26.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-2","text":"20代から30代のビジネスマンです。","textVersion":"sha256:04aa633318663da0aba8da50682a91d874a6bd6398aae137efa7c2ef26dd87f7","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":26.88,"end":29.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-3","text":"ああ、それでご飯が大盛りでおかずもフライが多いのね。でも若い男性の食事って普段カロリーが高くなりがちだから、むしろ健康的なもののほうが受けるんじゃないかな。ニーズ調査の結果は？","textVersion":"sha256:1203d5ab0577ef033f3aa924efc76ff3e481f00598786edd12bb2595959ca758","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":29.72,"end":44.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-4","text":"はい、社内の男性社員を対象に実施したところ、確かに低カロリーで健康的な食事を求める声もあったんですが、やっぱり量を求める声や肉が食べたいってという声が多くて。","textVersion":"sha256:f192c3857a63f26b3bc3c198bcbc35c09bf57ea5854fca3f4827d209bd0e7ae2","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":44.7,"end":57.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-5","text":"じゃ、例えばこの肉を揚げるんじゃなくて焼くみたら？全体のボリュームは変えずにカロリーを抑えられるんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:471816061c3bf34e031eabfe976e805a75425c4cbf64a44a8ade3d9374a75c12","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":58.12,"end":67.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-6","text":"あっ、それならどちらのニーズにも応えられますね。","textVersion":"sha256:79d5008d52147a810f4c9c41210cfee88839896ee9af16cd326276402db38629","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":67.54,"end":70.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-7","text":"じゃ、ほかのおかずも含めてその線で再検討してみてくれる？完成したら試食会を開いて社内で試食してみましょう。そっちの準備は進めておくから。","textVersion":"sha256:10e7c5cf969a2fc4920fccd8deac89b00d7f709084485ab46b997a94f61bbce5","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":70.8,"end":82.45,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-8","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:da6a6c88d6230ebb3804abf39c9778ed0933813c572b8f482371dbf6b947bbae","timelineVersion":"sha256:de0bddcbc2e1759a7940aa3253f15400edf062373f426da527bff0897e1981f7","start":82.48,"end":83.42,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"f8f70e1e2972be6d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:question","text":"町の文化センターで女の職員と男の職員が話しています。女の職員はこのあと何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b981b973907ef634f8acfad0e2f0abf05727ed94704fb92169123aefefb7f14a","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":5.2,"end":15.48,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0","text":"あのう、来週開催する子供の教育に関する講演会、まだ申し込みが50人しかないんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:ccea2287a0ac0455411206e6436bfb9497cb4515d43702c06969d1c5def572eb","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":17.08,"end":25.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-1","text":"え？50人か。会場は200人は入るところだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:4a544b9e853a5d1fb3df66515d8adc36f6710fa744cd8c567d3015d6911e1359","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":26.36,"end":31.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-2","text":"はい。センターの利用登録者に一斉メールを送ってお知らせしたんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:b15de4435f7b1984830e77dbce682b80f12dd883fe42328ab9636773efa1e12a","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":32,"end":37.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-3","text":"いいテーマなのに、もったいないな。子どもの教育の話だし、関心は高いと思うんだけどな。","textVersion":"sha256:966046f8bf7538ccf529c0587ae3d6fb4f654bfc4a429e2c8f7dd15ccf921e84","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":38.3,"end":45.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-4","text":"そうですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:74aeb69edd81912a2568aae05f19a175e9fc08ba03d1cf437c0d0fa865eb8c98","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":45.38,"end":46.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-5","text":"今からでも、どこかちらしを置いてもらえるところを探してみよう。市内の学校の先生方には配ってあるから。そうだなあ、近くの塾に頼みに行ってくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:4b817677848439edf6a88eb6681f4df9c8ab5a0ebb84de599ce93dadd1afb759","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":47.02,"end":58.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-6","text":"はい。あのう、今のちらし文字ばかりでぜんぜん目立たないですよね。少しイラストを加えたりして作り直しましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:d603ade27bb3df2f5d9110e9278c1528f1c79a32dfd00c8063cda13f1b53514b","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":59.26,"end":69.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-7","text":"うーん。いい考えだけど、とにかくもう時間がないからね。","textVersion":"sha256:02dca60c535e0c1d7cf00bbf2aa1e45e4d6fd7db42cb107f7ecc27886773df41","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":70.28,"end":74.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-8","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:7f821cabcfeb042e7f2ed6d6fa689e47649041f7b640d6cef4639a260e33578c","timelineVersion":"sha256:78a2d3f3742f158bee973f22be8d0282a1b8e9d78024eb4fe79c596a50509081","start":75.16,"end":76.74,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"21bd13d1dcdbf290"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:question","text":"高齢者を支援するボランティアの男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はこのあとすぐ何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:9504ae778a2ddc74ef76511a9c6eeaec9d41e4327c92f87b778085e668e10eb4","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":5.05,"end":15.64,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-0","text":"こんにちは。ボランティアの佐藤です。お手伝いにきました。","textVersion":"sha256:ac25dd8296c556f61523f4a4706096f632dcb1b6ac787545f7e0e75026a3b319","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":17.47,"end":21.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-1","text":"あ、佐藤さん、いつもありがとう。この間は、食料品を買いに行ってもらって助かったわ。","textVersion":"sha256:37e2cfe9f36fc831dfaa3783f495f83f8bd5807a654de5347bb6ed327bcf57cc","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":21.47,"end":28.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-2","text":"いいえ、重いものを買うときはいつでもおっしゃってください。","textVersion":"sha256:5c21a88eb50044f2c22016b1eee321a87665b32d5340d6ca1859aa7035e40fc1","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":28.66,"end":32.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-3","text":"電球を取り替えたりするのもお願いできるの？","textVersion":"sha256:45565a5d42bd092371ea03a68f4043e93f40401df42a5519b21e05b00b630ac3","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":33.21,"end":37.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-4","text":"ええ、もちろん。どこのですか。","textVersion":"sha256:66cb4ee37198ec54bc547b8e28bfbf56ab80d6be8c5d5cf401250894f8d29a4c","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":37.95,"end":40.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-5","text":"ああ、いいえ、今は大丈夫なんだけど。そろそろ切れるごろだと思ってね。","textVersion":"sha256:90051b56d0e9c379880416f94ca50e545e471ab6683b36401316d23ac9cc7a9f","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":40.45,"end":45.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-6","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":45.55,"end":46.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-7","text":"このごろ庭の雑草が気になってて、今日はそれをお願いできるとありがたいと思ってたんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:9f451fe02e2a62e26bb924188c5fa1e28598069c66136588291e678d5b700c90","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":46.75,"end":53.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-8","text":"もちろんです。あ、それから僕、料理もけっこう得意なんですよ。食べたいものがあったら作りますから、言ってください。","textVersion":"sha256:43535531d913235e570f2aca10df9b99cd2f5d3dea516553ee49431ba6482395","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":53.87,"end":61.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-9","text":"あら、すごいわね。でも、それくらいは自分でしないとね。","textVersion":"sha256:33b328bed05e216b2756a74c32351896b016c912505195cd9a4dcd139b3c2422","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":61.93,"end":66.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-10","text":"そうですか。じゃ、さっそく取り掛かりますね。","textVersion":"sha256:b8cc7016aac566632f6ebac9f5a324bbbddf4a9f4b21de6dca7c9f60f69dcb58","audioVersion":"sha256:7cf4db1992dc44a359bca87e0ddc81718b164657c24665ee87e4959f4503fec5","timelineVersion":"sha256:b51acd4b38d3782252559157eb62f82475c8c0a687463b5fef2006d627a9f8ec","start":67.15,"end":70.2,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"21bd13d1dcdbf290"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:a621cf2ed2c2845b6f6a82c4fac1d890a30c1c52ba13a25bcd1aafd3f0bdacd0","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":5.58,"end":15.44,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-0","text":"田中さん、ちょっといいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:602753707bf2e4994b80f741db32c96b3acb368d59cfa4e1b4c71e281fa779ca","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":19.04,"end":21.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-1","text":"はい、課長。なんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:0823082a327393e313b618aba948c118078afe9fecd84d1abb5c64196d934e1d","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":21.4,"end":23.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-2","text":"来月海外からお客さんが来るんだけど、何か気が利いたお土産、用意してもらえないかな、三人分。お帰りになる際に渡したいんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:9586ae360a2039963a7ffda41b1a8380b0b4e1eb3a956e0a481175ebf618dd5c","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":24.02,"end":34.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-3","text":"はい、その方たち、日本ははじめてですか。","textVersion":"sha256:34f0aa3ae962ea5ed1f17e8b473deea1d3c091a046d8f8f7c9940fffbd877dbe","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":34.64,"end":38.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-4","text":"いや、もう何度も来てるな。","textVersion":"sha256:a4f4173d1bd040718acf938ad12fd8cb7de891cbf055133a107a7c251ab5e850","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":38.76,"end":40.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-5","text":"じゃ、けっこう難しいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:274b5c54ac843ebb86d1aac6b43b6769dff1e8eb06faa2787ce2b4afe8328cca","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":41.24,"end":43.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-6","text":"たしか、去年は秘書課の人が用意してたから、何かアドバイスもらってみて？同じものにならないようにね。","textVersion":"sha256:163c9473df1d7d335f60bf2559b6b14b48fda692a1d605fe7cb40bc3fa5938cd","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":43.78,"end":51.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-7","text":"はい。あのう、今回、どこか観光地を案内したりするんでしょうか。訪れた土地の名産品なんか、喜ばれると思うんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:e6b20d11f6f9e7945e00203445ba15ee87f2c34c4ad2aaea92f03a1e16edc6ea","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":51.56,"end":62.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-8","text":"なんとか時間がとれないか調整してみたんだけど、どうにも仕事のスケジュールが厳しくてね、今回は。","textVersion":"sha256:1b29869af43fb6dfc4a613e5ade58b005116ebb5210345945733d664431da1a4","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":63.14,"end":70.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-9","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":70.84,"end":71.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-10","text":"じゃ、候補が決まったら、知らせてくれる？来週だから、急いでね。","textVersion":"sha256:318be726ec8468a8d0c30834d24bf76f5006c31a8060081f17a0044c5886cb8b","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":72.3,"end":76.59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-11","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:be0c48494f02b69b8001dfc2385cf7da357a5c20951408060831a6ccaef80080","timelineVersion":"sha256:a41c7471267cc266ffee99c74fcec354be6ac665335fbf27f2b050a37222348a","start":76.59,"end":77.26,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"21bd13d1dcdbf290"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:question","text":"留守番電話のメッセージを聞いています。荷物をいつ届くように送らなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:eb13d6d06d5cbdaeb3cad0bf07644236b443e60a34d69dc4bb504f9565332973","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":5.31,"end":13.36,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0","text":"白鳥ホテルの渡辺と申します。","textVersion":"sha256:fb537569d7a422f1684fb44f0936d198db5054c44ce54bbbaeee4806a134589c","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":17.14,"end":19.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-1","text":"お世話になっております。","textVersion":"sha256:2dad028c90a97453ad4581e90ddfd06c46fe0b0b2fd3715fb08deb151bf1bf6c","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":19.74,"end":20.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-2","text":"このたびはイベント会場として私どものホテルをお選びいただき、ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:438ef4e7251b975ccc66c7ab663ce37c41e155ef31308aac3d81e7d9efba1538","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":21.36,"end":26.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-3","text":"来月七日のイベントで使われる荷物の件ですが、会場が前日の六日の夜までほかのイベントで使われておりまして、事前に送りいただきましても会場でお預かりできない状況です。","textVersion":"sha256:c704c543c2a6dd416604b241caf93ac8a019d0cf5d6ad79990149fb9c64d5728","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":27.22,"end":40.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-4","text":"申し訳ございません。","textVersion":"sha256:c8d699659ded4e74bf9c3ab81b76dab0290fe4d2e3ebab4afe4d3bf1c1772040","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":40.35,"end":41.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-5","text":"宅配便は時間指定ができますので、恐縮ではございますが、七日の午前中に着くようにお送りいただけないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:32ed0165661d2bf693f2e25e379bf24da2d9fffc0f482963d03e667d21149d0c","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":42.34,"end":50.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-6","text":"イベントは夜六時スタートですから、準備は十分間に合うと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:be202c4a3ea53be4b2b3b6391bb89cb5323ee9733cade5b39586878fc11c320a","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":50.52,"end":55.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-7","text":"どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。","textVersion":"sha256:795b22b4bfaa1d840aed9af59a9c45bf6162def224298c4ffaca59a8ff8aaa73","audioVersion":"sha256:c39807cc11fc383d51781fb11e2264b47f77762fede929ea308e5dfe3babe82d","timelineVersion":"sha256:764f03f32cbdfb980207630d2b7635e2f4ff94dd526f2b0d61cab654c330ec30","start":55.84,"end":57.54,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"21bd13d1dcdbf290"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d8cf76c8357ef20316563d631779a2810c4feef9260d2e5d9796f140fb0ad69b","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9e53086d3526889cd6dd86b7a065a8f76e6e12d88cfb4df83c131460244dc8e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:question","text":"大学で女の学生と先生が話しています。女の学生はまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:5679ab48d264abce4dcdb3cf504b7b0ad03e2bea184c7ecc8f5f16368e5e1fbb","audioVersion":"sha256:d8cf76c8357ef20316563d631779a2810c4feef9260d2e5d9796f140fb0ad69b","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9e53086d3526889cd6dd86b7a065a8f76e6e12d88cfb4df83c131460244dc8e","start":5.18,"end":15.05,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-0","text":"先生、卒論の第三章、読んでいただけましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:8f4b9aa385ae4e6d530557aa843de48ffc64ee54fe53d2db45f8712d6e8100a7","audioVersion":"sha256:d8cf76c8357ef20316563d631779a2810c4feef9260d2e5d9796f140fb0ad69b","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9e53086d3526889cd6dd86b7a065a8f76e6e12d88cfb4df83c131460244dc8e","start":17.09,"end":21.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-1","text":"うん、地域経済の現状について、よく分析してあると思いましたよ。構成もしっかりしてるし。ただ、扱っているデータが去年のだけだったけど、もう少し遡って収集する必要がありますね。","textVersion":"sha256:5469b89ccdb24705f4dcb9804a26de4bdf2b3006a0c5d9961974be8d094ddc54","audioVersion":"sha256:d8cf76c8357ef20316563d631779a2810c4feef9260d2e5d9796f140fb0ad69b","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9e53086d3526889cd6dd86b7a065a8f76e6e12d88cfb4df83c131460244dc8e","start":21.9,"end":37.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:d8cf76c8357ef20316563d631779a2810c4feef9260d2e5d9796f140fb0ad69b","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9e53086d3526889cd6dd86b7a065a8f76e6e12d88cfb4df83c131460244dc8e","start":38.28,"end":38.57,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-3","text":"この分野では、長期的な視点が欠かせないと思いますよ。今後どのような課題に取り組むべきかという提案も、まあ、それによって変わってきますから。","textVersion":"sha256:c6f18b176508fc444a8bcbb50804a0fdd3b9345f6186374574aceda792aabe5e","audioVersion":"sha256:d8cf76c8357ef20316563d631779a2810c4feef9260d2e5d9796f140fb0ad69b","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9e53086d3526889cd6dd86b7a065a8f76e6e12d88cfb4df83c131460244dc8e","start":39.53,"end":50.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-4","text":"はい。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:70bc709713b29a96ff615b46ab015b19a85f5e34cba1a6d1088212cf4e892c78","audioVersion":"sha256:d8cf76c8357ef20316563d631779a2810c4feef9260d2e5d9796f140fb0ad69b","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9e53086d3526889cd6dd86b7a065a8f76e6e12d88cfb4df83c131460244dc8e","start":50.77,"end":52.82,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"21bd13d1dcdbf290"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c528d2c58da8d3154250225da10eecb9e4fae54710ea51b707e251bb39111d51","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":3.68,"end":13.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-0","text":"課長、午後の会議の準備ですが、資料の印刷が済みました。","textVersion":"sha256:41c90ead935fb30c97e2c57bcf5113df48c4f1421968fc3b578543bf4f081419","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":15.3,"end":19.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-1","text":"ありがとう。場所が一階の会議室に変更になったことはもう連絡してくれた？","textVersion":"sha256:5d8ec54f8eaa22e7b84ad79c69acd0c1c8b0a98ca495d5bc259dca6189ba6854","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":20.26,"end":25.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":25.98,"end":26.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-3","text":"そう。じゃ、悪いんだけどパソコンの準備をしておいてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:815223cb534bd49b3a5dc9d52e7e19881665acb9fffe4084030fe72129b11ff7","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":26.38,"end":31.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-4","text":"はい、すぐに。","textVersion":"sha256:4f6b6286d09a4ab78934c77ba2ce5c27b79bc1b1e4f32d80fc32249117bbcde6","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":31.34,"end":32.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-5","text":"あっ、部長だけど、都合がよくなって出席なさることになったって聞いてるよね？","textVersion":"sha256:b9ec61726a7267f689de258fe83d6ab4a29c2b0967625e1d41b63d09980aa929","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":32.68,"end":38.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-6","text":"えっ？","textVersion":"sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":38.72,"end":39.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-7","text":"部長のスケジュール、前日に確認することお願いしてたでしょう？","textVersion":"sha256:b82631ecfa034407bea416c1beead8fd70852c12ff6f6ea74e0a6f11c13374fb","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":39.56,"end":43.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-8","text":"あー、申し訳ありません。あのー、会議で配る資料なんですが、部長の分、数に入れてなかったので…。","textVersion":"sha256:fb1eed24a735ef0f291a75306644f41e221acb3735712d2c26db0a388ebb6382","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":44.06,"end":51.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-9","text":"じゃ、それを先にやっちゃって。場所の変更についてはお伝えしておくから。","textVersion":"sha256:74ba77cd8e6cf4d791c058656c089dd3268733dfe09edfd84d512f6d9bc80460","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":51.54,"end":56.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-10","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:c1771c5e34541860268e5c1ad2289ee8ebe44b95635ee2ef6c7b380cdcbc8467","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e4eddbe989bba535001b780f1c35ccb41b797f58ee9e68ab802c7a513b42dd0","start":56.72,"end":58.02,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"d330c0be150ab36e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:question","text":"市民講座の説明会で工作の教室の先生が話しています。工作の教室に参加する人は次に来る時、何を持って来なければなりませんか。次に来る時です。","textVersion":"sha256:11c7fc6cc0cd335e0e542ebd21c84246d7e0edbd23d7aae3fc6936e78936923a","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","start":3.52,"end":20.86,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-0","text":"この工作教室は来週から毎月1回、計5回開催します。","textVersion":"sha256:6a3ff13e1b79b5534331d5a35732529aae9674369106a0cd564959c0124d548b","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","start":22.68,"end":28.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-1","text":"毎回持ってきていただくものが違いますので持ち物のご確認をお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:ec689e21e65c96c99015929df90ae1ab5ea5c0b7760317794fc8bed7aeb953c8","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","start":29.3,"end":34.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-2","text":"ただ、筆記用具は毎回ご持参ください。","textVersion":"sha256:0dbd58b64f2441d0dc79bdd8ce06636989f38eb024cfa1af54f3e870c22f7406","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","start":35.72,"end":38.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-3","text":"で、来週ですが、草花で布を染めようという企画ですので、ハンカチ程度の大きさの布もお持ちください。","textVersion":"sha256:1202f3e7903886e8dda3931a495db1a3b50acd1653215681766b6cde9af85cc0","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","start":39.24,"end":47.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-4","text":"布は白じゃないときれいに染まりませんよ。","textVersion":"sha256:335a9fe846da528ee72a7d802935361b695b015e4ae9383cbfa9ebb6721e6200","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","start":47.66,"end":50.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-5","text":"それから来月ですが、外に出る企画となりまして、その際は石を集めたりしますので、手袋などをご用意いただきます。","textVersion":"sha256:a0f5fe330951b5215cbb089887bba4f4a0f821b634ec2013a3d08da9d4ef114e","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","start":51.05,"end":60.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-6","text":"はさみはほとんどの企画で使いますが、これはこちらでご用意します。","textVersion":"sha256:29e59b8992f6b2d83b409977ea956ac50afb27dd3603e319dbcdf946bb6210b9","audioVersion":"sha256:5b020978f115e8780dd979f6c7ab242654998537656f02162aa2b94f955e6d3b","timelineVersion":"sha256:ae8794a74d331dd5373e33df8bded3667b4cc5a27002e870746ea252db9e1f53","start":61,"end":65.76,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d330c0be150ab36e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:question","text":"クリーニング店で男の店員と店長が話しています。男の店員は何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:145194c634f1497f5e4db2368d2fac9da53fc4cc86566f9d9dded06036110a01","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":3.8,"end":14.04,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-0","text":"店長、すみません。さっき、店長の休憩中にお客様がいらっしゃって、昨日お返ししたワイシャツの襟に皺が付いているって、ワイシャツを置いて行かれたんですが…。","textVersion":"sha256:c88fb9a460a779bac3b4a1b645280f1e8de4200f9d8bbcca5fd259dbc6b34bea","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":15.6,"end":26.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-1","text":"このワイシャツですか？確かにこれはちょっと…。","textVersion":"sha256:36fd49c8b3c6a86b7ea4489a19a29f8837d82a5d2cf9d00afe6ad3ad23c6c353","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":26.72,"end":32.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-2","text":"今日中に受け取りたいっておっしゃっていたんですが、どうしましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:e936c2eb562269fa4ba23b034e207fa6d58c96d72a13590d24557dbf9e578350","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":32.56,"end":36.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-3","text":"んー、工場に持っていくと明後日までお返しできないしね。あっ、店のアイロンで直せば今日中にお返しできるか。森田くん、お願いできますか。私はお客様と連絡を取ってみますから。","textVersion":"sha256:a1b1d7215c49373e527d6d0e729d7ac11d62beb09f10073924d8872ac56a7895","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":36.34,"end":51.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-4","text":"はい、ここだけですよね？わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:ce821810244ed6f4fd64911ca96a6625b2b76a898b90fa91f8a8218874247bff","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":51.36,"end":53.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-5","text":"で、それができたら、ご自宅に直接届けて謝って来ますね。","textVersion":"sha256:b61b177dae567f7bce043265f5b039c55c5545d3c17a52486fdb1ae45b68755c","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":53.94,"end":58.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-6","text":"じゃ、割引券か何か用意しておきましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:5d4ecf5ba1608676ce08f0c6d86cf0d5baa37b3c115d3b7461e2dddfa79a9478","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":58.98,"end":62.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-7","text":"それも私が。","textVersion":"sha256:c15bf4eddeef45f1867af25635e83c1c277ebc5a48e4116e0c7afdb9604720d8","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":62.2,"end":63.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-8","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:94e411df676b3121bf2433501828905f16235695d6f2c651d04411008a609b08","timelineVersion":"sha256:73fcc0af8b765ad6879fc6580a3373b620ddb358750dd159f940547a473e01d0","start":63.44,"end":64.26,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"d330c0be150ab36e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:question","text":"大学院の事務室で女の学生と職員が話しています。女の学生は今月末までに何を事務室に持っていかなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:5ec1264ee7da6af2259603e59438253549ed631a11863999ec5e3c07412bdefc","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","start":3.84,"end":17.04,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-0","text":"すみません。私、今月大学院に入学したばかりなんですけど、学内の奨学金に応募したいので、申込書をいただきたいのですが…。","textVersion":"sha256:7d645ff92e4ac8e3ff73a2fb2feb6b5840024bb7b6363a2088d66d439cfcb33c","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","start":18.6,"end":28.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-1","text":"ああ、今年からインターネット上で応募してもらうよう変更したので今月末までに大学院のホームページにアクセスして入力してください。","textVersion":"sha256:02a96826a7cfba670316e892caf9ea75996fdc946e2f2ac1d58a0ba636816934","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","start":28.82,"end":38.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-2","text":"わかりました。入力したらそのページを印刷したものも提出しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:3d74d639ce1dc0c20709fbe6a973a470b5a05858527849f8d76387e7d25bd99d","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","start":39.32,"end":44.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-3","text":"必要ありません。こちらに提出する書類は指導教員の推薦状、出身大学の成績証明書、それから収入を証明する書類です。1年生ですから、推薦状は来月、指導教員が決まってからでないと頼めないですね。それは決まり次第でいいので、それ以外のものを今月末までにこちらに持って来てください。","textVersion":"sha256:1ac1de31db0a216450a67d80481950b6e411a3062e3a25a45c955dcfb1693cd0","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","start":45.12,"end":71.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-4","text":"はい。あのー、私、この大学の出身なんで成績証明書は必要ないって聞いたんですけど…。","textVersion":"sha256:3e9809d9c4df9ad8c62c830d3e325fe9954a183fa700479cff99929da8dc7e6f","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","start":71.68,"end":79.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-5","text":"あっ、それなら必要ありません。","textVersion":"sha256:820b218ff9fd1498fbd8fd551b6448f1c5e0dba12f77ea4eb1abaa80d462d393","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","start":79.56,"end":81.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-6","text":"わかりました。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:8eed0508d699cfc2d490d4b2a4476553438dfd17dca1b6ebf5135bcc6e20cb4a","audioVersion":"sha256:0ae1a07c64a756562b66e0653521fb69fac2a57d647bbe97cca4afd43d785650","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebfa5e95dd7317cf08249c2bdcaa4c97e6418630e781e9e730796dd5daa4e1e4","start":81.56,"end":83.98,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d330c0be150ab36e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:question","text":"大学の演劇クラブで女の学生と部長が話しています。女の学生はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:67ff5decce68bb3cb3867edf2c85e53627d136c5f95bfaafbf5229be8109e362","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":3.58,"end":14.68,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-0","text":"部長、大変です。今、村田さんから電話があったんですけど、明日の発表会出られないそうなんです。転んで足を骨折してしまったそうで。","textVersion":"sha256:1495c7ec32dacb0b789e7f7484380979d4d126fe8d45439059c14ca4b2b4003a","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":16.16,"end":26.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-1","text":"えー？鈴木さん、それほんと？","textVersion":"sha256:5a3f9cc42a1116c4bcdd09b9ee93e01fd285a7182e5eccc33eca101383148cb8","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":27.1,"end":29.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-2","text":"重要な役なのにどうしましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:9e0c78d5ef72f5ae91d84c92061bb675c2a536d30f8ca9f3970919a41eef71e5","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":30.1,"end":32.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-3","text":"んー、最終のリハーサル、今日の夕方からだし、村田さんの代わり急いで探さないと。そうだ、鈴木さん。セリフ覚えてない？いつも傍で練習見てたでしょう？","textVersion":"sha256:65298cc1d6654022e44843c76a72e500909cdba2c7b2c75f709a4743fd9a5a0e","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":32.62,"end":44.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-4","text":"え？私ですか？確かにセリフは覚えてますが、私なんかまだクラブに入ったばかりですから…。","textVersion":"sha256:00fd10ee2984c040f1cb86627001632b87915855683b7942cfbf6fbe8fb97723","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":45.14,"end":52.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-5","text":"でも鈴木さん、以前から演劇の経験もあるし、そういえば、この劇をしたことがあるって言ってたよね？","textVersion":"sha256:1a571cdd7a7a34a48154aebc8abb105caec80632c11af8925f9d139820556e65","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":53.04,"end":59.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-6","text":"はい。でも他にどなたかいるんじゃないですか。","textVersion":"sha256:19bd26beed51a6664ed66587ea4f99f2f3c9890491c79a4ef3d1e77426f52f08","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":60.56,"end":63.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-7","text":"他の人はみんなすること決まってるし、村田さんが劇で着ることになってた服を着てみて。合わないようだったら、最終リハーサルまでに衣装係が調整してくれるから。その間にみんなに役の変更を伝えておくね。納得してくれるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:cdbdf10a9065128ddd1243943fed1ee02f868828bfcb9fd931cad331b3b9f8a0","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":63.74,"end":82.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-8","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:612ba6b7ca63b974823a1427a5bbc3282a4d363ef15157b6cc21fc5e3029335f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b91d7a830c3c431539a9404d2fe8d233ca45c438db9833f021630b7bfca053f","start":82.2,"end":83.84,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d330c0be150ab36e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:question","text":"電話で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はこのあとすぐ何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:9ef5843d050f6d11116b21e92df39c12466192249577b3f910cdc71e8b441804","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":3.38,"end":20.48,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-0","text":"はい。桜デザイン事務所です。","textVersion":"sha256:e5081b4119ec15f51a19614d5dbffe091a05b0584210e53f8b31ca2c4c32d298","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":20.88,"end":22.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-1","text":"もしもし、いつもお世話になっております。南銀行の鈴木です。","textVersion":"sha256:b546e3d93b78ebd12eb6024b3ed195880e16aed6d7ec6ec80ed50422e057ff78","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":22.96,"end":28.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-2","text":"あ、鈴木様、ちょうど先ほどご依頼のあった資料をメールでお送りしたところです。","textVersion":"sha256:b7b81d2c70437c9d3779022e48c16b226898dbb404038683657477d57334edb9","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":28.2,"end":34.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-3","text":"ええ、その件なんですが、拝見したところ、どうもこちらでお願いしたものと内容が違うようで。確か、資料を修正していただくようお願いしたと思うんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:e62226cf7a2cc1afd46f2d98f710cf9b42e4b6f4448d886aebacd1a2b45cd023","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":34.6,"end":47.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-4","text":"えっ、変更されていませんでしたか。大変失礼いたしました。間違って修正前のファイルを添付してしまったんだと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:8b6ada7782ec5c8f944db14cee66bddea65c1f1b252fb62a342fabe18d28583f","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":47.4,"end":56.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-5","text":"では、すみませんが、新しいものを。","textVersion":"sha256:5052bf2a6c37886398edf42f5546ff6ceccb1414e15840a39f8096ddd0fadf7d","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":56.18,"end":58.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-6","text":"はい、直ちに。","textVersion":"sha256:cc745a18b01113f17894a054b0ed3a2a616591b066d02d67eabd409573c66c4f","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":58.76,"end":60.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-7","text":"次回以降の打ち合わせの日程については、資料を確認したあと、改めてご相談させてください。","textVersion":"sha256:4f58e0ae8248865f3ff2c48d61f14414bc8e46521021964269db8eecf48d5694","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":59.94,"end":67.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-8","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:efa54157bdd49b88b5a231d327562279aedbdfe5d4c68e94a5d596695a9099d6","timelineVersion":"sha256:0db86a67b368800ada130d1901819df3160814e3fc915f9440bf7a92e6d7ac34","start":67.42,"end":68.56,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"3b968fd983d09988"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:cc3aad2533e1296055f65a78b20426379d83b077ab3bb70d33377a33a0df9b4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e1b1e89bc82c83bc4113b39b8732cdfb80584bf1ea1d9fec838971abd50009e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:question","text":"オフィスで係長が話しています。社員はこのあと新たに何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:cafc4c80ee379d3c6a932f09a24cf7f59c315e83345209a49649919852b56f82","audioVersion":"sha256:cc3aad2533e1296055f65a78b20426379d83b077ab3bb70d33377a33a0df9b4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e1b1e89bc82c83bc4113b39b8732cdfb80584bf1ea1d9fec838971abd50009e","start":3.5,"end":13.5,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-0","text":"皆さん、先月の会議でオフィス環境の改善についてお話ししましたが、取り組んでくれていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8b111bb1b72b2bd3f862c841db25a42d6479378b8fae0ce917d5b544c5938fcf","audioVersion":"sha256:cc3aad2533e1296055f65a78b20426379d83b077ab3bb70d33377a33a0df9b4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e1b1e89bc82c83bc4113b39b8732cdfb80584bf1ea1d9fec838971abd50009e","start":15.38,"end":22.48,"speaker":"係長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-1","text":"机の上に個人情報を出したままにしないというのは徹底してくれているようですね。","textVersion":"sha256:009ca0f1ea9619af9a3d9cbcac987283293dc3e18f43a772b37a93068bc4f945","audioVersion":"sha256:cc3aad2533e1296055f65a78b20426379d83b077ab3bb70d33377a33a0df9b4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e1b1e89bc82c83bc4113b39b8732cdfb80584bf1ea1d9fec838971abd50009e","start":23.38,"end":29.14,"speaker":"係長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-2","text":"以前はメモがたくさん張ってあるパソコンをよく見ましたが、最近はなくなりました。","textVersion":"sha256:95e1747c46bc0d326f7dcab0362fd31377984a1a83386e4811c107bf6f3eb760","audioVersion":"sha256:cc3aad2533e1296055f65a78b20426379d83b077ab3bb70d33377a33a0df9b4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e1b1e89bc82c83bc4113b39b8732cdfb80584bf1ea1d9fec838971abd50009e","start":29.9,"end":35.17,"speaker":"係長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-3","text":"えー、今は使わない昔の書類ですが、ダンボール箱に入ったままになっていますね。","textVersion":"sha256:ead79c50d1ea3a856a6580e18d848994c1be21e052caa70c4dadfc3be047e968","audioVersion":"sha256:cc3aad2533e1296055f65a78b20426379d83b077ab3bb70d33377a33a0df9b4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e1b1e89bc82c83bc4113b39b8732cdfb80584bf1ea1d9fec838971abd50009e","start":36.12,"end":42.86,"speaker":"係長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-4","text":"年度ごとにファイルにまとめるなどしておいてください。","textVersion":"sha256:c5d486d8ad3bffcaeacc3c955a75945059bef94275c0a97b2de3a7c3835c4e28","audioVersion":"sha256:cc3aad2533e1296055f65a78b20426379d83b077ab3bb70d33377a33a0df9b4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e1b1e89bc82c83bc4113b39b8732cdfb80584bf1ea1d9fec838971abd50009e","start":43.34,"end":46.68,"speaker":"係長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-5","text":"あっ、ファイルといえば、棚の中のものは、ラベルが付いて整理され、見違えるようになりましたね。","textVersion":"sha256:48538a0c8fae32bcb0b08c7a0c9d7116df7fb0bc692b3e50902907306056ea33","audioVersion":"sha256:cc3aad2533e1296055f65a78b20426379d83b077ab3bb70d33377a33a0df9b4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:0e1b1e89bc82c83bc4113b39b8732cdfb80584bf1ea1d9fec838971abd50009e","start":47.14,"end":54.16,"speaker":"係長"}],"batchVersion":"3b968fd983d09988"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:question","text":"学校でコーラス部の女の先生と校長先生が話しています。女の先生はこのあとまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a1c03995192a67667b0f46c5e5e5d935e51e6b231d05fa8a0777803e18fc2e5a","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":3.62,"end":15.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-0","text":"校長先生、あのう、校長先生は以前、コーラス部の指導をされていたことがあると伺ったんですが、うちの学校のコーラス部のことで、ご相談したいことがあるんです。少しよろしいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:d6cf2b4e6a545efea9dacba3d3172f09933d4c94128bc203f7d24ac3bb84be45","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":17.12,"end":31.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-1","text":"ええ、なんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:bcfd6639d83e30f8c491be0128965c675c6a22a69eb8b8e09ce237e9d7a50955","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":32.24,"end":33.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-2","text":"今コンクールに向けて練習をしているんですけど、生徒たちの声、今ひとつ表現力が乏しくて。声の出し方など、基礎的な練習を強化したほうがいいんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:17b7439fe7595651a5bd73ef9bbfea3859e6a72797551abd5c50856d9140abb7","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":33.96,"end":46.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-3","text":"うん、そういう時は、曲全体を見直したほうがいいんじゃないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:1a77eaea4810d61fc6f94314651bd80d297ad84eaa15850e5a5e63d9d6df12a9","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":46.8,"end":51.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-4","text":"えっ、曲を変更するんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:7220c7912d5e6ed99f2a8ce11c2bdd439ba60c754f1c37711e803f7aceb63e9a","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":52.26,"end":54.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-5","text":"いや、みんなで歌詞を読んで、意味を深く理解する時間を取るっていう意味ですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:50ce68048222c42b30ff62ada0b46d760f510f44d8b8b0999bc9a844513c30b5","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":54.82,"end":60.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":61.34,"end":61.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-7","text":"そうすれば、曲の捉え方が変わって、感情の込め方もよくなると思いますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:3c00c0d056543141dd496a69c70066599664fa9de95ac1c7f465fde63a826420","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":62.54,"end":67.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-8","text":"なるほど。","textVersion":"sha256:e6060d825a6076f13a47cc304d64491b431764116f93db22e8a3eb419858f2a8","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":68.36,"end":68.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-9","text":"その後様子を見て、必要だったら、体力トレーニングを増やしたりしてもいいと思います。大きく伸びのある声を出すには体の強さも必要だから。","textVersion":"sha256:674ee3088be47e2425d911b55cc340f4981854a8c2ea949797d50a3b0fca8111","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":69.46,"end":80.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-10","text":"ありがとうございます。早速やってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:9d41c8da598dca188231d3f8b78e8f06d95793f178f6b3c6eb940d77eaefafd6","audioVersion":"sha256:a58136a040fec4b704f94edc1ae563246385bca2b023be16b32896975f31d0a1","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e963a4cd62af1d1f7d5662eca33903f6300e522ef049eec014a7b2514b2c82e","start":80.72,"end":83.46,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"3b968fd983d09988"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:question","text":"電話でホームセンターの店員と女の人が話しています。女の人はホームセンターに行く前に、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:b9d14489c7a92a6667d6182cf194b35be29a976060c1765bac23bce1f8174f84","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":3.5,"end":15.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-0","text":"はい、青空ホームセンターです。","textVersion":"sha256:1bfdb35f6d342d899d6f14b1e1323690630b1b97306a94ad64ae95eeb8bcb4aa","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":17.72,"end":20.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-1","text":"もしもし、あのう、そちらで家具の作り方を教えてもらえるって、インターネットで見たんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:72536cc90294c63c5e7e7344fd7761289a680a30bc500a905d2e5cd9d5153e38","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":20.52,"end":27.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-2","text":"ええ、今度の土曜日に、親子向けの一日体験教室をやります。定員が限られているので、早めにお申し込みください。","textVersion":"sha256:b2fc6112e198322ea1c66cdb72094d278ea62980a3876ad23cb5a871f3798d2c","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":27.4,"end":35.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-3","text":"えーと、そうじゃなくて、定期的に集まって、ちょっと本格的なものを作っているサークルのようなものがあるって。初心者なんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:32bf20c0fc4308e3f3a8aba0b20747d191cb80cc483a2f53f123af65703bc252","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":36.52,"end":47.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-4","text":"ああ、それなら、毎週日曜の午後にやってます。インストラクターが一人いますから、初心者の方でも大丈夫ですよ。作りたい家具の写真を持ってきてください。あくまで、参考にする程度ですが。","textVersion":"sha256:5b30df6d406816bc71cdcd1cc98e8a863c86760a5d88a18be9a8c5a0cd95ff3d","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":47.12,"end":61.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-5","text":"わかりました。あっ、ホームページに、会員登録が必要だって書いてありましたが。","textVersion":"sha256:3a0ccf8531b0c97a99e484eedc101eff19aef00c6c46438bc612afeb5f2b83ea","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":61.52,"end":68.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-6","text":"それは一度参加されてから、継続すると決められた時で結構です。","textVersion":"sha256:46232eb72a3d1a028f788d3121f6634e5b66c9763e591fe5e9ea9edf9e75b761","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":67.92,"end":72.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-7","text":"そうですか。それから、道具は。","textVersion":"sha256:bf5acf120fe2b10e4d78f098c54727e13a51926d806c3317d96065e7b4d6dd3b","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":72.8,"end":76.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-8","text":"初回は、ここのを使っていただけます。その後は、少しずつご自分で買って揃えていってください。","textVersion":"sha256:97e8fc9da49a4e37497270cd078b2f12c88e0729b3685ad160143547f20f93ec","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":75.9,"end":82.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-9","text":"わかりました。では、次の日曜日に伺います。わたくし、斎藤と申します。よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:26b216566459c79517b37d3907cfcd174a9b93915e895e97756d3544d5a71814","audioVersion":"sha256:193cfa0a539d112ce3860c242372bfead7090795a5a465753256eca56955f09e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4f9c2a0c26653f62cfd775aa5b6e0fc8c3eddbc5bf77d585b6599b0ace4fc04","start":82.02,"end":90.58,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"3b968fd983d09988"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:question","text":"大学の事務室で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこのあとまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:808fcb64f68c2110888b29518e1e0816415f9db86a3055c8778ebaedb4adc246","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":3.72,"end":15.02,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-0","text":"山本さん、あしたうちの大学で行うシンポジウムですが、お願いしていた準備進んでますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b3dd61d17e597ea01f83072ce70ac64cb6ce04f1b70c4b7c881865f012e75158","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":14.9,"end":24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-1","text":"はい。配る資料は、すべて印刷が終わっています。","textVersion":"sha256:5a8919810928ab11ccea8323ccd2be7ed4eb6eac75083449bfcae1930bbf4460","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":23.88,"end":28.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-2","text":"では早速会場に運んでください。","textVersion":"sha256:5339430a45820bfd272088450a6311c77e1e7f66b3aec3e6bcac4b5e1ea49378","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":28.2,"end":30.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":30.62,"end":31.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-4","text":"結構な量ですから。何人か手伝ってくれる人を探したほうがいいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:2f55a347307ddff1b2ddd5526df590973227141012bdab1d26a902819c3f4688","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":31.38,"end":36.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-5","text":"今朝声をかけて3人にお願いしてあります。そろそろ来てくれる時間です。","textVersion":"sha256:4854eb5ee2164efdcfdab05cf0e8175b98ece079ca04f930ef71fd6a32bb2051","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":36.58,"end":42.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-6","text":"そうですか。それから会場の席ですが、今回は招待客が来ますから、その方々の分をとっておかなくちゃいけません。前の方の真ん中辺り、十二席に「招待席」と書いた紙を張っておいてください。","textVersion":"sha256:24eafc244a212b123c1cffad25deed43835eaec583866d4c628cc4825325d357","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":42.48,"end":58.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":58.86,"end":60.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-8","text":"椅子に張る紙は山本さんたちが資料を運んでる間に、私が作っておきますから、後で取りに来てくれますか。","textVersion":"sha256:2fbc7fa40f870434b07f6f767507dc21ca0f20f8470c144bbaea0f7d70432337","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":59.94,"end":65.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":67.7,"end":68.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-10","text":"それから、講演していただく先生にお出しするお昼はどうなってますか。","textVersion":"sha256:467910e0310f451f27661584042baaec1519cf7327280d46be50a537ad5fe181","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":68.32,"end":73.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-11","text":"お弁当の予約は済んでるんですが、配達の確認は当日の朝することになっているので、必ずやっておきます。","textVersion":"sha256:2ab7ec3c6f43f703c700ffae2621f812090d320687dabad303e4924da4424abf","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":73.34,"end":82.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-12","text":"そうですか。頼みますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6e2f40029b5245628a695a2391e6b8e71bb754429043c31a9af4b084f04508a3","audioVersion":"sha256:af28fee642b183d598c36f5cb52fcf2a68672f3ce5697464ababcc30c6df750b","timelineVersion":"sha256:2859c00c67fc27820a01deb5c81e4c05ce0f1e2bb61d05e38104564b4338b5f8","start":82.1,"end":83.92,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"3b968fd983d09988"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:question","text":"会社で課長と男の人が話しています。男の人はこの後何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:033930d00fd8ddddc22766253f584560e92111b39e9fa6fda04b1183596846b5","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":0.12,"end":8.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-0","text":"ちょっといい？","textVersion":"sha256:d9486cb203a2e30ff05808af65c5695cb4fcb5cfe96a9f574127a2df4f6ef26d","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":10.62,"end":11.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-1","text":"はい、課長。","textVersion":"sha256:1c1822621906e9e2aca3530bd8eb21311b0f33e8b5296889074420504ac255de","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":11.78,"end":12.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-2","text":"今、林さんから電話があってお子さんが熱を出して今日は会社を休むそうなの。それで悪いんだけど、先週の会議の内容を代わりにまとめてもらえない？明日の会議で使うから今日の昼までにお願いしたいんだけど、前もやったことあるよね？","textVersion":"sha256:0c9a0fe1cb9d9ee2e2e23fd2237263de8539fe91b34589e7360dee811a71fcea","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":13.5,"end":30.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-3","text":"あ、はい。ただ午前中にその作業が入ると今やってる調査結果の入力が今日中には終わらなくなってしまいますが・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:7480b5f7816c602bdc6416649556ab7387d2c0fb00b4ff182ed120cbfa01b5de","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":31.28,"end":39.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-4","text":"あー、じゃ、今してもらってる方は他の人にお願いしましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:e2492e9c21441fad7e6f0b9b916f8a24bb2c27a086ca9f6b097de25ed0ed9ffe","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":39.7,"end":44.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-5","text":"わかりました。作業の詳細は林さんに電話で確認した方がいいですか？","textVersion":"sha256:2cd7bab58bc4d4a5b4639098bb0306f3ffd57fbb26ca9b6c805ac99b1d6d5cd5","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":44.78,"end":49.69,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-6","text":"あ、パソコンにある共有フォルダーに途中まで作業したのが入っていて、見ればわかるそうだから。","textVersion":"sha256:cfcb6fd3336dbb8a662c3d59967e1d5df8e9a31a8454818a6db8bcde3c35568f","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":49.72,"end":55.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-7","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":56.02,"end":57.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-8","text":"この前も他の人が休んだ時にプレゼンの資料を作ってもらったよね。申し訳ないけどよろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:59f15dec1a2fe12fd1be82b0a5a561f42e2cedefea7222bea8c16bcee37f0b3f","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":58.02,"end":65.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c85be041e62cdcb9ed6d2df53c8d6aca6c24933b0f22db0c8b89ff12a99a3a54","timelineVersion":"sha256:2cf0975d870df0e2405a7106981a3f143f84f08bbc019d7306267ea8a9b2a55a","start":65.28,"end":65.54,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"13267f6725dfdf6a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:question","text":"駅の改札口で女の人と駅員が話しています。女の人は今、ここでいくら払いますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d2c0db5e8f48d505241388bede2e7091dc12a335fcbd29c7122d2c1c15c8eac0","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":3.34,"end":14.08,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-0","text":"すみません。切符を失くしてしまって、山川駅から乗ったんですが、よく探したんですけど見つからなくて・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:8c1083348f26ea6c89b9f56402afecca57893e51516f3f0b00f721269aa9bc32","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":17.7,"end":26.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-1","text":"もう一度乗車券を購入していただくことになります。","textVersion":"sha256:b749e1de8c7f7fcea02b37a5645e5f6aac9fa68f85327c3517fb03cd0fe6e603","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":26.5,"end":29.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-2","text":"あのー、全額払わなければなりませんか？","textVersion":"sha256:cb1667141cc99cecb4a82d879370da7fc3318ce1ec76b958e86d5c76aa2670c7","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":30.16,"end":33.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-3","text":"はい。山川駅からですと1000円ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:2c6b51ba444523b77c41b9c2eac88dfd2581d7135aedcf95b4e28b70ecf82977","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":33.68,"end":37.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-4","text":"でも確かに切符を買ったんですが、2000円も払うことになっちゃうんですけど・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:ee6e715e7edd3360d64c68c046d0e50d7abf20b7c4d7fa2eed9f0955b1b4a040","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":37.48,"end":42.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-5","text":"同じ切符を2回買っていただくことになってしまいますがそういう規則ですので申し訳ありません。","textVersion":"sha256:3f7f1a4614af1c696bcd851cfb6a9c5d9de2c13f227209f4e2623c7ffd444e30","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":43.2,"end":49.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-6","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":49.8,"end":50.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-7","text":"今から切符を再発行したという証明書お出ししますので、失くされた乗車券が出てきましたらどちらの駅でも結構ですので証明書とその乗車券をご提示ください。そうしましたら乗車料金から払い戻しの手数料分100円を差し引いた900円をご返金しますので。","textVersion":"sha256:5037fd7f44db527dbeab848897df62bc4d669f7af53bd21538932f5c2ced8860","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":51.04,"end":70.91,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-8","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:4c75a2222c63321d2e34ac4a79fec928d349bb55d22a5aa5c7ff1625c35db5bf","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e00af54f0ddffa4ab968e0f3d4a41be824700d7cf3b7da440a05f2188f869da","start":71.24,"end":72.18,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"13267f6725dfdf6a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:question","text":"大学で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5acd897d7c33333dd784d17b4b948f65863bc6a10901722ee0c8b25d2b202fa1","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":3.52,"end":14.68,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-0","text":"あ、中野さん。中野さんって大学の最寄駅の駐輪場を借りて大学まで自転車で来てるよね？僕も駅前の駐輪場を借りたいんだけど、どうやって申請するか教えてくれない？","textVersion":"sha256:6b6826f0f3195003726fac905ba9a33c33a7b12ca5af417d2ffc83572dcbd9e8","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":16.34,"end":28.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-1","text":"うん。でも申請の締切って毎月二十日だから今日締切だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:be5bd61188f109a62ada508c1fda7b2647b8dbd35853f76f4fa4c8dd95e8d33a","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":29.36,"end":35.09,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-2","text":"え？ほんと？","textVersion":"sha256:b5f7184077250dbe01c69c1567d2ca79a0bc4492325188fe1d5b7a8ac045ce27","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":35.2,"end":36.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-3","text":"駐輪場に張り紙がしてあったの見たよ。","textVersion":"sha256:361d8a86033dd3604117b94259850f4c923b826e36ddb48ca9f67aff3de1e282","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":36.4,"end":39.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-4","text":"そうなんだ。今日4時半まで授業あるのにどうしよう。申込みは駐輪場の受付でするの？","textVersion":"sha256:b58298bb3cc3f039f8a34caf17b8b6418a9c7fc7f4e6c7eced22cd97d035d2f8","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":39.76,"end":46.67,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-5","text":"ううん、市役所。窓口は5時までだから申請書を用意してあらかじめ記入しておけばぎりぎり間に合うんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:9b0549ac0553165c7a6597b6b1db86be4300dbf071910b44c4544424641edf0a","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":46.8,"end":55.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-6","text":"でも申請書は市役所に取りに行かないとだめなんだよね？","textVersion":"sha256:10badb3770cef431e95e4f8b3b0cfcff83d712a6dfa95d4b54258c51c4e17359","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":55.96,"end":59.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-7","text":"市役所のホームページからもダウンロードできるよ。午後の授業が始まるまでまだ時間あるから印刷してすぐ提出できる状態にしておいたら？","textVersion":"sha256:2371974a88307d7e9508189849efee801c5f86cf12afb4002642d969acd295fe","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":60.12,"end":69.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-8","text":"うん、そうする。申請書の他に必要な書類ってある？","textVersion":"sha256:d3229a9692aada0e2bfe056b6db3148ce573b77c110fe28f4a338aa23624eb08","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":70.14,"end":74.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-9","text":"学生証のコピーがいるんだけど、それは市役所でコピーすればいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:50019da6a07712b6713c11d985edd87fcf9223cd5e04f37a4e3b7ae9fa1775e9","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":74.44,"end":78.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-10","text":"わかった。","textVersion":"sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9","audioVersion":"sha256:36482414d8bc7ff731d015784ad9106dea0bf6c93d88575f34d77497c0e2445e","timelineVersion":"sha256:9b5c67bb47f43e9d65b96104486bd41af6501f46e296bbfa741b33cedf723a21","start":79.27,"end":79.68,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"13267f6725dfdf6a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:question","text":"女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6994edbd2adfe991275684e8ff9cde7c57b4490d6fbdbb9f054696a7b1c05969","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":3.72,"end":12.88,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-0","text":"木村さん、夏休みに家族でキャンプに行きたいんですが、初めてなんで道具とかどうしたらいいかわからなくて・・・。木村さんはよく行かれるんですよね？何かアドバイスいただけませんか？","textVersion":"sha256:c75a32dc71155c56d16d20296aa7803358a85205350c40d605e08448a9c56bf3","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":14.58,"end":27.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-1","text":"最近はインターネットにいろんな情報が載っているからまずはネットで調べてみたら？","textVersion":"sha256:202613a2f98898b6bf631578bf78390559f50ce7f7c008240310ce28aaf735a3","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":28.24,"end":34.41,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-2","text":"そう思って調べてみたんですけど、情報が多すぎてよくわからなかったんです。","textVersion":"sha256:4bcb1fc07bf8230a886d03798f28f7325dd6bb1292b3a4c1b28c9611f7db5a6e","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":34.7,"end":39.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-3","text":"僕のを貸してあげてもいいんだけど一人用のだからな・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:9ceb101a82de0978931717b0fa1a38b2fb6b5c64b0e0426cb4a0ded9ab1e9ae1","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":40,"end":44.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-4","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":44.92,"end":45.87,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-5","text":"あ、アウトドア用品の専門店が企画してるキャンプの講座があるんだけど、お店紹介しようか？初めての人対象でキャンプのベテランがいろいろ教えてくれるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e09e3b318b6fac14794b20cd8f325227e285b722bf4d93f25195d6f6a248f77c","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":45.98,"end":57,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-6","text":"へぇー。でもそれに出たらその店でキャンプの道具を買わされたりしないですか？","textVersion":"sha256:85ae7d7b3076364a2e85afe493dc2357a441e927879af44ee5e54b315fb6f999","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":57.28,"end":62.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-7","text":"まあ、宣伝も兼ねてるんだろうけど、無理矢理なんてことはないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:71cc3274adad27716cd21d302afe69fce4379dc014448dcf8eb3beba5588903c","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":63.16,"end":67.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-8","text":"それならいいですね。じゃ、そうします。","textVersion":"sha256:4f28ac421fe7e44d3159f666e4c24943040cc631eae778a3776bff4db2800993","audioVersion":"sha256:1c8a1c82ee0310b27d7fba8cb5982d221f3e127080cfa05cb8d38b8eab27a77f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9f6bf729b7db27163fd89d5d2bf687dec3f7dfab9854494784a0bca67c32c65","start":67.36,"end":70.18,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"13267f6725dfdf6a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこれから何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:16c39a9b8cd35649f23bf1413c9ca307e335396c76e39c13921fb7b6651230eb","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":3.64,"end":13.83,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0","text":"うちのお茶の葉の品質管理のことで調べてほしいことがあって・・・実は市場に出る前でよかったんだけど、一部の製品の質が通常より悪いことがわかってね。","textVersion":"sha256:493522a7e3dbaa63cf786415d7511aa0d6aaf8e7942f8e9f77a73e2b46a05151","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":15.56,"end":27.23,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-1","text":"え？そうなんですか？","textVersion":"sha256:33b880d02c2a39dafe205cd3a94dccd60eef13b953ade7f72054907df68c4a38","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":27.62,"end":29.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-2","text":"いつもと香りが違っていて。それでうちの部が中心となって可能性のあるところを調べて原因を特定することになったんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:4b609e1427141cf00016bdd7507717b95b12a7efac18fa1957326c0b5678fa63","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":29.32,"end":38.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-3","text":"そうですか。どこを当たりましょうか？工場からでしょうか？","textVersion":"sha256:6a4dd4e416eadaf0b3b018b171a004db606b26ab9935f4b78d978f0cfb63a02c","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":38.38,"end":42.63,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-4","text":"工場の方は気温や湿度などの管理の状況を調べてもらったところ、特に問題はなかったんだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:547f30bec8ad7d5436ccb3ac37e57bc6d9b2656b7f70e5c94eaab0cf57d254df","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":42.98,"end":49.45,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-5","text":"では、生産者側への確認ですか？うちが契約している農家に問い合わせましょうか？","textVersion":"sha256:345d62c2a127d51630c09e8b69d438ca6c0d1cd7ded85002bc836e08f5c69d2a","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":49.72,"end":55.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-6","text":"うん、それは生産地に近い支社の担当者が対応することになっているんだ。それより農家から工場までの輸送は外部に頼んでるだろう？どのように運んでいたか向こうの会社の担当者に確認してもらいたいんだよ。暑い時期だしね。","textVersion":"sha256:b51be9615002fde17dae17484dd34bf533978ea7634e5f5c47bfe0efce401cbf","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":55.58,"end":72.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-7","text":"わかりました。あ、うちの倉庫で製品を保存しているうちにってことも考えられますか？そちらの状況も調べた方がいいでしょうか？","textVersion":"sha256:ac77a85114a3809bdaec0d27bfcdac7b28ee53c3df145956232bec34e7a2601a","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":72.78,"end":81.87,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-8","text":"ありがとう。そこは私がやるから。","textVersion":"sha256:af2046a9f4af7f5cde56e4563bd6e307319d54d64202f7225fe4c1f263bc534b","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":82.16,"end":84.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-9","text":"はい。ではすぐ取り掛かります。","textVersion":"sha256:b9abd421092599cc142c0f166af3b7ba60ba86fbd6520e18180cb8b22bf35c85","audioVersion":"sha256:ccc47e2bbb3084545991a031a0599be29c3c45e90c1d6f5774a1b5b0008d327f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6bdc103c4ec8810f8eda12add531b1d3baf3e7e509a0e6242c53554a3ac6d126","start":84.68,"end":86.98,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"13267f6725dfdf6a"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:question","text":"会社で女の学生と男の人が話しています。女の学生はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:fb0773c77fa28efb509fc979df72f359bda13c521666e0e9ba970140dae890b4","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":3.78,"end":16.08,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-0","text":"今日から１カ月、職場体験でこちらにお世話になる原田です。よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:3fcd9e7e7f400bf0768c6e98ed574a62cfd459389b8802ac5c32c0b56c836657","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":17.56,"end":23.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-1","text":"よろしくお願いします。じゃ、さっそくだけど、これ原田さんの１カ月の仕事の予定表です。挨拶を兼ねてみんなに配ってください。","textVersion":"sha256:892f5280068f0914c8590726c541a8be8eb54971eba43852cdcf060b26e56543","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":24.74,"end":34.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-2","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":34.8,"end":36.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-3","text":"終わったら原田さんが使うパソコンの設定をしてほしいんだけど、パスワードはオリエンテーションの時に聞いてるよね？","textVersion":"sha256:9bfda8576e4742d31031c60c024c7fc3f2e2e4a3fe006d014a15ea40dcdc43c8","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":36.62,"end":44.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-4","text":"はい、教えてもらいました。","textVersion":"sha256:b575cdd976ca9c544a0e00c79e95351cc9ad72e284e52ffc3b0f83e563bbb8f6","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":44.44,"end":46.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-5","text":"そのパスワードで一度入って、パスワードを再設定してね。それからじゃないとパソコンで何も作業できないようになってるから。","textVersion":"sha256:333aa3648757f0b0bc14a9c4cd164e8a74663eb00dc8783d1831a26f5d75ecfb","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":46.7,"end":55.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-6","text":"はい。あの、その日にどんな仕事をしたか、報告書は毎日書くんですよね？","textVersion":"sha256:105b34a8664c95bb7ef6b6ac7243e457918db8a6fa11d7ff58123b39861049ab","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":55.46,"end":62.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-7","text":"うん、そんなに長くなくても大丈夫だよ。あと、この部屋の座席表、原田さんの名前も入れて今、新しくしてもらってるところだから明日渡すね。","textVersion":"sha256:0e087ee730ea3d123e85718ddef9e198ea9c61e175d52af205be131cee5762c0","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":62.2,"end":74.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-8","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:c5a2ad4575a0f1e8cc1fef31f4e39b8213c2eaf49006306c005e1788144ce1aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:5421ed42143d610f5914f66f7e3b02e2d1d8be8e4dd29c1e669ab9f2593c801e","start":74.14,"end":75.7,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"ea7dabc1a59c3ea6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:question","text":"大学で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はセミナーにどうやって申し込みますか。","textVersion":"sha256:05b717835d5ed5ab6fd18ea46a00215c69a51749e08919e7d5856ba93374f1c1","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":3.72,"end":15.74,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0","text":"この間の授業で先生が言ってた来月のサクラ市の国際交流セミナー、申し込もうと思ってるんだけど・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:ab26e93968de23e55bebffc53a23d04704fb847f3e3d2bf6c273c89042efdd17","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":17.3,"end":24.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-1","text":"あ、私もう申し込んだ。締め切り明日だよ。申込書持ってる？","textVersion":"sha256:7134b62d5cd16800fa12e9ae0a2cdd27218f4b714c5b288602c32dbe45def9c4","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":24.3,"end":30.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-2","text":"うん、さっき書いたんだけど市役所の窓口に出せばいいんだよね？","textVersion":"sha256:ed6127d39312d55bbbc448c58839a287b9c7186fced69e3cf5600ae6466afc9a","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":31.12,"end":35.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-3","text":"え、郵送でしか受け付けてくれないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:13a28009d8f20cb232c38d84e1f1fde055bebc3f43fd9d514f23f98f334d8cc1","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":35.98,"end":39.17,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-4","text":"え？","textVersion":"sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":39.17,"end":39.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-5","text":"毎年応募者が多くて、窓口だと対応しきれないから今年からそうなったんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:5795bd4a215d2daa66e110f85bb7437b65584d41710ecd01b042c735fdda10bd","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":39.9,"end":45.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-6","text":"え、それなら今日出さないと間に合わないな。そんなに応募が多いのか・・・。抽選になったら結果ははがきで連絡が来るんだよね？","textVersion":"sha256:9964b3934df94642db1e38a3f5db401e5b732ff4837c27fa543a6f2056c6d639","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":46.04,"end":55.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-7","text":"うん。そんなのメールで送ってくれたらいいのにね。返信用のはがきは用意した？","textVersion":"sha256:5beb390a6c0456ef38f1459b48b98dd76e01b0cf1bddbb1d5086611273c2f000","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":55.79,"end":61.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-8","text":"まだ。これから買いに行くよ。","textVersion":"sha256:5363efb0d600504b4a5fde789bb9f27aaf9105100fb5fdd134335bd9d515bc04","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":61.96,"end":64.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-9","text":"実は１枚多く買っちゃって、今持ってるんだけど使う？","textVersion":"sha256:8d2874fd35bb4e2ae0acf6c57d7f1e97de0161293a9cb90de67d5b9c7e71a67c","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":64.62,"end":69.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-10","text":"いいの？ありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:2bb25d054278fcb8ec7005bc03050108783eb8c812d2a7edbe847bcfd20f6f44","audioVersion":"sha256:7cc8c7a961f30722a9fd237a47cb4d67040f36c2cd2e9f399aad751aca814e89","timelineVersion":"sha256:0390dab63292aa41f09005f054a544a3905cb739822196eb49612468a348fbc8","start":69.5,"end":71.24,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"ea7dabc1a59c3ea6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:question","text":"電話でテレビ局の人とケーキ屋の店長が話しています。ケーキ屋の店長は撮影の日までに何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:9d8355003704be04e08cf739a375febcc6f7e7fdb1adff6dcd9bcc462b1fd3ec","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":4.98,"end":16.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-0","text":"ひまわりテレビの鈴木です。番組の取材の件ですが、撮影まで１週間になりましたのでお電話しました。","textVersion":"sha256:e70aa4b27a44d67c1d013744217f1438be5a5c03437299800e367bb83fa43a11","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":18.32,"end":26.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-1","text":"あ、どうも。お世話になります。","textVersion":"sha256:f115a12f45470cb0c9165f745ee5a6d3e947c8240b602c6213f39457600b19e8","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":26.22,"end":28.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-2","text":"えっと、先日打ち合わせしましたように当日はケーキの制作現場とお店に並んでいるケーキ、それから外からお店全体を撮らせていただきます。お店のスタッフの方も映りますけど、よろしいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:e97b97bf607d9c4ab802bb39405a7b5b285ae2c1ca108d2f8bc8b1f5674b75dc","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":28.52,"end":43.63,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-3","text":"それは了解を得ています。","textVersion":"sha256:228fed423ed9c3a2117385a876a78e94420172c1f54d017878bb2ddbed6d6cb9","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":43.64,"end":46.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-4","text":"当日、お客さんもある程度いてくださった方がいいので、よくいらっしゃるお客さんにお知らせしておいてください。","textVersion":"sha256:9a8990c0ebfcae50bdb0c43d994e0909f4aec4a724953c7dc240ab8d8d1da8ad","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":46.5,"end":53.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-5","text":"あ、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:b74a7f5765f9515e4570e357c0c4e16391afe3d6280e73664d7a246a8bdf3080","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":53.28,"end":54.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-6","text":"それからお勧めのケーキについて一言ご紹介いただくことになっていますが・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:2c9c9281102dfbc2d0ca2722c4bd64130ee4bb7396f286c0f7470db0bf57cb16","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":54.82,"end":60.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-7","text":"はい。準備できています。ちょうど季節のケーキを出したところですし。","textVersion":"sha256:10e73f1b9abc2e211feffa523692699808c964d7795a9e0893406065b7c9f1c5","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":60.1,"end":64.87,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-8","text":"そうですか。じゃ、当日よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:e6fa2681ba1109a55fc5e6b568062c9e29bf25ae43bc8bc533bce9b8ecb5cc61","audioVersion":"sha256:abf3e97dcb8bbc7922aa0f8d824c0720068becc1be24fe1d089e9b3b17579fcd","timelineVersion":"sha256:772933b2f55ea89e7562941181bd34d125971060d2d468631e3aa094bcc8ab83","start":64.87,"end":68.18,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"ea7dabc1a59c3ea6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:question","text":"大学のサークルで男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f8c7ed610c03b9c4904937df973a0dd8d3dd6c21d2d59989734e63b4b702c8dc","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":3.3,"end":16.94,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-0","text":"先輩、来月の地域の子供たちとの交流会なんですが、そろそろ準備始めた方がいいですよね。今年は僕がリーダーなんですけど、気を付けることとかありますか。","textVersion":"sha256:db92f3fa2879cf947e40166501cb0b5f7b55a43eedb765d53a5a3366a8fc16a3","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":18.44,"end":30.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-1","text":"そうだったね。やることわかる？簡単に言うと会場の予約、食べ物の準備、プログラムの内容を決めることだよ。場所は何をするかによって変わるからね。","textVersion":"sha256:1a9957158fa15a233b06b579bf3969952e9ee7b64c5af80562aab9a062c8ba74","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":30.38,"end":43.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-2","text":"ああ、ボールを使うようなゲームをするなら広い所が必要ですもんね。","textVersion":"sha256:11af2bd5b3a7ac32d1d87cb91b57965cafb963983ae7d2d3d462faf172c21a75","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":44.06,"end":49.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-3","text":"うん、何するか早く決めてね。去年は決めるのが遅くなって会場確保に苦労したから。","textVersion":"sha256:9b710786ee05925d7bb5e07e8bef8ab452599d6ac456335a3ed907766772fe02","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":49.06,"end":56.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":56.24,"end":56.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-5","text":"食べ物は宅配のピザとかお寿司とかを頼むのでいいと思うよ。まあ、それは１週間前でもいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:44eda8cf306186b8cd6791c7f972f2a422a18a91fc58ab17c6547fdb9fb25720","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":57.08,"end":65.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-6","text":"サークルのメンバーに開催日を早く連絡した方がいいですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:76be2c920aed348f239e082ae6bac1d874a5e8d88fdb3e6d272afe51f99d53f4","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":65.46,"end":69.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-7","text":"それは年間スケジュールで決まってるからみんな知ってるはずだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a873ec89014be90fd9dedfa539399e7f02fb5dabf22ddb514d98ab212a6f0cd2","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":69.72,"end":73.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-8","text":"ああ、そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:c92b56f7ed765f15273a1b5a52fcbeaefcd399222a18feee4c71d7ba593949f1","audioVersion":"sha256:a5a8e702b961253e374e4144550920292f6fd7b97687bf3c3fadc888182d2da7","timelineVersion":"sha256:227f903c3e8009b4595d643468d9c63e2f2f1b5c6a6c98420726a04f5a066212","start":73.64,"end":74.8,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"ea7dabc1a59c3ea6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:question","text":"大学で女の学生と先生が話しています。女の学生はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1fd824a5407be084d858a43cd03c8921e479068d311a72fc4023b0841b0aff03","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":3.3,"end":14.26,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-0","text":"先生、レポートのためのアンケートができたんですが、見ていただけませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:97d30dd58756854eb52301acde9252abc2304e6aeba9ca813cf6c727afdb152d","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":15.96,"end":21.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-1","text":"んー、質問の数が多いな。これ答えるのに何分ぐらいかかるか、時間計ってみた？","textVersion":"sha256:53443e335610dd79a11f1a7055b0cb1a66c8ebfdb96fb2145a836ca6433403c2","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":22.2,"end":29.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-2","text":"いいえ。","textVersion":"sha256:56eb4b75f3ab28fa72313a7b23175878804a24a6bc9e9d26827943d3b2179776","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":29.84,"end":30.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-3","text":"え？あまりに時間がかかるようだと、ちゃんと答えてもらえないこともあるから一度自分でやってみて。本当は他の人にやってもらった方がいいんだけど、もう日程が厳しいしね。","textVersion":"sha256:7ed837d6c0c26c7ed608e397ed4ddd85b837cf4373e56790a4299221981cff4f","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":30.52,"end":43.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-4","text":"ああ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:13dee93f1583257ee63e6b4c8be5585ad2a43511bb9621997b30aefa41774d54","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":43.16,"end":44.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-5","text":"かかった時間によっては回答形式を変えることも考えないと。全部選択式にするとか。で、回答者の数は何人ぐらい？","textVersion":"sha256:e8146d807a23461072533230a06a541e3a46d4f515a22e43704293b52a40d536","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":44.44,"end":55.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-6","text":"20人くらいに頼んでるんですが、少ないですか。","textVersion":"sha256:9abac31185e0e4701311f48d637218221507aeff8db3fc0930b5896a3ccb7bbd","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":55.36,"end":59.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-7","text":"全員がきちんと回答してくれれば十分だけど、まあ、分析に使えないものがあったらまた増やせばいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6df63f1fa8fbfbce3a1c3a1b980fb1fc3478152fb7a3a385b5fac1847e77fd5e","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":59.76,"end":68.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-8","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:f95d5be980423b3cce0072f062ef6eb4745bc8d0d8f6cebc54e0c73da805c439","timelineVersion":"sha256:2f7be1a8c1ed92221d576ff8499d7cbb4d3e7e7c93f22ef166b481059bbb2e41","start":68.74,"end":69.4,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"ea7dabc1a59c3ea6"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:question","text":"会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人は、倉庫に入るとき、どの順番で入り口のボタンを押さなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:d672dab90f5de13976a88b207497397839e9e548838189534ae7bb3b0c26b77d","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":3.78,"end":17.44,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-0","text":"すみません。地下の倉庫に行って、資料を取ってきたいんですが、入り口の開け方が分からなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:18778f3c7b0ddb6085fc569438ae3595d86bd6111c68bfe51402235856f57d61","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":20.92,"end":28.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-1","text":"ああ、最近管理が厳しくなって、入り口の横のボタンを押さないと駄目なんだよ。倉庫は三つあるけど、何番の？","textVersion":"sha256:a27349b1b36f5d52aa361150b450674871f3d4d90549af974bab8a4c8f8920bc","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":29.16,"end":37.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-2","text":"えーと。２番です。","textVersion":"sha256:0aee3f120d524394f213ea8fcd29e6d3d66872a3bbd32d35f9de3ce7e84a974d","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":38.26,"end":40.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-3","text":"じゃ、倉庫の番号は002だね。それと、暗証番号も必要だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e0c15194f5b086f3f5584c6ff0625c5bf5597e5bb78543562d9bdb7695c997ad","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":40.7,"end":46.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-4","text":"そうですか。暗証番号は？","textVersion":"sha256:b3570b24d27328c2634e52cd1cf7df90ce5b08d97eaae98a8f8e27702b679217","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":46.74,"end":49.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-5","text":"725だよ。ドアの横のボタンを暗証番号、開くのボタン、倉庫の番号、開くのボタンの順で押して、そうすればすぐドアが開くから。","textVersion":"sha256:c8f244ab2b219338eda6bd3461aa5c756245314afc4b8a306486c9461d185b45","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":49.68,"end":62.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-6","text":"暗証番号、開く、倉庫の番号、","textVersion":"sha256:49f4a532eb2682d589668eb7fe2bfd61fea4a969ae114860692da2848421e7b7","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":62.8,"end":67.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-7","text":"その後に、開くだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:4f8f5ae517dfad33a3d83cd41c45fd4690c5ec5584fcba61d43256705f185958","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":67.9,"end":69.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-8","text":"分かりました。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:7af03e22e150440e83d60f0330e3d4f4576a96d293caf6cbafd1ad54eac82e62","audioVersion":"sha256:5c7fb22abd9a806869b87862d97af84dad979c492d7a6b0a14a2a7fecc4760a3","timelineVersion":"sha256:efb413518495671e91cdf6ab4a8ef99bec5f72cf346ab2d3fff0294d5ce18eb3","start":70.04,"end":72.34,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"645baac6c51292d8"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:question","text":"電話で女の人と課長が話しています。女の人はこの後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:02808068e0e345d0e41ae4eea8c3f35b2b979b64acea91a82fa70673aff3d58f","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","start":3.34,"end":13.89,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-0","text":"はい、山川工業です。","textVersion":"sha256:8aef3a0208721ecc4e625eb2e0ad105ca0d6fa95293d385cd55468af38aeb775","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","start":13.89,"end":17.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-1","text":"もしもし、田中です。いま出張先なんだけど、さっき青空会社の遠藤さんからわたしの携帯に連絡があってね。","textVersion":"sha256:10cf7030c1f0b8ba83ab3bee467b25b03ccae624d77ceb9091b6266756b976bd","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","start":17.88,"end":25.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","start":25.76,"end":26.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-3","text":"昨日の夕方、青空会社から注文が入った商品についてなんだけど、さっきうちの口座に代金を振り込んだそうだから、入金が確認でき次第、すぐ発送してくれるかな。かなり急ぎみたいで、できるだけ早く送ってほしいって。","textVersion":"sha256:ccd4139753e5386d2e88905eaa242e0a666a2d185a6d52d8dd0fc01c687de180","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","start":26.48,"end":41.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-4","text":"分かりました。新商品のサンプルも一緒に送っておきますね。","textVersion":"sha256:81aa9ef3af445f39088ed5962c2304bcd735a59a692e4312c8f2a8fabb393516","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","start":41.68,"end":46.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-5","text":"それは以前送ってあるよ。あ、青空会社の遠藤さんに一言、発送完了の連絡も入れておいて。よろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:d6dd8a0fe9ffdf1701d2bcf584025eab1d8d7b4730888f68d34237ba22ab15ea","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","start":46.3,"end":54.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:758a29160a0b0e1836e2a2b3a1b1874016f1c889b9876a840f22974e4d8cfc21","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3eb054d9f24663fc66de2b51adc1334a2959bbdc76c4619b48ae603a3bc6508","start":55,"end":55.62,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"645baac6c51292d8"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:question","text":"漫画クラブで女の学生と男の学生が話しています。女の学生はこの後どうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:73022dcd247f8af7dbf3df042d0fde3bfba3b4d271a496e83f30ee813d4a67af","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":3.42,"end":14.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-0","text":"山田君、再来月のコンクールに出す漫画の下書き、読んでくれた？","textVersion":"sha256:3b8df462ea1a830b6a5707861115d395e44e75b994143a778071fa8702dc2dea","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":15.72,"end":21.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-1","text":"うん、ストーリーの展開がよく工夫されてて、さすがだなって思った。特に最後、いい意味で読者の期待を裏切る展開になってるね。","textVersion":"sha256:c5a3e4d48643db44856eb2f701dcfc537cc37310a66b0a551d00178a9acd2a9f","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":21.58,"end":31.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-2","text":"そこ、けっこう苦労したんだ。あの、今回は全体的に線を太めに書いたんだけど、どうだった？","textVersion":"sha256:b465d752a07d432c1ca59edab18413c87cb266097afd686cdcd0bddedbe954ed","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":32.12,"end":40.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-3","text":"力強くて、話の世界観に合ってると思ったよ。線の強弱も効果的に使われてたし、コンクールでも評価されるんじゃないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:3a7e15dfd3e2a35facc22f6ae77b6019cdf2ac4648d42bd80c93ac2cd9bb648e","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":41.08,"end":51.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-4","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":51.72,"end":52.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-5","text":"でも、読むまえ、ぱっと絵を見たときに、主役のこのインパクトは弱いなあって感じたんだ。髪型とか、身につけてるものとか、もうちょっとユニークにできないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:260e21a6b49eca4beb5a78f18f61f5b1df1372a18224c65f6a1e9d64b0c73a82","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":52.84,"end":64.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-6","text":"うん、やってみる。","textVersion":"sha256:013abb54cbeaebca0366546032daba4b9bb74150ed3e2361f8b7ca7c675c2754","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":64.72,"end":66.35,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-7","text":"あ、そういえば、原稿の枚数確かめてある？確か制限あったよね。オーバーすると、減点の対象になっちゃうから、多かったら、減らしたほうがいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:52d8585429093f6f23b7bbc83290d0e38db32be78652be600c6e2fc6a0030d09","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":66.38,"end":78.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-8","text":"枚数は指定内に納まってるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0260b1d214ee6fe7de31d1ff982dc581ae78188da421b89ca74bee027cee31bc","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":78.46,"end":81.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-9","text":"そう。じゃ、コンクールまで、もうちょっと頑張ってね。","textVersion":"sha256:9ba872749fe54083ba2bc7d808f13ac7c3a0a29a04a841bb32e83b4d6cffaf88","audioVersion":"sha256:7b4eaba479beb962df35f877bfba471268d1bfe7c8dae5b35e85905739fefb88","timelineVersion":"sha256:e336e7250dda3e4eec3fcadf6e2f4c308c347a40fab4ef0a0f398ce72370aa58","start":81.12,"end":85,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"645baac6c51292d8"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:question","text":"電話で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこの後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:46c4b4d54f14d4892dbb63ad92ab9e8ad072f95ab9c40edadf215e7a15f1f1ca","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":3.3,"end":14.42,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-0","text":"もしもし、佐藤さん。おはようございます。中野ですが、今日体調が悪くて、出勤できそうにないんです。申し訳ないんですけど、ちょっとお願いしてもいいんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:474fe0a6dddce1f3540646c45ba710509d11f968f120ff90ac8fb0d4e0c1dc03","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":15.92,"end":27.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-1","text":"大丈夫ですか。何でも任せてください。","textVersion":"sha256:ebad49bef69f31d9b34d34835a1ebee5ae194bb714443af26a2eec8f92c10881","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":27.94,"end":31.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-2","text":"ありがとうございます。今日中に必ず課長に提出しなきゃいけない書類があるんです。わたしの机の右側に、赤いファイルがあるんだけど、その中の一番上にある見積書、課長に渡してもらえますか。","textVersion":"sha256:16a229bbd02a9ecb92bcbdfdc3dace9afdb42fe88f93de8b19086cdf28c43724","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":31.64,"end":46.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-3","text":"分かりました。いま確認しますね。あ、これですね。渡す前に、コピーとっておきますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c25eb59738f89da72f75cd08a594a5bcc508fa3fc136d3a7cdf360d15f503b66","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":46.3,"end":53.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-4","text":"ううん、いいわ。課長、確か今日は朝から昼過ぎまで、桜銀行で会議だから、午後にならないと、オフィスに来ないと思うんだけど、直接手渡してもらえますか。大事な書類だから。","textVersion":"sha256:415970b4602ec260a3a72d898e3457d3ba68ea23c6db9d309ac7e109256392de","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":53.96,"end":67.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":67.48,"end":68.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-6","text":"あ、そうだ。今日朝10時からのミーティングで、わたし出張報告することになってますよね。先週佐藤さんに一緒になった出張の。悪いんですけど、それもやってくれますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4888ad3c85ff2e58df0be77cf00e297bb354cc886a07640d2db32c0bfa375bc1","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":68.42,"end":81.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-7","text":"分かりました。出張報告書をもう完成してますか。きのう書き直したい箇所があるっておっしゃってましたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:30e34370c3e58e591b260121723d73b02dae1a3542289ba9399b24fa6ca9b9f4","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":81.06,"end":88.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-8","text":"ええ、昨日直して、パソコンの共有フォルダにデータを保存してあるので、印刷して会議で配ってください。","textVersion":"sha256:07808866af2ce9e10e8e7eeb62b511a025f2fec94aa4bcfdc91675a1ccb2bfdf","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":89.04,"end":97.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-9","text":"分かりました。今日はゆっくり休んでくださいね。","textVersion":"sha256:a2171dc3ca1ddcfb660b13f9fa7243c8cfdf0013c983c5560b8d4c0a554afccd","audioVersion":"sha256:e9d86373bbd059d818087e62bdbfe386479a0ad905049205372fa578a0a62169","timelineVersion":"sha256:0334b933579eca3f680048f4e3b6e88f8fa4cdd8d5c053602852041ac2f9d6ce","start":97.22,"end":100.76,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"645baac6c51292d8"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:question","text":"大学で女の先生と男の学生が話しています。男の学生はこの後、資料をどのように直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:539a478b892b79d14eb418e9aa0db8f2b38b0da9003197a8d4bdbe2ee92b1a77","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":3.76,"end":15.36,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-0","text":"送ってくれた資料、見ましたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d390bd5d0d3c8ced829aaf09270939703f80cc0c7955bf0dfdcfe610d901dae8","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":16.8,"end":19.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-1","text":"あ、ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:d63b5ac29a10becda26463a8decfe9191543d601a219425ad426b7b7cb6c6462","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":19.4,"end":20.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-2","text":"これは、小学校の交流会で配るものでしたね。","textVersion":"sha256:4ee87dfda4ca7552d94dc2f254a3025b760f30aa345d9a291600e386845cde0f","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":21.22,"end":24.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-3","text":"はい、子供たちに自分の研究について話すときに配るものです。","textVersion":"sha256:b4bf0f53b6c98529a89047a5a1a654a88a4bcb907129f494340f81a266872082","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":24.88,"end":29.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-4","text":"えーとね。なかなかよくできてましたよ。難しい言葉も使っていないし。","textVersion":"sha256:d9990e47f542c3730e9ca6b6bd62cac3883ce03447be5d43e1cec95f53a309b9","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":29.84,"end":35.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-5","text":"はい、優しい言葉を使うようにしました。","textVersion":"sha256:29d572eff16a45950b9dbb81f22fedf3d4740b5c6c890a67461ce529f7952980","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":35.82,"end":38.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-6","text":"うん～、ただ、話が抽象的で、何を言っているのか、分からないんじゃないかな。この研究が私達の身近なこんなところに使われていますとか、こんなことにも役に立っていますとかって説明してあげたらいいんじゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:71cd97da9c540a3c03f7d2c8806d58a276537aaf639e027995fd1d89b3779339","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":39.04,"end":55.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-7","text":"ああ。なるほど。はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:7c32d69e7b29f839bfc6ebc587dde596b2e2a75667ab20837d6da3ec4ba003b5","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":55.86,"end":58.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-8","text":"あとは、この図もとても分かりやすいし、問題ないんじゃない。子供たちから質問がたくさん出るといいわね。","textVersion":"sha256:8e5bbfa5bf0da2a724fb9982ff3d3ccdddb24a82ea7afe673b40d7dbd4ac21b8","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":58.74,"end":68.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-9","text":"ありがとうございます。すぐ直します。","textVersion":"sha256:9440123bc80dc609602c615937329469a3c4ddea5a5f35b9af44c119be360c7f","audioVersion":"sha256:8d04b32ca4d7c24d990df1ac2cbd8426a71d12fba2eac680ffe9999b971b9107","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ed2a80085dc649905f29887a1c50b7f463c3fb43016c62ea93f2b4d0e1ff038","start":68.4,"end":70.88,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"645baac6c51292d8"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:question","text":"大学で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。女の学生はこのあと何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:627431aacfb9708cf59c5392f3c2acc534187a4ef0bc6eb44c733172b5fb1dd5","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","start":3.38,"end":14.12,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-0","text":"鈴木さん。この間頼まれたレポートのチェックだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:d85aac525d01404bdb333a384d5baaff09d4f1c5522c16ed3530b671bdb0f154","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","start":15.68,"end":19.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-1","text":"あ、先輩。もう見てくださったんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:38dfbeae8bb02637de6bf07166970f356c55494a372dac83c6b07f2787f5a067","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","start":19.84,"end":23.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-2","text":"うん。再調査して対象者の数も増えてよくなったんじゃない？考察も説得力が増して読んでて面白かったよ。","textVersion":"sha256:beb60dfae44303b902fc179477d9ce25ff99a457847a40e5522fc3eecb5bdbbe","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","start":23.84,"end":32.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-3","text":"本当ですか。ありがとうございます。再調査、思ったより時間がかかって・・・でもやってよかったです。","textVersion":"sha256:6d6bed293d71862472b02709846cd98c3e00c1bf48e5e9899b6a69b07a6b0a68","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","start":32.74,"end":41.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-4","text":"よく頑張ったね。うん、せっかくだから結果の示し方をもう少し工夫してみたら？表ばっかりじゃなくて少しグラフも入れるとか。もう少し、パッと見てわかるように。","textVersion":"sha256:428f1d25dcb2aa02863f67233577c078f0aa0d34a39da7ac28b82eb17c8a55ce","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","start":41.44,"end":55.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-5","text":"あ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:688cc368fcc4633fa24fcf881503ca3e1c2828cc1d9b031049dde142f0b7a0b7","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","start":55.4,"end":56.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-6","text":"それにしてもこの分析方法、面白いね。今度僕も使ってみよう。","textVersion":"sha256:3c729d2e03209bbbf70769dab02a0f593d18d0ff0f5715af43f2122feabcc478","audioVersion":"sha256:5ad3ecd346dc7e052fbd124fa19fc29e1e4b824fa6067d3cf32fcca89fef6440","timelineVersion":"sha256:549caf69f282185c1abc9504661f15c3c42885893539b2c02c6978ff11bbb110","start":57.08,"end":62.44,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8beb1acf6b156732"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこのあとまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:c22ce158a60ebe2ffd5b14042e155b787c8140c40988a928b545e1f0bcf99fa7","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":3.38,"end":14.32,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-0","text":"佐藤さん。そろそろ会員向けのセールの案内を出さなきゃいけないんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:7b5e7a7de6237fde0f769a34695b77a82f990dcd2776f21f65d0fb6c9dad8775","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":16.4,"end":23.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":23.36,"end":23.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-2","text":"印刷屋さんから案内のはがきが出来上がってきたから宛名のシールを作ってくれるかな？会員の情報をまとめたファイルわかるよね？あれ使って作成して。あ、郵送物を希望していないお客さんにはメールで送るからシールはいらないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f86af15fc47487ba352b50636914e154c8c7fd5b6222e0c3a794dd939939ee72","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":24.48,"end":40.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-3","text":"はい。会員情報のファイルは更新されてるんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:4fb095e0b94ab59eaca61e5589a70793e780eb9764291ef5faf326ae1d6e7313","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":40.7,"end":44.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-4","text":"うん、されてるよ。個人情報だから気をつけて作業してね。","textVersion":"sha256:714f6e0159a869cb5b3fd74cef134a545b18ca389c08372362010390f6606a01","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":44.76,"end":49.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-5","text":"はい。メールの方も私が送りますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5b2bc12f4af2691c122e203abe37fc2f4d5e4e776b869eaf0a4feb9154c7b447","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":49.3,"end":52.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-6","text":"まだ文章を準備していないから今日はいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:abac5821bf75eabb2170e4e29cebd6ba18f7af2ea08fb28921554b8f7a8ffd3c","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":52.52,"end":55.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:3116dcfef6bff5ee2ef762c4c35aa95a53a5305b0b0578f1b480a4d02e0536de","timelineVersion":"sha256:232fa76a9264a7d1b50ff18db8f119bd7bb9eb91a854c97868748863f253f25d","start":55.36,"end":56.46,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8beb1acf6b156732"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:question","text":"大学で女の学生と男の学生が話しています。女の学生はこのあと何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:80c439b0ff8c2b2ac9eac443238c3d81341d3a77c1e0ad55947635f000ecb2e5","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":3.4,"end":14.04,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0","text":"先輩。去年の夏休みに農業体験へ行かれたんですよね？大学が主催してる。あれ、私も来週から１ヶ月行くんです。何か持ってった方がいい物とかありますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ea21181895fcbee662593f42e95a8749e6aaa897cf9eb3c9529768ec1b8b753e","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":17.82,"end":31.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-1","text":"保険証、去年忘れた人がいて大変だったんだよ。コピーすら持ってきてなくて。僕らみたいな素人が農業やるときは思わぬ怪我とかあるから忘れないように気をつけて。","textVersion":"sha256:d375816cbccad3a23e77ce7006a0286c94f8d23f4e29f7625c18d920d80daf91","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":31.78,"end":44.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-2","text":"はい。いつも持ち歩いてます。","textVersion":"sha256:f85747cb4328a1bca468e2ce4b3a522a14606ef3376fe9fafcaba4ebbb22c425","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":44.5,"end":46.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-3","text":"そう。それからＴシャツは多めに持ってった方がいいよ。作業着の中に着るんだけど、作業してると想像以上に汗をかくからね。作業着とか長靴は貸してもらえるよ。よく実習生が来るからか、いろんなサイズのがあったよ。","textVersion":"sha256:250aac28a6d1762f8b8b07c8b4f281e2fb76e6f4dd95a6c2a843c6d8ccd95784","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":47.1,"end":63.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-4","text":"よかった。長靴買わなきゃって思ってたけど、Ｔシャツは作業着があるからいいかなって思って部屋着ぐらいしか用意してませんでした。","textVersion":"sha256:4086cf2e94126bb705c2d6bb9cf1562600f642288ce374101ee4d764ee77dd35","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":64.16,"end":74.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-5","text":"そうそう。実は去年、僕健康診断受けるの忘れて、もう少しで参加できなくなりそうだったんだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:66c6c2cf365d9231c823d3678e791cf84a28cb12a2639e30384a0a2c1b44bb57","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":74.6,"end":81.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-6","text":"へえー、で、どうしたんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:6daf0a431c01572c063fe099faeaf596c993ac0aaa182cb11b0e1d998d200ede","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":82.04,"end":84.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-7","text":"診断書をすぐ出してくれる病院を探して何とか間に合ったんだけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:6f24d391c2798218d144b128fe5f8cc719f28c056aa87c85fcd8137180baa99a","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":84.74,"end":89.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-8","text":"ああ、それで今年は提出が先週までだったんですね。","textVersion":"sha256:44e783f76c39d38c576d2b4bfdd785797aba1c49e7f0b186c1430daf10b3ebe2","audioVersion":"sha256:d0e4e06095a1cf5402b69c96329b600fe1ef429520824493c697839def1dbf1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:383070b925ab2ee91e87afc07b9ab5b4582d9a3d02a9cbeaf096e49287481535","start":89.62,"end":93.38,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8beb1acf6b156732"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:question","text":"市役所の国際交流課で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はこれからまず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:68a2828bd043a45516a7691c133e3b138a450ea7061054633272f984a16f0b04","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","start":3.38,"end":15.96,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-0","text":"課長。来月の料理教室のことなんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:2657231e586128e74f0bcc072c99b9b5acee70662e3aaa7940f407c109361c29","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","start":17.88,"end":21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-1","text":"ああ、アジア料理教室の話ですね。誰でも家で作れるものっていうことでメニューも決めたんですよね？","textVersion":"sha256:51f8e7fa4353eef698170a7c4e85b2792e19f9d73360023dbc3555c5761fa5b6","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","start":21.24,"end":28.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-2","text":"ええ、講師の方と打ち合わせして材料のリストをもらったんです。僕が材料を人数分、まとめて揃えることになってるんですけど、聞いたことのない材料があって・・・取り寄せないといけないみたいなんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:36e1edce03d0482deb9fe053b59339b721baf78252a8dc2b2d6864fe230d3ce8","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","start":28.78,"end":42.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-3","text":"その辺で買える物で代わりに出来ないか講師の先生に相談してください。難しいようならメニュー変更ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:c573042d48c632bff512781ab9ef0c975918b5160d7920eabc1127aa9c77abc6","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","start":42.82,"end":51.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-4","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","start":51.38,"end":52.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-5","text":"作り方が簡単でも材料が近所で手に入るものじゃないとね。","textVersion":"sha256:160b92373340b9a9abb02a6d076089ef3a5cfc37c9177c00ed40f103d2b08867","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","start":52.5,"end":57.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-6","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:017c8a36dd35f3e10b643e1444c328159af8686361c2580e16f591fa22b3f147","timelineVersion":"sha256:22b7c9ffc309fe1ad56ead046f9158635054357d43a3702e21e748799973a604","start":57.66,"end":58.28,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8beb1acf6b156732"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:question","text":"学生の勉強会で司会の人が話しています。参加者はこのあとまず、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a36b1a9cfe2b513d22319064d9e4178e43c45b59ee85849b1a5393acbf344288","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":3.36,"end":13.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-0","text":"今日は大学合同勉強会にご参加いただき、ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:ca5d377d15e65d904a2301d2ae903bdef5e4a6d1f1801a22059db58e5e53fec7","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":15.4,"end":19.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-1","text":"これから世界が今抱えている諸問題についてグループ討論を行い、理解を深めていきます。","textVersion":"sha256:cc30fa8cd39c99148991bd937a2a2f274b3776640c93f3052b19bc85a83dc635","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":20.48,"end":27.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-2","text":"みなさん、既にグループに分かれていますね。","textVersion":"sha256:572697b9f63e2d87d3669346d96baa54964b599efdf340e4bfadd28c54681ee9","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":28.36,"end":30.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-3","text":"お配りしてある名簿に丸の付いている人がグループのリーダーです。","textVersion":"sha256:f286cbf9ad791e20047ff648bcff06a0270af3c4be27508b27fd70f31bf089ec","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":31.45,"end":35.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-4","text":"リーダーを中心に話し合いを進めていただきます。","textVersion":"sha256:2f5835c24a9a3349cf66cc91bf465f7c8eb2a28b6123bc020606cff61f421813","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":36.1,"end":39.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-5","text":"予めみなさんに選んでいただいた課題について議論し、どのような対応ができるかグループごとに意見をまとめて発表してください。","textVersion":"sha256:a6e2efd47f8f003aa8ae341e20d3e428308682ed1f1af443045f8cf61fcb7237","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":40.62,"end":49.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-6","text":"本題に入る前に自己紹介も兼ねてみなさんが今取り組んでいる研究テーマについて話してください。","textVersion":"sha256:ca058badfe2e782f4ec72c5ef2d3d49d2cbd1d98ec847debe5ef5492b38ec732","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":50.38,"end":56.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-7","text":"リラックスしてから話し合いに入りましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:96bd2be8722c1c2b20fd9d2af87f5d72675860adefef23e76b5b4199e9dc0c56","audioVersion":"sha256:ba7e78af4e6a6310648dc5f4f9764b1df98fc95bb45c1f22e7f000bd1dded7c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:134fcf4b9ec39f8c63162bfa34f31e670e18f9f755372e4744b4dbba6ced7990","start":57.6,"end":60.46,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8beb1acf6b156732"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人は列車の席をどのように予約しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f0e0aabf5fed9c9a642fc299449d82a8aabcfdea0ed4ca04d20140906afc319a","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":3.7,"end":15.16,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-0","text":"部長、今度の京都での会議、会長もご一緒ですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:e4a9efb306542619639cb295f80438d38966ecae17d798d7d126215bcafa5429","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":16.8,"end":21.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":21.36,"end":21.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-2","text":"じゃ京都へいらっしゃるのは全部で３名ですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:50009e5a251a1799f1cadc5afa5a5789923219d6d76f4e0a08319c6e0d0a3523","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":22.08,"end":25.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-3","text":"ええ、会長と社長、それから私で、３名ですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:94d48051d3f5dca418d813c5000d8c086a8f2f3b69d4610d102fc328bfe793bd","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":25.64,"end":29.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-4","text":"そうですよね。いまから京都行きの列車の切符を取ろうと思っているんですが、先日のミーティングの資料には４席取ることって書いてあったので、間違いでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:3f0bcbadf5f098d74f5e53a6e9026fd66eec4f69d31f8a3f90cf40ae3307082d","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":29.92,"end":41.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-5","text":"あ、いいえ、それでいいです。会長にはゆったり座っていただきたいので、隣の席も取っておきたくて、このことは言ってませんでしたね。すみません。","textVersion":"sha256:a83240051b0cfbf4b2c955886995f9d700c8f2d0e707f6f11d827046a2303c7a","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":41.76,"end":51.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-6","text":"ああ、そういうことなんですか。じゃ席はどうしましょうか。前後の方がいいでしょうか。それとも通路を挟んで、横一列で取りましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:897a1814a4945ded2c4e8cfaeb5399fbfb72cc13161dcd848a8a231e98deea8e","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":51.88,"end":62.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-7","text":"そうですね。前後でお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:b7f058e92bcd2da184e5104467064c3e2819152e3ce3edbf60efd3b49b2ac709","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":63.08,"end":65.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-8","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:c8c357e35398944c313e5aeb15900d2a6a4ce1378bb74bce2a06229163ddc47c","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaacccecd2cee7c9300ea69c86ea064a7c37225dbc9fb5e01a62879b2d0d09f3","start":66.3,"end":67.1,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"fe8e5dd39a522555"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c4b1e0f16e107f1fd4e64a6d148b38afc00c711e667cdc3dec4eb251b8cee32c","timelineVersion":"sha256:221d08400d8e5d7da6df8e4c38ae8f173d1d5a3449682d02bdd3672807c74d3a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:question","text":"バザー運営スタッフの女の人はバザーの準備について話しています。手伝いをする人は今日何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:2f76f2ce70cf083ee6dbbb47d1332acec6d36bf6fbcd5dfeaa504416900fee11","audioVersion":"sha256:c4b1e0f16e107f1fd4e64a6d148b38afc00c711e667cdc3dec4eb251b8cee32c","timelineVersion":"sha256:221d08400d8e5d7da6df8e4c38ae8f173d1d5a3449682d02bdd3672807c74d3a","start":3.82,"end":16.96,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0","text":"今日はお手伝いに集まってくださってありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:3e1d32080ef6f9061cf5e78df4c923268b7e75fe4194260986608785ae547939","audioVersion":"sha256:c4b1e0f16e107f1fd4e64a6d148b38afc00c711e667cdc3dec4eb251b8cee32c","timelineVersion":"sha256:221d08400d8e5d7da6df8e4c38ae8f173d1d5a3449682d02bdd3672807c74d3a","start":18.9,"end":22.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-1","text":"明後日のバザーで皆さんに持ってきていただいた洋服を販売しますが、今日はその準備をします。","textVersion":"sha256:a842389b217a76cf76491571e609c3a68f5cd3b9fe6304f81a8dcec096f4970e","audioVersion":"sha256:c4b1e0f16e107f1fd4e64a6d148b38afc00c711e667cdc3dec4eb251b8cee32c","timelineVersion":"sha256:221d08400d8e5d7da6df8e4c38ae8f173d1d5a3449682d02bdd3672807c74d3a","start":23.14,"end":30.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-2","text":"えっと、お客さんが選びやすいように、サイズ別に分類したいと思いますので、皆さんはその作業をお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:432420052ae44c7b5b4143f10c7056a6f9a29e52a76a81ab149567ae6b94ad62","audioVersion":"sha256:c4b1e0f16e107f1fd4e64a6d148b38afc00c711e667cdc3dec4eb251b8cee32c","timelineVersion":"sha256:221d08400d8e5d7da6df8e4c38ae8f173d1d5a3449682d02bdd3672807c74d3a","start":30.42,"end":39.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-3","text":"もし少し皺が気になるものがあっても、時間がありませんので、アイロンはかけずにそのまま出します。","textVersion":"sha256:ee244f44d380a04b25b900a61053fb76105b8a57231c92acaae12ad6e8ea6aa2","audioVersion":"sha256:c4b1e0f16e107f1fd4e64a6d148b38afc00c711e667cdc3dec4eb251b8cee32c","timelineVersion":"sha256:221d08400d8e5d7da6df8e4c38ae8f173d1d5a3449682d02bdd3672807c74d3a","start":39.62,"end":47.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-4","text":"なお、運営スタッフのほうで、100円から500円の間で値段を付けて、値段ごとに色の違うシールを貼っておきますので、販売するときは間違えないようにしてください。","textVersion":"sha256:c1d721ef73e1c9f5cf70bccebc0cae90abb0577565206c7f1269dacdaa0d3f34","audioVersion":"sha256:c4b1e0f16e107f1fd4e64a6d148b38afc00c711e667cdc3dec4eb251b8cee32c","timelineVersion":"sha256:221d08400d8e5d7da6df8e4c38ae8f173d1d5a3449682d02bdd3672807c74d3a","start":48.2,"end":61.02,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"fe8e5dd39a522555"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:question","text":"電話で大学の係の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はどのように証明書を申請しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1c9d466b6190437a6ac4c4eb47e060577438bda2cd8d8f1145c0c7d597b144af","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":3.96,"end":16.36,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-0","text":"はい、東條大学です。","textVersion":"sha256:1cb8d4fb068444f18da6fb624c6ea86823de3b9a65c843ff5dcd1dc9f408258d","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":17.98,"end":20.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-1","text":"あのう、卒業生なんですが、卒業証明書を取りたい場合、どうすればいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:5ccd646343a404d5b5dbeebe7a3d322f15c2ad85006e2b7ae784a6c106633b0d","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":20.36,"end":25.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-2","text":"はい。証明書でしたら、大学に来て申請していただければ、その日にお渡しできます。その場合はご本人であることが確認できるものをお持ちください。","textVersion":"sha256:636228500bc843d7896899db2d56058a0a0306a7b974d4d932f181e797e8c131","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":25.8,"end":36.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-3","text":"実は今海外に住んでいて、行けないんですが、","textVersion":"sha256:3815243568e2ccf10efc1997fb670d95af11119bf324ea42f5e83087b494e056","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":36.96,"end":40.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-4","text":"そうですか。郵送での申請も受け付けていますが、事前にこちらに手数料等を振り込んでいただきます。申し込みの際、身分証明書の写しを同封してください。あるいは、窓口で代理の方に申し込んでいただくこともできます。その場合、ご本人との関係を確認するための書類が必要となります。","textVersion":"sha256:345c59cac2b687bd03a65e4d518914c5455a36fa63239e2d73495e2e7c5940c9","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":40.44,"end":62.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-5","text":"そうですか。こちらから振り込むのはちょっと大変なんですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:aad251ddc9869fcfbc53574278dfed8357e3375fcd97cde6dae76f33f342858b","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":63.62,"end":67.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-6","text":"ではどなたかに窓口に来ていただくようお願いされてはいかがでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:304d10a8f8d8fa2af94c42c733ba2423fbb174295436ae80612cb01d79d63317","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":68.28,"end":73.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-7","text":"じゃそうします。あのう、因みに大学のホームページから申し込むことはできないんですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:5f21292f74f6fa6f54fde57fde134d13568ccb216df4ed51262176108aa689aa","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":73.58,"end":79.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-8","text":"すみませんが、インターネットでの申請は本人確認ができないので。","textVersion":"sha256:3fdd95a262fdfefaed0754176cb078fe323ea77cc346c5f99b9f54377aefb46f","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":79.96,"end":84.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-9","text":"そうですよね。わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:063455092cd8c1b4dd24725110f1411e15932b47db3390b73def55bb1d5e1af1","audioVersion":"sha256:151337ccffa35723caac263510ca49f17e5de964cd7685626b2589b9f1ada383","timelineVersion":"sha256:5f9f205836cbf38dd9e3a08f70059eeaa75895604671c913110c0848af961f58","start":84.92,"end":87.06,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"fe8e5dd39a522555"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後研修までに何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:97745a6b0b801e6a0befa173c24be16001c2d1622269c401a6e0b366272d02e8","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":3.58,"end":15.4,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-0","text":"山本さん、来週商品開発の社内研修受けるよね。さっき研修の担当者が来たんだけど、山本さん席外してたから、資料預かっておいたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:05d40b8a25d6b97a11a44413a561ea5f1c9572e563228afdb3452c6c360fe631","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":19,"end":31.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-1","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":31.3,"end":32.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-2","text":"この資料、去年よく売れた商品の開発前のアンケート調査の結果なんだって、当日までにデータの傾向を見て、それが示す意味をまとめてくるようにって言ってたよ。今仕事も大変だと思うけど、何とか時間作って。","textVersion":"sha256:52f2e41406c29d8e8d38800c74c8bad454ce390a5357aca7127a8f223769af8e","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":33.52,"end":48.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-3","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":48.88,"end":49.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-4","text":"課題図書も出ていたよね。もう読んだ？","textVersion":"sha256:b0c006bf8c8b29466b05284d3161e08f6c271c6bf616f780e0f30181969e876a","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":50.6,"end":53.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-5","text":"はい。指定された本を読んで、商品開発についていろいろ疑問点や知りたい点が出てきました。","textVersion":"sha256:5147963d09f8c746dfc19adbce0dc04137e1353e545848019459bfd634889bd3","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":53.32,"end":60.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-6","text":"そうか。じゃ研修で質問したりして、しっかり議論してくるといいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:8fdf9e97e03bde1f9b3c7926a3e7b1220fad67bd73a381c55098a19f6ccf4596","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":60.34,"end":65.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":65.96,"end":66.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-8","text":"この研修会では新商品の企画書を書くところまでするだろ。うまくいけば、実際商品化されることもあるから、いい企画書書けるよう頑張って。いい経験になると思うから。","textVersion":"sha256:f4915aee3fbd57a4e42a7af1bd9a7e5bf3ab7030ef16fb0a52422fd50ba9b47e","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":66.92,"end":79.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:87a41526b1c5248e3502aba68c4c4925581a3840024ef2e7e4c2939872564a72","timelineVersion":"sha256:016fa3254a221ccb54e331b2a538412ce2ce9e4fddf47cb652b61f441e499ecd","start":79.24,"end":79.72,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"fe8e5dd39a522555"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:question","text":"大学で書道サークルの女の学生と男の部長が話しています。女の学生は何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:147569cde4c852b6857d565c2b7acd678306820413d8cf129dec6bbc7a309de5","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":3.6,"end":16.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-0","text":"展覧会まであと四ヶ月ですね。ポスターの準備とかそろそろ始めたほうがいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:aa44db4e20b584674fd43b9c9481b2b58911e6e5760daaafb6371fb72870f541","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":17.72,"end":24.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-1","text":"ポスターは二年生の渡辺さんにデザインを考えてもらおうかなと思ってるんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:314c46b512289acfa0af44abe3f2e4b54f93fec7c9813df55fde3263ec989247","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":25.16,"end":31.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-2","text":"いいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:824f766e8638da15be9e77705d03903e3cea29ed5698e2ce40247cb94dcb2fc9","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":31.62,"end":32.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-3","text":"それでね。去年の展覧会に緑大学の書道サークルの人たちが来てくれて、今度一緒に何かやりたいねって話になったのを覚えてる？","textVersion":"sha256:0d6232c50b34c67caf5b1ed0dccdac589c8286c1aa2f9f40a163994acceb201a","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":32.98,"end":42.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-4","text":"そうでしたね。","textVersion":"sha256:82b18c52bbcdb9cc44245a42eec0ed106aa3f55c405d90542952512554a3324c","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":42.66,"end":43.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-5","text":"あっちの部長と連絡とったんだけど、今年は共同制作とかやろうという話になってるんだ。向こうの担当者の連絡先を聞いてるから、詳しいことを相談してくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:406f19f93a81fd8abffe7184a485515fae564a627058d80adeafac974285b7b5","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":44.34,"end":55.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-6","text":"はい、じゃ会場も広いほうがいいですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:4925b1fc3e3520fff6ff7ce1935e66133275da82ebdd6ef663e8f5fb2eae48c3","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":55.7,"end":59.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-7","text":"うん。今までは大学の中だったけど、今回は大学の外の施設を借りてみたらどうかなと思って、いくつか候補を絞ったところなんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:022b7cc49f8aed5ced8800ad1cbe59651da1b1b35a828928f0839b5b533eca99","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":59.6,"end":69.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-8","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":69.16,"end":70.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-9","text":"それと、宣伝のために、ホームページに作品の写真を載せとこうと思うんだ。過去の展覧会に出したやつ写真に撮って残してあるから。","textVersion":"sha256:621bbc64f70b22aae4ac2b4aeb8b8ae85d936d4e87c90c3b7080557d008f3eed","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":70.36,"end":79.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-10","text":"いいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:824f766e8638da15be9e77705d03903e3cea29ed5698e2ce40247cb94dcb2fc9","audioVersion":"sha256:cd4bafe56cd05c1dd8a5066190f62d738b6c26718cb19f7ef063816fb6afe646","timelineVersion":"sha256:a35433aa3557cf4bba04ea47d8a9c2e84b8a3f72fc0c60696ba8a1b0ec0b4dce","start":79.18,"end":80.4,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"fe8e5dd39a522555"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:question","text":"男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はこのあと何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:df974799738ac5ff46d4109bcf6364bdc57c1da13c0038132cbc62cce6cb4ccb","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":3.9,"end":12.82,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0","text":"森さん。僕、来週引っ越すんだけど、今使ってる冷蔵庫いらなくなるんだ。それで、もらってくれる人探してるんだけど誰か知らない？","textVersion":"sha256:d95a7556363bacb357c9f662486cafc10be1de645a18afae61b08b82a0d340c6","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":14.44,"end":25.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-1","text":"んー、ちょっと心当たりないな。","textVersion":"sha256:117435643abaae89c88fd355a7c2dee76af658a4e54c6ccf247820d2dae7f7c0","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":25.8,"end":29.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-2","text":"そっか。冷蔵庫って確か粗大ゴミとしては出せないんだよね？","textVersion":"sha256:b170d87c6d90a7532fb1111bac8c3d920d0851bff8aece63776913f2ecbe7974","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":29.94,"end":35.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-3","text":"うん。法律でいらなくなった冷蔵庫を出す時は手続きをすることになってるよね。","textVersion":"sha256:8e6c192198d9303abb2ca805f00bd98a52e390d6e8eae7cb754c4b9436641beb","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":35.4,"end":41.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-4","text":"そっか。手続きってどこでするの？","textVersion":"sha256:4d720d6bdb80e935c771679e977d67935be31cfc4f15823d284ec41545c0f6ee","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":41.86,"end":44.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-5","text":"市役所に連絡してもいいけど、引っ越し会社によっては事前に言っとけば手続きをしてくれて引っ越し当日、冷蔵庫の回収もしてくれるって聞いたことあるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1b8b68a0b996b27818271aa8584bd53a5c4a09dab05d649ce214179d0306a98e","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":45,"end":56.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-6","text":"え、そうなんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:7ded4f4e8d6498f9611084e7f1601d3c23921abc4aab2f52709917d05bdd6028","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":57.08,"end":58.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-7","text":"その方が簡単だから聞いてみたら？来週まで時間もないでしょう？","textVersion":"sha256:7d131350a3fda9f42021ce2f0e3dbfc22c26def51d4d5c8f5380680d115915f3","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":58.02,"end":63.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-8","text":"わかった。ありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:baeb65dc83e9158f4140605062df92bf5e90358d73016ce8c6a3779164b9cacb","audioVersion":"sha256:0996c4ed62946bb018028173e458c1afa100b3002d6619a594d172454f33944d","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6460dc3134ff28e5d0dce68ebe147a50809a8ede8db896b79607d92b6a7dea9","start":63.72,"end":65.32,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"56706c49847bc42c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:question","text":"日本語学校で先生が話しています。学生はこのあとスピーチの原稿をどう直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7894d8d3f79a70c923418f9b2c586cf5dd9b06c9212cb699b8cb2c305cdb0451","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","start":5.04,"end":14.5,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-0","text":"先週提出してもらったスピーチの原稿を返します。","textVersion":"sha256:38ece08c502a4800b788355d3212f873db3042e41d58bb13940cb5c096ab00bf","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","start":16.1,"end":19.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-1","text":"始めのところに自己紹介を入れてもらいましたが、皆さんよく書けていました。","textVersion":"sha256:5e81f9cdd7f5609469a0c3e3bf65f1395ec261d608324aa7f7c721096ad7f60e","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","start":20.28,"end":25.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-2","text":"スピーチの内容もそれぞれとても面白かったです。","textVersion":"sha256:9d6d345e6985a68bd4fd666e82baf09d68653cd1e3136691b27f9940aaca3c19","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","start":26.1,"end":29.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-3","text":"授業で勉強したように難しい言葉には説明を付けてわかりやすくしているのもよかったんですが、皆さん、文と文を繋ぐ表現がほとんど使われていませんでした。","textVersion":"sha256:bfe53269ff851cb3e2cb5576f9a0984db599c22806bcafb924940e97aa9229ce","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","start":30.16,"end":42.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-4","text":"不自然に感じるので今から見直して入れてみましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:8f12386cf8c844eeaa3b839c9d4084d4921b34dbcecc3c0d7527a3cac63db8e3","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","start":43.02,"end":47.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-5","text":"その他の点についてはそれぞれコメントを入れました。","textVersion":"sha256:3604576571c3a03042bf9ae5a87c2fba26bb64557bee3f316bdcd31ced3b504b","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","start":47.92,"end":51.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-6","text":"全体的な長さは今は考えなくてもいいですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:7ae46d6e83d99832f3d7dae25d3526e6ccd6c89c1bfbeaa37379e17b48cd4112","audioVersion":"sha256:d758d8fa257b73b7a1a85cab55db6bc934472808754374a62834bcb90d7de4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:612a8fcea15410af8a7c97ad7e4fd7ad868c146ef078f9748531c72aaf6dee44","start":51.82,"end":55.68,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"56706c49847bc42c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:question","text":"デパートの洋服売り場で店の人と男の人が話しています。店の人はズボンの裾をどのように仕上げますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0557d529f9058836b007f5a3170759b497643d432a000110d2774a71c223fd88","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":4.06,"end":16.64,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-0","text":"お客様、そちらのズボン、履いてみていかがですか。","textVersion":"sha256:daf0de245415299ca6ca1524c97e7c622541f515ee23d64dd761c328dc844275","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":18.2,"end":22.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-1","text":"あ、ちょうどいいです。ただズボンの裾が少し長いので短くしてもらえますか。","textVersion":"sha256:340071b760f717c52bb5bbd5686ddbff8831e2f2754af47a4623764382bd4e30","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":22.8,"end":29.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-2","text":"かしこまりました。では長さを確認いたします。","textVersion":"sha256:466baeae5a2dc262e3650a7230c397c1ff7088ccfb5290e3bf08c4b8458b48ac","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":28.96,"end":33.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-3","text":"あの、今これは裾が内側に折ってあるんですけど、外側に折るようにしてもらえますか。売り場に飾ってあったののみたいに。","textVersion":"sha256:612cd1ae9a1d1e6a76460feb230cf510083f72a67884484ade581fa3e6558de2","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":34.28,"end":43.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-4","text":"あ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:688cc368fcc4633fa24fcf881503ca3e1c2828cc1d9b031049dde142f0b7a0b7","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":43.3,"end":44.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-5","text":"できますか。よかった。で、売り場にあったのは折ったところをボタンで留めるようになってましたが、糸で留めてもらいたいんです。","textVersion":"sha256:1c7ba35263a4ab8cf436bb8a0566db1be6b23d0ba80dc204957d80d64cda8cf5","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":44.62,"end":53.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-6","text":"ボタンですと留めたり外したりしやすいので汚れなどのお手入れがしやすいですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a457e7110a8cc8e001f5374c9d3c88fdacf7846ea53c5c0839f2403f49f66e9b","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":54.28,"end":60.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-7","text":"うーん、僕には必要ないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:1e377d6a47cec1feb6b01fb3cf1f12f7b4a3881ba71dfd0664a874eb695000d4","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":60.88,"end":63.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-8","text":"承知しました。では、そのように。","textVersion":"sha256:d2c23f842847af18fb085491c0575099a62b470f7c5bb233d807a6deaa81eb7e","audioVersion":"sha256:be25020f5cf6a75e1c0eb53c2d99fa4757ea45de29d2647d76b0ef40bddd483c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9200f07309b7e6d6f45b1b1d1867eb5aeb44221a5552ce161829e842f16c87f","start":64.16,"end":66.6,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"56706c49847bc42c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:question","text":"会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこのあとまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:ab0be0a3df360b2704e569bc96f38f027c481924d93336c9d695fd4db1b8cd7a","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","start":3.82,"end":15.84,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-0","text":"田中さん。新製品の発売に合わせて行うイベント、あれ、やることが確定したから準備始めてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:7576fcf7192ffc0dde87f5f508d23c1830fa13a99efe0ca842ca67dbdf67ee2d","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","start":19.16,"end":27.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-1","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","start":27.4,"end":28.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-2","text":"今回は社長に挨拶をお願いしてあるから社長が来られる日じゃないといけないの。秘書課に予定を聞いてくれる？イベントの候補日を絞らないといけないから。","textVersion":"sha256:da4f7cee79edc2cfd8948307e9d1dec3b168a76431734ee692a36685e712d54e","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","start":28.86,"end":39.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-3","text":"はい。日にちが決まったら会場を予約しますね。参加者は何人ぐらいになるでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:e18502c2053f72eaa460f9255af0ed16b29ade74c6599201511f782981627f15","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","start":39.88,"end":46.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-4","text":"100人ぐらいかな。営業部が今、招待客の名簿を作ってるところなんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:61e5b93b4d67cfe14ecbbbdd9b75d92b47e71016b848d9db32a8dcf7bb87bfd6","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","start":46.88,"end":52.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-5","text":"じゃ、会場を予約するのは名簿が出来てからですね。","textVersion":"sha256:250420149d2b87863f2049df4da3faa18ae530aec8b5e4fc9ffde055d3df293c","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","start":53.06,"end":57.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-6","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:2ee808ac3f78992ee6613078e1bdc109e2dd3e2472ea9e8b278f29b9f488b89c","timelineVersion":"sha256:28c24795c85c3a828077828c0c09f11ddd958374502dd20feb2dfbc25b4c5e86","start":56.98,"end":57.88,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"56706c49847bc42c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:question","text":"アパートの入り口で男の管理人と女の学生が話しています。女の学生は明日の朝、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:d1396559e0fbcb3b9473a35ab2b64fa1f13851a438afdd93e3b53a730d952c38","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":4,"end":18.18,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-0","text":"あ、リンさん。おはようございます。掲示板にお知らせを貼っておいたんですけど、明日の土曜日、大丈夫ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:a9ed659394477338c048c00481f76609e1be49bf8eed83f2b7533df95d8b48d5","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":19.82,"end":27.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-1","text":"え？明日、何かあるんですか。すみません、掲示板ちゃんと読んでなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:4665783b3242d5fe8052d9242b58a6b263da5f892d9518f1f9239a83e0b1aa93","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":27.66,"end":34.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-2","text":"自転車置き場のペンキを塗り直すんですよ。ついでに自転車置き場の掃除もするんです。","textVersion":"sha256:8b780324c8a8e8436e6307c751b1dae4ed61bdda3a7705f9a3a5316912237f50","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":34.62,"end":40.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-3","text":"ああ、そうなんですか。すみません、明日はちょっと時間が無くて。","textVersion":"sha256:327a04e181ff64e5da0ab996dd8ac93f23b4de6e34fac37133f937397cef93ed","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":40.38,"end":46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-4","text":"ああ、いえ。自転車をアパートの前の駐車場に移動してほしいんです。今日はまだ駐車場が使えないから明日の朝7時から10時の間にお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:b05800fd23c908e59ccdae3e82259f02baa567f7f8dba81538c76a0b2ba9e971","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":46,"end":56.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-5","text":"ああ、一緒にペンキを塗るのかと思っちゃいました。","textVersion":"sha256:abd5bf66f165d07d676512737cd88b9aedc58705da18d2d56225497f3cfd959c","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":57.18,"end":60.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-6","text":"あはは、それはプロに頼んでありますよ。明日の朝、大丈夫そうですか。無理なら私がやっておきますが。","textVersion":"sha256:14808057c038b62039c684fa14a46670628099af7eac57059968d9f4ca7dab34","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":60.98,"end":68.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-7","text":"はい、出かける前にできます。","textVersion":"sha256:bae639c5f5e5280482c405611b4086273060874d2f2550b8e40835fafd32a629","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":68.58,"end":70.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-8","text":"お願いします。動かしたらすみませんが鍵は私に預けてください。自転車はこちらで戻しておきますから。","textVersion":"sha256:c52e6483ec1fe1b0327eb60e2a839a0c0762374547acecbf4a52a470ff7b46c6","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":70.98,"end":78.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-9","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:4a7c028babd0b1a255ffd75877f9e8ff21299bde01dd167480e2202703cecd4f","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf2aab45a29ccb30563723f25bae3c26431993551e280b4acb69bc10e4c4045e","start":79.28,"end":80.02,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"56706c49847bc42c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:question","text":"アパートで女の人と管理人が話しています。女の人は壊れたパソコンをどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0ac98d4b2c82a3bacc00f7c765c0cce515e2ba93efa8aac715790670c3b46ba7","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","start":4,"end":13.39,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-0","text":"壊れたパソコンは、粗大ゴミの申し込みをして、アパートの指定の場所に出せば、収集してくれるんでしたっけ。薄いノートパソコンなんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:eba26e14910288eb56e05f090f1729f51e9e1c9e524bbde6498ae62fbf1ba1fb","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","start":15.22,"end":27.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-1","text":"パソコンはメーカーに回収してもらうか、パソコンを買ったお店に持っていくかしないと、粗大ゴミとして出せないんですね。","textVersion":"sha256:71d8ad29cc0e51cd36185f6298f36ad1b5f8aaa9b5fe1045ab748cdc875907df","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","start":28.21,"end":36.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-2","text":"そうなんですか。十何年も前のものなので、どこで買ったか。","textVersion":"sha256:c16a46bc8982ab5ea2763af0a6f1fe5c5fe4bf902587899cd7e7d59de5d22640","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","start":37.28,"end":42.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-3","text":"でしたら、メーカーに連絡すれば、専用の伝票を送ってくれますから、それを梱包したパソコンに貼って、郵送すればいいんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f91833328f33fecf153283c53197620d049c02a72360d2ee4e421412ba1696f7","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","start":42.88,"end":51.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-4","text":"意外と簡単な手続きなんですね。","textVersion":"sha256:5c7dc703fbcd78f67bb0d52cabf8d861261de93caf84c8efa36d1d8bd28b8342","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","start":51.98,"end":54.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-5","text":"大きい自治体だと、市役所とか公共施設に回収箱が設置されていて、そこに入れればパソコンも回収してくれるんですけど、この地域はないんですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:58d667a6a40c4b5ac6103b40cd73bc24ffae14e6f34b59155603f033bd258b87","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","start":54.64,"end":65.67,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-6","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:bd869c466316a8103dabd6a8fb91c6e8706d2d036af5e465538ba9efb759a123","timelineVersion":"sha256:bee6eb4f8e4bb6f20de9cbacf077f6d239c0a6e3acfc40c6358ddba5e9415db5","start":65.93,"end":66.82,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"03f7dae262c3cd5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:question","text":"会社で部長と事務の女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:7af16d1855c36a7f4d09f47e82ae3d8db4b076abde7b5a096fe289cd74c0d226","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":4,"end":14.67,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-0","text":"ちょっといいかな。北山食品からのプラスチックの容器の注文のことなんだけど、この請求書を作成したのって。","textVersion":"sha256:a1e0518eba1bf965dab2b12b8eecb563f0c4c8ee1aaef3028a3c3f0149eeb3f9","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":16.86,"end":27.47,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-1","text":"作ったのはわたしです。何か間違いがありましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:05bb3486d0a70892781b668209b1faee2fc78e43cb3a05ec07caa9892d120d4e","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":27.88,"end":33.01,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-2","text":"いや、これ中村君に頼まれて作成したんだよね。営業担当は中村君だから。","textVersion":"sha256:603a7b8f167086892b1174c655123af2df6364fd3c17e5ddf86bee4694da5cae","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":33.47,"end":39.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":40.12,"end":40.53,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-4","text":"注文の数がこれまでよりずいぶん減ってるから、その理由が知りたいんだけど、中村君外出中みたいで、何か聞いてない？","textVersion":"sha256:bb905f3f48525aaffa74a662724f1da7097073b4a657b6726bfdb12d4d263208","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":41.05,"end":50.43,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-5","text":"いいえ、何も。","textVersion":"sha256:ee4de1194499c6913911898172504934e367b819c4da5fa95dacf7e52bbe75d7","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":50.76,"end":51.87,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-6","text":"そうか。悪いけど、わたし今から会議だから、中村君戻ったらこの件について、わたしのところに説明にくるよう伝えといてもらえるかな。五時には会議終わって戻るから、特に報告受けてなかったものだから、気になっちゃってね。","textVersion":"sha256:7ba5be600686a44622d9cd72ca0a1c8a78911df97d6aa731cc18c50b2458824d","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":52.65,"end":70.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:49162dc5ecbe083d6a95e8f71909ba0f91986fa7a04a21f9dfe3917aa6deeb07","timelineVersion":"sha256:cfe20b7471980cae7d5e08f227432af5d7e758d977d4674cd15226dc67857616","start":71.17,"end":71.96,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"03f7dae262c3cd5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2242bffa8c4e4e2916d0813af1994b5f0184311ec5065e9a7fb432fbb265193c","timelineVersion":"sha256:4f9aa8db84b352305dec02f05336a4741ffcac11dcb38a614cdd0db02b35a81f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:question","text":"日本語のクラスで先生が留学生に話しています。留学生は主に商店街の何についてインタビューのプランを立てますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1477db547be3dab68e2c4bc46b03b340bd508e1bf394f2cea0ddb11e2d02351e","audioVersion":"sha256:2242bffa8c4e4e2916d0813af1994b5f0184311ec5065e9a7fb432fbb265193c","timelineVersion":"sha256:4f9aa8db84b352305dec02f05336a4741ffcac11dcb38a614cdd0db02b35a81f","start":3.82,"end":16.75,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-0","text":"来週の授業では、さくら商店街にいって、グループごとに二軒ずつ古くから続く商店を回って、お店の人にインタビューをします。","textVersion":"sha256:21b30336cc87bbe66abc5a0d765a670f6e4ca16ebccfe039675e35170e17f93f","audioVersion":"sha256:2242bffa8c4e4e2916d0813af1994b5f0184311ec5065e9a7fb432fbb265193c","timelineVersion":"sha256:4f9aa8db84b352305dec02f05336a4741ffcac11dcb38a614cdd0db02b35a81f","start":18.64,"end":29.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-1","text":"ええ、さくら商店街は最近では魚のコロッケなどの人気商品で知られ、新しいことに次々とチャレンジしていますが、県内で最も長く続く商店街なんです。","textVersion":"sha256:1dab3c04f38950de0c1b0525d092b96fa2df0cb294739a5fe2f09f39fbe2d4c3","audioVersion":"sha256:2242bffa8c4e4e2916d0813af1994b5f0184311ec5065e9a7fb432fbb265193c","timelineVersion":"sha256:4f9aa8db84b352305dec02f05336a4741ffcac11dcb38a614cdd0db02b35a81f","start":30.02,"end":43.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-2","text":"そこで商店街全体がこれまでどのように困難を乗り越え、変化、発展してきたのか、話を伺います。","textVersion":"sha256:4128d66d932ac5f06188fbc5928aafede782e262e94d174a6d755c511882a083","audioVersion":"sha256:2242bffa8c4e4e2916d0813af1994b5f0184311ec5065e9a7fb432fbb265193c","timelineVersion":"sha256:4f9aa8db84b352305dec02f05336a4741ffcac11dcb38a614cdd0db02b35a81f","start":44.5,"end":53.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-3","text":"今日はこのテーマに基づいてグループごとにインタビューのプランを立てましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:ff28535cccfcc545638c58113d640d9b00fefdfad3b4f34f0d588c734c1ed351","audioVersion":"sha256:2242bffa8c4e4e2916d0813af1994b5f0184311ec5065e9a7fb432fbb265193c","timelineVersion":"sha256:4f9aa8db84b352305dec02f05336a4741ffcac11dcb38a614cdd0db02b35a81f","start":54.94,"end":60.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-4","text":"今から、各グループに店のリストを配ります。","textVersion":"sha256:4666e5d51f4601a176b8357ca1e09113f4dfded753d0a481a50a13c738077cdd","audioVersion":"sha256:2242bffa8c4e4e2916d0813af1994b5f0184311ec5065e9a7fb432fbb265193c","timelineVersion":"sha256:4f9aa8db84b352305dec02f05336a4741ffcac11dcb38a614cdd0db02b35a81f","start":60.28,"end":64.92,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"03f7dae262c3cd5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:question","text":"大学の事務所で学生と事務所の人が話しています。学生はこの後、まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e86ba5867a3f5508750ab1c2cdfc658c6474abcd195e657dc3da65d8bd5dd161","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","start":3.94,"end":15.11,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-0","text":"すみません。先週インフルエンザで経済学の学期末試験を休んでしまったんですが。病気の場合は、もう一度試験が受けられると聞きまして。","textVersion":"sha256:cdad6b30c44e5bac059f5840f3a80bdb05d37213c0cdf7e0e6e5b58d347ae145","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","start":17.06,"end":27.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-1","text":"経済学は西山先生ですね。まずは先生に試験が受けられるか確認して、受けられるということなら、こちらの申請書を書いて、医師の診断書と一緒に出してください。申請、今日までだから、急いで西山先生に確認してくださいね。","textVersion":"sha256:610280529c4c841fcf299e41fe81ddc666cb335a8c349ec206bc6169c8d58912","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","start":28.28,"end":47.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-2","text":"あっ、先生には許可をいただきました。あのう、診断書が必要って知らなくて、病院でもらって来なかったんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:7dab274ad5c1e5bed142bfe01f9a0f8727cd051f19daaff6c3a6bc4ae5c564ab","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","start":47.44,"end":57.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-3","text":"病気の場合は診断書がないと。","textVersion":"sha256:b02b313a67d029fda902253a2f9f48dc6413e9037d72c5adc9f2a57c0749c29b","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","start":57.5,"end":59.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-4","text":"今日は病院が休みで、明日書いてもらって持ってきますので。","textVersion":"sha256:fa4e3d572d86804ace44cc846de3aded6edd12077c7d350f21c4e3b1ffa21b0d","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","start":59.79,"end":65.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-5","text":"ううん、仕方ないですね。じゃあ、今日は申請書だけで、試験の詳細は来週掲示板に出ますから、自分で確認するようにしてくださいね。","textVersion":"sha256:77ce45cc8cbb3e221efafe4ccddca18b957c5818a26263cf08e2ec3d54fecd41","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","start":65.63,"end":76.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-6","text":"はい、ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:38147824564394ff9492239e2b0b8871fc9d54c44fdd9f56bb7e569673f7c4cb","audioVersion":"sha256:3d532ccffd976c4fbc8639d0ca53889cad75bb5f6d2b061dbf5a5e6001829f41","timelineVersion":"sha256:4061a4630d35dcd688234e34be4c741e43cde21aa32cb692a0422ff1e567b268","start":76.71,"end":78.34,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"03f7dae262c3cd5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:question","text":"男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人は、パーティーの日に何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:eb8b687927cc85bbb06360f87c22a1088d9e7ea24e03153d17a85cc7d15e444f","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":3.68,"end":12.81,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-0","text":"山下さん、来月、松田君の結婚パーティーをレストランでやることになったんだけど、手伝ってくれない。","textVersion":"sha256:115e6499200ac7df9abc0783afc60266a49b70ec831050a0a0f91761927f3446","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":14.74,"end":21.75,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-1","text":"もちろん、何でも言って。","textVersion":"sha256:df325a3a4d9b3c06bead674926a820211ff9af899adb159054035ab6c42825dc","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":21.87,"end":23.79,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-2","text":"【ア】受付をお願いできないかな、会費制でやるから、会費の受取をしてほしいんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:bf625613c828a91a7631f5017e2a7eca5a80bab650730897c93b0e854fde409e","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":25.08,"end":31.47,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-3","text":"わかった。","textVersion":"sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":31.69,"end":32.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-4","text":"ねえ、もう一つ、【ウ】会場の音楽担当か、【エ】ビデオ撮影の担当も頼めない？音楽係は事前に松田君と相談して曲を選んで、当日かけてほしいんだ。ダンスの曲とか、撮影係は動画の編集までやってもらいたいんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:c6d6cf2de85fc4e0697e26e967d1985b06fd3607dec796eb15d4beab58f591b6","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":32.89,"end":51.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-5","text":"【エ】わたし、動画作るの、得意。","textVersion":"sha256:b9ee3f0b35c9f42319c079e984e5117ae6f15927aabfdd730abe83c60d031d2b","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":51.56,"end":53.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-6","text":"本当、じゃあ、決まりだね、だけど、受付お願いするとなると、時間ギリギリに来場する人がいたら、撮影開始が遅れちゃうか。カメラを最初だけほかの人に任せるとしても、何か慌ただしいな、やっぱり、山下さんには【イ】受付やめて、会場の飾り付けグループに入ってもらおうかな、当日2時間前に来られる？","textVersion":"sha256:122fad9d6c1c6294fca5e7954484d6b34db56d3e7ccabd7e1b7cafcba44fdd3b","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":53.5,"end":81,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-7","text":"うん、大丈夫。","textVersion":"sha256:2dfd7adf91a1975859566dc7aaf7d7fe538556ed45c0a3376613421797ba0032","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":81.11,"end":82.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-8","text":"じゃあ、係りを二つお願いすることになるけど、よろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:08996205a860efffa18be64714640e4542f491b94364bdbceb81e95bdc0e6013","audioVersion":"sha256:4ecfe1b60ad5d84f0b6ba33dfa54c75225cdd3c77b825747c7eee489a2239f6e","timelineVersion":"sha256:006f1340c44ca29ca07cb2eea7651796624cb71a1a94d5e5e697d1de7409ced8","start":82.24,"end":86.66,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"03f7dae262c3cd5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ba646d5be5e72259283aa2db1aa7d2b051409578d0436848c577580ff7181fd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:4ba8de345fe0502c8f5898ac06f5e28bda7c7d7d73b1fee4430a3d246ba9e9bc","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:question","text":"駅のホームで女の人と駅員が話しています。女の人はこのあとまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f61414950f51a7fa060ae78465a3cc5502f6ad6257cdf415779fe072e36424b4","audioVersion":"sha256:ba646d5be5e72259283aa2db1aa7d2b051409578d0436848c577580ff7181fd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:4ba8de345fe0502c8f5898ac06f5e28bda7c7d7d73b1fee4430a3d246ba9e9bc","start":3.6,"end":14.27,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-0","text":"あのう、すみません。赤い傘の忘れ物なかったでしょうか。このあたりにおいたと思って探してみたんですが、ないんです。一時間ぐらい前なんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:0f516ca4fa5a169e10a4d245a36605c0d0927da54540e7a9dc93f1fb8926be3d","audioVersion":"sha256:ba646d5be5e72259283aa2db1aa7d2b051409578d0436848c577580ff7181fd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:4ba8de345fe0502c8f5898ac06f5e28bda7c7d7d73b1fee4430a3d246ba9e9bc","start":18.06,"end":29.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-1","text":"傘ですか。さっきまで掃除の人がいましたけどね。見つかった忘れ物は駅の事務所に置いてあるので。行って聞いてみてください。改札の隣です。","textVersion":"sha256:e2986e1f2268f15518b5399ebaa1555b80c0e5ca3c121a4825c9d6fabd536372","audioVersion":"sha256:ba646d5be5e72259283aa2db1aa7d2b051409578d0436848c577580ff7181fd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:4ba8de345fe0502c8f5898ac06f5e28bda7c7d7d73b1fee4430a3d246ba9e9bc","start":30.33,"end":42.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-2","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:ba646d5be5e72259283aa2db1aa7d2b051409578d0436848c577580ff7181fd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:4ba8de345fe0502c8f5898ac06f5e28bda7c7d7d73b1fee4430a3d246ba9e9bc","start":42.53,"end":43.57,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-3","text":"もし事務所になかったら、隣の山川駅の忘れ物センターに聞いてみてもいいかもしれませんね。まれに拾った方がそちらにお届けになることもありますから。","textVersion":"sha256:f2f30cbebcc5ca68deb9f50bfbb27d748ea948c3c1b2db2c5cbe94832db4374b","audioVersion":"sha256:ba646d5be5e72259283aa2db1aa7d2b051409578d0436848c577580ff7181fd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:4ba8de345fe0502c8f5898ac06f5e28bda7c7d7d73b1fee4430a3d246ba9e9bc","start":44.14,"end":55.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-4","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:ba646d5be5e72259283aa2db1aa7d2b051409578d0436848c577580ff7181fd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:4ba8de345fe0502c8f5898ac06f5e28bda7c7d7d73b1fee4430a3d246ba9e9bc","start":56.17,"end":56.92,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6463ac642ef797f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人は語学の勉強のためにまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d45607eb354bcdd5775049be7c7c01ade98f462008d93c9333d7bc7f2d7f8f6f","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":4.9,"end":15.25,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0","text":"この間、課長に、来年あたり海外勤務になるかもしれないから、準備しておくようにって言われたんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a7dacb357d27424360b9066aaadd486bfd5787638ee49805b91acdd5fbc3b636","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":17.28,"end":23.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-1","text":"そう？","textVersion":"sha256:3f9bf16d3207905ca375bc60f8f75cfde0df97ce8fab03dde280035d831d1acd","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":24.17,"end":24.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-2","text":"今のうちに語学の勉強をしなきゃって思ってるんですが、何かいい方法ありませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:6cda10c4984cffe653f220b1599b27d50a234ca5c150c168df1d08d8e704147b","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":25.01,"end":30.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-3","text":"そうね、うちの会社でも語学の研修やってるでしょう。参加してる？","textVersion":"sha256:3d7b113e205f66463a57acf76df4096e10fff10e88dd986b0c94253bba3ca9e7","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":31.06,"end":36.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-4","text":"残業や出張が多いので、なかなか。","textVersion":"sha256:f61a6d4cc3eaba42ed0ee1c00ae8d3203eaef17b528e6060469300cd9296a42e","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":37.09,"end":39.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-5","text":"じゃ、通信教育がいいんじゃない？移動中も勉強出来るし。高くなくて、いいの知ってるから、あとでメールで教えようか。","textVersion":"sha256:0ccbc6d7a451382626d2a917ba3301be4ab5da0caf86e7c77631ffe1f9e5becb","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":40.03,"end":48.69,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-6","text":"ええ、ぜひ。時間を有効に活用できていいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:723ec84f330d59932cf06e7e8621592dbd7924ef618a3f01e683b2b3f876db28","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":48.97,"end":52.69,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-7","text":"ただ、あれは聞くのには慣れても、話すのがね。少し耳が慣れてきたら、外国人の友達紹介するから、あってみるといいよ。話すと会話の練習にもなるし。実践が一番だからね。","textVersion":"sha256:ce41fcf0df1f261b56e59d1b929c5755720a0d4887bc5188fd085a1ad5244c85","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":53.22,"end":67.91,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-8","text":"何から何まですみません。慣れたらお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:802450a8b2788056c759a48ae1754f6839f987cd4f7b78e0468ec9bc04997237","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":68.24,"end":71.87,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-9","text":"あとは語学試験に申し込んでみるのもいいんじゃない？目標があれば、一人でも勉強を続けようっていう気持ちになるし。","textVersion":"sha256:6317390d384357369a74ea02a9f7e7785e467536f8ba58c09c124498e18b686d","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":72.56,"end":80.45,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-10","text":"そうですね。力がついてきたらやってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:02400c66389501a53ffb9453f2abcafc4a85b45cdefc9f877fb14a342e02237e","audioVersion":"sha256:5652b45b3c8dd93f877f324227766e506d0f07c01630cef7c72bb440dc2acd34","timelineVersion":"sha256:acffe2980f20570bd023ec3a48bcc89b7f19d7b4b988d06302a30f36b13553ff","start":81.58,"end":84.47,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"6463ac642ef797f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:question","text":"会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人は倉庫に入るとき、どの順番で入口のボタンを押さなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:300cd200bcc255266e7ae09942934741f3b4e2a641745ddb05a9dc9d0bc34e91","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":5.2,"end":17.43,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-0","text":"すみません。地下の倉庫に行って、資料を取ってきたいんですが、入口の開け方がわからなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:dd0ed37bf5e7e1b3f2b04c12a6bcdbb1990e6df22f47b0be9b30caa9e477805b","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":21.24,"end":28.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-1","text":"ああ、最近、管理が厳しくなって、入口の横のボタンを押さないとだめなんだよ。倉庫は三つあるけど、何番の？","textVersion":"sha256:c4b5b22f26bf3155053a99492b8a57460e0a6682c1c200407ccc797da4e0bf51","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":29.24,"end":38.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-2","text":"ええと、二番です。","textVersion":"sha256:cef8d4e4b41bd778f5d90e1ee104fbaadd81b373a3c726270b9acd4f9669272e","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":38.28,"end":40.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-3","text":"じゃ、倉庫の番号は002だね。それと、暗証番号も必要だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e0c15194f5b086f3f5584c6ff0625c5bf5597e5bb78543562d9bdb7695c997ad","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":40.74,"end":46.57,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-4","text":"そうですか。暗証番号は？","textVersion":"sha256:b3570b24d27328c2634e52cd1cf7df90ce5b08d97eaae98a8f8e27702b679217","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":46.87,"end":49.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-5","text":"725だよ。ドアの横のボタンを暗証番号、「開く」のボタン、倉庫の番号、「開く」のボタンの順で押して。そうすれば、すぐドアが開くから。","textVersion":"sha256:75df50066d7c85e93beb2353b6e22d7a7ab574e7fa2ec916985cb4b3ac4388bf","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":49.72,"end":62.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-6","text":"暗証番号、開く、倉庫の番号。","textVersion":"sha256:58876f5af8be1b932c6fedc2454c0f0447c11faae5afcaa3164119ad94eaab9b","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":62.98,"end":67.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-7","text":"そのあとに、「開く」だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:aaaa0ee2eb0ccc00b7ee19d670aefb8c5f0d8980faa33e68793e9fc53b6b4a6c","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":67.86,"end":69.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-8","text":"はい、わかりました。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:fca60b8021bdef5c7ab7939ddcf4db4b4442e18ebff2a94188ef494e9b4fe332","audioVersion":"sha256:a20f03135b9e49c83a47a67fd65b8a31fbab4f5fabb79572a502635fd29776ac","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d32ccd5d5799b712a7b3b7ca3ec1cda20495ac98010c630207e22e40085e518","start":70.04,"end":72.3,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6463ac642ef797f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a58f2ad19f5582490f367b66178d740818bd7608e104b3c1a38301795c86682b","timelineVersion":"sha256:64886a45e2ea03ef808c311a1be66c0254da3c3a9ea3feaf51dfee608e99afe8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:question","text":"ホテルの受付で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はどこでパソコンを使いますか。","textVersion":"sha256:bb4eade9fdc95b0e76a0a130d2df34db50b3a4f255b12f9cfdccdc479010bd02","audioVersion":"sha256:a58f2ad19f5582490f367b66178d740818bd7608e104b3c1a38301795c86682b","timelineVersion":"sha256:64886a45e2ea03ef808c311a1be66c0254da3c3a9ea3feaf51dfee608e99afe8","start":3.66,"end":13.93,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-0","text":"すみません、パソコンの貸出ってできますか。部屋で仕事をしたいんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:28a6121fbf19d39d4c19049daf78df858d3f4fffc627e98d5e90cb06db5598a9","audioVersion":"sha256:a58f2ad19f5582490f367b66178d740818bd7608e104b3c1a38301795c86682b","timelineVersion":"sha256:64886a45e2ea03ef808c311a1be66c0254da3c3a9ea3feaf51dfee608e99afe8","start":16.04,"end":21.61,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-1","text":"申し訳ございません。貸出はしていないんですが、二階にビジネスセンターがございます。午前9時から午後10時まで、コピーやファックスもお使いいただけますが、申し訳ございません、あと10分ほどしかございませんね。","textVersion":"sha256:7d180d8a27922de7e300ca0f1f3bd9f1097688b8459cdc2aa68f05de67a52dfe","audioVersion":"sha256:a58f2ad19f5582490f367b66178d740818bd7608e104b3c1a38301795c86682b","timelineVersion":"sha256:64886a45e2ea03ef808c311a1be66c0254da3c3a9ea3feaf51dfee608e99afe8","start":22.39,"end":36.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-2","text":"そうですね。あのう、この近くでパソコン使えるところないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:a34488fbd6ebdb92caf06144f55e2d37d81a6229e9c3847f0d2c030af9990f70","audioVersion":"sha256:a58f2ad19f5582490f367b66178d740818bd7608e104b3c1a38301795c86682b","timelineVersion":"sha256:64886a45e2ea03ef808c311a1be66c0254da3c3a9ea3feaf51dfee608e99afe8","start":36.58,"end":42.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-3","text":"でしたら、こちらから3分ほど歩いたところにインターネットカフェがございます。あっ、でもお客様、ロビーにも一台でしたら、パソコンがございます。文章をなおすぐらいなら、お使いになれますよ。あっ、でも今お使いのかたがいらっしゃいますね。お待ちになりますか。","textVersion":"sha256:615a3fdd32c1ca354a4f4bd22b858e8d69d1396c28bfd480975453dbde293512","audioVersion":"sha256:a58f2ad19f5582490f367b66178d740818bd7608e104b3c1a38301795c86682b","timelineVersion":"sha256:64886a45e2ea03ef808c311a1be66c0254da3c3a9ea3feaf51dfee608e99afe8","start":42.86,"end":60.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-4","text":"いいです。ちょっと歩きたいし、いってきます。どうもありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:77b6a0acd6f9b2e586a0ab4e3cb232e3f397191552e47e391fc6d1f41bd36dd4","audioVersion":"sha256:a58f2ad19f5582490f367b66178d740818bd7608e104b3c1a38301795c86682b","timelineVersion":"sha256:64886a45e2ea03ef808c311a1be66c0254da3c3a9ea3feaf51dfee608e99afe8","start":60.8,"end":65.29,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6463ac642ef797f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:question","text":"図書館で職員がボランティアの人たちに話しています。ボランティアの人はこれから何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4873f1c16bf9e729d1e18e3d24aacb22784364003bb5620b321170e945a93c76","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","start":4.86,"end":14.16,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-0","text":"本の整理のお手伝いありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:674bbf871bc83f053db1d54e4da578dc4e9a940a2e4fe700f793bab6ed275aaa","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","start":15.92,"end":18.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-1","text":"こちらの箱に図書館に新しく入った本がいれてありますので、本に貼ってあるラベルの番号をみて、同じ番号の棚に入れる作業を皆さんにお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:fce24f82171c9a366771c2e324bbf54868adf11e5ae5c41f702af969be144f02","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","start":19.34,"end":30.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-2","text":"ラベルの番号は本の分野などを表しています。","textVersion":"sha256:e6661ec49db721b9bb8c86138aa91552c44582e264a8a667ad0f8b515b36b9fc","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","start":30.74,"end":34.29,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-3","text":"さきほどお配りした紙に番号の見方が書いてありますので参考にしてください。","textVersion":"sha256:3090e7205ccf046a859c36c5e4b527a2524a39d18f82625840d3c358fbaa981f","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","start":34.66,"end":40.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-4","text":"それで、実はまだデータ入力が済んでいない本がありまして、いまパソコンで作業中です。","textVersion":"sha256:f767cd55ac89732baa85337cc32d4371087c380385983b06a745b84ea9516d00","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","start":40.58,"end":47.49,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-5","text":"終わった分からまた箱に追加していきます。","textVersion":"sha256:f58fdb25ad1b156c07d6e3fea0076653a5695fa17c306f75bca5cbb0aa980957","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","start":47.9,"end":50.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-6","text":"よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:f45d7ffa6c147b3598ad14b10a7e34ad20a6bdfb0139c448e065cc8112c13fd1","audioVersion":"sha256:b1711f16db9291ee2cc04a471bf1768e990f862180a65a7fb9355a46bc1bce1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:670e7d6af8c6f55660844bd7e0bb186f53d3a34f82ca03558ca43eaf0c8177c9","start":51.2,"end":52.74,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6463ac642ef797f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","examKey":"2021-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:question","text":"大学でダンスサークルの男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生は今日何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:59541fd1b8c5bec58c08e0cfe26e335c290da70e32a452b2aed7266e118eb000","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":2.36,"end":12.4,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:line-0","text":"おはようございます。","textVersion":"sha256:bc4e77e6407e004b7c8b2f83de56da665396ef3fa2d64a5a518fd7a82fdcab61","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":15.6,"end":16.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:line-1","text":"おはよう。ちょうどよかった。頼みたいことがあるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:35197b1e1c689f3e380236a95af8b52c2431f87993a2ad82ab789ef7ac0077d1","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":17.06,"end":21.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:line-2","text":"あ、そのポスター、来週のサークルの紹介でやるダンスのお知らせですね。新入生勧誘のための。掲示板に貼るんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:1f00432faebfd828eddb537229799272128ba5b54cbdc5e17dcce6b6d14dfc27","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":21.99,"end":30.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:line-3","text":"うん。その前に学生課で掲示の許可をもらわないといけないから。今から行くんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:77785bfb53d542cfe51520065e46cd2042833dacd338409104ac67856186c3e4","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":30.38,"end":36.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:line-4","text":"そうなんですか。後で貼るのを手伝いましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:2f5c4354347414ffef6c241ced151240a00fa212a52574d89e6b49d6f4efdd0f","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":36.93,"end":40.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:line-5","text":"これは一人で大丈夫。別にチラシも作ってあるんだけど、それを今日、大学の中で配る予定なんだ。その時何人か必要だから、手伝ってくれる。","textVersion":"sha256:962410c480f49f4df82f0308ad2f2ce8c66c1c91b18494ad4d752c5b7f068633","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":40.4,"end":51.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:line-6","text":"はい、分かりました。僕たちのダンスを見て、新入生がたくさん入ってくれるといいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:592c947426288a07ae090960a8a6f079271eefff4a10bb3940c889948399abc2","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":51.84,"end":58.05,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:1:line-7","text":"そうだね。","textVersion":"sha256:c85cdfda9a14283043e2de3b9a1404b82d3dd712711392e18ee40f6b395adb04","audioVersion":"sha256:e804f51b5a59d6167eba5f73814101f498b1d4e05a6ad4a60d34c75413951e09","timelineVersion":"sha256:66e421e0c986a76540375f26e92a754c15292a97f6fccc576798edd08efb89a9","start":58.19,"end":59.08,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"85efe1ec0897539e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","examKey":"2021-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2:question","text":"駅の窓口で女の人が電車の切符を買おうとしています。女の人はどの切符を買いますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8b2cd73d2c556740080e0e5035252b8854ea5b43558e4729aa334139a4834354","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","start":2.37,"end":11.46,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2:line-0","text":"あの、明日西川まで行きたいんですけど、あちらに三時半までには着きたいんですね。で、あの、どの電車がいいのかなあと思って。あの、新幹線でも。","textVersion":"sha256:c63eff15394d55ef37f8dd33723904c5636cb9719e9452f8021e9f5d8ca9abc3","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","start":15.32,"end":32.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2:line-1","text":"えっと、新幹線ですと、西川に行く場合、北川で普通列車に乗り換えていただくことになりますね。でなければ特急を利用するかですね。特急ですと、ここから西川まで一本ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:c194402c60a2a6e7a7ef52c922a883e064f64eae24363225c4802e7fe775163b","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","start":33.29,"end":48.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2:line-2","text":"そうですか。あの、私、乗り換えは間違えないかといつも心配で。","textVersion":"sha256:6caced64e46290466c33c8035c3ba8bbd93349cb35dec668875f73257f6827b1","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","start":49.37,"end":58.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2:line-3","text":"じゃあ、乗り換えはなしで。そうしますと、えっと、１５時半に西川駅着となりますと、んー、あ、１３時４０分の特急ですね。指定席ですが、ああ、もう禁煙車はいっぱいですね。喫煙車でもいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:88c07636692477e1184cce8c885c5ae324c173da9f68edb8e459766039e82989","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","start":58.08,"end":81.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2:line-4","text":"いや、タバコは困ります、私。","textVersion":"sha256:822ead5aecf18c8ec800aed14cb1c737d0306ff7db3a9ddb2b8a171c1b884d20","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","start":81.66,"end":84.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2:line-5","text":"わかりました。じゃあ、自由席になりますね。すいませんが、申し込み用紙に記入して窓口までお持ちください。","textVersion":"sha256:0e112f76eb8673a85516a9ac8475809f2c5adec625ea0e1c0a6de085f52ddd04","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","start":85.46,"end":93.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:2:line-6","text":"はい、じゃあ、そうします。","textVersion":"sha256:87cfd22e0141da1e7d3436e03daabb93985223cd28bb51f32ed6a7d6bf7110ab","audioVersion":"sha256:ba2742c0575d97b242f0336d704f0eec8c22607b8c5eb4264898273f803624e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:f82320019128bd5eeccb6c70de52af5b0cfc6c1883f07765949655fb8d476979","start":93.32,"end":96.52,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"85efe1ec0897539e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","examKey":"2021-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこのあとまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f36818c10c45bcdf8e32d8c93bdcbf5a933a3167d033d8c5ebce87df8f5b24c3","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":2.27,"end":10.27,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-0","text":"田中さんが今月いっぱいで退職ですから、みんなで何かプレゼントしようと思ってるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:eb2d487c38cba697a3ed2b9ebd01bb6b31c5788fb22c9c8c87f432538c643e16","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":12.17,"end":17.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-1","text":"ああ、いいですね。何がいいかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:22397361bcc605ddc20a84c50af6c16875d537a4bf32cd9a261cb3d34169a5c7","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":17.71,"end":21.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-2","text":"何かリクエストがあるか聞いてみようと思ってるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:3e963c1a5ef9c807f01a868b87918619af8634b47e866f50753299b12eb0b097","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":22.13,"end":25.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-3","text":"田中さんって、何かほしいものないって直接聞いても、いいですって言いそうですし。","textVersion":"sha256:2f2de3186aa03020fbd0a35fd1d80ace2b1c68d1bf4c28b344e31edd526d6502","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":25.6,"end":32.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-4","text":"あ、そうそう。この前、鍋のいいのがほしいとか言ってなかったっけ。料理教室に通い始めたからって。","textVersion":"sha256:f95eebad20bd5683bf93b0fe8e2a94e1d464100ab8070a6accdc8b583a2af9d3","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":32.04,"end":40.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-5","text":"そうでしたね。","textVersion":"sha256:82b18c52bbcdb9cc44245a42eec0ed106aa3f55c405d90542952512554a3324c","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":40.92,"end":42.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-6","text":"ああ、でも、もう買っちゃったってこともあるから、それとなく本人に探ってみてよ。それでまだだったら、鍋にしようよ。","textVersion":"sha256:105f313fc165cb2c87d0e4bb2c6fa58043e3212f32fd447ce71fcac25be96942","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":42.41,"end":50.77,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-7","text":"そうですね。今日のランチの時にでも。","textVersion":"sha256:1adaf95bf10fad7097742041213d6ee79ea5e3ba08eeb07db14f0b8b9951f1c9","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":50.87,"end":53.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-8","text":"うん、頼んだよ。プレゼント代はその後でみんなから集めて、もしお金が余ったら、それで当日花を買おう。","textVersion":"sha256:3f7ed4c929ef3ecf131a369c05c94bd5c844be54b27c07df8df8bc6b3c904ae1","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":53.8,"end":62.29,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:3:line-9","text":"はい。花の注文も私の方でします。","textVersion":"sha256:f1c36ad53739857ec36d0b400de012152b38b881866a8983819c6637efd8c0c9","audioVersion":"sha256:7030825422d8a53f57eb996ca5ef4ce7ce2db929a458c6c58a0980112a680f10","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9b69c06d0da4c2d168a1238ce8c3d458fcf09cd7bb0609b0933d81a9b93ac7c","start":62.57,"end":65.79,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"85efe1ec0897539e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","examKey":"2021-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:question","text":"女の人が新しい商品の紹介をしています。よく頭が痛くなる人は、どの商品を選びますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7b0d4fc6233da9c07a2622ceecbf619f6b722599a65c2f690623355b680a0c73","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":2.61,"end":11.99,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:line-0","text":"こちら、新発売の中国茶をご案内します。","textVersion":"sha256:a3cba2908bca006b7986db135cd53ed37b351a5a315315ab8e1353476b60f242","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":15.6,"end":19.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:line-1","text":"今回皆様にご紹介いたしますのは、月・星・虹・空のお茶の4種類でございます。","textVersion":"sha256:b2d44b32328ec9c0b370d9cf629a041fe539729fad43bb6850da65f492fa3c16","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":20.02,"end":28.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:line-2","text":"さあ、どうぞ召し上がってください。","textVersion":"sha256:f809c26ca48f7f90d248591a00e29ebbcd25bb8d2f932357eea83b1b8f6bf50a","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":28.26,"end":31.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:line-3","text":"えー、月のお茶は体を温めてくれます。","textVersion":"sha256:eb7f3e05fc6c3bd66c41124f02151466dccb15a37a75c5a827fdc20d0c30cb54","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":31.42,"end":35.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:line-4","text":"体が冷えやすい方に向いています。","textVersion":"sha256:901bf66545eb99518462c426e3e380f8053a5419c7f8010403ef8a5074072c97","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":35.9,"end":38.55,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:line-5","text":"星のお茶はパソコン等の見すぎで目が疲れている方。","textVersion":"sha256:50b100839cf966a1e8052c22edd2400390d2cd0b77cde5f49f121b75f6719f67","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":38.98,"end":43.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:line-6","text":"虹のお茶は頭痛でお悩みの方に最適です。","textVersion":"sha256:133078462d7ea42c1dbf95756481898b6922167b67e83300c9360d3457c7f0ec","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":44.1,"end":48.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:4:line-7","text":"なかなか眠れない方には空のお茶がお勧めです。","textVersion":"sha256:4d7a9a504cf831a57158fde687548f68ba8444566001e560563b91d7a8a33ee1","audioVersion":"sha256:260bd0d9ad705aeb17b6357c98fbe5c08d0bdd2e04da6dd9ddeeee25cb170791","timelineVersion":"sha256:fb76b42c653df9c58af60785bbcc43a82d033e92d9b0677ecb37f7ff14a844d5","start":48.52,"end":52.61,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"85efe1ec0897539e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","examKey":"2021-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:question","text":"大学の事務室で男の学生と職員が話しています。男の学生はこの後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f68d3789a8d2e48e8ef319471c850c2c69e69489c342ce73350ab63ad716d310","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":2.45,"end":12.85,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-0","text":"すみません、学生証をなくしたんですが、再発行をお願いできますか。","textVersion":"sha256:94f41d1693fa11ebb335af6c7f9ff5610fa191ec3fadb666614f80a2d9da936f","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":14.69,"end":19.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-1","text":"再発行には手数料が1000円かかります。あと、写真が一枚必要です。えー、それから、再発行するとこれまでのものはもし見つかっても使えませんので。","textVersion":"sha256:d25e9964ccecfac4daffbb1e50789daa040425a93d5831a0c4278ec861ccc3c9","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":20.07,"end":32.61,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-2","text":"はい。手数料、今払います。写真も持ってきました。","textVersion":"sha256:0195dfb2b7eb4d29e835bd133e94b91dd602484b066f662cda9937d60902d250","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":32.84,"end":36.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-3","text":"じゃ、先に写真、いただきます。それから、こちらの再発行の申込書を書いてもらえますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b72842b8c61949d2da55f0b04fe6fef679394952e05a2bcfd65d91498ffc70bb","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":37.04,"end":44.57,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":44.66,"end":45.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-5","text":"あ、住所や電話番号は変わってませんか。変更がある場合は先にその変更届を出してもらわなくちゃいけないんで。","textVersion":"sha256:81d3e6710ad03e9a98d55b42966fdff7a87b1c2ec1aa4eebde69f881979cde65","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":46.62,"end":54.59,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-6","text":"入学した時から変わってません。","textVersion":"sha256:f1e26715c694c3539aeca79b8417213f3b47de677301156fa151a231d3a08de5","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":54.88,"end":56.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-7","text":"分かりました。ええ、手数料はここではなく、会計課で払ってもらいます。申込書の記入が済んだらコピーをお渡しするので、それを会計課に持っていって手数料を払ってください。","textVersion":"sha256:974fbef2891ca9f8b02a15dbcfbcdf8da22aa611672ec78954977620a3c98dc5","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":57.04,"end":70.76,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-8","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":70.9,"end":71.33,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-07:5:line-9","text":"明日以降、こちらで領収書と引き換えに新しい学生証をお渡しします。","textVersion":"sha256:971c03a1b767758a6d16ce3fdfdc4dc8261d8e73af56516ee7d94ad05282239c","audioVersion":"sha256:76b403c9d14bffc0601ef387746360d8aee6b2f3b3b098e67d052abcc7af594e","timelineVersion":"sha256:281bfbde7f12711b3a394333977f113e59fc26c58ac1be35058be9322680e5e1","start":71.89,"end":77.17,"speaker":"職員"}],"batchVersion":"85efe1ec0897539e"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","examKey":"2021-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:question","text":"音楽教室の事務室で女の社員と男の社員が話しています。男の社員はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d6d8daa300a450bfd98e5464c07129c30da4febfaa9d1800f8438a166cd213fa","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":4.05,"end":15.66,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-0","text":"あの、ちょっと頼みたいことがあるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:cb58b0dbea3cebcccd17c3d6ee2f54dc2281098b5fd5b48ab41a7e55f2ec6e67","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":17.71,"end":20.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-1","text":"何でしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:9acfc5f37b0ce281577b3e521bb18c2c15dc98b047c2b8425c3533f496b84b40","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":20.65,"end":21.31,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-2","text":"初級ギターのグループレッスンを受講している山田さんから電話があって、次のレッスンから曜日を日曜から土曜日のクラスに変更したいって。土曜も初級クラスは同じ木村先生が担当なんだけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:4d981341741f40d888fe27d1223a69523f4ce2c0e3abb7d5bf5535cb4b9a5802","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":21.77,"end":35.83,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-3","text":"じゃ、まず希望するクラスが空いているか確認しましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:2c49b903de46324123fee25e2dc6ce036632ec92fdf3b85d5d08729fc0d154c3","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":36.2,"end":39.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-4","text":"あ、それは大丈夫だった。ただ、テキストと先生が同じでも、クラスによって、進む速さが違う場合もあるでしょう。山田さんに次何をやるのかって聞かれて。","textVersion":"sha256:4348ce404a12db11a3fc9c84a29f2e859c185a4e05696b4c96befc6195dfebf0","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":40.04,"end":51.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":51.61,"end":51.87,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-6","text":"それで、先生に電話して確かめてもらえないかな。で、それを山田さんに伝えてくれる？今日、私早退するので。","textVersion":"sha256:8e828a774057afb1082962c371b6994e697832763d6ead03b30b41c02476e644","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":52.23,"end":60.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":60.62,"end":61.23,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-8","text":"山田さんへの連絡が済んだら、受講生の名簿の修正もしといてもらえると助かるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:909f8446d76a7cfbe31f576ca90ca3df746256372ab2150c2df10833dee245c7","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":61.75,"end":67.19,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:1:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c1566f10c2d4eee403dca45a13fcaa379fb9c096117b1e6bb47f04f6868ced50","timelineVersion":"sha256:d57b7740d940976f1cbe676d11c45feebb4e4ad6dc344eeb79d11879f12abd67","start":67.45,"end":67.7,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"2f227d0b55ec4948"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","examKey":"2021-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2:question","text":"公園で職員が花壇を作るボランティアの人に話しています。ボランティアの人はまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d007be1c594d0b9283ff8d93e0d8b836c3733f67a57eda5ccffedde68a4247c9","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","start":2.4,"end":11.72,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2:line-0","text":"午後のボランティアの皆さん、よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:7d02afc2a7f9b0bcec516e9f243d7f1ccfd0b49a7b49b1afda7d302ddace8891","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","start":15.82,"end":18.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2:line-1","text":"午前の方には雑草を抜いて、花壇の整備をしていただきました。","textVersion":"sha256:7a462967bc9a76b50b6fdcf2f8789255f288634ae5c669c5909e7c6b20097ee8","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","start":19.36,"end":24.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2:line-2","text":"午後は花の苗を植えていただきます。","textVersion":"sha256:89dc220881c0b024960c5660ca5a2efe493eef17032d1a39991f9355d48b273a","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","start":24.56,"end":27.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2:line-3","text":"苗と苗は間隔をあけて植えていくので、今からこちらの職員が植える場所の目印を付けていきます。","textVersion":"sha256:09d2a65d9cfadca48b3698b8fb5f2ec7a8600bbacf914a6d0076e025de308642","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","start":28.12,"end":35.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2:line-4","text":"その間に、皆さんには私と一緒にそちらの倉庫から花の苗を運んでいただきます。","textVersion":"sha256:5eba945e7c7c74f30f893fa7e2dcc2309bb41dc006da39c9e3d72a6a9638ac3c","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","start":35.82,"end":42.45,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2:line-5","text":"とりあえず、花壇の前に置いていってください。","textVersion":"sha256:9e43b14fbee5b50c120cbde23869fe5f8d5518af279004a8682ee93853c7429c","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","start":43,"end":46.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:2:line-6","text":"その後、職員が付けた目印に合わせて苗を並べていきます。","textVersion":"sha256:4d86bed534bdda6e9b1461a60d8aeb8a2cf9b644f0e666fa60408c081dddbea5","audioVersion":"sha256:5cf8ca0ac3113d72de1b39139b2995440ac51aca7ac926975e1f7edb8baf15ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb6388041e96075bb045ed09e7004fffe7b9df4cc8218f84396bd91505edad1","start":46.9,"end":51.5,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"2f227d0b55ec4948"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","examKey":"2021-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:question","text":"女の留学生と男の留学生が話しています。女の留学生はいらなくなったものをどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f5855350680964e01c7650349a208fc1de0d1cff1ac901495d1c437609fc3d5b","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":2.44,"end":11.13,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-0","text":"いよいよ卒業だね。国に帰るんで、家具とか電気製品いらなくなるんだけど、どうしたらいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:f8a1d0f0c6dd785b098bf6d3f1960aab2c612ae31c40eecc370406ccebb7e568","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":13.29,"end":20.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-1","text":"僕の場合は、アルバイト先の友達に譲るんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:ae9129bbcb3e50953b85eaa3d8e1964ed31b69e72d3d4064bf594fd2b8b85eb3","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":21.34,"end":24.33,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-2","text":"それはいいね。私のもまだ十分使えるから、捨てるのももったいなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:15f356bdccd7f1b3557e654bd224e0a292f901f1cdf97bf1a67fa93af2221bde","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":24.84,"end":30.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-3","text":"この間、大学の掲示板で見たんだけど、先輩の家具を引き取って新入生にあげる活動をしているボランティア団体があるんだって。連絡すれば、取りに来てくれるから、そこに寄付すれば。","textVersion":"sha256:bdb46d285269d0d1a82577ebd536373028e87de7dd16d1c650dde81133132517","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":30.85,"end":41.91,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-4","text":"へえ、いいね。","textVersion":"sha256:7681cf7db51fe81f3b3e7a7fa953f15e322000956c26eee8e2dbbfed4c4f02ea","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":42.45,"end":44.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-5","text":"それか、リサイクルショップに売るっていうのもいいよね。あー、だけど、電気製品の古いのは買い取ってくれないかも。","textVersion":"sha256:a15f0139ce9ad8242cc0de05457e54595824b9626891250ead48e272cc981dc8","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":44.55,"end":52.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-6","text":"そうなんだ。あっ、インターネットでの販売はどう？写真載せて、買いたい人と直接やり取りするやつ。お店まで持って行く必要がないから、楽でいいかなあって思ったんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:f8befa07754dfd9fea8d4b7a49f2698c113b41ec4eb39cbfe72dbfce2c39753b","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":52.66,"end":66.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-7","text":"あ、それは避けたほうがいいと思うよ。受け渡しとか、お金のこととか、トラブルもあるって聞くし。","textVersion":"sha256:667edc9ca256dfc89a68d72cc925ead1e953ea548b2370c5984927db2913f80a","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":66.45,"end":72.71,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-8","text":"そうか。","textVersion":"sha256:59b55ebd3d334fefa3d9ad52455e119aaaf439dcd50edb85f7050b2666bef1f9","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":73.2,"end":73.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-9","text":"やっぱり、新入生に喜んでもらうのがいいんじゃない。手間かかんないし。","textVersion":"sha256:0a5154cd71292f4e6c4620d54226666b3bfe23d25153b40341b8fe50ec7777cf","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":74.34,"end":78.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:3:line-10","text":"うん、じゃ、そうしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:46aca319ba6eb4b934397a9895289817eed6b2758d19a698d224bc29e49ee2e3","audioVersion":"sha256:f10d8843b5abd82689b5d51f6f982b2b9639a965dab5e4948dee04623b41eacc","timelineVersion":"sha256:fdb107623431fc2ef25835c7eb698f87661b3b0bd384d1c5e01acb5b4db2a24f","start":78.95,"end":80.7,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"2f227d0b55ec4948"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","examKey":"2021-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:question","text":"大学で、学生と先生がスピーチの原稿について話しています。学生はまず原稿のどこを直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:23898aae745312ae007f499367454eab67be6c56b949cb207fff1068ed78b932","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":2.45,"end":12.69,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-0","text":"先生、昨日スピーチの原稿を送らせていただいたんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:e9425c50dbe8302e61fb89fb35981ba7f2c1cb2ea0cd6d7eb3d464c86ce6105f","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":14.77,"end":19.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-1","text":"あー、はい、見ましたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:8b2a18c73e46eeba69e6284b9b3760b46fb62c3de4316d6eed8afbaa94414169","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":19.78,"end":21.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-2","text":"いかがでしょうか。全体の構成があまりよくないんじゃないかと思うんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:e8112a47d69290d4174a8ea6b8308bd663647d4238cad6670593f00b1aa721bd","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":22.22,"end":27.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-3","text":"うん、構成は悪くないと思いますよ。わかりやすく書けていますし。え、ただ、導入の部分、詳しく書いてあっていいんですが、全体の長さを考えると、もう少し簡潔にしたほうがいいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:d4da9323466ecd5677dc2e2a4d3968482e05390b58e14165c1148b5f8b139d9e","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":27.82,"end":42.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-4","text":"あ、長いですか。真ん中の私の経験を書いた部分ももう少し短くしたほうがいいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:4f3d2e5babbb02b98e4a33cf058d1854303bb147f4afafe0ac7091d9718e981c","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":42.96,"end":51.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-5","text":"うん、具体的な経験が書いてある部分は大事なところなので、このままでいいと思いますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f4fa956f81383c973b3fe8c531f2046eb518a98f813990fc70b21a6e4a9cad6e","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":51.76,"end":58.27,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-6","text":"そうですか。最後のまとめの部分はどうでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:f9ae1ef2e4abcb9b3b8df90dce534a01b2317f63ab16fa02069fcdffe2f29407","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":58.8,"end":63.01,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-7","text":"自分の意見をまとめてあって、よく書けていますよ。ここはもう少し長くてもいいような気がしますが、全体がこれ以上長くなると良くないので、とりあえず、このままにしましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:e2e2c1f753d06ce1b5029d6ce70cea1caddc161d08d41dbf9b5eaa5fca93fa4a","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":63.76,"end":75.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:4:line-8","text":"はい、わかりました。じゃ、すぐ直します。ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:c5507176db7bc13700d44133d5ef09a018ef296e4b2d5f4e6969a3d7eca5b850","audioVersion":"sha256:464c9b6f061adcdb01c14507eb998c29afb8dc3cd34ebe6db0ee354142b9b0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1a8260593e9ed34d65eaf56385a4df28683650dd5ba72f532b8c328cb306135","start":75.6,"end":80.44,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"2f227d0b55ec4948"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","examKey":"2021-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2021.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2021.html","exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2021-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:question","text":"男の人と女の人がコンピューターを見ながら飛行機の席を選んでいます。男の人はどの席を選ぶことにしますか。男の人です。","textVersion":"sha256:8040d2a1dee862b7b0c2461903c451516a3a349d8dd70b64160f148d6323ad6f","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":2.38,"end":14.96,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-0","text":"この白いのが空いている席ってことですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:66be9d238f8232963ea9d2195aae10a0d40848e169701345d4e18aeb7a56cb4c","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":17.03,"end":20.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-1","text":"あー、そうだね。窓側がゆっくりできるからいいんだけど、並んで座れるところあるかな。できれば打ち合わせもしたいし。","textVersion":"sha256:4315a5397094f98d482580cce1ecc288e26a61a091ac6f122364ca97925fe4b7","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":21.01,"end":30.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-2","text":"そうですね。一つが窓側で、しかも並べるところですと、一番後ろになりますね。","textVersion":"sha256:02d3ad291f0c357afa83b95b390d27934204d3719ff48405f571d3327592c4fb","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":30.62,"end":39.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-3","text":"でも、一番後ろって、座席が倒せないから、苦しいんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:06ccf847a68ffecddaa73c21fb1c5023590571cf6a9b8ccc66cd284098b2091f","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":39.66,"end":45.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-4","text":"あー、そうなんですか。じゃ、あと、並んで座れるのはこの通路側のところですね。","textVersion":"sha256:1369db9637d1aa8099296b5589c8c9b0f71f2daf32be0e5a183d4a7bab932a30","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":45.69,"end":54.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-5","text":"うん、仕方ないか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6563c995909f84379807b4ea3ff3d1da7a3fe1886b4cdf6102e6108537238b9","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":54.83,"end":57.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-6","text":"窓側だと、ここに一つ空いてますね。","textVersion":"sha256:c9019364e7e7986308c1a139bb3e5b7602acc3bbabe3a3df8894d10a713daf04","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":57.66,"end":61.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-7","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":61.67,"end":62.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-8","text":"私はその斜め前の席にしますよ。もしかしたら、私の隣の人が課長の席と変わってくれるかもしれないですから。","textVersion":"sha256:c3040e31a12b360bcce0d3b8217a740452418003ae91657c8edc9641063f8843","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":62.96,"end":71.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2021-12:5:line-9","text":"そうだね。そうしたら並べるか。じゃ、そうしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:dc304ddc1e1325054a2d360d552fd7d61203c904f7035a3f7f47776ee2f9dab8","audioVersion":"sha256:0a3ee0b43e5d9b7835b2b287c2b2356a999f5fb506f37cf6a5e047c3cc91aa9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:4e713c1f8c01c9034f0ab7f188c19be1dd6d57d7f9c6398c5c4aa21602919f37","start":72.06,"end":76.43,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"2f227d0b55ec4948"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1","examKey":"2022-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:602ddbe0f48dceaaea2aa1b7e77db4f660fc91a941edb0f160d80b90cc7aee61","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7eaa39a87aa9e696a78a29a9a621ede2675d4e71bd4d2fb34d57a5cc174eeff","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1:question","text":"日本語の授業で先生が学生に話しています。学生は今日の授業で何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:126ebfc44872cb8a06f8d2ab9d87dba02066d95ebde416aa2703389356714a12","audioVersion":"sha256:602ddbe0f48dceaaea2aa1b7e77db4f660fc91a941edb0f160d80b90cc7aee61","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7eaa39a87aa9e696a78a29a9a621ede2675d4e71bd4d2fb34d57a5cc174eeff","start":0.8,"end":11.31,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1:line-0","text":"この授業では、学期末にまとめとしてレポートを書いてもらいますが、先週はそのテーマを『私たちの町』に決めましたね。","textVersion":"sha256:655b037c1336697522385f3a11a9b24505e5bd8c68e8319bbce4c16f5dad5a19","audioVersion":"sha256:602ddbe0f48dceaaea2aa1b7e77db4f660fc91a941edb0f160d80b90cc7aee61","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7eaa39a87aa9e696a78a29a9a621ede2675d4e71bd4d2fb34d57a5cc174eeff","start":12.84,"end":22.66,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1:line-1","text":"次回の授業では、この町に長く住んでいる商店街の方から昔と今とどう変わったかなどいろいろ話を聞いて、その内容についてクラスで話し合います。","textVersion":"sha256:d0df09f98cc41ef6503260e9e7de099f3f1955a70726a6ea8e2d610196b244ad","audioVersion":"sha256:602ddbe0f48dceaaea2aa1b7e77db4f660fc91a941edb0f160d80b90cc7aee61","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7eaa39a87aa9e696a78a29a9a621ede2675d4e71bd4d2fb34d57a5cc174eeff","start":23.22,"end":35.96,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1:line-2","text":"そのために、今回の授業は町の歴史などを各自図書館に行って、詳しく調べてみましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:e38ae53f29dec516e72bb89455d3d00f287b01f880fbfd6857886bccc43b109c","audioVersion":"sha256:602ddbe0f48dceaaea2aa1b7e77db4f660fc91a941edb0f160d80b90cc7aee61","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7eaa39a87aa9e696a78a29a9a621ede2675d4e71bd4d2fb34d57a5cc174eeff","start":36.62,"end":43.93,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:1:line-3","text":"しっかりやりましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:f1110bd2aefe40a869d3624f8d2e3ad7899b36e2600501c4b062e2481b358165","audioVersion":"sha256:602ddbe0f48dceaaea2aa1b7e77db4f660fc91a941edb0f160d80b90cc7aee61","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7eaa39a87aa9e696a78a29a9a621ede2675d4e71bd4d2fb34d57a5cc174eeff","start":44.34,"end":45.81,"speaker":"先生"}],"batchVersion":"a61e5049983d5ee1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2","examKey":"2022-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6cd065397b2667b4acbc1682b92a8792b5b599fbfc978cffdb8857c2a1e5dc9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:5814b95a1fd1e392ca49dcf54798d0570a3ec100a15799883fb9039b7f6d0b6d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2:question","text":"会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこれからまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:b22bf75c9008c27f98b7b7056f504bf8b0e3d5309d9d4a078036f3f294fc30dd","audioVersion":"sha256:6cd065397b2667b4acbc1682b92a8792b5b599fbfc978cffdb8857c2a1e5dc9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:5814b95a1fd1e392ca49dcf54798d0570a3ec100a15799883fb9039b7f6d0b6d","start":0.73,"end":10.89,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2:line-0","text":"山下さん、前回の会社説明会の参加者アンケートなんだけど、結果をまとめる作業は終わった？明日の会議で報告するんで、今日中に見ときたいんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:133422edc81a17d63b8d515dce28530240a5348e4e42d65ae305661788a70a3b","audioVersion":"sha256:6cd065397b2667b4acbc1682b92a8792b5b599fbfc978cffdb8857c2a1e5dc9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:5814b95a1fd1e392ca49dcf54798d0570a3ec100a15799883fb9039b7f6d0b6d","start":14.71,"end":26.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2:line-1","text":"え、今日中ですか。すみません。次回の説明会の申込みの対応と参加者への事前資料の発送の準備で忙しくて。","textVersion":"sha256:80241d14de348833e41398ff3f4529c972116cc30392dd242b7b231f1e2f42fd","audioVersion":"sha256:6cd065397b2667b4acbc1682b92a8792b5b599fbfc978cffdb8857c2a1e5dc9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:5814b95a1fd1e392ca49dcf54798d0570a3ec100a15799883fb9039b7f6d0b6d","start":27.08,"end":36.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2:line-2","text":"そう。うん。対応のほうは私がやるから、資料の発送のほうはまだ時間があるから、今日じゃなくても大丈夫でしょう。とりあえず、結果のほうに集中してくれるかな。あ、そうだ。参加者へのお礼のメールはもう送った？","textVersion":"sha256:09a7f4bef441ceb1181b4d890f377468b32734c25c8cf7054819e2fac3b88cbd","audioVersion":"sha256:6cd065397b2667b4acbc1682b92a8792b5b599fbfc978cffdb8857c2a1e5dc9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:5814b95a1fd1e392ca49dcf54798d0570a3ec100a15799883fb9039b7f6d0b6d","start":36.88,"end":54.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2:line-3","text":"あ、それはもう。","textVersion":"sha256:ac9306a37aca6fc978ad2fdb87c802f8b736b5aa37542ef91cd0f65450817530","audioVersion":"sha256:6cd065397b2667b4acbc1682b92a8792b5b599fbfc978cffdb8857c2a1e5dc9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:5814b95a1fd1e392ca49dcf54798d0570a3ec100a15799883fb9039b7f6d0b6d","start":55.12,"end":56.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2:line-4","text":"そう。じゃ、よろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:5c4b28fdbc73100d5b94fb63ddacb659fddeba7570a19eb3b9f3cd904d34c63f","audioVersion":"sha256:6cd065397b2667b4acbc1682b92a8792b5b599fbfc978cffdb8857c2a1e5dc9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:5814b95a1fd1e392ca49dcf54798d0570a3ec100a15799883fb9039b7f6d0b6d","start":56.42,"end":58.41,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:2:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6cd065397b2667b4acbc1682b92a8792b5b599fbfc978cffdb8857c2a1e5dc9a","timelineVersion":"sha256:5814b95a1fd1e392ca49dcf54798d0570a3ec100a15799883fb9039b7f6d0b6d","start":58.57,"end":58.93,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a61e5049983d5ee1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","examKey":"2022-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:question","text":"会社で女の人と課長が商品のポスターについて話しています。女の人はポスターをどう直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:75602a2113e9ba1ded59d8fc052232c633ade7dbb286599af3111f11f2be1cc7","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":0.63,"end":11.25,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-0","text":"課長、今度発売するパソコンの宣伝用ポスターを作成したので、一度見ていただけますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5c87f9f64338c7cf73b29d6622d27dc2defc9ad2022fc5952023918019aec417","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":15.07,"end":21.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-1","text":"はい。商品名の文字の色があんまり目立たないようだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:7e0005d878d73addac8d5d07776bba8579bf530a41734425ffda909d04cfb3da","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":23.57,"end":26.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-2","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":27.25,"end":28.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-3","text":"ああ。全体のバランスを見ると、統一感があるんだね。今回の商品は今までで最も薄型っていうのがアピールポイントだから、それをもっと前面に出した方がいいね。厚さの具体的な数字は大きく目立つように書いてあるけど、これだけでは厚さが分かりにくいね。","textVersion":"sha256:0b4fb2e63dacea119550b9479e97c580b05aef7b4a13f415e71088e72cd54c32","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":28.68,"end":48.57,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-4","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":48.85,"end":49.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-5","text":"今までのものと図で比較するとか、そういう感じのほうがいいんじゃないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:e63a28e4c73cb4850d2e9d8aa37a56446654bb132142d6a45dc7d6c9c4b5641a","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":50.05,"end":54.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-6","text":"はい、そうします。","textVersion":"sha256:692a17e3b6c3bb24b5cd02681593256cc51aee2aedd0849b6a889b446480d1b4","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":55.3,"end":56.85,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-7","text":"前のモデルからの性能の変更点はわかりやすくまとめてあるし、他に付け加えるものはないね。","textVersion":"sha256:4fae83135a817e2c1abd306635eb13214091c683ac2b1a07694fa14885ca67f2","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":57.08,"end":63.63,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-8","text":"あ、ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:d63b5ac29a10becda26463a8decfe9191543d601a219425ad426b7b7cb6c6462","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":63.89,"end":65.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-9","text":"それじゃ、その一点だけ直してみてよ。","textVersion":"sha256:5ff5ec2b8750e618aeccab59d662f894636dd439ad130f66cf4c611fdabac544","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":65.88,"end":68.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:3:line-10","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:ec37d987822c5f4bb489563d387e2a464eb778b3b474e614d9fd8de7931afe37","timelineVersion":"sha256:11e52e4e5dac242c9da0f7f0c554b76c164cdec61791e3c80a2080ee1cec3478","start":68.65,"end":69.48,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a61e5049983d5ee1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","examKey":"2022-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:question","text":"大学で女の学生と男の学生が話しています。女の学生はこれからまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:bbda464502b969ff2e0d95c3dfc9a78b671c6fa19acc17fdf0f9d2d629699337","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":0.82,"end":11.21,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-0","text":"先輩、卒論の発表、お疲れさまでした。私も卒論に向けてそろそろ準備をと考えてるんですけど、どうしたらいいかわからなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:4694522589159d05ed9fc910f58f8f306be2ded782b7b874aea20f66c28a0680","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":13.02,"end":23.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-1","text":"そう。加藤さん、今度三年生になるもんね。テーマとかは決まってるの？","textVersion":"sha256:e664de16c83dcb6b72897ce6cc4e43dfe1af15f9f0a55efdd4b3a2db9cb956a5","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":23.4,"end":29.07,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-2","text":"はい、先輩と同じように環境問題に興味があるので、環境を守る活動について書けたらって思ってはいるんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:0460e37f0f395c8c1d931183aa7e1fb19364842e538f634897d93763efc6e291","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":29.34,"end":37.61,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-3","text":"環境を守る活動と言っても色々あるよね。例えば、文学作品やアートを通じて環境問題を訴えたりすることもあるしね。文献とかはもういくつか読んでるの？","textVersion":"sha256:e267a88c984a95addfd85907d33f0e3cf098cb7602b44b98994cbb936ca5261f","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":37.89,"end":50.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-4","text":"まだ授業でテキストを一冊読んだぐらいで。","textVersion":"sha256:2c107e9eec79efd3947c5566700cb1eb500bac68d78a0234aa628ef4d821447b","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":50.53,"end":53.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-5","text":"そう、じゃ、まず活動についてまとめた文献を見てみて。それで、興味を感じるのがあったら、関連するイベントとかに参加してみて。","textVersion":"sha256:3e9e91c52ea039427115286cfa78f9f3cd89370669308ab072c0ad8f023ed233","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":54.95,"end":63.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":64.22,"end":64.71,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-7","text":"イベントとかに参加したら、具体的な問題点も見えてくると思うよ。そしたら、それに関係のある研究をしている友達も紹介できるかもしれない。","textVersion":"sha256:6d26a34862ac96abbd81f1a832e9f5c83070e02213eef78991cb932a21326b15","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":65.16,"end":75.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-8","text":"そうですか。その時はまた相談させてください。","textVersion":"sha256:2e21afe8e61970819bf03fc85d14d1988cf4401e91ea15c147746de649ebc2c8","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":75.54,"end":79.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-9","text":"うん。何があるか、知ることからだね。","textVersion":"sha256:31760a84759ffc88a00ffb81495f32c910851f851cc69521e326b572b7cc9044","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":79.49,"end":82.59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:4:line-10","text":"わかりました。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:8eed0508d699cfc2d490d4b2a4476553438dfd17dca1b6ebf5135bcc6e20cb4a","audioVersion":"sha256:6a49a0d0aca9572858a7228b2c17d6090f074012fc28ccec2fcc153e9ed55302","timelineVersion":"sha256:f6d4e7ba6c1a96dcd7b57f8c166368240cc52717fcb749da28e7cfc0e499e861","start":82.99,"end":85.55,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a61e5049983d5ee1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","examKey":"2022-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5:question","text":"大学で職員が話しています。ボランティアの参加者はこの後、まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0a4c7af5467131a7126b48b728128990e0648a8e4e09400b6234af03c4f5e066","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","start":0.9,"end":10.06,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5:line-0","text":"学生へ食品を配るボランティア活動へのご参加、ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:683cef326e883e14af0057b53b86bcf82ca1be85d28a82b2da08d7d6fb6e6c97","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","start":11.64,"end":16.5,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5:line-1","text":"こちらの教室で準備をし、配ります。","textVersion":"sha256:4e6b7107ea9101dec1def4fe8ea6df4c405a860199d0ece40420061e28deb185","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","start":17.18,"end":20.39,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5:line-2","text":"これまでは食品をまとめて袋に詰めたものを学生に渡しておりましたが、一人当たりの数を決めて学生に自由に選んで持ち帰ってもらう方法に変更となりました。","textVersion":"sha256:23b4e87546dc63449c78b4759bcf2ee9120ae4fd5b2da5b1f9076d2f00c2a33c","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","start":21.06,"end":34.37,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5:line-3","text":"ええ、食品が入った段ボールをそれぞれの机の下に置いておきました。","textVersion":"sha256:4c8f74aaedc12bb495b703d797f247b4775af5cfcf23021358a333f0bce014b4","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","start":35.26,"end":41.28,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5:line-4","text":"取りやすいように箱の中身を机の上に置いてください。","textVersion":"sha256:2e79cbe60fd7a3a2dbe11078e392cce62da808e0f3dfd341bf2bb9fec0dfcec8","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","start":42.02,"end":46.77,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5:line-5","text":"配る際ですが、袋を持たずに来てしまった学生には袋の用意がないことを、食品の数を取りすぎてしまった学生がいた場合は、数に限りがあることをお伝えいただけますでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:4f6ae13fe99a858fff9635070f161c5ad51e0a463c8a165f82e8ae26611c098d","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","start":47.64,"end":62.18,"speaker":"職員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-07:5:line-6","text":"それではよろしくお願いいたします。","textVersion":"sha256:339c0e68d250020a6ce94c69d51f227f932072ea9b9bf4778f803c72b4e70acb","audioVersion":"sha256:410f63d8d625c0370c690f405a561af20cadccc12e456894824004abdff664a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:53838d78053f56e58554c15b8b720d46ec0bfa07d474d01f988658beb0b1478a","start":63.04,"end":65.58,"speaker":"職員"}],"batchVersion":"a61e5049983d5ee1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","examKey":"2022-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:question","text":"大学で、女の先輩と男の学生がクラブの合宿について話しています。男の学生は何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:60718ae86e7c2cccb4fcc3de2c8d3c9f58146110ad72b235916eb589dd956425","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":0.82,"end":13.8,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:line-0","text":"明後日からのテニスクラブの合宿について、確認をしたいんだけど、今いい？まず、人数だけど。","textVersion":"sha256:cdc6840e222912e8f018746dee016f554aa4df694d223ae37d48cbf7db7df322","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":15.64,"end":23.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:line-1","text":"参加者は、コーチを入れて20人で確定です。申し込んだ時から、変更はありません。","textVersion":"sha256:d8048e3e9b64e529a8edf101d4d8a1cd9da8a6addfff0f7077f71c630bce40ce","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":24.36,"end":30.73,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:line-2","text":"ありがとう。コーチの都合で、朝の出発時間が30分遅くなったでしょう？貸し切りバスの会社には、もう知らせたって言ってたよね？","textVersion":"sha256:e383308967b0a596add4c71e1887c482b479a9db133c4bf084303cf494850e19","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":31.12,"end":42.25,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":42.49,"end":42.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:line-4","text":"じゃあ大丈夫だね。コーチと他のメンバーたちには、当日の集合時間が変わったこと、連絡しておいたよ。ペンションにも、到着時間の変更を伝えてあるよね？","textVersion":"sha256:2548ebcae9b3cbc9abfad8a3e3c97c2bd03c293aef34641b505b792e226b7053","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":43.41,"end":56.03,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:line-5","text":"そうでした、すみません。","textVersion":"sha256:1dffbf16014cfebbc32001b928852255dbcfbc737dd270fbc19fb314f6fb2d74","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":56.49,"end":58.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:line-6","text":"忘れずにね。迷惑かかるといけないから。えーと、朝晩はこの時期にしては、気温が低くなるらしいんだ。上着を持ってた方が安心だと思うから、みんなにメールで伝えておくね。","textVersion":"sha256:6aa6fff3c608fc5f335ed0dc5436442c7f9d639de9d94264a9813472c114e6ca","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":59.01,"end":73.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:1:line-7","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:1c0ea4b76aad8872edf3790c69bc153eba2e2d70f0dd2e32e58bec3fc2d10dfb","timelineVersion":"sha256:ebf975c9c9e7a1c5d42f44090f24f73ec99246cb928921342137ca326628fe1a","start":74.36,"end":75.51,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"7e732bde50581e5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","examKey":"2022-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:question","text":"地域の生け花サークルの部長から、留守番電話にメッセージが入っています。このメッセージを聞いた後、ポスターのどこを直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:9d7dd5264d77bf4af817e79bd8b1dcfe6930600f9957ef89e188d453ecc9a85e","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":0.68,"end":12.88,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-0","text":"森さん、島田です。","textVersion":"sha256:233c601378f80008c9e8c8bb1337e86d910e7dfede8c1461de8b5db561ae8516","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":16.3,"end":18.38,"speaker":"島田"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-1","text":"メールありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:3e8e60044f0bd5b8d82cb042f492c5c4f95073a28b65441ef0d7b20cf82b6362","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":18.66,"end":20,"speaker":"島田"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-2","text":"急いでるので、電話しました。","textVersion":"sha256:ef21d46e03ab74842f2a650f54cd9ca5d2b7a74a13992c68a85b8938c55476b1","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":20.44,"end":22.52,"speaker":"島田"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-3","text":"森さんが作ってくれた、展覧会のポスターのファイル、見ました。","textVersion":"sha256:b55448dcdd7855ddc97193e41f77652864d66f952e8123c406f573efc5ce6c6f","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":23.08,"end":27.36,"speaker":"島田"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-4","text":"会場とタイトルの文字を、去年のポスターより一回り大きくしてくれて、見やすくなったと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:fc61aae86abc5421c0431e125fda3117dd9ed53c5a0ad49b0a04c43e939c5c40","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":27.98,"end":35.1,"speaker":"島田"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-5","text":"生け花の写真なんだけど、位置がいくらか左に寄っている感じがするんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:cd5e2e3c560e1f5d0f7aec69e8327bc4779bacb1020e47fb57819545ba961f43","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":35.86,"end":41.2,"speaker":"島田"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-6","text":"少し真ん中に寄せてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:6c8390be144890cd0745df1a5f8650e765da90dc172e884eb86cb814f432f6c5","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":41.4,"end":43.7,"speaker":"島田"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-7","text":"あと、森さんは、日時が書いてある位置を少し下げた方がいいって提案してくれたけど、それは動かさないでいきましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:3b5c9047e002ec5599fcc613a9b5a2ebdbc6e80b658be727870d50276526315c","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":44.24,"end":53.3,"speaker":"島田"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:2:line-8","text":"じゃあ、よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:f8b11d347a99787852df46d7c0114261da6d95b93ba7fc7eb69439d52e922ab9","audioVersion":"sha256:937054e97d8d49c359bc8c6cb8133f45071ca91324651bda071ed3e56418dfd8","timelineVersion":"sha256:2ed37a60fb9ba3a862f5ba60030809537005bfb2b5f78e0f31a5de5508c03cf7","start":54.3,"end":56.08,"speaker":"島田"}],"batchVersion":"7e732bde50581e5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","examKey":"2022-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:question","text":"お菓子の会社で、男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後、クッキーの企画の何を変更しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:fd1119e5a01df0d17fa181e0282e6b37ee5eee1595790bea037a87bf8e61a33d","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":0.72,"end":14.16,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:line-0","text":"山田さん、新商品のこの企画書、読みました。甘さを抑えた大人向けのクッキーの企画、いいと思いますよ。うちのクッキーは、これまで子供をターゲットにした商品ばかりでしたからね。","textVersion":"sha256:4afc893b8b379a3c2943ab289cfaab49c5e0b5c685ae7de7091cb0fcd58321aa","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":16,"end":31.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:line-1","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":31.96,"end":33.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:line-2","text":"箱のデザインは、高級感を出そうという狙いですね。","textVersion":"sha256:7b9fa9d2bf7e540fdb98dda89cb919af85dc6d159ebdf89df645e7639d38b095","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":33.93,"end":37.45,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:line-3","text":"はい。販売価格を少し高めに設定したので、それに合わせてみたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:f88ce22f46635ed339b7c3fceff54d3c9d10449540162a25bfabc875f7046a06","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":37.9,"end":43.91,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:line-4","text":"そう、この案だと商品が店の棚に並んだ時に、消費者の目に止まりにくいように思うんですよ。少し目立つ色も入れたりするとか、してみてくれます？","textVersion":"sha256:fe15c992a6ee18c31f0c318fa527a4a68224506ed5a5c75760f66abac7b5c609","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":44.23,"end":56.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:line-5","text":"あ、はい。そうですね。じゃあ、価格については？","textVersion":"sha256:42407ae0aa5024328a2046a33c60a9669bda75f7c1f902cb9929f8391b3501e0","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":57.17,"end":62.35,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:line-6","text":"価格は、後で細かい調整をしますから、企画書のままでいいので、指摘した点を修正してもらえますか？発売する時期は今のように、来年の春とだけ書いておいてくれれば十分です。","textVersion":"sha256:f566d053262a4693ff7637584b0fe915e95c6a5d91a9b2182a9bb0f3aa14b99e","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":62.66,"end":76.91,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:3:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:0f9d49de0ce2626078933f12a20c5ebf3b656c90fc58be30e0511132f2f95c24","timelineVersion":"sha256:bef2a4fa3780fc11002ef6f4f130fa32f5f6ca388ed5f70760771b7cf66d0932","start":77.88,"end":78.75,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"7e732bde50581e5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","examKey":"2022-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:question","text":"大学で、女の学生と男の学生が話しています。女の学生はこの後どうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8dd3fb6775c8153a9907016abb47cabdfc7106019c6a23ad69bf5ec9f338bd70","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":0.74,"end":11.52,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-0","text":"鈴木くん、確か金魚飼ってるって言ってたよね？","textVersion":"sha256:d3e741719371a39729a15a690702e970bbbb048e7bb76fa14b699d6bd656afa9","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":13.42,"end":17.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-1","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":17.88,"end":18.35,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-2","text":"私も2か月前から飼い始めたんだけど、魚を入れているガラスケースがすぐに汚れちゃうんだ。毎週のように掃除しなきゃならなくて、どうしたらいいかな？","textVersion":"sha256:b4e7c31cc98ea81df6e3e71647697810683f450c04b0ec49df2b6de2d9a09c3c","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":18.73,"end":30.37,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-3","text":"水の中に貝は入れてる？ガラスケースについた汚れを食べてくれる貝があるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:afb0ade200d09821bbde5157511e919e1224748cdd1a08e5bee4b3828d0cdd8d","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":30.7,"end":35.99,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-4","text":"うん。店で勧められたからね。","textVersion":"sha256:25906da93ccb27cac74da3d1d4bdccab11d0eab80ac96fb3739479c644d3ef21","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":36.33,"end":38.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-5","text":"そっか。あと、餌の量が多かったり、日当たりのいい部屋に置いたりしていない？そういうのも汚れに影響するよ。","textVersion":"sha256:76b35f59fb342ab73e4c1c7a2889a61caf5467ecbdb3ee1629899971cfa62404","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":38.87,"end":47.17,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-6","text":"私の部屋、日当たりがいいけど他に置くところないんだ。餌は店で教えてもらった通りにやってるよ。少なすぎるかなと思うくらい。","textVersion":"sha256:7667a0df6fd661e3a0fdcbd465cfde1d4d7b19acedeee01b39d067c1d0167548","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":47.73,"end":57.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-7","text":"場所は、玄関に置けば？餌は食べずに残ったものが汚れの原因になるから、少なすぎるくらいでいいんだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:06294a6f05c72b5e95b4af19cfec523f78cfd16fd8d821723799671956e5c999","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":58.26,"end":65.99,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:4:line-8","text":"そっか。じゃあ、餌はいいとして、置き場所を変えてみる。","textVersion":"sha256:de2e0e4503e29b4eab2db146287374ff2f2edf04743502658f1a025ec26c0a67","audioVersion":"sha256:fb57eb2fb7a0081c818837b1898fa3b844ae74f86f99de3736e9753bc079a6e9","timelineVersion":"sha256:3b6e5f451e18e2d74307c4a5c76e43b90cf6e59b63746bdc60a9a4ee283d5ec3","start":66.25,"end":71.59,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"7e732bde50581e5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","examKey":"2022-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2022.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2022.html"],"batch":"2022-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:question","text":"会社で、課長と男の人が話しています。男の人は、この後何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:2692c2089ba4a41773b5101757c69c80950b7b5d2dd2ff2f5af73e205d3d3ff4","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":0.73,"end":11.59,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-0","text":"中山さん、新製品の洗濯機につけるマニュアルの案、見ましたよ。ちょっといいですか？","textVersion":"sha256:41bc0f7726f80a396517ed56734864850fb4ebfa37f4878c51650481de69c74a","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":13.45,"end":20.41,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-1","text":"はい、課長。","textVersion":"sha256:1c1822621906e9e2aca3530bd8eb21311b0f33e8b5296889074420504ac255de","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":20.73,"end":21.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-2","text":"今回のマニュアルは、詳細な取扱説明書と簡単な簡易説明書、これは印刷物で、もう一つはインターネットの使い方の動画、この3つということですね？","textVersion":"sha256:dfd1215fef61567287ad0c4d7a8198886d950bc484d2384c581d72fd89ad1dcf","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":22.15,"end":36.16,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":36.5,"end":36.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-4","text":"詳細な取扱説明書は、このままで問題ないです。簡易説明書の方は、文字を大きくしたんですね？","textVersion":"sha256:b633e11005f2b581de806bba584c8edde3970458d434eb12a60c22f6ee5ef530","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":37.43,"end":45.91,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-5","text":"はい、見やすい方がいいと思いまして。","textVersion":"sha256:e4b12b62049c7c44d9c4c74332d632a7b9b53b0baa6a23cf1d1af26853db32b6","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":46.23,"end":49.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-6","text":"いいと思いますよ。絵もシンプルだし、説明の言葉も簡潔で。動画は、洗剤を入れるところなんかは、あんなに時間を取らなくてもいいんじゃないですか？","textVersion":"sha256:925ce64e9a9b98181503fc64979de1a48649e4fc8d6105682327678d1ab11c3e","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":49.37,"end":61.71,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-7","text":"ああ、そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:c92b56f7ed765f15273a1b5a52fcbeaefcd399222a18feee4c71d7ba593949f1","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":62.19,"end":63.95,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-8","text":"他にも、余計なところは省いて、もう少し簡潔にしてみてください。動画の字幕を複数の言語に対応させたのは、今のニーズに合っていると思いますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:14830634c5050684c3953b3cbe25968e25356622d397ead14ec6de1e5bda79a5","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":64.18,"end":76.27,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2022-12:5:line-9","text":"ありがとうございます。承知しました。","textVersion":"sha256:e84bd15810d308c6357a7aee5d039cb8e7c8e685e45c1655e5c4160f0e5bbc1e","audioVersion":"sha256:ab6fa3eedef448d2c14e2ac530ad1608833e7aa5e1519dd4b891b0b9f8c6f300","timelineVersion":"sha256:77438063d2547d4ba7b27ba5bd0a2c528253c52859c92bc56ccd4e4a1babd3d8","start":76.63,"end":79.03,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"7e732bde50581e5f"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","examKey":"2023-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:question","text":"大学で女の留学生と先生が話しています。女の留学生は新入生のオリエンテーションで何の話を担当しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5b834c9594f4157cf7cec3a43284f9a8cdb0319811c50575a1743546e6628bda","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":3.62,"end":16.45,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:line-0","text":"先生、新入生のオリエンテーションの件で、話があるって聞きましたが。","textVersion":"sha256:a0bdf2a409b21c2f70bb1845c2c5069d728c7678026b4bcfa37d3f0e3796dfc5","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":18.23,"end":23.97,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:line-1","text":"あ、ハンさん。そうなんですよ。ハンさん、新入生の時、先輩の留学生がオリエンテーションに何人か来て、自分の体験を話してくれたの、覚えてる？","textVersion":"sha256:2f9b501a961a27feb0a4b8aa0f1e6973f81e28c664f8afa6058af1680d482359","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":23.96,"end":35.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:line-2","text":"はい、先輩からサークルやアルバイトの話を聞いたの、覚えています。","textVersion":"sha256:e9dd8acbc9584300ff21a14bdd6afcdb307ba01d687e123e46a0f6affabff557","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":35.3,"end":40.81,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:line-3","text":"そうですか。で、実はね、優秀な成績だということで、ハンさんの勉強の進め方や、その工夫などについて紹介してほしいんです。アルバイトやサークルで忙しい中でも、勉強を頑張ってるみたいだし。新入生にも良い刺激になると思うから。","textVersion":"sha256:0e96f016a83e05714748c413b1ed89a87cf2c9c8a29e4eb961dec9650b342a4e","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":41.02,"end":59.25,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:line-4","text":"わかりました。私でお役に立てるなら引き受けさせてもらいますが、新入生って、サークルやアルバイト、それに就職に興味あるんじゃないかなと思いますけど……。","textVersion":"sha256:7e5f5dbc1aa0696f1048673f83783e793271e56252fc5fabfb725fc12ed3a040","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":59.55,"end":72.41,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:line-5","text":"ええ、そのことについては、他の学生が担当してくれることになってるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:944a97cab216e268896d79c97823c7c1b402895ac58f163861464924f7b70d9a","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":72.41,"end":77.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:line-6","text":"わかりました。あっ、今度、就職についてご相談したいことがあるんですが、よろしいですか？","textVersion":"sha256:8c2d8b16903baa5535e751a5a1f10ee2e1a5a47e466985cb3e45d12a427c7e2e","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":77.96,"end":85.27,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:1:line-7","text":"もちろんです。","textVersion":"sha256:0e53de0458978a53305161f6d28c6fda043ee307762a63dc643eb699784a9821","audioVersion":"sha256:7c7f3ed7e41200d1a2408e15fc71b0cf0deb3783d025b2f689680a1c3e63529d","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d54fbd871b973271469ab3ff088febddbba0665b2b2a88d7bd9b4d1b83b7e8f","start":85.39,"end":86.22,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8081cc2d78e7ece2"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","examKey":"2023-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:question","text":"農家で、農家の女の人とアルバイトの男の人が話しています。アルバイトの男の人は、まずどんな作業をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d82c7e76b2ec0409fc97370755a4505f9bfc02be3bd253fc8faa2422e158d433","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":3.62,"end":15.27,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:line-0","text":"中村君、今日からよろしくお願いします。農作業はしたことありますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0a2f873679df0c548a6f11ddbdbffe65287e3ffc4fabe3b46e7292fc0cbe4658","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":17.06,"end":22.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:line-1","text":"祖父が庭で野菜を作ってて、土を耕したり、種を蒔いたりするのは手伝ったことがあります。","textVersion":"sha256:ba6137c752167007f524cc9d1f4bfb2bbd5acce62c5d8962a183b916b87ba63e","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":23.07,"end":29.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:line-2","text":"じゃあ、まったく初めてじゃないんですね。うちはいろんな野菜を栽培しているんだけど、今の時期、ねぎの収穫をやっているんです。","textVersion":"sha256:f0491d4994187d7f87f279a9c379546f40ce96972d5987529ab3b3c42ba11415","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":30.01,"end":38.85,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":38.9,"end":39.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:line-4","text":"ねぎの畑の雑草を抜く作業をやってもらえますか？収穫は明日機械でするんだけど、余計な草を抜いとかないと、途中で機械に絡まっちゃって、機械を止めないといけないんです。","textVersion":"sha256:5c3dbf2fcc9f0dfd076cb5d68948aac5818b3872263617b612f2cddae61051d3","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":39.95,"end":53.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:line-5","text":"そうなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:ec0ceb9eb16153f37f4132b358dccfaf722bd76310f524f5f66e38dff84e5bf8","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":53.78,"end":54.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:line-6","text":"大変だけど、大事な作業なんでお願いします。これが終わったら、隣の畑にほうれん草の種を蒔くから、私と一緒にお願いできます？土を耕すのは済んでるから。","textVersion":"sha256:a98dc0d9ecf4005af54e230a94f88345abdde0e80809d30b262e45bda42fb326","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":55.62,"end":68.79,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:2:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:fd0d2ce25a72d8d79c8e3d8f36005ce4b1b763bb1f9db140a101272986c6c067","timelineVersion":"sha256:049873d73a457871e1614803727adbd5a288244a6b4f8cb9213083b02d442c4e","start":69.12,"end":70.04,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8081cc2d78e7ece2"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","examKey":"2023-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:question","text":"男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生は、これからまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4b574b87a37a8f0d94ac398a843ebbe495a6114e90275d378902e1a83fbac08f","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":3.62,"end":13.3,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-0","text":"ビジネスの立ち上げ方のセミナーの申し込み、もうやった？","textVersion":"sha256:add30b190ea6fe9c57ff9fc53f02feb03693d81f75889ca3d52349b01a4eb59c","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":15.1,"end":18.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-1","text":"うん、ホームページから申し込みしたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0143a8c75adc6a707bdea8d60036075473598f60ded4915c1e77f0ecb76047f5","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":19.26,"end":21.91,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-2","text":"そっか、僕も申し込みたいんだけど、受講料の支払いって、クレジットカードが必要じゃない？まだクレジットカード、持ってないから。","textVersion":"sha256:8266cf7df156b2415e3033fe346290b4dc11d18e112e90298ec380c8df96aa0d","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":22.12,"end":32.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-3","text":"ホームページに振り込み先の銀行名と口座番号が書いてあるから、振り込みでも払えるよ。確認してみて。","textVersion":"sha256:73320edffea405975e6f5192afc8a0e4ad4890cec6885fbd974026b95816655b","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":32.37,"end":40.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-4","text":"えっ、そうなんだ。知らなかった。もう一度ホームページ見てみる。","textVersion":"sha256:cc4b4ae152e5d113d5ba0d03fe83e2d5eeabe01f1f55500b5717fdc36ded0854","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":40.2,"end":44.75,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-5","text":"支払いが済んだ用紙の写真を添付すれば、ホームページから申し込みできるって書いてあったよ。","textVersion":"sha256:ad6c4f1934e776b483a45f2e19c95b665d13b2a489c03a5213bd61d043fbab4e","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":45.25,"end":51.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-6","text":"ありがとう。でも、やっぱりクレジットカードがないと、こんな時本当不便だね。","textVersion":"sha256:44e0a2ae71364d5e54672beb555419ab7e0752b6878f25ab139ff2720bd6bd65","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":51.51,"end":57.63,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-7","text":"そうだね。","textVersion":"sha256:c85cdfda9a14283043e2de3b9a1404b82d3dd712711392e18ee40f6b395adb04","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":57.6,"end":58.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-8","text":"今回のセミナーの申し込みにも間に合うかもしれないから、早速カードを作ろうかな。","textVersion":"sha256:803582d7517e2dfafb04cc6e33fc398f645c9d59d2363d82047e2a4495ec7b4c","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":59.24,"end":64.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-9","text":"だけど、クレジットカードは自宅に届くまで、二週間くらいはかかるかも。申し込み、今週いっぱいだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d1b3a6d17a66642b4c95db6ee033a8e429205e022be4e00717fa5f24940f37bf","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":64.84,"end":72.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:3:line-10","text":"そっか、じゃあ今回は間に合わないし、また今度にしよ。","textVersion":"sha256:3899511334a6b9f96e95519ea8414de564f072e78081e55302a71e8aea6a4b86","audioVersion":"sha256:0140df5d7348cf825d0ef909e5b0de03ba77b5282f20ca5e969d3cc84a9908f2","timelineVersion":"sha256:c9807a34e337a85abebb9e8d6098cf2bd0514c5c9a801e14770c3f33d3158b65","start":72.76,"end":77.08,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8081cc2d78e7ece2"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","examKey":"2023-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:question","text":"建築設計事務所で、女の人と課長が照明の設計について話しています。女の人はこれから何を変更しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e2e6c8641167be0a0f8736e0c895346b5e3a7800e2246ff35f2835c869b4fdb8","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":3.62,"end":17.24,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-0","text":"課長、カフェ北山に提案する照明デザインなんですけど、案を見ていただけましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:5d5283075433164ffba1b3111db6e6b71811bbc88d3d2982d4b6e7f2b601bee9","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":19.05,"end":26.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-1","text":"うん、見たよ。この資料だよね。前回見せてもらった時は、天井に大型の照明を一つ取り付けるってことだったけど、今回の案では、天井から小さめの照明をいくつも並べてぶら下げることにしたんだね。","textVersion":"sha256:912c20d8641a701882f93caade1df6edd0238b50db60cada6d85a54bec0f9f29","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":26.12,"end":42.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":42.12,"end":42.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-3","text":"面白いと思うよ。天井からぶら下げる高さもよく考えてあるね。","textVersion":"sha256:2111e1c8b236b1939f4a44006fccfcdf484821e5b6d4708e13c5388c126e06f2","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":43.04,"end":48.27,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-4","text":"ありがとうございます。あのう、照明器具の素材はガラス製のものにしたんですが、どうですか？","textVersion":"sha256:d6235f0408ef6fba9cd5639b297a9ac09c8ce618bf81781c2e4261f1a664ae8f","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":48.65,"end":55.77,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-5","text":"ガラスも悪くはないと思うけど、店の雰囲気から考えると和紙なんかも合うね。","textVersion":"sha256:66d07731898ed53538a0d13dff6154df64f2bc7bb96eeaa934ecf68bf313cfe5","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":56.01,"end":61.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-6","text":"ああ、考えていませんでした。そうですね、そうしてみます。","textVersion":"sha256:aef3bc21cc895548be86b83e145f569ceff00a000bc3dcbb3b2cb30d293004ae","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":62.09,"end":67.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-7","text":"光の強さについては、リラックスする空間にふさわしく抑えてあるね。明かりの色は白すぎず、温かみのある色になってるから案の通りで。","textVersion":"sha256:7a6c086b29ee969f9ca6c255e7503dbed748190b247b402d4f234eb937fdf574","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":67.22,"end":78.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:4:line-8","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:01eb94364a9d66d965d2dafebf38da7121ef8f06b206d7d844b438899791db68","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca80e995e48c1cb3763d59e72c6a14a5d408b150afde0b457a765a1cf861524d","start":78.29,"end":79.67,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8081cc2d78e7ece2"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5","examKey":"2023-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d42eb97bf0bdf55e3746a2c139a387fbdf84cd3a2580ae16e0ebfcf569a7f6b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e35b064d6142fe3d2f748f833f372e1f4a76f78df11bde8afabb1cb3674b264","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5:question","text":"説明会の会場で、課長が部下の社員に話しています。部下の社員は今日この後、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:3d97dbe83eb72587922c9724d619ed1f628bdc536b55c73aa06c2b4f06710da8","audioVersion":"sha256:d42eb97bf0bdf55e3746a2c139a387fbdf84cd3a2580ae16e0ebfcf569a7f6b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e35b064d6142fe3d2f748f833f372e1f4a76f78df11bde8afabb1cb3674b264","start":3.62,"end":14.49,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5:line-0","text":"皆さん、暑い中、明日の新商品説明会の準備を、ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:60ca9be8e7b086b49db386b281bdfd59eb0749a13223d874bc2a7f84edd56b17","audioVersion":"sha256:d42eb97bf0bdf55e3746a2c139a387fbdf84cd3a2580ae16e0ebfcf569a7f6b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e35b064d6142fe3d2f748f833f372e1f4a76f78df11bde8afabb1cb3674b264","start":16.3,"end":22.41,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5:line-1","text":"おかげさまで、机、椅子は準備が整い、パソコンやスクリーンの設置は当日行いますので、パンフレットが入った封筒を各机に置いて、準備は完了となります。","textVersion":"sha256:2ac92c2ecb60cbb7917a716f9c0fcbdc7a34d2c53b40f741c39791c46b4b8bd1","audioVersion":"sha256:d42eb97bf0bdf55e3746a2c139a387fbdf84cd3a2580ae16e0ebfcf569a7f6b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e35b064d6142fe3d2f748f833f372e1f4a76f78df11bde8afabb1cb3674b264","start":23.14,"end":36.38,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-07:5:line-2","text":"今回の説明会は、規模がかなり大きいので、当日は来場者の案内もよろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:54e5d70e71a3ed4966bdae92e4cd23aed3503a6086c8dde5464a755646d4cede","audioVersion":"sha256:d42eb97bf0bdf55e3746a2c139a387fbdf84cd3a2580ae16e0ebfcf569a7f6b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e35b064d6142fe3d2f748f833f372e1f4a76f78df11bde8afabb1cb3674b264","start":37.05,"end":44.76,"speaker":"課長"}],"batchVersion":"8081cc2d78e7ece2"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","examKey":"2023-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1:question","text":"大学で、女の学生と男の学生がプレゼンテーションの練習の後に話しています。女の学生はこれから、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:8b1f9348f2ce6497db4c97e5c81fb413b546a7c91cb15f1666bb1cd9b08b5ac8","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","start":3.61,"end":17.82,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1:line-0","text":"先輩、プレゼンの練習を見ていただけてありがたいです。他の大学との合同ゼミでの発表なんて、私初めてなので、今の私のプレゼン、どうでしたか？","textVersion":"sha256:dd2187743845b8670e85c2877de0fd71cc6db845af9d189925fa9349d6bf4d80","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","start":19.61,"end":32.41,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1:line-1","text":"うん、話す内容が整理されてて、簡潔にまとめられてるって感じがするよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6b9289bb54db73a8961d1f67e19b54abc06c178d35608588f0780bf7daa33edf","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","start":32.75,"end":37.57,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1:line-2","text":"そうですか。あの、自分で時間を測ってみたら、予定した時間より早く終わるんです。それで、もう少し内容を追加できそうなんですが、説明が足りていない部分はありますか？","textVersion":"sha256:924949aae2c0979092499430ffc22aef8008dcbcec369476f5df9e99458fc5ee","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","start":37.78,"end":50.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1:line-3","text":"今以上に詰め込むことはないよ。それより、速度を少し落として話す練習をしといて。原稿を読むのに一生懸命になっちゃって、早くなりがちだったから。聞いている人の理解が追い付かなくなっちゃうよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0787c8080b4e0634936eac76e37e093e017909c5d6c8b1e21812ee8af3ce5db0","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","start":51.23,"end":64.83,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1:line-4","text":"はい、原稿は暗記しなきゃダメですか？","textVersion":"sha256:6cd160927a3f07bc48c20d44020ea7242ea3063a00168c7ec4c13260e7c80fcd","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","start":65.15,"end":68.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1:line-5","text":"覚えたつもりでも言葉が出なくなることがあるから、見ながらやっていいんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:998d044f8ae602bb5004608aca8c0be28a48a6a1ec62e8c87c32f95220d031e2","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","start":68.78,"end":73.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:1:line-6","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:195c05b81391226ab8977e8f13d1f08c8ea66aec4765a356b77bd35864978412","timelineVersion":"sha256:622b3a1fb0aa6890d1434805ed5b84b1b15313c5525d422c6c29718b89d36233","start":73.71,"end":74.67,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d3505524d346dc06"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2","examKey":"2023-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9d8b9668c7e90e5b13db33ec37bcc96a218a5c7ff62dfee8366964b26f584285","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff2eeabf10b55511aab43c912ab0177d264d7628316aebf5a7e7786ecd7b153","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人は新幹線の席をどう予約しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:99f7c514b56a5b2c07f2c2c10c106ed34706ebc82eefb215934fc56eba2f187c","audioVersion":"sha256:9d8b9668c7e90e5b13db33ec37bcc96a218a5c7ff62dfee8366964b26f584285","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff2eeabf10b55511aab43c912ab0177d264d7628316aebf5a7e7786ecd7b153","start":3.62,"end":14.5,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2:line-0","text":"山本さん、あさって私と行く出張の件だけど、部長も一緒に行くことになったから、新幹線のチケット、私と部長の分も一緒にとってくれますか？","textVersion":"sha256:8c54f7007af7afe8f53721edcdf8a71b897d6baf97bdf3d767ad36590eb5b543","audioVersion":"sha256:9d8b9668c7e90e5b13db33ec37bcc96a218a5c7ff62dfee8366964b26f584285","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff2eeabf10b55511aab43c912ab0177d264d7628316aebf5a7e7786ecd7b153","start":16.3,"end":27.31,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2:line-1","text":"あ、ちょうど今予約しようとしていたところです。7時発のがあります。えっと、先頭の車両に四つ空きがありますけど、3人並んで座るのは無理ですね。画面見ていただけますか？白いところが空席です。","textVersion":"sha256:d4783cdd4ff1d81c0fdd151506008db2d321b9b80a8ebb3c0db874e0c69a3f6e","audioVersion":"sha256:9d8b9668c7e90e5b13db33ec37bcc96a218a5c7ff62dfee8366964b26f584285","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff2eeabf10b55511aab43c912ab0177d264d7628316aebf5a7e7786ecd7b153","start":27.85,"end":47.69,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2:line-2","text":"えっと、部長に窓側希望って言われているので、窓側の席をおさえてもらえますか？","textVersion":"sha256:3593dcf35c3c69e25149c7d07997fa6e989a7b57bddfdfd8e97f7ec74bdec6f2","audioVersion":"sha256:9d8b9668c7e90e5b13db33ec37bcc96a218a5c7ff62dfee8366964b26f584285","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff2eeabf10b55511aab43c912ab0177d264d7628316aebf5a7e7786ecd7b153","start":47.88,"end":54.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:9d8b9668c7e90e5b13db33ec37bcc96a218a5c7ff62dfee8366964b26f584285","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff2eeabf10b55511aab43c912ab0177d264d7628316aebf5a7e7786ecd7b153","start":54.56,"end":55,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2:line-4","text":"あと、私たちの席は、部長も私たちがずっと横にいるより、一人の方がリラックスできるでしょうから、私たちは、今空いている残りの2席でいいですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:6e0535e11094b87ead0391f7ef7a4de6a0e69d9731382cf41fd36cd2e01d42c4","audioVersion":"sha256:9d8b9668c7e90e5b13db33ec37bcc96a218a5c7ff62dfee8366964b26f584285","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff2eeabf10b55511aab43c912ab0177d264d7628316aebf5a7e7786ecd7b153","start":55.5,"end":68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:2:line-5","text":"そうですね。分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:774774bf0b1866167c093feeb48e3a22ebeaffd2d4ae65a02f4a39b48df73e81","audioVersion":"sha256:9d8b9668c7e90e5b13db33ec37bcc96a218a5c7ff62dfee8366964b26f584285","timelineVersion":"sha256:bff2eeabf10b55511aab43c912ab0177d264d7628316aebf5a7e7786ecd7b153","start":68.49,"end":70.54,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d3505524d346dc06"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3","examKey":"2023-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4333ae2845470ea5945e3c6857ba65d810969cfd87d3c4aadc9f8681a0c77766","timelineVersion":"sha256:272d673313aaf1aa46b470f2b38099a33b438f1ff3f7c48c6e0fd19ef5aa50bd","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3:question","text":"日本語のクラスで先生が留学生に話しています。留学生は今日の授業の終わりまでに、グループで何を決めなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:d5ad0f221df1c76598e4acaabdde1259b6945fd03bae485424a34509082260bd","audioVersion":"sha256:4333ae2845470ea5945e3c6857ba65d810969cfd87d3c4aadc9f8681a0c77766","timelineVersion":"sha256:272d673313aaf1aa46b470f2b38099a33b438f1ff3f7c48c6e0fd19ef5aa50bd","start":3.6,"end":17.21,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3:line-0","text":"えー、テキストの第4課では、ゴミ処理の現状と問題点、その対策について、日本の例を読みました。","textVersion":"sha256:779dbed808356145cd52f8f9eb880697802acb78205254546a1800d30a9076c8","audioVersion":"sha256:4333ae2845470ea5945e3c6857ba65d810969cfd87d3c4aadc9f8681a0c77766","timelineVersion":"sha256:272d673313aaf1aa46b470f2b38099a33b438f1ff3f7c48c6e0fd19ef5aa50bd","start":18.99,"end":27.84,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3:line-1","text":"前回話した通り、皆さんには、グループで一つの国を取り上げ、ゴミ処理の現状・問題点・対策をテーマに来月発表してもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:c4002f53c1fb9986bb3e0b67d6740245ad71fd0a7f0f5b6bbdfbc43026f548a5","audioVersion":"sha256:4333ae2845470ea5945e3c6857ba65d810969cfd87d3c4aadc9f8681a0c77766","timelineVersion":"sha256:272d673313aaf1aa46b470f2b38099a33b438f1ff3f7c48c6e0fd19ef5aa50bd","start":28.43,"end":40.47,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3:line-2","text":"今から、どの国について調べるか、グループで話し合ってもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:c6214b67b2d4a6c3e48e722102a09185445dfabb4b756c7c6f24f1700a39897c","audioVersion":"sha256:4333ae2845470ea5945e3c6857ba65d810969cfd87d3c4aadc9f8681a0c77766","timelineVersion":"sha256:272d673313aaf1aa46b470f2b38099a33b438f1ff3f7c48c6e0fd19ef5aa50bd","start":41.4,"end":46.27,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3:line-3","text":"家で参考になりそうな資料を探したりして、調べたい国をそれぞれ考えてきましたね。","textVersion":"sha256:927f6372ce4051d6853aed02d5310a8f1c1de2610329dd56c11538f2f2ceb84d","audioVersion":"sha256:4333ae2845470ea5945e3c6857ba65d810969cfd87d3c4aadc9f8681a0c77766","timelineVersion":"sha256:272d673313aaf1aa46b470f2b38099a33b438f1ff3f7c48c6e0fd19ef5aa50bd","start":47.17,"end":53.61,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3:line-4","text":"前回の授業で、グループのリーダーや記録係など、役割を分担しました。","textVersion":"sha256:da9b894b37fa407d944c67cd0c1d99fd7524bc17ee9f46d87676b1965d547d68","audioVersion":"sha256:4333ae2845470ea5945e3c6857ba65d810969cfd87d3c4aadc9f8681a0c77766","timelineVersion":"sha256:272d673313aaf1aa46b470f2b38099a33b438f1ff3f7c48c6e0fd19ef5aa50bd","start":54.63,"end":60.72,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:3:line-5","text":"リーダーを中心に話し合って、授業の終わりに、私に報告してください。","textVersion":"sha256:00708a75508baf7a24317bf2c0b8f921f170264599e3c67e69c429628a35adf7","audioVersion":"sha256:4333ae2845470ea5945e3c6857ba65d810969cfd87d3c4aadc9f8681a0c77766","timelineVersion":"sha256:272d673313aaf1aa46b470f2b38099a33b438f1ff3f7c48c6e0fd19ef5aa50bd","start":61.59,"end":67.27,"speaker":"先生"}],"batchVersion":"d3505524d346dc06"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","examKey":"2023-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:question","text":"大学で、男の学生と女の学生が話しています。女の学生はこの後まず、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:598141240e0c155ab91c494e16ab508b0aa9b9a9a035e05e1e13ab003b7d7183","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":3.61,"end":14.97,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-0","text":"中村さん、青葉市の市民文化祭のことだけど、ステージ演奏の出演者募集に応募しようっていう話。","textVersion":"sha256:b1b6bb45f6dbf56c224da2de9aed500bbd78259f1e2df0e9b23afe0594f6c817","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":16.77,"end":25.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-1","text":"二人でギターを弾いて歌おうって言ってたやつね。事前選考のための演奏動画の作成が、締め切りに間に合わないって諦めたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:b8d0e1103703f30afe13818845629fa978361f097c6570dc44500d07f2b26cb7","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":25.46,"end":35.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-2","text":"それ……僕の勘違いだったよ、ごめん。応募申請書と動画を同時に提出しなきゃいけないと思ってたんだけど、動画は申請書の締め切り後、一週間以内の提出だったんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:829ff624319b7c278296e26fb31f9bd09ec8b8e09956fa26882fe227089c6778","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":35.99,"end":48.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-3","text":"えっ？そうだったの？私もホームページ見たのに、気が付かなかった。ごめんね。","textVersion":"sha256:4324535746e5b02148e48ec5e182a90102136a327824a4d0a925dac0a239e23f","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":48.67,"end":55.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-4","text":"うん、間に合いそうだから申し込もうよ。パソコンで申請書作ってくれたって言ってたけど、削除しちゃった？","textVersion":"sha256:9fa16c79e5fb3ccd51f9009a20497cb81c75c2a465fdde6e60fcc789c180c61e","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":55.2,"end":62.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-5","text":"残してあるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:28be25bdf1af5116da525fdbf97423e2ff7e8f3af1cc96f1f1eeadbf1e9d1498","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":62.56,"end":63.59,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-6","text":"じゃあ、それ使えるね。締め切り明日だから、提出任せるね。","textVersion":"sha256:0ef69872a9ba74cfa464fbef5f095dd593aaf64ea1ca2b2bbb9f503d83c42b04","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":63.83,"end":68.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-7","text":"了解。","textVersion":"sha256:0157e6aed55c5c02d6a5db10de6381ff48cf5d42afdf83c802629cb18e71b92a","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":68.5,"end":69.19,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:4:line-8","text":"動画作成もすぐに取り掛かんなきゃ。応募する以上は絶対出たいからね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c5284d4adf4e7dce205799553391de0a08dadc6535f3ac2fc9c290054c483ea","audioVersion":"sha256:b4347a1d38bd998a4f75d7be31f929128c1ca992733ef1452d88a03cc85af122","timelineVersion":"sha256:cecc21738860f1b899959b9c1295e76ac21b137b65c14f0ced2456c78dcb6a07","start":69.57,"end":74.37,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"d3505524d346dc06"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","examKey":"2023-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2023.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n2/years/2023.html"],"batch":"2023-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:question","text":"ガーデニングの店で、男の人と店員が話しています。男の人はまず、植物をどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1ecc6058e1b9dfc3ce9ba4278b75cdaa2518b678683159d730600ee3c00b2f3e","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":3.63,"end":14.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-0","text":"すみません。うちで育てている植物のことで、教えていただきたいんです。この写真の葉っぱが手のひらみたいな植物なんですが、最近、葉も枝も弱々しくなってきちゃって。","textVersion":"sha256:41fc20778a156261848e6945bb67f54f95ed16f6a6bb02a4e82017cca0d0b909","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":16.54,"end":29.97,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-1","text":"ああ、これですか。写真では、日当たりがあまり良くないように見えますが。","textVersion":"sha256:b29a236f3cbcb7ac31cf9422b58405e311ffd55bb165abef5eccd3dd8777dd6f","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":30.47,"end":36.57,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-2","text":"ソファーの横に置いてるんですけど、あまり日は……。","textVersion":"sha256:17e84a24919e10a968d93e0aab542ae5090fe6a5053b5744637f3c1e319b1d4c","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":36.81,"end":40.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-3","text":"これ、日当たりのいい場所を好みますから。日光がよく当たる窓際に移してあげるといいですよ。水はどうしていますか？","textVersion":"sha256:9a0aff05de83e8125cd66706204100c4bb85ae507d5afe46309bbd8802b69964","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":40.75,"end":49.92,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-4","text":"ああ、昨日はやりましたけど、毎日はやってないです。","textVersion":"sha256:9113ff95d68bb3018b6eefb54e31e2f412637b2168ae1a405c6795561ad8cdc9","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":50.19,"end":53.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-5","text":"それでいいですよ。土の表面が乾いてからやれば、十分ですから。","textVersion":"sha256:09da32b4dc34e07d8b07cbfc03d61655ca090cecf9f4a8e885c5a8a254d172c5","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":54.04,"end":59.98,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-6","text":"はい、あの、弱ってる枝って、切るんですか？","textVersion":"sha256:1fcb5e8b27c0bb52b2ed21f76336e58aa5b8961eee12c7635cbdebf3fcb0e27a","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":60.53,"end":63.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-7","text":"その必要はないですよ。それより、元気になったら、今より少し大きめの鉢に植え替えてやると、よく育ちますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:79aff1b24ad41cf90c0b3ca48de4d35cdcfc9428d9541393559c7bb86b93259d","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":63.88,"end":72.57,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5","unitId":"n2:task-comprehension:2023-12:5:line-8","text":"ありがとうございます。元気になるように、必要なことをまずやってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:314843282e5200d3fa7f870c38519ef45cfe31c354a4d043c1147a19422d64b0","audioVersion":"sha256:507c2849dea0ca7937b4640d932da42066434d192f01226de8317558eeeed198","timelineVersion":"sha256:5bc1aeab5a9c27737994b0e6aeaf49a41673a303d498838fa0fd38c2b0cdb51a","start":72.83,"end":77.27,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"d3505524d346dc06"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:question","text":"一番：女の人が電話で話しています。女の人は講演会の当日、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:e05897bf5ff8b56b1ddf961d8ed1b3648a7fe61b297237575c1155d9663097cb","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":3.58,"end":13.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-0","text":"もしもし、あのう、来週四日の講演会に参加したいんですが、まだあいてますか。","textVersion":"sha256:fec7121f902979524337cf013ca0bddcfaf14568139c7bac39294d1e038e11ee","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":15.62,"end":22.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-1","text":"ああ、田中先生の講演会ですね、少々お待ちください。調べますので。","textVersion":"sha256:5fdea524a56c2512809666084d974b82c9934976bd5517e3445c578823763d35","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":23.08,"end":28.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-2","text":"お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:0dff9c22444294d7fdf07f405c2811876bff03ecf38962ce4d88f4b259444f57","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":28.14,"end":29.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-3","text":"あっ、もしもし、お待たせしました。まだ余裕がございますので、ご参加いただけます。","textVersion":"sha256:688c5b2e1d2138c4f768e6b79ce7547f15fd1ce958b2a78b11f723ac1f7b7fed","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":31.86,"end":37.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-4","text":"ああ、そうですか。よかった。","textVersion":"sha256:f2adf615e4e09dc2d5abade84c568b37fda11eba992aa91058c6ea00e2f4b1fa","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":37.34,"end":39.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-5","text":"参加費は今週末までにお振込みください。","textVersion":"sha256:87306149c6b347d9c4639e7542f35a4fc17a04dc2171493b8c277b85ddcd1809","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":39.82,"end":43.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":43.34,"end":44.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-7","text":"当日は一時間前からの開場となりますが。受付で入場券をお受け取りください。","textVersion":"sha256:246750a260d018741448caa1f68e928293ca5e44c166e0a9bc080d0da36dd6d9","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":44,"end":49.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-8","text":"開始時間まで、先生の著書の展示販売も行っております。定価の二割引ですので、ぜひご利用ください。","textVersion":"sha256:5308ac80b87f87fd30fdc62493b0f018c2448e97ea7c0a27a27048f9bfea6c9d","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":50.74,"end":57.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-9","text":"あっ、そうですか、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:d87ca258517f995f63226059837873041cc7eca5f4c9e45e57911ecf583f8980","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":57.84,"end":60.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-10","text":"それでは、恐れ入りますが、お名前とご連絡先お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:f452e1955d963aa46759f53a59b87b58bc9be8ec2089b7d5619bbcb431c9bb60","audioVersion":"sha256:2cfa6d8d14578f7a4ca5ffead60f5c2eed8ff160f061f79387e679b752555dbf","timelineVersion":"sha256:85a3a1bfe376c60667d8672ac0c692170e55fb056a9faad1456c5709e6fe7d48","start":61.18,"end":65.46,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8218043c69cb417c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:question","text":"二番：会社で女の人と男の人が会議について話しています。男の人は何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:02c7bc6726ef03218a77606068e2721d08e0ad54faa1f0dfc58bea30bea68812","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":3.52,"end":14.5,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-0","text":"田中さん、例の金曜日の会議の件なんだけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:0e2e9036b730c7663f464d28e285e2937c4dd356c60bb8da0bb393fccdf86ede","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":16.12,"end":20.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":20.16,"end":20.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-2","text":"上のほうから、会議の効率化をはかるための指針っていうのが来てるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:78b54e4ae92033fef163acd39768c609e88fbc5b214da2f235d9be0e9780312f","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":21.2,"end":25.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":25.9,"end":26.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-4","text":"それでね、まず会議の開始時間だけど、原則として、九時から十二時までの間って書いてある。","textVersion":"sha256:a0a06e67df7f05bd1601b6bb015c454729d37816e6dc776fb487bfb475e1fe7f","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":26.5,"end":34.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-5","text":"ああ。会議は十時からの予定です。","textVersion":"sha256:81784f3b145ab9aa97f180217db0014994ca7fca9e234aaa8d1f796ed841be63","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":34.26,"end":37.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-6","text":"あっ、そうでしたね。それから、会議時間なんだけど、二時間を越えちゃいけない。","textVersion":"sha256:236d2cb95597605e2144dea379ac52c597c0d323f61c74b6b1d30aab6f95f953","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":37.68,"end":43.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-7","text":"ああ、それは何とかなりますね。","textVersion":"sha256:85b4184fb55a9262c3f397947103a0d3d79edfdb7cf3ac6444d77d6216d60577","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":43.72,"end":46.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-8","text":"それと、議題は四つ以下にして、遅くとも前日までにメールで参加者に知らせておくこと。","textVersion":"sha256:7de9ca3fa08fc2ef6530e868ddb8088f26945563b7a8808b13bf85b490be3666","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":45.96,"end":53.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-9","text":"あっ、そうなんですか。では、今日のうちにやっておきます。数のほうは問題ないですね。","textVersion":"sha256:ecaace1136a7ff987501ba3d3cf57ee3fca38af94eb67f506348e7eda90c9f89","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":53.1,"end":60.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-10","text":"そうね、じゃあ、準備、よろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:1b16ad30873f182061a23c7a3efc9e7eabe3c8c3b232c57a1b7206380573863c","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":60.64,"end":64.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-11","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:47b0611885bc89c9c94a128c3b2a1e25f561812a35f052dcc1a0d29bbf0af338","timelineVersion":"sha256:b47739d1b640c4609da6c0716032d4be54e6f2f7dca71ea10e46354e490d697a","start":64.24,"end":65.9,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8218043c69cb417c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:question","text":"三番：ホテルで男の人がフロントに電話しています。フロントの人はこの後、客室係りにどんな指示を出しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:dd6e6602109249cccbf2015412ca90586904aeeed2f762192896aa1a6ab2b44f","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","start":3.8,"end":14.8,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-0","text":"はい、フロントでございます","textVersion":"sha256:9c125acaa55d0425a9a063ecc7887659cc5743bbeb30e7027b8b0186da46f415","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","start":16.7,"end":18.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-1","text":"あのう、洗面台の水の流れが悪いんだけど、後、毛布もって来てくれないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:4e7b6e267376bd012332a13bb6949419af3beba29406fbf7a935f10a4091dc11","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","start":19.48,"end":24.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-2","text":"大変申し訳ございません。あの、お客様。毛布はクローゼットの上の棚にございます。洗面台のほうは、係りの者を伺わせますので、しばらく、お待ちいただけますでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:a3f144a5ee86bc9e0610f84b0841b4dd477f34fccd7d6928349915c528982e92","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","start":25.36,"end":39.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-3","text":"どのくらいかかるかな。疲れてて早く寝たいんだよね","textVersion":"sha256:d91336ea4787a8172ab40777e4e66c58337af8d37ceaa4c27d4f8865b42c267c","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","start":39.46,"end":43.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-4","text":"それでしたら。ほかのお部屋にお移りいただくことも可能ですが。","textVersion":"sha256:e9fdaaeba9aae7bc23b402ee3b727b06457a5da4b462e19d825d7bb39e43c183","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","start":44.36,"end":49.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-5","text":"うーん、荷物あけちゃったし、とりあえず見てくれる。","textVersion":"sha256:466e5532be86a52a69042c5a3b26d268c0c07c1a7420fd93d1a62a04314de89b","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","start":49.06,"end":53.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-6","text":"承知いたしました。すぐに手配いたします。","textVersion":"sha256:388a6d5c13f685634ed1cbd1e7b293fdf5a1a1f94b6b804128a92b0c365cb260","audioVersion":"sha256:4e976bac266335b82604b47d82e532e13fb26ce9dc99943f9c31bcc736230263","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdd7e161b98241e8a9789be86aff587ba0b06e878353ec2474cad74c339100e7","start":54.06,"end":57.24,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8218043c69cb417c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:question","text":"四番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人は、明日何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:69a0554c7001a4707c973da796e636d842c12b8283766398993929e9250a7f5f","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":3.68,"end":13.9,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-0","text":"今度の国際共同プロジェクトについてなんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:15eecb507e1061faf5d4449e9a26ed5512d4dc466638573594d00b8a22184b49","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":14.46,"end":18.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-1","text":"はい、来月から予備調査のために、国内の支社を幾つか回る予定です。","textVersion":"sha256:b3e6cd5d4a48ae94699da13d798626d3adfc0223d9f6aacfadebe0081133c0e3","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":19.42,"end":24.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-2","text":"あっ、そう。それでね。この件で明日アメリカの会社から責任者がくるんだけど、君に通訳を頼めないかな。実は予定していた人は急にこられなくなってね。","textVersion":"sha256:e07ee8ee1ec89ae7ede9ef03c31b18705236bf15d470ec8c7b15af94fb0a89f7","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":24.32,"end":37.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-3","text":"えっ？急に言われても、私に代役が務まりますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8a1f111f4559855ab5109303dba0e11ed6032e8c873c46debab53a7c7443242a","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":37.24,"end":42.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-4","text":"できそうな人は君しかいないんだよ。会議の資料を読み込んで準備してくれないかな。頼むよ！","textVersion":"sha256:40c99605a9dc54f291dd4e7da1f4cac89139f2312d59108f4aced83e0092516b","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":42.88,"end":50.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-5","text":"えっ、そんな大役、自信ないんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:0af79be22af9e13090e6747305fd79ca3b28b5ebee278e99df582a889725e073","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":51.56,"end":54.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-6","text":"何とかお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:988087a2d8baf75aadfba13273ef8e1c82e3f2a6adf42bcdfb1d64ab6c0413c2","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":54.98,"end":55.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":57.88,"end":58.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-8","text":"ああ、そうそう、例の海外出張の件は許可が下りたから、そっちの準備のほうもよろしく。","textVersion":"sha256:a7079ce780ac0edb1f199b481ebdf48a1b5d40f58ed5f6cd10cd0b780dd18f35","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":58.32,"end":63.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:4:line-9","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c3a642d606d9f31298c606a6437d7d4e2a5f8f0bf20ef915b2740642f101aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ad60a92aa39c93afa5be8d0ef94bd8cd23fd2e1a448ef6ac2a32e320c36c0e5","start":64.3,"end":65.78,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8218043c69cb417c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:question","text":"五番：繊維工場の男の人が取引先の女の人と話しています。男の人はこの後、どうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:142edcf63fa590ba6ca1875803fbbbb9825ad366372aab385400bc35535975f0","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":3.54,"end":14.56,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-0","text":"どうですか。この生地なんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:598582d06b4434ba1eb6404f7f30bc314c24f8c77c0c5d96562ed9bd5c671a78","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":16.12,"end":18.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-1","text":"ああ、いいですね。この触り心地はなかなかほかではないんですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:4ad39a9f3748ddd793feff8e3af6770f0395191c84de1948ec6b87b2291945f4","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":19.58,"end":25.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-2","text":"そうでしょう。うちでは昔からの織り方で作ってるんで、この独特の感じが出るんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:623d41c5d739b584a36a5e974d72708d63e1ba1cda6ebd65b146ead1635ce799","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":25.8,"end":32.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-3","text":"そうですか。新しいやり方ですと、こうはならないんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:8c23a311b4570768930d32575faff771c9b957e786c73840a750a403673144a9","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":32.04,"end":37.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-4","text":"いや、無理ですね。手間がかかっても、うちではその点にこだわってますからね。","textVersion":"sha256:25f5241e532121a2fd162c698d8cb08a736fff4227df730868536eb97a65971a","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":37.18,"end":43.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-5","text":"なるほどね。色合いはかえられますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8f7ef46402b639b09f1d265f6d3b7f74583bc212e95202d59ad4bc5a84ba0879","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":43.76,"end":47.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-6","text":"ご希望をいっていただければ、微妙な違いも出せますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6ace38bc933d31cd5b9a9a85d94720fb4f2875357c8c9af03b1ff04da03a9580","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":47.52,"end":51.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-7","text":"じゃあ、もう少し、淡い感じを出していただければ、私たちのイメージに合うんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:627839aef2e305b109cdfdfd3f0faff014779fe192d3b1a189137f3437994132","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":52.54,"end":58.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-8","text":"ああ、そうですか。わかりました。じゃ、２、３日ください。","textVersion":"sha256:bb5b57283bfd9931915d2d037dd824aebb4fdc7701ea8a6f36c135a78bfa8bfc","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":59.16,"end":64.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-9","text":"後、こちらでは、ふくに仕上げていただくことも可能ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:23c5b36a1bc665ac4a9f53aaaad33b90e1305b2835a91a5306de8d1f253a1d3f","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":65.32,"end":69.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-10","text":"うん、ちょっと時間かかりますね。今、人手が足りないんですよ。厳しくてね。","textVersion":"sha256:c7b92a7acafd99fe598a24c4a96b8626c314de68efc4f2b53df64f736048ad84","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":70.32,"end":77.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-11","text":"ああ、そうですか。それですと、難しいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:6e307855b5d47426d30303274728d865a795a58659b45663987c859808b6f091","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":76.96,"end":82.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-12","text":"すみません。じゃ、ご希望に合うようにやってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:468d31aa685a24fc736aa2663b2151dafcc83a18dcb998edaf60a645bbced7e6","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":82.54,"end":86.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:5:line-13","text":"はい、お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:88eb4b6c03d9aefa7eef93799b51e908724716b33075c070d52696471dcf8338","audioVersion":"sha256:8fbf4a23553565b9f7107819239a2ff0408a0ddbbae947a6458e5d2c4e88a0ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:010bae762cfa202153b1b8f6e3e9241d7a7c2ef10f4f8a0fc2e8569f73d97357","start":86.86,"end":88.72,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8218043c69cb417c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:question","text":"六番：電話で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はホテルにキャンセル料をいくら払わなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:730c4f508e04cde73619a511d4e1e4b2a10a718b403f322da1b301a9d6fcbf4f","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":3.6,"end":15.58,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-0","text":"はい、北国ホテルでございます。","textVersion":"sha256:61e3e5ac710a033a406fb507c330958ef993b647a54808a8d9003f4dab3313b2","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":17.46,"end":19.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-1","text":"あのう、明日の予約お願いしてた山田ですが、急用ができてキャンセルしたいんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:692f61286988ad91306afdf88aa3f7f9c788c2a1278c0003f2f886e325ed3aef","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":20.2,"end":25.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-2","text":"かしこまりました。山田様ですね。一万円の部屋をご予約ですね。はい、そうしましたら、所定のキャンセル料をいただくことになりますが、よろしいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:909633d30aeefddd5ba60939a8b2ac7e594f772b4d2f481f57d1b3ae9ae60aa1","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":26.14,"end":41.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-3","text":"えーと、キャンセル料は確か、十パーセントでしたっけ。","textVersion":"sha256:76d05632d608e0028ffbd5be5d8cfb0e1a749c0d742fb9cd5b0732c4cc980c35","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":41.84,"end":46.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-4","text":"えー、あのう。ご連絡なしの場合は全額。ご連絡いただいた場合は、当日は八十パーセント、前日は二十パーセントとなっております。","textVersion":"sha256:124b74102a8d74d146f132b7925f474a590e6d5d3bb5d0620277344c49a46aa0","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":46.4,"end":58.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-5","text":"ええー、痛いなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:10e69cee9b2ce4b2bb82a7b6e81e86603fee4dcff8b8bc0712435d20700dc552","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":58.64,"end":61.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-6","text":"あっ、お客様、申し訳ございません。前日の午後九時以降にご連絡いただいた場合は、当日扱いとさせていただいておりました。ただいま十時を回っておりますので。","textVersion":"sha256:c10cd0cc9971e8c3fbc5d444d9d50638a264c1e5fa093b93b3095dd4f0e1e513","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":61.62,"end":76.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-7","text":"ええー。なに。もう当日扱いになるの？それはひどいなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:38f1770147496de40de5f5897baf25c39047e08849af9b8772dd2591733d382c","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":77.84,"end":83.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-8","text":"誠に申し訳ございません。お送りしたパンフレットに明記しておりますので。","textVersion":"sha256:34c6ab848c46da3b82ee22c0dc5b3e9b6292aed74093f2ded872bc2ee1d090db","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":84.2,"end":90.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-07:6:line-9","text":"そうか。しょうがないな","textVersion":"sha256:9c979cdfd035b5da1bb2b93af5d4ffe12abd95377c8181f6ec5e7b3c24e0abbc","audioVersion":"sha256:2027863b5f92fb5c7d363dfebd095445749511828e2c148986dc46bd015f7876","timelineVersion":"sha256:9101b80b80acc2b4f90312928e1a83988f7d845e779c06b4731b1501a2dc4ca7","start":90.64,"end":93.02,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8218043c69cb417c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:question","text":"一番：女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこのあと何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0f1f3d417f96e7a7c4c567e4263d8b2cb29f54827447dfd1c82938e0b3338921","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":3.36,"end":11.72,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-0","text":"おはよう、今日は忙しいのに、朝早くから引越し手伝わせてごめんね。","textVersion":"sha256:e9fd73eab74b19cba0dc774eeb9564e21f5b9f0036fc08994f0c3ffd006db181","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":13.54,"end":18.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-1","text":"いや、こういうのはお互い様だしね。","textVersion":"sha256:9407e6fb59696af9099f129df5c96cc75dc3d29aa292d1bd2fd284162fd19321","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":18.92,"end":21.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-2","text":"本当に助かる。","textVersion":"sha256:f31448c79bebb10a0bdef1f0475477b96db3aabea5b0df9e803f05c7481e4d2a","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":21.34,"end":22.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-3","text":"それで、早速だけど、何から始めようか。荷造り、終わってる？","textVersion":"sha256:48e0854fc2528e72fbdf18406e2140af3ef72da1c23939636fcc3696f12a3f15","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":22.76,"end":28.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-4","text":"うん、持っていくものは全部ダンボールに入れといた。トラックにダンボール運んでってくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:ed1dee3ada6005e797a8f7d69d10469a184b84c71f6c27e1a6c759fc8384bdb6","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":28.56,"end":34.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-5","text":"ベッドとか大きな家具はどうやって運ぶ？","textVersion":"sha256:65c5d042ed26051cd85f0d1182ae036487d011f48de4a04351ee29b83d822af7","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":34.84,"end":37.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-6","text":"ああ、それは友達が欲しいって言ってるから、そのままでいいよ。運ぶの終わったら休んでて。その間に簡単に部屋の掃除するから。","textVersion":"sha256:0be340677303df92b49d52dc62b1b3636d227bae0d52056d58bbe455424263f3","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":38.42,"end":46.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-7","text":"了解。","textVersion":"sha256:0157e6aed55c5c02d6a5db10de6381ff48cf5d42afdf83c802629cb18e71b92a","audioVersion":"sha256:3628867ad9f82292c30be3e60decff7746fe105e96274d24a2b5572542dc52c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:f8c9d51c4e38ef33aadc2ab765f0b39ccea8d97752eba46ff19c8f6dbcb64236","start":46.36,"end":47.16,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"9af8d921ecf52c98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:question","text":"二番：会社で女の人と男の人がプリンターについて話しています。女の人はこれからまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:7189e1fdd732ac4d546d88e428d7960e5c642b0f2c7279c4235846ce3db8001f","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","start":3.34,"end":15.02,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-0","text":"あのう、故障していた例のプリンターの件ですが...","textVersion":"sha256:aadb4c878d2cbbd0cabdd5650226964845d154956726a18a253efa6bd000cbc5","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","start":16.76,"end":20.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-1","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","start":20.86,"end":21.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-2","text":"修理をしてもらったんですが、まだ調子が悪くて...","textVersion":"sha256:94169977f9cd79a965eb83958624ddaf536f02b96996df48843adc1b88337bc8","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","start":21.72,"end":25.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-3","text":"そうか、困ったなあ、やっぱり、これを機に買い換えるしかないか。そうなると、まず、新しい機械の見積もりが要るな。あしたから連休だから、急いで業者に頼んどいてくれない？","textVersion":"sha256:a31622c2bf4f7e56ed9581418393bf31164d647106aecd6c05bd78df2c1d8598","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","start":25.24,"end":42.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-4","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","start":42.88,"end":43.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-5","text":"届いたら、課長の許可を取って、それから注文することになるから。","textVersion":"sha256:db04f09e8735ca27bde0563c09ba6230839413af304a94a539adb6dda7451ea8","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","start":43.8,"end":48.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-6","text":"わかりました。すぐに手配します。","textVersion":"sha256:1a93d09d1065622473e3aa71b5907d649050ae7b90f98a76b18cf0de939097dd","audioVersion":"sha256:149d83bf04e99f89ff1d41231d6828711c9eadb22a19b5661fde4987368b748d","timelineVersion":"sha256:4852d9384dc21ec1a55075fad116bfb2c963b7bb8e121b32bd9d78d79f223300","start":48.62,"end":51.36,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9af8d921ecf52c98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:question","text":"三番：会社で女の人と男の人が新しく発売する弁当について話しています。男の人はこのあと、まず、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:9c6872528529fd8c420bd1ba8ddf60874b0e52db525c7219b8f7a68f24198be3","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","start":3.38,"end":16.28,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-0","text":"あのう、新しいお弁当の件だけど、ニーズ調査はどうなった？","textVersion":"sha256:d902dea25e6b02a263b7e549426fbc9399afd93636937e5d6f10d08c55f221f4","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","start":17.88,"end":22.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-1","text":"あ、はい。で、対象者なんですが、最初の企画書では曖昧だというご指摘をいただきましたので、再度検討して、健康志向の若い女性に対象をしぼることにしました。","textVersion":"sha256:8097f5e7bdf7020d71f67331f866328a1d63c0b8b93a9b3ce81a5d12ed418af9","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","start":21.98,"end":36.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-2","text":"ああ、そう。","textVersion":"sha256:7a3f1fb650f093cb9000fbda306eca4af1dfc922e952b4893eea3e73e1e6c7ef","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","start":37.22,"end":38.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-3","text":"それで、先週２０代から３０代の女性にニーズ調査を行ったんですが、狙い通りの結果が出ています。","textVersion":"sha256:844de08749e7737e94d1c03aaa8c2d9e2c06539a988c0bd02cb3e5fbff390a2b","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","start":38.54,"end":45.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-4","text":"そう？じゃあ、次は社内会議に向けて、企画書の修正が必要ね。調査結果を反映させて、販売対象を明確に。","textVersion":"sha256:0104a97acdc0dbfaa7b88324b54626eb9f70d7136c0e18725de2d3dc607f962b","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","start":46.12,"end":56.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-5","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","start":57.68,"end":58.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-6","text":"会議で企画が通ったら試食会を行って、対象者の生の声も聞いてみましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:b8843c4d4c4e1da892304b87f913519c0e9c5f4210a36c6f1dd2a595c5b0bb26","audioVersion":"sha256:2db23588a58ac7149f6a261c1347fcf7a946df340e114eb69716fc611b8ef555","timelineVersion":"sha256:1829930360432b3c687f82e23129d667caa22360bd658ac0eb6a27eb08343393","start":58.76,"end":64.28,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9af8d921ecf52c98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:question","text":"四番：男の学生が女の先生にゼミの発表テーマについて相談しています。男の学生はどのテーマで発表しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b1f5b4a6207025e25483f425ab8b6353872dd13f0a7ae7272a4bb54235259dc5","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","start":3.56,"end":15.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-0","text":"来月ゼミの発表がまわってくるんですが、テーマをどうしようか、迷っているんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:afa1d03bf89b4217376c1f25d0a3fb8f127d016877f698e064fde6a6f47c323f","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","start":17.08,"end":23.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-1","text":"確か教育政策に興味があるんだったわね。","textVersion":"sha256:fe2c48006abba5fc09baf1eaa74fb990935ee780908c90d410b8ef608a8619f4","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","start":24.02,"end":28.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-2","text":"はい、それで、「教育政策と経済効果」という新聞記事を見つけたので、それを取り上げたいと思うんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:553e8e50201fe3d867cd0e0194b73a2334cb67eaf4c2ae28886afa3392955464","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","start":28.02,"end":37.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-3","text":"なかなか面白そうなテーマね。でも、まず、教育政策自体について調べる必要があるわね。日本の教育政策について調べて、それから、いくつかの国と比較したら。例えば、アメリカ、ヨーロッパ、アジアから数か国ピックアップして。","textVersion":"sha256:91afda5837a4553a2f35925b2be2791cafd2c4288ee34b03f31d1bc5e80561f9","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","start":37.16,"end":58.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-4","text":"うーん...国際比較ですか。やってみたいですが、難しそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:267e333ee866330fa3894c6e385e0da49e9b94209c88b8b971b8c6ee190eada3","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","start":59.84,"end":66.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-5","text":"そう？じゃあ、まず、今の日本の問題点を調べて、解決策についても検討してみましょうか。本当は過去の流れも踏まえてと言いたいところだけど、今回は時間もないし。","textVersion":"sha256:85ea15951c7a95958d00fadaa64b4c3b80f2571ce339db3f90c7f05cc641781f","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","start":66.42,"end":81.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:4:line-6","text":"わかりました。がんばります。","textVersion":"sha256:55667edd261a1edfda3a7f82e724c1264d209b5e4e57c7e712bc45eacdaf926f","audioVersion":"sha256:29a4747a4c73e8549ae488488b66d11a5a1a457ab27ebde9a2e3efa987557d1f","timelineVersion":"sha256:7aac934e2782b889ce32158660df6c221500f1ee6c4297e900599fc9c01ca6a5","start":81.74,"end":84.14,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"9af8d921ecf52c98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d66b8eae28ca67340e18714bf6257fed6aba73e2c0de8435fc35dcb5472ee99d","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf13d5679a8d6f1ecb04d2f518459db451bb4e8dd07060faac03cbc1016cb6e0","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:question","text":"五番：会社で社員がボランティア活動について説明しています。新入社員はこれから何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:45d8f805c4a0ea650bfa0a5cac278e6e08814e6e2aabe18d8ec75e7eb6c5824b","audioVersion":"sha256:d66b8eae28ca67340e18714bf6257fed6aba73e2c0de8435fc35dcb5472ee99d","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf13d5679a8d6f1ecb04d2f518459db451bb4e8dd07060faac03cbc1016cb6e0","start":3.4,"end":15.46,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-0","text":"ええ、今日のボランティア活動は地域の清掃活動です。新入社員には商店街の清掃を担当してもらいます。所属している課とは関係なく動きますから、注意してください。","textVersion":"sha256:ea7e33f225e6e0844249f70d039c858d9698321bb4ae149ff84953349f84a2dd","audioVersion":"sha256:d66b8eae28ca67340e18714bf6257fed6aba73e2c0de8435fc35dcb5472ee99d","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf13d5679a8d6f1ecb04d2f518459db451bb4e8dd07060faac03cbc1016cb6e0","start":16.96,"end":31.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-1","text":"ええ、それ以外の人は課ごとに動きます。経理課と営業課は、ここから駅までの道の清掃です。","textVersion":"sha256:242f368bbbc036ea3a4308cb7b6096d5f97cd77b54644d89f1ff0687deacebde","audioVersion":"sha256:d66b8eae28ca67340e18714bf6257fed6aba73e2c0de8435fc35dcb5472ee99d","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf13d5679a8d6f1ecb04d2f518459db451bb4e8dd07060faac03cbc1016cb6e0","start":32.68,"end":40.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-2","text":"集まったゴミは総務課が回収して回ります。","textVersion":"sha256:411dd352db1bb2a5d2187477a6e96d8f5142db9437b319abbbb6e10f76f189d3","audioVersion":"sha256:d66b8eae28ca67340e18714bf6257fed6aba73e2c0de8435fc35dcb5472ee99d","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf13d5679a8d6f1ecb04d2f518459db451bb4e8dd07060faac03cbc1016cb6e0","start":41.68,"end":44.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:5:line-3","text":"皆さん、清掃用具は駐車場に用意してありますから、各自取りに行ってください。ただし、商店街については、商店街の皆さんのご好意で清掃用具をご提供いただけますので、持っていく必要はありません。","textVersion":"sha256:6b37d4e0327bfbda905869643f3e37543cf0cccf90c33d5b1dbb96ef407dde0e","audioVersion":"sha256:d66b8eae28ca67340e18714bf6257fed6aba73e2c0de8435fc35dcb5472ee99d","timelineVersion":"sha256:cf13d5679a8d6f1ecb04d2f518459db451bb4e8dd07060faac03cbc1016cb6e0","start":45.82,"end":62,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"9af8d921ecf52c98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2010.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2010.html"],"batch":"n1-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:question","text":"六番：電話で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこのあとすぐどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5affea56c0b954ed538e70e4ab3fa44f5e91a878dbd3c68d1fad7f0b72a164a4","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":3.3,"end":12.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-0","text":"はい、もしもし。","textVersion":"sha256:30b00b7238bf0aec2a6ea6afa3806078ed3641f25492df635e132a6e70ce2cfb","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":14.54,"end":15.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-1","text":"お疲れ様です。リンです。","textVersion":"sha256:7a373de59aa85aef66417869e8f923e31f028c64c95188fddddc553716e35ca7","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":16.44,"end":18.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-2","text":"あ、お疲れ様です。","textVersion":"sha256:42e33d072fda44b81b72b3b19ed6371c15d13672436c4f69d3a10eb90830b062","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":18.1,"end":19.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-3","text":"あのう、桜電気との打ち合わせは無事終わったんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:42b8479cb17065ebd829fa3b03d11a0c577d1f612720f2f43345b30323b467ea","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":19.52,"end":24.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-4","text":"どうした？","textVersion":"sha256:18d162531d5f9652f5090e392594e21551e1fc20748023a27800d522426cc30b","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":25.36,"end":26.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-5","text":"実は、今まだ山川駅にいるんです。電車が止まってまして。","textVersion":"sha256:09cd74a50572025199729b6af93f74940ec3180fd1b6aca137ee2d769871c94c","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":26.62,"end":32.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-6","text":"そっか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6512789ed6959f2b08585c5a20526d51e9036dcbf9c8d6ea1f7db766be59607","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":32.56,"end":33.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-7","text":"復旧に２時間はかかるとのことで、予定より社に戻るのがだいぶ遅れそうなんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:d055c3d83db8b7b2b732c3019e0744a07de8f3c99c099e566538e72a8f21c560","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":34.14,"end":40.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-8","text":"そうか。帰ってきたら一緒に次の取引先に行ってもらおうと思っていたんだが。","textVersion":"sha256:ec4b95b0eaa6f9ff0a7f64f9430ac40858b0f87110a87dbf61f8f658759f1fa3","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":41.28,"end":47.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-9","text":"すみません。","textVersion":"sha256:ad69bc14be090d150d7b49223533c91ec92ca9c4aa3f7dc8de76a9eae85afbb0","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":47.28,"end":48.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-10","text":"まあ、駅で待ってるのも何だな。そういえば、そっちの方の取引先を田中が回っているはずだから。","textVersion":"sha256:04444da5879112d0a613645def70b8471395aafd468f14075581cb83dd50c664","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":49.54,"end":56.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-11","text":"あっ、そうなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:c90260c68f1b3a2327659ecc4256ebce262cd0defb76c0b57a4e18a88306ea58","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":56.62,"end":58.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-12","text":"今日は予定を変えて田中と合流してくれ。携帯の連絡先、わかるな。","textVersion":"sha256:049354bb0aa938197d2b2c9da375e842373f4eaa68febad2b302bea4422b8f10","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":58.98,"end":64.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2010-12:6:line-13","text":"はい、わかります。ご迷惑をお掛けします。","textVersion":"sha256:83ed0810f0f65499e42d21c0286faff3f58ae4b054709ccfd0748f745593ce4e","audioVersion":"sha256:6aaad9ca6a8ca98e70b29cc0556236f5ff8007a88d3da519da7ddb6547cb016a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b80b0c54b82cc7e84496e6754389aa526256f765281354cf0abfb55ba3d431aa","start":64.48,"end":67.84,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9af8d921ecf52c98"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:question","text":"一番：大学で男の留学生と先生が話しています。男の留学生はこの後何をしなければなりませんか？","textVersion":"sha256:45ed587edfed608536538b9c079e5f0f90f0cdbcccc7c567e054f3eda0f37883","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":3.54,"end":14.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-0","text":"先生、先日お渡しした論文ですが、いかがでしたか？","textVersion":"sha256:a33417792d24aeee559a667cc38535b3dc1d64b8c5d0fe88623823f87095bfdd","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":16.48,"end":21.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-1","text":"ああ、見ましたよ。前回見たときは研究の背景のところが不十分だったけど、そこは今回だいぶ良くなったんじゃないかしら。","textVersion":"sha256:d17ecf09148e0ea2bb7c049dfaf02992ffc88eb3a9ed2855db8b9867ebaf5d08","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":21.6,"end":31.46,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-2","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":31.52,"end":32.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-3","text":"研究の背景が上手くまとまったからだと思いますけど、研究目的も前の原稿より明確になったと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:8b8fc0357d96d5840edffa4f66f1ce5d88eec74511f1d33d1061d3aeb3371242","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":32.74,"end":40.58,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-4","text":"あっ、そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:f05c212968cd004cc88337946f60f51b5ac3ca32d2ccb29d79f4719614bb9f53","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":41.04,"end":42.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-5","text":"でも、この調査の結果の所、もう少し効果的に示せるようにデータを図やグラフで表したらどうかしら？","textVersion":"sha256:aeaa6f7da54610b8e0c417c0b368a971b8fb3d6f5f4d7ecde717bbc78ca488b5","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":42.8,"end":51.32,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-6","text":"ああ、なるほど。そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:e8193c815f22731dfe90a2c729a541a2abe853aacd30b3157cc7e61fc87735d0","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":51.26,"end":54.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-7","text":"そうした方が説得力が増すと思いますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a3662e834312c6021715ab492227096e72f831364809e913d65fa875c80f7150","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":54.56,"end":57.42,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-8","text":"わかりました、やってみます。それから、前回ご指摘を受けた日本語の文法的な間違いについては？","textVersion":"sha256:d21d17643c64ef4b81c7a6f06207be7ba36bd045b6fe9a98622a72c78490e521","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":57.36,"end":65.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-9","text":"ああ、今回は特に気になりませんでしたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:25d8664c424dd4e76834867fae2dbec664f6b1a65f624f899162b4260d50c71d","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":65.1,"end":69.1,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-10","text":"あっ、そうですか。じゃあ、すぐに修正します。","textVersion":"sha256:af15d19596800882d0c8e70d4a0d6fe612473040f0fbce86596c8a146a6a9b23","audioVersion":"sha256:2b2ae84c0fe4b0465a649ef4acb2dbdfc516bfd2eaa46ba6a98d617f51a4c9e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:413934b765ae507be30b784ecf8e3f0397770ef484845d634a2abc4c7d731093","start":69.04,"end":73.2,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"b58561be02a88486"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:question","text":"二番：女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はどうしますか？","textVersion":"sha256:0a75f1a684d0aad4b22accfa462ff6c79b6bb60beb95636620a1749cf7cac308","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":3.6,"end":11,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-0","text":"部屋の観葉植物、なんか元気ないんだあ。","textVersion":"sha256:8c0a8d1639334e9e36a693bf708aceec91a1d28a2874c8c168c4d3259d9ada0d","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":12.4,"end":16.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-1","text":"えっ、ちゃんと水やってる？","textVersion":"sha256:ad3b4fe8f759e4fadb8adc7c17a17e3095b13c187918041839e6afa4bd98e20a","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":16.26,"end":18.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-2","text":"それが、すぐ忘れちゃって、気がついたら、土がからからってことよくあるんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:d1f6089f119bc4f0d8f6028230da53a1b32d298925476cb589dbfa84c3e9cf6c","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":18.36,"end":24.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-3","text":"あのさ、この前ニュースでやってたんだけど、ある大学の研究で、名前を付けて育てた牛と、名前がないまま育てた牛のミルクの出方を調べたら、そしたら、名前を付けた方がミルクの出方がよかったんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:cbc5920edfade7cd7194097ed9cab4ce3f4ffa7fb7cc17e88aec336def82b59c","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":24.64,"end":40.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-4","text":"は？","textVersion":"sha256:cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":41.28,"end":41.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-5","text":"名前を付ければ愛着が増して、いろいろ世話をするようになるからって。そうすると、牛のストレスが減って、ミルクの出方もよくなったってわけ。","textVersion":"sha256:76e62758332f389b7577be3b87f749d052ca4d4596b8492586e6aff734517e27","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":42.24,"end":52.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-6","text":"ふーん。","textVersion":"sha256:0570c75d174cbfee5aca29c4f21283c344c6a23fb8b525bc148fda2d4410dc32","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":52.78,"end":53.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-7","text":"だから、君もやってみたら？","textVersion":"sha256:9698c04c83f067ba758343cbd45ffede320be93d47b475a2d8b98e2ef2354669","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":53.62,"end":55.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-8","text":"えっ、牛を飼うの？","textVersion":"sha256:b81012395ea9358d5a51a661ea6af8b24562f3c32061a16d319813b3ed434104","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":55.58,"end":58.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-9","text":"名前だよ。すぐ忘れちゃうんでしょ。水やるの。","textVersion":"sha256:f57dfd9a7a81d63861ed88bbe3ad170b9eb5b84cee806573a288f7c41d076e24","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":58.04,"end":62.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-10","text":"あーあ、牛と植物は違う気もするけど、面白いね。やってみよう。","textVersion":"sha256:314cb00b9cd24d67152c54186164ae206d4bae5d145646bf79006f6cf50c362a","audioVersion":"sha256:f2723b80f7bb8176d37890e545a81007b7d0b0ceb027abfedcd26a30ec3b9f5a","timelineVersion":"sha256:a414b969175cfd5df44cd10247c16a860b093a267b777192605215fd173b5169","start":62.06,"end":68.68,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"b58561be02a88486"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:question","text":"三番：大学で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はこの後、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e130aba7b04b2bdab62a9de1634ce67c4eb397c4bc7b9c4eee635e34778c0a00","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":3.74,"end":14.7,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-0","text":"あのう、先輩、来週の研究発表のことで、相談があるんですが...","textVersion":"sha256:521a53f44350951d5152fa1eda0bab0a799443a112a71ac452f5990296bff381","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":16.18,"end":21.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-1","text":"ん？どうしたの？配布資料がまだできてないとか？","textVersion":"sha256:26ad3007ca9960ceab85ac09a5302548d5ab03465e056d34e2ac3218438acd06","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":22,"end":25.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-2","text":"いえ、それは昨日、何とか。実は僕、すぐにあがってしまうんで、発表が不安で。","textVersion":"sha256:4c1a73d269bf9ed118dc709e8441026d125b61a4819f93404e4d6f3be1572bdb","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":25.92,"end":34.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-3","text":"そんなの、だれだって緊張するもんよ。とにかく、何回も練習して、自信つけるしかないんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:d72717e2fec7598c4e5dba16231cd23bfb0535df92d1286f6235e7f68d064fe0","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":34.48,"end":42.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-4","text":"それが、原稿を暗記するくらい練習したんですが、本番では頭が真っ白になりそうで。","textVersion":"sha256:e1de783ec5d8cbe44689fa188678cf3cc411478c46efdab1962d6276741cff32","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":42.22,"end":49.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-5","text":"まあ、原稿を読んでもいいんだから、完璧に覚えなくてもいいって。それより質疑応答でどんな質問が出るか予想して、シュミレーションしておいたほうがいいかもね。","textVersion":"sha256:a1d6867802c457e19d38ef572e5d4e6c24b1d638dd8a2c48bcf96431cc5ac810","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":49.72,"end":60.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-6","text":"そっか。とっさに答えるのは難しいですもんね。うわあ、ますます緊張してきた。","textVersion":"sha256:d8d4bacbffad2983d9f3b18842fee2f1c07cb2cf3795f43e95e34d087f517fef","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":60.68,"end":68.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-7","text":"大丈夫。自分の研究テーマについては、自分が一番よくわかってるんだから。","textVersion":"sha256:ab83b445eea87f2f84f35465e7191e6f3c93ee95add8e62a65b508ef814f4750","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":69.08,"end":74.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-8","text":"はい。じゃあ、さっそく、対策を練っておきます。","textVersion":"sha256:51d429dee0db508285138aa522ec6ad11b3b5d6f2018586b6840f0afb10d6909","audioVersion":"sha256:987a210d1505353f5f977a45723cdba2d152c90776e16014767678f79fa9bf56","timelineVersion":"sha256:425d02e1baaa0988ef27b5258cd49f9fb73be481fdd4bb75fbb512f7d7899f6a","start":74.06,"end":77.9,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"b58561be02a88486"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:question","text":"四番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:7cacbd9d00e75a4de84e3ed46134cbace4d5b4f851cb1d814121635b0ec2f764","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":3.78,"end":14.6,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-0","text":"田中さん、ちょっといいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:602753707bf2e4994b80f741db32c96b3acb368d59cfa4e1b4c71e281fa779ca","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":16.06,"end":18.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":18.06,"end":18.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-2","text":"今度の展示会の件なんだけど、会計課から、明日の朝までにもっと詳しい資料を出せって言われてるんだ。それでねー、悪いんだけど、とりあえず資料を至急作ってくれないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:da3b8609f988b324e1fc219dd596b67348b16411487fd5eaf54f1f153b35d35c","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":19.18,"end":32.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-3","text":"はい、分かりました。これは、先週の打ち合わせの記録を元に作成すればよろしいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:24d1399c7ad98de38dbc9a22b4d9180af1ef0832181e23772a6332a7cee8b4a9","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":32.66,"end":39.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-4","text":"うん、そうだね。具体的なこともほとんど決まったから。それを反映させて。","textVersion":"sha256:55506a57da232adb93e8f040495aae02946b9e310c5b5bc1aeb51ef452ea75e9","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":39.5,"end":44.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-5","text":"はい、分かりました。あのう、何時までに...","textVersion":"sha256:83d89e30d64e00f2e3d850a228d6b08ad5b2d07ab01b9f5d77f2a37b886f5e72","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":44.92,"end":49.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-6","text":"５時くらいまでに頼めるかなあ。今朝頼んだ仕事のほうはおいといてもらってもいいし、ほかの人に引き継いでもらってもいいから。","textVersion":"sha256:996d37b1d38fabfd8d4ebdb247184267f131b9ec4cb8375b38c6623994d19076","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":49.34,"end":57.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-7","text":"そうですか。でも、ほかの人に頼むと、かえって時間がかかると思いますので、後でやります。","textVersion":"sha256:5281a2a010cb04f09d4ce7997a382d65c09c6e127e0d3426d91961ba610ebfc5","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":57.6,"end":65.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-8","text":"じゃあ、悪いけど、頼むよ。","textVersion":"sha256:36abd4ae99d8876b979755c1b92cf98e98a76a1f9afbef874a9f39e0571b76b4","audioVersion":"sha256:bc3a18473bc77d43cddc70220a9cd087179ed7c987ea82e6698eee50db941f32","timelineVersion":"sha256:b616bc734480d3c837b5c790ef52fb4a1c9f240c0a3a6a41ff495f3de8c338b5","start":65.84,"end":67.66,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"b58561be02a88486"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:question","text":"五番：レストランで店員と店長が話しています。店員はこの後すぐ、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f5005c2a1ce01a3bffccc099e51b75c2cb99c9612072513039a79be652efcf4c","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":4.46,"end":14.26,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-0","text":"あのう、店長、申し訳ありません。コーヒーをお客様のコートにこぼしちゃったんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:b702c35ccc96cf6fe7b1b07f56d46c07bf6ec629bf35d817895b31dac229c7e5","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":15.9,"end":21.64,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-1","text":"えっ？！ちゃんと、お詫びした？","textVersion":"sha256:91c5b64aa24222260fe29881e70b4b27d842d739988d0bb3a8ef41f62ffd257a","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":21.58,"end":23.98,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":23.92,"end":24.42,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-3","text":"で？コートはちゃんとお拭きした？","textVersion":"sha256:2bbdf4647250ac4a6d93369829922ceecd13bc94619ba4a7cad1a968d1ff2b5c","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":24.36,"end":26.82,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-4","text":"はい。濡らしたタオルで。ただ、コーヒーだからシミになりそうで...","textVersion":"sha256:1c9108eef00256f217d675c5c76f0497e0c4fb4c6a05f7c5d0415b1e3cf829a3","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":26.76,"end":31.56,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-5","text":"そう...。できれば、こちらでコートをお預かりしたいところだけど、今日は寒いしねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:b3e3f6f21745f05bccedebb5213299b008cd976f6397db47c9591771c4503daf","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":31.5,"end":37.6,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-6","text":"はい...","textVersion":"sha256:105ccdce87513cac6efd11f079cfe0288e1b6072529e1af564b37130c06b0ef6","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":37.54,"end":38.36,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-7","text":"じゃあ、クリーニング代、後で請求していただきましょう。もし落ちなかったら、弁償ってこともあるし、連絡先だけは、忘れずにお尋ねしてね。","textVersion":"sha256:9f03d1d56cee158177b681257349130c9d9bff4e1a9bd0d3d62961d6c935f920","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":38.58,"end":48.68,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-8","text":"あっ、はい。すみません。僕、後で払います。","textVersion":"sha256:84a8e92724802e41f5a147e4f733a054ad5ec9e5d364ada2aeb3600051d413c6","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":48.62,"end":52.2,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-9","text":"いいのよ、それはお店がするから。さあ、早く。お客様がお帰りになる前に、お願いしますね。私もすぐに謝りに行きますから。","textVersion":"sha256:218ac6b9252de2ce9f9415f7c8af0c928894654e27fb23ac8803756bddf601c3","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":52.14,"end":61.56,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-10","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6c81ac771f81108a3ad1933fefb7ad2a1ebabb2771644caef43dfb69d0645bba","timelineVersion":"sha256:f4a1e0529aa9076059be28575ffb4204232b5a0a13e6835ce34af4255b574a58","start":61.5,"end":62.2,"speaker":"店員"}],"batchVersion":"b58561be02a88486"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:question","text":"六番：男の人が、プリンターの修理センターに電話しています。男の人は、プリンターと一緒に、何を送らなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:237436ada084c269927f5a231cfb5add9bfd09f3deeb5a07f6a8843c1bbf7c59","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":4.04,"end":15.6,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-0","text":"はい、修理センターでございます。","textVersion":"sha256:9875b9953752a7d41aff87832acdd95a07792b3e371a6c8b070ea4b26dc6c053","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":22.5,"end":24.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-1","text":"あのう、すみません。そちらのプリンターのS100を使っているんですが......","textVersion":"sha256:a1305481fcaaa44766b8045a7e9ab2cc6ca6fb64c61bab8084d5c3896f54664d","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":24.88,"end":30.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-2","text":"あっ、小さいタイプのものですね。どのような状態でしょうか？","textVersion":"sha256:78f0f0c3a48af3730af246167f2de7957a38f90b3a8dfbaf212dfbda17c99ccc","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":30.42,"end":35.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-3","text":"新しいインクを入れても、インク交換を知らせる赤いランプがずっと点滅していて、全然印刷できないんです。","textVersion":"sha256:7c021b6592ec862024296173ddc7187957c099264d70921aa666d2d8e47e4053","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":35.38,"end":42.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-4","text":"そうですか。一年の保障期間内でしたら、無料で修理いたします。その場合は、保証書をお送りいただくことになりますが。","textVersion":"sha256:e24fc4c3b8022023dae82be38493a5eb2313656da530b19399e5fc4212af4b9f","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":42.94,"end":52.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-5","text":"ああ、ええと、一年ちょっとになりますね。でも半年くらい前にも同じ状態になって修理してもらってて、その時の修理記録もありますけど。","textVersion":"sha256:17307ef1eccaf5477b71bc3eaaed75da00a70176736eacbdcfcf9e4cd76c74ee","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":52.08,"end":63.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-6","text":"大変申し訳ございません。それでは、無料で修理させていただきますので、保証書をお送りください。","textVersion":"sha256:11e251f947b08bcfa51d00bee28896a215e65589619ce4bb91d9deb48a162c38","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":64.08,"end":71.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-7","text":"じゃあ、お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:89473f8bde1a264e919118cd6a5e8a639b1bbbbdb4c4986c308f8d0555126112","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":71.2,"end":72.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-8","text":"それから、説明書の最後にある修理依頼書をご記入の上、プリンターと一緒にお送りください。","textVersion":"sha256:7be10a8061557c6a09dc253f00f0f17a8183d67f2ff2f57baccc76a7ec23492f","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":73.08,"end":79.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-9","text":"修理記録も送ったほうがいいですか？","textVersion":"sha256:4342c84a49ab511d5b12127627966dd94f0420a117ef7f998979a756571c6936","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":80.12,"end":82.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-07:6:line-10","text":"それは、こちらに記録がありますので、結構です。","textVersion":"sha256:88aeb558205e4254f3f03cdfb0d9bf8a3a283baac836123c2a822957b371862e","audioVersion":"sha256:97bbbe5529dadff826a423dd0711ab7618b70ca84f96a9564e4f99004f26f535","timelineVersion":"sha256:a736f198db2d6c5f36d43b41e5a779cd1996993ac2ebc0893d7b4b58d299d649","start":83,"end":85.9,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"b58561be02a88486"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:question","text":"一番：花屋で男の人と店員が話しています。男の人はこれから花の世話をどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d325f76a2ace03929d4d525167ab968aa131670f76335ff79ebdc3d673ccbb2c","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":3.54,"end":13.56,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-0","text":"ちょっとすみません。２ヶ月ぐらい前にこれと同じ花を買ったんですけど。寒くなってきたらなんだか元気がなくなっちゃって、冬の間はどうしたらいいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:e0a73c5420b40e084acd400a8deb024897f7f4998d3e5da09c57843d85b12fbf","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":15.14,"end":27.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-1","text":"ああ、この花は日当たりのいいところに置いとかないと、すぐ弱っちゃうんです。","textVersion":"sha256:a62041a1f7423f1c4a34abd714b54c2a61e9ad01f5c8d56743b2491c433f7dbf","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":28.08,"end":33.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-2","text":"窓際の日当たりのいいところに置いてるんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:c7ae30c9c388de4dfa7240ca5d36c8638b05da8037dc0ca37e1a4ea8f1dfd335","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":33.5,"end":36.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-3","text":"そうですか。水は、足りてますか。","textVersion":"sha256:2b7402fc14f4fa85fd0d72540c69d59f66bd4eb853f8f77dce9b66f5eb09693f","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":36.32,"end":40.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-4","text":"はい。毎日欠かさずやってます。","textVersion":"sha256:812483bebb851ab9437f1fd56c910e294e35a6ffc2b145aa3976f65608859c4c","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":40.2,"end":43.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-5","text":"そうですか。もう少し控えたほうがいいかもしれませんね。かえって根っこが腐っちゃうことがあるんですよ。肥料はどうされてますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f6839db7707b4a65dabd3edfaedca2398a7d94389a6dbbe37ce6582cfb7160c5","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":43.06,"end":53.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-6","text":"１ヶ月に１回あげてるんですけど、もっと増やしたほうがいいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:8ed7cf2cacbee24a1044e6a896a3ea9ef4ea41f38eb00b2a031ccbd77698d818","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":54.02,"end":59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-7","text":"ううん、とりあえず様子を見てください。","textVersion":"sha256:f032f124164751535dee9f5335c98ad57ce8fb7a33f50b92b9477cb7d707d265","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":58.94,"end":63.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-8","text":"そうですか。わかりました。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:d1fb099e23d30b698326260df0892e14af54023001905b21c3683633689928df","audioVersion":"sha256:e9675fd0aa6c75ca2e3cee00acaf9413b71c48d8602968e39b489d7d046490a9","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d8eeb8be108118e3bed9aadee493ccdc5b9d5ce62664ff66f36c5fc75c35d19","start":63.18,"end":67.62,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"f9129107ef20c9b7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:question","text":"二番：男の人と女の人がボランティアの清掃活動について話しています。女の人はこの後何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:01803094ed77dc823cd54c816060297b18dfc681e50fcc98e4abc8905b4ec735","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":3.9,"end":15.72,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0","text":"来月の駅前のボランティア清掃、そろそろ準備を進めていきましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:a2a8b897f0fd82d8046cd1c448664b8fbbd353bab89ee3628de79a97de9c1874","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":17.24,"end":22.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-1","text":"はい。もうごみ袋は十分揃ってますし、清掃用具は、いつものように皆さんに持参してもらうことになってますから。","textVersion":"sha256:9120fc3352f591506d270dc9407e8061da783677bf08811e89e26b20707245cf","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":22.5,"end":31.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-2","text":"ボランティアの皆さんには掃除用具のことも連絡してあるんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:c49b4fc4af6a3457557765ded7d9cbddc439f9fac1231242ea4ff121abbec787","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":31.1,"end":35.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-3","text":"えっと、いつものことなので、特に連絡は... 清掃日時や当日のごみの分別方法は、念のため、直前にお知らせを配るつもりなんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:5a398700dde177614dbc9662f6d19ce9a1e4c98a8b4b44821689099dc63aa200","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":35.48,"end":46.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-4","text":"うん。掃除用具、足りないと困るので、連絡するに越したことはないですね。その情報も入れときましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:3de87380d6e6be3ba4dc727bf3aa0c0e00a893c9e80e664667f533d9dd9b73fa","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":46.92,"end":56.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-5","text":"そうですね。わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:a9595529f2d0c28135d966ec081c4554fe2cdf3528f6e89085a1c0c3dd2902e3","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":57.06,"end":58.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-6","text":"お願いします。あっ、役所にゴミ回収の依頼はしていただけましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:53d7bc502fbdfdf21440b476c562ea243f7edf60b9bdaaafa40bfba74b47c842","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":58.64,"end":64.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-7","text":"あっ、それは済んでます。","textVersion":"sha256:d1381420a21e784beb1a3734a49e72b63bd74303a7d7f686d4fd451cd5673bb3","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":64.24,"end":66.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-8","text":"ありがとうございます。助かります。","textVersion":"sha256:ec57b484351baea93583b983f747fce594f3143170e349524075453ad53b559e","audioVersion":"sha256:2a7b20c8e3e3aac7f824cee535aeb43144b930ba286081bd1326b2a9ef68c5a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:6950457e50b8e8d1bd1fa0f5aac4bc8bc86f7bedf0db34e6cadc53622f4ec9a6","start":66.08,"end":68.38,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"f9129107ef20c9b7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:question","text":"三番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人は商品について何を検討しなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:8987a4ee2d2b6f1f113bd408aa336c3a7fd544a4f1bc81f26fd889684900d3d4","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":3.48,"end":14.5,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-0","text":"うちのチョコレートクッキー、来年で発売３０年なんだよなあ。このあたりでせっかくだから、改めて注目してもらえるような企画できないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:1a9a74e95fa68d95e1b1f5e276f0b1a51d1a4a2c8ee56476b7f1dbd87aaf53fe","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":16.06,"end":27.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":29.2,"end":29.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-2","text":"パッケージのデザインを大幅に変えてみるというのも一つの手だと思うが。","textVersion":"sha256:41cd3405fe54eb0bd9d59a66ad8752c4771ee1f81c70cab5a3115353e9898932","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":29.7,"end":33.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-3","text":"そうですね。ただ、デザインを大きく変えると、長年お買い求めいただいているお客には違和感があるかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:bb2a8d3442fbec1a4c125bfbd449ca7caa5537238c9ea0ec534123d40cc1093f","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":34.96,"end":42.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-4","text":"うん。そうか。となると、クッキーにかけるチョコレートクリーム、これに何か変化をつけられないもんかな。期間限定商品として、いつもと違うホワイトチョコレートを使ってみるとか。","textVersion":"sha256:051fe47dd4d59b3b9b7e56f83a170d067bc3cb7f0f97351045bea3a1fd102865","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":42.78,"end":59.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-5","text":"はい。これまで試作してきたものがいくつかありますので、その中から検討できます。","textVersion":"sha256:611dbea29325616fb4fc3365eb29166672c5ce3326ab9372a2bf18dfda451981","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":59.26,"end":64.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-6","text":"そうしてくれ。一箱あたりの量を増やすっていうのも考えたんだが、製造ラインやパッケージの関係があってなかなか難しいからなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:b1a17e2de74ea78edba32132cd593a722e1a6ac920d5106027af127766f7b9e8","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":65.26,"end":74.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-7","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":75.06,"end":75.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-8","text":"じゃあ、よろしく。期間限定だから、多少のコスト増は構わないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:fdafb8cdb71654b82999b67f6211338b1dd31eff97af493640f7499908b0956b","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":76.32,"end":81.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-9","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:20434356a87b621683b79dd4a72e3dc850a6b0c37dc703a241ce44f4cb76299e","timelineVersion":"sha256:788a63c1cc85cbd6e0b9766edcf52ac00506c31059ad341110e7c5546206f800","start":81.44,"end":82.56,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"f9129107ef20c9b7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:question","text":"四番：携帯電話の店で、女の人と店員が話しています。女の人は割引制度を受けるために、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:d0f03a2d11c52f34c46e42b7615cdf2321ac57644d1cf46fedde0ac7fb8cb090","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":3.8,"end":15.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0","text":"あのう、料金が半額になる割引制度ができたって聞いたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:5541253abb14a64588da1feb9fafc0e5f9c37745a315468a88d40e144c688ae6","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":19.9,"end":24.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-1","text":"はい。お客様は当社の携帯電話をお使いですか。","textVersion":"sha256:3ca773cd34a4d6681c0032602a2affd387b946cf684c2cedefecc55a26ee1a74","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":24.26,"end":28.96,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":28.9,"end":29.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-3","text":"ありがとうございます。ええ、新しい割引サービスでは、当社の携帯を続けてご利用いただくと、料金がお安くなります。お客様の場合ですと、今後さらに２年間の契約で、料金が半額になります。","textVersion":"sha256:5200e2e3205fac24ba721649c757db580597cc0e191b30c29dbcebede359f7cb","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":29.62,"end":45.46,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-4","text":"あっ、２年ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6626596471ddd0575deb09cb7679035a3581202d45b8b5ffee68f4737b7d90a","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":45.82,"end":47.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-5","text":"はい。はじめて当社を利用されるお客様ですと、１年の契約になるんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:8afb1966c2c2c2de44a5ac8eb80371f2031ad4f01f35f1b49316c030bdfd1953","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":47.18,"end":53.08,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-6","text":"ああ、そうなんですか。あのう、今使ってる携帯を途中で新しいのに買い替えても大丈夫ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:5a0a3b21e6f24a74528ccc5eab00c6d6911919f5963ea0ede1faf884364fa462","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":53.02,"end":61.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-7","text":"はい。機種の変更ですね。手数料を２０００円いただくことになりますが、変更は問題ありません。","textVersion":"sha256:2ba45f77e1ab0148c7066acf3e1b001fc0bd0c8f128900438075da41d4643c80","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":61.06,"end":69.08,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-8","text":"そうですか。それじゃ、申し込みます。","textVersion":"sha256:6055633bf3ceebe8e1eadb47b9793e90d222f2ecadb10e23a7add80518c21cac","audioVersion":"sha256:924ac9bf1143d94a4d7abce3975011574645202210f5df9745c28496467b1ec8","timelineVersion":"sha256:21fc022490a8aff02cd5f77cceb794c985a2a156bf1b14a194bd900697ccc36d","start":69.02,"end":72.34,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"f9129107ef20c9b7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2a4f540f9db743efc14ca38d0355c8a5b33c0b62142baf5420fe3899509cefa2","timelineVersion":"sha256:0967c93bcf9418297082b416ebfcc3c34c2e06ec0006570fa09d07040a430d87","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:question","text":"五番：農園で男の人が農業体験の参加者に話しています。参加者はこの後すぐ何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8ccc8d98605bcfd7a9049dd159f651442b1060c6d2e1a9fee947000529c53f4a","audioVersion":"sha256:2a4f540f9db743efc14ca38d0355c8a5b33c0b62142baf5420fe3899509cefa2","timelineVersion":"sha256:0967c93bcf9418297082b416ebfcc3c34c2e06ec0006570fa09d07040a430d87","start":4.18,"end":14.36,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-0","text":"おはようございます。今日の一日農業体験のスケジュールについてご説明します。","textVersion":"sha256:ffea5c8c6e00b3fbf7ae55f18078cf51d8918732fae949991621f92d04b17c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:2a4f540f9db743efc14ca38d0355c8a5b33c0b62142baf5420fe3899509cefa2","timelineVersion":"sha256:0967c93bcf9418297082b416ebfcc3c34c2e06ec0006570fa09d07040a430d87","start":15.76,"end":22.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-1","text":"ええ、皆さんに事前に配布しました案内では、午前中に畑で野菜の収穫、午後から牛の世話となっていました。それがですね、準備の都合で、午前と午後の作業を入れ替えて実施いたします。","textVersion":"sha256:574359ad4d35f3537ee9bd1fab73d6cff57992abb3eae6c968dca35a605d9fc9","audioVersion":"sha256:2a4f540f9db743efc14ca38d0355c8a5b33c0b62142baf5420fe3899509cefa2","timelineVersion":"sha256:0967c93bcf9418297082b416ebfcc3c34c2e06ec0006570fa09d07040a430d87","start":22.84,"end":40.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-2","text":"ええ、午前の作業が終わったら、この土地の名産や採りたての新鮮な野菜を使った料理を、地元農家の若手グループと一緒に作りたいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:2276b89c37b45e44be9de069d0414fcce85d77e0b9b5852286fa2148ddebf991","audioVersion":"sha256:2a4f540f9db743efc14ca38d0355c8a5b33c0b62142baf5420fe3899509cefa2","timelineVersion":"sha256:0967c93bcf9418297082b416ebfcc3c34c2e06ec0006570fa09d07040a430d87","start":40.36,"end":52.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-3","text":"昼食時には、彼らの最近の取り組みについて話を聞いていただければと思います。今日一日、よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:87175929ad8718bf48978122776cc57a0bdd70d7140d7618325b29b64398f6f3","audioVersion":"sha256:2a4f540f9db743efc14ca38d0355c8a5b33c0b62142baf5420fe3899509cefa2","timelineVersion":"sha256:0967c93bcf9418297082b416ebfcc3c34c2e06ec0006570fa09d07040a430d87","start":52.76,"end":62.52,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"f9129107ef20c9b7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2011.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2011.html"],"batch":"n1-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:question","text":"六番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人は来週、どんな仕事をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:2317ecb5c510f32feaa51b9e8bfea6efecda905c791654210c4244b7b753b603","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":4.12,"end":14.26,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-0","text":"ちょっといいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:638d02eb2ca4ab192b871640e2c995fe17628548e0401172df11507be1c54e88","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":15.8,"end":16.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":16.88,"end":17.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-2","text":"今やってくれてる川田電気との商品開発、どんな感じ。","textVersion":"sha256:3fdb147743c528615db590183d7f57c1de1b7b72595583d1185233ed2f1d2fa2","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":18.16,"end":23.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-3","text":"はい。先方と毎週会議をして、内容をつめているところです。何か...","textVersion":"sha256:6a91863108cf0c8754e3478fe2a92dd18fc6c4361c11be6b56d6627b6670f581","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":23.4,"end":30.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-4","text":"うん。実は今日、川田電気に行ってきたんだけどね。会議前とかなかなか君と連絡が取れないって言われてね。君には人事課の新人研修の準備も手伝ってもらってるけど、そっちが忙しいのかな。","textVersion":"sha256:4b346dd82e47534a2300ade6ad142e3ff16e7e068e12c52d66fb57cfdd2fb0fc","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":30.78,"end":47.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-5","text":"申しわけありません。今ちょうど新人研修のほうの打ち合わせが多くて、それに、今週は私が主任研修に出なきゃいけなかったので...","textVersion":"sha256:ca839b08274765e94dffec53b1744d5d883358c6f767d40b3d2947d09ce65e1d","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":47.68,"end":58.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-6","text":"ああ、そう。やっぱりなんだかんだ時間を取られるよなあ。それに、これから、製造部門に試作品を依頼したいって、忙しくなるだろうから、来週から当分人事課の仕事のほうははずしてもらおうか。僕から言っとくよ。","textVersion":"sha256:c1576ac9498e15ef570eebf57c093f00f6dd8ead77d415b2988ff816c90a643d","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":58.68,"end":75.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-7","text":"わかりました。ご配慮ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:97d7b3721d559776215e5a44dbdb778aa0f7dc1e9071dd2d0182d4f1720111d4","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":76.04,"end":79,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-8","text":"川田電気と商品の検討を十分してもらいたいからね。製造に話を持っていく前に。じゃあ、来週からはそういうことで、よろしく。","textVersion":"sha256:05ab5d1ee8b3ba463f604afad27ed4b2dfd5a1d3089a9d44007ae7ae248f6b07","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":79.62,"end":90.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2011-12:6:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:194b5f0f78aaf954dc6e5883c1c537d8de9256eccdf55678b6116d7a6b38feb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:95c3ab592803c34decc585597e81aaffa15854677be7588f6ca82db2a09d424d","start":90.96,"end":91.64,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"f9129107ef20c9b7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:question","text":"一番：病院で女の人が患者の男の人に薬について説明しています。男の人は今日の夜どの薬を塗らなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:79b40a30cde31168e3564aa5d88de988cfb266f031ac05509ce5ee198f856184","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","start":3.76,"end":18.04,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-0","text":"今日、お出しするお薬、こちらになります。","textVersion":"sha256:462f4a6cd7dd8e03dea99e8f51431bf1bac75e87580fa9d30861e3c18fc6bde7","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","start":19.48,"end":22.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","start":22.82,"end":23.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-2","text":"ちょっと多いので、ご説明しますね。えーと、痒いうちは朝と夜、この黒い容器の薬を塗ってから、白いほうの薬を塗ってください。 ただ今日はもうこの黒いのは塗ってありますので、今日の夜は塗らないで結構です。","textVersion":"sha256:ba316b4df72d621cc84710ad787163a829cfd43b2d7a41cb327f1b5363f13795","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","start":23.86,"end":43.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","start":43.7,"end":44.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-4","text":"それで、２、３日して、痒くなくなったら、白いのはやめて、この小さい容器の薬に切り替えてください。","textVersion":"sha256:ff9e4f78e73c9712e5ab548cb979f3d3c1a9504a494206fd402ea67082e8ea7f","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","start":44.94,"end":53.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-5","text":"黒いのは続けるんですね。","textVersion":"sha256:9286a5b6d6c25ca6c031e6e0f0bd57a7ccaf20019e2eb5a9bc371f89d412bafb","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","start":53.7,"end":55.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-6","text":"はい、二週間はやめないでください。","textVersion":"sha256:738b04246cc5a45992698adfc44e69244daabce1fa6ec65ef6888a36c05407a4","audioVersion":"sha256:adca3dfa87b668fed96f7b494f657eca9d46fb7eff3ec54968d0abe5f503b8b4","timelineVersion":"sha256:5842534a24c5ca1d6edef3b552d5fb10bd1df8f9641c3b55b84510ef39c0f96d","start":55.76,"end":59.04,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"56205f24a928ed9d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:question","text":"二番：男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はこの後どんな準備をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:866b9b7cfab2d88f49f1703db20c0135a0c3472137dd4780f0268b35aa2eb146","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","start":3.98,"end":14.12,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-0","text":"ねー、環境保護ボランティアのサークルに入ってるんだって。僕も何回やってみたいと思ってるんだけど、どんなことやってんの。","textVersion":"sha256:b6016799ed897159e7009350756eb9b838a0381a945bdec5731fd596c6ccfdd8","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","start":15.66,"end":23.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-1","text":"うん、いろいろ。あー、来週の日曜日、川の清掃活動があるから。来てみる？","textVersion":"sha256:6a56dc024b6d2d03189c07b690585b9b8503366b7d8f049452a4a7e9ab404d34","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","start":23.72,"end":30.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-2","text":"うん、行く行く。でも、いきなり行っていいの？事前に登録するとか、読んでおく資料とかないの？","textVersion":"sha256:2a9f7c606d2cc273a527ae0cf230d4de6ea856128612d997a9d4bb2bc72006e4","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","start":30.48,"end":37.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-3","text":"うーん。特に何も。当日集まったら、まずみんなでその川の生物について、簡単に説明を聞くの。で、その後、実際に川に入って、観察しながら、ゴミとか、空き缶とか拾うんだ。だから濡れてもいい靴で行ったほうがいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:9efaa4290ad023ded7f05511b21496d7493f37b5e562767b24b6b8c996b4bc90","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","start":37.88,"end":57.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-4","text":"じゃ、長靴かなんか買わなくちゃ。後、掃除するんだったら、ゴミ袋とか手袋も持っていったほうがいいよね。","textVersion":"sha256:2431199e1007f34145579069019d5e664da012c47bb5723c7af12dd1f52ec3a3","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","start":57.38,"end":65.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-5","text":"あ、そういうのはサークルのほうで用意するから、大丈夫だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d6669051527340542289eea1d441e1875f9139509100239ad73ee77e3dfc1e00","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","start":65.8,"end":70.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-6","text":"そうなんだ。どんな感じなんだろう。楽しみだな。","textVersion":"sha256:471cf7f80dce1935cedc0eba95e55e71b14db113d85d4fc88c4213397c5925ef","audioVersion":"sha256:bdfeec13ca5570366bb0d22096c5e0821293af30c4d9e117296d07b186205ec7","timelineVersion":"sha256:481b07596bab04c66cbc4567081dc3eda5ca84de32e8935d240e18b07e7df139","start":70.12,"end":73.84,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"56205f24a928ed9d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:question","text":"三番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人は翻訳のどの部分を直さなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:429703a34572005853adca1607ecd29cd16eef2449d0a8a6ddd71b14a26fe5f1","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":3.68,"end":14.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-0","text":"この間やってもらった経済記事の翻訳のことだけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:9d39df74b8bf5690d9cd5abd88ddc2ae6a6392a495405bf6fa0388dd2a0c9c9e","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":16.18,"end":20.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":20.24,"end":20.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-2","text":"全体的によくできてるよ。世界経済の動向っていう見出しもいいし、最初の分析の部分もとても読みやすいね。","textVersion":"sha256:dec2d4c44e313897a32ddce7339a346200ae614b5c1650d14f040ebacd81156f","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":21.2,"end":30.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-3","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":30.88,"end":31.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-4","text":"問題は政府の景気対策の箇所かな。気になったところに下線を引いておいたから、もう一度やってみてくれるかな。","textVersion":"sha256:d10a804d282b71aff44bafc398df5469474325ac7803762ad3032882f7658df3","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":32.3,"end":40.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-5","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":40.96,"end":42.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-6","text":"株価の予想のところは田中君に見てもらった？","textVersion":"sha256:59b2263c1f024cac9a98e2aab10c6a5c497e29a2fc5033f223fa6bd121eba9f8","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":42.56,"end":45.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-7","text":"はい。コメントいただいて、すでに修正してあります。","textVersion":"sha256:350f0f7d9418542fa07e7eadd7fc1829f3e5ecfbf88757c2b4e9e6666e43d7da","audioVersion":"sha256:8e49a67d2ccf9b4771a1ff452982f1016dd06a1d974267866beabec3a7080ad2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ca2b8f90ed538b7b9ab62dff066d55fad9789ec58a0dbbf7cf5d1f1a6de7afcb","start":45.54,"end":49.1,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"56205f24a928ed9d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:question","text":"四番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人は開発中の商品をどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:302a8f6b254b317fb4f4981acc87dcb07e203d7281c59f12ffdd189b70dd7d4c","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":4.32,"end":14.58,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-0","text":"部長、今度の春に発売するお弁当の試作品ができたんですが、ご意見をいただけますか？","textVersion":"sha256:8e2094fa3347b67bd529346d1d9e783d49635a1a182c7406000d60d891400324","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":16.02,"end":22.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-1","text":"うーん、見た目はカラフルで食欲をそそるわね。容器の色もなかなかいいじゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:fbb064106dc304b2a185f97947b4d9f12c41bceeec71edb4c2bb368f625347c5","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":22.84,"end":30.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-2","text":"はい、今回のターゲットは女性ということで、彩りを重視しました。","textVersion":"sha256:9d759005b24af27975376416c16263f8e862efa76638ea02a3b87e12d17689b9","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":30.82,"end":35.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-3","text":"確かに、野菜が豊富で女性受けしそうね。それぞれ一口サイズで女性向きだと思うわ。","textVersion":"sha256:f49c48a4404442166f938f900e9cc58d3520bacc74fc6cbe8931c6f17e2f3444","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":35.84,"end":43.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-4","text":"うちの女子社員にアンケートを取ったところ、少しずついろんな種類のものが食べたいという声が多かったので、品数を増やしました。","textVersion":"sha256:e468babb14902a35dcc9ff5fa46b6f4a637f1f882a4ce97b1442429faacf7153","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":43.22,"end":51.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-5","text":"うん、味付けにも変化があって、飽きが来ないわね。ただ、品数の分だけ、入れ物が大きくなってるわね。あんまり大きいと持ちにくくない？","textVersion":"sha256:e67f43a1d31c8260bcf70eedc05d2e6148b502b568e141d80926617856022c92","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":52.34,"end":64.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-6","text":"そうですか。じゃ、少しおかずの数を減らしたほうがいいでしょうか？","textVersion":"sha256:f53d85445084b79169336b367f7c07445753945903d9fe697a88e974b32bae22","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":64.62,"end":69.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-7","text":"うーん、そこはセールスポイントの一つだからね。味のバランスも変わるし。むしろ、外側を変えられない？例えば、箱を二段にして、ご飯を下の段に入れちゃうとかね。","textVersion":"sha256:8abb8846003c9f05924098ba734bc8cf025c4c53e939485a5ee3cc2a86872f8e","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":69.5,"end":84.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-8","text":"なるほど。そうすれば、おかずはこのまま全部見せられますね。わかりました。早速検討してみます。","textVersion":"sha256:5a26be1b3d1bf4331b3a5679a169fd124fef2a712447d2c7e34e6bd050966561","audioVersion":"sha256:bea1028ac6040e6588424202cef70e01c531219ea9ba5d4aeaf96e7e66390255","timelineVersion":"sha256:818a134fd2bbd7a7b7c47a4c8b9b385c035b09833dc3b86489ce54bf4c1354a6","start":85.1,"end":92.68,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"56205f24a928ed9d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:question","text":"五番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこの後すぐ何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5a0e207fbae90c0d10be970d1add34f11378095ac9cbb97ad3ad19ab9a4b21b4","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":4.04,"end":14.16,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-0","text":"部長、プレゼンで使う資料のコピーができました。会場に運んでおきましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6b5874f70859fd3e5d26624584fe2b0a1bdfb789f7f864da01079b108d1470b","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":17.64,"end":23.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-1","text":"あ、それなんだけど、実は今、いくつか間違いを見つけてね、訂正が必要になったんだ。せっかく作ってくれたのに、申し訳ないんだけど、作り直してもらえるかな。","textVersion":"sha256:c8eba94abb5f7dac9ce728f418f8026934336f617ed80e114c0b4b5c714c84ed","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":23.64,"end":36.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-2","text":"えっ？そうなんですか。わかりました。訂正するのはどの部分でしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:4aa6137fff2b9ee8171e7dc43de60bd999b54db4a807a7c9fabc9bdb9a35f023","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":36.84,"end":42.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-3","text":"赤ペンで書いたところ。うん、ちょっと待って、訂正するページがたくさんあるから。今から、資料を作り直して人数分コピーするじゃ、間に合わないかもしれないな。","textVersion":"sha256:2d695d2cbd6823fa73fe9359ec83b34014075219c096ff24855fbdfc1e66b3c7","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":42.04,"end":54.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-4","text":"そうですね。ちょっと厳しいかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:222fd5fa6e277e1a313dcc002e79edf4360840ffeb0a6ffe162ad757e60a0dcd","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":55.3,"end":59.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-5","text":"じゃ、訂正が必要な部分をリストにして一枚の紙にまとめて配ろうか。それならコピーも一枚ずつで済むから、時間に間に合うだろう。","textVersion":"sha256:9cf734c6b531e1f051b07bb4dd61b41fc5bbcec39b2dbbf0f4781e6a238299d8","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":60.66,"end":70.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-6","text":"はい、それでしたら、なんとかなると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:893f0e85301f53da5f66dbff0e55f8728eb885b74c5df686f2eccc292a52560a","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":70.58,"end":73.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-7","text":"ちょっと見栄えは良くないけど、いまある資料も処分しなくて済むしな。よし、そうしよう。僕は先に行って会場の準備をしておくから、悪いけど、資料のほうはお願い出来るかな？","textVersion":"sha256:01c90023bc0fbf177e723e19b0624995c9cd035f318ec074d80583f2f36ab6c1","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":73.78,"end":85.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-8","text":"はい、では、至急取り掛かります。","textVersion":"sha256:2e2f80fba6e304f4faca20e1c9eb09b6868965488c3dcb56222384bfa3464601","audioVersion":"sha256:9e248f83dc22b9ddf1871dffe720876e2836200cdb791aace93ec41a1033a094","timelineVersion":"sha256:b9f5baa167b294c4056d3ea1a780b53aa06edf977b7214f7ffd124728b1334e3","start":85.9,"end":89.08,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"56205f24a928ed9d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:question","text":"六番：先生と学生が卒業論文の目次を見ながら話しています。学生は論文のどの部分を書き直さなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:6b76ae62f5af5cee261252edb8ceacd28bf7cfc42bc852a1b9981b0fddd6bd8e","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":4.14,"end":16.92,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-0","text":"論文、読みましたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:31c1f97d28442b47ca57706cd4782a8f9965a31f9d575f711ccce86380451340","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":18.38,"end":20.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-1","text":"ありがとうございます。あの、どうでしょう。五章がちょっと気になるんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:0753b36eb503858b29784d59ac4ffae95fd8c65d7636ed785ae466ccaadb7704","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":20.5,"end":27.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-2","text":"大体いいんだけど。五章のまとめにもう少し自分の意見を書いたほうがよかったかな。本当はまとめって大事だから。もう少し丁寧に書かないといけないんだけど。今回はもう時間がないから、まあ、いいでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:0617695e28bf950ad9c6738047448141d08c26b32ab5dcc0ed045913b3323a74","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":27.74,"end":44.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":44.92,"end":45.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-4","text":"あと、１章の研究の背景だけど、これまでの研究について、ただ並べてあるだけで、読みやすいとは決して言えないですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:7fb05707dcc6f1a075d8badeac36e849739d491de4db8e43340cca5ce86488d6","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":46.3,"end":56.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-5","text":"あ、はい。すみません。","textVersion":"sha256:45ffaab0777ffa56cbc85998b25cd6c5bccb6fdc5c85fd9c09d1ba1c950aeec8","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":56.2,"end":58.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-6","text":"２章の研究の目的につながるようにそのあたりをわかりやすく書かないと。ここはちょっと手を入れたほうがいいと思います。あと一週間あるから。","textVersion":"sha256:42553d272fed7b032f6e608ebe7f94cf824fc1d7db8a426eb1a580d5556af884","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":58.94,"end":69.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":69.08,"end":70.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-8","text":"それから、分析結果は本当は項目ごとにもう少し深く分析するとよかったんだけど、まあ、これは今後の課題ということにしましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:cafb84e39e36278df223a5b8be064de99bb82a9664b606ae1f251df587d46a79","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":70.46,"end":81.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-07:6:line-9","text":"はい、わかりました。では、ご指摘いただいたところを書き直して、来週持ってきます。","textVersion":"sha256:78982bbcdf0e39eeb1b28b793ba3e6163b1b9bb3625caad965ca86002ae808b9","audioVersion":"sha256:f2eb45cc7236ecea07dadbf7a376f1a0fc9457680b8700c72c1cadb6253da360","timelineVersion":"sha256:add6866f036882574144c85a8da2e8cc67d0a84b6faf02a2e664c511302f03f4","start":81.54,"end":88.82,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"56205f24a928ed9d"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:question","text":"一番：大学の陸上部のコーチとキャプテンが話しています。キャプテンはリレーの順番をどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:2a36049f894ef31e828728cfee44fca5a3b0481270269b9597a29782932e0dd9","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":3.94,"end":13.36,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0","text":"田中、来週の試合で四人順番に走るリレーのことなんだが、選手選びを任せていたよな。決まったか。","textVersion":"sha256:592de517741f896c7dccdc81251eb7398e600c5adca684f29b917db0d7deecff","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":14.78,"end":23.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-1","text":"はい、コーチ。この四人に決めました。このメモ、見てください。","textVersion":"sha256:698348537886e88cd571c0b44e9baf9c058e932b394aa7d8e52c56ad4a384328","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":23.26,"end":27.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-2","text":"うんうん。","textVersion":"sha256:bb33c01591e5f7149c374a7ce748c61bbc3be4307b759fe4530d1b86fec15aba","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":28.24,"end":29.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-3","text":"順番はどうしましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:26c420947d2c198d6ba46bcdedd995bd6453a9b175c3fd827c7cb15943641236","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":29.22,"end":31.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-4","text":"一年生のキム、二年生の林、三年生の山川、田中か。田中、君はいつもどおり、最後を頼むよ。","textVersion":"sha256:cdfd27ea615becbe61d617c96f6212f5cd2e1fe24c31fe9bb65714785a3ac264","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":31.72,"end":41.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-5","text":"はい、わかりました。 私の前は、いつもどおり山川でいいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:8cc78b90a8d7fb0efc9df0c7116151d85a83fc6b91f793cb57c908f0014ad8a9","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":41.66,"end":46.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-6","text":"そうだな。あっ、ちょっと待てよ。最近、山川の調子がいいからなあ。今回はほかのチームとのレベルが拮抗してるから、スタートでリードできるように、山川を最初にしたらどうだ。","textVersion":"sha256:b57f77006b55deeb0df35524b9fb59fcdbc6bead0640b9edac141bb1b6cf704b","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":46.78,"end":60.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-7","text":"はい、次にキム、林でしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:e230d2e3828eb2deab56d8a093e609ef981ef0489fee3a52969611188c3364f6","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":60.78,"end":64.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-8","text":"キムはコーナーが得意だから、林と入れ替えるか。","textVersion":"sha256:1afde70906a284c9f95cb0838d9c2086a4c7d256223931d069f693436bbbef20","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":64.24,"end":67.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-9","text":"そうですね。わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:a9595529f2d0c28135d966ec081c4554fe2cdf3528f6e89085a1c0c3dd2902e3","audioVersion":"sha256:ff17aea921827da4f59b3aa4db614c881875a920144ad02582d6cd5c5330f92e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a3102036e0c299de048f33e8fb4e5c8cb96c902f9db504da1afa3260d58a211","start":67.98,"end":69.86,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8756df6ea5d835a4"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:question","text":"二番：大学で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:70d2171add9dd32c3c5b1d1384e1b10328e0e79e5e2cfff9bba1592c1c6cf517","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":3.66,"end":13.46,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0","text":"就職活動、もう始めた？","textVersion":"sha256:8ef1fda4e2b8a1b84648e85e7bd6949810c1c6a84807c782d3320c029931c103","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":14.92,"end":17.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-1","text":"まあねえ。早く始めたほうがいいからね。就職支援サイトにも登録したよ。","textVersion":"sha256:16e63603f37b2ab6c260fdecfa612a0e1244acc2bb07127ab27c25b40e510476","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":17.3,"end":22.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-2","text":"それってインターネットの？いろんな企業の就職情報が載ってる。ぼくもそろそろ動かないとなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:9cc1b36f35783cc8aa96702408e3c13662ed62891fbbdfbd1599eca1fddfc883","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":22.88,"end":29.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-3","text":"それより、大学の就職課には相談に行った？うちの学生向けの就職情報が分かるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:ed87078dba1f83b7daaa56ed03f09fd9c70e167fa09d72391b8c2bbc7e86291e","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":29.7,"end":36.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-4","text":"ああ、就職課か。","textVersion":"sha256:b030a060637143938401a545fc2cbde465b91c257f44e5b0b506f16c68c9a5cf","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":36.28,"end":37.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-5","text":"あと、私は就職活動の流れをつかむために、就職関連の本も読んだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:587a744ebbdea0603c1aed66dd47530546a195cc24c1b3249e261758ea9677ae","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":38.32,"end":43.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-6","text":"あっ、それは大丈夫。面接対策の本、先輩にもらったから。","textVersion":"sha256:892415bbce7a29efa9b166d793de739545321b7e0f0277fec81bb6526a575243","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":43.68,"end":47.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-7","text":"面接か。気が早いね。でも、まずはうちの大学の就職情報を押さえといたら？","textVersion":"sha256:ce835a7ba9d592b80772d90195ef6e196b3ec49611f0c912a598788d8bb46591","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":47.86,"end":55.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-8","text":"そっか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6512789ed6959f2b08585c5a20526d51e9036dcbf9c8d6ea1f7db766be59607","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":55.06,"end":55.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-9","text":"うん。それと、履歴書用の証明写真の印象も大事だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:97690cd244e7b157fdc1790d3209aa3dedab530214276b8d4289a932cdfed725","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":56.82,"end":61.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-10","text":"あ、早く準備しといたほうがいいよね。","textVersion":"sha256:a439170af6f64201caef216b3f8159b86d182e15c11bd076aba865a1f3e1f1aa","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":61.84,"end":64.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-11","text":"そうだね。どんな業界に行きたいの？","textVersion":"sha256:47f3a3049e3826ca9fcc8310cc6e074e1a318ad3756fedf8afd59210198ece03","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":64.48,"end":67.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-12","text":"まだそこまでは。","textVersion":"sha256:f9db4da5730bea1b4154766648c28f7560095b6b2b15665d2f325496857929c3","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":67.68,"end":69.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-13","text":"業種によっても、写真の雰囲気、変えたほうがいいんだって。まあ、とりあえず話を聞きに行ったら？","textVersion":"sha256:eba1cf926d78e684ef2c425c6ffe2e7c360915dd00bb87c2beb15496a3b83147","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":69.28,"end":75.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-14","text":"そうだよね。そうする。ありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:90354b0fc8f7e9762d56b92f99883cd9d426679d043c31fd7becfdeff76bf76d","audioVersion":"sha256:038d8c2ac4b4cdfe12eebebd25104000eca82e411481602b0d77ba9bc3f77d74","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c145fad0d5a5f06868767ed4fddd1cae93d35237ea1374f18fa02f7af73b214","start":75.62,"end":78.3,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8756df6ea5d835a4"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:question","text":"三番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f65a7f4180d5f1e902207b828569b8d7fd4a027d4a95d89999a6c1928a2712a7","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":3.96,"end":12.92,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-0","text":"今年の新商品の展示会が来月に迫ってきたんで。カタログの準備に取りかかろうと思ってるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:8e964e294190ee8f14e3683a06778c5ef0df3e3d65ac5af22f7f23acf0875e44","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":14.6,"end":21.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":21.04,"end":21.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-2","text":"去年の資料を土台にして作るとして、カタログに載せる今年の新商品の説明のところ、文書を新たに作らないとねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:01538b2e6e1c5da4135da3115f0edfc5e4542c100cc93b6e682e6757cc223901","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":21.82,"end":30.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":30.58,"end":31.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-4","text":"うーん。表紙のデザインが古くなってきてるんで、これを機に、表紙の写真を変えたらどうかって思ってるんだが。","textVersion":"sha256:80c38fed1c06ec2ae0b974f3ef28bc95a751803bf66413913722edf93569cc37","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":32.04,"end":39.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-5","text":"新しい研究所がある、長野の風景を使ったらどうでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:532f803c36f88387bf2c1f28d965eda694572931caa80cac621188dcd3249021","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":40.08,"end":44.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-6","text":"なるほど。きれいな環境の中で、製品の品質管理に力入れてるとこ、打ち出したいところだしね。じゃ、その方針で進めるとして、デザインについては、印刷会社に案を出してもらうとしようか。担当は佐藤君が適任だな。手配は彼に頼もう。で、商品説明のとこは、君にお願いするよ。","textVersion":"sha256:410a91eed134ae39466de93eddef332886e486a92ff70dec89cb6baf3943b1ea","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":44.68,"end":68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":67.94,"end":68.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-8","text":"次の会議で検討するから、それまでに頼むよ。原稿を取りまとめて、印刷会社に送ったあとも、チェックや修正に時間がかかるから。急いで取りかかろう。","textVersion":"sha256:2484883f07d20913f053903d791068c7272ea48d947eec147a7ef11270b2d677","audioVersion":"sha256:ff6cf4de1019b1beaf148298ddcf928bb77a1ef5ac39e147592d408c3a24b83f","timelineVersion":"sha256:8412c6726e4503c26eb3b7822cca289898705953b96538c6962fa0f3b196be03","start":68.72,"end":80.14,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"8756df6ea5d835a4"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:question","text":"四番：大学で学生と先生が話しています。学生はまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:ede3103f53063f3e1d317b44a36db0481211a0366649eb08f4764f0ecb8fa985","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":4.2,"end":13.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0","text":"先生、卒業論文なんですが、どのように進めたらいいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:59935605900825f1c982ca000aa759451185a0f4f041e2552ce7807ec3640fdf","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":15.34,"end":21.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-1","text":"そうね。提出までまだ一年近くあるから焦らなくてもいいけど。インタビュー調査をするんでしたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:21337d8fe63ca9d830366ae0b1063e20065825c2bf97194b3edcef41cf4a90bd","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":21.02,"end":29.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":29.32,"end":30.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-3","text":"分析の時間をしっかり取るためには、なるべく早く調査しなきゃね。","textVersion":"sha256:922ea7c7d68681549dbeef46a3a6d77f6cc11113fddc373bc5cd67e3ffc15702","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":30.34,"end":34.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-4","text":"はい、そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:5b172a98b63b6ccdc41167ddc6931a4acc4eee2087f2c0c6964a606f0ef8487c","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":35.62,"end":37.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-5","text":"まずは、調査したいことを絞って、インタビューの質問項目を作ってみましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:4c9f154d0a0aab0d94d1d64387f5c949eda79da9eaedafd8f0bd4ae48074c23a","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":37.2,"end":43.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-6","text":"はい。少しは考えてみたんですが、どんな質問にすればいいか難しくて。","textVersion":"sha256:91eddb73fad2602a6f5d0c7f98975b3191342a904e6bc4c375658712f67f6a5c","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":44.54,"end":50.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-7","text":"あっ、関連する文献はまだ調べてませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:5bb3b387ec69386a876aa9eb9fe3f0d9e698fb48afcf61c7d86a85b252382e4b","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":50.18,"end":54.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-8","text":"ええ、まだあまり。","textVersion":"sha256:b01613f43ffda7752623ab7b38faa6f5fd44cf94a17551aa3146cd244c27f780","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":54.18,"end":56.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-9","text":"じゃ、今までの研究で、どんな調査が行われて、どんな結果が出たか、調べてからよね。","textVersion":"sha256:56e87d1782c769cb9907e676be0d92c5c41bf684e8cf301798cea5dd266ec51d","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":56.74,"end":63.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-10","text":"あっ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:4e1900035195db95f82e6ff1303b48a4d06cad953f29c4ad1fd717f24d047ea0","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":63.96,"end":64.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-11","text":"それから、卒業論文のイメージを掴むのも大切よ。先輩たちの卒業論文は読んでみた？","textVersion":"sha256:92d563908cc086504cbd457155162b6ec991c5e296fc217d2709487190786b7a","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":64.86,"end":72.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-12","text":"あっ、それは一通り。","textVersion":"sha256:2480379d012c0621b3d4f9882b2da45c854e7eedfdc70619b0999466959555bc","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":72.16,"end":74.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-13","text":"そう。じゃあ、再来週、途中経過教えてください。","textVersion":"sha256:4c0e2c952824446856db4bd450008538ee551a9a0eb234a896d4acbbf824381a","audioVersion":"sha256:c3c1e96d4ae695fc19cc97b691eb11b68911fae1f60541c74ecc9cc2e2811130","timelineVersion":"sha256:7e112ee87629c7e3847859c3f697193bc3936a98ce279b7064fe670501a914d6","start":74.14,"end":78.7,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8756df6ea5d835a4"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:question","text":"五番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はホームページをどのように変更しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4bd52a097b10d1632cddba054aa7c707bc0849627a2cf613e328bac84461d43b","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","start":3.94,"end":14.06,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-0","text":"新製品の掃除機のホームページなんだけど、アクセス数、あまり伸びてないみたいだね。","textVersion":"sha256:d69e7f3e035479fd9b1567a8158369ab19f7fa6459e3a3362b4d56ad1874273f","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","start":15.64,"end":21.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-1","text":"はい、トップページはそこそこなんですけど、製品紹介や使用体験のページにすすむ人が少なくて","textVersion":"sha256:1bcd710e930a47ec1e2c21d96fa3beac776906b151119fe4713f6f86dd89c3df","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","start":22.1,"end":28.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-2","text":"そうか。 体験記を見てもらいたいんだよね。そこへ誘導するしかけ、もっと考えられない？","textVersion":"sha256:4ecd6fcf8df4bdfd24a1bf5a56804bb2b7dcc74b5426a7b69173342010c96583","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","start":28.98,"end":35.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-3","text":"ページのデザインですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:f5b2381cd7ddb9173887b14f554654a17ab776d76ca3bc7625d4cc9156dd8a3a","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","start":36.06,"end":37.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-4","text":"うん、トップページのリンクが貼ってあるところ、目立つような色にしてみよう。それと、製品紹介から体験ページへのほうもよろしく。これいいよっていう声を受けて、決める人もいるだろうから。","textVersion":"sha256:62b84687c17f4df30def9d38616bfe74e51366b19514c91dbc7253ff18825641","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","start":37.78,"end":50.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-5","text":"セール中っていうのも、もっと全面に押し出しましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:7503c9868d04f3d7c55add0480c6aa356c93552f27dc9dde23c0323dd840c58d","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","start":50.54,"end":54.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:5:line-6","text":"うーん、それは弄らなくてもいいかな。あんまり派手になりすぎてもって思うから。","textVersion":"sha256:b498973458dcaa879529d6c125b74ea95d65da7a408228c5e7c68097ed7df4d1","audioVersion":"sha256:8dc1e0a53dee1426fe520bb9e9b95e43a819d97821bff5fb57a964edda6c4974","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9d29334e3a0f9a8200e6cf9f5b1a55380faa392b6b73e5fca6b957559933df","start":54.08,"end":60.2,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8756df6ea5d835a4"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2012.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2012.html"],"batch":"n1-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:question","text":"六番：電話で雑誌の編集者と留学生が話しています。留学生はこれからまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:846f5ba1a3d9ae93f8c1367e9b4b1dd0e55fb1f1b5fcc3ff035709f6491a0de8","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":4.24,"end":14.6,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-0","text":"あのう、もしもし、月刊トラベルの山田です。先日お願いしていた日本に住む外国人に記事を書いていただくという件なんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:ba2a09ed0772bca4cd19ddf36f8fb297552b7bb854d150bca9c6e1edd051f9e7","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":16.04,"end":24.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-1","text":"はい、確か日本での生活についてでしたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ca0c14de863204e03ae40a1ef32353ce35535453aeb2352cfab4e3e579616312","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":25.12,"end":28.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-2","text":"いえ、それが社内で検討会議を開きましたところ、日本での生活ではなくて、日本ではまだあまり知られていない、お国の文化についてお願いしたいということになったんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:4c9c29be1fe1425bf75bfface19bb221a3dfaaa811b2732608b70465dd27e910","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":28.58,"end":40.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-3","text":"ああ、いいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:f38eb2a1bf0b497236da79ae9c0a5bf463b487b7db3ebb9a40613cf2bccb7241","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":40.08,"end":41.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-4","text":"うちの雑誌の読者層が三四十代の女性ですから、女性目線で見たお勧めの情報はいつも好評なんで、ファッション、文化、美容と健康について取り上げていただけませんか。ページ数は写真を含めて2ページから3ページと言ったところです。","textVersion":"sha256:f742a612f758f41e2f6180f5564309e6f6a9dfa276d9935f9733df52dfdb68be","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":41.66,"end":58.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-5","text":"ちょうど来月一時帰国することになってるんですよ。そのときにいろいろ写真を撮ってきましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:4369e14a02d390ad089e524af3ca78d6ce4167b098825809e0fd3a109e913f61","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":59.2,"end":65.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-6","text":"それはよかったです。んで、今ご存知の内容で結構ですので、最近どんなものが流行っているか、情報を簡単にまとめておいていただけませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:df85e5b1c893fb6a8af882fc5e3b65b25c689d74c3cc14719e41e5e213c449c9","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":66,"end":75.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":75.6,"end":76.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-8","text":"企画の段階から一緒に練り上げたいと思っておりますので、一時帰国の前にそれをもとに打ち合わせをさせていただきたいんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:ecab4b5808ae18b8f8d887ccfa2499aa795b4b2dafa55ae14a9935a6e772ae2b","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":76.14,"end":84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":83.94,"end":84.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-10","text":"打ち合わせを踏まえて、企画書はこちらで作成しますから。原稿締め切りは二ヶ月後を目安にということで、だいじょうぶでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:eafc30ce7fdf65d8417a5edbf865b269b12f293c13706edd82c1ea9b1039a22a","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":84.5,"end":92.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2012-12:6:line-11","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:18e686064c4b79efdde20348f5d5f400d1e5880868c7036f5bf8147d9433986c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b67702c6a518da94faae09736ab866218b11ec0a8d95dd6b2ab3bced2c59a76d","start":92.94,"end":94.38,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8756df6ea5d835a4"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:question","text":"一番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこの後まず、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:18a2552075dcca2ec74deae72d6b968860a4334adc21f3e71c4384b6a7658f19","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":3.7,"end":13.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-0","text":"来月の新製品発表会だけど、会長の挨拶、どうなっている？","textVersion":"sha256:878fca1b0bb7313019bf89802ec083ab4701fd4db3c46f2855c2b63ee8db4a5c","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":15.1,"end":19.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-1","text":"はい。了解いただいております。","textVersion":"sha256:12f23e14f811d9dd8c3ab579d9f4c281c2420dda9c0a8aaca5229ae3891b89cb","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":19.52,"end":22.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-2","text":"会場は？もう押さえてある？","textVersion":"sha256:efb3963d051480407e862a772adcfe314744059117f3cf10e66a9a5e60ebe5fd","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":22.04,"end":24.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-3","text":"それはあのう、出席者数によって大きさが変わるかと思いまして、今は大小二つの会場を予約してあります。","textVersion":"sha256:e8c830571aa62038a0ef83f4eff62a00df5f5de6bc56de74b9fe385794bb7f4d","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":24.54,"end":34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-4","text":"なるほど。じゃ、とりあえず、保留っていうことで、出席者と会場が決まり次第、招待状の準備に取りかかってくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:6de1773b303319f3a73b557c0fcc1ca99b69c25f95f6899ece1c6bf3c2345fa1","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":34.84,"end":41.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":41.7,"end":42.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-6","text":"ああ、それから当日の会長の送り迎えの車、頼んどいてくれると助かるんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:286a9350cb4912d79303c509afc152e50014c6dcf0f51214e5a42cb535799726","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":42.18,"end":48.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-7","text":"承知しました。","textVersion":"sha256:ab6ba1f659c6e35fe52cd5ab20ac40bfe98e7c674788f711e9877e68302e8b1b","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":48.1,"end":49.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-8","text":"できることからやっといて。よろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:cbaa87c019982844981070f07130ccd5779c327fdc6ace459d96086ceb4c5d42","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":48.96,"end":51.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:b8c0a7bd9566a6ce9f305ccd69d8f825baa312c7883fc6b2a30f6db3593038ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:a3e4f6057cfdab2a2842780ccc9b1878eac71af464a55eea1b2ec38520b344e1","start":51.68,"end":52.06,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"bff9ae13e817e9b3"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:question","text":"二番：大学のサークルで女の学生と男の学生が話している。女の学生はサークルのほかのメンバーに何を伝えますか。","textVersion":"sha256:fe59d7ea80ac05757bd1fe7751b4e4027ccc4264d1c7435b4502b45d2b9000b9","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":4.02,"end":16.52,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-0","text":"先輩、大型の台風が近づいているみたいですね。サークルのバーベキュー、今度の日曜日ですよね。大丈夫でしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:9fd14efe4721a4d65fbb4a474aabdf784ee328ce9321bfa63e0a26e5e93cfd18","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":18.14,"end":27.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-1","text":"うん、僕もその件で、サークルのみんなに連絡しなきゃと思っていたところ、台風週末にこっち来るみたいだね。","textVersion":"sha256:456a17d105cb10cefaa48c1a7b684c9a7c2dd75d6dd2c3c8b61d8a7ec20d1b1d","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":27.32,"end":34.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-2","text":"はい、みんな楽しみにしているし。雨覚悟で、予定通りやりますか。","textVersion":"sha256:947b664fade56d7f86fa9e014015f5346aa4a5c337c9cf98884142cd1dbe8874","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":34.56,"end":39.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-3","text":"うーん、安全面が心配だしね。今回は残念だけど。","textVersion":"sha256:87122d424b47cdc38afa8f9f0ef3605d8c0127e5f0b2fd0bdd262afdeeb530a1","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":39.76,"end":44.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-4","text":"えっ？延期じゃなくてですか。","textVersion":"sha256:90d7c8b08279d5e42691efa87c3b10a3e0db254501dfbf394d82fdf3289fe99b","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":44.42,"end":47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-5","text":"うん、だって、一週間伸ばすと、学校の試験期間と重なっちゃうし。","textVersion":"sha256:1d67413fce51d9466cbf2fcd4f089db8186a65eefe55f005cd2a7b44cf1f5e56","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":47.48,"end":52.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-6","text":"あっ、そっか。じゃ、日曜じゃなくて、土曜にするっていうのはどうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:bce825dd258508c9946c34f962182cdcebc8508b324c615a4919b5d10095d12a","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":51.98,"end":57.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-7","text":"気持ち、わかんなくもないけど、でも、台風ってスピード読めないから、予報通りくるとは限らないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a031764f083c98aa84e853a850683a4018f4e9568559f767d6c611c88f71bae6","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":58.44,"end":65.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-8","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":66.98,"end":67.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-9","text":"じゃ、みんなに連絡、まわしといてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:9f1a432ac20c9afa620640cbd1b7473184e6b3dfab404cedb355d887fed197b6","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":67.5,"end":69.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-10","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:3f2b628e2924d52de32683405436a9e5fb87c975c5b23547028abd15e4527bf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:1f21e6fddc408725ddaef2be6e8ad5b652f83740897ee8f93092b1243af1baf9","start":70.16,"end":70.74,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"bff9ae13e817e9b3"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:question","text":"三番：レストランで女の店長と男の店員が話しています。男の店員はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f420759470c3fbbb39288db92ffe4cc22697ec23ee5d174af94b7f763dfdaa9f","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":3.82,"end":14.84,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0","text":"うちの店、このところランチの売上が思わしくないじゃない？でね、過去にヒットしたものを日替わりで出してみたいと思ったんだけど、オープン当初のランチ、どんなだったか調べてといてくれない？","textVersion":"sha256:72a45176f6c91e52118ec9119c622c608dc1139594d0d2fc1d353f486f2f824d","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":16.28,"end":28.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-1","text":"わあ、昔のメニュー、残してあるんですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:47fbd12107340e09d0101e9170ee00185ee8733018e2e58a41fb14f7beeda491","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":29.08,"end":31.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-2","text":"そう。うちの店、来年で３０周年になるから、なつかしいって思って、また来てくれる方もいるかもしれないじゃない？最近は若い人の間で昔のものが受けてるっていうし。","textVersion":"sha256:adcfeae6f978be25df89afae8b13463226c828f3f3c1f4f7429fbc428899edb4","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":31.38,"end":43.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-3","text":"なるほど。","textVersion":"sha256:e6060d825a6076f13a47cc304d64491b431764116f93db22e8a3eb419858f2a8","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":43.34,"end":44.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-4","text":"割引券をつけたらっていう提案、もらってたけど、やっぱり効果は一時的なものよね。","textVersion":"sha256:e274d825719bc0a45ad8c1efd737693b02851cbedb99a165aca00b6a7949b315","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":44,"end":49.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-5","text":"そうですかね。じゃ、今やっている飲み物やデザートと組み合わせたセットメニューは？","textVersion":"sha256:445837d9df3d7c12a23394f921a9c7db272115cd646a08fbe53787a70fbf2cb8","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":49.82,"end":55.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-6","text":"うん。それはそのまま継続。あ、そうそう。３０周年を機に、内装も新しくしたいと思ってるからまた相談に乗ってね。じゃ、さっき頼んだこと、お願いね。","textVersion":"sha256:61a60cdf262cc017c9c0f201b438f83941d66a44c9ef4765fb641b4c55f06d6a","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":55.58,"end":66.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-7","text":"はい、わかりました。やっておきます。","textVersion":"sha256:df6e18f9e95a2e9396fa89d9e78bfadef8bcd6015454335658f40c1d7207be31","audioVersion":"sha256:7d66f18d5ed1e2523436086f0d0e2950e5b6d9c6d01e663cf9067b1abb4e4a82","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c72fda66935a4f11465cc31a0ff89848c14cca3e04e35587cfa0b7a895038ad","start":66.62,"end":68.76,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"bff9ae13e817e9b3"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:question","text":"四番：大学で男の留学生と先生が話しています。男の留学生はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:4702018c7043e43fbacc0850a7f259a6e63fc85d47d6248c189c2938d0bf5f6e","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":4.16,"end":15.84,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-0","text":"先生、今日先生の中級聴解の授業を受けてみたんですけど、僕にはちょっとやさしいようなので、聴解だけでも上級クラスに行っていいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:f2b903e8079da50d2ff3421d066d2188ba4d11685f0a8dfe1899f36b7280116e","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":17.52,"end":27.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1","text":"でも、ポムさん、レベル分けのテストでは中級でしたね。基本的に、テストの結果に従ってもらうことになってるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:5527e5e50fe1d623095399941c96540fdea2681ab2b0c4781866f739bd5fc1da","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":27.44,"end":35.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-2","text":"でも、あのテストは文法や漢字や聞き取り、全部が出題されてて。僕は漢字が苦手だから、合計点が低くなってしまったんです。ほかの問題はできてました。","textVersion":"sha256:0427ad09a31b19570a735307f5891f6ce9f621e5d91e415ef359684270693517","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":36.1,"end":46.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-3","text":"そう。でもね、聴解も中級と上級の差は大きいのよ。","textVersion":"sha256:7dc0841f3bd666075e58c8e319fb418cdd9d5aa095529f4c93316173cd320081","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":47.82,"end":52.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-4","text":"頑張ります。","textVersion":"sha256:f464475ead61cacfa6bea987653976126da00e64ef9dec225ea1233750e29dfd","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":52.2,"end":53.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-5","text":"うーん。じゃ、一度出てみますか。で、やっぱり難しかったら、わたしの授業に戻っていらっしゃい。でも、わたしが勝手に許可するわけにもいかないから、まずはそのクラスの先生に話してみてください。","textVersion":"sha256:ffb8385fbd7f81bf8aa592d0969e6a85cde56754d8294761a099b463ad5cac66","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":53.08,"end":67.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-6","text":"わかりました。ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:854a8d00c29b5b13d6c411dc842fefcfefd7b0591c665f0dab9251eb38aca56a","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":67.88,"end":69.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-7","text":"でも、本来は漢字をしっかり頑張って、全体的にレベルを上げないと。","textVersion":"sha256:744e2cb372ce38d18d0ebdf9e7bed79a9265d762d08e17e9292090c763503e58","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":69.78,"end":75.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-8","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":74.98,"end":75.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-9","text":"じゃ、先生に許可をもらえたら、事務にも報告してくださいね。","textVersion":"sha256:ff5ea362dd98b7a11860597c10dc98caecdc009cab7e69a4fcc6856c75fa6153","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":76.18,"end":80.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-10","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:0701981ffbd6dde7c55dbd540b2c08c735b8364975f7c1969ae439ca49a3ec0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:28d7193cd2a4e30527f54ee50735deafa94ae6d8ec41df9778207c3c9bdd5279","start":79.96,"end":80.98,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"bff9ae13e817e9b3"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:question","text":"五番：大学で環境美化サークルの女の学生と男の学生が話しています。男の学生はこれから何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:7e0b4a7ac1022546bb27fc248b26f605991d72664fbce603561610db26988558","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":3.66,"end":16.42,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-0","text":"先輩、あいかわらず、大学の中、ゴミが落ちていますよね。","textVersion":"sha256:cb0c4e1b84217c352bcb5efad7210972b4f6d6231bf59c2c8d1dfb4ca2af0ce0","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":18.2,"end":22.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-1","text":"うん、ポイ捨て禁止のポスター、大学のいろんな場所に貼ったのに。あまり効果、上がってないね。","textVersion":"sha256:f11ad662f7e850ded89580ea8d7b1a79e5544ad8d004a7057781824c864dba13","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":22.42,"end":29.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-2","text":"すごく目立つって友達は言ってましたけど、もっと貼りましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:7fe4f21d84dd05a7feb008ff4390f4dc8e9ee7f546979459c37950f064576388","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":29.18,"end":33.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-3","text":"ポスターを増やしたところで、学内のゴミがゼロにはならないでしょう。ねえ、みんなの前で呼びかけてみてよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1bb4e7cc9d5c268df489dc06247755f913f5d0161ed0144939d701d8a5a33a8b","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":33.32,"end":40.81,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-4","text":"「みなさん、ゴミは必ずゴミ箱に」って僕がマイクを持って言うんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:443140382c8742e87491150be11787eb717b4a6297f387b20d5f8275a01bc8e7","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":41.22,"end":46.13,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-5","text":"うーん、ほかのメンバーからは授業の空き時間にゴミ拾いの活動をしたらどうか案が出てたけど。","textVersion":"sha256:4612bad522643657e5c3434e4c6c8174e0653ae08b16fcbf247b3023715afb24","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":46.56,"end":53.71,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-6","text":"そうですか。やってみますか。","textVersion":"sha256:bc024ea1136cc2ad188efb07b32fd684f281013d9cd5a73e40d92fd515d08d81","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":53.88,"end":55.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-7","text":"でも、メンバーだけでやってもね。大学全体の意識を高めないとだめだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:71e311d253aaadffeae9a38df1fac0ca19d66d6ea328dabe1313ab79933ca5c2","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":56.12,"end":61.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-8","text":"確かに。あいつら、偉いなあなんて他人事って感じで見られてても困りますよね。","textVersion":"sha256:95d2322af3bf51625abfe5610668956f79c284f13a12f0294d3f122c1d5dd0fb","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":61.87,"end":67.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-9","text":"ゴミを拾うんじゃなくて、拾うゴミがない状態を目指すべきじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:22fe90fd1b4514678746a296fa6f8924515d5c0bb1b3a421547bce644ae61904","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":67.69,"end":71.85,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-10","text":"それで、ポスターを作ったんですもんね。","textVersion":"sha256:d1a34c475aa47a6d1495db1a5d15b21ef71f6c119dce43d8a07af5625a17ed3d","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":71.94,"end":74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-11","text":"じゃ、さあ、やっぱりマイクじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:22698c79d27fcc9b8f54369431310a45b8cf007ec282fb5a13f348bc1c249b75","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":74.18,"end":76.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-12","text":"いいですけど、ほかのメンバーにも声をかけてくださいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:dd2e846df4a6ef1a94bdbe3d16c10930817b9a7e90974954aa3c6f6598951179","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":76.66,"end":80.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-13","text":"もちろん！でも、一度一人でやってみて？それからサークルのメンバーに提案するってのはどう？","textVersion":"sha256:7ebb92be86c232d1e7aa8b3b42cedaeb20cb67881fd5e3d820fd098286bec4f1","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":80.36,"end":87.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-14","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:8d90915ad57bf27cae7a4a77166fdfee50ff88a20ea70b4bcfb8338b16c33b92","timelineVersion":"sha256:73e67b1fcbeb3745ea445c28d1c05c458a73339c8aa308cb315bee26191ece22","start":87.36,"end":88.54,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"bff9ae13e817e9b3"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:244311ef1661c40273f91c9ee46fcc9bee73c7d5bbfe19a84f630132b4a9efd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:14817c2e67e40824f915504f3f49b163d7bc9d24fadfd8839a62697f69f51b35","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6:question","text":"六番：洋服の店で店長が話しています。この後、店員は男性のスーツをどう展示しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a2682d46cb3d5c2ba112b0344a72dc8236869723c5345755eb7869b09dd57323","audioVersion":"sha256:244311ef1661c40273f91c9ee46fcc9bee73c7d5bbfe19a84f630132b4a9efd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:14817c2e67e40824f915504f3f49b163d7bc9d24fadfd8839a62697f69f51b35","start":3.84,"end":13.68,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6:line-0","text":"今から商品の展示を変えます。えー、婦人服はこのところ好調で、高級なスーツなども予想以上に伸びています。","textVersion":"sha256:5e4a56513fe8adc7e0375818d0bf837d16fbdd7a0b361db35429fe58e1689e5a","audioVersion":"sha256:244311ef1661c40273f91c9ee46fcc9bee73c7d5bbfe19a84f630132b4a9efd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:14817c2e67e40824f915504f3f49b163d7bc9d24fadfd8839a62697f69f51b35","start":15.1,"end":23.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6:line-1","text":"しかし、紳士服の方は依然苦戦しています。働いている男性なら、まあセーターなど家で着るものはともかく、会社に着ていく服には気を遣っているはずです。","textVersion":"sha256:abacad69f123c848080f9cb2a7e2d1739df96abac5416348940052da4b260693","audioVersion":"sha256:244311ef1661c40273f91c9ee46fcc9bee73c7d5bbfe19a84f630132b4a9efd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:14817c2e67e40824f915504f3f49b163d7bc9d24fadfd8839a62697f69f51b35","start":23.42,"end":34.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6:line-2","text":"でも、スーツは頻繁に新調するというものでもありません。となると、小物の出番です。例えば、マフラー一つで印象がガラリと変わることをアピールしたいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:d8effb1b4f84ce512190930eeae81840e062ffa595ffa97475f231b7f2046ca1","audioVersion":"sha256:244311ef1661c40273f91c9ee46fcc9bee73c7d5bbfe19a84f630132b4a9efd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:14817c2e67e40824f915504f3f49b163d7bc9d24fadfd8839a62697f69f51b35","start":34.76,"end":45.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-07:6:line-3","text":"その組み合わせに魅力を感じてスーツも買っていただけたら万々歳です。このような方向でみなさん、作業をはじめてください。","textVersion":"sha256:8870a2b2670d19fd52df4957b0d6b4777feb85d74a12e5dbd061fa75d7b55113","audioVersion":"sha256:244311ef1661c40273f91c9ee46fcc9bee73c7d5bbfe19a84f630132b4a9efd3","timelineVersion":"sha256:14817c2e67e40824f915504f3f49b163d7bc9d24fadfd8839a62697f69f51b35","start":46.3,"end":54.34,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"bff9ae13e817e9b3"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:question","text":"一番：男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はこの後まず、どうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:fd8f90225ee70d74550b864baab0fbbd119f8eb7b343b2cd0c1b7e99cbff9260","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","start":3.42,"end":12.86,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0","text":"アパートの隣の人が夜うるさくて寝られないんだけど、こういうときってどうしたらいいのかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:84a32780e59a07d3b9887de30541681694821a63fcee88c4d460eea1d3c07cd7","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","start":14.28,"end":19.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-1","text":"寮に住んでいる私の友達は、隣の人がうるさくて困ったとき、掲示板に張り紙を張ったって言ってたけど。","textVersion":"sha256:d8a004da37da0592eccb6e46aa818766b76234a86152436a1a5f18180052f6bd","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","start":20.24,"end":27.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-2","text":"へえー、でもうちのアパート、掲示板ないしなあ。実は、先週から隣に何回か話しに行ってみたんだけど、チャイム鳴らしても誰も出てこなくて。管理人さんには一応こういうことで困っているとは話してきたんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:f6083758d52203b58539a406b63e560ae0e4cb3548180f7980f839f160e2d57e","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","start":27.22,"end":41.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-3","text":"じゃ、大丈夫じゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:20013f6a216ad972f3af6c27f46970b24749440613e305d02b305ad5ba043753","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","start":41.7,"end":43.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-4","text":"それがね。管理人さんにはおととい言ったんだけど、おとといも昨日もうるさくて。今日ももう一回隣に言ってみようかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:12a26790daa37b2862fc34137c7b30bc1268a6700b0c4d8fdf85edc5dd92ccc0","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","start":43.02,"end":50.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-5","text":"厄介なことになるのもねえ。管理人さんにもう一度話して、まかせたほうがいいよ。それがだめだったら、隣の人に手紙を書いてみるっていうのも手だと思うけど。","textVersion":"sha256:95f28f30c46b6fcbdbb1d9e598056c6d4ea1f34ee4eb8341510fba2bc33a8fb5","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","start":51.36,"end":62.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-6","text":"そうだね。そうしてみる。","textVersion":"sha256:64d5db3a9b276fdf1938e6b1b6bc1d8180f03460bcc12cef82502d6e71195d6f","audioVersion":"sha256:e7735a6f323415f823f3f9a63b04f0726e5bc6517170ed60c55cb7254be2dc40","timelineVersion":"sha256:1d9cba4b53f804e9f291c1d664bd5b3833a752774c83b69a54d61be150848ef9","start":62.44,"end":64.96,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"171cf9e5df5c6cac"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:question","text":"二番：会社で男の人と課長が新商品のパンフレットについて話しています。男の人はこの後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:7af4f4718024a2ce71f3eb9fb413adb902087ef76be61b32fc3d91d7c46cec6c","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","start":3.46,"end":15.84,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-0","text":"課長、先週コメントいただいたパンフレットの表紙を修正したので、もう一度見ていただきたいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:99751e3c2da22c13755d0313526234363809db70f3e7f4966db6bff1b88a3bd3","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","start":17.46,"end":23.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-1","text":"うん、見せて。キャッチフレーズの位置は...。ああ、直したのね、よくなったわねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:3810a2fd693f5e614bcedd337ee149bad5b113c085485b6875ab799b781f4627","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","start":24.14,"end":31.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-2","text":"はい。でー、このキャッチフレーズ、どうでしょう。みんなで相談して、変更したんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:8ea461cf99f13042963cc5d8902cd69798228593b8d2562f88efd534c2a180a6","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","start":31.78,"end":37.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-3","text":"うーん、そうね。キャッチフレーズにしては、ちょっとインパクトが足りないんじゃない？ちょっと考えさせてくれる？あっ、後、写真の説明文はもっと簡潔にしたほうがいいわね。そうしたら、写真はもう少し大きくなるんじゃない？説明文との兼ね合いだと思うけど。","textVersion":"sha256:6942decba2c80278f23ba167335826580c2a7593daf7c991f09babe5ace19500","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","start":37.36,"end":57.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","start":58.24,"end":58.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-5","text":"じゃ、とりあえずそっちからやって。写真の大きさはまずは保留で。","textVersion":"sha256:85ae5c170258787c7d4d0af4a560cfb6db7731d071d0a9dc407ec39f04d2b278","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","start":58.78,"end":63.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-6","text":"はい。分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:80ba06fc4bf728a24140fa18a8790dddac2ad413add2350485d16bdbd6740fbe","audioVersion":"sha256:c8d75da6ac92cb184099975c82f7d6e59f58d8016a1da6d3dea30a66aead00db","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c43492534e17c6afe6faf1f45e2d352e4c6d186582b358d1b5745df7b9191","start":63.76,"end":65.26,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"171cf9e5df5c6cac"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:question","text":"三番：夏祭りのミーティングで、男の学生と女の学生が話しています。女の学生は何を担当しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:41f4efb282b35437e3390243d49c3f957926f21ae4fe96ee465571d65e1dc12b","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":3.46,"end":14.18,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-0","text":"ええ、じゃ、夏祭りの各担当を決めて、次回ミーティングまでに担当ごとに準備を進めておきたいと思います。ええと、大野さん、会計を担当してもらえない？","textVersion":"sha256:741c6baa3fe395d3a881bd221bcd0aeb2e331957c51fd5aa9f28aee5fb0621d1","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":15.76,"end":26.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-1","text":"あのー、会計ってどんなことを。","textVersion":"sha256:034797e58ad3df23586f81ed6c8bc5872f345aa0e61ff91a1ca9b4f91ccce6f5","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":26.88,"end":29.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-2","text":"えっと、屋台で食べ物を販売する店の係りが食材の仕入れとか器材レンタルとかするんだけど。業者から見積もりを取ってくるんで、会計はそれを取りまとめて、予算を立てたりするんだよね。そのほか、最後収支を出すとこまで、お金に関すること全般。","textVersion":"sha256:eaaf211343dc1850bda3dfbdec8c5d0707d18712984ce43a1f3c2b1fbd28ad59","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":29.72,"end":45.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-3","text":"私、お金の管理や計算は。何かほかには。","textVersion":"sha256:fea37b3f7f35758ed891b5111ce244f88b4756eaba59f25aa5003cd8b4ab7dae","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":46.88,"end":51.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-4","text":"ええと、ほかに決めなきゃいけないのは、ステージの係りと広報の係り。ステージの係りはイベントの企画と当日の進行役。広報の係りはホームページ作成とか。あっ、そういえば、大野さん、ウェブデザイン、勉強してたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:9aafe74345b15db31ef93a2475e8262c19067bf85f43ef711d5a648f8cadbc7f","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":51.28,"end":66.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-5","text":"はい、基本的なことだけですが。ホームページにはどんな内容を載せるんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:517c7e7a8eab0b629a21295ca6daa3f225a3a260d1e758c637baf01f9c3ad659","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":67.38,"end":72.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-6","text":"それは、ステージの係りがイベントを企画して、参加者募るから、その情報とか。あと、店の係りから上がってくる情報を載せたりとか。","textVersion":"sha256:097fdba6737865e57a165fe576ad3590c7dfc1f66a16984c27ed20cfcc30581f","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":73.04,"end":81.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-7","text":"ああ、だったら。みんなと相談しながらやってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:c6010f400cfb4044af1061b32c38e20cf5407aade2bf76ac02648873bd3feb4b","audioVersion":"sha256:b6ab471bf92a361f25e84f77c536f97b7c4e2b43687df309ee2ffebe00030c04","timelineVersion":"sha256:504f937927263dd2cbef74449ab1949bf68c9f0e4277f75c0b4984a96cca2bff","start":81.22,"end":85.36,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"171cf9e5df5c6cac"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:question","text":"四番：大学でアシスタントと男の先生が研究会の準備について話しています。アシスタントはこの後まず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:924d89ebc13285d18e1995eefaaa13015c594514153a7de74884a40307575b03","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","start":3.52,"end":16.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-0","text":"先生、来週の研究会の準備の件で、確認させていただきたいことがあるんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:9ce73461d6f6eb44a8c870701e59f385b2401431fc400473455d45f5e0822986","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","start":18.46,"end":23.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-1","text":"ああ、ディスカッションのグループ分けの件？当日、受付で教師の経験がある人と未経験の人を混ぜたグループをいくつか作ることになってたよねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:39277f6658218b8951098c2320b01356a8b630363b65f3f37f4c32b84821880f","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","start":23.9,"end":34.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-2","text":"はい。ただ当日、参加者一人ひとりに経験の有無を確認して、グループ分けをする時間的な余裕があるかなあと思いまして。五十名以上の方が参加予定なので、資料代をいただくだけでも、手間がかかりますし。","textVersion":"sha256:693eb5f4fdb324f3a68b8c4f4e4e8d39ba5300b96b3e1935c13c2b3bf921e1ee","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","start":35.02,"end":49.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-3","text":"うーん、そうか。じゃあ、前もってメールで確認しといたほうが確実だね。それで、それを踏まえて、グループ分けまでをやっといてね。あっ、資料代の連絡はしてある？","textVersion":"sha256:d879d43e7a80fe8f2130a4b2bbeb651b16b07fd1941283f61697a7189297dd79","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","start":49.78,"end":62.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-4","text":"その件は、ホームページに掲載済みです。","textVersion":"sha256:a7634841a947fda6c2f52be46dd996535b8be7005cb1ed986dd86aa74d83f34c","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","start":62.92,"end":65.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-5","text":"そっか。資料のコピーも頼むよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0f78188ea36a84fa53f902ab74d68b256f181514896894029c1f55b5b75872db","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","start":65.68,"end":68.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-6","text":"それは、前日に用意しますので。","textVersion":"sha256:1db0c715fef55bdeb36120bea55b4e07e3be9405847178659e2b7d222c189282","audioVersion":"sha256:4be8ff7ad11c259b2fddfe2e5278433adb95194a945f038ef30cf34b5b51a508","timelineVersion":"sha256:b6e01b1f81c0bf6bb32b52205251e90aa37dda8d1bfb4cf86c8765414954b956","start":68.86,"end":70.9,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"171cf9e5df5c6cac"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:question","text":"五番：会社で男の人と人事課の人が話しています。男の人はまず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:6381976c4bfa7e76f21fb6dbd702e94f66704eaaad8ce9e82bf9d7a399e38b56","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":3.42,"end":13.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-0","text":"あのー、今年は健康診断よりもっと詳しい検査をしたいんで、人間ドックを受けたいんです。提携している病院で、人間ドックを受ける場合、たしか費用の補助があるんですよね。いままで、利用したことないんですけど、どうやって申し込んだらいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:09286fb8e7df85b54dc4bf297847f8c1183488b918b57379c126c75dfd67c0ed","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":16.06,"end":30.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-1","text":"はい、人間ドックを受ける人には、一万円を上限とした補助があります。うちの会社と提携している病院での受診は、社員向けホームページから直接予約できるシステムになっています。","textVersion":"sha256:b0bc66820a1b84f720f0f698150bf1d29f3b6fcd52a54fadebf5a1a7876f82dc","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":31.62,"end":44.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-2","text":"このシステムを通して、人間ドックを予約すると、自動的に補助が受けられますので、申請書等は必要ありません。この制度を初めてご利用なさる際には、社員番号などの情報を入力して、利用者登録が必要です。","textVersion":"sha256:0532828dccbfe251326cb4d0cc8513a380c3acc5d81c1ef1840f18e144ff81c5","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":45.6,"end":62.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-3","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":61.98,"end":63.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-4","text":"それから、必ず受診する三週間前までに、予約をするようにしてください。病院によっては、予約が殺到することがあるので、できるだけ早くされたほうがいいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:e372c69d912b711a49327b34b871960ede1143cf507c06a8b2562ad116bf64f8","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":63.1,"end":75.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-5","text":"分かりました。あと、受診の日は欠勤にはならないって聞いたんですが、人事課に事前に受診日を連絡するんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:b26072c5bb2167e6c16b7a012d08207afd61e131dfc4d2db3d62649af06a0b7d","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":75.9,"end":83.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-6","text":"受診日も新しいシステムで一括管理していますから、特には。不明な点がありましたら、またお問い合わせください。","textVersion":"sha256:6b57a2ec9ab42c9d8bc58965ff4e2afe85f3dbba174e65a93a3a6f8c308fad5e","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":83.76,"end":92.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-7","text":"はい、やってみます。ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:bc5944807210084042d5580e3cd92b327bcdebd09d338d931ebab1b63c3008e4","audioVersion":"sha256:ea57090c977029ba415e54ac7d09055ee6a9aa5875dbe957900bf59da08928c9","timelineVersion":"sha256:1809c42953d19f27fc8f059f33ba0a2614946069a0124f32b7e8709db4af7831","start":92.8,"end":95.18,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"171cf9e5df5c6cac"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2013.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2013.html"],"batch":"n1-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:question","text":"六番：会社で男の人と女の人がこれから売り出す弁当について、話しています。女の人はこの後まず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:b2316b56c93413a9d5f9d2ab8b9ce86c653c29e0f9b270ef29c5454565e47302","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":3.44,"end":17.14,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-0","text":"来年秋に駅で売り出すお弁当だけど、どうなった？調査結果を踏まえての。","textVersion":"sha256:02e5822bc4aee19d5670e619e6e8c5b96f6e325b0c7e8d1c47583a267323d333","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":20.74,"end":26.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-1","text":"はい、あのー、ニーズ調査を分析したところでは、やはり、この地域でしか食べられないものが望まれています。多少値が張っても。それから、作りたてのような温かいものがほしいって声が高いですね。","textVersion":"sha256:b37f33e5e131ad0a995a356b9c57f041a146fb04b01601e2adc340796be2448d","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":27.3,"end":41.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-2","text":"そうか。","textVersion":"sha256:59b55ebd3d334fefa3d9ad52455e119aaaf439dcd50edb85f7050b2666bef1f9","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":41.68,"end":43,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-3","text":"でー、保温機能のついた容器を使ってですね、温かいご飯とここの名物の鶏肉の天ぷらを入れたらどうでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:63f2cf5054b706aac9a0db315730d8d68114e8d2b6b487f13f84d182395c6c6f","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":43.68,"end":51.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-4","text":"なるほど。温かい鳥天ぷらが入った弁当っていうのはないかもなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:eb367ba081f6ee179452b4caf3079a34425f7d30867ed1a9464eb2df9b8155a3","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":51.86,"end":56.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":56.66,"end":57.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-6","text":"うん、保温の効果がどれだけ持続するかにかかるなあ。どんなのがあるか、調べてみた？","textVersion":"sha256:7a72e9248de18425f83d408bead94b6ed3902d06a62c561a60c241036b142784","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":57.4,"end":64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-7","text":"いえ、まだです。","textVersion":"sha256:fbd1cf1905fe417bc70d586c8c3f57aaab4c92a1322772b2f0a903b7087ace5e","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":64.36,"end":65.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-8","text":"じゃ、ちょっと当たってみて。あと、お弁当にいれるほかのおかずについても、保温機能のある器ならではのものが入れられるといいだろうねえ。その当たりも、案を考えてほしいんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:15ad790585decf3fc2e263a5366dffffb26cb62b93680dc99a64c65f2a1c7064","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":66.06,"end":77.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-9","text":"まずは、器が実現できるかどうかだねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:6eb1a7d8d6b1495ec8a46da5bb1c7904068a3f73378688490c1ce9a443fde22e","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":77.74,"end":80.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-10","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":80.86,"end":81.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-11","text":"そういったことがクリアできたら、お弁当の価格設定の検討だなあ。コストパフォーマンスも大事だから。","textVersion":"sha256:3bd3c02d1a703e397024481c472eccb6106406e5791571ea67b69f3b957ea084","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":81.74,"end":87.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2013-12:6:line-12","text":"はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:18d2ff50b951ddb3ce339017a80a9a6dc1c1ce5a19553206efead7a638dd54f4","audioVersion":"sha256:033d78b644a5c49f89e59d56e40c44aed7ce8184902e0ce33e8590d979f595f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3665938b075d1131c870abba53ee32d376e6b3fc93cafc283a98daed524a9316","start":88.52,"end":89.76,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"171cf9e5df5c6cac"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:question","text":"一番：スポーツジムで男の人とインストラクターが話しています。男の人はウォーキングをするとき、これから新たに何に気をつけますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5198c4cc1200e50eb6d0b5ffb3244f1bf02e7cd75dda20a31cbe7da330840dbb","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":3.72,"end":16.48,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0","text":"すみません、ちょっとお聞きしたいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:799145ee8b6a852c9896442fde45b291891af056490f1545bc3c641674271758","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":18.04,"end":20.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":20.84,"end":21.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-2","text":"毎朝公園をウォーキングしてるんですけど、慣れてきたんで、もうちょっと筋肉をつけるのに効果的な歩き方ってないかなと思って。","textVersion":"sha256:c9c97180c695dd574f4101d1f3f2c73caf57826ba0f9b9b7a9ace035267f8e8b","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":21.78,"end":30.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-3","text":"今はどんなふうに歩いてるんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:a69953775c6f8df99d235993bcb99a1d402190c0f9293b6fee4407f519db8a59","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":30.9,"end":33.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-4","text":"背筋を伸ばして、歩く姿勢に気をつけるとか、手を大きく振るとかしてるんですけどね。どうも効果が感じられなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:7db66825776129cb68a04b3a901809bf967a295f3b5322036e47408a05fd1d22","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":33.38,"end":42.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-5","text":"うーん、足を高く上げるように意識して歩くと、すごく効きます。しばらく続けると、筋肉がついてきたっていう実感が得られますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1b0093428af13582dd0ae00bcf9fcf70ab80fef4bb90c3f4b2fbe6d7abb553fb","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":42.1,"end":52.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-6","text":"なるほど、それはやっていなかったな。さっそくやってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:9bbc338a4da4830069100e367ffab29cab716a8b1aa5221759c9fa4fdf83021b","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":53.74,"end":57.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-7","text":"それから、歩く速度を上げるっていうのも一つの方法ですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0e2e751ddd23ef35705ce944c96d7e3dfb14574bd43d326a419ec21328c48722","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":57.32,"end":61.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-8","text":"あ、それはもう意識してやってます。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:d546b73736d40ac7c5ed67449d02fd2d7382cf4e297faaecdb8efa9c1f8c2bca","audioVersion":"sha256:2a5e6671c52a5ee74cc3ffb8d6c381ce7e7222e02e4edbe217e3d9065f125ab6","timelineVersion":"sha256:49f0bee87f536752b62a44f2e684429bfb2318f2151e330b813f8c287b8e829d","start":61.92,"end":65.94,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"2526c3aa297384f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:question","text":"二番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:fc657e531e895e5315641b61d1ef26314778e077288ddf660227888dc65e361b","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":3.94,"end":14.34,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0","text":"部長、建設予定のマンションについての資料ができました。チェックお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:927a1fc18bcc7d4df53473f31a041a1d457b7b618b6c5e674448f72d35e3483a","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":17.88,"end":23.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-1","text":"うん。あー、この公園の写真だけど、これって、山田さんが自分で撮影したの？","textVersion":"sha256:8e1630279b38bf918edcf2cb5f39aeed0528c42666e51abc6adbaf5fe26c9cf9","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":23.1,"end":30.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-2","text":"あ、これ、無料のサイトからダウンロードしたんですけど、それにちょっと手を加えてみました。","textVersion":"sha256:2366e24167866e81f79bc828985854d71447db388b9977667afbfa947a715e45","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":30.22,"end":35.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-3","text":"ああ、そういうサイト私も使ったことあるけど、無料って言っても、使うにはいろいろ条件があってね。勝手に加工しちゃだめなこともあるのよ。","textVersion":"sha256:c30fff68c9c4463c2594866afba380f74eb5361c7f88c1bd8bbc86ab1c0ca0e6","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":37.38,"end":46.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-4","text":"えっ、そうなんですか。知りませんでした。じゃ、この写真は削除します。","textVersion":"sha256:34e8cebc07c32875b80f35fca0159d5ce63d92562f176ce94f6ed80b43e54a4a","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":46.32,"end":51.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-5","text":"うーん、近くに公園があることはこのマンションのセールスポイントだから、写真は残しておきたいな。きれいに撮れてるし。加工して使ってもいいか、撮影者に連絡とってみてくれる？もし今回使えなかったら、そのときは山田さんが同じような写真、撮ってきてよ。","textVersion":"sha256:56ee819d325d39c83b8eba1cc340220865e9c10441600a41134efc1b627185e1","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":51.26,"end":69.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":69.32,"end":69.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-7","text":"これから、無料サイトの写真を使うときは、利用条件をちゃんと確認するようにね。","textVersion":"sha256:3b13818d53b4264b8ad67fa017b4fc4bee43b39603f0cbb4279f1f3c52db02ec","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":70.3,"end":75.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-8","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:c8f3ab5c7c443db9e6a7bb4db0072f4594f84cf993950ee6c471b4df97e3561c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8538385136fbbb00b4290d26713d5d6b40e58a02913d912eed0e9bfc46109d00","start":75.62,"end":77.3,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"2526c3aa297384f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:question","text":"三番：市役所で男の職員と女の職員が話しています。女の職員はこの後何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:de9d8be7bcd50ec3289a2610773a6a7f5c886471926bf751c6dc99ef70852158","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":3.86,"end":15.12,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-0","text":"鈴木さん、この間頼んだメール送ってくれた？来月の市民講座の参加者に。","textVersion":"sha256:edbab0243458e748a136eb6f8ad4c7219bd9e7961ebb9fcab9196b7c3590d979","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":16.72,"end":22.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-1","text":"はい、昨日、当日の内容、持ち物や注意事項などお伝えしておきました。","textVersion":"sha256:a0a445fd9a3e7d2ca75dab10231c31291f857d5c33b995378627cef41299836d","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":22.42,"end":28.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-2","text":"ありがとう。でも、最近は迷惑メール扱いになって、ちゃんと読んでもらえないこともあるからね。それは大丈夫？","textVersion":"sha256:8dc85be24be405675e373da5832e78beae85214c258be0de90dacb060d94434e","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":29.3,"end":36.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-3","text":"はい。メールを受け取った方に必ずその旨返信してくださるよう一言添えてあります。","textVersion":"sha256:5f76655b940444173bee2b855064f3d0e06a65a967faec0e432520489c803893","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":36.78,"end":42.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-4","text":"そう。じゃ、数日経っても返信がない人には電話するしかないか。それを僕がするよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1678a72336efb29a996d870123cd51092662993ae03fb588d182eb31df5bf8db","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":43.62,"end":50.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-5","text":"はい。あのう、当日参加者には６つのグループに分かれて作業してもらうんでしたよね。まだグループ分けまで手が回ってないので、これについては連絡できていません。","textVersion":"sha256:dc9bc977303039fcbdf325299e87da30be2f09bd552f830ee0d8c360afa513fd","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":50.18,"end":62.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-6","text":"参加者に知らせるのは当日でいいから、グループ分けはやっといて。なるべく性別や年齢が偏らないように。","textVersion":"sha256:2204fa219e237db7b23a9998e8d4bae8339378b877062d6aa317237157f9ab95","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":62.94,"end":70.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":70.06,"end":70.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-8","text":"それから、参加者名簿を印刷しといてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:6accca7f96bf7a4efad6ed108b53b35b467cce654c20af2d24b464925c14e5e3","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":70.86,"end":74.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-9","text":"それなら、メールの受取確認用に作って印刷したものがあります。","textVersion":"sha256:2d6725a44f4d55966e49e0674729a7dd823305773e67a64e5bbbd26114c26144","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":74.46,"end":79,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-10","text":"さすが、仕事が早いね。","textVersion":"sha256:7f54b5a3aa2a24a565b15e2974821d1ea95498e6628651609d051b9a3da2d881","audioVersion":"sha256:6b3eb5334eae2257d9c286adbee1ab32c3c4c50090a9ac4f2bdd3e15e3d277c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b4caa45900c3654b346f4bce856f6bfc9b5e98828b4a220b7cb659684a60ca0","start":78.94,"end":81.24,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"2526c3aa297384f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:question","text":"四番：女の人と引越し会社の人が話しています。女の人は引越しの日までに何をしておかなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:801d08518fd65e86af11d4428270fc2a2c09a2b1e5e8561a8426a421614780a1","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","start":3.74,"end":14.34,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-0","text":"じゃ、荷物がたくさんありますけど、当日よろしくお願いしますね。","textVersion":"sha256:c7e8357dfea91b7bbc2ceb00bc0f40d70ccce5be33e9ebc3c6e662d843647e8c","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","start":16.32,"end":20.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-1","text":"はい、お任せください。食器棚やたんすなどの家具は当日丸ごと梱包いたしまして運ばせていただきますね。","textVersion":"sha256:f77c4cf08c8186733177ee2ab0dc456b1db85d6de914b0d762a9f8f246d0c3ff","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","start":20.52,"end":27.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-2","text":"はい、中に入っているものはどうしたらいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:4944a86e6908b8f4ceaa0723f3735de7a1c82789e1c80e795c7bf5130fd8c7ee","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","start":27.8,"end":31.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-3","text":"あ、お皿につきましては、私どものほうでシートに包んで箱に詰めさせていただきます。衣類のほうは本日箱をお持ちしましたので、あらかじめそちらに移しておいてください。","textVersion":"sha256:1d2c81abb762dd2a9fd212b86ecc988474ddabe843b59c2eebd629ef8482a5e9","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","start":31.1,"end":42.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-4","text":"はい。わかりました。それからあと、パソコンは？","textVersion":"sha256:8a1535f709e52611c29ac724320f82e5e100c0496df63b7f7746199e35ae2171","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","start":42.42,"end":46.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-5","text":"はい、お客様はパソコン安心サービスを申し込まれていますので、当日専門スタッフがしっかり梱包いたします。データのバックアップにつきましても、お客様の立会いのもと取らせていただきます。","textVersion":"sha256:3028312a01bb8a1b673969529b80ce8d694753d4f83c754e9a3029e36febf14a","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","start":46.4,"end":58.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-6","text":"ああ、そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:e61a6cc6a0f662ae70e6611a99d6c3b98385cf5f9dc257fc063f1e93e72618fd","audioVersion":"sha256:9e36d513545d984915506d6e86358bc656af5ff90dd89175ff862b80fedb9d04","timelineVersion":"sha256:5c75f01f9c50e8b1fef11ed831556e35c21985c63fcd4ee6e338894de6c629d2","start":58.66,"end":59.84,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"2526c3aa297384f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:question","text":"五番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:34901e6547c1e319bd3aa06b4df1744a0859d462073900b9ac512a45262599fd","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":3.82,"end":14.34,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-0","text":"課長、今度うちの健康茶を愛用してくださっているお客様をお呼びして、ご意見を伺う予定になっていましたよね。お客様に出す案内状できたので、見ていただけますか。用紙の下半分を切り取って返信していただくようにしてみたんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:f1e2edec13ea7292a91d6473bfff09c620c47c1b337f3d41d3639009c35bf2e8","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":15.84,"end":34.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-1","text":"ああ、ありがとう。座談会のことだね。今回は一年以上飲んでくださっている方の中から、参加者を募るんだったね。","textVersion":"sha256:28fbb4365da6d014815ab2aeddc7f182ea89035b5ab28975d8c78bfc43eeb2a2","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":34.92,"end":43.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-2","text":"はい、健康茶は即効性があるものではないので。","textVersion":"sha256:1251cea94d567a9130c477ad363a105b2cca81bef3cc8f7fa5ab1ee504c87dff","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":44.16,"end":47.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-3","text":"うん。あれ？座談会の予定日が３つあるけど。３回も来てもらうの？","textVersion":"sha256:7778dd2bdd418f5c0bd1b265658446fa109853da2b2a94e6961cf379eb0b023f","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":47.48,"end":53.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-4","text":"いいえ。人数の調整がしやすいよう複数をお聞きしてますが、おいでいただくのは一度だけです。","textVersion":"sha256:ca65ddc53575a1db8402a5129b0331426f27b3bc9bc4b44b212e735c7a824c6b","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":53.8,"end":60.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-5","text":"ああ、そうか。あ、謝礼については、ただ「出ます」っていうんじゃなくて、ちゃんと金額を明記したほうがいいなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:e000912fc741d3cb7b1c0408374ed87c563663ed4a79900214c81d979ecff449","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":60.52,"end":68.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":69.06,"end":69.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-7","text":"それと、せっかく事前に用紙を返信していただくのに、日程だけってのはもったいないでしょう。何か少しでもご意見をいただけるようにコメント欄を作ったら？","textVersion":"sha256:5025bbbd37f6a4f729f2927891e1168689c703034ba5f72578933f53ca8635b2","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":69.58,"end":80.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-8","text":"あ、はい。それは裏面に。","textVersion":"sha256:adc7b0dfb20f53839729db016576e9de2de7d71ec6dbe0a39401eddb59f189fb","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":80.44,"end":83.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-9","text":"あ、そう。じゃ、いいね。","textVersion":"sha256:433948b0b692fcfa0b97c04c4a5234d7a6b4317dc9c2b6cade0dc51f70ab92ee","audioVersion":"sha256:7f5f0991af938d05b2a015c950145ebcbe0bb30768bce89517adf8c75f8c4e0b","timelineVersion":"sha256:45a73028655e65df6f3718bbb747a0ce4304383bb9e62b2b5eb40bafd1fffbb7","start":83.32,"end":85.84,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"2526c3aa297384f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:question","text":"六番：ギター教室で男の人と受付の人が話しています。男の人はこの後すぐ何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:28bfcca77418ac1473ba15099b542880553ccb162ad7cf9b211d4fce0166e4ea","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":3.54,"end":13.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-0","text":"すみません。来月からしばらく休みたいんですけど、休んでいる間って月謝を納めなくていいんですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:2cb2ea70881a2a259de5974c5090a327bbd30ad77c495e6f5176e8dbe4dbc1fe","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":15.34,"end":22.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-1","text":"休会でございますか。失礼ですが、どのような理由でしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:ab5455e68322effece104bbea47c3faad001faf21caa5ff255e3f8d82fa0e569","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":23.12,"end":27.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-2","text":"仕事が忙しくなっちゃって、しばらくこられそうにないので。","textVersion":"sha256:ab093b75ba02813ffc834197b76e5c5d463ff645d6ea485dfd76430f456f343a","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":27.92,"end":31.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-3","text":"申し訳ございません。入院などやむを得ない場合を除き、１ヶ月以上お休みになる場合は一度退会していただいています。","textVersion":"sha256:46109d15e42dce715d92f2509ac57d8cc63d1646cf96fb6de2b0d050da307d1f","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":32.04,"end":41.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-4","text":"退会？やめるって決めたわけじゃないのに？","textVersion":"sha256:7ffbb9a76cd0757a9e9ed4e47c9d731ced75974ae58162b8fd60a081015ee930","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":41.62,"end":44.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-5","text":"あるいは、月謝をお支払いいただいたままご欠席という形を取られることも可能ですが。","textVersion":"sha256:3af789e872a169d9d46de5d5ba313c8897e5b21d89f3b58c152b933d06409551","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":44.88,"end":51.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-6","text":"えっ？休んでてずっと月謝を払い続けるか、一度退会してもう一度入会金を払うかっていうこと？","textVersion":"sha256:345648858f9f1ffab62a28a5a244aed56954a1b4f0810b386cbb686224d8de05","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":51.62,"end":58.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-7","text":"そのようになります。入会金は一万円ですが、月謝はどのクラスも７０００円以上はいたしますので、お休みが２ヶ月以上になる場合は月謝をずっとお支払いになるよりお得かと。","textVersion":"sha256:d088ae7ef69425ff1fcfebdbf5714ae94da1aa8b6a7f93683f88e1d29a8f3d2d","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":58.86,"end":72.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-8","text":"うーん、半年は無理だろうな。ああ、再開するときはまた入会手続きか。面倒だなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:346351432cae90054a75752304ee246b5124367ab3bf71d8873ca269c2666ea0","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":72.56,"end":81.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-9","text":"申し訳ございません。","textVersion":"sha256:c8d699659ded4e74bf9c3ab81b76dab0290fe4d2e3ebab4afe4d3bf1c1772040","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":82.06,"end":83.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-07:6:line-10","text":"しかたないか。じゃ、今日付けで。","textVersion":"sha256:12cc6a37723c63535115bc936a962d74db08d9be2b597a19085031755559ed27","audioVersion":"sha256:10dfef0155042342fe7335a683348d4d6921d84e2e1b5d3dba4fa0bfe1f464c5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1e7b938e088e468687073cb9d02698021eb00c829c21161fee418ecad5de343c","start":83.7,"end":87.32,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"2526c3aa297384f5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:question","text":"一番：市役所で男の職員と女の職員が話しています。女の職員はこの後何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:7b5acbd44619b7a4dd304e7156c2c50534aa73a262f5b06932b0b92c98bd65b5","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":3.48,"end":15.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-0","text":"佐藤さん、来月の親子工作教室、今回も応募多数だったね、定員オーバーだから抽選しなきゃいけないけど、準備はどう？","textVersion":"sha256:592d32894e2ed59151d8a87f4007d86bae45ec340ee5b43849816ee58ba6b18f","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":19.2,"end":28.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-1","text":"はい、はがきを整理してすぐ抽選できるようにしてあります。","textVersion":"sha256:38cc77a0298300377fab4976b509d73eb02ffe871f06c3db0c8fa5c996631350","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":28.7,"end":32.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-2","text":"そう。あ、それから工作教室の会場なんだけどね、予約していた会議室はほかの課が使いたいから譲ってほしいってことで、うちと交換することになったんだ。工作教室はもう少し小さい部屋でも大丈夫だから。","textVersion":"sha256:14556baf7c47121c909e74dca4f8da9c0039eb38b7b34a012edd8226a3ffb83f","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":32.58,"end":47.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-3","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":47.04,"end":48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-4","text":"建物は同じ市民センターだけど、四階の会議室から五階の会議室に変わったから。講師の先生にお伝えしといて。会場の予約は改めてしないで、大丈夫だから。","textVersion":"sha256:be34d49604fd8426a506b78ef03bdd5bc392fe9617f2537e955c4d889372ce6e","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":48.3,"end":59.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-5","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":59.12,"end":60.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-6","text":"それから、当日使う画用紙とかのりとか、文房具切れているって言ってたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:1770da0ec9fe198ef876fde4960c650bb686489b81a3e1108e3eddc24d991867","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":60.32,"end":65.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-7","text":"あ、それは補充ずみです。","textVersion":"sha256:de2ada8c2593cd8ed227377130064166a967f2ab3a6e8589faaa9915e59fee9d","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":65.42,"end":67.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-8","text":"あ、そう。じゃあ、そういうことで、よろしく。","textVersion":"sha256:76fc98605ae817485cc66c70b50fac2ce6bafa7dddba7bc2aef0beff82eb0da7","audioVersion":"sha256:e6b4508cf1f888fa7e70b74a263de80b544ee7050c6fc125d35406a796679314","timelineVersion":"sha256:94c8e903c7cebff75e7247b6a43c79e3867f18703101cf6f8f7f071ee86d75c1","start":67.54,"end":70.3,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"4e684d8732a55613"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6c894a59ba8bca50b5af96b82bfc986db916dd87be96d6b0b4882dda8325dab3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c64ed9df0cc407106e8bf15be564875bf57355bd8b838211ae1291b592c75","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:question","text":"二番：大学で職員が話しています。学生はゼミの申し込みの結果をどのように確認しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8cebe63c29f38a8544ecc70910a2b5d14aab72be534cd9de011a02d0486bfed4","audioVersion":"sha256:6c894a59ba8bca50b5af96b82bfc986db916dd87be96d6b0b4882dda8325dab3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c64ed9df0cc407106e8bf15be564875bf57355bd8b838211ae1291b592c75","start":3.72,"end":13.66,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-0","text":"ええ、ゼミの申し込みの結果の確認方法について説明します。第一希望から第四希望まで選んだかと思いますが、希望が集中した場合は、第二希望以下のゼミになる可能性があります。","textVersion":"sha256:1fbb758e370fb9943aae9f73977520886d39c960e72fd5fc81d8e572d0c0054c","audioVersion":"sha256:6c894a59ba8bca50b5af96b82bfc986db916dd87be96d6b0b4882dda8325dab3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c64ed9df0cc407106e8bf15be564875bf57355bd8b838211ae1291b592c75","start":15.5,"end":27.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-1","text":"結果は来週の月曜日に学生課の掲示板に張り出します。","textVersion":"sha256:79c575bc9bbcef06b8c4952ef5632ec3698211407e762fc8c4da2feea8d82497","audioVersion":"sha256:6c894a59ba8bca50b5af96b82bfc986db916dd87be96d6b0b4882dda8325dab3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c64ed9df0cc407106e8bf15be564875bf57355bd8b838211ae1291b592c75","start":28.08,"end":32.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-2","text":"担当の職員は個別の結果については対応できかねますので、各自で確認してください。","textVersion":"sha256:4d5e1354d5e7056b5801109a0b6b4fb1bd79f9aad6abe68fda412accaeb45960","audioVersion":"sha256:6c894a59ba8bca50b5af96b82bfc986db916dd87be96d6b0b4882dda8325dab3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c64ed9df0cc407106e8bf15be564875bf57355bd8b838211ae1291b592c75","start":32.16,"end":38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-3","text":"申し込みはウェブ上で行ってもらいましたが、結果はウェブ上には掲載しません。","textVersion":"sha256:f15938b01c65525464b2c05d422f06285cd315414795f853971c3c2453d98ede","audioVersion":"sha256:6c894a59ba8bca50b5af96b82bfc986db916dd87be96d6b0b4882dda8325dab3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c64ed9df0cc407106e8bf15be564875bf57355bd8b838211ae1291b592c75","start":38.42,"end":43.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-4","text":"直接先生からもお答えいただけませんので、気をつけてください。","textVersion":"sha256:5a44cded81a65a324b0370ce6556c10d26d6ab12916cfca203e7f41e75d05b9e","audioVersion":"sha256:6c894a59ba8bca50b5af96b82bfc986db916dd87be96d6b0b4882dda8325dab3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c86c64ed9df0cc407106e8bf15be564875bf57355bd8b838211ae1291b592c75","start":43.3,"end":47.08,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"4e684d8732a55613"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:question","text":"三番：パンを製造している会社で、男の人と課長が話しています。男の人はこれからまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:6b8f6dd1c522e916f65366613e0c49faa9d376537af2da6580774bbd993d804d","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":3.54,"end":15.38,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-0","text":"課長、今度の新商品候補のパン、味見してもらえましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:a97b861c145a85bfb2c8b406b5d528ea867255ee2adec934df81aa2c0d6a268e","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":18.92,"end":23.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-1","text":"ええ。","textVersion":"sha256:30224d71f95afa967c387b6513d7bcc534c393cc15c36334b132286ff5d66c36","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":23.3,"end":23.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-2","text":"いかがでしたか。今回はこれからの季節に合わせて、レモンを生地に練りこんでみたんですが。。。","textVersion":"sha256:f57a1cffc979f3e94b2dd7a4407f41a1ea5ee08e27bfb5135caa2285ae7c1c73","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":23.8,"end":30.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-3","text":"うん、うちのレモンクリームパンと若干方向性が重なっちゃうんじゃない。同じレモン味だから。","textVersion":"sha256:cbe9803fdfe1d229c36b096081b8c6f0f63736818f27107bfe62dd7c914c34a8","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":30.1,"end":37.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-4","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":38.06,"end":38.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-5","text":"練りこむっていう発想はいいと思うから、後はいかに味の差別化をはかるかが課題ね。改善案をまとめて出して。","textVersion":"sha256:138cf1ea5129156c8030158e42b452552d12b0a7c3bf07ed9a4615589269cc03","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":39.2,"end":47.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":47.86,"end":48.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-7","text":"あ、作業に入る前に、レモンクリームパンについての消費者アンケートの結果も出たみたいだから、それを先に読んで、参考になる意見もあると思うし。田村さんのところにあるから。新商品も開発が進んだところで一度アンケートを取ってみてね。","textVersion":"sha256:94a33ed3cb01cd54b8c3f6b1651671646477580041d7ae9846cf22d3558ec8e3","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":48.48,"end":65.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-8","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":65.88,"end":66.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-9","text":"それから、商品名も考えなきゃね。具体的に商品の方向性が決まったら、特徴を考えながら、いいのを提案して。","textVersion":"sha256:dc221d15e1eb131e0e71c4222a2d5972f58e801df226ea38066221b2499c385d","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":67.34,"end":75.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-10","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6cfc031579159a6ee1281676c440152bdb0fcb3b00620188c50d79f200de85ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e3d49f689c50956f365b384218efdc271859c15d045c08cde6f8bd4c2dd83a9","start":75.76,"end":76.42,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"4e684d8732a55613"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:question","text":"四番：大学で女の助手と先生が話しています。女の助手はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:a420ba309f35a8f25ebff4ed1f306b62d51d2cdeff6d5719901dcaf9c57bf721","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":3.74,"end":14.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-0","text":"あのう、先生、この建物の一階の裏口を出たところに、大きな蜂の巣ができているのを見つけたんですが。。","textVersion":"sha256:979a7fc22bbb187fcf0ffe8c819664abd3155d2496e4b856949421d2ae550e38","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":16.7,"end":24.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-1","text":"ええ、そんなところに蜂の巣？すぐに事務室の人に連絡して、専門の業者に駆除してもらわないと。","textVersion":"sha256:4dc78f5cf68db9c950ac7713d16fb01d1ca2323666acb5e77789c3a1dd1e7bfe","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":24.18,"end":31.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-2","text":"そうなんですけど、もうこんな時間ですし。。","textVersion":"sha256:d05c56a907f32576435e4bbddabf66c8a3a2965757250b190e77a012e39ea6b5","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":31.88,"end":35.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-3","text":"あ、そうだね。しかも、今日は金曜日だったね。週末ほっておくのが心配だな。","textVersion":"sha256:e3ffe1d10abcd13a44734a24db098fedf24d760b69cf53e4efdb86c07e9bc1aa","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":35.1,"end":42.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-4","text":"ええ、とりあえず殺虫剤を買ってきましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:8de20962076d246f95f537f0e3d89772bdc2deaac2b2a60369855774c8673bfd","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":42,"end":45.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-5","text":"自分たちでやるのが危ないから、やっぱり専門の人に駆除頼まなきゃね。悪いけど、月曜日の朝一番に事務室に連絡してくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:eb9ea278ce5267d1f4544acfb5c4b78627edc2e52159f3cbd7fa430564354b11","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":45.9,"end":55.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":55.08,"end":55.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-7","text":"それから裏口を使わないように、裏口のドアに張り紙をしといてくれるかな。土日に裏口使って刺されると大変だから。","textVersion":"sha256:c8ca087327b7930c959f87578b42251db15ca3db6ba7d73a0789095909a79fde","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":55.68,"end":64.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-8","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":64.48,"end":65.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-9","text":"後、それが済んだらこの建物に残っているほかの人にも伝えなきゃ、それもすぐに頼むよ。","textVersion":"sha256:79ec326e9be727f47e97d49a1a56695c3d48c98a2709b4174bfa37df9f751ad5","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":65.48,"end":72.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-10","text":"あ、残っている人はこの階にしかいないので、全員に伝えてあります。","textVersion":"sha256:6fefc30dcc06c6cc3c0df8558d2853a66e4efac603d68af2884b06617cdcdc1a","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":72,"end":76.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-11","text":"ありがとう。じゃあ、そっちは大丈夫だね。","textVersion":"sha256:dd88d3fe3dc31a4891b3c1ee99ddc5aa9e83a233cf7e5203c583e64096ad5d9a","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":77.68,"end":79.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-12","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:31580e5db472ab72b80fd02dce5cff5f15cf16ad5b31aeca87e665215d29dfa8","timelineVersion":"sha256:4b09a1dd7d1570d657f2f08bc559b1c024e0921d0dd68734011627d37f6f5640","start":79.56,"end":80.04,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"4e684d8732a55613"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:question","text":"五番：電話で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。女の学生は来週の打ち合わせまでに何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:8c6be8f70d5bf89ab4d4cb5e84fc7a6de6f921c208a05b74b0d43f9adc24d6ab","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":3.84,"end":15.94,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-0","text":"もしもし。","textVersion":"sha256:0c170454ca9211753d46cef76f50406cf059a634dcb7bf1c19e4273b43ad7d04","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":17.46,"end":18.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-1","text":"あのう、先輩、山崎ですけど。例の異文化理解の共同研究の件で相談したいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:dce21107c29ff0bf9213b36bbc71556da7f624435e4ae69a7560826936331c9e","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":18.26,"end":26.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-2","text":"うん、なに？","textVersion":"sha256:477bee3385e3f75b507630e5846282d4091eac8bd9125b3a5252d7739f9cfcf7","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":26.32,"end":26.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-3","text":"本調査の前に所要時間とか内容とか確認するために、予備調査することになってましたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:6a27799e57b10916548ac2d8d93dc536bb336e595490f55dea54ed6fa5dfd2bc","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":27.4,"end":33.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-4","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":33.76,"end":34.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-5","text":"で、昨日予備調査をしたんですが、実は記録用のビデオに不具合があったみたいで、一部録画ができていなかったんです。すみません。","textVersion":"sha256:f9b1f7846e8d46e20cd6cd5355fe0e1222f5778cc88a1049c4ee476aa37bf6ca","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":35,"end":44.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-6","text":"うん、えーと、予備調査は五人の人にインタビューして、それを分析して来週の打ち合わせに持ってくるってことになってたよね。現時点で何人分集まってるの。","textVersion":"sha256:d689551fd266083aa065934534b53f4141ecf0cb926792d442b8948238f468f2","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":44.62,"end":55.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-7","text":"ちゃんと録画ができたのが三人分だけです。","textVersion":"sha256:30b1dbe21f921100aa8462a961fe4a172b48576e84f0969c70ed4650159a6406","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":55.72,"end":58.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-8","text":"今から協力者を再募集するっていうのもな、とりあえず来週の打ち合わせには録画できている分をやってきてくれればいいよ。で、そのときに予備調査の報告をしてもらって、本調査に向けて改善すべき点をまとめよう。","textVersion":"sha256:0814433dcb1c29e607edc932299bed6358cdc76a2be0407dda3039392a91f2ca","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":58.66,"end":72.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":73.24,"end":73.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-10","text":"まあ、予備調査でよかったよ。あ、つい最近、僕たちが今やっている研究に近い内容の論文が出たんだよ、先生にも薦められたから、山崎さんにも読んでもらえればと思っているんだ。来週の打ち合わせの時に持っていくよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6b4f535a879581b2e96e02516d689a1ee86bd56035aa0127385974961471d377","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":74.1,"end":88.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-11","text":"はい、分かりました。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:127b542e6f5e8432564d16c42cf48a7e4c110d7afe92111c2c68ac9dcd6212fb","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd27b9810d7fd5d950290f8a669d2010df73a60995d77714cbe17c46a9a11e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:20e13ecba424ca26db294ef00ab3e2f4139475c1e7c806263c0aeb276f030dec","start":88.42,"end":91.52,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"4e684d8732a55613"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2014.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2014.html"],"batch":"n1-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:question","text":"六番：会社で女の人と社長が話しています。女の人はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:422eecdf5c4d4d5650dd667ab708b38b63fca5457fa43eb1f6d3db4fe9d2a3c1","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":4.08,"end":13.5,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-0","text":"社長、田中電気に持っていく見積書作ったんですが、見ていただけますか。","textVersion":"sha256:3dfabc77150e52578ed0651d66981d157d8db1545f996654f7b0b36978aac278","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":16.98,"end":22.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-1","text":"うん、新しいねじのだよな。うーん、もうちょっと値引きできないかな。ほかのところもこのタイプの部品は作っているから、このままだと、新規の注文をいただくのは難しくなるぞ。","textVersion":"sha256:187ef3ef7cae2f0398fececb06d79551ed08943f703217e43ad60a9e2de1ab43","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":23.28,"end":36.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-2","text":"検討はしてみたんですが、これ以上はなかなか。。","textVersion":"sha256:bf339b6e1f82e0c2e23ec59e7c18cd3324c1457cfc526875eda17c9607c0bbd2","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":36.52,"end":39.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-3","text":"そうだよね。これが最低ラインなんだよな。","textVersion":"sha256:f3ff178b99d0001b0c3524eb3820e0d1ccf3934502ef1a8b14355332243cc964","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":40.86,"end":44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-4","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":44.38,"end":44.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-5","text":"先方にとっては安いほうがいいだろうけど、うちにはそんな余力ないしな。じゃあ、見積金額はこのへんで勘弁してもらうとして、納期の希望は確認してあるんだろうな。","textVersion":"sha256:8bc4c44ea3f72f528af21b4368266ebe10c2a9002e4bc8d7375d46c3cb6465d8","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":45.32,"end":57.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-6","text":"ええ、実はもうすこし早められないかと言われているんです。","textVersion":"sha256:4da2991ddf8c99459fa6ae050ae9a31c99f9f0f12ce5d9cf17dcf2eba6f0a674","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":56.98,"end":61.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-7","text":"ほかに工場のほうは急ぎの注文入ってない時期だろう。これを優先させればできるんじゃないか。","textVersion":"sha256:3b00f8ee82778a3b9a0f90ddd68df72ab468a859654390fab4065a0b130c4048","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":61.98,"end":67.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-8","text":"そうですね、できますね。","textVersion":"sha256:891343c1a3ca5ec7f1b046cbd511a319169bacf992ef6ffaa1f7abe13bf98e22","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":68.8,"end":70.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-9","text":"でも念のため、生産のスケジュール確かめて。。。できるだけ、早い納期を見積書に入れて、おっと思わせたいからな。ライバル企業も同じこと考えるだろうからすぐ動いて。","textVersion":"sha256:3158cf58ec66d697696a3b3fd4444aec896274374493dbd0e30dc32fb87786e9","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":70.84,"end":82.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2014-12:6:line-10","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:a8dec0a7e040704fdeddce28bd4294d978811b64b043aaf30ad799fa34b0d538","timelineVersion":"sha256:5e645c02e1c1ad0a5b50d2416cacb2d98c0200f541c76fb527df5401c3772d53","start":83.2,"end":84.14,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"4e684d8732a55613"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:question","text":"一番：女の学生と男の学生が話しています。女の学生はこの後、原稿をどのように直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8692b5a1745aac7be4dea08cacb4cfb3871ed4bac717c47acc9196c416076003","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":3.38,"end":13.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0","text":"先輩、毎月出しているうちのサークルの広報誌、今回から私が担当することになったんですけど、原稿作ってみたので、ちょっと見ていただけますか。","textVersion":"sha256:666e3a8aa49017cd51ab70a9d29be3da0fa2fe116e565d6328b0063756696cb8","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":17.5,"end":28.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-1","text":"へえ、今までのとだいぶ雰囲気が変わったね。","textVersion":"sha256:3dcaa532205bf1c6f62a99ea047831551fda3b217adc90d4bac8f488babbe565","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":29,"end":32.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-2","text":"はい、友達にイラストレーター志望の子がいるので、今回ちょっと協力してもらって、イラストを入れてみたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:4e562b7c93ce430004038d45c102d59db8bbd28e746c74e1569e82bcf37608d5","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":32.8,"end":40.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-3","text":"うん。レイアウトもよく工夫されてるし、うちのサークルの楽しい感じが伝わってくるね。","textVersion":"sha256:086dc602eac3c2e8235ce8f29667483a7042c5336af7be0e3629cf1adec7348e","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":40.7,"end":46.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-4","text":"よかった。文字はどうですか。全体的に、字体を変えてみたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:2f28f2b52edf0e8c6a9ecf636b994c6cb1bdd4f537d5f227c352e48d4efdc26a","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":46.36,"end":52.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-5","text":"うん、いいね。あ、タイトルの部分はサークルの顔のようなもんだから、いままで通りのほうが馴染みがあっていいんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:59d1ce94362d9dffc6a91aaa2a034036a0669b1ba732478ab6b35b6c55312efd","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":53.4,"end":61.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-6","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":61.72,"end":62.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-7","text":"あと、今回イラストが入ったから、写真はもう少し減らしてもいいと思うけど。","textVersion":"sha256:78f2da83f49ada1528de085fa6bc8974a8ae1bf6049061b343e3b33b0a62ef86","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":63.38,"end":67.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-8","text":"うーん。活動中の写真、読者からはなかなか好評なんですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ce43ed2bf14db358b47993de51fc30a5bb8bc36b21ae916e8d851f6413c4390a","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":68.36,"end":74.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-9","text":"そっか。じゃあ、さっきのところだけ、お願い。","textVersion":"sha256:baa6701eed123c0aff40b12bf1d3b7f7b8b6a419d45efa93f7eb84302477dfdd","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":74,"end":77.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-10","text":"はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:18d2ff50b951ddb3ce339017a80a9a6dc1c1ce5a19553206efead7a638dd54f4","audioVersion":"sha256:64eb97f5aad3bb88cbe2c7b40e2fb8bca7b755ada2606168675281d2984f32c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:18584306795a68b99926926106dc09efc013a1f203617e4bd5d83bafbf2562bf","start":77.52,"end":79.34,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d2132bd0f6c97ea1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:question","text":"二番：電話で、女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこの後まず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:4ec4fd82f2ea21ce195c0a4ce60aae7813a6e0d1b35c0d6300e7e5105a6ec061","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":3.8,"end":14.46,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-0","text":"あのう、すみません。四月から御社に入社します。山本と申しますが、送っていただいた書類について確認したいことがありまして、お電話いたしました。","textVersion":"sha256:b2d98efe22b1b114d094ba7af9c1d26e1797e486438b551e569d7be1958bd70a","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":16.14,"end":27.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-1","text":"ああ、はい。山本さんですね。どのようなご要件ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:95ec8d64342b6fad3d573a2339d17e67e45279127f622263751892648293b544","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":27.44,"end":32.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-2","text":"あのう、受け取った封筒に、契約書が二部入っていたんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:93b5e21347baddf4139977c0af77d25b36044149cb192d7ff8d2547b60873a2d","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":33.06,"end":37.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-3","text":"あ、それはサインしたあと、両方返送してください。","textVersion":"sha256:05ff225a445225e97776085c913558217790ebf21a78d84d8cad2e2c6a40c079","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":37.88,"end":41.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-4","text":"はい。あと、給料の振込先なんですが、指定の銀行はありますか。みどり銀行の口座しか持ってないんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:aa9068256ab96e37f81cac43f4068d3421f0b3d96606ce62188785ca737ff12d","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":41.3,"end":50.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-5","text":"口座はご本人名義のものなら、どこでも結構ですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d7b50c706083a5f6c2990faf2f30085167e7ddf1e715d23e9a545b89f97cfc94","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":50.88,"end":54.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-6","text":"分かりました。あと、もう一点。 交通費の申請用紙と住所届けも入っていましたが、実は、近々引越しを予定してるんです。ただ、決まるまでに、すこし時間がかかりそうで。。。入社までには決まると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:0d7f7fbe5fb603b842c4f1bf93bab5750977da27379d0c28ea8ba4934ad6f165","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":54.54,"end":72.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-7","text":"そうですか。では、新しい住所が決まり次第、すぐにご提出ください。","textVersion":"sha256:37296074ec26f75c2347c549b95cf5a23c2d57add03b8de0d5a8996796c0de22","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":72.4,"end":77.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-8","text":"はい、お忙しいところ、ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:111c4587955fa45b9cdbc337ca6d131f91270ad497e55f4ff121ffcae15f2576","audioVersion":"sha256:b4a509c36fdae71a45707b32e88cfa531b48ac61769abc09d3f23030294fd4d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:60fb1a94e540fc4a7205e8cc73aca544dc711b4a94c7b4b5545fef9970f2268c","start":78.26,"end":81.02,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d2132bd0f6c97ea1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:question","text":"三番：大学で、留学生と先生が授業の発表について話しています。留学生は予定していた発表をどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b9249a96065cfa45a0040b546e2a25113d07611525cff2866dd6a3def5108a37","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":3.76,"end":15.06,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-0","text":"先生、ちょっと相談があるんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:213f340aae05ab9dfe4b7cbd56bfcf74b412ed6679d3a59493e40dd9979d828a","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":17.3,"end":19.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-1","text":"あ、リーさん、どうしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:22072e57a644bdd3b0ed5efbb8c89c1e537e5035551d83dc29d023aa9f1f23cc","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":19.88,"end":22.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-2","text":"あのう、わたし、来月の十日に、この授業で発表することになってるんですが。実は、その日、国から両親が来日することになりまして．．．日本ははじめてで、日本語がまったくできないので、わたしが空港まで迎えに行く必要があって、授業を欠席させていただきたいのですが、発表もありますし。どうしたらよいかと思いまして．．．","textVersion":"sha256:c450e488a19fc50ec9a7cd10594bf77f70fd90ed9fed2deb17a688179e21a54a","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":23.58,"end":47.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-3","text":"そうなんですか。分かりました。発表はそういう場合、普通は次の週の担当者と順番を変えて発表してもらうんですけど、今回は内容を考えると、順番が変わるのはねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:b15f8f025e3c40aec2da03dd0254558b9fee1ddd1728b2681aba03970784de7f","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":48.42,"end":62.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-4","text":"ああ。あのう、では、発表の原稿や配布資料はすべてわたしが作成して、当日、ほかの人に読んでもらうということはできませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:8f51ccc08525f4141c65c3f2a0283a3eedf7be39d4a39ab0523cb4d9bca0dbd3","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":63.06,"end":74.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-5","text":"いや、発表するまでが今回の課題ですからね。ああ、そういえば前に、事前に発表を録画してもらって、当日みんなで見たことがありました。","textVersion":"sha256:9b685ad3576264f46f0a3640f4b194e8d0f8bb6f00bf57db500290e8f1e7e686","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":74.96,"end":85.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-6","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":85.82,"end":86.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-7","text":"それだと質疑応答ができないんですけどね。まあ、でも、今回、質問はみんなにメールで送ってもらうことにしましょう。休んだ週の次の授業で答えてください。","textVersion":"sha256:e509aad9f8cef0e6f912b81bc88bc201b22ebb4f499654269c10c6bfa4a34977","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":87.16,"end":98.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-8","text":"はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:18d2ff50b951ddb3ce339017a80a9a6dc1c1ce5a19553206efead7a638dd54f4","audioVersion":"sha256:df7edc5007f9a7af1baeb5706cc45904619340d9064f2ab3cfa1ce3a8719c827","timelineVersion":"sha256:104e9620a8532f1b96768accd5437773c10d0419ad7ea9578735eb5f47694001","start":98.78,"end":100.34,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d2132bd0f6c97ea1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:question","text":"四番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はこのあとまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:3cbbaba72b553b2020e8541effcec0f34b87a58692eb5199f7dc12cc3e9d4aed","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":3.78,"end":14.46,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0","text":"課長、いま山田通信さんから連絡があって、先日うちが納入したシステムがうまく作動しないということなんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:24a8e59f9595226dffc3a4648d15a5c4733e06f006ec6ab89e5d46d529458fe5","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":15.92,"end":23.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-1","text":"え、本当？じゃ、先方には至急伺うと連絡して。","textVersion":"sha256:762361b2fc3a39403e2dec00727e9fc74deee31175fc2ef0f5734ff9c1434c56","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":23.64,"end":28.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-2","text":"あ、先ほどの電話でひとまずそれだけは伝えました。","textVersion":"sha256:6a554acf58d7f9b6cb3e360155e6889bbd386405bb4e2b3d2f97746c54dc8899","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":28.88,"end":31.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-3","text":"そう、それじゃ、仕様書や契約書の類を揃えておいて。","textVersion":"sha256:3d8e0fa0a658752a2261bbf899ee6d1ca416cc55a72944ee0b74a98b757aba9f","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":31.7,"end":35.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":35.88,"end":36.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-5","text":"あ、システムの問題ってことなら、技術部にも同行してもらいましょう。そっちの段取りから先にお願い。","textVersion":"sha256:d74b4d4f750ef9fe2296b68ba8138d06e4e431b5bab89c346baed82fa86ebd0f","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":36.96,"end":42.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-6","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":42.82,"end":43.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-7","text":"それと．．．どの程度のトラブルになるか分からないけど、部長に報告しておく必要があるわね。","textVersion":"sha256:4e16aa3cbd503ad5813c471ebbc3f6a350d41e4c4708da08a7d4f40defebddf3","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":44.24,"end":50.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-8","text":"では、それもすぐに。","textVersion":"sha256:f7e493f204d117afba8a3df58589bea02562eeb19963d85ca498b145bb324a54","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":50.48,"end":52.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-9","text":"あ、わたしこれから別件で部長にお会いすることになってるから、そっちはやっとくわ。","textVersion":"sha256:d4cfb8198493cb393378a2306e61eb6ffa38006b143ffde01495c0990b25e8d1","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":52.04,"end":57.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-10","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:9d11af4e7711201e07e42919dd0c60adb1dfb942b2ce05a96adcd6b6f195056b","timelineVersion":"sha256:674abb25aa9bfee7e07f5194ee7a8ada3df854ead79d14c2e5f0d6a258ecc3cc","start":57.2,"end":58.74,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"d2132bd0f6c97ea1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:question","text":"五番：大学で女の先生と男の学生が研究計画について話しています。男の学生はこのあと、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:43d12035ee92c2b5944bc14f580064bd38e8efb2e387163ab64ad1a74659a851","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":3.76,"end":16.7,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-0","text":"この前出してくれた研究計画、見ましたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f779a6cbd26ef303b6646fc8634b9f17dddbd726a775d27e0a973a64acaccb25","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":18.16,"end":21.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-1","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":21.52,"end":22.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-2","text":"テーマはだいぶ絞られてきたわね。いいんじゃないかな。うーん、調査方法は子供にインタビューしてデータを集めるってあるけど、幼稚園児を相手に？","textVersion":"sha256:53450ac0e5c1530358ae1981184946d5cc6ca865ea4d9b1da706b7d5e6d6e8d0","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":22.88,"end":34.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-3","text":"はい。そのつもりですが。","textVersion":"sha256:af23fc94d174a383aa27d385ed6292b2a5f691a92376b941a652ae3c39f942cd","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":35.16,"end":36.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-4","text":"小学校高学年にならないと、話を引き出せないわよ。幼稚園児の行動が研究対象だったら、幼稚園での様子を観察するのが一般的よ。あとは保護者の方や先生に話を聞いてもいいし。","textVersion":"sha256:95c7df7dad10dd8d164d6fa859b30b75e68bc9626e3935c30fee70b3e80f5074","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":36.7,"end":51.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-5","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":51.56,"end":52.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-6","text":"基礎的な文献、ちゃんと集めて読んだんだから、わかるでしょう。検討し直してね。","textVersion":"sha256:288f914ebb344a83613aa795d6132bb0c268dc9b476700662e2260e7c840ed6b","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":52.8,"end":58.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-7","text":"はい、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":58.8,"end":60.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-8","text":"それで、協力してくれる幼稚園はもう目処がついたの。","textVersion":"sha256:17e204bc12e547c670823dafc9b5942beb419030cdd7ff52f37385bc5c3e188d","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":60.8,"end":64.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-9","text":"はい、僕がバイトしている幼稚園でデータを取ってもいいと言われました。","textVersion":"sha256:1cd74707e60af5034b3da380427f0c9a371cd633e17b7767754555447dcf504c","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":64.34,"end":69.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-10","text":"それはよかったわね。","textVersion":"sha256:e8afec22eb201b3d490b2da8c6087b474d0bcaaee5827a0b52f9d2e497afa28c","audioVersion":"sha256:395875f25215bd4fbc74a69366fd0802fce9d1b1d3f06dad060099c1cd4c0219","timelineVersion":"sha256:f706337b44c39e636be495f9923a7208af37ad4c629a862c2d0fd1ec3d7f085a","start":69.24,"end":70.8,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d2132bd0f6c97ea1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:question","text":"六番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人は新たにまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:39e374852c1f390b3191258a4a2531ac118e34edb62b316e2e6fab496e7543a9","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":3.88,"end":13.64,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-0","text":"先輩、わたし来週までに新しい金融商品の企画を一つ出さなくちゃいけないんですけど。アイディアが浮かばなくて、どうしたらいいでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:7fbf3d7702abec392a69cf1d1665bf0a8513a03a8e5fa41ec47f32e7988d4fa7","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":15.2,"end":25.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-1","text":"僕が新人の頃は、まずは「市場調査データを分析しろ、ニーズを冷静に分析するものが勝つ」って上の人からよく言われたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:eee889e6c0e83d574ca2377cff59885eb652e05c5295f450dd07a116f6b13cd4","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":25.38,"end":34.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-2","text":"それ、わたしも言われました。やってはいるんですが、なんだか既存の商品と似たようなものしか思いつかなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:eedc2eb6ae585bb14cb5ed82c75a3805d30aeac1b94ab131266c1b64121e6012","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":35.02,"end":42.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-3","text":"まあ、僕も最初はそうだったな。じゃあさ、いろいろ思いつくことをとりあえず片っ端からノートに書いていく。バラバラで関連がなくても気にしないで。そこから意外な関係性が浮かび上がるってことがあるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a17764f308f55bb8d8009245817650104fc2c59bb791b376516486b62b742e56","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":42.62,"end":56.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-4","text":"アイディアを出せるだけ出すんですね。やってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:7f1f03721efdb42ff3440d03fab5f1e62cea16302067a6dafc0483f9a9ff695e","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":57,"end":60.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-5","text":"それから、異業種の人と交流することってすごく大事だよ。ほかの業界でいま何が話題なのか、どういうニーズがどこにあるか、世間話をしてる中から学べるからね。僕にとっては一番の情報源だよ。まあ、人脈作りに時間がかかるから、来週までにっていうのはちょっとね。","textVersion":"sha256:43e0618d6e6ed9f0ef2a08ff060b14094bc8d3c5858fa90bf9007018f004f92f","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":60.4,"end":80.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-6","text":"へえ。今度、わたしもそういう場に連れてってください。","textVersion":"sha256:ee06e4e42f2e0edc92971aa2bc2947dd881efe94e288aa9a40372b78d301ef4f","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":80.38,"end":84.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-7","text":"うん、いいよ。ほかには、そうそう。発想力を鈍らせないために、関係なさそうな分野の本とか雑誌なんかにも目を通すようにするのは鉄則だよね。","textVersion":"sha256:91ab3d98f5c12d19427db75ed69bdaad5cc70b62ca58bc612b25ed7706f5e85d","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":84.6,"end":95.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-07:6:line-8","text":"ええ、それはいつも意識しています。先輩、いろいろとアドバイス、ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:0d9f69a1b0e2b1ed77db41509fec464cf773656c2af84bd3628b267795eee6f3","audioVersion":"sha256:6674c41907fff9535da580e1216f64808fdd0bada7b8961ea5edce89fe244f4c","timelineVersion":"sha256:12d68c86149230cf07362d2a525e9f7be759562259580f834c98fda459432c7c","start":96,"end":102.28,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d2132bd0f6c97ea1"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:question","text":"一番：大学で男の留学生と女の学生が話しています。男の留学生はこの後何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f25e783eb4bc4234a920241247b5dadd17010861674bd5f5e6f1154ad5378b62","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":3.62,"end":14.22,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-0","text":"今週末から一時帰国するんだけど、一ヶ月もアパートをあけることになるから、ちょっと心配なんだ。何か注意すべきことってある？","textVersion":"sha256:2901ff57e56eed6afa09ddae56d0bf563f91e68ee4f178cd318bc30a47a07162","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":15.62,"end":24.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-1","text":"そうだな。郵便局に不在届を出して配達をやめてもらうといいかも。郵便受けいっぱいになっちゃうから。","textVersion":"sha256:2bbc3d5bf2ca169e962f06c5962d9bd93f6759368bb2b4d44c4c923fc9e14292","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":24.38,"end":31.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-2","text":"うん、それはもう手続きしたんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:e1b159bbb06bb8b18ef52d3d27102abf8d55a94d91cbc762d9d7c72ff7b553c4","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":31.84,"end":34.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-3","text":"あっ、アパートの管理会社には知らせた？","textVersion":"sha256:b74de7764e2b5c0ed7633b789f6c7b817a8ac5dbeb50d1e57be7ba0fa7a0f2fc","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":34.22,"end":37.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-4","text":"えっ？そこまでしないといけないの？友達にかぎを預けて時々見てもらえばいいと思ってたんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:df126ec058dea22810388ddea8dd2b6ac673ee0591ec3758f645c71b1331cf7c","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":36.96,"end":43.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-5","text":"それだと、友達がなくしちゃうこともあるし、かぎの管理は自分でしたほうがいいんじゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:650a6cdc3f74e66e966eb672440d46af343a592826d975f77756b279ccd8078f","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":43.46,"end":48.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-6","text":"わかった。","textVersion":"sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":48.84,"end":49.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-7","text":"それに万が一不在の間に上の階から水が漏れたりとか、素人じゃ対応しきれないことが起きるかもしれないでしょう。そういう時に迅速に対処してくれる場合もあるから、知らせておくに越したことはないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:5a27555a0e8f729d327f18e0ec8aff613127e8c152bb8dbe067352e03bfc2521","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":49.54,"end":63.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-8","text":"なるほど、そうするよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6560adbdbaece4b37553e7fc02b665ad2f65dc0e549efbcd82bad50f8a9df55c","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":64.06,"end":65.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-9","text":"あと、冷蔵庫の中のなまものとかはきちんと処分していかないと、大変なことになるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0833dbcabc5bf4704f55e05e590a5a8ba939f5a6417d7cdce16360b82c7c6e3c","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":66.24,"end":71.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-10","text":"そうだよね。まあ、料理しないし、いつも空っぽだから、それは必要ないけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:06b3fe98491e6e0c7610aef63b4eff4267b310b445311bddd224fb4373661df7","audioVersion":"sha256:aaedc95e855ee257912cb5c953ec2dac062e6e5846dbfa5d198131c0b2ec7f88","timelineVersion":"sha256:3474ed9b0d75e88e584a47924eb023699292d1cb71ede09c4157838609b9c058","start":71.78,"end":77.14,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"9e1b5371c645b125"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:question","text":"二番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこれからまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:ac3a52c8c496f40b60a3ccdd111a0b4e0760d176a5d3fb41cb9ce8a9878ee57c","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":3.94,"end":14.56,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-0","text":"おはようございます。お呼びでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:d070d9df2333e6c865d2729f6c5307e4d8d4332aaf1d8331695ca5e22dbd8a2a","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":17.92,"end":20.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-1","text":"あっ、忙しいところ悪いね。実は、部長が風邪で朝から声が出ないそうなんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:caed1e1ae7a75955c3a79c7656cea65d26c1531fc7c1de11a4cffd861fb13d10","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":20.68,"end":27.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-2","text":"今日の４時からの取引先との会合はどうなりますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ec424163b6263e57933169ab5f56a75f70cc6eb6ff5a5e60a4c2dd1ad6798bc8","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":27.42,"end":31.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-3","text":"延期ができればいいんだけど、プロジェクトを進めるうえで延期は難しいんだ。それで悪いんだけど、一緒に会合に出席して部長をサポートしてもらえないかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:1050d2a536096318739f8c0d1047f5652f6e4abc163bbc6cbf4411191a75ed8b","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":31.12,"end":41.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-4","text":"私でよろしいんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:eecc376caef192d06079f10bb88656eaa8068ffb4458cc158a6aa1ed664bebab","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":42.04,"end":43.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-5","text":"君なら今回のプロジェクトに携わってるから適任だと思って、会議室の予約だの資料のコピーだの、そういった準備は整ってるから、とにかく今日の会合の資料を読んで頭に入れておいて。","textVersion":"sha256:2dd5bad09bf9e8db4acf21041df459ef45732f10f02d0bf834b0e4c49e2a6b75","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":43.98,"end":55.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-6","text":"そうですか。分かりました。あのう、部長との打ち合わせは？","textVersion":"sha256:ccf187882a70f873064aff1517c33b5af7f1788cc6ba256fd189ef96a21e6539","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":55.72,"end":60.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-7","text":"もちろん早急に部長と打ち合わせをしてもらいたいんだけど、午前中は部長手が離せないそうだから、今できることしといて。","textVersion":"sha256:529c2c2c97d0132cc1375a6556d45818207e67c255c493f4fd41c8c9f8c456c3","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":60.28,"end":68.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-8","text":"承知しました。","textVersion":"sha256:ab6ba1f659c6e35fe52cd5ab20ac40bfe98e7c674788f711e9877e68302e8b1b","audioVersion":"sha256:a337cc7ce6ad3d111ecf113a64f38d4cb662076c487c539faa8eeb367d0d5536","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf3c3838d4a3fba122e52afbaf837306b058a30c90bd152642d145bcb6fa534a","start":68.26,"end":69.5,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9e1b5371c645b125"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:question","text":"三番：会社の広報部で男の人と女の人が会社案内について話しています。女の人はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:c6f441acbd5285e1d57e18fde483f622a6695edd5492fcb57b849f861b08be90","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":3.82,"end":16.66,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-0","text":"来年度の就職希望者向けの会社案内の案、見たよ。社長の写真変更するんじゃなかったの？十年前からこれだろう？","textVersion":"sha256:33ab134275b641d1a1e026b27251fee98049a2f13f1eb73a244d0f46c338beeb","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":18.2,"end":26.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-1","text":"新しい写真も撮ったんですが、社長がもとのままのほうがいいとおっしゃって、社長今週いっぱい出張ですし。","textVersion":"sha256:25cade3e758192e7082fe4f060e7fa8910900b75413f7e1ebc11f6bc449977bf","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":26.84,"end":34.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-2","text":"そうか。じゃあ、しかたないか。表紙の方は前は背景の色がグレーで印象が暗かったけど、淡いピンクに変更してぐっと明るくなったね。","textVersion":"sha256:b3a91720ff10046f232e7bef6cd00093c1dc2edf2ab917a2acba40c82b706897","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":34.54,"end":45.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-3","text":"ありがとうございます。それから内容は昨年のものとほぼ同じですが、各部署からのメッセージを新たに入れてみました。","textVersion":"sha256:b81cd57ccfab2633242f6420998714fb4682101766d0e544f396f1bf0c7ad495","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":45.4,"end":54.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-4","text":"うん、この営業部のメッセージ、ちょっとアピールしたいことが伝わりにくいんだよな。ここ表現変更しといてよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d99d73fe146a6d82ae88cf7b232d7facdbb2bf8ec6dbcb3420899d00e698fb66","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":55.44,"end":62.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-5","text":"あのう、いただいた原稿をそのまま載せたんですが、勝手に手を入れてもいいんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:a01e36e146854bd7854b98222ca305f712f21e8f9aec134a3228fdb163d6d0c4","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":62.88,"end":68.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-6","text":"あ、会社案内の編集については広報部に一任されてるから。念のため、営業部に修正することは伝えとくよ。じゃあ、金曜日のミーティングで内容の確認したいから、それまでに。","textVersion":"sha256:91dc280facffb87511b597b7b5b18fd6d65069932dcc05be01048ca370adb1f1","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":68.42,"end":81.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":81.06,"end":81.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-8","text":"で、やっぱりさっきの社長の写真だけどね。社長が戻られたら、写真本当に変更しなくてもいいか、もう一度聞いてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:86cf6868a028805edf2ec5ca807ee2acd74907a8e23c782bba6cef37a1ca3d2d","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":81.7,"end":90.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-9","text":"分かりました。戻られたら、すぐ確認します。","textVersion":"sha256:c33735772f2ba82f80d1f89aa26d0b032ea3a4ea49da8163e98a71474cfe0420","audioVersion":"sha256:00a653e40f26290ebf7893457bb3d5b9f32ef1ae8778f7f714d3c7a258341c70","timelineVersion":"sha256:34cb2ac192764e5888268004ce545cae7fc8c34bb3e5613581cf8a4f5ddeb5d7","start":90.36,"end":93.82,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9e1b5371c645b125"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:question","text":"四番：園芸用品の店で、女の人と店員が話しています。女の人はこの後まず、どの作業をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4c59af8288d530f60e4c8c15bbac55fec895536ac48d936d6cc2fd0e87570989","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":3.86,"end":14.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-0","text":"あの、すいません、種から野菜を育てたいんですが、ちょっと教えていただけませんか。苗から育てたことは何度かあるんですが、種からは初めてで、土に種を撒いて水をやれば、芽は出るものでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:e9e1d164b3a6d41bc28882f27500a7cb3c01285d4fa3f46ef0a2981390a159d6","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":16.32,"end":31.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-1","text":"大概のものはそれでいいんですが、ものによっては逆に、先に土に水を撒いて、水分を含ませてから種を撒かないといけないものもあるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1eb7962bc092b9e6da739bb04af8276aceac2be72e225513208bd2284ffaeaf6","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":31.7,"end":41.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-2","text":"えー。","textVersion":"sha256:25c32f422ec803844eef3134cee59e645407ed183eed25b19b9c4e33c14ab80d","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":41.9,"end":42.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-3","text":"細かい種だと、水をやったら、土と一緒に全部流れちゃいますからね。育てたい野菜がもうお決まりでしたら、種拝見しましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:5664f5b05ccefa29840e9139011564e9f9d7f740a8f5036d3b0e833fa43b10aa","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":42.72,"end":51.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-4","text":"あっ、これです。","textVersion":"sha256:957ca3fa8c237fa70c6916a9ac021ae16cc1b1db647aaa92f2c92671d4f9d1a5","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":51.34,"end":52.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-5","text":"あー、これはまさに今言った逆のタイプのものですね。種が細かいですから。","textVersion":"sha256:f3fe7ae3d1b1c43ed8744116e3a68d5c080f13d4669be5579097d93b8f69e005","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":53.9,"end":58.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-6","text":"そうですか。聞いてよかった。やり方も一つじゃないんですね。","textVersion":"sha256:d7ee476f2d06cc8501f30d20b98c3595e611fe09f42ab6fd30c229259fe82aff","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":58.74,"end":63.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-7","text":"ええ。前もって種を水につけてから撒かないとだめなものとかもありますしね。あと、苗から育てたことがあるなら、土の準備とかはご存知でしょうかね。最初に土に肥料を入れて、しばらく寝かせる必要があるんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:ad1ba6ed421e68c85b0e693a3991dffdab07528d1a70f91e2c212ce62cd00b16","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":63.52,"end":78.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-8","text":"はい。肥料を入れて、今日で一週間になります。","textVersion":"sha256:281e37074567897d4c96819ff2a8af258e88bbb919a9cfe6213070e6ce73eaf7","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":78.32,"end":81.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-9","text":"じゃ、ちょうどいいころですね。","textVersion":"sha256:f95c13d02ef6a329de9234d135a30a1aeb1c0735b6ec20559d90137b82bab3d5","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":81.6,"end":83.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-10","text":"はい、じゃ、今日帰ってから、早速やってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:3f084afe58e690d21818b75424d8d60664c910ece2857f750373d83a74c41d89","audioVersion":"sha256:d17f2066866679bc5c2c8737726bd1473385dadda79dc4712155f3abbbcf67b6","timelineVersion":"sha256:2a45b7ebb413876f14928d369be99893eeb60eeb94aeee5c2faf2b8eabe81b8d","start":83.46,"end":87.22,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9e1b5371c645b125"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:question","text":"五番：会社で、女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこれからまず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:6489403da818c0d83c0e04620a096e894843d6e0a8ae62adf99f97abeedb3374","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":3.68,"end":14.36,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-0","text":"あっ、課長、今山川デパートから昨日うちが納品した商品に間違いがあったと電話がありまして。","textVersion":"sha256:f6befc3996dcc5aaa2cefa94a6702c85bb3f880e9a952973a16dd393544a2358","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":17.9,"end":25.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-1","text":"えっ。","textVersion":"sha256:2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":25.16,"end":26.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-2","text":"新しいデザインのTシャツを百枚納品すべきところ、五十枚しか届いてないそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:557db6a9f9a6bbbe12ef1fc803fe568f24997c1f91c13e7cfb4d1f7859310d9f","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":25.96,"end":31.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-3","text":"それはまずいなあ。まだ電話は繋がってる？","textVersion":"sha256:76fd61e48562bf09e1bbe2c340b73ee82bd3c9691f69cd652390cb574600c6f0","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":32.08,"end":35.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-4","text":"いえ。課長が席を外されていたので、折り返しかけ直すとお伝えしました。","textVersion":"sha256:77a0d6a738da34c4136493afa2d9e7e5ceeb211249dd9ac830e972dc0d526261","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":35.06,"end":40.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-5","text":"じゃ、それは僕が。で、えっと、まず、倉庫の在庫を確認してみて。","textVersion":"sha256:da35cf5d733b7117e51e91d6e1cef28cc9cea06db63266de1aa4c0a27d1d31f0","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":40.24,"end":45.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-6","text":"はい。在庫はありませんでした。工場の方で、商品はもうできあがっているんですが、工場から倉庫に届くのは明日になります。","textVersion":"sha256:efb59f5a9376e30da3acd993aad8845696636a9d28a3883da4aeb37c7d082dc0","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":45.9,"end":55.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-7","text":"そうか。できているなら、工場から入荷するのを待ってるより、こっちから直接行っちゃった方が早いなあ。じゃ、それ頼めるかな。で、その足で謝罪も兼ねて届けに行ってくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:9d57269250ccc6dcf69a4cc847ae6c48945e272501b72f5d910d64759cc002e9","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":55.28,"end":67.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-8","text":"分かりました。じゃ、工場に連絡してから出ます。","textVersion":"sha256:86f99a7b977aa19a53cbfcbc4e7d172f627248c6684d0d6f18a58ba593b5fb2c","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":67.62,"end":71.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-9","text":"いや、連絡はこっちでしとくから、君はすぐ向かって、できるだけ早い時間に商品をデパートに届けたいからね。必要枚数を受け取れるよう手配しておくよ。","textVersion":"sha256:dd96747f973ac898034a832c56f78268c571c47524d4dbe58a693830a329807e","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":71.34,"end":82.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-10","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a03f74d05da048b453e59bd4fd6493745847b0772334280f42f034fababd9528","timelineVersion":"sha256:2dbdb062a5fa6766cce1e8b340e20cb272f01c723a082fbd9a039172b1c2053a","start":82.12,"end":82.7,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9e1b5371c645b125"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2015.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2015.html"],"batch":"n1-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:question","text":"六番：大学で男の留学生と女の留学生が話しています。男の留学生はこの後、レポートをどう直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f65cc84d3537a6b3aa65cfbcb3bcfbcdcdc5b231d5b35275daeefef3735a6620","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":3.72,"end":15.38,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-0","text":"リーさん、日本語の授業でテーマを一つ決めて日本と自分の国を比較するっていうレポートがあるんですけど、去年リーさんもそのレポート書いてましたよね。僕今書いてるんですけど、思うように進まなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:59310f52ab38cd30e84f82f09e1c1c1c93f8b103253b63006918eaa3ef2e5034","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":16.8,"end":30.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-1","text":"あー、うん、私は近代文学を取り上げた。後から参考文献を追加したりして、苦労したんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:0dbbf31c95b5cdb4a6782ebc423b9e012fe6a08c51a2c5381548cbd571b9b714","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":31.14,"end":38.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-2","text":"僕も国の文献、手に入れるの大変でした。僕は建築が専門なんで、日本と自分の国の住宅の歴史的変遷をテーマにして書いてるんですけど、指定の枚数を超えてしまって、短くしないといけないんですけど、なかなか。","textVersion":"sha256:6528b2031810aa45703a82ffa4871dfd91f16dd3e2b65a97c1a5b340671318de","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":38.92,"end":54.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-3","text":"じゃあ、住宅の中でも特に関心があるものだけを取り上げたら？","textVersion":"sha256:ddb3ae25cba84b6edcb83e2b4beeed2fa83877008cae5c386631628e968f51ba","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":55.1,"end":59.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-4","text":"うん、どれも興味があって、対象とする期間を短くするのはどうでしょうか。今は４００年ぐらい前から現代までの範囲で書いているんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:0420578a4cb21df15a0ec7158b38195f3ff8557d4251dc3dc282706204b248c0","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":59.36,"end":69.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-5","text":"長すぎるのも読みづらいけど、かといって歴史的変遷をやるなら、あまり短いのもね、そのぐらいは見ないと変遷を示せないよね。","textVersion":"sha256:96f4586130f76e343832b11402512909585bdb6b1e11bd42bf7939b98292584c","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":69.86,"end":79.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-6","text":"そうなんですよ。となると、調べた中で特に集合住宅が面白かったんで、それに絞ってやってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:59c71ac7359c1dd9cdc806c79485bde9c47c52a95a23af3396728a128ca7d4e8","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":79.42,"end":87.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-7","text":"うん。写真とか図は入れてる？視覚的に相違点を示せば説明も短くて済むんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:7f269910a71223763ca3b9b4a60249f41dcab64e1f11612809a627e8869da096","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":87.18,"end":94.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2015-12:6:line-8","text":"はい。入れられるところにはもう。じゃあ、頑張って直してみます。","textVersion":"sha256:0699957439a2547c55825b6ae87b8a5438d8ced3303f5c1168b09f31ec25184e","audioVersion":"sha256:b55770dbcd5c27ca6c02645239756eac6a11d5db8edb202bdf8cbdf35a8d1be0","timelineVersion":"sha256:39d93203f6a371098909ab47632f246db9cf2e80f4283d200fb116fd53073df8","start":95,"end":99.54,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"9e1b5371c645b125"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:question","text":"一番：ピアノ教室の事務室で女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこの後まず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:e8e142d7f5f61c35b334b7f899abbaaed65df3858e4c0f7849bfb5c8b759df57","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":3.8,"end":15.14,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-0","text":"あっ、主任、今森先生からお電話があったんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:3692fa78aca53770f3ee753e3be7d75be3f5d552cf0a349d1a3c626e3a4d3cab","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":16.8,"end":21.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-1","text":"森先生？いま夏季休暇中でしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:36122e07bf89ed00c09defc3fec4acdf04c20948e60c260f80a5ed7de809b966","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":21.46,"end":24.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-2","text":"ええ、それが旅行に連れていってた先生の犬が旅先でいなくなっちゃったみたいで。","textVersion":"sha256:23f884b94c900327fed75033ee3a08a69b3292d8a40f5b7c426f1ca20f31f7ba","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":24.5,"end":31.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-3","text":"え？","textVersion":"sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":31.24,"end":32.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-4","text":"必死で探してるみたいなんですけど、今のところ手がかりがなくて、時間がかかりそうなので、できれば来週もお休みしたいと。","textVersion":"sha256:bdc300fa5f8b23d3176ea3b847fb759bac9acab1ac3eaa2306fa9e7afb865de4","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":32.48,"end":41.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-5","text":"それは困ったなあ。確か森先生今回の休みも当初生徒さんに渡してたスケジュールと違う週に変更して取ったんだよね。ご主人と休みが合わなかったとかで。","textVersion":"sha256:bccdac86e02a56983187c91a267f73bc939cd479de38f0dd9c0256a6aece442e","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":41.9,"end":54.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-6","text":"ええ、それは生徒さんにお願いして休みを一週間入れ替えてもらってなんとか対応できたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:83c2316dab8c87ed965b7d4982d22f93be91f1af17a0ff2ccc8bba27711cb9f4","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":54.28,"end":61.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-7","text":"でも、急に休みが変わるわ今度は延びるわっていうんじゃ、生徒さんも困るよね。来週休みにしないで代講にするか。代わりの先生どうにかならない？","textVersion":"sha256:aa60234b653977352f98347aeb0ef6570b3802d1117a2dfc64b208f0a7a8e0e0","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":62.48,"end":74.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-8","text":"それが時期が時期なんで、なかなか．．．","textVersion":"sha256:64c61e14642cecfc67f1d0eb8f9acb87e1684b0519632a6ded3ebb78ebddc762","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":75.08,"end":78.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-9","text":"じゃ、帰ってきてもらえるようお願いしてみてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:a6275eec3c54bc6aab1d371dee1c222ca4037ffba34da465f2fb3e7e24a99675","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":79.68,"end":82.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-10","text":"わかりました。早く見つかるといいんですけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c0c2a2566913806e2e78ab26021b95cb13c83a8cfed14fc5547af9e8ab15a46","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":82.76,"end":86.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-11","text":"そうだね。","textVersion":"sha256:c85cdfda9a14283043e2de3b9a1404b82d3dd712711392e18ee40f6b395adb04","audioVersion":"sha256:a97e4c119e73289a2d92ab396f15c0c971976210aa5c793366890f3116327ee8","timelineVersion":"sha256:84a0ea86e83dafc569b8447d60d52aaeddceeca2302da1f854f442c191b0f318","start":86.68,"end":87.68,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"9d1a71c324e5e194"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:question","text":"二番：市役所で課長と男の職員が話しています。男の職員はこの後何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1f074ac18fc3b86b73bc00440d8f74f99ce4333e2c73a69b85740dcb4e384fed","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":3.96,"end":13.36,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-0","text":"林さん、中学生のホームステイの件どうなってる？海外の姉妹都市から来る学生さんの。","textVersion":"sha256:cce5cb5b4584465ce2b3a55179f65251a9fed4e4faafd02121f884f5a3cafeb2","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":14.92,"end":21.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-1","text":"はい、先日ホストファミリーの募集案内を市のホームページに載せたんですけど、なかなかの反響で、説明会への申し込みは予想以上です。","textVersion":"sha256:6d3d12a8a83aecaa2e1de5697d62144322b5736d1e3e3daf607cb95d3e56286d","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":21.48,"end":30.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-2","text":"そう。滑り出しは順調だね。でも、去年も説明会は満員だったけど、結局受け入れまでいった家庭は少なかったよね。","textVersion":"sha256:bfbe3b8a10baa6157ff576d6cb9957a450a34429f490e45a328cab19ef1a1f1a","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":30.54,"end":39.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-3","text":"はあ。","textVersion":"sha256:fc10529e4cf91d4577a5481f160e85c048f3a9a0e0bf53b7652d3990580ac414","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":39.76,"end":40.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-4","text":"今までは条件の説明が中心だったけど、今回は受け入れ経験者に体験談を話してもらったりしたら、どうかなあ。案ずるより産むが易し。やってみようと思ってもらえるように。","textVersion":"sha256:97ab71d7acb9fecc778901536171c5d1def268d7e37e84f872a6518a011711d8","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":40.62,"end":52.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-5","text":"そうですね。去年はどのご家庭も受けいれてよかったっておっしゃってましたし。","textVersion":"sha256:d1c261cbebe7b907c221118e77f5447eb79808fe704acc38c6b82df71e5d676a","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":53.68,"end":57.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-6","text":"じゃ、そのうちの何人かにお願いしてみてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:5b97e8edecee119114df5c848e692096ae121244e2f4effb99855ae93c3d01ee","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":57.7,"end":61.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":60.98,"end":61.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-8","text":"それから、去年の説明会ではホームステイを体験した学生の写真とか手紙をパネルにして展示したけど、今年はどうなの？","textVersion":"sha256:10cc1cb74d593fc4e7202f596cd23588f930bc2d07afe3ce92f7a45f4fffadaa","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":61.52,"end":70.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-9","text":"あ、それはバイトの人に頼んであります。","textVersion":"sha256:3aa84211056036d978aa5638215777c289e9c17237996ebfa16d680471c4f8e5","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":70.52,"end":73.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-10","text":"学生にビデオメッセージを送ってもらおうって話も出てたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:f4b79e61ffbb70e40d34ace44a335e4af377022eae0f47129502a4f8d8306a95","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":73.14,"end":77.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-11","text":"ええ、機材の確認だけまだなんですが、当日会場で流せるよう準備できています。","textVersion":"sha256:3ee05cc27cbb92e6eb721a99a83d9e68045fb298329832870c39f7d8ec266f3f","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":77,"end":82.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-12","text":"そう。","textVersion":"sha256:b91b50623d821caf8b5cb623882a17198c300af94e5ceea647f8a945ff5720d7","audioVersion":"sha256:e40cd72e557fd0a54fa672e06ad5194f22fb81c89e1cc105b8ed4efd15856340","timelineVersion":"sha256:9d639e0c2e1e322c2f46d7310b49e88c25d4fb412434e1b5d997a9825ad9f3f9","start":82.58,"end":83.2,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9d1a71c324e5e194"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:question","text":"三番：大学で学生と先生が話しています。学生はこの後、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:c7495e2a90fe3adea83f8bbad7a43896288de8b01fd77f983ad3c8d87cf242fb","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":3.54,"end":12.8,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-0","text":"先生、卒論のアンケートのことなんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:f965066cc8dcdc2d0ba1cba77a212e7537c7dc875460221a5f23d44315b68b83","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":14.84,"end":17.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-1","text":"あ、留学生に漢字の学習について聞くんでしたね。","textVersion":"sha256:536ca04471b999b82b6dcb7f460c21de6406c19378fb2b8184214ec406a9ad37","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":18.22,"end":22.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-2","text":"はい、前回先生からいただいたコメントにそって質問事項を見直してみたんですけど、これでよろしいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:9df98993483ab22f6dbf6b53f24a66832ffd72c739e3c50707bb5dc7d2ac6c25","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":22.08,"end":30.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-3","text":"うん、内容はこれで十分だと思うけど、これすべてに回答するとなると、かなり時間がかかりそうだね。全項目自由記述にするんじゃなくて、選択肢にできる項目もあるでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:35d9e2ee445ab9675ceb1e3082aef596d563a98a6b2c553482dd3508d643c671","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":32.68,"end":45.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-4","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":45.5,"end":46.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-5","text":"あと調査協力の承諾書は作成した。","textVersion":"sha256:c41d76107a1cc47dce13f0d55e902d8111c283fa88bd2ae142532503ca4a5811","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":47.16,"end":50.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-6","text":"あ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:688cc368fcc4633fa24fcf881503ca3e1c2828cc1d9b031049dde142f0b7a0b7","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":50.52,"end":51.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-7","text":"アンケートする前に協力者から必ずサインをもらってね。そういう倫理的なことへの配慮も忘れないように。","textVersion":"sha256:279a0f260462239d536ffff2de9d09ac849f69aac13a1b9890b430f49841ffca","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":51.3,"end":58.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-8","text":"はい。あのう、承諾書、先生にご確認いただくために昨日メールでお送りしたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:cf13908efb22d6318b82b294159c9aa692df852129adf25b02c79fdb371ea0d7","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":58.6,"end":65.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-9","text":"あっ、そう、確認しておくよ。それから、調査は協力してくれる学校に出かけてやるんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:49b9f1c69ace5d022433442a41c4e2bfc4dd115243ae4b1e629eada0f5f9e5c6","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":65.84,"end":73.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-10","text":"はい。あては複数ありまして、大方了承を得ています。","textVersion":"sha256:d0cc2ba151622fcbf82a29459aaf4942ec48173c6f2d33bcf8f1f28edf522c8c","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":73.4,"end":77.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-11","text":"協力者の数は足りそう。","textVersion":"sha256:12341959a17ba7b8d7b8589c2a87be2f45ddcd24d3599beb94c65b77025813fc","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":77.7,"end":79.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-12","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":79.66,"end":80.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-13","text":"わかってると思うけど、対象に偏りが生じないように。","textVersion":"sha256:d5c7b223a43527b4b4cc6213bbdcf72a82e423a6397ba46f93330f07b110f1b3","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":80.5,"end":84.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-14","text":"はい。その点は考慮してお願いしてあります。","textVersion":"sha256:e19109e96f1f033b63c8a524aa8d28aefb7d36b8962b4584dc67a779e50dd687","audioVersion":"sha256:9ed93669249b5bfb0fe6aac72648a0f339c71c92aa613bf61c99a0a351bd4360","timelineVersion":"sha256:f1b5a3c03ee57ca20f65ad5b56b84e88f647f2eb9c7e1d7e80537c05dca3583b","start":84.38,"end":87.6,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9d1a71c324e5e194"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:question","text":"四番：塾を経営する会社で社長と女の部長が話しています。女の部長はこの後まずどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ed68a81e99eadf436064ddd9dbe3c3241928f35636eb72495f395390ce0235e1","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":3.98,"end":15.02,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-0","text":"うちが経営している塾全部で5校あるけど、東町校の収支、目立って悪いですね。","textVersion":"sha256:a8345a835711228b31301830dbdf74fe56fb3a830ad922f8718aa932d4dec901","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":16.42,"end":22.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-1","text":"はあ、競合校が増えてまして。","textVersion":"sha256:33b3f1c6946131ea0245b79beff65644371e0259ad8f1ea3910012632258feae","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":22.86,"end":25.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-2","text":"何か対策が必要ですね。今やってる講義形式の授業に加えて希望者には個別指導をすることも考えてみてはどうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:4511b65b1cdfe659ac8f7e0a71a90f0b3fcee55759d68c0400178b8a855ec6eb","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":25.84,"end":35.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":36.14,"end":36.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-4","text":"それからこの業界最近小中学生以外にも対象を広げるところが増えてますよね。例えば高齢者向けのパソコン教室とか。","textVersion":"sha256:d04fb3df4fc852e1c695664528915048a2a825b535e2708454dc72f17afb7411","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":37.04,"end":47.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-5","text":"ええ、ただ先月近くに市のカルチャーセンターができまして、高齢者向けの教室が開講されたんです。市が運営してるので、価格も手頃なんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f98c7e1997210344707c5456b41f84f96769889116459813f8952fec07994a9f","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":47.34,"end":59.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-6","text":"そうですか。他に就学前の幼児をターゲットにクラスを新設する手もありますね。ああ、それから授業をしてない時間帯教室遊んでますよね。部屋を貸し出したりできないんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:7cd6e6febd8b31c571a96c9d9d2c3d9924efebb86a9b5bfadc53dcce84755730","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":59.4,"end":74.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-7","text":"それは今借りているビルの賃貸契約に違反することになるので。","textVersion":"sha256:9a2f35556cd279bc8055f9196c326bb052f7d23a5c64ee74f21c662514dafd2a","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":75.16,"end":80.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-8","text":"そうですか。じゃあ、まずは新しい指導形式を導入するほう。具体的な価格や時間数のシミュレーションをしてみてください。幼児を対象にしたクラスのほうは内容を詰めるのに時間がかかるだろうから、おいおい考えていきましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:4a8eb37901b7fc17f2d8a08d6c9450a178538e0c57ae688eb9da5a47ec8c31ba","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":80.72,"end":98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a0dea446453125bc9e9be50275903ad2d9e83e3a51a58c275032bf8056872ca4","timelineVersion":"sha256:186fbe8729ba59074df64369b32bd0158b1f349718b2c40ff3fbbd16e0a786e9","start":98.12,"end":98.76,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9d1a71c324e5e194"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:question","text":"五番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこの後まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:9ca11efc1ec64a83a3f4e887c5c5f2105cffe961f17f9ac8428fb799b6fbf716","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":3.84,"end":14.58,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-0","text":"山下さん、中野電器さんから追加で受注した携帯電話のケースだけど、５００個。もう海外工場に製造を頼んだ？中野電器さんできるだけ早く納品してほしいってことだったけど。","textVersion":"sha256:5af05f45b10ae79fbc21c83aff31944354b8b4a88e7415f32f21ab4cfdc16fc5","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":18.1,"end":31.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-1","text":"はい、海外工場から中野電器さんに直接送るよう手配してあります。来週半ばには納品できる予定です。","textVersion":"sha256:649533ad81328a54cc358b6f59336f606c9670d564943343f90ee150d4c100e6","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":31.32,"end":39.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-2","text":"そう？工場から直送にしたんだ。いつもは一旦こっちに届くようにしてるよね。","textVersion":"sha256:939c4928ec4f2b5e7d99920a6c20b60531bcb9a71aa67a06014f6102f1881189","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":39,"end":45.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-3","text":"ええ、ただ今回は急ぎってことだったんで。","textVersion":"sha256:462cf99d7ab82f91889dfde3ce6240240ada84d6ea23954b91b411800abdcb76","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":45.54,"end":48.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-4","text":"以前他のメーカーさんに海外工場からバッテリーを直送したら税関で止められたことがあったでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:81ceac3c32a0eea8538de3998120e545677b335fb66bf0def11fa633d14b19d4","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":49.26,"end":55.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-5","text":"ああ。","textVersion":"sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":55.78,"end":56.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-6","text":"あの時は先方の担当者が税関にいかなくちゃならなくなってずいぶん迷惑かけたよね。同じようなことになるとまずいし、いったんこっちで受け取った方が安心だと思うけど。","textVersion":"sha256:11b370d6f29668fd06ebe8553caa403055a8d58bffe483bfc0bec13bb32eaf10","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":56.68,"end":69.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-7","text":"今まで携帯電話のケースを税関で止められたことはありませんが。","textVersion":"sha256:8ace57f7f0c409e6937732e3e1f3df04ac7cf627623e4a5f0e4f9e6513d4abb1","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":69.16,"end":73.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-8","text":"うん、でも書類に不備があったり、万が一ってこともあるわけだし、やっぱり安全策を取っといた方がいいと思う。","textVersion":"sha256:9bc2acbac1614f0eb8546c300cccc6f716a54d00a9cc67531e3d6cab30fdd7a9","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":73.82,"end":83.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-9","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:9c2467ad8e43a520cadbc1f113ce71406db31caec436702a1fc5240e0b83ee62","timelineVersion":"sha256:418e782d60dfff3f31fba09c24a725e73e7cea19c31651fce4346513b69142b9","start":82.96,"end":84.04,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"9d1a71c324e5e194"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:question","text":"六番：会社で女の人と男の人が社内の広報誌について話しています。男の人はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:20101f6502803ee8d77e3a3a37abc244d7fc4e8904754c946e58b9270c74e75e","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":3.82,"end":15.58,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-0","text":"山田さん、次の広報誌、特集の企画は山田さんが担当でしたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:43710aee435099a49225b0775a5a7ae6147b47d9060e4bf8e4fd90b0129a92b5","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":17,"end":22.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-1","text":"はい、特集はまず恒例の新入社員による新人レポート。それから、会社近辺のお勧めの飲食店を紹介するお店紹介の二本立てでいこうと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:27b6d265e37d8cae8e97d9b56c3fe4494247f86e0ef99c71d3e403a2df09f7a3","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":22.48,"end":33.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-2","text":"実は、新人レポートは新人ばかりを取り上げすぎだっていう意見があったので、思い切ってカットしてしまってもいいと思ってるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:50fa309c2f17232889abc275c81a19a87e32beab87bed4c94eaf630b0f6681f2","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":33.78,"end":42.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-3","text":"そうですか。でしたら新人レポートの代わりに郷土自慢と題した企画はどうでしょう。地方出身の社員にインタビューして地元の名勝を紹介してもらうんです。地方出身者、結構いるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1a9a1a62b7baa6c578fce52ff14f7a2b8b2f3ceb5c38950fd755f0d8dd7f8874","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":42.3,"end":55.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-4","text":"なるほど、それはいいですね。でも、お店や観光の事ばかりじゃねー。社内誌で部署間の情報共有や相互理解の促進っていう役割もあるんですよ。2つの企画のうちどちらか1つは違うものにしましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:48a8f8e689e1b194a439b736513c97df8c7099c09a4ac17a165f5697840c72c8","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":56.6,"end":73.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-5","text":"はあ。","textVersion":"sha256:fc10529e4cf91d4577a5481f160e85c048f3a9a0e0bf53b7652d3990580ac414","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":73.46,"end":74.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-6","text":"そうね、お店の紹介は前もやったことあるから今回はやめましょう。今営業部で大きいプロジェクトが始動したところでしょう。営業部の人にそれについて話を聞くっていうのはどうかな。","textVersion":"sha256:bd65e4b873d63c7bbf98780f278afe76209ddbac7940104aa907519689bd6dc3","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":74.18,"end":87.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":87.88,"end":88.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-8","text":"めぼしい人がいるので私あたってみます。もう一つのほう進めといてくださいね。","textVersion":"sha256:aa455561265a8baadc0889747c386d508a8d89719222386d880c700022a585c3","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":88.74,"end":94.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-07:6:line-9","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:c50380598ee0abd9203801753169fa5d5d6a201b199408ca5b5689aba231c9e6","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a0989acc20916ac8c72803551b168ec878fa2a38fbdafae799c4f4476f760ff","start":94.5,"end":95.52,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"9d1a71c324e5e194"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:question","text":"一番：洋服の店で店長と女の店員が話しています。女の店員はまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6d49c878644dd551e09cecac3a6a3709e808dcc80594a242402ed52327aa389c","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":3.28,"end":13.72,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-0","text":"森さん、僕これからちょっと出かけないといけないんだ。その間、店のほうよろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:470827880a2701362fc30b3dba733590da2f9045316394fe68215fafbc5cc8e3","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":15.24,"end":21.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":21.46,"end":22.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-2","text":"今、お客さん少ないから、接客のほうは斉藤さんに任せて、森さんは売れた分商品を倉庫から持ってきて売り場に並べて。","textVersion":"sha256:836c5a5186750268840d2623295de1344966c573c9b243a0a50970ecd7d121a1","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":22.3,"end":31,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-3","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":30.94,"end":32.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-4","text":"あっ、その前に、桜店に送ることになっている商品をいつものように送っといてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:fab0910bb808f32e6894b9756ee3ccd684b13b3b58a82d43934cb6c1f78afa63","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":32.44,"end":37.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-5","text":"はい。それなら、さっきしておきました。","textVersion":"sha256:58a910d8c75e282dd86667f2f0b6c1cc9bffa813abf5ef83dbb34a5044e014ba","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":37.58,"end":40.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-6","text":"ああ、ありがとう。あと、手が空いたら、ダイレクトメールの発送の準備もよろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:01b371e29bd43851e68b002119d321ef68fb45094b48c786eae9dfdb37f2fd69","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":40.44,"end":46.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-7","text":"はい、今度のバーゲンのですね。あっ、それで思い出しました。バーゲンのときに店で使う飾りはまだ作らなくていいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:979b7627d1b3bec5621bf6b2613d00ac1fa8c5292dfd5480320768c9c9e51b10","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":46.1,"end":55.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-8","text":"うん、それも急いで進めないとまずいんだ。僕が戻ってきてから、指示するから、すぐとりかかろう。じゃ、行ってくるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:ea2f77214e750fd5011250c7bdf75da44cbedcbee6dce3db15d2c7254f73c441","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":55.98,"end":63.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-9","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:a126e6bccf06d7975f4c3829cb5eadbb83689c21b192747ebe2e1170b91c48cb","timelineVersion":"sha256:fe7d6ed3632e2042e058708fb866c390ee4da14c20ce2edde1164e49a0386f9d","start":63.92,"end":65.04,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a9e7258545430836"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:question","text":"二番：大学の就職支援センターで男の学生と職員が話しています。男の学生はこの後まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6b742320e99f6c9c6e0ddc2558570ec587dcf2a3b8e878308eb7ff2682915c59","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":3.22,"end":15.64,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-0","text":"すみません、インターンシップに参加したいんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:3048096bd4f687a5d3b870dee955385755a6b384c46b9070cfce468a99752c80","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":17.06,"end":20.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-1","text":"そうですか。インターンシップのイメージを掴んでもらうために、申し込む前に、先輩たちの体験談のビデオを見ることをお勧めしているんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:943b60a627909bc6f5a778074b6a29b55638d36fa5eb8510bd728c713879cf0d","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":20.72,"end":30.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-2","text":"はい、それは一通り。それで、川本貿易という会社に申し込みたいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:cfff073f13725faa7dc94cf04579fa0ea237fc8d2d5ea58ab96482bb5e032167","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":30.56,"end":36.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":36.84,"end":37.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-4","text":"あのう、指導教員の推薦状とかって必要なんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:a480502e484e2bb7dafa840ff9de2de396c3ac1d4a97bc6592def46aec5277f4","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":37.88,"end":41.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-5","text":"はい。実際の業務をするんで、保険にも加入する必要があります。","textVersion":"sha256:4143a4eb174824c74e381c534478331f6c5f82f361bb2ce57c0bb8b103e8367a","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":41.6,"end":46.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-6","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":46.38,"end":47.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-7","text":"あと、グローバル経営という科目はもう取りましたか。この科目の成績がよくないと、申し込めないんですよ。成績が優か良であることが申し込みの条件になってます。","textVersion":"sha256:fd60cf2b7012300e370adeea102ca6edaa788c16b858ace87db1ebf3d6bb3aae","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":47.82,"end":60.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-8","text":"あー、その科目去年単位は取得していて、確か良だったと思うんですが、どうだったかな。うちに帰れば、分かるんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:5aa7968409965dca7067633e99bb90331bd17e2863756839a3276c6f50b7ba13","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":60.28,"end":69.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-9","text":"じゃ、それを確かめることからですね。 申し込みの締め切り自体はまだ先なんで、書類や具体的な手続きといったことはそれからで。","textVersion":"sha256:7ac8e760a0327c4a9e2f11bbd532b4c939d1c90d3654f9c85d826783d7af421a","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":69.64,"end":79.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-10","text":"はい、ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:54d8d0e2410dc87322ecd04110ccec41fc40e0549f03c000f5dd60d8f942228a","audioVersion":"sha256:ada6d5aa00e7c43654198af604133299fb35dabb8b0d594fba66e1e409590fb1","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6f7dcea8a0720bfc91036d28a5e83302795ebf22da688d6067031d3e4036971","start":79.06,"end":80.6,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a9e7258545430836"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:question","text":"三番：旅行会社で女の人と課長が見積書について話しています。女の人はこの後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:78e8dc12074399bf0c026fed2183bc65f3866c082cc3f8744677c5c2bc469430","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":3.38,"end":16.3,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-0","text":"課長、海山産業の社員旅行の見積もりを作成したので、ちょっと目を通していただけないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:162d072b25e1aa6e76923609fb521985a2b7974cad26aa9fdb642bddb0b66689","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":17.78,"end":24.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-1","text":"いいよ。うん、見積もりの合計金額はまあ妥当な線かな。これでよさそうだね。でも金額の提示が大雑把っていうか情報不足というか分かりにくいね。","textVersion":"sha256:193d3fb1030a69d665993089306ff7959efccb5ce244aa827edbee90fe76c80f","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":24.78,"end":38.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-2","text":"とおっしゃいますと？","textVersion":"sha256:fb6535a11f5ee754d71e77257e74d9a58cb587f795472feb5dce8fd4fb19bac3","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":38.38,"end":39.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-3","text":"何にいくらかかるかというところをもう少し細かく書かないと、先方も検討のしようがないんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:3b499cb8d50b9f1db5716ab0ba555828f37f9b3f026680c9c05a256e5bced5b6","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":40.28,"end":46.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":47.28,"end":47.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-5","text":"それから、バスは二台ってなってるけど、確保できてる？見積もりを出す以上は当日移動手段がなかったなんてわけにはいかないからね。","textVersion":"sha256:4c296869407ccad24f2f9722ea66cf5a041e8abed4f9499cb68eacfdcc332743","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":47.66,"end":57.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-6","text":"バス会社のほうからは可能との報告を受けております。","textVersion":"sha256:6f16b70670b68756f0c8e740ac4b6fdfa83bae4cbcfb1f2b042ddccfa5df5670","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":57.14,"end":60.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-7","text":"そう。仮予約取れてるんなら安心だね。あっ、見積もりの有効期限抜けてるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e43a994634b631823b661beb174713742cd59e12d2655e4035aa6374ab4589ce","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":60.88,"end":67.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-8","text":"あっ、すみません。最終的に部長の決裁をいただいてからと思っていましたが。","textVersion":"sha256:c9864380b8553fe811323b4636cf7d08b6407f8ea0e36855a8d752df04b8c3eb","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":67.68,"end":73.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-9","text":"そうか。じゃ、さしあたりさっきの点だけ直しといて。","textVersion":"sha256:30f704b2f2f89ab153897aabc674b3aca4d7965986ca900d018eb1bbdc20b4ad","audioVersion":"sha256:b726738d86c2e9016b2bcadd331a57a30c135fd6777936a5e69c3a47dc2186f7","timelineVersion":"sha256:acc0e3540aa1a0ed1f1e4205a0b28e5fac256ada08a17cd877a20dae83273ef5","start":73.66,"end":78.98,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a9e7258545430836"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:question","text":"四番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:cbec22eb476fbb614ae027c9c7d7b37bd1f8b90e2ca2f92f96dbac0f36b0e36b","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":3.38,"end":13.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-0","text":"林さん、企画書確認したよ。明日、大山商事の中田部長との打ち合わせで使うやつ、直してほしいところをメモしておいたから、修正してくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:16136aba7b800ebfac888373363fe47622cf608e1335e6d2ced6f90dc464cbe7","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":17.06,"end":27.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-1","text":"あの、今、来週の出張のための資料を作ってるんですけど、その後でも大丈夫ですか。あと一時間ほどで終わる見込みなんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:90f375e61c38f87f88fa2c91c2171629e3afb73e08034cb0a823982ac6b0d6da","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":28.1,"end":36.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-2","text":"今十時か。３０分ぐらいで済むと思うから、先にお願いできる？私、一時間後に出ちゃうから、その前に最終チェックしておきたいんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:ff4ed4579533dd3479e658af5cebfbc73a7ec60d5400deb400a6208e8fd28922","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":37.38,"end":47.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":47.84,"end":48.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-4","text":"あと、打ち合わせの後に予定している中田部長との会食の場所なんだけど、いつもの焼肉屋予約しちゃったよね。","textVersion":"sha256:a66b7a100d2e7bdfdde878da98975078420e4c05eb33927d2bbfc4404381a3ca","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":48.74,"end":56.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":56.06,"end":56.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-6","text":"そっか。申し訳ないんだけど、予約のキャンセルをお願いできる？実は、中田部長最近健康を気にしてて、油っぽいものは控えてるんだって。さっき、電話でそんな話聞いて。","textVersion":"sha256:53425532b60342104ea963d9fa90f0f2f4858b0e907dff0d9ab4c345266fd4ad","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":56.88,"end":69.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-7","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":69.94,"end":71.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-8","text":"修正が終わったらでいいから。","textVersion":"sha256:01b0e0839afe2c1bc8e1a153b1f0557524688a6f4b22552877830cc6a7e05bcc","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":70.96,"end":72.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-9","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":72.6,"end":73.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-10","text":"あっ、お店捜すのはほかの人に頼むから。林さんは、とりあえずキャンセルをよろしく。","textVersion":"sha256:2b3ebbcb2988e2fec23eb981600a491af306ca58178f65fe69442e278d46e9ef","audioVersion":"sha256:5b6396a37323bfde0c17e1bc0a51be148cc4e2f96aabe237d9ea0241cb74b610","timelineVersion":"sha256:c828361fadbb12f5a2ed6e95e5d729d7b9510fedc1a925d5e79b96e07f887086","start":73.62,"end":79.94,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a9e7258545430836"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:question","text":"五番：飲食店の男の経営者と経営の専門家が話しています。男の経営者はこの後アルバイトの人に対して新たに何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e877f5efd81c66e93febc48f0b6fd7d3bfd5bf5ba75cac1035dced0122e832ab","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":3.36,"end":17.5,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0","text":"短期間でアルバイトをやめてしまう人が多いんです。なんとか定着を図りたいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:64475b7698c78dd1f20cb1598a1ef68e335775f0185a4a80cdc18fe04303fccc","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":19.04,"end":24.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-1","text":"そうですね。仕事に慣れない、人間関係が築けないということでやめてしまうことが多いようですよ。ですから、職場の環境に早く馴染めるよう、新しい人が入ったら、期間を設けて研修することが大切です。","textVersion":"sha256:3cb8592b608780f281245941e92a931edcca874eb049efa4df0ba8fc9e5c08dc","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":26.1,"end":40.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-2","text":"はい、今研修期間は三日間ですが、時間が十分ではありません。期間を長くしたほうがいいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:7634aeacd91bae9a4f92c9301693946c7823f108c8798b5355d96b7ba81676c9","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":40.82,"end":49.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-3","text":"それは、個々の状況に合わせるのがいいので、無理には。それより、どんな店にしていきたいかなど、経営に対する経営者の根本的な考えについて話す時間を設けることが必要ですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f7119d2615932ec2ab98209e5c0de55cd2100449e3f0fe7fd034b419d9e904e5","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":49.52,"end":62.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-4","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":63.12,"end":64.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-5","text":"そうすることで、共通理解ができて、連帯感も生まれますから。","textVersion":"sha256:bf32b4f4a53a3e3fe43e6fc1c88b17564cfd618b0141fb1a80b200de338d4bdf","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":64.48,"end":69.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-6","text":"なるほど。研修の時間は限られますが、その中でうまく時間をやり繰りしたいと思います。あと、やっぱり時給も影響がありますよね。","textVersion":"sha256:19022f2681aea88d87b3b3516f701ad6aaf70f7db93f9bf575d8f1790933bf20","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":70.26,"end":79.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-7","text":"時給が高いに越したことはないですが、必ずしもそれが仕事をやめる原因となるわけではないんですよ。あとは、仕事の作業項目ごとに習熟度を定期的に評価して、アルバイトの人自身が成長を実感できるようにすると、モチベーションが上がっていいですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:5ef1d991fe863dfd92bf8442e74551112d320847b31ad5b9b1cf0bb3a0e908f9","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":79.64,"end":98.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-8","text":"はい、それは以前から取り組んでいます。では、アドバイスいただいた点、早速やってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:65468aee4ef88937f1098992c37f2591201e6fd2b5e0ed51e0de1f3ce8b8b3ea","audioVersion":"sha256:43d68b6fd30fb762deea40bfcddf43b37c9ad25d3338930150a78320aaa97e46","timelineVersion":"sha256:1583268a67a6bcf9270dfe0a62ac0f4e540362693ffa7e98c71c0844ab28eb7e","start":98.4,"end":105.4,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a9e7258545430836"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2016.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2016.html"],"batch":"n1-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:question","text":"六番：市役所で男の職員と女の職員が市の広報誌について話しています。女の職員は次の号の広報誌をどのように改善しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d02dd336a4aa01c32bb006eaead2c941e6900b6adfa471de469636320ac35bc5","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":3.36,"end":18.22,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-0","text":"先日行った市の広報誌に関するアンケート結果が出たから、次の号から反映できることは反映して、紙面を改善しようと思うんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:f7b261696d5a35d9b3fec9e32d9cf07f8cede06936cf93cbf49f3fe74b9c2be5","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":21.8,"end":31.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-1","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":30.96,"end":31.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-2","text":"投書欄を設けてほしいっていう要望が多かったから、早急に対応したいんだけど、いつから始められるかな。","textVersion":"sha256:25f5a488ce70de708ff0818f7646b1bffe9b6ab9bb14588823b77865e39bc0c7","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":31.5,"end":38.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-3","text":"えーと、次の号の紙面はすでに割り振ってしまったので、市からのお知らせを掲載する欄で投書を募るとして、その次からなら、投書欄を設けることができます。","textVersion":"sha256:8dd85ec528699ab86fa4f18d92db595b4e829545f6a078fd3025c408f8a1dded","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":38.66,"end":50.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-4","text":"じゃ、それでよろしく。それから、政策を紹介する記事が分かりにくいという意見も多かったんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:d56a9643271a3f473acfbc0c48b439d77ddeb6f96ff855af64c17858f2e257fa","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":50.32,"end":56.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-5","text":"そうですか。昨年から、イベント情報の記事を増やしたので、政策関連の記事にさける紙面の割合がやや少なくなっています。そのせいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:7c5ddace3e67be109325643bd628b377df02c1534cbe39bd19201dbd1a728907","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":56.86,"end":68.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-6","text":"分量というより、グラフやイラストなど視覚的な説明がなくて、分かりにくいってことなんだよ。イベント情報は一番よく読まれてるって結果だったから、イベント情報を増やしたことはいいと思う。それはそのままで。それより、その分かりにくいってとこを見直して。","textVersion":"sha256:8e699bd03c82f9172eb28615e76a1741f2e2604ca5c7ba4a2ec96513119a3c24","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":68,"end":85.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-7","text":"はい。次の号からやってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:66a723253bc48df5b8a323be2ea051c647e2b881bbefde461585b445a07bc8c4","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":86.18,"end":88.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-8","text":"うん。あと、子育て関連の記事は参考になっていいってことだから、これまで通り取り上げていこう。","textVersion":"sha256:1a7dee0ae56a72ed995b20a2e0de4c614063e0af8bab10f080367092070bd580","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":88.28,"end":95.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2016-12:6:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:39a5fe18b8d9343ee63115ec1097860a5196832f562f7caafc8710c978df6721","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ddb4e8e9ff26e49a81708478e77c60d94d31efe48a1fa42f01259496bbce335","start":95.12,"end":95.82,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a9e7258545430836"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:question","text":"一番：大学の事務室で男の留学生と事務の人が話しています。男の留学生はこの後、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:da3894cfd76ae8765384b24075df7b8f74824b721fa9d2baa70525fc51a4b538","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":3.44,"end":15.8,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-0","text":"すみません。奨学金の申請の書類を書いてみたんですが、これで大丈夫でしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:90f5602d25d16e16a715e1bfa5bc4a79221ed8dbf3ebaf520e69d9029bf80ed4","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":17.36,"end":23.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-1","text":"ちょっと見せてください。ああ、申請書はパソコンで書いたんですね。募集案内には自筆とありますから、自分で書いてください。","textVersion":"sha256:2fff56c5622115bf2ffc329119f229cd95c0f8ab4b1c730e8b630e0f84ed1d7e","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":23.08,"end":33.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-2","text":"そうなんですか。わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:a61b5753a3c3ddf84935ae4f9d0c6a8505d6ef2c1a424d87a880d6f6c64c4068","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":34.1,"end":36.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-3","text":"それで、これが研究計画書ですね。今これで何字ぐらいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:05c81c9eefeaa39822546324ff98793f25b07914864913e5026b0bb33f6221bc","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":36.88,"end":42.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-4","text":"えっと、千百字ちょっとです。もう少し書き足したほうがいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:c9ed3dca9ef9edcc4bd31ccfa311762f3b8f4b0c02d10163b23062eb86d083dd","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":42.28,"end":47.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-5","text":"ううん、千二百字以内となっているので、それぐらいで十分ですよ。あっ、あと、推薦書と成績証明書がありませんよ。","textVersion":"sha256:40771d2994dd1a239341644db397852026a67c693f1a23404f8eafcf129fdd99","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":47.78,"end":57.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-6","text":"はい、推薦書は先生にお願いして来週の提出期限までにいただけることになっています。成績証明書も今申請中です。","textVersion":"sha256:29e38164b4021df03e260e4ed1a0ae90e3f269c91010940085fda798d3bc5846","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":58.42,"end":66.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-7","text":"そうですか。来週の水曜日までですからね。","textVersion":"sha256:6cdc1cb38b058bdf89f65ea0cba74fbb01ef6156ed7b12fed5e552b4ec8cbfaa","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":66.7,"end":70.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-8","text":"はい。ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:ded1add839fccb12a08a97f7f3916d00f26bd6faeccbaed27d9c7c487aa728e3","audioVersion":"sha256:c30f27d128e9a94dff6ec3278d2de54643fd4589cd47fc989fb1c9b5961da28b","timelineVersion":"sha256:6996fc788c7b9fb8a7e74eb1e1542f09dc342252e78ca7d1a20a7b65ad8a9e82","start":70.06,"end":71.74,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"0834d0f434a16990"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:question","text":"二番：出版社で女の記者と雑誌の編集長が話しています。女の記者はこの後まず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:600920e0ca6c18eb4ca5f7637f5b5f399ec38683592a003c41d0473ea12693a4","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":3.44,"end":14.84,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0","text":"編集長、担当しているパン屋の特集なんですが、原稿ができました。ご覧いただけますか。取材した店はすべて取り上げました。","textVersion":"sha256:5fd4c32687bef4587966d17b0694bc70ec685075775d4f5525ba71adc3418994","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":16.58,"end":25.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-1","text":"そう。見せて。この間の企画会議では、三タイプの店を紹介することに決まったよね。商店街のパン屋、カフェつきのパン屋、移動販売のパン屋。","textVersion":"sha256:aeff6971b0f1d2a4baea7e9d930ac3ec29a957e25f29ce3f1009aa18ddc68289","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":26.16,"end":38.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":37.98,"end":38.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-3","text":"こうして見ると、ちょっと物足りないなあ。ううん、この三タイプとは少し視点が違うけど、最近サンドイッチの専門店が話題になってるらしいじゃない。まだ時間はあるから、こっちのほうもあたってみて。","textVersion":"sha256:c9a198217d8a8cc998426803feb1a8a1d56427fc049c9d3366056c5192e09c84","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":38.96,"end":52.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-4","text":"はい。わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:2144deb792eec49f3a87082d5baa7822ef070386bc6e4a869724b6d4e2af8d06","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":52.48,"end":53.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-5","text":"それに、写真、肝心のパンが写ってるのが少ないね。文章も少し練り直しが必要だなあ。 まあ、載せる店が変わったら、いろんな変更がでるから、それは後でいいや。","textVersion":"sha256:71d1c05dabd3bb5d8e347f60c889ba37a06fc74c69c801d86b816fd2272cfaab","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":53.88,"end":66.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":66.38,"end":67,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-7","text":"取材終わってからでいいから、次の会議で変更点説明できるよう準備しといて。","textVersion":"sha256:ae371469d15a29c2a471065ebbdf22992e20358eeb3311c25a3d715fe3d5594f","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":67.46,"end":72.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-8","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:34325a0a5d279ccac72bf2c6415e9dc0a112e08ccf70582017783fe98f04a045","timelineVersion":"sha256:d630a918456ca9037e146cf507846256a2e4373feb812a7e3df9f8bd409a23a4","start":72.7,"end":73.66,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"0834d0f434a16990"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:question","text":"三番：日本語学校で、事務の女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこの後、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:3ab731c47d14c3e86d0632163a5f5ff15177e4ada0d321a04638761daad7e7e6","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":3.52,"end":15.26,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-0","text":"本田さん、今度のスピーチ大会の招待客に出す招待状、作ってもらえる。去年ののが事務室のパソコンの中に保存してあるから、書式はそれを参考にして、日付とかテーマを変えて、宛名はまだ空欄でいいから。","textVersion":"sha256:b032a068463810af5c478a89dd2b53f2ab9835b92a44b55b1d20a685ef057311","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":16.82,"end":31.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-1","text":"はい。わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:2144deb792eec49f3a87082d5baa7822ef070386bc6e4a869724b6d4e2af8d06","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":31.88,"end":33.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-2","text":"会場は例年通りのホールを予約したはずよね。","textVersion":"sha256:fbc385a5eb2c5dc68d39585c43e90b80f31a25fdfaf5854dbcf0feebc38140be","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":33.24,"end":36.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-3","text":"はい。先週確認済みです。設備も去年から特に変わったところはありませんでした。","textVersion":"sha256:38bf6595794ae2805ad466648f4efeb777cacabdcd43410fb90dc5c5d67aa7f0","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":36.5,"end":42.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-4","text":"ありがとう。早いのね。招待状を印刷してから、会場を変更することになったら大変だから、気になってたんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:7135699542ec4b759c1565e7c5e1545b0083e317609f3e76a9ac8e19a02cf749","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":42.06,"end":49.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-5","text":"はい。それは大丈夫です。","textVersion":"sha256:f8e23561e67db40c06598d1d7d4a982a17cc40a3d4cf75225f766d3f78fa136e","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":49.38,"end":51.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-6","text":"あと、今年から新しく招待する方のリストを渡すから、招待客の名簿に追加しといて。","textVersion":"sha256:79f4163162c56f562e68abc8d2d3769f5dfffe44d6934db2d1384b1f50afccf6","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":51.22,"end":57.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":57.48,"end":58.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-8","text":"リストはパソコンに入っているけど、ファイルはパスワードがかかっているから。パスワード、先週替えたのを知っているよね。","textVersion":"sha256:4951ea3512ec13277c3fbe693939717e7bb9e2d331bbce3ffd3c2b2d77d513d7","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":58.36,"end":65.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:02d791c777cf129cca291eb62fc21615ef1ca876ae69f2f38dd9c6aee983a631","timelineVersion":"sha256:94859cc77cc7121be39b722fd47aa93fd116d3edf3a294d4158f40d030446373","start":64.98,"end":65.68,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"0834d0f434a16990"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:question","text":"四番：電話で、演劇部の部長と女の学生が話しています。女の学生は来週のリハーサルまでに、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f14e6f537d83c6621c70fe8126b29683252d5a0b4b70112eb91758cee0b1f640","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":3.44,"end":16.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-0","text":"もしもし。","textVersion":"sha256:0c170454ca9211753d46cef76f50406cf059a634dcb7bf1c19e4273b43ad7d04","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":22.76,"end":23.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-1","text":"あっ、先輩、衣装係の川村です。あのう、演劇発表会のリハーサルのことなんですが、来週の。","textVersion":"sha256:09a99edf0e0e3bdaa60a257fa372ebfb400e5b25281d33180245513e9ffa7887","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":23.62,"end":31.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-2","text":"うん、どうした？","textVersion":"sha256:cf8772b07feb412cd1d10b17ba292e304de3f5102c76391f31fd2174cbc761d8","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":31.4,"end":32.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-3","text":"あの、そのときに、衣装チェックをすることになってますよね。で、今作り始めてるんですが。もらった布では、足りないようなんです。","textVersion":"sha256:8cf4c1a6b17b194c4b4f94c28c1020d2f421db909cbd459e1ae740faefa0b56b","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":33.22,"end":41.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-4","text":"えっ、ほんとう。えっと、川村さんの担当は主人公のワンピースとその妹のスカートだったよね。","textVersion":"sha256:b746d86cf51ee387a6e993a51fc12519ac9526cb1e3cc05acd638c360b18823f","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":41.42,"end":48.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-5","text":"はい。今主人公のワンピースを作り始めたとこなんですが。布を買うときに、寸法を間違えたんじゃないでしょうか。このままだと、残った分で、妹のスカートはかなり厳しそうなんです。","textVersion":"sha256:061b4e8a94c3df9f6a20d13f001a58b61ef592657a523fab56befa9e12bfdcd2","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":48.66,"end":61.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-6","text":"その布、お店にももうないんだよね。妹だけ違う布を使うわけには行かないし、参ったなあ。でも、今からデザイン変えるのもね。とりあえず、ワンピースはそのままで作って、リハーサルに持ってきて、 残った分でどんな衣装ができるかそのとき検討しよう。","textVersion":"sha256:7e20ee89b6d5b03b7cdb08dc5d7ab2daa75799a8ee12771c7b4d63330cb0a1e6","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":61.6,"end":79.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":79.38,"end":80.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-8","text":"リハーサルから本番まではあまり日がないし、また大至急お願いってなっちゃうけど、よろしくね。","textVersion":"sha256:57ca7f6eab8260ec91e48d20c5d93f3f27038e746af819ce823dedd3857d4f14","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":80.46,"end":86.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-9","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:f8649b52367f380cec20aed77635bbe429609b5ef781fb5003df4ed466c222d8","timelineVersion":"sha256:e90432ace73bc9f7545482237914484b1f896451e4acaf45f75c2b4452665627","start":86.08,"end":86.78,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"0834d0f434a16990"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:question","text":"五番：会社で部長と女の社員が話しています。女の社員は何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:28c6ec5ac8605f268b81f9404c11ec552edb2fbc081e823e318b5773d6ed1db2","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":3.48,"end":13.32,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-0","text":"森下さん、森下さんたち開発チームがすすめてきた新しい洗剤、今日の会議で発売ということにきまったよ。消費者アンケートの結果が評価されてね。","textVersion":"sha256:97f97dd1ca3bd8ac62e06443bf408e46297fd630efc991b595f8419e5e598d05","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":14.92,"end":26.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-1","text":"そうですか。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:57e061b5dcae75732346cc6a2c134de0cc97d3e42af473f90f673ad6985b15a6","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":26.14,"end":28.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-2","text":"会議では、少し要望も出たんだ。この価格帯の他社のと並べてみたときに、パッケージの印象が弱いって意見が出て、後発なんだから、目を引くようなものをという注文なんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:a567c659fb426f9c8587d7e4dd77e2c6de22171d88a54429db1d7c14632ddcb1","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":28.66,"end":40.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-3","text":"はい。デザイナーと相談して、いくつか案を出してもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:07a3ab9258d1685a22dbe59ff1d7ef4ab7bb83d45b4c441e51ceeada1a7569e2","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":40.96,"end":44.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-4","text":"うん。来週の会議に諮れるように、お願いしますよ。アンケートで、香りについて高い評価が出たことが決め手になったね。","textVersion":"sha256:7c5da2a3dc5e94a339a7bea881de1b6926702b21166fbb0d4884391914f92f86","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":44.74,"end":53.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-5","text":"力を入れたところですから、チームのみんな喜びます。","textVersion":"sha256:c3155de783c6b4d5db402c0980cfa634c7556d15c092f87fc2c054e74641b211","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":53.86,"end":57.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-6","text":"もちろん。洗浄力の高さはデータで示されてるしね。残る課題は販売価格をいくらにするかだけど。これは開発チームが出してくれた案を、営業に回して検討してもらうことになったから。","textVersion":"sha256:c127dd0848d5d76498a7e7e330557e831985ae5ccdc97c98bee722a1213896f4","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":57.44,"end":70.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-7","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:8bcfe145be6be27d850eca816662ac5673cef981c7eb4319cc461156c3f795fd","timelineVersion":"sha256:818e9736aae64d27f7eb4eb14a9708db2274c3097b2cd9916b6d3ee113eb5f9a","start":70.86,"end":71.82,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"0834d0f434a16990"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ebb961ecf89a4af46ffc1a8be1802155e0b05eae04ffc97fc5ae87cd81100a24","timelineVersion":"sha256:d6f9780c54a6fc2e7e846396be746c253a4a8bf4f95a0aa71e15ecc829350599","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6:question","text":"六番：図書館で、職員が職場体験の参加者に話しています。参加者はまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7645dc30d3c0edd8afe5d7a3dce25d017cafd8ddb758b83c8c4a46ae459eec48","audioVersion":"sha256:ebb961ecf89a4af46ffc1a8be1802155e0b05eae04ffc97fc5ae87cd81100a24","timelineVersion":"sha256:d6f9780c54a6fc2e7e846396be746c253a4a8bf4f95a0aa71e15ecc829350599","start":3.48,"end":13.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6:line-0","text":"一日職場体験にご参加の皆様、おはようございます。本日の予定ですが、皆さんからやってみたいという声が一番多かった、カウンターでの貸し出し業務は、事前にご案内したとおり、午後に体験していただきます。","textVersion":"sha256:59097957e3d8810294db8bfa7c4023c44c832e88e1b43d08517e36dce6ae9e5e","audioVersion":"sha256:ebb961ecf89a4af46ffc1a8be1802155e0b05eae04ffc97fc5ae87cd81100a24","timelineVersion":"sha256:d6f9780c54a6fc2e7e846396be746c253a4a8bf4f95a0aa71e15ecc829350599","start":13.14,"end":30.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6:line-1","text":"午前中については、少し予定に変更があります。事前のご案内では、まず新しい本の情報をコンピューターに入力する作業、その次に、破れた本の修理作業の見学、の順で行うことになっていましたが、ええ、、、コンピューターの不具合のため、この順番を逆にします。","textVersion":"sha256:5eef26281f28f91d9c8faf573382240f088d3cce40926f2bf3b083179ecc9907","audioVersion":"sha256:ebb961ecf89a4af46ffc1a8be1802155e0b05eae04ffc97fc5ae87cd81100a24","timelineVersion":"sha256:d6f9780c54a6fc2e7e846396be746c253a4a8bf4f95a0aa71e15ecc829350599","start":30.3,"end":51.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-07:6:line-2","text":"コンピューターは今業者が修理していて、あと少しで復旧する見込みです。この二つに続けて、館内の棚にある本の整理もしていただきます。では、よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:31a74e2713e4d616e0bc64e3f9c8333e301081b468ffe1ef0fbf6161c8a0e72d","audioVersion":"sha256:ebb961ecf89a4af46ffc1a8be1802155e0b05eae04ffc97fc5ae87cd81100a24","timelineVersion":"sha256:d6f9780c54a6fc2e7e846396be746c253a4a8bf4f95a0aa71e15ecc829350599","start":51.96,"end":64.82,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"0834d0f434a16990"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:question","text":"一番：大学のダンスクラブで部長と女の学生が話しています。女の学生は、この後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:d1823f05b79e65a169e1e68e54d0369b8901559c39b8524b17ba3a8f49e06b4a","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":3.6,"end":16.02,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-0","text":"中野さん、毎年行ってるダンスの発表会なんだけど、今まで大学から出てた運営費の補助金が来年から出なくなるんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:fecc1d2e43ccc5d5a2ad3f970a435306d2903617b7c04150d98f4e85430f00ce","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":17.68,"end":26.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-1","text":"え、そうなんですか。今はスポンサーとして地元の会社が、２社協力してくれてますけど、会場代とか考えると、新しいスポンサーを探す必要がありますね。","textVersion":"sha256:b7487989df2abf1834454847de11fef6bff5bda4530bbb15b3003b4713297a4c","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":26.6,"end":39.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-2","text":"うん、それについてはほかのメンバーがもう動いてくれてるんだ。でも、それだけじゃ足りないから、新しい方法での資金調達も考えないといけないんだけど、今やろうと思ってるのは、これまで無料だった入場券を有料にすることと、大学校内で寄付を募ること。","textVersion":"sha256:c5711ab7c5009b003d6d086c31a7d97e28295227d445a58549c9d767774b301f","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":39.74,"end":57.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":57.38,"end":58.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-4","text":"あと、ウェブで一般の人から寄付を集められる資金調達サイトっていうのがあるんだけど、それを利用しようと思ってるんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:bf90409d6adde280bc9ed8351e136ab45879f4cee588df18cc3bace5c502faf5","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":58.44,"end":65.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-5","text":"へえ。大学での寄付は、何かキャンペーンをして集めるのがよさそうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:e3a586de6706a089470a6885ee9d2019e290d20c539360ec5c7647238e27ba93","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":65.64,"end":71.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-6","text":"そうだね。どんなキャンペーンをするかは次のミーティングで話し合おう。問題は入場券だね。今までは無料だったからなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:9d0af3f89e3ec53146513aec09d022c7e50416dc3ba0aa0bec297deff41d91a1","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":71.74,"end":80.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":81.26,"end":81.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-8","text":"悪いんだけど、ほかの大学のイベントの例とか参考にして、これぐらいがいいんじゃないかっていう額を次のミーティングで出してもらえるかな、みんなで検討できるように。資金調達サイトは利用方法を詳しく調べておくよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a20047997314db06af399ab3eb0bc795f5946626a7e6d9f4e6fc1da69f851a12","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":81.74,"end":95.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-9","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:285ab8200aa8891c8d4f1f08afeeebf2af1398d4ccff13f4919b585c12580144","timelineVersion":"sha256:493add992599d4b1b6e320145797b97f8aa1ace58988e681bade75d8107e6fd5","start":95.48,"end":96.54,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6efd734fb0bf1144"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:question","text":"二番：市役所の市民課で、女の人と市の職員が話しています。女の人は、この後、どの順で回りますか。","textVersion":"sha256:2e3ce8a9cbbc6bca467c5202a80e752739c371fbeea732f3abc1ae4963303441","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":3.28,"end":14.68,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-0","text":"すみません、先日こちらの南市に越してきたので、転入届を出したいんですが、提出は、市民課でいいんですよね。これ、書いてきたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:8c85d72645d62d63bc4fc7fb1edcc807c6a7279124fafe9f0b75209a653b133f","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":18.22,"end":28.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-1","text":"はい、承ります。","textVersion":"sha256:fd75b3e44ef9dcbaf656e43628c9c51339d38cf832e0fb07ed69d28ae8ac4221","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":28.8,"end":30.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-2","text":"あの、健康保険の手続きも必要だって聞いたので、それもお願いします。あっ、それから、運転免許証に載ってる住所も今日変更してもらいたいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:e4825d6d2b18be95c13e0aaf21724d6d463e8e8995d52d154cc196688a9a75ef","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":31.44,"end":42.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-3","text":"はい。健康保険の手続きは保険課でお願いします。運転免許証の記載事項変更は、警察署の管轄です。市役所のすぐ隣の建物が警察署です。 警察署で手続きをされる際に、新しい住所が証明できるもの、たとえば、公共料金の領収書や消印つきの郵便物が必要になりますが、今お持ちですか。","textVersion":"sha256:2dfb98fd920293c7d89db11a9fd73615f296458ef62aae357ac992d56dbaa711","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":42.36,"end":66.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-4","text":"いいえ、持ってません。","textVersion":"sha256:6c99f0e50c19ba65af60764f21b2bb2095240cee1a5a7fe8ed2c7c70ac32e614","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":66.72,"end":68.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-5","text":"でしたら、発行手数料はかかりますが、住民票の写しでも証明できます。こちらで発行できますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d3631ede4fa05bb64803a6bb3883cf4cc5a5a9187c15973d3cd1b42d0485c4b8","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":68.26,"end":75.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-6","text":"じゃあ、お願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:89473f8bde1a264e919118cd6a5e8a639b1bbbbdb4c4986c308f8d0555126112","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":75.58,"end":77.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-7","text":"では、ご用意ができましたら、番号でお呼びしますので、隣の交付窓口にお越しください。お客様の番号は22番です。ただ、今二、三十分はかかるかと。その間に、保険課で健康保険のお手続きをどうぞ、十分もかからないと思いますから。","textVersion":"sha256:9fccd81b7dd1c8403b14d67673341a1cfbcaca9c10f01bced9c9a0d8cddbe28e","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":77.04,"end":98.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-8","text":"わかりました。そうします。","textVersion":"sha256:2576d86dc8a4c3afddb6a3d17b4fcb931c63f55cd3619d6d9753b12fb5508cf1","audioVersion":"sha256:4048bae6f6a542023fca2dded6a4915fd08f6f311c96d9d6240165cc80b4fbe2","timelineVersion":"sha256:ee57b7a47833ccdc4e7d86d801726c319da2cfa04eb3d9a1cf5f4d5c0cc7d020","start":98.24,"end":100.48,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6efd734fb0bf1144"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b258aea426819330247d1ec71d4a32241f89561448537a23f15136d86a240b16","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d42607ce189d01dc312dcab46a82972bdd4331d7f5330e069bb619a455d57ac","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:question","text":"三番：会議で課長が係長を集めて話しています。各係の係長はこの後、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:934aa25b58536b456e7a1a713684f5aacc737bd49e8a1d13a51d81ca95958acf","audioVersion":"sha256:b258aea426819330247d1ec71d4a32241f89561448537a23f15136d86a240b16","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d42607ce189d01dc312dcab46a82972bdd4331d7f5330e069bb619a455d57ac","start":3.4,"end":15.14,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-0","text":"ええ、この課ではここ数年、残業時間の増加が問題になっており、これまで、仕事の効率化を図るため、皆さんにはさまざまな取り組みをしてもらってきました。","textVersion":"sha256:cc3c72ef4d289b507c949ca7723fb0a78ba94b12f1a4d68e573860f95754634b","audioVersion":"sha256:b258aea426819330247d1ec71d4a32241f89561448537a23f15136d86a240b16","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d42607ce189d01dc312dcab46a82972bdd4331d7f5330e069bb619a455d57ac","start":17.68,"end":27.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-1","text":"しかしそれも限界があると判断し、来年度から新たに事務スタッフを雇うことにしました。それに伴い、事務スタッフに委託する業務を決める必要があります。","textVersion":"sha256:4c2c58213a0d157c85c5ab1437ccd6562a81c71f531b669d275033f7c58905fa","audioVersion":"sha256:b258aea426819330247d1ec71d4a32241f89561448537a23f15136d86a240b16","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d42607ce189d01dc312dcab46a82972bdd4331d7f5330e069bb619a455d57ac","start":28.64,"end":40.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-2","text":"皆さんは、今各係で行っている業務を洗い出し、その内容を箇条書きにしたものを提出してください。","textVersion":"sha256:19006ac4e618b2649bd7d36090b30dcdad2027420a0250a82212f49235a568bd","audioVersion":"sha256:b258aea426819330247d1ec71d4a32241f89561448537a23f15136d86a240b16","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d42607ce189d01dc312dcab46a82972bdd4331d7f5330e069bb619a455d57ac","start":40.84,"end":47.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-3","text":"それを踏まえて、わたしのほうで委託する業務の案を練ります。記入フォームはこの後メールで送ります。","textVersion":"sha256:1f80207fff59457f66ec81afd0dafe5a8c0b67c0eff5b38e0d24bbae830e0dd6","audioVersion":"sha256:b258aea426819330247d1ec71d4a32241f89561448537a23f15136d86a240b16","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d42607ce189d01dc312dcab46a82972bdd4331d7f5330e069bb619a455d57ac","start":48.6,"end":55.5,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"6efd734fb0bf1144"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:question","text":"四番：洋服店で、男の店員と店長が話しています。男の店員は、この後、まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0df1204d969365cf2c5d90c075bcf739450a77849d58c22826038871fed11e0b","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":3.34,"end":13.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-0","text":"店長、さっき店開けたばかりなのに、外の行列、どんどん長くなってますよ。新人アイドルの夢野光がデザインしたTシャツ、この勢いじゃすぐ売切れてしまいます。一人一枚ってことにはなってますが。","textVersion":"sha256:6383bfc8f2cae076ad391ad8e802ef414a7331191e2e60708e3b8ebf4b8f8777","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":15.44,"end":29.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-1","text":"そう、予想以上ね。じゃ、県内のほかの店舗に連絡して、在庫に余裕があるところ探してみてくれる？うちのほかにも３店舗あるでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:72d223e664b12dba0ffb7e9e9d328d45c1c9aaf42d52846b807384c268397bf2","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":29.76,"end":40.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-2","text":"そう思ってさっき問い合わせてみたんですが、どこも同じ状況だそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:6363740515aff2e17baf9198a2aa9492156537f2dd07addd3da00b471695bebe","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":41.14,"end":45.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-3","text":"へえ、夢野光、恐るべし。とりあえず近隣から苦情が出るといけないから、大谷君は道路に出て、お客様の列の整理に当たって。通行の邪魔にならないようにね。","textVersion":"sha256:a3c96b262acb63911f84c8d89f96cdb5d05474fd402fece0b75a1975f49e1227","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":45.82,"end":58.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":58.9,"end":59.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-5","text":"あっ、外に出る前に、他のスタッフ、誰でもいいから在庫の数を確認するよう頼んでくれる？確認でき次第すぐわたしに報告するよう伝えて。在庫数がわかったら、大谷君にも携帯で知らせるから、列の先頭からお客様の数を数えて。商品が行き届かないかもしれない方には、その旨伝えてくれるかな。こういうのは出来るだけ早く伝えておいたほうがいいから。","textVersion":"sha256:20e4e5d956bd052d29f6336ace4322aac007586c4ee0fb56c69fcc03b5a176b6","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":60.38,"end":86.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":86.7,"end":87.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-7","text":"あ、そうだ。今日お渡しできないお客様には、次の入荷予定日を知らせておいたほうがいいね。本社に問い合わせて、入荷までに何日かかるか聞いておくわ。あとで在庫数の連絡するとき、一緒に言うから、今日渡せない方に伝えてね。","textVersion":"sha256:945212e16d9899f797c068d8baa3508ec1a65d2f8c226a83370de2ab1ff0105e","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":88.22,"end":105.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-8","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":105.3,"end":106.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-9","text":"とにかく、近所から苦情が出ないよう、整理のほうをしっかりお願い。","textVersion":"sha256:4aa85602d347585eaab455b746e038c561ce1fd65b1b1cdf9e76081623a1caca","audioVersion":"sha256:7d97ec0721f612602722da0f4fc41ad90728e91b7f9ae0dd4118733b3746315a","timelineVersion":"sha256:b96de42b753c40987a05fec30195ce907f106816c810548461dc651bb7f25f77","start":106.96,"end":111.46,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6efd734fb0bf1144"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:question","text":"五番：大学で女の学生と先生が話しています。女の学生は、この後、まず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c8e9d4b3d4da3b04788c603defa7a193108f4c437cd642ec1139db35c4f2262f","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":3.3,"end":13.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-0","text":"先生、先日提出した卒業論文の原稿を見ていただけましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:1819375cc19a52c9177c12986f50e5e88b39a40d1422a41707b11b6f8bcdc4f3","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":16,"end":20.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-1","text":"ああ、テレビや動画が乳幼児の心身に与える影響っていうテーマのだね。よく書けてたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:53dab3855459033887c5df839f94b6efc3d72bed7a14c0c993391ff2266837a5","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":20.8,"end":28.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-2","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":28.42,"end":29.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-3","text":"ただ、ちょっと気になる点があったんだ。論文の冒頭ではテーマを明示して、そのテーマを扱う目的や意義を述べるってことは前に話したよね。","textVersion":"sha256:31e6e4f88fbb5dd98960f291ba481e9016730218118aa6b1193f0c6bba33f268","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":29.9,"end":39.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-4","text":"はい。ですので、冒頭で関連する先行研究を紹介し、これまで乳幼児にスポットを当てた研究が少ないということを書きました。あと、調査方法についても触れたんですが、不要でしたか。","textVersion":"sha256:f48d1cc928909e132bb1db2ae0747bce444cf710fa3ea869b0121694df7ff8ac","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":40.18,"end":53.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-5","text":"いや、その点は簡潔にまとめられてたんだけどね。ただ、なぜ今回中島さんが乳幼児を対象に研究をしようと思ったかっていう部分が弱いんだよね。これまで十分に行われていない研究だからってことは書いてあったけど、それだけじゃないよね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c598f144b27eafe35a2489bca0938457a404d0f282edc7e459d3fb3bde04b41","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":53.82,"end":70.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-6","text":"ああ。","textVersion":"sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":70.82,"end":71.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-7","text":"ほら、前に話してくれたでしょう。喫茶店で親が小さな子に携帯で動画を見せて、ほったらかしにしている様子を見て、問題がないのか疑問に思ったって。そのあたりのことを書くと、読み手の興味を惹くことができると思うよ。","textVersion":"sha256:de8ea796cb79c070d0e7cc30c04f888f56bc230e7ecf358b5019f18eeb24c821","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":71.34,"end":87.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-8","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":87.42,"end":88.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-9","text":"あと、論文全体の構成について、冒頭で簡単に説明してあったのはよかったよ。読み手が全体の流れをイメージできるようになるからね。","textVersion":"sha256:993feff495bfbc265b73a2c4d108caf65b196120b3507f5c7ed23dc9034f5c57","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":89.1,"end":98.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-10","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:159bb6d971f6a3712bfa61166263074109663d73e14087f431ad024aef1d3636","timelineVersion":"sha256:ad30ae160deedbbac33f186798cb138cbf527d7c3f0997fedb0a5d8bf0e9ef99","start":98.5,"end":99.14,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6efd734fb0bf1144"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2017.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2017.html"],"batch":"n1-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:question","text":"六番：食品会社で、部長と女の人が話しています。女の人は、この後、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:e8af23ab550be880d6dd511d84e268bd524c460dc57cc697af2ae2672ad9d68c","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":3.38,"end":14.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-0","text":"吉田さん、今ちょっといいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:dd67b83b9c51b7bda9063f22c7e58b64228231b80c2c94a202640df464966de2","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":17.96,"end":20.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-1","text":"はい、部長。","textVersion":"sha256:4d3c0b5e4ca4e112086ee12d89fe0bc188679c5e583d2f57938ffa647dfcd63f","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":20.14,"end":21.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-2","text":"うちが販売している冷凍食品のことなんだけど、ここ数年、売り上げが芳しくないことは知ってるよね。","textVersion":"sha256:f51f85438530d16b7df115e30b297c25a9c6f216989c939977c716052969c6a8","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":21.44,"end":28.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":28.7,"end":29.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-4","text":"それで今、新商品を作って梃入れを図ろうとしてるんだけど、先日の役員会議で専務から、今後は今までの路線を変えて、高級志向の消費者をターゲットに冷凍食品を開発するのはどうかって意見が出てね。","textVersion":"sha256:5a6e2f504f8b76f91a62eef350259bd1e2198b3f15739f47e9a28845ed50819f","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":29.18,"end":43.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-5","text":"ああ、最近よく聞きますね。お菓子とかレトルト食品とか。以前に比べていい素材をつかった高級品の売れ行きが伸びてるって。","textVersion":"sha256:38f88119c94545ad38b4d2bd09eb12fae4f8e4799823cbe0cb687301a4abf7b3","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":44.7,"end":53.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-6","text":"うん、高級食品の売上額が上昇しているのはこれまでの調査結果を見れば一目瞭然だから、わたしも路線としてはいいと思うんだ。でも、具体的に何が消費者の高級食品に対する購買意欲を刺激しているのかについては、ほとんどリサーチされてなくて、会議でその点について独自に調べてみようという話になってね。それで、それを吉田さんにお願いしたいと思ってるんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:9f889fc836fc88e18aa7540f88144eaa71aa663de31c4600ca31809956ed40cd","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":53.32,"end":80,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-7","text":"あっ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:4e1900035195db95f82e6ff1303b48a4d06cad953f29c4ad1fd717f24d047ea0","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":79.94,"end":81.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-8","text":"あとでもう少し詳しく説明するよ。もちろん僕もいつでも相談に乗るし、必要なら、ほかにもメンバーをつけるから。","textVersion":"sha256:6690718c62627416a97704ef1121bb7a65f8b46c434c6c2578aed1f95e84124c","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":81.14,"end":89.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2017-12:6:line-9","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:a7bf4abf0ee13582176a4f742fdee75903d7f82905ec9fc0308bdd6fcb3e4d2c","timelineVersion":"sha256:062d08f3fb9010184b47a6d461b3c21c6640f6b8b1bd99094c340332cf6de9fb","start":89.34,"end":90.3,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6efd734fb0bf1144"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:question","text":"一番：市役所で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこの後まず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:ba51d5b4e5c981131741f03fcaa6ea3d408a76526749f4a1e3ab9073831087e9","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":5.26,"end":16.5,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-0","text":"田中さん、来週の講演会、頼んでた講演者三人のうち、一人が急に入院されたそうで、辞退したいって連絡がきたの。","textVersion":"sha256:6df83d5efb14da4be1fbdbb6b7656d15d44112358350fb73923330d391ac23b3","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":19.98,"end":28.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-1","text":"えっ、そうなんですか。じゃあ、講演会どうしましょう。もし中止にするなら、申し込まれた方にすぐ連絡しないといけないですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ba2e181d484006cedccaa6a984ea39770134df61dbaf4048f6eef2f0dd477385","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":28.98,"end":37.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-2","text":"うん、さしあたり、ほかの二人の講演者の方に連絡して、講演時間を延長できるかどうか聞いてもらえない？","textVersion":"sha256:3be740ea593cbe71c99cd26f277bebc725a56f25e87186157dba09b7719e3502","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":38,"end":45.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-3","text":"あっ、はい。分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:415b37e889f070ac1513caa257bbc478b778321eaaa45c29bc19bc2b8ba88fa7","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":45.22,"end":47.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-4","text":"本当は代わりの人を探せたらいいんだけど、来週だからちょっと厳しいよね。","textVersion":"sha256:8f01733750b89486c49eb77cfde64328fb1f4c888fe06ffe078e5ca103078796","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":47.2,"end":52.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-5","text":"そうですね。もし延長がだめだったら、時間どうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:af1374776a516a8c3124305366765b41566b7ea0c1c915e65bcc01def8619e9f","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":53.88,"end":57.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-6","text":"その場合は、空いた時間で何ができるか考えよう。","textVersion":"sha256:f4afc19d580d89b72ef80109d69bfe7c458c3b66a2f349b1fcdc7aeaa6aadc35","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":57,"end":60.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:dddb7ac0225117503caabbc6a0f09fbbd5f7cae7b5ba7c512aa9075a0c9aefa4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6073d7d27c539a9024e6b68d5ec27e3871ecbc607eb53312bdf619bc0633af0e","start":60.22,"end":61.04,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"d42db1c4165c69c5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:question","text":"二番：女の学生と男の学生が話しています。女の学生はこれから、マラソン大会に向けてどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:76a199c3db9de215a91f117d35af77fc6f4ce049fe99c164f3e246ddbfb77efc","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":3.64,"end":14.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-0","text":"佐藤君、今年も10月の市民マラソン大会に出るんでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:03c34940195a419c5ff33b588a24d7f818fd7d02d230817ec42acb0cc11bdffe","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":16.4,"end":21.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-1","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":21,"end":22.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-2","text":"私も、申し込んだんだ。フルマラソンは初めてだから、練習方法とかアドバイスもらえる？あと半年で何ができるか。私、どうしても最後まで走りきりたいんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:e286a19c8b76af19a9214b0e100564d3dcc0c2ab1f08fbcde74731874bf677e0","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":22.22,"end":34.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-3","text":"そうだなあ。まずは腕の振り方とか姿勢とかフォームが大事かな。でも、この前一緒に走ったときに思ったけど、フォームきれいだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:16afed30976d3d4b3a9a827af2106a60215e3e260540d3becbd5bdfbe61b976d","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":34.88,"end":44.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-4","text":"本当？よかった。今は週三日のペースで走ってるんだけど、もう少し増やしたほうがいいかな。授業で忙しいし、なかなか増やせないんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:e777da3b56dc544d65b3304012dcc9e440d03a31d21e3cbadd5fd42be6b58ba2","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":45.36,"end":55.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-5","text":"休養日も必要だから、それぐらいがいいよ。無闇に走る回数増やすと、足を痛めちゃったりするし。それより、とにかく筋肉を鍛えること。","textVersion":"sha256:6f14083f21f39dcf799bfe2be5cb5dabbf7b584ebcd867d4a5ef4b9e359ac747","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":55.72,"end":65.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-6","text":"スポーツジムとか通わなきゃいけないかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:d0dd62e2d6951aff684d0115dee2ca21ed518771e1ef5755391f1fda39290330","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":65.6,"end":68.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-7","text":"今大学までは電車で来てるんだよね。それを自転車にすると、結構足腰鍛えられるよ。家、自転車で通えるぐらいでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:a3179f50fc4e8155cb34735a35ec72a9675eb05c51bb917fac1aec581e99a5d8","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":68.32,"end":77.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-8","text":"なるほど。","textVersion":"sha256:e6060d825a6076f13a47cc304d64491b431764116f93db22e8a3eb419858f2a8","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":78.12,"end":78.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-9","text":"雨の日は辛いけどね。ジムだと、時間もお金もかかるでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:3d67850f29fe2ec5fb6e1f617da24193dd084a70667fedc7069b5eec0eaa9917","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":79.3,"end":84.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-10","text":"うん。じゃ、明日からやってみるね。","textVersion":"sha256:5563ad8e0913fe7035e1ee13ecf8a3b3ba178ec151be0db3679a82658fb82442","audioVersion":"sha256:99bbdc3a02446759cfafcde41f8bd676288d6599117e65b4275213df97f0d666","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3d9afc48fa3960bdfc2e3de27cea1da43cf8600e8eafe8857b4b3e327fb2311","start":84.46,"end":87.28,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d42db1c4165c69c5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:question","text":"三番：会社で、男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこれから新たに何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:85a3a67edac1295bc88cd003fcd5a02f4f8fff4be0cf06f77df558b5c0328655","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":3.76,"end":14.42,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0","text":"山田さん、入社して半年経ったけど、どう？書類の作成とか遅れがちみたいだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:d38d919ea93628953670e329868a60704dd08bcbd2807c9f338fd7cfac985a0d","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":16.22,"end":22.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-1","text":"あっ、課長。申し訳ありません。締め切りを紙に書いて机とか目につくところに貼ったりして、自分なりに頑張ってるつもりなんですが、間に合わないことが多くて。","textVersion":"sha256:78d0f98258ddf217a42a17d82179dee0c92202fd557b4bc6339e6b8f8da90a97","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":22.66,"end":34.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-2","text":"仕事の優先順位は付けてる？朝出社したときに、その日にすることをメモ書きして、仕事の順序を決めるだけでも、効率は違ってくるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:dbdca2afe0272b6388fffd6026ed2156ac91569fcea16e2f3bbf8ecc451b4cff","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":34.3,"end":43.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-3","text":"一応やってるんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:4ae28956bc70167aae249a5a3e41bfc72eec7120a21cb418ac9b2718fee9c788","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":43.62,"end":45.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-4","text":"じゃあ、個々の仕事の進め方かな。山田さんは、書類作るのにどのくらいかかってるか把握してる？","textVersion":"sha256:f9a7585e5ec0dd0b2678fb8b595d626b5b2800ea25ee3257ac9bab0576f18e5f","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":46.06,"end":52.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-5","text":"そこまでは。。。目の前の仕事をやるのに精一杯で。","textVersion":"sha256:94ff4de1d3fd371c21d65c3e41a98c79cf0ce88625bbdafea6f392097449eb52","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":52.9,"end":56.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-6","text":"そっか。僕が新人のときは、仕事が終わるたびに、ちゃんと書いてたよ。そうすると、自然とどうやったら効率的にできるか見えてきたよ。やってみて。","textVersion":"sha256:b7a59d933e905b6eb044d3def86612d371b0378c91f0fb6e5a3f22c37ed643dd","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":56.9,"end":67.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-7","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":67.46,"end":68.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-8","text":"仕事のアドバイスもらったら、次に生かすようにしてね。","textVersion":"sha256:021a7661c3f59e9885963020180c3db2d689837a9781dbad51f70ed69a03545a","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":69.14,"end":72.56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-9","text":"はい。教えていただいたことはメモに残してます。","textVersion":"sha256:de737036622d9545989aa7e24d169b97eba39426c4f2a60dbbb931295ea95f47","audioVersion":"sha256:c2c402d1760e698c34f5ad7121442e6c0f6bb4adc53f43cfa9272e0f675fd08b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f19cca87630db716208c40acf2a2fd2ac14aef22f86d741d45d0763689ad1314","start":72.5,"end":76.16,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d42db1c4165c69c5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:question","text":"四番：ボランティアサークルのリーダーと女の人が話しています。女の人は清掃の日、どの作業をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:51689287b3a2ca03db14d2b763b2c83ff68d0f19c85358766bd42b8a12b50f9e","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":4.14,"end":14.86,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-0","text":"島田さん、来月の公園清掃ボランティア、小学生も来るからね。","textVersion":"sha256:055ce574a980c966a3e0dc32c30087a0d377caa365854492284af85ceffdaffc","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":16.5,"end":22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-1","text":"ああ、毎年恒例ですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:4df7e7785d6b932b45e05fe0ec874d9f53752a84fa27758f7e5aeb871543a4ce","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":22.78,"end":24.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-2","text":"うん。島田さんは去年は確かベンチの落書き消すのをやってくれたよね。今回も同じでいい？","textVersion":"sha256:d99b05a12aabd620b7ce0a8d12677260c9845c2985bfdfcfb78dcada3e50e0f4","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":24.86,"end":32.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-3","text":"うーん、今回は子供たちと何か一緒に作業をしたいです。落書き消しは大人しかできないですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:a44cb7c66d6b605a6a54975eb90d53c4dd8052c17a9365f53fe73c5e4f511c96","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":32.44,"end":40.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-4","text":"そうだね。薬品使うからね。ええと、子供たちと一緒にする作業っていうと、子供たちにはごみを拾うグループと落ち葉を集めるグループに分かれて作業をしてもらう予定なんだ。落ち葉拾いは今まではやったことないんだけど、公園の管理事務所に依頼されてね。","textVersion":"sha256:2b63daa750d43545626222f6e34a034fa392629edabe8d6fc490859c86b03eb5","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":40.6,"end":60.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-5","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":60.22,"end":61.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-6","text":"今回初めてだから、島田さんがいてくれたら安心だな。お願いできる？","textVersion":"sha256:6df16db430c12c50e7a000f5385acfc58ff5d88fa5e2c46a27101de32bd24089","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":61.66,"end":66.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-7","text":"はい！花壇の雑草を抜くのは今回やらなくていいんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:6f731eff5c327ffed28a49949b279ec1b4004113b0b51257dacd7b8e1daae6b4","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":66.22,"end":71.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-8","text":"やるんだけど、花壇は道路沿いで危ないから。子供にはさせられないからね。一応そっちは人手は確保できそうだし。","textVersion":"sha256:82878330698a99e133efd7af22f2abe20a8997c825a268112428bb248d365c74","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":70.96,"end":79.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-9","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:de8b2462d69ab847783a7b2f7dcfbe9f83b00d56fe010a58befd9ecf638acd2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:e1740dd9215875bf1c7b44428da8bf1e04b1a8169e1edff8b3579ebc395e9594","start":79.56,"end":80.52,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"d42db1c4165c69c5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:question","text":"五番：大学で演劇部の男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はこの後どのようにポスターを直しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a81d9ea20a95358bf3fd05e30bf8b06408b432de256704797a72894deadc1dec","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":3.82,"end":16.6,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-0","text":"先輩、次回の公演のポスターなんですが、下書き見てもらえましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:e5d7576551f2c75ed3e9b5271b3a5d11eee30f349d1ddee4494afda22e254a7c","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":18.14,"end":23.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-1","text":"うん、これね。青空を主人公の青年が飛んでるって構図、すごく斬新だよね。夏の日って芝居のタイトルとも雰囲気合ってるし。","textVersion":"sha256:913c93461032445136a22d000e611d2d69d53fb4b21f7fbccf9de63d49afbd09","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":24.06,"end":34.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-2","text":"ありがとうございます。そのタイトルなんですけど、空の部分に白い文字で入れたんですけど、どうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:8366fe18fed4b4bf197b7194092394e751dd3957fc9ea44ca5c4bbe45d795aa6","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":35.84,"end":41.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-3","text":"書体は洗練された感じでいいけど。背景の空、ほんの少しだけ色を濃くしてみたらどうかな。そうしたら、タイトルの文字も際立ってくると思うんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:ec6c953bbf14672f3db6ef295774a8dfb6b279e867617e7c91e20ba5a086bdbd","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":41.64,"end":52.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-4","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":52.94,"end":53.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-5","text":"後は、ポスターにあらすじは要らないっていう案もあったけど、やっぱり残したんだね。","textVersion":"sha256:4b1ed810ced7ca16835af6409cfed191737a8c6e9ea8f9fa356f1c8eb1e1e35b","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":54.1,"end":60.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-6","text":"はい、だから極力短くしてみました。","textVersion":"sha256:73d3d2e200c423d52231ce8695a707c659f055b9dfa42a4e4fb2f4a734168c12","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":60.54,"end":63.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-7","text":"うん、この程度だったらいいね。ええと、出演者の名前は漏れはないみたいだね。じゃあ、明日までにお願いできる？","textVersion":"sha256:bce773344c6d1da448ec1d02d7c010b164f15b099fa97ca961334ce25c49015b","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":63.64,"end":74.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-8","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:76a8280cc63b5795495c3b41232f1a4bb427947d01428b867288d007bf9c0db6","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff880336c30f19497d5ef13ac832341aeabc3ee67167c62456499a840374e7e0","start":74.34,"end":75.16,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"d42db1c4165c69c5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a7dcd2bbd387cf00cd057ccdb926635295d6d763d46ebcc367f5ecedf659543b","timelineVersion":"sha256:0f2749a2decf131e522a99e43f7aa291b3c8f50fddcb5340d1aab039afb094bf","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6:question","text":"六番：本屋の店長がミーティングで店員に話しています。店員は特集コーナーに置く本として、どんな作品を選びますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7be203ec51a029746c11490a1259a469832139435ebfac6533154b5aaa9e7401","audioVersion":"sha256:a7dcd2bbd387cf00cd057ccdb926635295d6d763d46ebcc367f5ecedf659543b","timelineVersion":"sha256:0f2749a2decf131e522a99e43f7aa291b3c8f50fddcb5340d1aab039afb094bf","start":3.78,"end":15.94,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6:line-0","text":"おはようございます。ええ、駅前の緑書店が最近売り上げを伸ばしているという話を聞いていませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:5c22f9db90d7de7e6102ee34f07d5ca86a03344a6dafa2ad91dd51f2c4a1699a","audioVersion":"sha256:a7dcd2bbd387cf00cd057ccdb926635295d6d763d46ebcc367f5ecedf659543b","timelineVersion":"sha256:0f2749a2decf131e522a99e43f7aa291b3c8f50fddcb5340d1aab039afb094bf","start":17.4,"end":25.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6:line-1","text":"関係者に聞いたところ、売り場の客の目に触れやすい特集コーナーに売れ行きが芳しくない作品を並べる戦略が当たったらしいんです。","textVersion":"sha256:0fa5c95d02dac4d3c7291a35a97fd98d0cfd7f2f2c51a47635476e97fa9ffb7f","audioVersion":"sha256:a7dcd2bbd387cf00cd057ccdb926635295d6d763d46ebcc367f5ecedf659543b","timelineVersion":"sha256:0f2749a2decf131e522a99e43f7aa291b3c8f50fddcb5340d1aab039afb094bf","start":26.16,"end":35.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6:line-2","text":"特集コーナーには話題になっている作品、というのが業界の常識だったんですがね。それで、うちでも何かできないか考えてみました。","textVersion":"sha256:892ecf80a7796bf0de2d7c8a809f7400a32b69a4d536ed92cb2b699e8cc9714d","audioVersion":"sha256:a7dcd2bbd387cf00cd057ccdb926635295d6d763d46ebcc367f5ecedf659543b","timelineVersion":"sha256:0f2749a2decf131e522a99e43f7aa291b3c8f50fddcb5340d1aab039afb094bf","start":36.46,"end":45.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6:line-3","text":"これまでは、季節にちなんだ作品、え、今なら冬の作品を集めていますが、敢えて冬以外の季節をテーマにした作品を並べてみようと思うんです。","textVersion":"sha256:f52e3fa7c7a217f83dda31d1caf0eab7721218612ddf07e52a9f9b4e69165128","audioVersion":"sha256:a7dcd2bbd387cf00cd057ccdb926635295d6d763d46ebcc367f5ecedf659543b","timelineVersion":"sha256:0f2749a2decf131e522a99e43f7aa291b3c8f50fddcb5340d1aab039afb094bf","start":46.4,"end":57.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-07:6:line-4","text":"意外性からお客様の関心を掘り起こせたらと思います。今週ゆっくり時間をかけて各自候補を選んでみてください。","textVersion":"sha256:a889b31057618b1b98b41ab634f78170492e7b53f5e261eda56e73b3536c1aa1","audioVersion":"sha256:a7dcd2bbd387cf00cd057ccdb926635295d6d763d46ebcc367f5ecedf659543b","timelineVersion":"sha256:0f2749a2decf131e522a99e43f7aa291b3c8f50fddcb5340d1aab039afb094bf","start":57.98,"end":66.52,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"d42db1c4165c69c5"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:question","text":"一番：喫茶店で店長とアルバイトの女の人が話しています。アルバイトの女の人は来月どの日に働きますか。","textVersion":"sha256:3a5dfb9bb7aa3a4b3787171479f0d9bf58727f0e2d040383958ef8774ad032f0","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":3.48,"end":15.74,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-0","text":"小田さん、来月六月のアルバイトのシフト、もう少し勤務日増やせないかな。バイトの中山君が5月いっぱいでやめることになってね。","textVersion":"sha256:769e3ac0ae01fb0075016a17efda5803453d1874fad8ecdcb80a4ccf6fcdff4d","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":17.18,"end":27.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-1","text":"えっ？そうなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:2a20a81d46a7ef8bece37948e2730e8998d114cf8fce44df37381ac8596ad18b","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":27.02,"end":29.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-2","text":"うん、で、中山君週３日、月水日の勤務だけど、その穴を埋めなきゃなんないんだよ。えっと、小田さんは今、シフト入っているの、火曜と金曜だよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ec0b8bf469c1abf92209aa7d7038db52e203a0bd376d3f42d36767d9791d6980","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":29.5,"end":41.4,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":41.7,"end":42.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-4","text":"月曜、水曜はどうにかなりそうなんだけど。隔週で日曜も入ってもらえないかな。第一と第三。","textVersion":"sha256:4ac663c1f1d2b922bca1af83111ef3c5893cb472b782db4e98c96750eca0d160","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":42.54,"end":49.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-5","text":"はい、わかりました。あのう、七月以降もでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:3dd5d2847598160dd40b998fc9b3ebda409cd1412f68363c4f1609ae11541f9d","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":49.6,"end":54.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-6","text":"新しいバイトの人探してるから、とりあえず六月はっていうことで頼むよ。","textVersion":"sha256:c866c3b1fc2638832dc2191139082bd0105760225a5dbc7472d0f6411c11f38e","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":54.2,"end":58.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:1894806809862e42c9a1968b47fc1670083b4af5599296ad0eae981b28882606","timelineVersion":"sha256:1316d8054fa8a7825178b7d017a941be91fa2f6e7cbb0f9e15d59459bc04b098","start":58.84,"end":59.64,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"00adb2f43dfdfb4c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:46b5c8bc6fcac81b9789908f3e558f86acb3644f9efec47ca079b78cc9609a35","timelineVersion":"sha256:21f2e0dca1bbe5aecbd7ef7cf7fe1647443f67140adc310bd18b76189ff9dde7","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:question","text":"二番：男の人がボランティアの参加者に話しています。ボランティアの参加者は今日何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:47a42ff14e8a0812efb9c5eb9e4d39c15c5ba2dae7576a00c5b6d160c8b7ebf1","audioVersion":"sha256:46b5c8bc6fcac81b9789908f3e558f86acb3644f9efec47ca079b78cc9609a35","timelineVersion":"sha256:21f2e0dca1bbe5aecbd7ef7cf7fe1647443f67140adc310bd18b76189ff9dde7","start":4.2,"end":14.6,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0","text":"え、緑山の環境保護活動に参加いただき、ありがとうございます。本日は林の雑草を刈る予定でしたが、先月の大雨で遊歩道が土砂に埋もれてしまったため、急遽歩道からこれを除去する作業に変更になりました。","textVersion":"sha256:be8035661f912b2f1e6518b93769dd1a115f0b50c128e1d1e72deb0a459eba77","audioVersion":"sha256:46b5c8bc6fcac81b9789908f3e558f86acb3644f9efec47ca079b78cc9609a35","timelineVersion":"sha256:21f2e0dca1bbe5aecbd7ef7cf7fe1647443f67140adc310bd18b76189ff9dde7","start":18.94,"end":34.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-1","text":"撤去した土砂は後日池のさくの補強に使いますので、遊歩道脇に置いてある袋に詰めていってください。","textVersion":"sha256:32319d45694047ebf2d022dac0fb3570725842b4029668c523957f599ba8c039","audioVersion":"sha256:46b5c8bc6fcac81b9789908f3e558f86acb3644f9efec47ca079b78cc9609a35","timelineVersion":"sha256:21f2e0dca1bbe5aecbd7ef7cf7fe1647443f67140adc310bd18b76189ff9dde7","start":35.64,"end":43.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-2","text":"え、展望台へ行く石段は、一部くずれている箇所がありますので、そちらには立ち入らないようにしてください。","textVersion":"sha256:b2c59950e432ae0f6131984df4e4a5213475b9ada2e55a610d8b7d7fd69e4fe7","audioVersion":"sha256:46b5c8bc6fcac81b9789908f3e558f86acb3644f9efec47ca079b78cc9609a35","timelineVersion":"sha256:21f2e0dca1bbe5aecbd7ef7cf7fe1647443f67140adc310bd18b76189ff9dde7","start":44.66,"end":51.76,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"00adb2f43dfdfb4c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:question","text":"三番：会社で上司と女の人が話しています。女の人は今日中に何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:905b60f889f19610e0cf86a72a650a6f6394aee33bf559f21f9711530b33117d","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":4.7,"end":15.38,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-0","text":"武田さん、おととい頼んだ販売戦略の打ち合わせの資料できてる？業務の都合で今日中に見たいんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:2cb3a932030e2c00e3c2cd0d7a7c23c8108ab0d7cc7237548a56792c2c0b92f7","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":18.94,"end":26.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-1","text":"すみません。明日になりそうなんですが。収集したデータが多くて、分析に時間がかかってしまって。","textVersion":"sha256:832091031c440c2ac9eb1ec14fd86b5f79ba338f1aa756782506aef35aeaedc0","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":26.56,"end":34.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-2","text":"そうか。武田さん、新人研修会の担当も重なってたよね。ベテランだからって、いつもいろいろ任せちゃって悪いね。データ分析は後輩の青木君にやらせてみたら。","textVersion":"sha256:1ae1aaabb0954b13d779acc79bce0176dbff0cd9e5406def46596d7600dbd626","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":34.44,"end":47.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-3","text":"それが、分析とか、あまり得意じゃないみたいで。","textVersion":"sha256:5c2f0db2054c5efbe2bb32b88b701336453876bf3126aa1fe9c311ccbaf1a837","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":47.34,"end":51.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-4","text":"でも、いずれやってもらわなきゃいけない仕事だから、今回は急ぎだからいいけど、時間あるときにでも指導してあげて。研修会の準備でほかの人に回せることは？","textVersion":"sha256:62d852845d72d76b5d16d6926ceb17657930651963bb7316a06709871447184a","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":51.22,"end":62.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-5","text":"今日中に会場の手配をと、思ってるんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:b892288bde32e883f3d27786b4bc75b3e2361df1fefaf836a76db917ff415499","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":62.74,"end":66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-6","text":"じゃあ、それは青木君にやらせるとして。あっ、わたしから伝えとくから。これで武田さん今日中にできそう。","textVersion":"sha256:26eaf026e271bf32c60237f696fd38bc8aa554d41305f13a9dc2e07edf38d99b","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":65.94,"end":73.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-7","text":"はい、ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:38147824564394ff9492239e2b0b8871fc9d54c44fdd9f56bb7e569673f7c4cb","audioVersion":"sha256:c6e498e42efae47733dd0324f667d01b8ca4a073ccfee15e7ef84fb05101ec99","timelineVersion":"sha256:dbd9a5d85716549899bc2945f03a32063bacfed76e1431461a31928916bdddf1","start":73.96,"end":75.74,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"00adb2f43dfdfb4c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:question","text":"四番：大学の研究室で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はこの後、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f4561ff081b6b3e4ce033e905128d5fd9eaa81a6263ab4f40444c7cc6e4fd9bc","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","start":4.44,"end":16.72,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-0","text":"先輩、食事と睡眠に関する研究プロジェクトの実験を受けてくれる調査協力者、今日までに２０名ほど応募がありました。","textVersion":"sha256:436b052b475352f558a89ff46afc6e7089691264dab0b5870818fbb8668ce734","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","start":18.24,"end":26.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-1","text":"３０名は集めたいから、後１０名だけど、この分なら集まりそうだね。自宅で記録をつけてもらう作業が中心だけど、何度か研究室に面談に来てもらうってことも、募集の際にちゃんと伝えてるよね。","textVersion":"sha256:300cc9bb7cc2f2e76e2a84577ef80ba528e236931cfdd4548c7af65f9c2c1dee","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","start":27.28,"end":41.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-2","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","start":41.36,"end":42.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-3","text":"面談の日時は、もう少し人数が集まったら調整するとして、調査協力へのサインをもらう同意書を郵送しないとね。目標人数に達するのを待たずに、その二十名には発送しちゃおう。","textVersion":"sha256:ff6fffa83fc0516d5753ecee951d660b935b8ae9a57d7a541ce6f1f2be905f3c","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","start":42.6,"end":56.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-4","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","start":56.36,"end":57,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-5","text":"それと、提出してもらった応募書類の取りまとめ、すぐにとりかかってくれる。どんな人が応募してくれたか見たいから。","textVersion":"sha256:f10e75ca8c2b7942a3de8470e4805dfc8563ea8afe6b3e20eeee138686b157b0","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","start":57.22,"end":64.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-6","text":"あっ、はい、それはもう済んでます。","textVersion":"sha256:48c6e79ac27dd3277860499cd17adaea7511cf76df2f4a71a1408aff84bd4fe4","audioVersion":"sha256:9f2b24b3e07feadfde0709a1ab90417f554e401dcda351ed1eedd8eb390bb739","timelineVersion":"sha256:321bf7f5d25309d444763065b61ba46815d7521a35a2762799e26393cefaf4a7","start":64.72,"end":67.4,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"00adb2f43dfdfb4c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:question","text":"五番：会社の人事部で上司と男の人が、会社説明の原稿について話しています。男の人は、この後、どんな情報を原稿に加えますか。","textVersion":"sha256:abdfa4994e4359c2e8dcb2e736cac623791b801847a13b06e2865347d78fed0a","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":5,"end":19.82,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-0","text":"佐藤さん、来年度の大学生向け会社説明会の配布資料の件なんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:d03a1f050adbe4231b8fe503fba6058ce5eab531fe62943a3cf6ebed1ebe64ce","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":21.36,"end":27.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-1","text":"あっ、はい。原稿を一通り書いてみました。こちらです。あのう、福利厚生については、去年とまったく同じ文章を使ってるんですけど、もっと詳細に書いたほうがいいかなと思ってるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:42567056a7036e17b2cfb2900233e60f2691325c45ef6565deaee16066dae146","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":28.74,"end":41.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-2","text":"確かに、休暇とか、住宅手当とか、福利厚生については、参加者が関心を持つところではあると思うんだけど、それは口頭で十分に説明するからいいです。","textVersion":"sha256:739d975a7b6ed55433d61e0bc08f837c0a7458ff222b5c7e0ce7e41ba445bc5e","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":41.26,"end":52.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-3","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":52.52,"end":53.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-4","text":"えっと、来年度から大学生に向けた社員のメッセージは載せずに、代わりに社員の一日のスケジュール例を入れることになったんでしたね。","textVersion":"sha256:81d91cef166a2dab5a77e7d12bd03456c226c7677d9f3dd6979a31543090f6b2","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":54.76,"end":64.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-5","text":"はい。入社後の生活がイメージしやすいようにということで、次のページです。","textVersion":"sha256:7a10a85bd6d0ab771d9e5104116d0ac9f087f819fd631eaa05e7eb8a149778b2","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":64.86,"end":70.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-6","text":"いいじゃない。それで、ちょっと思いついたんだけど、これとは別に、入社１０年から２０年目の社員を数名ピックアップして、入社から今までどんな業務経験をつんで現在に至るかっていうモデルを提示できないかなと思って。","textVersion":"sha256:060330edcb9f505f95799349b6aa33720461ef53ce77001cbd1f298204a3eafd","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":71.56,"end":87.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-7","text":"将来がイメージしやすくなりますね。わかりました。一日のスケジュールと共に、今回から新たに加わる情報ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:e05765f743d1bc21fc67a0cb0ce2b68ebaa18114c4982ed2715603bb85cc0cbe","audioVersion":"sha256:8b8d3112b330d1f236d1c3ffad279230acd4063178f243cabe6b9105167fdf6a","timelineVersion":"sha256:155f4c45ff320f3e5329fb569bda969f3a99e01589aa2bb475b79e0c56fe9d9c","start":87.9,"end":96.34,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"00adb2f43dfdfb4c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2018.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2018.html"],"batch":"n1-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6:question","text":"六番：大学の事務所で女の学生と職員が話しています。女の学生はこの後、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:0e73b1983a63a0eb1c02d793b0fdd59f3ab6a8c8f2e6ddce8f1fb2773564ef5b","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","start":4.66,"end":16.74,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6:line-0","text":"すみません。来週から始まる履修科目の二次登録でほかの学部の授業を取りたいんですが、手続きはどうしたらいいんでしょうか。ボランティア学っていう科目なんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:30d1d22b56b64da6ce55457d58ea195298851d411f92fd252c8b5345b55bb548","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","start":18.3,"end":30.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6:line-1","text":"一次登録で定員に空きがあれば、大学のウェブサイトから自分の学部の科目と同じように、オンライン上で自分で登録できますよ。一次の結果は今日からウェブサイトで公開されるので、登録するなら、その確認をしてからですね。希望者が定員を上回った場合は抽選になります。","textVersion":"sha256:cda40dcbdda275a05bab841cd1670b05e567d7124b2989c92c7e49216b08eca0","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","start":30.48,"end":51.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6:line-2","text":"はい、あの、抽選で入れなかったときは、登録せずに、聴講っていうこともできるんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:1958a3b802bdb412582f0a9e8f62d8e0f9a342e49f17e86d7ec5001f208bcfc4","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","start":52.26,"end":58.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6:line-3","text":"定員のある科目は聴講の制度は適用されません。前は先生に個別に相談して聴講を認めてもらう学生もいたようですけど。不公平になりますから、今はね。ちなみに、登録科目の単位数は上限を超えてませんよね。超えてると、登録はできませんから。","textVersion":"sha256:b2c78e3c940feeea87da9ce30edb363793ceb089bd2d3e5582596393e036caab","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","start":58.42,"end":78.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6:line-4","text":"はい、大丈夫です。","textVersion":"sha256:4e2b71ef2567f33ec396dd5fdb278aaf38a4b3fc0dae6cbe6f4435bb117ab2d1","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","start":78.32,"end":80,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6:line-5","text":"ボランティア学は、学外での活動もあって、なかなか厳しいそうですよ。授業概要をちゃんと読んでから登録するようにしてくださいね。いったん登録すると、取り消しが効きませんよ。","textVersion":"sha256:b15eaafafcfc4eec0774e6523ae38c88b3915dbcf5fa6572864acca44f1c6a08","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","start":79.84,"end":92.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2018-12:6:line-6","text":"はい、よく読んだ上で決めてきていますから。","textVersion":"sha256:f0ac441b375d1b2ba0ffd98e77efb82c3a03c11f5dbad5a72e2f693a391195dc","audioVersion":"sha256:564d0124eb293da1ed809012cfea469058c94fef4b17b31c56078b6ac7966362","timelineVersion":"sha256:95f725d13011c1b417215b88087c4c54ba5e2627f124642a59324b5bcf1493f5","start":93.42,"end":96.38,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"00adb2f43dfdfb4c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:question","text":"一番：花屋で、女の人と店員が話しています。女の人は、これから何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5194f99ce39e9d8e9b66404f0e54e12cbc1b312258ddcf8bbfbb2ed8891674de","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":5.56,"end":14.58,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0","text":"あのう、すみません。この赤い花をつけてる植物、先日こちらで同じのを購入したんですけど、花がつかなくなってしまって。","textVersion":"sha256:aaf844b9ff8735266ad1bb00183b6fd3f98f4d437656f626259a2f0ba5976bea","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":16.14,"end":25.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-1","text":"そうですか。これは夏まではずっと花を楽しめるんですけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:2045f2de488e4146fcbc4b37ae04a74c5b1dea29d28d702d7dbdf39672eb4ef1","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":26,"end":31.28,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-2","text":"一回り大きい鉢に植え替えてみたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:81067fc0fd273ab1cfe616fe62d2d00a6ab26d25c2e0c3fb3dd4a89d4b50c280","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":31.22,"end":34.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-3","text":"植え替えはおすすめしてるんですが、花を咲かせるのには、肥料もたっぷり与えないといけないんです。","textVersion":"sha256:779986157d75372a0b6b86b7fc51814b9754495c1b25966aa8ae452db1970307","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":34.82,"end":41.74,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-4","text":"ああ、買ってからまだ一度もやってないです。どんなのがいいかわからなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:082d9a71a63456d7e6423d57fdb29ac43cf1609e7a8f15cddf639604404e6b94","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":41.96,"end":47.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-5","text":"花にもよりますが、液体タイプは水やりで流れてしまって、効き目が長続きしない場合もありますよ。粒状のもののほうが、少しずつ溶けだして、ゆっくり効くので、おすすめです。試してみてください。","textVersion":"sha256:0acc7fd7f6daf0b63c883c6b6d5c6aca0564b92c9ad26525115fb0ccbd6cc152","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":47.86,"end":63.38,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-6","text":"はい。水はたっぷりやったほうがいいんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:95f1eb0c7228aa9e3d67fb7e580860eb0232a2a734e07fcb402b87d8c23b12f0","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":63.32,"end":66.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-7","text":"水は土の表面が乾いたらやる程度でいいですよ。あと、日当たりのいい場所に置いてくださいね。","textVersion":"sha256:76baf3dad567b2609aa7492c8719b7889f06602e5b80ce565d6be2fd8ed6e37e","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":67.08,"end":74.48,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-8","text":"はい。ベランダの明るいところに置いてます。","textVersion":"sha256:827ae7dede2f55e5bc21fd8125dc87b5250fb576e3eb0d66887076d18e997249","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":74.42,"end":77.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-9","text":"だったら、それは大丈夫ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:1f49f77def0548cef944bfe278bf2ec5dacf47a1b0e0d08f82eccdef48f34026","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":77.84,"end":80.28,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-10","text":"はい。ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:ded1add839fccb12a08a97f7f3916d00f26bd6faeccbaed27d9c7c487aa728e3","audioVersion":"sha256:71111db5dfbbd6f3df5350e8a4581030f0706350c18f7ab3327e5b5938a833a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:75ea639e88539bff512c10ead53f46e41bf662888ae7f0fefd4eca7b7a36e2a8","start":80.22,"end":82.66,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a9114f8d63809dbe"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:question","text":"二番：会社で、女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人は、この後すぐ、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:2914aa486eb1a927918746be34e662a05825dcb2750b7a90d3a4dee862b16d2b","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":3.72,"end":14.74,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-0","text":"田中さん、きのうお願いしたキャビネットの整理のことなんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:1017593b0008a4cacb74b183fc61b207a90cab416f3a6938ee35c4b599249f08","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":18.18,"end":22.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-1","text":"あっ。中にあった書類はきのう確認して、保管の期限を過ぎているものを処分しました。ご報告が遅れてすみません。判断に迷うものが少しあったので、それは処分しないで残しておきました。","textVersion":"sha256:b3912087dd0b93f040db73464b40a1ce21d12fe6fb683ca188086c6f07b92939","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":22.9,"end":36.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-2","text":"そう。わかりました。じゃあ、それ、この後確認するから、持ってきてもらえますか。","textVersion":"sha256:beeb3e298f5e1d89c0976de7e5b8e04a3f9cd9c8706c836b0d4fdf9cf66cc6e0","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":36.7,"end":42.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":42.02,"end":42.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-4","text":"そういえば、古いノートパソコンがあったでしょう。どうしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:5e9b0dbe8b437536d81725e477a982889a4a3add592b15378e7e44ecf92f8611","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":42.96,"end":47.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-5","text":"あっ。それお聞きしたかったんです。パソコンの処分って、決まったやりかたがあるんですよね。マニュアルって、あるんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:e89f50d3665d5b54d3f5ccb7323e16a60fa7c0a308d6e34244aae9cf0cf166f6","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":47.36,"end":54.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-6","text":"うーん。パソコンの処分は総務課が担当だから、連絡して教えてもらってください。総務課は、今日は海外からの視察団の対応でてんてこまいだろうから、別の日にでも。","textVersion":"sha256:bc3eea4440e0794a71cdc1cf7a6cc9113254aa2d7248d1cdd893c057df36254a","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":54.88,"end":67.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-7","text":"わかりました。ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:8eed0508d699cfc2d490d4b2a4476553438dfd17dca1b6ebf5135bcc6e20cb4a","audioVersion":"sha256:7d02c26005cd0601647162ac27bcd9346fe859629f10ec5303292f3e3dd6136b","timelineVersion":"sha256:15caaf9982b0242d0f7c9766fe529af3b1a3618e9ef0520f8dde3aef83f6052f","start":67.4,"end":69.44,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"a9114f8d63809dbe"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:question","text":"三番：大学で、女の学生と男の学生が話しています。男の学生は大学祭の準備として、あした、まず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:0af61f5928350814e111a2e981accfe3cff4c07eb4dee741f54e76ea86f49556","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":3.64,"end":17.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-0","text":"あっ、木村君。探してたの。","textVersion":"sha256:622bcfa7b57ee471c41b80f414067adf21d92e4db89f5e8d80dabcda805bdf49","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":21.24,"end":23.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-1","text":"あ、どうしたの。","textVersion":"sha256:38ad4a2c3d64822cbf030d524b2ee52bc7e60fbb3e7381b5fda57b4093766513","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":23.88,"end":25.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-2","text":"あした、サークルのミーティングで、大学祭でやること、話し合うよね。私が司会をすることになってたんだけど。どうしても大学に来られなくなっちゃって。木村君、代わってもらえない？","textVersion":"sha256:a3810ea01150ea69e44539fd5c0b06098e8526ba4234d282906be2c28c09c599","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":25.56,"end":38.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-3","text":"ああ。いいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a3378c506f084e3e108ed9164211e595f99c45e66790a6e1184f73897225f6fb","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":38.28,"end":39.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-4","text":"よかった。ありがとう。今年の大学祭では、クッキー作って販売しようって、先週決めたじゃない。あしたは当日の役割分担について話し合ってほしいの。","textVersion":"sha256:2099984aa4c74eadfa789a0bb56923e9c00bf6774a05de3da2a56ed74051ccd3","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":40.18,"end":51.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-5","text":"わかった。","textVersion":"sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":51.68,"end":52.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-6","text":"決まった役割分担はミーティングの後で一覧表にしといてもらえると助かる。それ見てスケジュール表を作るから。あと、もう一つ、大学祭にお店を出す申請の受付があしたの2時からなんだけど、出してきてもらってもいい？","textVersion":"sha256:5a8eb2a389814d464a1ea34c9702595c8b4110c59e16d36833ccbb7f07c23021","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":52.72,"end":68.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-7","text":"いいよ。ちょうどミーティングが終わる頃だしね。","textVersion":"sha256:b617580dea7f4cf308b4fb6dd12c703e6653ce83b614b38329298f35074c3a91","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":68.76,"end":72.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-8","text":"ありがとう。申請書はこれ、もう書いてあるから、お願いね。","textVersion":"sha256:c1035b8b3f80b0bac66c3d21985e254cecc046a172b064120b11ca0ff78021cf","audioVersion":"sha256:d81d8457b71a57925478dfb9c7a24dc563c4228ce495e78201480ab86e8e23e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cdb0b596a42214c1773cd024724d24f0574c044803b3f57ed5ea043c5fe8867","start":72.4,"end":77.08,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a9114f8d63809dbe"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:question","text":"四番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。女の人はこの後、まず、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:001d0ddc75fc844fb7d8bf6b077e5c1cef3bf672c8ee1d5f502010ed7dfa60f1","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":3.38,"end":13.38,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-0","text":"斎藤さん、今気づいたんだけど、このちらしの原稿、三千円の商品のところ、ゼロが一つ足りないよ。もう印刷業者に送ったんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:a85429ccbf00d73346e094b303ad9f11b1222c79c5ae58cf4f4d8c662ae60e56","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":14.96,"end":25.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-1","text":"えっ？","textVersion":"sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":25.04,"end":26.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-2","text":"すぐに電話して訂正してもらえる？","textVersion":"sha256:d791fd4b3ca125cc472db910a0fc03e56ff703d555315b5af0249a1679213df0","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":26.32,"end":28.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-3","text":"ああ、それが実は出来上がったものがつい先ほど届いたんです。印刷業者に注文を出したのはおとといで。申し訳ございません、何度も確認したつもりだったんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:35f4abb2a36074c084ce1a0c27b00d4cda8cc4dd15a049f6e69e06455d74dc1b","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":28.38,"end":41.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-4","text":"そうか。まあ、今言ってもしょうがないね。ううん。これからちらしをもう一度発注するわけにもいかないしね。こうなったら、アナログなやり方だけど、その部分だけ修正のシールを貼ろう。私が今からシールを作るから。","textVersion":"sha256:d889df4adb236226853e5389308980e768bdeea24b431c78efa0c9fb7a1a13f0","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":41.6,"end":56.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-5","text":"すみません。","textVersion":"sha256:ad69bc14be090d150d7b49223533c91ec92ca9c4aa3f7dc8de76a9eae85afbb0","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":56.88,"end":58.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-6","text":"あっ、今日はアルバイトの人が来てるから、手伝ってもらおう。事情を話して、頼んどいて。","textVersion":"sha256:5fbfb58a81a2571c76653106e2f911eab8b6bcb8ec7511570002723fbd395189","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":58.56,"end":63.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-7","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":63.8,"end":64.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-8","text":"斎藤さんはひまわり社とのアポが入ってるでしょう。戻ってから一緒にやってください。","textVersion":"sha256:f5a75c49107d5b40fb2662b222dda318be6b447e21e752577cf76a89b698da94","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":64.72,"end":69.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-9","text":"はい。わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:2144deb792eec49f3a87082d5baa7822ef070386bc6e4a869724b6d4e2af8d06","audioVersion":"sha256:045b29f39063d3d51848b362cfb89b4024f5797c5a372abb16e61e33be7247aa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8c02b7631df8d907b483d4a754a8a1b0372e29432a00ae276b22c32063c1e78b","start":69.4,"end":71.1,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a9114f8d63809dbe"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:question","text":"五番：女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人は家で使用しているヒーターについて、まず、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7ff42d9f4a0289a7b362b9c05cf39581bc490f1858559d12de55b8258a4c1031","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":3.64,"end":15.14,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-0","text":"山田君、すすめてもらって買ったヒーター、きのう突然スイッチ入れても動かなくなっちゃったんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:0e0dc6d200d56bf802fc098f7922667b904ba71c09a06d3c6695545226966cc5","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":16.72,"end":23.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-1","text":"えっ。去年買ったばっかりだよね。僕は三年ぐらい使ってるけど順調だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d3610fc3192986692b92e71dce17a0e7c3209e4d0780e4927b4ff3db1929df52","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":23.84,"end":29.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-2","text":"そうなんだ。あれ、小型なのに、あったかい空気がすぐに出てきて、すごくいいって思ってたのになあ。","textVersion":"sha256:b7e3388f0f4b198462bfa547fd2238f75e92c7703f34af081dfaf9f7e997e97d","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":29.56,"end":36.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-3","text":"うーん。空気を取り込むフィルターがついてるじゃない。あれにほこりが詰まったりすると、安全装置が働いて、停止しちゃうことがあるけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:ce45dacf9366cb48b5d652bdb4fde5bb7a44214afc5b3253aff5285190deb51a","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":37.42,"end":46.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-4","text":"へえ。","textVersion":"sha256:5b4758906dde4833d3f779bdfcf51ff70e042a5bc79b305f0b03b3a0bf9c6fc6","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":46.32,"end":47.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-5","text":"結構頻繁に手入れしないといけないんだよ。一度やってみたら。もしかして、タイマーで止まるように設定したりはしてないよね。","textVersion":"sha256:a1f0e5df7e81d0276ef482c0640c0bedafc79fa1738db63748dba8c2cdd90612","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":47.38,"end":56.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-6","text":"タイマーは使ってないから。","textVersion":"sha256:a6d9e23c288a29309df595097b5ea34948bb56fc317890e54ee773ae4191f018","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":56.44,"end":58.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-7","text":"そう。じゃ大丈夫だね。ヒーターが壁やものに近すぎても、熱を持っちゃって、自動的に止まるよ。それはしばらくつけてたあとのことだけど。電源プラグはコンセントに根元まで差し込んであるよね。","textVersion":"sha256:84c67d828aafb8782c4ca121f009e7daa71864bde580eb4f7a8cc1b758e5ea9b","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":58.92,"end":73.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-8","text":"それは確認した。じゃあ、今日帰ってからさっそくやってみる。","textVersion":"sha256:b56a0943c15ae65fad98600cd86dee9d98d81b063101af4afb67e7152f33f00a","audioVersion":"sha256:f57d538d5f922c5688c7ab09269342b813a122df85e88a7b93b2afbd80289f8e","timelineVersion":"sha256:86b512df78075cff80da4cbd811426122f12ca4a7bb455ac3d91346f94813253","start":73.62,"end":78.8,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a9114f8d63809dbe"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.7-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2c011d3734db3d502b031f71301be80924d878b276be08562adb563822092dea","timelineVersion":"sha256:a53a0616b5abca42918e3ac8268dd06ed55391b9fff7fb0acc4414ca461d6105","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6:question","text":"六番：大学の日本語のクラスで先生が話しています。学生は今週中に何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f09a6d35952a32f6357f2c5af025577702227dbe3ed1b6f2a3982787acb28b63","audioVersion":"sha256:2c011d3734db3d502b031f71301be80924d878b276be08562adb563822092dea","timelineVersion":"sha256:a53a0616b5abca42918e3ac8268dd06ed55391b9fff7fb0acc4414ca461d6105","start":3.56,"end":14.3,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6:line-0","text":"今学期のプロジェクトについて説明します。来月大学の近くの桜商店街に、グループに分かれて取材に行ってもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:f58ee38f901d399dba87a0ff87df49de06a848b2e5b34f75e763c3806aa69a53","audioVersion":"sha256:2c011d3734db3d502b031f71301be80924d878b276be08562adb563822092dea","timelineVersion":"sha256:a53a0616b5abca42918e3ac8268dd06ed55391b9fff7fb0acc4414ca461d6105","start":15.02,"end":25.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6:line-1","text":"古くからあるお店も多いので、店の話を聞くことで、この地域への理解も深まると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:9f4ec0d2d406dbea9924727395d72114b75d47fbcb81560b07b26135eedb9f0d","audioVersion":"sha256:2c011d3734db3d502b031f71301be80924d878b276be08562adb563822092dea","timelineVersion":"sha256:a53a0616b5abca42918e3ac8268dd06ed55391b9fff7fb0acc4414ca461d6105","start":26.14,"end":32.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6:line-2","text":"ええ、グループ分けと担当するお店の割り振りを、このあと発表しますので、店を一度訪ねて取材をする日時を決めてきてください。来週の月曜日に報告してもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:e45831f0d520330dc8119239832b1eaec8e6bd23adb11a9a3cff4759d537b836","audioVersion":"sha256:2c011d3734db3d502b031f71301be80924d878b276be08562adb563822092dea","timelineVersion":"sha256:a53a0616b5abca42918e3ac8268dd06ed55391b9fff7fb0acc4414ca461d6105","start":32.6,"end":46.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6:line-3","text":"取材のテーマは、店の歴史、働く人の苦労など、いろいろ考えられると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:69ab21ddc78642d6c69989ba3522c733837b23f532e32a2c375e3cdab043b4b2","audioVersion":"sha256:2c011d3734db3d502b031f71301be80924d878b276be08562adb563822092dea","timelineVersion":"sha256:a53a0616b5abca42918e3ac8268dd06ed55391b9fff7fb0acc4414ca461d6105","start":47.44,"end":54.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-07:6:line-4","text":"どんな質問をするのか、来週の授業で話し合いましょう。取材した内容は最後の授業で発表してもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:3be68708ddb0148b4a73caec671191cc8a20e9b0b52ae43d2793b748bdc7d498","audioVersion":"sha256:2c011d3734db3d502b031f71301be80924d878b276be08562adb563822092dea","timelineVersion":"sha256:a53a0616b5abca42918e3ac8268dd06ed55391b9fff7fb0acc4414ca461d6105","start":54.82,"end":63.22,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"a9114f8d63809dbe"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:question","text":"一番：図書館のカウンターで男の人と図書館の職員が話しています。男の人は、この後、どうしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:5e92cf640b290967e053136bd7072b32a388400c45a6138ee6e9802672e75d8f","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","start":3.42,"end":15.82,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-0","text":"すみません、これ、先日お借りした本なんですが、子どもが破ってしまって。","textVersion":"sha256:4ab3b8f31fdac3779fe5e81337e371c2ccc8484d92572f67ffb43c29032b359c","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","start":17.44,"end":23.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-1","text":"ああ、そうですね。このページ、一部ちぎれて読めない箇所がありますね。 この欠けてしまった部分お持ちですか。お持ちでしたら、修理を試みますが。","textVersion":"sha256:9bad5b39299c237768302f41b73d12451a2c6079c82e51f7b23734b13691793d","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","start":23,"end":34.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-2","text":"それが何度も探したんですが、どうしても見つからなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:90f1adefaa19aeed417220d84122c5935977df7cea524008018ccef830e0b00f","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","start":34.64,"end":38.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-3","text":"では弁償していただくことになります。","textVersion":"sha256:169fd91a6fad8bb55b239de9b35927e5c5df5a64ea00da2498e969fb7ef9c37e","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","start":39.16,"end":41.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-4","text":"えっ？弁償ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:80acba393f8a1db5ecbac52b756dea71eb0f759b07173b379bc9173693b6d4d4","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","start":42.32,"end":43.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-5","text":"はい。盗難等に遭われた場合は警察に盗難届を提出していただければ、弁償は免除になるんですが、紛失や破損の場合は同じものを書店などで入手の上、お持ちいただくことになります。現金での弁償はお受けしておりませんので。","textVersion":"sha256:cf0385f55ffddaddbcd5e0cb15d6ae0f6f691c81746314301c0fd61513e75fdd","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","start":44.1,"end":61.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-6","text":"そうですか、わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:58b4cfe0ce469f4fcc928c9da86ebbad86b6bcf485e00e37c56930c9103465b9","audioVersion":"sha256:759351f56258c89fc98ad29037665d1c49959e1a06f6016953bb13bfceb79922","timelineVersion":"sha256:043a124add81507528f933a0b7a5ebe0a02631937ccda05a12e914f311327770","start":61.64,"end":64.02,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"65732e51139ae66c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:question","text":"二番：会社で、女の人と男の人が話しています。女の人はこの後何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:891efec48c8c1c8278054370838a6fb0499f241500ba26796b701edfd3d6dc9a","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":3.76,"end":12.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-0","text":"あのう、課長、わが社の創立３０周年記念パーティの件なんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:7b15da935df82772085b0da6f83ec0c2441c7511510dcde2efc45b2ac5680e51","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":12.82,"end":19.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-1","text":"うん。準備進んでる？","textVersion":"sha256:f1fdf2900abe744bb28a9e8e2fb5d02ee2c2a835cbb329586175c35c3ea015ce","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":19.8,"end":22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-2","text":"はい、それが、来場者に配る記念品の写真立てなんですが、３０周年ということでかなり凝ったデザインのものにすることになりましたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:0f3cf36ca3f4f4773b4fd7e30ce80e6f92cae5b206cad1d1b071ec42f7fcb09f","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":21.94,"end":31.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-3","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":31.74,"end":32.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-4","text":"いつもの業者に頼んだんですが、あれだと、納期に間に合わないと言われまして。","textVersion":"sha256:d06a39fb482f7b4b9c881029ac19f608e3c99cf705a970354a59c5a73835ca12","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":32.86,"end":37.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-5","text":"それはまずいね。別のとこにあたることはできない？","textVersion":"sha256:94cde3f15b40033f3376bea9dae32935d7eb912f2f63dee6afa5778ef8b37e30","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":37.84,"end":41.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-6","text":"それも考えたんですが、あの業者には予算面でもかなり無理を聞いてもらってますし。","textVersion":"sha256:2a31e0f0d6360e3d31b94a758c898a6f3f4494f2a4ea78ae83ac100bea502b7f","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":41.78,"end":47.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-7","text":"そうだね。じゃあ、見た目に拘りたいのはやまやまだけど、時間のことあるし、業者と相談して納期に収まる程度のものにしてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:990ec886a3318a108bb50b96fb73abb1dce44b2045bf6d93fbafb1ed1f9a479c","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":47.86,"end":57.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-8","text":"はい、承知しました。","textVersion":"sha256:9ac1d0c3b110caefd813bf90a262f2679c8a663bf03d699ec2769c775a2d0fb8","audioVersion":"sha256:132af612e51718c903aecae7893a5c25e982f8b25b0737cd67fc8b612643801c","timelineVersion":"sha256:b285e0561066c702d1d9992f45c559f889295b1906b38583227b7625abf4e369","start":57.66,"end":59.46,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"65732e51139ae66c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:question","text":"三番：旅行会社で上司と女の人が話しています。女の人はまず何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:66f9336ab52a3807075ee3140d6035d0f27f9e8a44a0f61fc31573a2669f371f","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":3.78,"end":13.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-0","text":"山田さん、うちがはじめて手掛ける登山ツアーの企画、山田さんにも加わってもらうことになったから。","textVersion":"sha256:3527e86f62b32e22eb048f9136b818a2d4707cbaa94c74a3b8af48de4c854732","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":15.34,"end":22.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-1","text":"あっ、はい。あのう、私、これまでまったく登山をしたことがないんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:12ef5111893657a2a77b75346fa70e6036f5069e202cdcfe82723d49180dee9c","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":22.02,"end":28.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-2","text":"この企画はそういう初心者が気軽に参加できるものをと考えてるんだよ。外部の専門家にも入ってもらうから、専門的なことは心配しなくてもいいよ。早速で悪いんだけど、頼んでいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:a408535ad2f0cdf2ec9e8865bffe2bc1b7904cc9b118e4c560875dc024614df6","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":28.38,"end":41.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":41.7,"end":42.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-4","text":"そこのファイルに近郊でツアーの候補地になってる山をリストアップしてあるから、そこから五つぐらいに絞り込んでもらいたいんだ。自分でも登れそうだって思えることを念頭に、コースの魅力度でね。他社の類似ツアーの資料も入ってるから、それも参考にしながらね。","textVersion":"sha256:5e51612b19211023b333d7204600ce46ecb1b4b6201738673b445c2c05746512","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":43.16,"end":61.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-5","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":60.96,"end":61.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-6","text":"最終的には、五つの候補地を専門家と企画担当全員でさらに検討して三つにするんだけど、その段階になったら、周辺のレジャースポットを調べてもらうのも山田さんにって思ってるんだ。帰りに寄れそうな温泉とか土産屋とかね。","textVersion":"sha256:883886aeee1589f84ab345d5d19dc456a690384aa178f2a20c5d024a4f71187c","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":62.16,"end":79.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-7","text":"わかりました。いいツアーになるよう頑張ります。","textVersion":"sha256:db6e2a8a86826e6bdcddf430f714eaa685a56fe8932e492cf72d19ea2012656f","audioVersion":"sha256:6e0bc36de2e6047f70085ec9cd81819e99b9bed7aac6b78ae10eb355e60cb0c2","timelineVersion":"sha256:5821757a272c35142852718e09aa754f5745f3cfc79fb3b55f20430ff4b2812e","start":79.54,"end":83.26,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"65732e51139ae66c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:question","text":"四番：パン屋を経営する男の人が知り合いの女の人と話しています。男の人はこの後何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f4795908d93e8d99cb096bdc86a7498db11e1a2216c61264b676740dc45b24d3","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","start":3.4,"end":14.3,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-0","text":"うちのパン屋、お客さんがのきさきに自転車を止めることがあるんですけど。どうしても歩道にはみ出してしまうので、近所から苦情が来てるんですよ。佐藤さんが経営なさってる喫茶店もうちと環境似てますけど、どうされてますか。","textVersion":"sha256:524d1e8200e6dbfce98ce521af158382f91753d7a5009c138f6c1fd35f30264e","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","start":16.06,"end":30.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-1","text":"私のところでも以前同じような問題がありましたよ。ただ、たまたますぐ隣に市の駐輪場ができて。無料のね。今はそこを使ってもらっています。","textVersion":"sha256:e98192823915774d16b70e3c9e70655eb2b24ed634f549ccbdc1a1dc1b83e1e5","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","start":31.2,"end":42.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-2","text":"無料で使える市の駐輪場、ないことはないんですが。店からちょっと離れてるんですよね。って言っても、徒歩五分くらいだから、ぜひそこを使ってほしいんですが。駐輪場までの地図を入口に表示してるんですけど、なかなか...","textVersion":"sha256:c3190fe4434349084268dfb2d69d5f1608f1e4ec4122f0db1737525845cb7137","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","start":42.32,"end":58.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-3","text":"うん。自前の駐輪場が持てたら一番いいんでしょうけど、店の隣の土地が手に入らない限りはね。もう自転車を物理的に置けなくするしかないと思いますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:83977e2b61ef70ab595f6e0a32eee120205f3a4dad6a55f37daaaa2e4e49fe69","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","start":58.8,"end":70.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-4","text":"つまり、自転車を置いてほしくない場所に駐輪禁止と書いた大きな看板を設置するとかですか。","textVersion":"sha256:98a1ebb33ec5bc17871ef36ec960c371760e7d85ed91d97309af818312579791","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","start":71.36,"end":78.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-5","text":"ええ、まあ。ただ、そうすると、お店の雰囲気が悪くなっちゃうでしょ。だから、花や緑の植木鉢でのきさきのスペースを埋めちゃうんです。うちも隣に駐輪場ができるまではそうやってて、効果ありましたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:865de48442f172296517ba4541062964de0fe9137c158fb9dbd779c334b9575e","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","start":78.34,"end":94.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-6","text":"なるほど、早速やってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:eda3974b461271123df4bb3caa08ae79648e862c47dc831bff0cc80803796ccb","audioVersion":"sha256:cddaeca626d42dde0a1e576220744d296c48196c92201cefc5f2f0113aad9637","timelineVersion":"sha256:92191cd00d6cfc95e677b6f19dc4e7b20a7262fb41895fb196277dc4060cd66c","start":94.84,"end":96.82,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"65732e51139ae66c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:eeaaa8dcabb12a5d448d247885e9efb80edb826cad27d9db034e001769cd33ba","timelineVersion":"sha256:783fc52572a66b5458a4d29d40032476b00ca1eab022d0898421043ba1590c18","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:question","text":"五番：語学学校で職員がこの学校の講師に話しています。講師は何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:4f6e230aaed9bc6035d259f6274fed701dd952a478d1c53455689eedfaee9ba9","audioVersion":"sha256:eeaaa8dcabb12a5d448d247885e9efb80edb826cad27d9db034e001769cd33ba","timelineVersion":"sha256:783fc52572a66b5458a4d29d40032476b00ca1eab022d0898421043ba1590c18","start":3.34,"end":13.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-0","text":"講師の先生方にお知らせとお願いがあります。来年度から、本校の受講生が自由に使える自習用のオンライン教材を導入することになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:fb738af0240b378f95e93f7ef6a5ceb2f787e8b929560b7326779cdde6b9912c","audioVersion":"sha256:eeaaa8dcabb12a5d448d247885e9efb80edb826cad27d9db034e001769cd33ba","timelineVersion":"sha256:783fc52572a66b5458a4d29d40032476b00ca1eab022d0898421043ba1590c18","start":13.86,"end":26.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-1","text":"これは、 受講生へのアンケートをもとに開発したもので本校のホームページからアクセスし、音声を聞きながら単語が学べる教材です。","textVersion":"sha256:9ef9713e38e9a77f00e840d3601a15b852d0e133efd7c0c62923d9144b7d5c52","audioVersion":"sha256:eeaaa8dcabb12a5d448d247885e9efb80edb826cad27d9db034e001769cd33ba","timelineVersion":"sha256:783fc52572a66b5458a4d29d40032476b00ca1eab022d0898421043ba1590c18","start":27.04,"end":36.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-2","text":"受講生から質問があるかもしれないので、どのような教材か把握しておいてください。閲覧は明日から可能です。アクセスに必要なIDとパスワードは今からお配りします。","textVersion":"sha256:5aa5fe8275e11e8f538555e03b71355abe4d8d165aa6f5e24a448caa6721938e","audioVersion":"sha256:eeaaa8dcabb12a5d448d247885e9efb80edb826cad27d9db034e001769cd33ba","timelineVersion":"sha256:783fc52572a66b5458a4d29d40032476b00ca1eab022d0898421043ba1590c18","start":37.28,"end":50.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-3","text":"パソコンの設定は不要ですが、もしアクセスしてみてご不明な点があれば、事務にお問い合わせください。","textVersion":"sha256:9df39cf27fbcbe1c5029df9434f1cd3bda9a83e175941f446348beb40ce43f25","audioVersion":"sha256:eeaaa8dcabb12a5d448d247885e9efb80edb826cad27d9db034e001769cd33ba","timelineVersion":"sha256:783fc52572a66b5458a4d29d40032476b00ca1eab022d0898421043ba1590c18","start":50.06,"end":57.9,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"65732e51139ae66c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2019.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2019.html"],"batch":"n1-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6:question","text":"六番：会社で男の人と女の先輩がパソコンで作成した議事録について話しています。男の人はこの後まず、議事録をどうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:9046c3d1f56c47db1cac0608813baedc74c8da829c1f1c275b140b5fb6e27eba","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","start":3.62,"end":17.86,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6:line-0","text":"あのう、先輩。僕、今日初めて会議の議事録を取ったんですけど、この後、議事録はどうしたらいいんでしょうか。皆さんに内容をチェックしてもらわなきゃならないですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:c6f8f41244df0f7a1dec0ba9d437649594842a902203960cee017137888067a8","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","start":21.48,"end":32.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6:line-1","text":"ええとね、オンラインの社内ネットワーク上に会議記録っていう共有フォルダーがあるんだけど、そこに保存しておけば、各自が加筆修正するから。 今年度から経費削減で紙媒体では回覧しなくなったんだ。だから、印刷はなしで。","textVersion":"sha256:65030668858b261f09acb73bc7517ce99d798244c4ea707c2f21369c7d3ff5dc","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","start":32.84,"end":50.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6:line-2","text":"はい。あのう、部長にもそれで内容を確認してもらえるんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:b2ba41e3459fb62498460047ef4ff7cc69faca9a8c676e0b0146d80489057549","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","start":51.32,"end":55.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6:line-3","text":"うん。あっ、そうだ、前回の会議から、メールに添付して発言者全員に送ることになったんだった。共有フォルダーにアップしてもみんななかなか見てくれないから。","textVersion":"sha256:4b347efd5f200573793275c18d5ac1ad11a9b9b351af7f15d0bcf80c160164a2","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","start":55.58,"end":67.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6:line-4","text":"そうなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:ec0ceb9eb16153f37f4132b358dccfaf722bd76310f524f5f66e38dff84e5bf8","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","start":67.76,"end":68.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6:line-5","text":"それで、加筆修正して返信してもらって、それを反映させたものを完成版として共有フォルダーに入れるの。ちょっと手間がかかるけどね。あ、混乱しないように、未完成のものは共有フォルダーに保存しとかないでね。あっ、部長は完成したものを見るから。","textVersion":"sha256:032e16bd12e3a178be2a78f7cf94e7cf2a8d27a150744631d96b22e4f53bff74","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","start":69.58,"end":87.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2019-12:6:line-6","text":"わかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95","audioVersion":"sha256:192233d6f0f127eff7fed98f9561e6b4194f771066007d0506b5a706f91c195c","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fc406a6538fafbd01b191b330057324ca11538980bb6b0692a995134aac763a","start":88.14,"end":89.1,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"65732e51139ae66c"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2020.html"],"batch":"n1-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:question","text":"一番：女の人が修理センターに電話しています。女の人は最初に何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f265b7178e445e43af5b78ce4efac443c029b4b8a5c9e60e9adbf9878d971b97","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":3.78,"end":13.3,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-0","text":"あのう、三ヶ月前に購入した電子レンジのことなんですが．．．","textVersion":"sha256:ae422db7566c0c8c73d5ac23ab70d1587f8ebcbf719bd2ca539612668159eb53","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":15.34,"end":19.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-1","text":"はい、どのようなことでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:ae5af533617acce16e51233446bb38e9a0e6f45f93eebc6f769c0ce26822242f","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":19.3,"end":21.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-2","text":"なんか、使っていると、変な匂いがしてくるんです。焦げ臭いというか何というか．．．","textVersion":"sha256:00fce017d0a503cf4050832614b7b494c0dd14927e9acd925c6023c8be9973d5","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":22.18,"end":28.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-3","text":"そうですか。あのう、匂いと一緒に何か煙のようなものも出ていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:708a4b7ad7912593e2f51ea43a45ebb8c047fe30eac4b520fe931ee26360b60f","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":28.93,"end":34.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-4","text":"煙ですか。それは出てません。","textVersion":"sha256:f83e3e68769d651e8bd570a3a5a22d16ddeccc0bfab7610d5b5f825cb00ea473","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":34.54,"end":37.13,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-5","text":"それでは、レンジの上に何か置かれていませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:f27b152c6903879cea994a095f1ee72d7c54a44b52fd59b70802e5bb69431b3c","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":37.52,"end":41.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-6","text":"いいえ、特に．．．","textVersion":"sha256:7569d179592332f7ce89fa6820e8f71fdae020f66e2874cfdec96181b2d3c1a6","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":41.39,"end":42.69,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-7","text":"ええと、そうしましたら、レンジの内側に食品の滓や油がついてそれが加熱されて匂いの原因になることもあります。汚れを拭き取っていただきますと、匂いがしなくなると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:0edb63e69d7e648d108b6edc067273c3d88575a653fc0283976a1d5a00912f2c","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":43.16,"end":56.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-8","text":"はい、やってみます。","textVersion":"sha256:48ac895d4da40fffcd3d26030082c1e26998e2c663af104831f2de05a94af39b","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":56.66,"end":58.11,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-9","text":"で、もしそれでも解決しないようなら、修理に出してください。その場合は担当者が引き取りに伺いますので、お手数ですが、再度お電話いただけますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d4c15b2c05303e96d3b5b5e3d98764bbb3329a59850dcd7e6ea0b1f2316cc3af","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":58.36,"end":68.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-10","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":68.88,"end":69.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-11","text":"では、よろしくお願いいたします。","textVersion":"sha256:195ebd5fd19ec27602df57970675e74c59fc2fa2933ed4c80485b100898fc7d7","audioVersion":"sha256:778544d2ab6a01fa3e782873fdbadfb2008fad12e9b46b0d09d387831d01ca91","timelineVersion":"sha256:896d5d097425a998380b269274fc000df8f3f6e4b09e4fb642a031fa29e8f8db","start":70.06,"end":71.6,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"e0807ae20e118ff7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2020.html"],"batch":"n1-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:question","text":"二番：会社で課長と男の人が話しています。男の人はこのあと、まず、何をしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:26aa0e9a617fd23467e89c4e66f9a9cfb5e61f74d5e699883367c3d33451699c","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":4.2,"end":13.02,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0","text":"あっ、林くん、おはよう。今、大阪支社から電話があって、昨日到着するはずの荷物がまだ届いてないんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:973bded97be451157789ac0e208648e862daa8e5866d75c4b0ce1635fdc5d1a7","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":15,"end":22.97,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-1","text":"えっ、新商品のサンプルと商品紹介の資料ですよね。昨日大阪に届くように送ったんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:8b4249f7dd71cdb9ba324e32093fbce38ad8d433b6e3aad0228e8366ee53086b","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":23.38,"end":30.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-2","text":"明後日の家電フェアで使うものだから、今日には届いてないとまずいよね。","textVersion":"sha256:b25a9faf742387d458f3de63a802d3a4a140f41da7c010215446f82d09b4ae77","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":30.34,"end":34.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-3","text":"予備の物をすぐ送りますか。","textVersion":"sha256:fefb45d1907dd296c5df59a7b8df63e879cc3f26f5014cd5321367523547535e","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":35.02,"end":36.63,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-4","text":"うーん、ちょっと待って。とにかく、荷物の状況を把握しないと、運送会社に問い合わせてくれる？","textVersion":"sha256:7b0daea4a9c111f8d8f410b72482a3376941770ba33d840df08b64c13b2e4687","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":37.27,"end":44.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-5","text":"はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:18d2ff50b951ddb3ce339017a80a9a6dc1c1ce5a19553206efead7a638dd54f4","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":44.38,"end":45.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-6","text":"資料は電子データで事前に送ってあるから、問題はサンプルのほうだよね。万が一、見つからないなんてことになったら、直接持って行ったほうが早いね。","textVersion":"sha256:1fd9224be29bacaddea22468fc4e6fc4005519751b7b877b3b8ed880145c2f92","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":45.82,"end":55.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-7","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":55.26,"end":56,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-8","text":"大阪支社には私が連絡しておく、日が迫ってるからすぐ動いてね。","textVersion":"sha256:4b74e4e2f9f8fdc9950042ef4f1cdcdae60f8b6c24d0b4374404a558d317f9af","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":56.34,"end":60.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-9","text":"はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:18d2ff50b951ddb3ce339017a80a9a6dc1c1ce5a19553206efead7a638dd54f4","audioVersion":"sha256:01f2a15f3161304431f965562a5916cbf0177bb0a8e48b3e28b97cf71d2baab8","timelineVersion":"sha256:b4f82b4c3506507a1d911f9f3f8c3d193eea30d0688e110f6e64a0103e8dd8ad","start":61.07,"end":62.28,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"e0807ae20e118ff7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2020.html"],"batch":"n1-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:question","text":"三番：大学で国際交流サークルの男の学生と女の学生が話しています。男の学生はこのあと何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:02642d39de0ebb2e7a29512f3d2fdfabf382760f9a656f6f318b18014549da63","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":4.5,"end":16.4,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-0","text":"先輩、今度の留学生との交流会、５０人も申し込みがありました。みんなでお好み焼きを作って食べるっていう企画が良かったんでしょうか。留学生と日本人が半々ぐらいです。","textVersion":"sha256:6d0d4ee3afd80dcb7b71019ef2cb22b1d11c36eca7d94c0d94d00611847ff830","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":18.39,"end":30.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-1","text":"５０人か、予想以上だね。申し込み者の情報をまとめておかないと．．．国籍とか、学部とか、グループ分けに必要な情報を入れて、リストを作ったほうがいいね。いつもより、人数が多いから、いろいろ大変かもね。","textVersion":"sha256:9fc25a936374745785b52350e9ca79537e1474e0f3027782a1b62af650dfe106","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":30.78,"end":47.29,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-2","text":"そうですね。調理の道具ももっと用意したほうがいいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:c3cbd0080ab64427b26b8dc7656c417137bb753621de10b77e482d88276d535e","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":47.48,"end":51.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-3","text":"道具は余裕を持って用意してあるから。それより、当日の進め方をよく考えないと．．．うーん、自己紹介はいつものみたいに一人ずつ順番にしてもらうんだと時間かかっちゃうよね。ちょっとしたゲームとかのほうがいいか。","textVersion":"sha256:0558e1f7a798e1081594cc74d55814ed40a3dfe0a9262b53c2084302b9ac07f3","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":52.02,"end":68.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-4","text":"ああ、知り合うきっかけ作りになるような．．．","textVersion":"sha256:c32c5f05398727db04362b05895060396a0b39c36b861dfd4a2eb95ee62e43f6","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":69.27,"end":71.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-5","text":"うん、来週のミーティングまでに、ちょっと考えてみるよ。グループ分けも来週したいから、それまでにリスト、お願いしてもいい？","textVersion":"sha256:169e912698dd2b6d9001358e277e67027fca3a63891e84262276fcf557fd532c","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":72.28,"end":80.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-6","text":"あ、はい、分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:bb8f659aa53ffdfbfc5b8a6d01392cc4dcf8af528f3a48db4b7297ecfa306e66","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":80.94,"end":82.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-7","text":"当日のスケジュール表は私が叩き台を作っていくから、ミーティングで確認しよう。","textVersion":"sha256:01a468d9c01f06044217b95e131857ec486c833d9c13102de362d16e1325021f","audioVersion":"sha256:9237ea213dfc4f81e7bdbcddcf15e593281e3f3227e16249d49fa939210fc83e","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e317e15b12ea0241f8e8ca9abd46e8733f53f4253b0ca1f186ceefb2f8a62f5","start":83,"end":88.09,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"e0807ae20e118ff7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2020.html"],"batch":"n1-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:question","text":"四番：会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。男の人はこれからまず何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:eb59395cf6b1abfa342a46824b47ab279733552f6f8bcdb9ee64c412c339fd91","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":4.48,"end":15.25,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-0","text":"加藤さん、来年の新入社員の研修なんだけど、今回も全体のコーディネート、お願いしますね。","textVersion":"sha256:6c9ec48e379578b258d95be402784d3e25216b774555f555951190708acaf6c4","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":18.9,"end":26.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-1","text":"はい。たしか、去年実施した社内アンケートで改善して欲しいっていう意見がありましたよね？","textVersion":"sha256:75a4d2bb85fcde4c1e957082a6193d1d70a29ef9526394e11a090a1cc911acaf","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":26.88,"end":32.81,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-2","text":"うん。パソコンの基本操作を研修で扱ってほしいっていう意見が多かったね。最近、スマートフォンなんかが普及したせいか、キーボード入力とかのパソコン操作に慣れてない人がけっこういるんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:95cb6bbc26d0fe9db08c803c5541bd39f062f2c7a7d9f104d949692fa3664e24","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":32.88,"end":45.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-3","text":"ええ。ただ、できる人はできるんですけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:455bce36b0c8603bf0bfed5abbb8e6aadce8deaa3317c8d7bd07fe41773e6a8b","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":46.63,"end":49.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-4","text":"うん。だから、新入社員のパソコンスキルを研修前に確認したらいいと思うんだ。ちょっとインターネットで探してみたら、パソコンのスキルがどれぐらいかを無料で簡単に測定してくれるテストがあるみたい。実技と知識の問題が含まれてるようなんだけど。内容が適当かどうか試しにやってみてくれる？サイトを教えるから。","textVersion":"sha256:e85644ebfb1ac1c286dfd4ae9bf418caa01618f31525d688a1621036f376cd7b","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":49.94,"end":71.85,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-5","text":"分かりました。もしそれを使うとして、スキルの低い人がいたら、どうしますか。そういう人向けのマニュアルでも作りますか。","textVersion":"sha256:469698336c77890592611d3b2a0ea097154b0fd5a9baaf511b3cc9484e395402","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":72.2,"end":80.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-6","text":"マニュアルだけじゃ、難しいでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:60e2996d716aa79a7dcbb9eaddaeda62484abe861ba64f5e5d9baf5990f33e80","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":80.91,"end":83.39,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-7","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":83.67,"end":84.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-8","text":"結果を見てから、それに合わせて研修内容を考えましょうか。外部に講師の派遣を頼んでもいいし。","textVersion":"sha256:789bb0c81d93ebeb248460a9fe9c66f7920aec3e6db5537c60ee2a7c38b6d391","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":85.09,"end":92.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-9","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:89d9b3f406d23d6ff41b10112d9cdaba467865fddbeb8fd45f751d8f277a28ad","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fa9d2369f7a2eac567d3ed950c8b4513a8e90414d887967348bc4c8955c8e5c","start":92.12,"end":93.15,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"e0807ae20e118ff7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2020.html"],"batch":"n1-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:question","text":"五番：出版社で雑誌の記者と編集長が話しています。記者はこのあと、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:fcc178ba3c5273ae472576dc3c005fa06652d95e2db9e324d22340105873c630","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":4.51,"end":14.45,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-0","text":"編集長、この間、確認をお願いした特集記事の原稿、見ていただけたでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:cccb10e878f0299eb2547c4715609a6ce1a28cd55d30206a01c9eb7445a4cc49","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":18.17,"end":24.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-1","text":"うん、見たよ。四十代からの転職がテーマだよね。うまくまとめられてはいるんだけど。転職経験者の話はインタビューを元にしてるんだよね？","textVersion":"sha256:cea66befe46da88ac3fd0976d528b1a0e3fb17672838a81d6450ea11149c9a28","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":24.36,"end":35.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-2","text":"はい。五人の方にインタビューした内容をまとめて記事にしてあります。","textVersion":"sha256:c588a835755e8fa8aebbc727d3b91cc94db530ae0490bfff60b0c53c2d9d0b25","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":36.84,"end":40.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-3","text":"五人か、うーん、まあ、人数はそれでよしとして、内容を要約するために言葉を言い換えたりしてると思うんだけど、その人たちが使った表現をそのまま記事に盛り込むといいんじゃないかな。生の言葉のほうが断然インパクトがあるから。","textVersion":"sha256:9bb583ffd634f17f13b478c8058780296deb40b0f82db447083ebe51f6a35658","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":40.91,"end":58.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-4","text":"ああ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:13dee93f1583257ee63e6b4c8be5585ad2a43511bb9621997b30aefa41774d54","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":59.22,"end":60.05,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-5","text":"録音したインタビューは文字にしてある？","textVersion":"sha256:6cd449ec6ef65afabffbc0463cd87118f55eed4eee629e77a06dd5766bcaff31","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":60.2,"end":62.65,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-6","text":"ええ、全部ではないんですが、重要なところは。","textVersion":"sha256:0958543f92fc556342fbfc817857a90a8227c66e8c064db8801e1701e21f3309","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":63.05,"end":65.99,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-7","text":"そう。じゃあ、その中で、記事にそのまま使えそうなのがないか見てみて。せっかくインタビューしたんだから、最大限活かさないと。","textVersion":"sha256:6f669657fd72492f2674da1f19debbcb69551f426baf6aeff1e67279effb1d91","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":66.1,"end":74.89,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-8","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:a45f418b99d3c7e217c37b769ddd90f8d50071728b038bab52510bf84b202435","timelineVersion":"sha256:651993e15efb7d9f882f26322bc916ebafe48e74648c22abf10c2c78812432ed","start":75.24,"end":75.72,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"e0807ae20e118ff7"},"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-6.mp3":{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":6,"audio":"/exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/assets/audio/2020.12-6.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:44f5d064b2bcdd842bb0fcdaccb59a6a3a5e04aa9796e7972fd7de27ed9587e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:7cf26fa80590aae6f279ea609b5c5291bcfe17c625564fe61fa6df446ca9a50b","pages":["exam/listening/task-comprehension/n1/years/n1_2020.html"],"batch":"n1-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6:question","text":"六番：バザーの会場で女の人が話しています。ボランティアの人たちはこれから、まず、何をしなければなりませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:fe290b463a7848794cb0016ccb8c38e86f3b33500b74bbb28c69764d4f1d5996","audioVersion":"sha256:44f5d064b2bcdd842bb0fcdaccb59a6a3a5e04aa9796e7972fd7de27ed9587e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:7cf26fa80590aae6f279ea609b5c5291bcfe17c625564fe61fa6df446ca9a50b","start":4.51,"end":15.4,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6:line-0","text":"えー、ボランティアの皆さん、こちらに明日のバザーの品物が集めてありますので、仕分けと値段のシール貼りをお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:f112906ca435798a4b1afebb6a04716675a21b30ed91d7eb42dfe4d61d18f32b","audioVersion":"sha256:44f5d064b2bcdd842bb0fcdaccb59a6a3a5e04aa9796e7972fd7de27ed9587e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:7cf26fa80590aae6f279ea609b5c5291bcfe17c625564fe61fa6df446ca9a50b","start":17.39,"end":26.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6:line-1","text":"品物ごとの値段一覧表を見ながら、シールを貼っていってもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:89860c7acc09f7f9fe42ddc3bd4371af0a20bf358569b6d5ca9275b2f4963fd1","audioVersion":"sha256:44f5d064b2bcdd842bb0fcdaccb59a6a3a5e04aa9796e7972fd7de27ed9587e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:7cf26fa80590aae6f279ea609b5c5291bcfe17c625564fe61fa6df446ca9a50b","start":27.47,"end":31.85,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6:line-2","text":"えーー、衣類、おもちゃなどの種類別に分けてからのほうが効率がいいので、先にそれをお願いします。それぞれ箱を用意したので、入れていってください。","textVersion":"sha256:ff4adee9f032ab2c46ac5f0684204baa2c32bcac9c3c7c05452c286b51247523","audioVersion":"sha256:44f5d064b2bcdd842bb0fcdaccb59a6a3a5e04aa9796e7972fd7de27ed9587e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:7cf26fa80590aae6f279ea609b5c5291bcfe17c625564fe61fa6df446ca9a50b","start":32.95,"end":42.93,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6:line-3","text":"去年は新品か、中古かの区別もしたんですが、煩雑なので、今年はその区別はしません。去年も参加された方、ご注意ください。","textVersion":"sha256:7f06c6ff39503b41fb37857dc7de6ffafc2770e8dcc288966645db368e164396","audioVersion":"sha256:44f5d064b2bcdd842bb0fcdaccb59a6a3a5e04aa9796e7972fd7de27ed9587e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:7cf26fa80590aae6f279ea609b5c5291bcfe17c625564fe61fa6df446ca9a50b","start":44.28,"end":52.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6","unitId":"n1:task-comprehension:2020-12:6:line-4","text":"値段を付け終わったら、各販売コーナーに運んでいただきます。何を、どこで、売るかはすでに会場内に貼ってあります。","textVersion":"sha256:fec47b0d05e9858b1664d16375659d95018659786e88c5ebaefa28ad46def898","audioVersion":"sha256:44f5d064b2bcdd842bb0fcdaccb59a6a3a5e04aa9796e7972fd7de27ed9587e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:7cf26fa80590aae6f279ea609b5c5291bcfe17c625564fe61fa6df446ca9a50b","start":54.55,"end":62.18,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"e0807ae20e118ff7"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2010.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:question","text":"一番：先生が旅行会社の人と学校の校外学習について相談しています。","textVersion":"sha256:88f7706e04eb5525adcc40d18fa24e76244307ba3a133f913cc084a7dee047e5","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":3.78,"end":11.3,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-0","text":"今年の3年生の校外学習の行き先なんですが、去年行った植物公園は行ったことがある生徒が多いみたいなんで、できれば違うところに行ってみたいと思ってるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:499f17e11f1bb8658661f745ac7c380077faec7fac136172ec3991b640402578","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":13.22,"end":25.39,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-1","text":"ああ、そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:e61a6cc6a0f662ae70e6611a99d6c3b98385cf5f9dc257fc063f1e93e72618fd","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":25.57,"end":27.13,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-2","text":"今年も人数は80人くらい連れて行くんです。ここからバスで1時間くらいで行ける所だったらいいんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:824b23cb7e20cdd4ba9216557206ca12c6c67ece5b89b0a45c23a7cada1244d6","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":27.45,"end":35.19,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-3","text":"そうですね。植物公園は去年評判よかったんですけどね。同じように自然について学習するんでしたら、動物公園も非常にお薦めです。ただ、こちらからですと、高速道路を経由して2時間程度かかりますので、そのあたり検討いただかないといけないと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:4917cc356c2725ebe652e2dd4457094256fef14a9fae6787f6bdc9ff212b6942","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":36.56,"end":56.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-4","text":"2時間は厳しいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:44b6637471e24b3b19059007f2b1c66a8c668c5a24cf83118b692b7dce6d5e2f","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":57.4,"end":59.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-5","text":"工場見学も人気があります。雨が降っても大丈夫ですし、バスで30分ほどの所にある自動車の工場でしたら、車を組み立てる様子が見学できて人気です。工場内の自動車博物館もありますし、人数制限もありません。","textVersion":"sha256:c6ef1b60a79db4a00bc4462dd68d8aa01bbf591698e1fb43ede5088cff37e908","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":60.08,"end":78.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-6","text":"なるほど、いいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:e4c6c29b335e8b1ca6aa2b25986678f6259b592d99b5e7eafdfcdf4357510378","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":79.06,"end":81.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-7","text":"あと、今回は難しいかもしれませんが、最近一番人気なのは、パンの製造工場の見学なんですよ。500円でパン作りも体験して、試食もできます。ですが、人数に制限がありまして、50名までということになっております。","textVersion":"sha256:99db106d3c99eea8ccd049029e3b1518bd0e24bdb0b40b422f4c47f1cc4887e9","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":81.54,"end":100.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-8","text":"そうですか。うちは80人ですから、やっぱりさっきの所にします。","textVersion":"sha256:b3b3227cebfb6abda0d57631587cc56c9286f53bdcd0a209ac5866a25f7229a4","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":100.66,"end":106.39,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:1:line-9","text":"校外学習はどこに行くことにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:715518736c09b3109efcbd77d58ed30650cc0a55c53bef448562a8730912fd7e","audioVersion":"sha256:7960f1e1e3e1b506e468046282e8700dde5577fd547b3c6c827832f2ee6ff84a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f37d5ed85ee2ecc5e65216da9d2d37e64432045e1891a9ac65a354722610e570","start":112.24,"end":115.78,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"ffed282d560f5b08"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2010.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:question","text":"二番：家で母親と兄と妹が携帯電話の広告を見ながら話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:9a038ee89af95f0994ffb57d126a8be23c0258b9456aa6481155caf8eb3cb762","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":3.76,"end":11.84,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-0","text":"何？それ。携帯電話の広告？","textVersion":"sha256:b94e7271ad5e258d3cbe0fc1b918ae475318a7c9aa42caee7b6556a2518fc930","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":13.78,"end":16.49,"speaker":"兄"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-1","text":"うん。そろそろ新しいのに替えたいと思って。今キャンペーン中で、この四種類の中から選べば、今持っている携帯電話と無料で交換してもらえるんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:abb626f4195164b20fbf2c8774677e1716aadfabf486c58f0f461a6c7fe0039c","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":16.98,"end":28.45,"speaker":"妹"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-2","text":"へえ、えーと、なになに？1番は機能を限定したシンプルな携帯、電話しかできないのね。2番は電話とメールと、それから、カメラ機能付き。3番も大体同じね。ちょっとデザインが違うけど。","textVersion":"sha256:2bb2ed463cdbbfc7b9a4f6cc341d111ee1c4e0b19e9753543f32b4621f6a58d3","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":28.74,"end":51.76,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-3","text":"4番の携帯は最新型で、機能もいろいろついてるね。テレビも見られるんだ。これ、いいじゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:3d245d103f311c26dd4886edbb19ca47ad99f2a1a0918cf97bb3c62be4832a9e","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":52.15,"end":60.35,"speaker":"兄"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-4","text":"うーん、携帯でテレビは見ないな。メールはよくするけど。","textVersion":"sha256:38f861bdabf42709cec38a2916f9b497d52c831c22416090a66914cd5b434b28","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":60.73,"end":65.8,"speaker":"妹"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-5","text":"じゃ、これがいいよ。3番。僕も持ってるけど、軽くて使いやすいし、それに、水に濡れても大丈夫なんだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:444b8b46e2dfa1cf23ed488995e3005aed56f8ea96e9f439068ef5050337a3b8","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":66.04,"end":73.56,"speaker":"兄"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-6","text":"そっか、お兄ちゃんと同じか。嫌だなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:5d7bce4ddc8c9051db50a09c7b6a35dbec30731aab8e09a03f7f50ef02af3195","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":73.92,"end":77.98,"speaker":"妹"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-7","text":"なんだよ、それ。","textVersion":"sha256:93a9338dc89eb5be42594b58a2db21be4af1378bb70b215de9b8493c3a7928d5","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":78.3,"end":79.26,"speaker":"兄"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-8","text":"まあまあ。でも、無料で交換してくれるんでしょう。じゃ、やっぱり機能がいっぱいついてるのにしといたら？今は使わなくても、あとで使うかも。","textVersion":"sha256:042b49ce9ab9d2399aaa03c59b2ac87f6a63212ac94304a277cb3ebaacf7fa6e","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":79.22,"end":90.84,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-9","text":"それもそうか。じゃ、これにしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:0df897c60becf4bf93ec07ad3d959392a19e9063024bebbdca618205c371902b","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":91.22,"end":94.32,"speaker":"妹"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:2:line-10","text":"妹はどの携帯電話を選びましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:434476308d63386cba570ee02293bd19c5c6b22ee0a0144252461dd3044adb49","audioVersion":"sha256:4f7221835ab7e7f228fd95d40240679db7f753931e649868e8a6adf0acc472a5","timelineVersion":"sha256:445c6616887060d6084f5eb60291c2af2cfea07ab4bfb90cbfff3b140b60571c","start":100.15,"end":103.64,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"ffed282d560f5b08"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","examKey":"2010-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2010.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2010-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3:question","text":"三番：公園でアナウンスをしています。","textVersion":"sha256:571ccdb7ee54b765b69b361b824a35cf89328ea2fcd54af7d7c6efac519e7e44","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","start":3.86,"end":7.94,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-0","text":"本日はご来場、ありがとうございます。この公園には大きな広場が4つあり、それぞれにお楽しみいただけます。「花の広場」は、桜の木が多い場所で、今ちょうど一面ピンク色に染まっています。ベンチやテーブルも多く、ピクニックにも最適です。「もみじ広場」には木がたくさんあり、秋になると紅葉がとてもきれいです。また、大きな池があり、この時期、池に映る木々の緑がお楽しみいただけます。「緑の広場」では馬に乗れるコーナーや小さい動物と触れ合えるコーナーなどがあります。「青空広場」にはバーベキューが楽しめる設備があります。おなかがいっぱいになったら、芝生の上でのんびり寝転がってみてはいかがでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:de561717ff7294d37c074cc26b372efbc1ce0cf53a638097974076edc3e7fbd9","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","start":15.64,"end":73.6,"speaker":"アナウンス"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-1","text":"どこに行く？バーベキューも楽しそうだけど、今日はお弁当持ってきたから、ベンチとテーブルがあると、食べるのにはいいけど、ちょっと人が多そうだね。","textVersion":"sha256:e7555ff5b07458db5c41585a3b39be227093216b43ed685c21bbd87da36a837e","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","start":75.42,"end":87.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-2","text":"そうだね。お弁当はベンチがなくても、どこでも食べられるよ。それより僕は馬に乗りたいな。","textVersion":"sha256:1b633fdea8d8a8755bac8b4ebe0d7390a92c1d4d1952e2d86a91311ec609ec50","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","start":87.5,"end":96.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-3","text":"うん、いいね。でも、それは食べてからにしようよ。","textVersion":"sha256:135ab84b94291d212618854c9f6eb12175453c0c0a312cf7677d3e9c27f7e736","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","start":96.32,"end":100.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-4","text":"じゃ、そうしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:a5373e3293bb47b9f29e78e4299e4ea5e20bcb9d5ac3022ba82fd9390923f25d","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","start":100.7,"end":102.05,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-5","text":"ねえ、お昼は、池を眺めながらっていうのはどう？","textVersion":"sha256:a5f3f8419a8c9e42ee0295468b867531535f03e36afbd88b6a6a332753fc4cb0","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","start":102,"end":106.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-12:3:line-6","text":"うん、いいね。じゃ、行こう。","textVersion":"sha256:8f883cea6f4f55ce85afc435156caac114fe8944b3c10c63bad7f16c34ca69c2","audioVersion":"sha256:6fd3826abd3946b696bd479cb0813873a88003a3a2289ed069240743305d41fc","timelineVersion":"sha256:00f02bf51fe9d994a577b6c2ccb82d1f41ff92cd9e8d13c00ad08430cdf3569e","start":106.26,"end":109.34,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"ffed282d560f5b08"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2010.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:question","text":"一番：図書館で、女の人が係員と貸し出し用CDについて話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:7a237b022b9ebd53978a3d842e0d3c848801e8a1730335b94ea58860fe659edd","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":4.3,"end":12.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-0","text":"すみません。子供が好きそうな歌のCDを探してるんですけど。この4月に小学校に入ったばかりの子なんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:87e2c3684083e5a79b84c301e7805e061a5a885db936c41b5debd6583addd03c","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":14.18,"end":23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-1","text":"えーっと、こちらが子供向けのCDコーナーです。「みんなで歌おう」っていうCDが人気があるんですが、えーっと、あー、あいにく「みんなで歌おう」はいま、貸し出し中ですねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:cda457d99ee540d74c162ffb2e0546f47fff8e5bf3a9948e8f0712dc1536a660","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":23.8,"end":40.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-2","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":40.35,"end":41.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-3","text":"えーっと、それから、こちらの「懐かしい子供の歌」は、昔懐かしい、小さいお子さん向けの歌ですね。それと、こちらの「アニメの歌」は、テレビの人気アニメの歌を集めたものです。","textVersion":"sha256:73bd71db23c778772fb6fab8f7ed7542fa5702b02056718d08885c4b1f970e13","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":41.65,"end":58.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-4","text":"えー、いろいろあるんですね。息子には、アニメより、私が子供のころ歌ったような歌を聞かせたいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:be3c55dd2036431e005814c7641cc0453872bc8dda5a1072ffdb7c62a801c2d0","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":59.38,"end":68.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-5","text":"あーあと、いろんな国の子供の歌を集めたCDもありますよ。「世界のこどもの歌」っていうんですが、こちらです。","textVersion":"sha256:2ac643f08e8a62745b7252d57f28b854ff8bae9bcf05487b2bfcf17c748b4fb0","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":69.16,"end":78.71,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-6","text":"あー、でもこれ外国語なんですね、やっぱりさっきのにします。","textVersion":"sha256:b1bfbe5ba5cb43594e2674288286028cb899706e958fbffe34b7861a6743e3fb","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":79.01,"end":85.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:1:line-7","text":"女の人は、今日、どのCDを借りますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b29a005038d419fd3f327d4a82422661279008adf7e00dc693806c08e3273b55","audioVersion":"sha256:22b64c65bc51d51ce0602c020426325fdcbcbdaeeafc22bc7634098a05700a12","timelineVersion":"sha256:19dd78aa8b0310458329cc062d634ebf622a19802d7aa903dcb3fab43cf2727d","start":91.65,"end":95.35,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"9b23c0af43410348"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2010.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:question","text":"二番：親子3人が、遊園地へ行く計画を立てています。","textVersion":"sha256:df8484f8b99c56c13a94ce36fc6130af783d6413b6600f01653462c3f15bee61","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":4.01,"end":9.74,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-0","text":"今日、遊園地の無料チケットをもらったのよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0e143ae497bd93e5f4d61c743e4a6ed09e3c4f6f0d3ffe913a20938f2a71e494","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":11.69,"end":14.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-1","text":"お、遊園地か。いいねえ。じゃあ今度の日曜日に、3人で行こうか。","textVersion":"sha256:0a7ade2cf88e061606eb21c262f39fd6167d7d9ed1b057b3102b70bdc5dbc8e4","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":14.92,"end":20.95,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-2","text":"休日だと混むだろうから早い時間に行ったほうがいいかもね。","textVersion":"sha256:b06b5b12caee77d96ba186019a0e568ebfeb9ce15c768fdf615bf827ba8b50da","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":21.38,"end":25.71,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-3","text":"ねえねえ、僕、来週の月曜日、学校お休みだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:8f5a267614fbb320f14e4b9fffdc01e74710bb3c65150acb2efaa5a7335c11a1","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":26.1,"end":30.56,"speaker":"子供"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-4","text":"あら、そうだったわね。月曜日なら平日だし、空いてそうねえ。ねえ、仕事休めないの？","textVersion":"sha256:bb7e697316c860b14c32200f72edce1c777d1d7ffa3b0cb582b35d2269367f2b","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":30.71,"end":40.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-5","text":"うーん、いまちょっと忙しいから、難しいなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:3141514b1f6a142b26667fa0dd90fa08ef5fc2ec16cb8b0c22fabf3376ec4d13","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":40.55,"end":44.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-6","text":"でも、休みの日は、乗り物に乗るのにも、すごく待たされるって言ってたよ。空いてる日のほうが、たくさん遊べていいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d2d62358546ab9b8d1ccd4c62b9c1d7104ae6b641c2e039d02e8012caf9f0ec1","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":44.87,"end":53.71,"speaker":"子供"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-7","text":"そうよねえ。仕方ない。じゃあ、お母さんと二人で行こうか。お父さん抜きで、空いてる遊園地で、思い切り楽しんじゃう？","textVersion":"sha256:1fd94b0c39482493fe7c20f7604be31970a3a02c1a308ff2fddfb7063c8f2c3c","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":53.85,"end":65.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-8","text":"おいおい、そんな、わかった。何とか休みを取らせてもらうよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d21d24dc877c2bd97f546915f4c18751af22125e029ee4f1c58338638aff035d","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":65.08,"end":72.35,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-9","text":"やったあ！","textVersion":"sha256:47cd5f2cdbc0f17721cb453517e89490eaa375fc60ad60228fa39651d7aa7b60","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":72.49,"end":73.58,"speaker":"子供"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:2:line-10","text":"遊園地へは、いつ、何人で行きますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5e5928b8a36dda7b4c43ba5773de5a67c5c5574e7af4291825920535220f7289","audioVersion":"sha256:f187f9520b1810a44a6c1bebb483d0adee7b42a75356c5e3a705728d8d18a880","timelineVersion":"sha256:bdde30a2c75e6878beb7a2d58879fd2e284ba0165a37d2bdc71ea5991f032e45","start":79.56,"end":83.21,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"9b23c0af43410348"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","examKey":"2010-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2010.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2010.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2010-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:question","text":"三番：男の人と、女の人が明日の旅行コースの説明を聞いています。","textVersion":"sha256:372d97d5730a27701bb1cabb7f011bdee11423a14022bffb4131c4db8f3d7976","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":33.66,"end":41.1,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-0","text":"えー、明日は、皆様にお選びいただけるよう、コースを4つご用意しました。それぞれ、半日のコースなので、午前にひとつ、午後にひとつ、一日にふたつのコースを自由に組み合わせてご参加いただけます。まず、リラックスコース。こちらは、温泉をのんびり楽しむコースです。わくわくコースは、畑での収穫、牧場での動物との触れ合いを体験いただくコースです。ロマンコースでは、ドラマでも話題になりましたお城を訪ね、歴史を肌で感じていただきます。最後に、欲張りコース。このコースでは、地元名産のそばを味わっていただいたあと、大型ショッピングセンターでお買い物をしていただきます。","textVersion":"sha256:12e4784e7b6422a7e6970a839d8dc809c479f8e341f15959f5ba315ba269bcb0","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":43.07,"end":94.96,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-1","text":"どれにしようか、2人でひとつずつ、好きなの選んで一緒にまわろうか。","textVersion":"sha256:1f9f9141ea221cb2a5895c028f19cbc2bf1ec2be1a3ad2505be6ddd09b6cefb5","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":96.23,"end":101.1,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-2","text":"そうねえ。あなたはやっぱり、温泉？","textVersion":"sha256:a1f4684c7bcc525e9f314a2ef0a3f0159897e7383450c1db7ed5331c578a4141","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":101.43,"end":104.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-3","text":"うーん、そのつもりだったんだけど、さっきの説明聞いてたら、いろいろ体験してみるのも悪くないかなって。今ってなかなか自然を感じるチャンスもないし。","textVersion":"sha256:ceb826da3d48c2cfebff5c1e7f19942ff2d8143e91fda280e1b671b6d8db1137","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":105.39,"end":115.87,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-4","text":"いいわねえ。でも、そばはいいの？","textVersion":"sha256:649f2eaf693906064fac4a2f2d93004a4fdc007a96466e59cd3f0bccdcf1778e","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":116.22,"end":120.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-5","text":"そばもすてがたいけど、今回はやっぱり、体験かな。","textVersion":"sha256:f16a5be73c882d5531723da8d7f775eafe0f5c18b0243a91bc32bfb6b4890a46","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":120.53,"end":124.07,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-6","text":"そう、じゃあ、ひとつはそれね。私は、ドラマで見てからここのお城気になってて、一度見てみたかったんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:4548b05867063976116dc992e7e8d6eddf151364d9db29fe2b77a5c7995e13f9","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":124.58,"end":133.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2010-07:3:line-7","text":"じゃあ、今回はそれで行こうか。","textVersion":"sha256:408ef184484c05d62122dd540b1d72fe3e992b7412bcb0a45f152ef7484c18ff","audioVersion":"sha256:43833c359c293902120e4e90a9f91b541c2b06b2a67d223c014f78118a5daabe","timelineVersion":"sha256:6ea629fca3f15350dbfc2555ca7edce81bae3d779ee6888a030303bf9c3c67fb","start":134.1,"end":135.93,"speaker":"男2"}],"batchVersion":"9b23c0af43410348"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2011.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:question","text":"一番：会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。男の人はどの歯医者へ行きますか。","textVersion":"sha256:629bd3f4317453a85794e797f67d8a28d8d6c307784e8b5850dc93ab71fd1a3b","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":3.92,"end":9.58,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-0","text":"先輩、会社の近くでいい歯医者知りませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:a6281567b7327c6237df72484019ddad88c1335663d140feab7ed99c8b3abb79","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":11.44,"end":15.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-1","text":"虫歯にでもなったの？","textVersion":"sha256:4baa245fe629fd5ed18398e0f692d8a57f16ba0b9d8f18f45d8786edb99139b3","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":15.86,"end":17.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-2","text":"先週からずっと痛いんですよ。会社帰りに行けて、待ち時間が少なくて。それと、短時間で治療をしてくれるところって、ないですかねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:01d9369fe119cb1e511d74784c2b53329a08040cedb25184c2de448619001d3f","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":17.08,"end":27.9,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-3","text":"うーん、ここから近いのは山田歯科医院だね。一回の治療時間が長いけど、その分通う回数は少なくて済むみたい。でも、予約していっても待たされることがあるって聞いたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:23a7277b69097641b98b67d347ab6b419a8f85c4e58264f273354ad118c0463a","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":28.26,"end":43.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-4","text":"うーん、そっか。","textVersion":"sha256:9030877d1b3179190306e7d67455afc7fa713fdfff747b4af3115aac9e689585","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":42.98,"end":45.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-5","text":"私がいったことあるのは駅前歯科医院。待ち時間は殆ど無いし、丁寧な先生で時間をかけて治療してくれるのはいいんだけど、長く通うことになるんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:94c45f86edcc46ad98e150db6a607ffb3344851fad7ebaf984a81755fdc198a5","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":45.78,"end":58.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-6","text":"そうですか、丁寧なのはいいですけどね…","textVersion":"sha256:43a2c3a41032185e4f6b7d9db2554e7822c35b0135c7471927ed350f0ea27e9c","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":59.56,"end":63.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-7","text":"両方とも先生の評判はいいよ。後は、会社からちょっと離れてるけど、桜歯科医院、でも先生が有名でね、一ヶ月ぐらい前じゃないと、予約が取れないんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:ca8cf47ad3561b1e0041e3b380341640edb0d0db0dfaefe999a4de39eab26909","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":63.62,"end":79.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-8","text":"ええ？","textVersion":"sha256:88a45182afbbdf380863b6349368afe6e173e433bcbab6d5eb29ec5df1550faf","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":79.06,"end":79.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-9","text":"すぐに見てもらうのはまず無理だと思う。あ、そうだ。会社の向かいのビルに、グリーン歯科医院っていうのが出来たの。知らない？あっ、でも、診察時間が5時までって書いてあったなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:29c101de45b0d7183ac508ab81571f9bb44fe053ca549d2669e4d426218ebfd1","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":80.28,"end":96.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-10","text":"そうですか。会社帰りに行きたいんで、それだと間に合わないですね。うーん、待ち時間が多少かかっても我慢するしかないか。あまり通わなくてすむとこがいいんで。","textVersion":"sha256:d595c9d592b39ff74406cbe48ea51051503aff57ed23716336140c526a6c0559","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":96.8,"end":110.8,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-11","text":"男の人はどの歯医者へ行きますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b9cee6f3ca4f3d220ef4b24fef6edeb0989d76831f08e478c1ece8c012178d1c","audioVersion":"sha256:472f0247f4005708028575d5566229da0ad3e1bb2a33d085401f457d557952de","timelineVersion":"sha256:e6d5aef9cf12d63455980aa8caeb768387344eea9a459ce755f15be5bfb07a6f","start":116.36,"end":119.98,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"eabc5f6be1db8f50"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2011.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:question","text":"二番：学生二人が調査の方法について、先生に相談しています。学生二人はどのように小学生から話を聞きますか。","textVersion":"sha256:3e3c3837e05255ba251c49b9c4019e98f500486cfa2c4ac9c1458714cedbd5c8","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":3.96,"end":10.88,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0","text":"あのう、先生、ちょっとご相談したいんですが、いまよろしいでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:52302fcf56071cd97066250f82c05b4a595e501a9b60e054d09677ca16828142","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":12.92,"end":17.72,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-1","text":"うん、いいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:9632cbf7e82b3ce474b1b7fc15b37011a5e0641b74f5eecd9b16913fb46db639","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":18.12,"end":19.34,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-2","text":"あのう、僕たち二人、子供たちが社会をどう見てるのかってテーマで調査することになってるんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:657f870f6879aa72869c8bb4dc14577c4032cfbc950a131f49d5e44bae7381ce","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":20.54,"end":27.4,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-3","text":"ああ、そうだったね。で？","textVersion":"sha256:0515d1c5384850f18cc670f40f77679c82ca5e64352ebb52d537b95447ddf54b","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":27.92,"end":30.38,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-4","text":"小学三年生にインタビューして、データを取る予定なんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:2c51b870071807eb18fb0e5fbce99d688501d51fa2e913410b75b56939256dab","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":30.58,"end":34.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-5","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":35.12,"end":35.6,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-6","text":"それで、インタビューの仕方なんですが、小学生一人が初対面の私たち二人と話すんだと、たぶん緊張しちゃってなかなか話せないと思うんですね。それで、お父さんかお母さんにお願いして、一緒にいてもらったらどうかなって思うんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:c95f6c8effe307ea26677185d7873920edb6000be2e66435877529e015ad36ac","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":36.22,"end":54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-7","text":"でも僕は、親の前だと格好つけちゃって、なんかわざといいことだけ言ったりするんじゃないかと思うんです。緊張するかもしれないけど、一人のほうが正確なデータが取れるんじゃないかと思って、ちょっと意見が分かれて困ってるんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:8b0b0a642fc07498255e2f6d1568c44c18a2b4675e9ae3a91d10fa871dd96d83","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":53.94,"end":70.2,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-8","text":"あと、いつも一緒にいる小学校の先生から質問してもらうってのも考えたんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:cc38ac6b8608d3970b7b91f43b937f1ae761452ff23e70f26c23d7891ddfac78","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":70.96,"end":76.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-9","text":"うーん……うん、発想変えてみたらどうかなぁ。一人ずつインタビューしなくちゃいけないの？","textVersion":"sha256:b30b1796ef3bf8c24692dac4066cc2fc3d5276a8c3cca303548c8f2b16477d6f","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":77.5,"end":85.96,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-10","text":"いいえ、そんなことは。","textVersion":"sha256:635d2a12bc21fdb70678ddf654bc826a11e6614dcada7b5f5b3977187dc745ba","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":86.06,"end":87.72,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-11","text":"あ、そうか。友達同士何人かで話してもらうってのもありか。そのほうが率直な意見が聞けるんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:1aa0a8b4b2b5a06661de5916ba7a62ef27f16097d78634714e65007a361eedb3","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":87.94,"end":96.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-12","text":"ああ、一人に拘らなくてもいいのか。","textVersion":"sha256:1aa1176bbcad0b048973f451af91f11d9882bcf5a2a35bc67a36e2e5043c6f9a","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":97.36,"end":100.96,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-13","text":"じゃあ、その線で考えてみたら？","textVersion":"sha256:d9cfc8137e99545b2642ff67724f295feda4f61dd1397280f1c97dc5189a0bdc","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":101.74,"end":104.36,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-14","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":104.48,"end":105.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-15","text":"学生二人はどのように小学生から話を聞きますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d1f0c11705f9f38d6eb4d6690fa1419234f972e85ecab0d18f917bbe4ffc84de","audioVersion":"sha256:864b0e38f70fa40471f0771338b58931c2c48b14cd1dc65d46ec1546b05ca576","timelineVersion":"sha256:8335b594242415bc27b9bbd089b2fa4e485c25e67b36f50bdb1a2551cfef0b6d","start":110.68,"end":115.56,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"eabc5f6be1db8f50"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2011.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:question","text":"三番：テレビを見ながら、女の人と男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:8f5e12cfbe98a8542a5b2b2a3862dfa358cba4d32b9b90b87c53fc1604b1f927","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":3.98,"end":10.02,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-0","text":"では、この夏、お勧めの映画を紹介します。一番のお勧めは川田弘出演の最新作、『夏の空』です。これは高校のサッカー部に若い教師が入り、弱かったチームを県大会で優勝するまで導いた感動ストーリーです。恋愛映画では『ジュース』がお勧めです。ある湖で出会った二人が誤解と擦れ違いを繰り返しながら、やがて同じ道を歩んでゆく物語です。恐い映画が好きな方にお勧めなのは、『ふたつのカギ』という映画です。森の中の古い家で起こる恐怖の数々。見た後は、夜一人で過ごすのが恐くなってしまうかもしれません。楽しい映画が見たい方は、『タロウ』がお勧めです。仕事をやめてしまった若者と偶然出会った犬、タロウがお金を稼ごうと力をあわせて様々な仕事を始める話で、とにかく笑える映画です。","textVersion":"sha256:bf06e67b1315a224293f64bbe86942305add020e49f17bf1e7a53777ee198ee4","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":12.14,"end":77.6,"speaker":"テレビ"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-1","text":"明日、映画なに見ようか。恐い映画好きなんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:d939206e6f2b40900afb1971877941dbe6d558992cbdaf4ff2396dec7df32f43","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":79.2,"end":84.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-2","text":"え？そんなの見たら、夜恐くなっちゃうよ。それより笑えるのがいいんじゃない？犬、好きでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:5deafab94da0be927c7ded6e52840ffecc1daeafc65bcabbec029a7e860fa122","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":85.16,"end":92.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-3","text":"うーん、好きだけど、やっぱり川田弘が出てる話題作に引かれるよね。彼の作品に外れはないからね。","textVersion":"sha256:c4c74eb18ef816facae5f46d260a2cd67d3b57f8fdce6112348c7ee5c4797ec8","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":92.22,"end":100.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-4","text":"そうだね。スポーツものもいいね。それにしようか。さっそく時間調べよう。ええっと、あっ、まだ始まってないよ。来週からだ。","textVersion":"sha256:63d9c4e3ecffb32ff3fef055bf0c40da9dcd26c4f94ea56dbecc5aff21d4a541","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":100.92,"end":113.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-5","text":"え、そうなの？じゃ、それは来週見よう。","textVersion":"sha256:058e68648a4d329e9b84d1cd55a0b49270533ae9340e4be9d533becc4051468d","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":113.26,"end":117.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-6","text":"明日はやっぱり楽しいのにしない？","textVersion":"sha256:e3dbdbceedc1af5e5846fb94769d02c6ec24938b8b5ca6ebd3f184255e33e2fa","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":117.28,"end":119.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-7","text":"うん、そうしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:898e5e5b101b4989c746e5edeab94fc0d2dd043e98a1321ff79293c232907898","audioVersion":"sha256:ce8f31717b966a17a034276fff86bf0fbd17c8ebbf01b009796387a9a88ec901","timelineVersion":"sha256:e30651a78a195cd2b5b5651ec423b73506b1d39e64396a2a1b3264c2a3c43764","start":120.22,"end":121.74,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"eabc5f6be1db8f50"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0f162b23f19fde2c9fc8c2fd3b39608571b26712ef10793128ee883d3fe45522","timelineVersion":"sha256:36ebec1792bfe8675314a9a59060407a0cdc86ad9aaefafab981744ff93f7f9c","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2011.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1:question","text":"一番：電子辞書売り場で留学生と販売員が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:2c31a845d3af62faa758d3d5a3d86be807c8497fea7785a4cd92ae9ef38f995c","audioVersion":"sha256:0f162b23f19fde2c9fc8c2fd3b39608571b26712ef10793128ee883d3fe45522","timelineVersion":"sha256:36ebec1792bfe8675314a9a59060407a0cdc86ad9aaefafab981744ff93f7f9c","start":3.94,"end":10.31,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-0","text":"あのう、電子辞書を探してるんですけど。なるべく安いもので、日本語の勉強に使いたいと思って。","textVersion":"sha256:e737a381b65e605464ea7e18716e99895bc23e7e4f6375966158688114f2d34f","audioVersion":"sha256:0f162b23f19fde2c9fc8c2fd3b39608571b26712ef10793128ee883d3fe45522","timelineVersion":"sha256:36ebec1792bfe8675314a9a59060407a0cdc86ad9aaefafab981744ff93f7f9c","start":14.54,"end":23.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-1","text":"そうですか。えーと、それでは、こちらの一番の辞書がもっとも安い商品になっていますが。機能はあまり多くありません。こちらの二番は漢字辞典に漢字認識機能が付いてて、人気があります。","textVersion":"sha256:63016599dd9521705a85c808f7c69ccd955a3847b63b94ead29057ada9c07b55","audioVersion":"sha256:0f162b23f19fde2c9fc8c2fd3b39608571b26712ef10793128ee883d3fe45522","timelineVersion":"sha256:36ebec1792bfe8675314a9a59060407a0cdc86ad9aaefafab981744ff93f7f9c","start":23.18,"end":40.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-2","text":"漢字認識機能？","textVersion":"sha256:5027637014441ecae0d97cccfbb7f0657601d459bc5635c889a7989d065b2785","audioVersion":"sha256:0f162b23f19fde2c9fc8c2fd3b39608571b26712ef10793128ee883d3fe45522","timelineVersion":"sha256:36ebec1792bfe8675314a9a59060407a0cdc86ad9aaefafab981744ff93f7f9c","start":41.08,"end":42.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-3","text":"はい。大体の形しか覚えていない漢字でも簡単に調べることができるんです。3番も同じ機能が付いていて、後、カタカナ語辞典も充実しているタイプですね。後は少し高くなりますけど、この四番はさらに単語の発音も聞けるようになっていて、人気ありますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:03b148224364d05e86f8ebf96287049352aa3ea175c8885321072ce3b5ecaccb","audioVersion":"sha256:0f162b23f19fde2c9fc8c2fd3b39608571b26712ef10793128ee883d3fe45522","timelineVersion":"sha256:36ebec1792bfe8675314a9a59060407a0cdc86ad9aaefafab981744ff93f7f9c","start":42.96,"end":65.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-4","text":"うん。漢字認識機能はよさそうですよね。発音は聞けなくてもいいんですけど。カタカナ語辞典あったら便利ですね。じゃ、これにします。","textVersion":"sha256:6237411d10faa069058b63383249e497f1dd4a655e145434d149d1233cec453a","audioVersion":"sha256:0f162b23f19fde2c9fc8c2fd3b39608571b26712ef10793128ee883d3fe45522","timelineVersion":"sha256:36ebec1792bfe8675314a9a59060407a0cdc86ad9aaefafab981744ff93f7f9c","start":67.4,"end":79.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-5","text":"留学生はどの電子辞書を買うことにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:8b6bbd0f2565d43aa2931232fb90a7d4df684480c85d0e97f0f56186a5af80cb","audioVersion":"sha256:0f162b23f19fde2c9fc8c2fd3b39608571b26712ef10793128ee883d3fe45522","timelineVersion":"sha256:36ebec1792bfe8675314a9a59060407a0cdc86ad9aaefafab981744ff93f7f9c","start":87.5,"end":91.96,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"9d14d7920dddef5e"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2011.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:question","text":"二番：家族三人がペットについて話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:d89800c38dd3b2186d259249333b906900108f99ab4430f14399088de1033f43","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":4.04,"end":9.34,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-0","text":"ねえねえ、僕、犬飼いたいんだ。飼ってもいい？","textVersion":"sha256:ca4b22c357af6d3c932663ed7c1acd194371b6df0da60f036ad8ea486dfb9a42","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":11.12,"end":16.09,"speaker":"子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-1","text":"うん。犬か？","textVersion":"sha256:cdd0351e264be345b7d301dc2443807519bc4cc9f99134864a1d71cc5afaa642","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":16.26,"end":18.24,"speaker":"父"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-2","text":"だめだめ。犬って家族と一緒なのよ。一度飼ったら、途中でやめるわけにはいかないのよ。","textVersion":"sha256:555725a2f8ac5a30fc017ac7f925fba20c131c8c945a1daa004ed80a10f8fffd","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":18.18,"end":25.77,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-3","text":"僕がちゃんと世話するから。","textVersion":"sha256:adf8232043e29fbcbf6d855f3731b859225b13a9ead4236fcb468dc739a30b7f","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":26.1,"end":28.55,"speaker":"子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-4","text":"でもね。前ほしいほしいって言って飼った金魚だって、結局今誰が餌をあげてる？","textVersion":"sha256:99da96e526e7d338fe4ecb298810f4dd682880aa27f6682b5e91b154e93f7708","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":28.89,"end":36.47,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-5","text":"お母さん。だって、金魚って、一緒に遊べないから。今度こそちゃんと世話するから。お願い。","textVersion":"sha256:600780a6e0415163d4c27751f83494e2ae2209aca71f494d912a8f7f976fa970","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":37.57,"end":47.7,"speaker":"子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-6","text":"うん。まあ、お父さんは犬を飼うことには賛成だよ。遊び相手になってくれるだろうし。","textVersion":"sha256:fe888fb1b570ba4c18d6931cd4cdbacebc78ca9008e5ab1e0a83f32d4174b0c7","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":47.64,"end":55.54,"speaker":"父"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-7","text":"本当？","textVersion":"sha256:e0877e3fbafa10dd8b382fc0894170606cdb582ed51b20dbbfad80bef2bec20f","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":55.48,"end":56.3,"speaker":"子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-8","text":"うん。でも、一つ条件があるんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:1c5d26c5e884688cb14a4184a5c88adc87cf08bae882360853e4d84df0ba1051","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":57.26,"end":59.92,"speaker":"父"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-9","text":"条件？","textVersion":"sha256:cdbd46c1fdbffccafacd31871210b4ed45084045c219237be5aa804758828d05","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":60.6,"end":61.44,"speaker":"子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-10","text":"うん。まず、金魚の世話をちゃんとすること。それができたら飼ってもいいよ。金魚の世話ができないのに、犬の世話ができるはずないからな。","textVersion":"sha256:2000e5582385ca3caec41a50e13b99931049d1e2a5b41df1b17f3c148d412c44","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":61.38,"end":73.08,"speaker":"父"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-11","text":"分かった。僕、頑張って世話するよ。それから。お母さんもいいでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:62eb67d48a7cf39f9c93293db2f4bf78b370298f8f900ec7f7aa2b1df54d36c2","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":73.72,"end":79.93,"speaker":"子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-12","text":"そうね。しょうがないわね。","textVersion":"sha256:60a70457b0b681b96eeaac3ee87fb500db5bb799e4a08cf6ba90e0ca9d9b5f87","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":80.42,"end":83.14,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-13","text":"両親はどうすることに決めましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:bb1b94231d8cbb8277b32f0c4f17fc23951be5d816f2b2f0ce316be698daca83","audioVersion":"sha256:a2ea0d6abafc57900c5409b9d9ecf05e4a75bdc0199a2a8892a65bcb78342cf0","timelineVersion":"sha256:360d3237e9f5fa6748cccd0ad11c5d8744804c2f9e8315e3ab392b541cd4733e","start":88.84,"end":91.78,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"9d14d7920dddef5e"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2011.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3:question","text":"三番：ラジオでプレゼントするCDの紹介をしています。","textVersion":"sha256:70109c47ffddd7b96315ab6fe8eb291090c0719deb7cb83841e42bd483de8b90","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","start":3.64,"end":9.16,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-0","text":"ええ、では、番組からの今日のプレゼントです。今日はCDを四枚ご用意しました。それぞれ一枚、四名の方にプレゼントします。今からご紹介しますので、ぜひご応募くださいね。ええ、一番目はクラシックの曲をピアノで演奏したものです。静かな曲が多いので、私は夜寝る前によく聞いてるんですよ。次、二番目は、世界の民族音楽をその地域の太鼓で力強く演奏したもので、聴いていると力が湧いてきます。三番目は年代別に流行った歌を集めたCDで聴いていると、その時代を思い出しますね。そして、最後、四番目は、私が最近出したCDです。最近、子供が生まれたので、子供に歌って聞かせたい曲ばかりを集めて作ってみました。","textVersion":"sha256:e06e9fd32e89933155a7e4e089d671f8cde96ba1352ef6ca234241f9efb1b950","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","start":11.32,"end":70.48,"speaker":"アナウンス"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-1","text":"へえ、この人って、歌も歌うんだね。知らなかった。","textVersion":"sha256:467265520f5f238c0fa1d4f2f35a36dfa98436032034aa421dd540aad265a647","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","start":72.12,"end":76.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-2","text":"本当だね。私。応募してみようかな。","textVersion":"sha256:2c3dd0c97d154ade9280817b0cc0ae67e9f7bbcc3aaa56e337ee14d118107437","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","start":76.92,"end":81,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-3","text":"えっ、この人の歌、聞いてみたいの？","textVersion":"sha256:0a7d2080700561addb8bd15018c4fb63613781557e0b6cde36b15dcd59877be1","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","start":80.94,"end":83.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-4","text":"そうじゃなくて、私、最近夜、眠れないのよ。だから、この人も寝る前に聞いてるって言ってたし。","textVersion":"sha256:1c724e6f3c840d09748a593d1c8739cfff28b3c734f65c9799d4d9b71cdb7ca3","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","start":83.64,"end":92.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-5","text":"ああ、そっちね。じゃ、僕も応募しようかな。カラオケでよく上司が歌ってる昔の歌っていい曲が多いんだよね。CDももらえるんだったら、聞いてみたいな。","textVersion":"sha256:c47b9b11370924eecbaf282cfe01e81e2562f638074bf068405ad2a0c3ee1000","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","start":92.36,"end":104.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-6","text":"そうなんだ。太鼓習ってるから、そっちにすると思った。","textVersion":"sha256:4c330bba3ba824807009444431ab7d70765c27871bdd82b148281aedaac51f39","audioVersion":"sha256:67feb58269a22dc1043bba22745907b6735b215cb0022a653b35d702272c2e06","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed792ddaad6cdb8dc30150afc66c07945ded003937e5beaac7222ccaead537ca","start":104.8,"end":109.44,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9d14d7920dddef5e"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2012.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:question","text":"一番：男の人と女の人がレストランについて話しています。二人はどの店を選びますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e017e0044034f5901a6f0fa8bb69fa0625c64188c964773f9658763c40c52514","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":3.48,"end":9.68,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0","text":"山本さんの結婚お祝い会をするお店なんだけど、どんなところがいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:1a6f50ed3a1a3932dc957acd879b57d61d825a587e5a1bf158e4b68b8a3f6c96","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":11.34,"end":16.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-1","text":"そうね。参加者は全部で30人で、予算は一人5000円ぐらいまでかな。落ち着いて話ができるところがいいね。","textVersion":"sha256:10349d52cce56e922776273eac6ba9671b4e4b2f8062c45f462496b0864f16de","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":16.4,"end":26.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-2","text":"そうだな。レストランミラノは？","textVersion":"sha256:7bab63450214190f8038068f791c6e93919785876af56a72239d2707f041586f","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":27.16,"end":30.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-3","text":"ミラノだったら、予算内でおいしいイタリア料理が食べられるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:2af359f83421d85b6639cc3e89573c4038e4ec47a513a46f3b39cec84baeb395","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":30.98,"end":35.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-4","text":"あ、でも、スペースが厳しいかも。そんなに入らないな。","textVersion":"sha256:d760237f5cdd65e65676aa5c86c048e22ac85af3c2be3856ba21463fd893e407","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":36.48,"end":40.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-5","text":"そう。それじゃあね。","textVersion":"sha256:de8f6040549572b99eddacf5d2c37afadf5ff8d769161891a67b69d33f265fb7","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":42.02,"end":43.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-6","text":"うーん。それから、金沢っていう日本料理屋もいいよ。古い家が店になってて、広い庭もあるし、落ち着いた感じだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:60f0dc86fb2d2f559891d432e9370312833b1c1847f590f1524fafa2230430c1","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":44.3,"end":55.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-7","text":"よさそうね。でも、予算、大丈夫？","textVersion":"sha256:fe04a0c3d01a6d3a21ef9d9f47d5228585efad006f176e240d374ee87de16e6a","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":55.72,"end":59.78,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-8","text":"ああ、5000円じゃきかないね。それだったら、桜ホテルのレストランはどうかな。ホテルの中庭にあって、雰囲気がいいよ。あそこなら入れそうだし。","textVersion":"sha256:af83e21526bf7ecdb09fd2e22a52786d814b7f5d7655644c715599fe42421db2","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":61.24,"end":74.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-9","text":"ホテルなら集まりやすいしね。","textVersion":"sha256:9b1f2c11f6dad61ff952e130ca93db7b195e4a553d747bf1ded658f630f7d390","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":74.06,"end":76.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-10","text":"うん、そうそう。船でパーティーができるところもあるよ。ミライ丸っていう船。料理はバイキング形式で、フランス料理から和食まで何でもあるけど。","textVersion":"sha256:a013f116b62936682d949843ddda45288291c1b4393ed8e7d03e382e30ba1481","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":76.56,"end":88.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-11","text":"立食スタイルだから、座って話せないね。やっぱり結婚のお祝いだから、ゆっくり話せるところがいいねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:f8291f94a7c17432f5e1b093380fab9cf2bcd14cebabff37f134645c9c11fb77","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":89.22,"end":98.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-12","text":"二人はどの店を選びますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5b664781e4451a138bab4da710aa4fe7ad2d1b6c2f884669e9396c6b950a7236","audioVersion":"sha256:70ef3a0c322eacb98d060d2576e7cb107303d6e0529a5c63797b982cbcdd378f","timelineVersion":"sha256:30e56f02a7b27890cc2ac81b6e7a0ffac4c99fd416bfd6dcf1fc9b7d5f8073fe","start":103.44,"end":106.14,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"4d341cd1341cc20c"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2012.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:question","text":"二番：母親と姉と弟が語学留学について話しています。弟は何週間のコースに申し込みますか。","textVersion":"sha256:035e81f3a7300e3dc0b46b5e24e0dd5c6a36939801b2b052177fa301e783ea8b","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":3.58,"end":10.66,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0","text":"お母さん、夏休みの語学留学のことだけど、大学で、パンフレットもらってきたんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:803b32cedfc8fb457048f0094bf27dde3fd8d29dd405ac58d45747208f0afe2a","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":12.3,"end":18.88,"speaker":"弟"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-1","text":"あら、そう。","textVersion":"sha256:53fb21673cb863bd691c8bb55638a91e8fd025fabd1ed3280a50318af13bce41","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":18.82,"end":20.26,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-2","text":"うん。この学校、去年お姉ちゃんが行ったとこだよね。ね、どうだった？","textVersion":"sha256:e3c0a0b24a57103c98b1de4818f952ad0e2cd99378abfaf6ab789c76326ee8e0","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":20.2,"end":27.2,"speaker":"弟"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-3","text":"うん、よかったよ。会話の実践クラスが充実してるんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:9070abe68e5779261c3d83e14d1b3280a69e01c7660cd6e74613f66558953f77","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":27.54,"end":32.36,"speaker":"姉"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-4","text":"うん、ぼくもそれがいいなと思って。","textVersion":"sha256:6236835973e4513994dad5cdaea5f91af3a8da2cea06a724a90271b7041a78eb","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":33.2,"end":35.42,"speaker":"弟"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-5","text":"いいんじゃない？期間はどのぐらいなの？","textVersion":"sha256:ebd95ec86de6ec0d881f60be3b70f0040d53bd1f8d8290438864fa0b236add40","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":35.36,"end":38.84,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-6","text":"いろいろあって、2週間と3週間と4週間。あと、一番長いのが6週間っていうコース。でも、夏休みはサークルとかアルバイトとかほかにもいろいろあるし。2週間か3週間にしようと思って。","textVersion":"sha256:401b1bf4a6e7970888d078b2327251ebd7959e4fe5b002204d4aed2d84816a6f","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":38.78,"end":56.42,"speaker":"弟"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-7","text":"それじゃ短いんじゃない？せっかく行くんだから、もっと長いのにしたら？","textVersion":"sha256:9634f8ea75ada6af9e50c7275e7c7c06c47b665c096b825f228be485e35ebc33","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":56.36,"end":62.16,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-8","text":"うーん。確かに、2週間じゃちょっと物足りないかもしれないから、3週間にしようかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:05404d743cfcff743a6d23345d81598379186a13ad74fffb7b0415293e86f908","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":62.66,"end":69.92,"speaker":"弟"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-9","text":"私も3週間だったけど、すごくあっという間だったよ。慣れてきたなと思った頃に、帰らなきゃいけなくなって。もっと長いのにすればよかったと思った。4週間にしたら？","textVersion":"sha256:c3456a719e60ef277047a6354fb5ddb11b402b9ad8cf1afdec7bbb3111281211","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":70.28,"end":83.24,"speaker":"姉"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-10","text":"ええ？そういうもんか。","textVersion":"sha256:d14d88abc486e72e1757112df96981385d9b47cb13bec9ee44512e180e7752db","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":84.26,"end":85.96,"speaker":"弟"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-11","text":"ちゃんと勉強したいんだったら、6週間でも短いくらいでしょう。一番長いのにしたら？","textVersion":"sha256:5e38d14f1da04e1f310102d84452d6093fd2a2b3294f17c28aec6b5882a6a91e","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":86.22,"end":92.74,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-12","text":"勉強する気はあるけど、いろいろ忙しいんだよ。6週間もいたら、後期の授業も始まっちゃうし。じゃあ、経験者のお勧めに従うとしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:7d3b7a54851ca637c608448413643f9e2673e9bf18ca2d3b5c1aad7201c64cd9","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":93.34,"end":105.54,"speaker":"弟"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-13","text":"弟は何週間のコースに申し込みますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7fc11643057cb1a4bf7ea3df85f667818c9614137577dcccdb1beb1b108c0527","audioVersion":"sha256:c8950cdb9eaaa949a4727c766a0d58a04083ac3620ba653c1e76a9d12999333f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c308a2ff9a29da4e03b04321a80674b79ef19e86792275a29e9a6e68fdf3c8a1","start":111.26,"end":114.98,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"4d341cd1341cc20c"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2012.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3:question","text":"三番：新聞社で部長が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:bb772e65e46f69c0838bfa07cf6f57a85e44737ccc9777e65597b91210e5fe5d","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","start":3.86,"end":8.66,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-0","text":"来週の自動車ショーなんだけど、特別な記事を組みたいから、二人で行ってきてくれる？イベントは四日間で、ええと、木曜日は招待者と報道関係者のみに公開。この日は、実際に開発を担当した人の話も聞けるらしい。で、開会式は金曜日。大臣がテープカットに来るらしいよ。一般公開が始まるのはこの日から。土曜日には、人気俳優の山田一郎が来て、講演をするんだ。この人車好きで知られてるよなあ。で、最終日の日曜日は抽選会、いま話題の電気自動車が当たるみたいだよ。これは人が集まりそうだなあ。ほかにも取材があって、大変だと思うけど、二人で分担して、よろしく。","textVersion":"sha256:be475339c5820158bf8b799cf6754c99b3370068e74843daa3e8234545dbd998","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","start":10.4,"end":62.82,"speaker":"部長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-1","text":"僕は去年から特集記事で車と環境の問題を扱ってるから、最新の動きを取材してくるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:99d479d43e4b41776b7dbcc4829535226dae45acd472c710e49fb2901d87a5d3","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","start":64.54,"end":71.14,"speaker":"男の記者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-2","text":"あっ、そう？じゃあ、専門的な記事は任せることにして、私は一般の人の反応を見てくる。","textVersion":"sha256:d087e17e71f3e2639e4482e38082b2479aa57697cc849c3679e6c727287a2381","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","start":71.08,"end":79.14,"speaker":"女の記者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-3","text":"抽選会の日は人がいっぱい来るだろうから、インタビューたくさん取れるんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:221d42c2c06f6cd89b7734de36709e6b91659e1cfbd757baeb524f6052be3e8e","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","start":79.08,"end":84.02,"speaker":"男の記者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-4","text":"そうね。そうする。","textVersion":"sha256:f79c661c19d2e9a863e966fcb49b04379499f3b25b174033ada708e4afbdcb21","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","start":84.22,"end":85.94,"speaker":"女の記者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-5","text":"ぼくはゆっくり取材したいから、一般の人がいない日に行ってくるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a60403db20b29ff9f6643897073480dea120331c89c53a3eb673a1d972e44a82","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","start":86.1,"end":90.54,"speaker":"男の記者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-6","text":"じゃあ、そういうことで。","textVersion":"sha256:f8405689c89483e2374ace4221aad6a12ff0f1c80feb4d7cdfe27089412a76e6","audioVersion":"sha256:0eca3766985a65b9ac8531f574ced7dfbe161c8dc1fc52791c8f3fa66ea31798","timelineVersion":"sha256:1b593e95e3b33c4fa04e92a0ce2ced201a6ea61407b5201eac0f48072d50862f","start":90.76,"end":92.54,"speaker":"女の記者"}],"batchVersion":"4d341cd1341cc20c"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2012.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:question","text":"一番：留学生が授業について先生に相談しています。学生はどの授業を取りますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1e65a4b5a11432a63c5f5e6cfc5f45486df8c44d30127aaaf2cfa6f1d310cef8","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":3.9,"end":9.58,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-0","text":"先生、日本の文化や社会の授業を一つ取らなくちゃいけないんですが、よくわからなくて、ただ、あのう、日本語を読むのが苦手で、読んだり書いたりが多い授業が、ちょっと…、あ、それから、木曜日は他の授業がたくさんあって、ダメなんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:34fc9ed08965dc49b49ecda0335073a97043722f6be42c675df2ae38cf33fc90","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":12.26,"end":30.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-1","text":"ええと、まず文学、月曜ですね。うーん、毎回、小説とか作品を読んでくるのが宿題ですねえ。それから、火曜日に音楽、日本の楽器を教わる授業で、人気ありますよ。あ、これは希望者が多くて、もう締め切ったって言ってた。","textVersion":"sha256:6c92f32f636ea7736a87ddc8ca6d42309d47f4a44b6d9d4cd0c66aef465765ba","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":31.08,"end":55.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-2","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":56.44,"end":57.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-3","text":"それから、教育、水曜ですね。小学校の見学をしたりします。あと、自分の国の教育についても発表します。","textVersion":"sha256:0d49ed388f31346908bcebeac862fcd6d6b12d40c69933f808e9d0360dac0d1e","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":57.88,"end":67.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-4","text":"レポートですか。","textVersion":"sha256:a0cd2c89bb5a0a9138a8549154ea6b149aacd63eb26f983eba97232584495098","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":67.62,"end":68.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-5","text":"ううん、発表、一回だけですよ。あと、経営、工場見学に何回か行きますよ。ああ、これは木曜日ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:d12ec60e4c370d663569a4a9b03210222edd125915ef938220f75f9e674ed6f7","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":68.94,"end":80.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-6","text":"じゃあ、さっきのにします。","textVersion":"sha256:2ec238aac85b606c19c05d064ea6701aadec62fd0c0184d97f54fb66e18384ed","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":82.37,"end":84.49,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-7","text":"学生はどの授業を取りますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e5cfce8d6a405ab25d2e079dc9210a322b4c4d116bdd4b3f3254ffc9497d0407","audioVersion":"sha256:3b5f917a6f7ad34234e6ec797d6f5c850f4878fdc4e242344b60653e3d35ba51","timelineVersion":"sha256:76702ee0fc30074360f7a43edb83c0e978bbbda8d3694586d8191fa8b1787491","start":85.24,"end":89.04,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"fa65ea2ebd46dbe6"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2012.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:question","text":"二番：大学で、男の学生二人と女の学生が話しています。このサークルは大学祭で何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:0dcd85d5aaf5d215380732c7219a5018c6593a30395fb5bfc40e927c84dadf59","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":4.12,"end":10.96,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-0","text":"今年もうちのサークル、大学祭に参加するんだよね。準備、どうなってる？","textVersion":"sha256:49f6c6640261650ce2240e8020b64bb7fa2f65877e6a601c6aeb3c068699b15f","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":12.68,"end":18.08,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-1","text":"ああ、先輩、実は、意見がわかれてしまってるんですよ。うちって、日本文学サークルじゃないですか。私は研究発表がいいと思うんです。研究をまとめて紙に書いて発表するっていう。","textVersion":"sha256:288aed7f475fa1ed9a553e54e477ec2d1b28a03a2c988c302d74c4ba970ea9c7","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":18.6,"end":32.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-2","text":"僕は発表って人が集まらないと思うんですよ。せっかく紙に書いても、あまり読んでもらえないだろうし。","textVersion":"sha256:c5756ed2c24077dfa6ecd77cb15909785577d8096975866c2b600df7bc864dc7","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":33,"end":39.72,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-3","text":"じゃあ、映像使ったら？","textVersion":"sha256:a3c511ca806019670fe5cb5d2d43828dc7b7698c1c96906ed04027a68df125b1","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":40.52,"end":42.16,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-4","text":"映像ですか。確かに、見る人の興味を引くかもしれませんけど、編集が間に合うかどうか……僕は、それより、古本のバザーとかしたほうが人が集まるんじゃないかと思うんです。うちにある読まない本を集めて。","textVersion":"sha256:f97cfb26a1de05b06509a9342c09dc47dbae9ce35cfede6147716e15cd869bff","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":42.38,"end":56.66,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-5","text":"でも、そんなに本集まらないと思うんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:452eb8ccc9a868402cf6e49072f490f69ada6718b981194cb2680dabdeb0f9c3","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":57.46,"end":60.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-6","text":"うーん、そうだね。数が必要だからね。","textVersion":"sha256:5f51e1950607cf81f0f62160ea3e616bd38458d0e2d74082d13eeb7c24c641b2","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":60.5,"end":64.78,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-7","text":"ああ、じゃあ、日本文学カフェっていうのはどうでしょうか。有名な作家に似た格好をして、文学に出てくる食べ物を出す店。","textVersion":"sha256:78eff207852d20cdc46c5d5663dd4a292ddf14ea8be8f41bac6b6cba17113ac4","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":66.22,"end":73.78,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-8","text":"ああ、作家の格好は恥ずかしいけど、その時代の事とか、わかってもらえそうだね。でも、もっとサークルの研究テーマも紹介したいなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:a296168863199b754250a240e988c858a2b5ed2a0c7bcb536c55b5b0d316c9a6","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":74.72,"end":84.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-9","text":"なるほど。じゃあ、文学について紹介する時間を作ったらいいんじゃないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:b7af1c09ea414bf2140d3b22837cc0c25f75f215f5d1e49813fef54b014201e9","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":84.92,"end":90.4,"speaker":"男1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-10","text":"それ、いいですね。甘い物でも食べながら。","textVersion":"sha256:3da4a879e64fa1d8ff6d2d20d47be11d6da7682c178f8a75d00728ecfdaa24af","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":90.64,"end":94.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-11","text":"じゃあ、その線で。","textVersion":"sha256:b92ca74b815817854ce869a72a65d703005adf588256937ab7dcd49e5a2f7e2e","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":94.06,"end":95.62,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-12","text":"このサークルは大学祭で何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:24fc3e2432d756e03382dc58a753b218f3655ec947e973ae7eb099f330119ced","audioVersion":"sha256:56a0c43e84ecc149cf102f57b2d1eed075da1ff76b0269dbf75f49037ed69038","timelineVersion":"sha256:e02b5ab77b85cec97ed85004b66c12f3f71e906431fea43b08ed28dacc22628c","start":101.22,"end":105.64,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"fa65ea2ebd46dbe6"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4a398080e19d12322007acaa5b2a61f0dc8deb16d2e72325d3b078f99ef0e49b","timelineVersion":"sha256:35ed999d58c4bf002aa73392cd1a0ab40368f67d1a96d3a5a8883ec78fe579ff","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2012.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3:question","text":"三番：二人の女の人がラジオを聞いています。","textVersion":"sha256:3f7d62289469424956c55970d0cb6794ecbe53549412513b11da9f23b4f85190","audioVersion":"sha256:4a398080e19d12322007acaa5b2a61f0dc8deb16d2e72325d3b078f99ef0e49b","timelineVersion":"sha256:35ed999d58c4bf002aa73392cd1a0ab40368f67d1a96d3a5a8883ec78fe579ff","start":3.84,"end":8.92,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-0","text":"今日のあなたの色の時間です。色は人間に対して不思議な力を持っています。その日の調子や相手に与えたい印象を考えて、洋服の色を選び、あなたの運をよくしましょう。青というのは気持ちを落ち着かせる色です。落ち着かない時、よく眠れない時には、青い色がおすすめです。赤は元気になる色です。元気がない時には、赤い服を着てみてください。ピンクは優しい気持ちになります。優しく見せたい時も、ピンク色がおすすめです。そして、オレンジ、オレンジ色は楽しい気持ちにさせてくれます。寂しい気分の時には、オレンジ色の服を着るといいでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:3c5fee4f7a067956c9910408e263303207778102f6027772c00f2fa7b69c4e02","audioVersion":"sha256:4a398080e19d12322007acaa5b2a61f0dc8deb16d2e72325d3b078f99ef0e49b","timelineVersion":"sha256:35ed999d58c4bf002aa73392cd1a0ab40368f67d1a96d3a5a8883ec78fe579ff","start":10.54,"end":65.6,"speaker":"ラジオ"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-1","text":"へえ、オレンジ色は、楽しい気分になるんだ。あっ、そう言えば、明日デートだったよね。赤い服にして、積極的な印象を与えれば？","textVersion":"sha256:eb73e04f591b76beeede904865cff506105d4680b30c304daa89983ab3f089b9","audioVersion":"sha256:4a398080e19d12322007acaa5b2a61f0dc8deb16d2e72325d3b078f99ef0e49b","timelineVersion":"sha256:35ed999d58c4bf002aa73392cd1a0ab40368f67d1a96d3a5a8883ec78fe579ff","start":67.6,"end":79.86,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-2","text":"へえ、それより、やっぱり優しさを強調したいよねえ。","textVersion":"sha256:1627bf8a07addd15e56923753f3643939724eb6ab7eaeb51d101eb22769bba77","audioVersion":"sha256:4a398080e19d12322007acaa5b2a61f0dc8deb16d2e72325d3b078f99ef0e49b","timelineVersion":"sha256:35ed999d58c4bf002aa73392cd1a0ab40368f67d1a96d3a5a8883ec78fe579ff","start":79.8,"end":84.48,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-3","text":"あ、そうか。でも、何でもいいけど。まずは落ち着かなくちゃ。今日の夜はよく寝たほうがいいんじゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:7181130dcc3226b7235b1e6edd8564997b60032f1f0607232ded33532b7abf55","audioVersion":"sha256:4a398080e19d12322007acaa5b2a61f0dc8deb16d2e72325d3b078f99ef0e49b","timelineVersion":"sha256:35ed999d58c4bf002aa73392cd1a0ab40368f67d1a96d3a5a8883ec78fe579ff","start":84.7,"end":93.68,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-4","text":"うん、確かにね。（※よく眠れるよう青い物を着て寝る）","textVersion":"sha256:8439407ce7037e2e477638cf9bb96af5b07fb86dcf97b26806742d82e65a5d94","audioVersion":"sha256:4a398080e19d12322007acaa5b2a61f0dc8deb16d2e72325d3b078f99ef0e49b","timelineVersion":"sha256:35ed999d58c4bf002aa73392cd1a0ab40368f67d1a96d3a5a8883ec78fe579ff","start":94.24,"end":96.26,"speaker":"女2"}],"batchVersion":"fa65ea2ebd46dbe6"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2013.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:question","text":"一番：デパートで店員と客が話しています。客はどのかばんを買いますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f67005be4974c62fefb471bd4ea16404d299d0b65379428cef56889eee850207","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":3.76,"end":8.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0","text":"いらっしゃいませ。","textVersion":"sha256:6001f93c73acdb7864bc88f25a50040e53b3e0bb4ac010d7efbe4c363aebeeeb","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":12.38,"end":13.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-1","text":"あのう、通勤で使えるかばんをさがしてるんですけど。パソコンが入れられて、背負えるタイプで、ふだん荷物が多いんで、軽いものがいいかな。それから、携帯とか財布などの小物を入れるポケットが二つはついてるのがいいんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:2d1b256391fecb231e3acb7bd8afcc7cf4e69ec649a1466bdba1dc63b34ebf84","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":13.3,"end":29.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-2","text":"うーん。そうですね。パソコンが入れられるタイプでしたら、こちらのシリーズの四つのモデルはすべてパソコンが入るサイズで、背負うことができて通勤にも便利です。へー、このモデル１はパソコンを収納する部分が頑丈に作られています。外側には、ポケットがたくさんついてるので、いろいろなものを整理できますし、それほど重くありません。","textVersion":"sha256:723f2c2388e2c4b80ede8a210798c250b7cb06e29643908fe9b918e9e2dff17c","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":29.78,"end":56.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-3","text":"うーん。","textVersion":"sha256:23b85579b278ca2b1bbe8ce4830f38cc16cb8016bbc4a1f1406b3b31a7602f6e","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":56.7,"end":57.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-4","text":"軽い素材が使われているのがこちらのモデル２です。外側に小物を整理するポケットが二つついています。","textVersion":"sha256:8061623edf66e48ecba3ecad5e49c0520d38f00ea97bf18b814ba5c82de97821","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":57.96,"end":66.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-5","text":"へー。","textVersion":"sha256:043e96d54aa9a3279d4bff4ab0e31e88750d2fc8432ed73a39c3e33b12db5385","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":67,"end":67.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-6","text":"それから、このモデル３も軽くて背負いやすいです。ショックを吸収する素材が使われているので、パソコンを入れても安心です。内側はポケットのないシンプルなデザインで、外側に大きめのポケットが一つついていて、携帯や財布が取り出しやすくなっています。あと、こちらのモデル４は、ベルトをつければ、ショルダーバッグにもなります。素材が皮なので、ちょっと重いんですが、内側に携帯と財布それぞれの専用ポケットがついてます。","textVersion":"sha256:5a12190aeeaa932f2c03c25b98af30c4a75da922f4dd372685d4fedae83058c2","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":68.08,"end":101.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-7","text":"うーん。ポケットは一つじゃ足りないし、多すぎても、どこに何を入れたか分からなくなるからなあ。それに、やっぱり軽いほうが通勤には便利かな。じゃ、これにします。","textVersion":"sha256:a17a01be1449a6ef1511a4cee917e306ccc12eea9fca31387797663b9104ba3a","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":102.56,"end":115,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-8","text":"客はどのかばんを買いますか。","textVersion":"sha256:52b6e87835e1cc7c9b5f56919aa7d45f8287380a1f33fa7fdbf940ec4090005c","audioVersion":"sha256:7a51887061eeb953d3cc91478695e5b3f63c2f3339ae736b566b7a5e51c214c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1ff97f73b576efd405885aa563a5a6748fa33e7b0a9005d5964115e686018ed","start":122.4,"end":125.42,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"1922faa450cb7c7d"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2013.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:question","text":"二番：会社で、女の課長と若い社員二人が、食事について話しています。三人はどの店に行くことにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:de1177c7f31617694a14c5ef359bd2c254853f7d91e50925ce86355c69ae1fcf","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":3.56,"end":11.36,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-0","text":"もう、9時ね。遅くなっちゃったから、帰りに食事して行かない？","textVersion":"sha256:5efa7c8142172c4642a0d0bf8afbf711f54152ee6a551577ee40b4be76b0557d","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":13.16,"end":18.08,"speaker":"女の課長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-1","text":"いいですね、お腹がペコペコですよ。この間、中華のおいしい店を見つけたんですけど、どうですか？","textVersion":"sha256:5208d56f069a8d389e10db72301ad87ad8bdf25cc30750ee258dd7e42e0c7404","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":18.02,"end":25.24,"speaker":"男の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-2","text":"それ、先週、一緒に行ったところ？確かにおいしいけど、あそこ、この時間は結構込むよ。会社の隣のパスタの店なら、すぐ入れると思いますけど。値段も手頃だし。","textVersion":"sha256:00a75e6d9e6f008bff8fc9c3c66cfd13e6f6ca7b6aa777155c596f145e912c93","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":25.74,"end":39.68,"speaker":"女の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-3","text":"あ、ごめんなさい、パスタは私、今日お昼に食べちゃったの。","textVersion":"sha256:54c5accca86938274a97ae29a4bc3a15122042689e6d0aa2931545fdf93c9420","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":40.04,"end":44.2,"speaker":"女の課長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-4","text":"そうですか、それなら、会社の向かいの和食の店はどうですか。雰囲気もいいし、料理の種類も多いし。","textVersion":"sha256:f23d6c6d0bd14333412c09a7bd4ecde5de9cda81de9100df11ad412844a6ba2f","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":44.6,"end":53.26,"speaker":"女の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-5","text":"あそこ、ちょっと高級なんだよね。給料日前だし、きついな、駅の近くの焼肉の店はどうですか？二時間で肉食べ放題なんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e5260ae473e21261d7f6e91ba7a5fe15eb42abac59b7ddd82e0ea336d2fc6b7b","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":53.2,"end":63.72,"speaker":"男の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-6","text":"こんな時間に重いものは食べたくないな。野菜や魚のほうが胃にやさしいと思うけど。","textVersion":"sha256:28c55a7ff59323e45cfb3951c3cfae41d22fd2508f9b16286f0b2565f445f7d2","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":64.14,"end":70.72,"speaker":"女の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-7","text":"そうね、時間も遅いしね。うーん、メニューがいろいろあるところなら、好きなものを選べるんじゃない？二人とも頑張ってくれたし、今日は私がおごるから。","textVersion":"sha256:2e17e7b4251491581bfe8583503e1661a6fe0dfd345061d2970a705be5e9594c","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":70.94,"end":83.06,"speaker":"女の課長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-8","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":83.76,"end":84.54,"speaker":"男の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-9","text":"三人はどの店に行くことにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:31c2e54dd78a72c4c1d74108cbef6d1e8243702afb89007e2b40ea6a2d87d2ad","audioVersion":"sha256:5903ea2aec28a2fe3f90a8d68ebfcbce85fbf283a99596145cf7ebcbfc6bf705","timelineVersion":"sha256:d24e9a2400c7c674a63430c36b6afc3ce51659a0f190ded123df9f87f471f500","start":90.12,"end":94.16,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"1922faa450cb7c7d"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2013.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:question","text":"三番：農業のイベント会場で、アナウンスを聞いたあと、男の人と女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:91e5f1ac0169ca293c8de916093d02fe6d457b42aa8a26cc68f555e294c46137","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":3.54,"end":12.58,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-0","text":"本日はご来場いただき、ありがとうございます。会場についてご案内いたします。第1会場では、地元でとれた新鮮な野菜の試食と販売を行っております。季節の果物も豊富に揃えております。第2会場では、地元の野菜や肉などを使ったお料理を、会場のお席に座ってお召し上がりいただけます。ただし、毎年人気の野菜天ぷらは残り僅かとなっておりますので、お早めにお越しください。第3会場では、農業について知識を深める、様々なクイズやゲームをお楽しみいただけます。本日は、お米一年分などがあたる巨大なかぼちゃの重さを当てるクイズも用意されています。第4会場では、可愛らしい動物たちがお客様をお待ちしております。馬に乗ったり、山羊や兎に餌をやったり、動物との触合いをお楽しみください。なお、本日は4時に終了の予定です。終了まで、どうぞ楽しいひとときをお過ごしください。","textVersion":"sha256:04f2e101e0a155b1c5f9c863a414c9250c1eb7c06b5861edb300a0166c8803a0","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":18.5,"end":89.9,"speaker":"アナウンス"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-1","text":"終わりまであと1時間か。うーん、ずいぶん混んでるし、あんまり時間もないから、会場一つしか見られないね。どこがいい？","textVersion":"sha256:dd763f932111e46c8ada148cb474bf85b0b0e77c19a2d392f28c7fa356f43c7b","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":91.8,"end":101.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-2","text":"そうね、私は、いろいろな野菜が食べてみたいな。","textVersion":"sha256:5f33c6a78a9d7ffe0269aea290e06497aafdf4c21241e9316b71b629aa36c2d1","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":101.68,"end":106.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-3","text":"え？さっき昼ごはん食べたばかりなのに、それに、人気あるって言ってたから、きっと行列が出来ているよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d5ba14e515888ea53e55f82675c37becd9478558dd006c0af5b94b4f175b6e04","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":106.64,"end":113.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-4","text":"ううん。そうじゃなくて、今日の夕食の材料が見たいの。とれたばかりのって、なかなか買えないじゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:997f603e60f6c371cf32866d0d8830a08b5e35b3dc3cd1d84ac4b588c468e192","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":113.22,"end":121.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-5","text":"ああ、そっちなんだ。じゃ、別々に見ようか。僕はせっかくだから、勉強していきたいし、何かいいものが当たるかもしれないから。","textVersion":"sha256:9e1b4cf004496ab64dc26987bb38e1460c2a7197cb6c7467678ff00d35c5d278","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":122.6,"end":131.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-6","text":"うん、じゃ、そうしよう、動物はいいの？好きでしょう？","textVersion":"sha256:e7552ed650dcec555e06790090dcec256d6044eae61f7bd8099b64d39af9b2de","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":132,"end":136.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-7","text":"動物も見たいけど、時間ないから、次の時でいいよ。","textVersion":"sha256:54649f65a89cc236f88e0998e331c42ec6c68d044dee1e1e3c48a4bceca0f1d5","audioVersion":"sha256:0017c85d5a8325d0aa1263116dd30e176fcae7496bc1cbca511d9b596ed84062","timelineVersion":"sha256:29eff9370b153a91fb70d2c121636d5b72aa298855f1200fe4d0eb1ee5155c25","start":136.52,"end":140.72,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"1922faa450cb7c7d"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2013.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:question","text":"一番：大学で、女の学生と男の学生が話しています。女の学生は最初にどこで本を探しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:fbf146d2d604dab60962fcd3886b05afaebc4fe1ffe6b711993d77929f1f2138","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":3.38,"end":9.48,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-0","text":"先輩、専門書が安く買える本屋さんってありませんか。来週のゼミまでに買いたいんですけど。新学期は、教科書代が大変で、少しでも安く買いたいんです。","textVersion":"sha256:33b50bc72c55a7f1202341d711532a416a860667f3b8b00f44e41a1225d9609b","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":11.18,"end":23.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-1","text":"専門書？大学の大学ブックで買う人が多いんじゃない？あそこなら現金で1割引きだから。店にない本も注文すれば取り寄せてくれるよ。遅いと一週間近くかかるときもあるけど。","textVersion":"sha256:0f7da7118118c828da3fffe02d442a9c8ea992f4f8fd23386642e36d248a4663","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":23.56,"end":37.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-2","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":38.3,"end":39.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-3","text":"あとはインターネットのリンゴブックとか、富士ブックとかだね。リンゴブックは新品しか扱ってないから定価だけど、翌日の夕方には必ず届くよ。富士ブックなら中古品を扱ってて、すべて定価の半額だよ。運がよければ自分の欲しいものが手に入るけど、分かんないね。あれば、遅くても3日以内には届くよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e4bda8345524a7195aacd6adb0b0ee5b7486eed399a7c9ff40612312f47759e9","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":39.1,"end":63.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-4","text":"へー。","textVersion":"sha256:043e96d54aa9a3279d4bff4ab0e31e88750d2fc8432ed73a39c3e33b12db5385","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":64.58,"end":65.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-5","text":"あと専門書が充実してるといえば、駅前の何でもブックかな。定価だけど、ない本はないっていってるぐらいだから、あそこなら確実に買えるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1a8f5c92436cb4fb0510dd5a8c3f5793c2371774b672b6ba15f8eba510821426","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":66.12,"end":77.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-6","text":"そうですか。確実に買えるところが近くにあるなら、安心ですね。よかった。でも、とにかく安く済ませたいから、まずは運を試してみることにします。ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:18bcb043205b1aa1d5a8ce400d0904019b63b212ab264a0788bddcd0177848f6","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":78.04,"end":91.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-7","text":"女の学生は最初にどこで本を探しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:144dc31f0e0f50d4e2f237f7a6de0f63a83dde6843d69c22547d29e68b4c786e","audioVersion":"sha256:43b9de789ffba515831dc99d189aeb7ac24211460435e69831404d71e032d674","timelineVersion":"sha256:5cb3e6ed9a673c8485d793e3462c763621e34fec5d0a82b29eb813ca2962011e","start":97.78,"end":102.14,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"2fdd314275f8a60a"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2013.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:question","text":"二番：海外でホームステイをする予定の息子が両親とお土産について話しています。息子はどんなお土産を探すことにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:5d64d88d89a3d59d9a08858b6847b3f118d8b24ecdee134d8f11db391b45bba4","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":3.48,"end":11.48,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-0","text":"ホームステイの家の人には、何がいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:c2bf8285a4c26b45638ad576fd62bc1ee67c5cd0b0b9f726c24b04f26841add1","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":13.08,"end":15.88,"speaker":"息子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-1","text":"そうだな。まあありがちだけど、日本的なものって、お煎餅とかかな。","textVersion":"sha256:fd6928ddd4d4ebd49d909258f9c6f9b6df190c6981b696a59f870cc6ebe33576","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":15.82,"end":22.34,"speaker":"父"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-2","text":"それはもう買ったんだけど。一ヶ月もお世話になるから、なんかもっと形に残るものをって思って。","textVersion":"sha256:b38f05dd9b9f72c7d2f5fba55600e605a0075f1844f5aaa2f149badded1946a0","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":22.46,"end":29.34,"speaker":"息子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-3","text":"じゃ、身につけるものなんかどうかな。和風のスカーフとか。絹の。","textVersion":"sha256:e995bb7226d857e574551cffeba9241f24a99a526e177d0adc77e9115fed60e8","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":30.12,"end":35.58,"speaker":"父"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-4","text":"そういうものは好みがあるからね。","textVersion":"sha256:18d115d68e89f2aea9d4016b40ffaff836eb4192ada3b1e7de1ba67687f67b72","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":35.94,"end":38.78,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-5","text":"せっかくあげても使ってもらえないとね。","textVersion":"sha256:f7a32ed807072eebda2e382350d38daec2bd79b2ea201414712b445d005a07e9","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":39.06,"end":41.88,"speaker":"息子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-6","text":"あ、うちにあるような木のサラダボールは？温かみがあって、素敵じゃない？お箸なんかいいけど、使わないかもしれないからね。","textVersion":"sha256:f023864fbbc7278fef2be2594d523f8093851e1f8695358cb2813766e0fe2db5","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":41.82,"end":51.88,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-7","text":"そうだね。食事の時に使うものだったら、家族のみなさんへのお土産になるね。","textVersion":"sha256:4db488ef6cdd4e05051d2dbbdccd28c73b946b9425f3ce9cd853eeed4ab27c9c","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":52.12,"end":57.78,"speaker":"息子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-8","text":"それなら、陶器でできた和風のコーヒーカップとかもいいんじゃないか？なかなかお洒落なのはあるよ、最近は。","textVersion":"sha256:f10039ac30655e7ee22aa287cebd0340caad7f6e4b8b7b6c996590189d634dd9","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":57.92,"end":65.26,"speaker":"父"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-9","text":"ん〜それもいいけど、もっていく時に割れないか心配ね。","textVersion":"sha256:8423169e365b68fa8ebfba3d256980299dc927e940117b433705987cf5214e66","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":65.4,"end":70.06,"speaker":"母"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-10","text":"確かにね。割れちゃうと残念だし。じゃ、さっそくデパートで探してみるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:8492d9caad216cb32c0455d96a688f550bd4898612d49601aa9b7f194d85ae23","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":70,"end":76.68,"speaker":"息子"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-11","text":"息子はどんなお土産を探すことにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:029598a54888879f81926fd68908b88bc4c117254a987c672f9d5c23dd455925","audioVersion":"sha256:5a65b35ab449ef97ed0d809d2d7310c1a5d1d6a0de0fc39c40a6428baac2bb0a","timelineVersion":"sha256:7a3990e33ce760307a59df0b3999a74278650dc6333b39bcae02d687ab138e77","start":82.18,"end":86.12,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"2fdd314275f8a60a"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:90772fbcbfabfca3f3e0eca1e8f2eef37c8d7009bd79ad2bb254ddefb275b94b","timelineVersion":"sha256:127a16ee707b86b7cca43273630512fe380a1030d9c5d4ded2a2d2c68c1d92a9","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2013.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3:question","text":"三番：夫婦がラジオの天気予報を聞いて話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:a85e5d2cc45cc891fcf88ff44375c4fa75bbdaf5b557cfbc5325f5d21f70de64","audioVersion":"sha256:90772fbcbfabfca3f3e0eca1e8f2eef37c8d7009bd79ad2bb254ddefb275b94b","timelineVersion":"sha256:127a16ee707b86b7cca43273630512fe380a1030d9c5d4ded2a2d2c68c1d92a9","start":3.5,"end":9.42,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0","text":"では次に、気になる連休の天気予報をお伝えします。まず三連休一日目となる金曜日は午前中は晴れますが、午後からお天気が崩れそうです。特に夕方からは雷を伴った激しい雨が降るおそれがあります。気温も下がりますので、お出かけの場合は傘と上着をお持ちください。二日目の土曜日は朝から晴れて気温も上がり、気持ちのよい一日になるでしょう。この暖かさは日曜日も続きますが、日曜日は曇りで、ところによっては小雨が降るでしょう。お出かけの際は、傘をお持ちになるとよいでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:a7991a36ea683dfef7ad9e9c0d8c30d73d11217725fb69c4afbafac56c0fcaa1","audioVersion":"sha256:90772fbcbfabfca3f3e0eca1e8f2eef37c8d7009bd79ad2bb254ddefb275b94b","timelineVersion":"sha256:127a16ee707b86b7cca43273630512fe380a1030d9c5d4ded2a2d2c68c1d92a9","start":11.14,"end":51.38,"speaker":"ラジオ"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-1","text":"いやだ。雨だって。三連休の予定どうする？一日目はハイキング、二日目は買い物に行こうっていってたけど、雨じゃね。","textVersion":"sha256:6fa039adbbb07ad81d8d1b425d5c62a98f9a3d4481d19091fa3802dcb33664a0","audioVersion":"sha256:90772fbcbfabfca3f3e0eca1e8f2eef37c8d7009bd79ad2bb254ddefb275b94b","timelineVersion":"sha256:127a16ee707b86b7cca43273630512fe380a1030d9c5d4ded2a2d2c68c1d92a9","start":53.06,"end":63.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-2","text":"ん〜ハイキングは一日晴れてる日じゃないとね。買い物は雨でもいけるから、予定入れ替えればいいんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:27c4636f704a1c685fe883f08840dbdd71acb6c84d47a0caa262d3f251b1ae45","audioVersion":"sha256:90772fbcbfabfca3f3e0eca1e8f2eef37c8d7009bd79ad2bb254ddefb275b94b","timelineVersion":"sha256:127a16ee707b86b7cca43273630512fe380a1030d9c5d4ded2a2d2c68c1d92a9","start":64.16,"end":72.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-3","text":"そうね。ちゃんと晴れる日（土曜日）にハイキングってことで。でも、雷が鳴る日に買い物もね……","textVersion":"sha256:abbdf45d84768e0277040058aa674cab45ce1dfa97b2bd69a9e569912be9e187","audioVersion":"sha256:90772fbcbfabfca3f3e0eca1e8f2eef37c8d7009bd79ad2bb254ddefb275b94b","timelineVersion":"sha256:127a16ee707b86b7cca43273630512fe380a1030d9c5d4ded2a2d2c68c1d92a9","start":72.26,"end":79.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-4","text":"じゃ、でかけないで、うちで映画のDVDでも見ようか。","textVersion":"sha256:fa5eb8f9924b35cf304ebb3243def202d91f4dfcb2fa3a38c4084ecee7555a16","audioVersion":"sha256:90772fbcbfabfca3f3e0eca1e8f2eef37c8d7009bd79ad2bb254ddefb275b94b","timelineVersion":"sha256:127a16ee707b86b7cca43273630512fe380a1030d9c5d4ded2a2d2c68c1d92a9","start":80.96,"end":84.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-5","text":"じゃ、買い物は最終日ね。","textVersion":"sha256:27d9d46a95534b1e3b97760fbc049ae566df67e26c04c6cf297c6b3a06b55f9c","audioVersion":"sha256:90772fbcbfabfca3f3e0eca1e8f2eef37c8d7009bd79ad2bb254ddefb275b94b","timelineVersion":"sha256:127a16ee707b86b7cca43273630512fe380a1030d9c5d4ded2a2d2c68c1d92a9","start":84.62,"end":87.72,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"2fdd314275f8a60a"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2014.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:question","text":"一番：観光案内所で、地図を見ながら、男の人と係りの人が話しています。男の人はどのコースにしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a37ea7418f4ef6657ed9899300ee21bb201a8accb76f957ee8840a7c479ff54e","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":3.79,"end":11.48,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-0","text":"近くをドライブしたいんですが、いいコースを教えていただけませんか。海が見えてできるだけ込んでないコースがいいんです。あと、どこか一つぐらい観光できる所がほしいな。","textVersion":"sha256:0d3b9d40837504196eb21565a16385a1f0a501f7dae5d17f3133160fa3507ed9","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":13.53,"end":25.43,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-1","text":"うーん、そうですね。このあたりのドライブコースとしては、四つございます。まず、海岸コースですが、こちらは海が見渡せますし、途中に花の公園があって、季節の花を楽しむことができる人気のコースですよ。ただ、今日は休日だから、込んでますね。","textVersion":"sha256:b7eaba4427e6890b4d3d460df4e35c302efdf048b43a0ea08a2ae5405a958f62","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":26.04,"end":45.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-2","text":"ああ、そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:e61a6cc6a0f662ae70e6611a99d6c3b98385cf5f9dc257fc063f1e93e72618fd","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":45.64,"end":47.25,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-3","text":"ほかに海が見えるのは有料道路コース。こちらは海岸コースと並んで走っていて、眺めもとてもいいですし、空いています。ただ、途中に車を止めて見るようなところはありませんね。","textVersion":"sha256:897a58c0764a7d59683fd9066a1edfb022b7e99b97c8aadb737060610675d9c3","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":47.71,"end":61.94,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-4","text":"うん。車に乗ってるだけなのはちょっとね。","textVersion":"sha256:36ef1e542d80d12a30ed7d59ab06c5bb2cb84737f95ee5d3b26f78637ba5dc94","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":62.09,"end":65.83,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-5","text":"そうですか。ではこの山頂コースはいかがですか。途中にいい美術館もありますよ。海から少し離れてしまいますが、空いていますし、山頂からの海の景色は最高ですよ。あとは。","textVersion":"sha256:ae545fa24cf685afd008d00a35deb069fc95a8ff7d7e48256845a274119f70d0","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":65.85,"end":81.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":81.41,"end":81.97,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-7","text":"海は見えないんですが、お勧めのコースがありますよ。山の麓コースで、山の上の方には行きませんが、混雑もなく快適ですし、今は菜の花畑が続いていてきれいですよ。それに途中に有名な神社もあります。","textVersion":"sha256:cc75718ad88a6dc6be176c5f4245ab14634b84fd4b298c45ae9d067f89c15264","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":82.41,"end":99.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-8","text":"そうですか。やっぱり込んでいるのは嫌だし、海の眺めも捨てがたいな。観光もしたいし。じゃ、このコースにします。","textVersion":"sha256:453873b8d5054822797b1509f396b985f6e771e3c3074fcdf0929d0542910694","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":99.73,"end":109.35,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-9","text":"男の人はどのコースにしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:11e678c6f61419c42570df757fe94a9938a1901ee7db977599e80a2193fef72c","audioVersion":"sha256:246cd7c72948a2b9071cf4b4b59d06bcfd749b80f79bd16e6d8c043cd5876373","timelineVersion":"sha256:461acc2f7f251b0524e45505ebbe29f75e6e6e83287ff9a8a18684673b62cb9b","start":115.17,"end":117.99,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"3b62e3382e5a3618"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2014.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:question","text":"二番：タクシー会社の経営者と二人の社員が話しています。今回、どのサービスをすることになりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:3a2efeeafd72171f145a49ed390168656fa06cc07f55c6109a429af83da30ec1","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":3.75,"end":9.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-0","text":"最近、売り上げが今一つなんで、何か新しいサービスを始めようと思っているんだが、現場を知っている君たち運転手に意見を聞きたくてね。何かいいサービスないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:94157f6bed36e9b382c1aa41445b13a7ebb9ab8f6d09cf4fd9b91dfc9b8c3301","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":11.46,"end":24.03,"speaker":"経営者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-1","text":"うーん。そうですね。お墓参りへ行くお客さんの送迎をすることがあるんですが、お墓参りをされるお客さんはお墓の掃除をすることが多いんです。高齢の方も多いので、送迎とお墓の掃除の手伝いをセットにしてみてはどうでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:5e9def8a7e0460e23888b476a1f00d98694213c61977172062018adcc761a7f1","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":24.93,"end":41.53,"speaker":"社員1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-2","text":"でも、どの程度需要が期待できるでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:0954a30d037c181252808177419e5bc6a7e8c1e536ce7edcd2bf9e85969ded2a","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":41.73,"end":45.18,"speaker":"社員2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-3","text":"そうだね。お墓参りはそうしょっちゅう行くものでもないし。","textVersion":"sha256:df778f5bc0909fa4bba8f3226eb774ed4967ce3c035070b51f87784a9308b615","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":45.45,"end":49.9,"speaker":"経営者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-4","text":"それじゃ、お客さんをスーパーやデパートまでご案内するだけじゃなくて、買い物のお手伝いをするというのは需要があると思います。お年寄りは重い荷物を持つのも大変でしょうから。","textVersion":"sha256:fcdbe0b9cf04da3941dc61768640ec0432e71da38dce4d09f6b81c71a731c514","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":49.98,"end":61.88,"speaker":"社員1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-5","text":"それだったら一年中利用してもらえそうだね。","textVersion":"sha256:413cc62b8a53be3cf65ad09bf6ce3276fe541e7b02a3570b8fba6a8635dbe88f","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":62.06,"end":65.19,"speaker":"経営者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-6","text":"高齢化社会という点では、介護が必要な人も外に出かけられるよう、タクシーの乗り降りや車椅子での移動のお手伝いといったサービスはどうでしょうか。運転手は研修を受ける必要があるかと思いますが。","textVersion":"sha256:3d371d2c6d36504c25c95d08cdb5d23184b72c547598fef776f4154e9aa67e18","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":65.6,"end":79.81,"speaker":"社員2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-7","text":"確かにそういったサービスがあると、高齢の方も安心だね。ただ研修には時間がかかりそうだな。","textVersion":"sha256:3baa298d4384944a71377c69d24072667416183c8ea9f0674cfb130a051a01e7","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":80.41,"end":87.93,"speaker":"経営者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-8","text":"そうですか。あと、以前に比べて、外国のお客さんが増えています。運転手の語学研修などを行って、外国語で案内できると喜ばれると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:d77dc0c4c97ec8b822ad7e40869518d2632cfdd4902eb6d8c1b03d4e99260b46","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":88.05,"end":99.57,"speaker":"社員2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-9","text":"うーん。それは成果がでるまで時間がかかると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:0a7c66eb6de57ceee4cce2acce2f91641f3d990eaf48d509499f1ab85c24803f","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":99.66,"end":103.99,"speaker":"社員1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-10","text":"そうだね。長期的には運転手の技術や能力を磨いていく必要があるけど、今回はすぐ取り掛かれて、需要の広がりが期待できるものにしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:52370581b1140116000f9feeac483fdeb78505b6345c7c29feb5b58365370a93","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":104.17,"end":114.63,"speaker":"経営者"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-11","text":"今回、どのサービスをすることになりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:66988bbeb0095602fe21a0285cd4809733d885430b607a23c898036022f21a54","audioVersion":"sha256:7a347f3c42963e037cb4977968238573955469ec1b8dab717166310781abeadc","timelineVersion":"sha256:2008dc6ca8779163dfea5790aa4ec4dacace0db71e6c967866c79e437ca3ac2e","start":120.45,"end":123.84,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"3b62e3382e5a3618"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2014.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:question","text":"三番：ラジオで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:3995bf216b8ee7474478cdb7d94f0d15c70610774ad1ee9efb40f83a6ca037fd","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":3.83,"end":8.1,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-0","text":"家の中が物で溢れているとか、片付けることが苦手という声をよく聞きます。そこで、今回はみなさんに四つの方法を提案します。一つ目の方法は、知り合いが多い方におすすめです。まだ使えるけど、自分は使わないといったものがあったら、新たな持ち主を見つけて、どんどん譲ってしまいましょう。二つ目の方法は、譲りたいけど自分で次の持ち主を探すのが難しい方におすすめです。そのような方はリサイクルショップを利用しましょう。服だけでなく、本やCDも買い取ってくれます。三つ目の方法は、物が増えないように、持っているものを有効利用するというものです。例えば、新しい服をどんどん買うのではなく、今ある服にスカーフやベルトで変化をつけましょう。四つ目の方法は、収納で工夫するというものです。家の中を見渡してみてください。階段やベッドの下など収納に使える場所はありませんか。棚やカゴで収納すると部屋の中がすっきりしますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:01aa11b1460fdea13b7f4cb300088429792ce02eb567de040cf9f860fb1e18fd","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":9.94,"end":80.81,"speaker":"ラジオ"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-1","text":"うちも物が増えて困ってるのよね。いい機会だから、やってみない？","textVersion":"sha256:f9de574e80f0f2975e30691f9387882b9a7e5cac8f2ad5f7e654f7fb44926e96","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":82.65,"end":87.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-2","text":"そうだね。ぼくも気になってたんだ。整理するなら、ぼくはCDだな。この際友達にあげよう。","textVersion":"sha256:b6fd4ad32844ca7e9c595d5cc5091a3f52ba6253285f9a449772d8cb8c1c6531","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":88.16,"end":95.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-3","text":"うん。それか、お店に持ってってもいいんじゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:35930c3a7eac01a8be57aac999f2b98256c4df03efc4ecae1cd343cbc9629cd5","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":95.65,"end":99.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-4","text":"うん。でも、やっぱりどれも捨てがたいな。廊下に天井まで棚を取り付けることにしようかな。CD用の棚なら、そんなに場所取らないし。","textVersion":"sha256:624a1ed4855cb99d35f42769dd27d8561fa1efd334d2413ac52bb7490656068d","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":99.48,"end":110.54,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-5","text":"それ、よさそうだね。わたしはやっぱり服よね。新しく買い足さないで、小物でアレンジしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:7d4b3ca34717334baf31bccc42fa72b6d48dc17f2e4deb8f0b1bc3fbe6ae70c1","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":110.63,"end":118.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-6","text":"えー、だいたいもう箪笥から溢れてるじゃない。お店に持ってったら。","textVersion":"sha256:94834bc84dd0744a73e8e48ff84b2723ce99cef2266b1bcebd274e49676d7f07","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":119.06,"end":123.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-7","text":"アレンジじゃ確かに解決策にならないか。それじゃ、やっぱり少しはお金になるだろうから、思い切って整理しよう。","textVersion":"sha256:7b7fde0a8fd2cc81e4693975f4a365df925c9a2b859be4a3b5d12405ac69412f","audioVersion":"sha256:e741da05cbd688043f27d9ec31a9f267afd5892f855b3b76a8ee1f683ebf4632","timelineVersion":"sha256:063a706b348860182fc4e71292b82c690b800b5b30ab0d1ab35e6ae2a0c0a172","start":124.44,"end":133.48,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"3b62e3382e5a3618"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2014.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:question","text":"一番：大学で男の学生と女の学生が授業案内を見ながら、授業について話しています。女の学生はどの授業を受けることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:cd5c6781cba3a00359079145a7af6ca1dfcabd41537fe347ea8b4b37f297a18a","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":4.06,"end":14.24,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0","text":"授業、どれ取るか決めた？","textVersion":"sha256:d8ee3e82a8132d0fdcf6540408aec87e63460120ad1eb83b3084c4578f258ffa","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":16.09,"end":17.74,"speaker":"男の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-1","text":"いいえ、まだ迷ってるんです。専門的なことが学べて、発表とか、討論とか、参加型な授業を受けたいなあと思ってて、受講生はできるだけ少ない科目がいいんですが。先輩、この4人の先生の授業について、知ってますか？","textVersion":"sha256:1b861e26ad6ca49685d54aa03c18c13fb268f1accfd55f29efbda5139924497a","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":18.1,"end":35.82,"speaker":"女の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-2","text":"うん。佐藤先生の授業は専門的な内容に入る前の基礎固めがきっちりできる授業だね。関心あることを調べて、発表もしたなぁ。人数制限はないから、僕の時は結構いっぱい取ってたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:304e43e4797ece18f7d52c205c9721acd5428365cb72a52fb04e97d9e63b4e1f","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":36.22,"end":50.62,"speaker":"男の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-3","text":"へえ。","textVersion":"sha256:5b4758906dde4833d3f779bdfcf51ff70e042a5bc79b305f0b03b3a0bf9c6fc6","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":50.72,"end":51.6,"speaker":"女の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-4","text":"で、山本先生の授業は基礎知識があることが前提になってて、より専門性を深められる授業だったよ。毎回、授業の最初に少し先生の講義があるけど、その後はグループ討論で、いつも何かのテーマについて話し合うんだ。受講者が少なくて、和やかな雰囲気だよ。で、本田先生の授業は、いろんな論文を読んでいくんだ。学生が資料を用意して、順に発表していく授業。ただ、毎年40人ぐらいは受講するみたいだけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:a2cfc768af217efbddc8fe7dc960ec2f4ba106b3a3dfa33ad072178ef30661cd","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":51.85,"end":84.08,"speaker":"男の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-5","text":"40人もですか。","textVersion":"sha256:af4e6987b0db8060417c26bd4ec4f44e0ebf6ffc626f9de01526bc5fdf66bc0f","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":84.41,"end":86.03,"speaker":"女の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-6","text":"うん。あと、鈴木先生の授業は、先生が毎回解説しながら、専門書を読む授業。まあ、学生が中心になってするような活動はないんだけど、先生は少人数で読みたいっていう方針で、学生は毎年10人以下だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:cc7e2714259182d592b55fd05cce5d23fdd28526f69bfda58ca10f1aa3329616","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":86.42,"end":102.84,"speaker":"男の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-7","text":"そうですか。専門的で、話し合いが中心だし、この授業がいいですね。人数も少ないようですし。","textVersion":"sha256:29f039394c5ca2bbc49bbd472d3769266e35da985e8ff02a0474eb0e261d84ec","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":103.21,"end":111.49,"speaker":"女の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-8","text":"女の学生はどの授業を受けることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:c611fefc4b36e7052616ccbd64781a76e9c4909c14d600282003af9b4f4ece9c","audioVersion":"sha256:677dc3a146797ad42545a624b831d372bf3dd281743d0f3197fb48c2f10ef3a6","timelineVersion":"sha256:32cf972d5a98feae6ee0023fe97abd0810251258cd6b10efcca4ac35a9bb309f","start":117.32,"end":121.61,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"66f28f2367a59e1c"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2014.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:question","text":"二番：パン屋で、店長と店員二人が、駐車場について話しています。問題を解決するために、どうすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:365d457b149c92aa1193a005b1d7ed79003cae2d6394fc514a29602d380dbbb3","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":3.86,"end":11.1,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0","text":"最近、お客さんが増えて嬉しいんだけど、駐車場が込んでて困るって苦情が来ているんだ。何かいい方法はないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:b1e5fb29b6826774b63dc85e830cf9be4bf46db47fdd01cab72932ba91c075ba","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":12.96,"end":22.02,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-1","text":"でも、駐車場、お店の横に5台分ありますよね、パン屋さんにこんなに駐車場があるの、珍しいほうだと思うんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:df545baacbd05c87e31a2a14bb343536e14070132772fc4d0cab0165b6ff924e","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":22.22,"end":31.29,"speaker":"女の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-2","text":"道の向こう側にある空き地、あそこを借りて、うちの駐車場にしたらどうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:7fb1d6e62953e59c7ba8c2ba96e5c3a948cbbbd93b781601c66d92ea95032709","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":31.63,"end":36.92,"speaker":"男の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-3","text":"ううん、でも土地を借りるのはかなり費用がかかるからなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:8449a5702a6d21ba46bd80750e834063bf49fc989115f4605b14648c7cb5e5e6","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":37.06,"end":42.5,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-4","text":"じゃあ、今の駐車場は余裕を持って作られてるから、一台分のスペースを少し狭くして、もう一台とめられるようにするとか。","textVersion":"sha256:3da1dc53e634ee8e73dea5b7cae360882590a3b82cf6e24651c3ca425ffe6f9b","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":42.74,"end":51.37,"speaker":"男の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-5","text":"一台でも増えるのはいいね。でも、お客さんの安全のことを考えるとどうだろうね。","textVersion":"sha256:6482c590ccfcda14828953e78aec6a45739d1ed4a5b4d56300368561174790f0","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":52.3,"end":58.99,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-6","text":"あのう、今、私たち店員が会計の後、レジでパンを一つずつ袋に入れてますよね。","textVersion":"sha256:88979693476b8c37073c578aa191e2b2c1038802ed4bc24d64e7567f523e482e","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":59.37,"end":66.37,"speaker":"女の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-7","text":"ああ、あれ、時間かかるから、込んでる時はお客さん待たせちゃうよね。","textVersion":"sha256:35ba56dee5c29d0ba302d45d8ba61974098fdf3852b560e2e59f6cc3c1566c91","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":66.61,"end":71.3,"speaker":"男の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-8","text":"はい、お店が忙しくなる時間って限られているので、その時間は事前にパンを袋に入れて、棚に並べておいたらどうでしょう。会計の時間が短くなったら、お客さんの流れがよくなって、駐車場も混雑しなくなると思うんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:15630c2ce49117f45145030a0b9108c79ec25290273b36d218f10557d5aedf5a","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":71.32,"end":88.11,"speaker":"女の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-9","text":"ああ、それいいね。","textVersion":"sha256:761e46a45ac86aca6b5d20c0a5074bd57907e1b0b9d1874ef355925637d23b83","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":88.49,"end":90.66,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-10","text":"あっ、それから、今レジは一台しかないですけど、それを二台にすれば、もっとスムーズに会計できると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:0aca87a00b2fd7885b039125cd347629b4639b0d85a95a11b81b2a2d870ece89","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":90.99,"end":99.25,"speaker":"女の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-11","text":"うん。でもそうすると、レジをもう一台買う必要があるからね。ううん、お客さんの安全も考えて、経費も負担にならないってことを考えると、さっきの案かな。取り組めるところから始めようか。","textVersion":"sha256:b3478a4a052800fe9b96cdb8f04e44bd71845bc36461284f573222697b86106c","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":99.54,"end":116.48,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-12","text":"問題を解決するために、どうすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:f2eb9405e179b353bee8ba7ef6b2de23a008bc8b13f9ababda9446f97ef3f26b","audioVersion":"sha256:1c3e747449fd5966c46b3f48f6c42c24292a05cbc4d4a1fb364a9a6d4c386231","timelineVersion":"sha256:1874f7ba73ea816e6edcb12b110512e63bbeba383141c65a3564b05d4fca596c","start":122.54,"end":126.72,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"66f28f2367a59e1c"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2014.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:question","text":"三番：イベント会場のアナウンスを聞いて、夫婦が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:0a9598185647f54e636ca20b662da1c9637696c5b79b437be774b96c70119de7","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":2.93,"end":8.68,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-0","text":"本日はご来場いただき、ありがとうございます。会場についてご案内いたします。会場は四つに分かれております。まず、第一会場では今注目の世界の電気自動車をご紹介しています。第二会場ではスピードとデザインを重視した話題のモデルのスポーツカーをご覧いただくことができます。さらに、第三会場には国内、海外を問わず、最新のオートバイが数多く並んでおります。この場で実際に車にお乗りになりたい方は第四会場でそれぞれの会場の人気のモデルを運転していただくことができます。なお、本日のイベントはあと一時間ほどで終了いたします。最後までどうぞごゆっくりお楽しみください。","textVersion":"sha256:cbf456cf482eab16bf3aa250c4fe0db732aad9ac151994619f12fac1285e24cb","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":18.48,"end":68.32,"speaker":"アナウンサー"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-1","text":"あと一時間か。全部は見られないね。最初にスポーツカーから見に行かない？","textVersion":"sha256:7637d41130f2b255da33150b7adaf05b6c34d1e6926ddda26c799dbf88b66c64","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":70,"end":75.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-2","text":"本当スポーツカーが好きよね。でも、うちで車を買い換えるとしたら、普通の車よね。ね、電気自動車ってどんなのか、ちょっと見ておかない？","textVersion":"sha256:b4b34612a34fb28095a49092fe9264c11aba8a0e8be9c863de5d286eedb729a9","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":76.04,"end":87.49,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-3","text":"そうだね、じゃ、先にそっちから見ようか。","textVersion":"sha256:2427e23093a8f420bf3ea15f2d52c68074e63afe2191916074ef56e391a31caf","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":87.55,"end":90.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-4","text":"そうね。じゃ、そのあとスポーツカー見てきたら？","textVersion":"sha256:2745d0d1e55c792100398fbc1fbaa840c8b44ebb9dd818f4077f7b2cfbd0ba71","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":90.57,"end":94.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-5","text":"いや、ゆっくり見られそうにないし、今日はやめとく。","textVersion":"sha256:ea1d3ccad9be3e0264030e90825dde3c73191c3c6e2826988cd5f982858feca1","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":94.8,"end":98.25,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-6","text":"そういえば、バイクの調子、悪いんじゃなかった？","textVersion":"sha256:ccd9f5d9be8ace1683b4da06576531932754983041e3d8878d66620bf19d3e2f","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":98.58,"end":102.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-7","text":"うん、この間修理したよ。でも、最新のを見ておきたいな。時間があったらね。","textVersion":"sha256:a905afa413b8591473e14f765e7db87117331482d1eb8f3fb1780a580d917e5b","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":102.14,"end":108.29,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-8","text":"そう。じゃ、私も時間があったらどれか電気自動車、運転してみよう。","textVersion":"sha256:2bf626c07343477070de63227149a0243345893e01adfcc855378efd8c2c060d","audioVersion":"sha256:2704e077a294b501db14ce4c66450cfb70e49a191329f3cc857ab6beb28fd66f","timelineVersion":"sha256:4006e0f3cc9dab61ca3a3e7df28ddb34a80b80b9b2be29490c7475f5a8d4ce3a","start":108.25,"end":113.98,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"66f28f2367a59e1c"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2015.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:question","text":"一番：男の学生と女の学生がサッカーの練習をする場所について相談しています。どこに練習場を予約することになりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:9d469b0c59800de9ce3bea7f90f53db44e638e5fc2a0cd906da01a38b74208d3","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":4.03,"end":11.84,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-0","text":"本田さん、来月大学のグラウンドが使えない日だけど、代わりの練習場見つかった？できれば、夕方以降もできるようにナイター設備が整っているところ。","textVersion":"sha256:7ae0bd9d5bb0ba078340dabc05519e388269b9a44eff962a2beeb9efa91a6bcb","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":13.63,"end":24.27,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-1","text":"あ、はい。照明設備があるところですね。使用料は2万円以内、できれば大学の近くでということでしたよね。4つピックアップしました。一つ目は「緑サッカー場」、ここは照明付きで、値段も一万二千円、大学からも近いです。利用できるかどうかは抽選で決めるそうです。翌月分を毎月下旬に決めるので、抽選はもう少し先になりますね。","textVersion":"sha256:62d812bd65147c01c096f81b4377b731fa6e04334ed60545a5d24f960277c916","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":24.54,"end":54.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-2","text":"そっか、抽選結果が出るまで使えるかわからないんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:96bd0b089a486bf068b368991bb29b385270a70a47068b7c594b9d3bcc1b97ea","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":54.2,"end":57.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-3","text":"はい、それから、「黒岩サッカー場」も一万五千円と安いです。照明はないんですが。ただ、ここは大学からは近いですし、予約が先着順で使用する日は空いてました。","textVersion":"sha256:bcb339eab4f7da4cb8cc0b2f875a8ae7eef667dce6d2fd832a19826885a87df7","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":58.03,"end":73.87,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-4","text":"今すぐ場所を確保できるってのはいいね。","textVersion":"sha256:8843842882535ea0c1135fc229cc2f2dd32dc9d15aaf5093bcce277f21763635","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":74.54,"end":77.13,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-5","text":"はい。後2つも今、空いてるんですが、予算は超えちゃうんです。えっと、「青井クラブ」は二万二千円です。ナイター設備が完備されていますし、昨年出来たばかりで、新しくていい施設です。ただ、大学から歩いていけないことはないんですが、少し距離はありますね。えっと、あと、学校のすぐ裏にある「赤井公園」は照明付きで二万五千円です。どうしましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:eeaa8065a7e574bd3cc990c232f645680c31b8d3ff1b8aac9e6ed185d864074e","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":77.24,"end":109.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-6","text":"そうか。やっぱり日が暮れてからも練習できたほうがいいなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:956f813571648c5ff31d56d56b474ecd80df4a1f59b3b1217b5778dbb9d5d995","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":109.98,"end":114.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-7","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":114.7,"end":115.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-8","text":"じゃ、今予約できるところで大学に近いほう、手続きしてくれる？予算オーバーだけど、しょうがない。","textVersion":"sha256:92b5ee7a906829edd53f62f5430b6062950ec5033fb3c6649a904bfd48a346f2","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":115.86,"end":122.28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-9","text":"どこに練習場を予約することになりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:93479e8759fa708e562d7514dbfda9d645fc9d1042730135753df895859c86e3","audioVersion":"sha256:b13ec9e8f9649ea192d06cd0651b58464ded2e4a61d48302384ddf459693592c","timelineVersion":"sha256:cda14f21ef51eecd47993cd8b9d90682e0da0bc4fcc1b38b8f905216b94a1420","start":128.09,"end":131.29,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"9d35693e5ef70dcd"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2015.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:question","text":"二番：銀行で、上司と銀行員がセミナーについて話しています。問題を解決するために、どうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:03131cf36306b2dd4c358330201c75d2b9064ff0112a5da17c82f3ad11a00fa5","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":3.93,"end":10.49,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-0","text":"毎年実施している経営セミナーなんだけど、参加者が徐々に減ってるんだ。参加者を増やすための何かいい方法はないかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:d11576a8a8ecbbc263961a2755082fde06b10723c79b9b3aecf5f21574bbf6d1","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":12.4,"end":21.97,"speaker":"男（上司）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-1","text":"いままでパンフレットを各支店で配ったり、ホームページで宣伝したりすることしかしてきませんでしたが、新聞にも広告を掲載したら、もっと多くの人の目に留まるんじゃないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:d16bb9f7aa81d9637401067952c8e2ea47b2ae4bb7689f2f74cf609842018377","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":22.39,"end":34.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-2","text":"なるほど。","textVersion":"sha256:e6060d825a6076f13a47cc304d64491b431764116f93db22e8a3eb419858f2a8","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":35.22,"end":36.29,"speaker":"男（上司）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-3","text":"それに、新聞に申込み用紙を掲載して、ファックスでの申し込みも受け付けるようにすれば、応募しやすいと思いますし。","textVersion":"sha256:1d516a73d1479a00b58ecb22d73e840dc79c49bf8a0c2548cf8105a26c279894","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":36.34,"end":44.81,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-4","text":"そうだね。ただ、費用がかなりかかるから、新聞ってのはね。","textVersion":"sha256:5dbcccebff05e7e971480f077e5542be00f263d6c917524220c15e107010f658","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":45.14,"end":50.47,"speaker":"男（上司）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-5","text":"あのう、セミナーの講義内容が毎年同じようなものだと、一度受講した方はもう参加しませんよね。新しい参加者を増やすこともいいと思うんですが、内容を見直して、二度、三度と受講をする人にも役立つようなものを考えたらどうでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:2cea028e4589bd3c0521fc77fb4e15258d715dae0befd3473e1dfbc79e69c0e4","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":51.85,"end":67.68,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-6","text":"うん。そうしたら、申し込みが増えそうだな。","textVersion":"sha256:0c10706198a237c65291c542459a8aee282f8e13176839a3377ef9f0ce934866","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":68.06,"end":71.23,"speaker":"男（上司）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-7","text":"あと、セミナーはいつも山田先生にお願いしてますが、ほかの講師に変えるっていう方法も考えられます。","textVersion":"sha256:b7f55191c18bbf67ad6e6b202a28c1bc036b77a1cbe87518c81df2acd96ffd20","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":71.42,"end":78.4,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-8","text":"山田先生は評判がいいんで、代わりとなる人はなかなか…。先生ならこちらの希望にも応じてくださると思いますし。","textVersion":"sha256:938356ebd477b4546347e1c47ff3f0bb1c3bf7ded8f3f54c4bf2776c94903bfa","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":78.77,"end":87.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-9","text":"それはそうだね。じゃ、さっきの方法で繰り返し参加してもらえるようにしてみよう。","textVersion":"sha256:6ac2391b0b36e1dd45d83a20962a40d1804c6b4430765ed7cc521ff9955c919a","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":87.91,"end":93.85,"speaker":"男（上司）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-10","text":"問題を解決するために、どうしますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a55356b9fd1a8af7737b7dc8b965ab0b6a8ffcf33afb8a30df181b1ce060f6b","audioVersion":"sha256:80623c78040384a8386463c11d47ccd73a7496bff0b37fc74bde30128282beea","timelineVersion":"sha256:3fb8935eaf4d3f9aa97f1c7394b150aa9c4df6b4343b314de9f7921bd0818e53","start":99.66,"end":102.87,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"9d35693e5ef70dcd"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2015.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3:question","text":"三番：ボランティアの説明会で、ボランティア団体の職員が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:dd86da796540c627e1e93afe041fb6b695b171d22bbb5415b1e08430cba58a20","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","start":3.81,"end":10.63,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-0","text":"今日は説明会にお集まりいただきまして、ありがとうございます。今登録できる4つのボランティアについてご説明します。まず一番、子供の遊び相手になっていただくボランティアです。子育て世代をサポートしていただきます。後の3つは高齢者の方の生活支援のサポートで、まず二番の庭の手入れがあります。草取りをしたり、芝刈りをしたりする屋外の作業で、体力のある方にお願いしたいと思います。それから三番、部屋の整理の手伝いもあります。高齢者の方から部屋を片付けたいけど、重いものを動かすのが大変だという声がありましたので、今回新たに加えました。四番はパソコンの指導です。高齢者の方々で、インターネットを使えるようになりたいというリクエストが多いので、パソコンの使い方が教えられる方、ぜひお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:480620716b0ae78e2e425ba5fde2aee90caffba6dfbfe4872143cf99cab8baca","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","start":12.71,"end":79.16,"speaker":"女の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-1","text":"ゆみ子は子供好きだから、子育てサポートだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:01fcc9b051e5569fb5116b6461bbab2897dba5e4d1f5babb2984e038ab847bef","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","start":81.02,"end":84.27,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-2","text":"えっ？そうね。そう思ってたけど、腰痛めてるからしばらくは無理ね。","textVersion":"sha256:3435cb8d2df09c9cc190748c3d74b6358c0b5fd640509608bf21aaae1e4b8d4b","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","start":85.5,"end":90.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-3","text":"あ、そうか。じゃあ、体を使う作業は無理だよね。","textVersion":"sha256:6fc284fc0044e718b19d80cea06397f7df5afa25e9c323e96e4c092768000512","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","start":91.09,"end":95.13,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-4","text":"うん、だからできるのは1つしかない。あなたは。","textVersion":"sha256:07fde79a40c608330aaae6b1251007d3248c983f8adac39ca2fd9b77d99f3ad2","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","start":95.22,"end":99.39,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-5","text":"子供は苦手だし、体を動かすのがいいんだけど、片付けは苦手だからな。","textVersion":"sha256:e16496d5f0971abdf1e7e7ce6cc5b79fa7922c45acf33795e6feb764dd30e4e1","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","start":99.73,"end":105.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-6","text":"そうよね。じゃあ、決まりね。","textVersion":"sha256:90a33c49ce037247978403de341332469c7b1ceb2e2bd0ef7a931cbc88cd7c55","audioVersion":"sha256:02c7dc9faaa9eeaa4cee12bb570fc2a12a4be49aefec6327747eacd4ea7ba2ff","timelineVersion":"sha256:ff7c0adc337bdcc30c8680672e8d0af1d7b82dc1a93dc1cfd81a458719cd36e2","start":105.38,"end":108.17,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"9d35693e5ef70dcd"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2015.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:question","text":"一番：男の人と女の人が犬を連れていく公園について話しています。男の人はどの公園に犬を連れて行くことにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a1842e3aaff2669c8d5525587d43b0595edbd4bba2f5ff319e6cba044bbbc43","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":4.03,"end":11.07,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0","text":"田中さんって犬飼ってるよね。","textVersion":"sha256:f446e7eef351cc17458247e36b70d9116dff10be97eb622dade11f4f4c389518","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":12.89,"end":14.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-1","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":15.09,"end":15.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-2","text":"うちも犬を飼い始めたんだけど、まだ小さくて家の近所くらいしか散歩したことがないから、犬を連れて行くのにいい公園を探してるんだ。この近くでいいところ知らない？","textVersion":"sha256:7d45bf0fa1044153342ecdf68e153e1eba5b2a8f63a89b7cdfc125d1944e099b","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":15.9,"end":27.31,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-3","text":"まだ小さいんだったら、怖がるといけないから、人が少なくて、大きい犬があまりいないところがいいよね。そうだなあ。ここからすぐの緑公園は広々してて、芝生も整備されてるし、人が少なくて散歩しやすいよ。後、東公園の散歩コースも木や花が多くて、すごく気持ちいいよ。東公園は散歩している人がいるから、大型の犬だと連れて行くのはちょっと悪いかなと思うかもしれないけど、小さい犬なら大丈夫じゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:0a725bd3f8664dc25ed22868b1c8182945f6eb1d60a65cad7a949a5fafa0a151","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":27.66,"end":62.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-4","text":"へえ、よさそうだね。","textVersion":"sha256:d0401b479a5a16dbe592270df0eb07cf9e36513095901f0ce00636d23ba1bd1f","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":62.97,"end":64.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-5","text":"今言った二つの公園はずっと犬を繋いでないとだめだけど、ちょっと離れていてもよければ、桜公園と西公園に犬をはなして遊ばせられるスペースがあるよ。両方ともスペースを使うには登録が必要なんだけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:ad4412dcedff9f6cdd7d5bd1121a4637eabba2840dda0afd4acfe9b8bd8b9b26","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":65.36,"end":82.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-6","text":"そんなスペースあるんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:2b4d9ae10dcc0e2fb4af9ebeaef4956ab303a4ce57013c8410efa7e5900d6375","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":82.44,"end":84.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-7","text":"うん。桜公園は使用料がかかるけど、スタッフがちゃんといるし、犬の大きさによって場所も分けられてるから、小さい犬でも、自由に走り回れるよ。西公園は無料だけど、大きい犬も小さい犬も同じ場所なんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:585f752f62c4c9579f819d2e2f3f29b0ba6a3b79406ad628594df4c1f060e184","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":84,"end":101.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-8","text":"へえ、いろんなところがあるんだね。はなして自由に遊ばせたことまだないから、試してみたいな。週末にでも小さい犬だけで遊べるほうに行ってみるよ。ありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:20acad7599eaa6c2b701435b88ffb36d02b5c29725fd36714e8a70ba7d0ea013","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":101.66,"end":113.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-9","text":"男の人はどの公園に犬を連れて行くことにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:846e00f9d24a3a672f9ca3518f3812761f1b26421003e7581581c7a59a079ddc","audioVersion":"sha256:49b1de09a452746e6c0a6c897b27cac43f326bf012dd06672fc64157b93049e0","timelineVersion":"sha256:1405e644c5da688026803e46391864952e6684581e85199991e33de973e77665","start":119.45,"end":124.33,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"6a9caff087f79c80"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2015.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:question","text":"二番：母親と子供二人が父親への退職祝いについて話しています。父親への退職祝いに何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:5c6ba14e796a2e1d93b2e39c70449564c4e97ac5ab38272296b528c7d29fb635","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":3.96,"end":10.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-0","text":"来月お父さん60歳で退職だから、みんなでお祝いしましょうよ。何かお父さんが喜んでくれるようないいアイディアはない？","textVersion":"sha256:16e9a027a6eb0f73db581aefd539ba37841a34221ce3e7c497e5d629ee323921","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":12.95,"end":22.4,"speaker":"女1（母）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-1","text":"お父さんこれまで仕事が忙しかったからな。ありがちだけど、家族でのんびり過ごせるように旅行はどうかな。国内で三四泊するとかいい思い出になると思うよ。","textVersion":"sha256:82053470735fe34ad05ea1971ee2107d1252d7f80ef3358c0c15990e83aeaea8","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":22.77,"end":34.71,"speaker":"男（息子）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-2","text":"そうね。","textVersion":"sha256:c3f3b3a66f174bfb71c18d3cc03ac791ddb58e0cd459c10228f85941d90134e4","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":34.72,"end":35.81,"speaker":"女1（母）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-3","text":"どうせだったら、海外にする？家族で海外旅行なんて行ったことないし、せっかくだから。","textVersion":"sha256:575d9430603a9a73aad4ad3dfd0af41ea34b1b3f3ce64c1bdf4db460510f3fa7","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":36.05,"end":42.06,"speaker":"男（息子）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-4","text":"国内ならともかく、今から海外はちょっとね。もう来月だから。","textVersion":"sha256:28431f85a234706f023f67efb85ce44e8c162842237350b9a3e1f22f3d885d71","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":42.14,"end":47.57,"speaker":"女1（母）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-5","text":"うん、私は形に残るものがいいと思うな。カメラを送るのはどう？お父さん、そろそろ新しいのがほしいって言ってたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0eea575ecf7956df7087b64f5d5d8e2690851f077ba1c77fafbfd83947dc5c01","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":47.73,"end":57.67,"speaker":"女2（娘）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-6","text":"そういえば、パンフレット取り寄せてたみたい。","textVersion":"sha256:500d81f2dfde75da661e870b0c7c34781ecd9fe3d2d96f87708751bc46382ab4","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":57.76,"end":61.1,"speaker":"女1（母）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-7","text":"じゃ、もう自分で買っちゃってるかもしれないね。記念だから、写真館で家族で写真を撮るのもいいんじゃない。きちんと撮ってもらうの。","textVersion":"sha256:aa4625e06a7f9f3d721b70dd99ab4758848bffa1eedb024b50f30de4ead3500a","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":61.34,"end":71.58,"speaker":"女2（娘）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-8","text":"家族写真なら、旅行中にだって撮れるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:5da213b55242454090be09428a4915539eb61db0d1729fc5ae8f03e5268937c3","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":71.89,"end":74.77,"speaker":"男（息子）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-9","text":"確かにそうね。お父さん撮るのは好きでも、改まって撮られるのは恥ずかしがるだろうから、喜ばないと思うわ。","textVersion":"sha256:58a32c827907c0d1fcb0865dfcbedf70abc06f87d28cda7628a4924a2a7c3cff","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":75.02,"end":81.95,"speaker":"女1（母）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-10","text":"それもそうか。","textVersion":"sha256:4e876aff39e7fb19dd378194f6b7e63c9cbed7504703767368eb18ecd534a86c","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":82.03,"end":83.61,"speaker":"女2（娘）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-11","text":"いい機会だから、家族の思い出を増やしましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:3a58f3d90db9aa9d7b87b733fb98fa54c37c63902e0d23aa848bd6de1d04d036","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":83.73,"end":88.98,"speaker":"女1（母）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-12","text":"父親への退職祝いに何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:2e7da340f1695d2087a321e936f8ccb9abf63954cf3b1dfb0818c6e25bd46680","audioVersion":"sha256:f1ef46a98c91b2583d9a48ce85fc2fcb97238e531a4ac14c22822084b1492189","timelineVersion":"sha256:646f6ad3511c5c4e114de9af9acae2c11100238e468023d64863cd8ef92f46af","start":94.82,"end":99.18,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"6a9caff087f79c80"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2015.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:question","text":"三番：テレビの園芸番組を見て、夫婦が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:d5c8cdd4361e77f6cf896987a6abf2da858fc92da3f445a3ab4408390ee6852a","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":3.79,"end":9.3,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-0","text":"えー、今日はこちらの四種類の花についてそれぞれの特徴をご説明します。まず、このアカバナ、小さくてかわいらしい花が一年を通して楽しめる珍しい種類です。それから、このキイバナ。これは夏に咲く花で、暑い国が原産です。ほかの花と違い、乾燥に非常に強く、水分がなくても枯れることがないので、しばらく放っておいても安心です。次に、隣のモモバナですが、これは甘いかおりを持つ花で女性にとても人気です。あ、蝶や蜂もよく集まってきますけどね。そして最後に、こちらのシロバナ。この花はとにかく環境選びません。春と秋に花が咲き、虫にも強く、日光の少ないところ、寒いところでも元気に育ちます。ただ、すこしずつでも水は毎日あげてください。","textVersion":"sha256:39fcb439849e406b6ec070561e95351465dc255fac2c2bda1ed0d4a3703b7a28","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":11.12,"end":74.37,"speaker":"テレビ"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-1","text":"いろいろあるのね。花ほしくなっちゃった。ねえ、うちに何か買おうよ。あまいかおりなんて素敵じゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:53d55a109b8645d837428263c459c7b30a7859611a7703b010d0798444624a75","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":76.18,"end":85.03,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-2","text":"うん、でも虫来るみたいだよ。大丈夫？","textVersion":"sha256:1eafc0da9f580702074753524de738a4669d12570f6decb6ecfa6000e6140432","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":85.16,"end":88.87,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-3","text":"そっか。じゃ、一年中花が楽しめるのがいいな。どう？","textVersion":"sha256:4d7208e94a65c4ef800b0c5f1c6e3290727a00f0a8f53ae1f4d0a4e38332d53e","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":89.18,"end":95.27,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-4","text":"いいね。そうしよう。","textVersion":"sha256:6c58032407086e4a52c53d10f033e382467f51e459324ca9ede33fc3d16638b3","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":95.46,"end":96.99,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-5","text":"私、職場の机にも何か置きたいな。私のオフィス日当たりいいんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ab2c1c89b7104ed76d39b76399f52f3a04eb042027c081bb8afab5a7ffda69c9","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":97.36,"end":103.81,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-6","text":"でも休みの日は世話できないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:2b1df43f1e9c7c900c3d351965efea2f4d27c471f3ddbed6dc79c249ee3fb6fe","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":103.95,"end":106.45,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-7","text":"さっき、手がかからないって言ってたの。あれなら大丈夫よ。","textVersion":"sha256:df033e33e44763a71bdbd32ccf324aca05a62fa81e5323e8f815c00d83c7fa33","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":106.69,"end":110.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-8","text":"そっか。じゃ、明日早速花屋に見に行こうか。","textVersion":"sha256:5b64d797d74bd2d0fe08354e90f60da69868cf6cfff7b36cb6fbb636bf48b721","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":110.88,"end":114.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-9","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:e495faa0962a9cba6d9742444df5077a617580ee6b3119b09853fbc148fb4e0f","timelineVersion":"sha256:c7f56cf2b169e287d7dcf6ce196bd5e283b882d6761c48ac2a6d2df65e2a134d","start":114.98,"end":115.5,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6a9caff087f79c80"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2016.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:question","text":"一番：大学で男の学生と職員が話しています。男の学生はどのアルバイトを選びますか。","textVersion":"sha256:af685f718bc4cfc2cf4fa67f36b609f7220060ac29e3db12d080910bfc2eca08","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":3.73,"end":9.53,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-0","text":"すみません。アルバイトを紹介してもらいたいんですが、お客さんと接する仕事がいいんですが、どんなのがあるか教えていただけませんか。時給はできたら900円以上で、週3日までで探してるんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:7d277948c65c66b4c3070e992ec1ba1da3f24e6e1490e421ede562a5eb7580c9","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":11.33,"end":30.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-1","text":"えっと、条件に近いものが4つありますよ。まずこれですね。大学正門前のコンビニです。時給850円で週3日、早朝と深夜は時給が100円高くなるそうです。それから大学の前の大通り沿いのガソリンスタンドですね。時給1200円です。ただ土日を含めて週4日以上勤務できる人が希望だそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:938ae28b8f486083e7271637648405aadcf4448154090302f27f0657474094e7","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":30.4,"end":55.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-2","text":"どちらもお客さん相手なのはいいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:be7814a465bd9e77f5463fca2959abe230721715bbe74a5e0a0641c32b27cea2","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":56.48,"end":59.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-3","text":"あと大学から駅に行く途中にあるレストランでも募集していますよ。時給1100円、調理の補助をまれに頼まれることもあるそうですが、基本的には注文を取ったり、料理を出したりする仕事で週2日来てほしいそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:b03ade667e370759a9de5f6beba587c141ed5071f8f4e51f44b37f9490e4ee55","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":59.29,"end":77.19,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-4","text":"キッチンの仕事もたまにならいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:b0f865ca600cc4a3ebadbd0771502e03e786036c6ca0b8e7b9d88630f572dc79","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":77.44,"end":80.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-5","text":"えー、それから駅前のデパートでのアルバイト、売り場には出ないで商品を発送する仕事になりますが、勤務日数が自由に決められますし、時給1300円と高いのが魅力だと思いますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:ac65bdb40440f83e13107b3f6849034afe278690110757f13ddfc4b66aa39991","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":80.28,"end":94.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-6","text":"うーん、直接お客さんとやり取りできる仕事で、できるだけ時給が高いのがいいです。クラブ活動などもあって勤務日は増やせないからこれにします。","textVersion":"sha256:0a1ad15d5a40c6c53ac3fce733d6efd02961e7881e8ba49432071c60b79b0114","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":95.25,"end":106.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-7","text":"男の学生はどのアルバイトを選びますか。","textVersion":"sha256:39369b17f1b9ecc90b996cf3e91c999cb2f10da7c3e3bd70e81cf65d968f61c0","audioVersion":"sha256:593762fddede1cec3b318dd3186b4ec089c166257bf9f7a4f305cbc21c35f22b","timelineVersion":"sha256:66ba470d48abf0f90c47d32fd22c572d62afd39c137feeff2878276e1d3e0e4a","start":111.83,"end":115.43,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"6f6c1368069376ef"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2016.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:question","text":"二番：環境問題を学ぶ学生三人が授業でのグループ発表について話しています。発表の時間を短くするためにどう変更することにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:f37bfdcc5aac308b474c9ae22a08e9c26398a6ce5e1f4c805cbaa99270291c31","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":3.84,"end":11.72,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-0","text":"今度の桜蛙を守る地域の活動についてのグループ発表だけど、昨日の練習だと10分以内に収まりそうになかったよね？どうしよっか？","textVersion":"sha256:66e9c2367d5652619c06c1965cd30f6e1f187dc1e15e3bbadccbd5cc39dea6b8","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":13.53,"end":24.31,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-1","text":"前半で蛙が減っている現状について説明しておいて、後半で写真を見せながら蛙を守る活動の重要性について話す構成なのに後半、時間が足りなくなっちゃったよね？後半で見せる写真を少し減らそうか。","textVersion":"sha256:bbb4d2ca8a8c380459e86f3242b1e223ec626df5aee26040a38743a981891d62","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":24.74,"end":40.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-2","text":"そうしたら活動の様子が伝わりにくいことはない？","textVersion":"sha256:233fdb75f0bd703a647ea0cb6b1881846ae72947a68a63e2cc6972350d4e845c","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":40.82,"end":44.65,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-3","text":"そっか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6512789ed6959f2b08585c5a20526d51e9036dcbf9c8d6ea1f7db766be59607","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":44.76,"end":45.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-4","text":"前半の減っている現状については少し省けるところはあったと思うけど。","textVersion":"sha256:85abb02d246d8bd42b3d53bbda0a46c23064f5e2b61435e8f3c8109e1b6b279d","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":45.79,"end":50.7,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-5","text":"例えば？","textVersion":"sha256:e7eadb75eadce72d0d59d71b77f3e4288f5713dc7fcc4c4111867bdd5a6f8da6","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":50.99,"end":51.87,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-6","text":"説明で似たような内容を繰り返しているからそこをカットするとか。","textVersion":"sha256:6588b2c0dfccdc04104b95eec6c2a623d350734611383620f7bd4b65224d3cb3","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":52.11,"end":56.55,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-7","text":"なるほどね。他にはないかな？","textVersion":"sha256:9f60a572a7c20f2ca0dea580e19a92e58ccf2f54a0cf9d9db1199f8099f5f8b2","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":56.76,"end":59.53,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-8","text":"そうだな・・・前半の発表は私の担当だけど、昨日は少しゆっくり喋り過ぎたかな。少し早めに話そうか。","textVersion":"sha256:0c07a007c2480cafa27efad3a0afaf048b8c829f8ed33692d5433b75dd67886d","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":59.72,"end":69.65,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-9","text":"話し方で調整か・・・","textVersion":"sha256:3480c0255758a353faf0edd0bc8e8ea6ce244f0d4ef54d4824fa2420073fdfeb","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":69.98,"end":72.06,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-10","text":"それか活動の重要性について話す前に地域の学校でどんな活動が行われているでしょうってクイズを入れてるよね？あれを無くせば後半の時間が確保できるんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:6ca165f33076f126aca237663476efc21f2891af8f2a3be7a8bc8dccf0a2225a","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":72.21,"end":84.17,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-11","text":"いやぁ、聞いてる人に興味を持ってもらうためにあれは良い工夫だと思うよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e6984088b77025adc833f9b2b7754fc99a9b105b80f629e3ebaef3e8abc6e491","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":84.42,"end":89.89,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-12","text":"うん、私もそう思う。","textVersion":"sha256:733ba6e5328a7ba66720a17ec71b3fdeb971378fb255040028e971583267af49","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":90.06,"end":91.76,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-13","text":"じゃ、話すスピードは今より早くすると聞きにくくなっちゃうと思うから、やっぱり現状のところを整理しよう。","textVersion":"sha256:8890691ade28a1a62cd80c408b03063d93954704fa9bd6b68a6a4d9fc6e5ad2e","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":91.97,"end":99.48,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-14","text":"発表の時間を短くするために、どう変更することにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:529c181303f68a2cc837fee2945e91883071dbb28832ce7486541825ffa74098","audioVersion":"sha256:2c4b5d20a586b654fb69e5764a6a7e150ce62cf09f25ece79bd012d0a72dae03","timelineVersion":"sha256:8fba58e382341ea411712a1011fe3ac9b72410129424cf958fc5ec0f8fec1163","start":105.27,"end":110.29,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"6f6c1368069376ef"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2016.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:question","text":"三番：町の市民講座で交通安全についての説明を聞いて夫婦が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:9b0886224a73d7f8fb3d7f23b51f8b291bf3b34fbde181ca9f44f602c4ca71ec","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":3.95,"end":11.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-0","text":"今日は町の交通安全について考えたいと思います。グループに分かれて問題になっている地域の現状を見に行き、そのあと対策を話し合いますので一つ選んでください。まず、北中通りです。駅前の大通りで歩道に自転車が多く停められていて歩きにくいと苦情が寄せられています。次は運動公園沿いの大川通りです。週末、公園の利用者の車が駐車場に入りきらず、通りに駐車するため問題になっています。次の上田通りは近くに小学校があり、児童が通学で利用しています。しかし、歩道が狭く、安全を心配する声が上がっています。最後の山下通りは商店街です。自転車の通行量が多く、歩行者が安心して買い物ができる対策が求められています。","textVersion":"sha256:c37167d5296428828cfd32c990d356490926f78b27608985307a26ac1d999911","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":13.78,"end":71.07,"speaker":"男1（説明者）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-1","text":"どこにする？この前、公園の近くを歩いてたら確かに道路に駐車してる車が多かったな。","textVersion":"sha256:a7262d9fabe525426da1d5a4bb91cfaa4ef074b3b37a076f5ccd10e5a25c9f6f","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":72.88,"end":79.94,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-2","text":"うん。でも親としては子供が毎日、登校や下校に使う道路の安全の方が心配じゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:8d9734a7d02fc1804cbeac2f044357eaca298fa9cf26876912e7dd1edbfc5bb3","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":80.19,"end":87.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-3","text":"そうだね。僕もそっちの方が心配だな。","textVersion":"sha256:e1c7588f961f65736aa170c4982651a7a854622dd2d7b914e4cbbbcefabc7a53","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":87.19,"end":90.35,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-4","text":"じゃ、決まり。一緒に行こう。","textVersion":"sha256:bf7685ca513032bdc5262265f2577813f762df61eb3d4e8fecdf7f8a410f8102","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":90.39,"end":92.26,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-5","text":"あ、でも僕、自転車の問題も気になってるんだ。通勤で急いでいる時、迷惑なんだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:c5e68eaeed12ca883a2b1e170be7009136ce6db3e633d986f42075c27fb599bd","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":92.44,"end":98.62,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-6","text":"あ、商店街でしょう？私も自転車とぶつかりそうになったことあるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e72cb08d9c27533c994823f7bfc5e1abe7ab37b9124698fd1828b7ee63861e0e","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":98.8,"end":103.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-7","text":"僕が言ってるのはそこじゃないよ。朝とか人通りが多い時に歩道に置いてあると邪魔なんだよね。僕はそっちを見に行くよ。","textVersion":"sha256:3800a1833e6859e4eefca160ca44dd5f567aa9f2c04ba1ea8e2e414e3be7fa3c","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":104.08,"end":112.55,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-8","text":"わかった。じゃ、別々に見に行こう。","textVersion":"sha256:45192357b2935f3ccbf2c8be2249a1b656d1fe400349306b24841e9d365e3dc3","audioVersion":"sha256:7d61a3f31866a304b1dfebf4c10cc6bd87e3cc211487283f16dc8c93773190de","timelineVersion":"sha256:1717718cc15f75577421a7abb47376cb5c3b57957936593c4b720d165ffb16f8","start":112.66,"end":115.39,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"6f6c1368069376ef"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2016.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:question","text":"一番：町のボランティアセンターで女の学生と係の人が話しています。女の学生はどのボランティアに登録しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:aad78e0b929068022a60550efbdb22f1489a2bfa5ebda7073f4634265df9b65c","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":3.83,"end":11.06,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-0","text":"あのう、何かボランティアをしたいと思ってるんですが。子供が好きなので、子供と一緒に活動出来て得意な英語を活かせるものがあればと思うんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:1e2be18644d50bc6288d2896cf65610ece36b0af4a1191c71c691473d5db7dc1","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":12.82,"end":23.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-1","text":"そうですね。ええと、こちらが現在募集しているボランティアのリストです。英語を活かして、子供を相手に、となると、通訳ボランティアというのがありますね。小学校や中学校で授業中に外国人のお子さんが言葉で何か困ったことがあるときに手伝いをするんです。","textVersion":"sha256:15e31a96c2aafd9a6676aeb76785ae89ba4643d5e85c02be1ba8a88cafd6b899","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":24.19,"end":48.83,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-2","text":"学校で外国の子供の手伝いをするなんて、やりがいありそうですね。ただ、私学生なので、平日の日中は……。週末なら時間はいつでもいいんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:71769256dd130309f7686c26484e1a52f9ffa6729f37ca9be9054f6c9d9334fd","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":49.31,"end":59.35,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-3","text":"でしたら、毎週土曜日の午後に、読み聞かせのボランティアを町の図書館でやっていますよ。あ、これは日本語なんですけど、子供たちに本を読んで聴かせる活動で本の内容に合わせて歌を歌ったり、ダンスをしたりすることもあります。","textVersion":"sha256:b373381feb8b7d319e75defb99ebd460adc120866ed5879a9571b8d23438b7fe","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":59.84,"end":81.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-4","text":"私、歌とダンス得意です。","textVersion":"sha256:babbe24c816bc2ce3d3c16459e179fc04a4db866d20a1a2cd7c0bbaf9fe2bb27","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":81.59,"end":84.27,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-5","text":"他には学習支援というのがありますね。小学生や中学生が放課後集まって宿題をしているんですが、それを見てあげるんです。英語の宿題もあると思いますよ。毎週水曜の午後5時半からです。","textVersion":"sha256:c1aafe7a9196988eb74bfa156f820e887bf8d620e0edd06a7cc9f7213eb37bb1","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":84.73,"end":102.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-6","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":102.53,"end":103.57,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-7","text":"それから、料理教室もあります。英語を使って、外国の方に日本の料理を紹介するんです。英語を活かすにはぴったりですね。週末の午前中ですから、時間もちょうどいいんじゃないでしょうか。参加者は主に主婦の方ですが。","textVersion":"sha256:6a4c5898ff1a228e16ca5fc190c8ebe3ee5b2acffb023ba6037147816f96e1bf","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":104.07,"end":122.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-8","text":"うーん、どれもやってみたくて迷っちゃいますね。でもやっぱり、子供が相手で英語を活かせるものがいいです。この時間なら、なんとかなりそうだし、じゃこれに登録します。","textVersion":"sha256:46b5e69c259b822597cd71867c61806788efa1888f44b56e03a9c42969b42072","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":122.69,"end":137.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-9","text":"女の学生はどのボランティアに登録しますか。","textVersion":"sha256:47e15efa4339c773d84dd31801ac6a874953cf1f7fea6e96f23af2aaddb44967","audioVersion":"sha256:b578c88d4c6b5c3c6434c4d964f3fdcf17d112adb6bb6607c8cb4b80d5519914","timelineVersion":"sha256:300dec27ba9ef3c1fbc090d28c099f908fbe66de86a9c3a09c157bbbb2920f55","start":143.57,"end":147.45,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"231d434ccccac12a"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2016.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:question","text":"二番：レストランで店のオーナーと店員二人が話しています。店の売上を上げるために、まず何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:56ffa0703a26d3d03e3d673b4f13c2ccf7783f2fbfae064e1bcb2c4cb7991916","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":3.74,"end":9.85,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-0","text":"このところ毎月売上が落ちている、客も減る一方だな。何かいい対策はないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:c6b427b3a232edfe2093c42fcbb1b062bd75a91e85f9ecc3aed017c60672fedd","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":11.67,"end":18.76,"speaker":"男1（オーナー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-1","text":"料理には自信を持ってるんですが、お客様の好みが変わってきたんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:551e43ae13a178afeea6a3aba76d05b9e079ca9eda35ad7a5b6e1cb815649df2","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":19.81,"end":25.09,"speaker":"男2（店員）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-2","text":"お客様からの料理の評価は高いですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:59f92f9f86222d5e67a322ccc11231840d27b746ffb3b5536cca49d8885c82dc","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":25.42,"end":28.55,"speaker":"女（店員）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-3","text":"そう、となると......。","textVersion":"sha256:81eed7872b3e290f79e06e95715a2238804a4c1b1ae0abb399fd790ea31cec2f","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":28.7,"end":31.47,"speaker":"男1（オーナー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-4","text":"あのう、思い切って店の雰囲気を変えてみたらどうでしょう？インテリアに特色をだして、最近近所にできたレストランうちと似たような店ですけど、雰囲気がおしゃれって、評判なんです。","textVersion":"sha256:e60493b0dc5c3b6d8d2f0c298b50b9430b24ddb9c2147f6702b2b6778e2bff0e","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":31.6,"end":45.8,"speaker":"女（店員）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-5","text":"確かに、でも店の中を大きく変えるためには結構長い間閉店しなくちゃいけないし、費用もかかりますよね。","textVersion":"sha256:f19f6f6d1041ab6df2c077bc0faf861fbe5a610de696aa0a12ea97d8a00b519f","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":46.67,"end":55.05,"speaker":"男2（店員）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-6","text":"そうだな。","textVersion":"sha256:22807a340966f04da20a8e8e9d748bcd8e543053ec03e3c94dd9687304827f96","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":55.37,"end":56.49,"speaker":"男1（オーナー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-7","text":"あの、インターネットの掲示板に店の広告を出したら、客が急増したところがあるってテレビで見ました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c8d533f4fbe3cacd66bfe4cecef584b4174702bfd62dac1c6d656e71e6a8e72","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":56.93,"end":63.42,"speaker":"男2（店員）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-8","text":"そんなに宣伝効果があるもんなんだ。それって簡単にできるの？","textVersion":"sha256:2cf6f60f0d8e43f1f1ebb4bd74d0076510a5235337f9f1c46aee9e2ad136b624","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":63.63,"end":68.75,"speaker":"男1（オーナー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-9","text":"簡単ですよ。費用もそんなにかからないし。","textVersion":"sha256:0d104ffa7c7a7e97166e943528d17c8bff1efe52fecd8b4690276418cda73104","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":69.05,"end":71.99,"speaker":"男2（店員）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-10","text":"うん、前にドリンクの無料サービス券を配ったことがあったけど、近所の人にしか利用してもらえなかったしな。うちも時代に合わせて変わらないとね。","textVersion":"sha256:0df80a06802fd5ef29ee846e3c675acaed43cda61715049e8100b577656c3e73","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":72.27,"end":83.57,"speaker":"男1（オーナー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-11","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":83.63,"end":84.54,"speaker":"男2（店員）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-12","text":"まあ、確かにインテリアの方もずいぶん変えてないから、こっちもいずれどうするか考えないとね。","textVersion":"sha256:fa930812e305a230f66a82405aa15c51ffc711cdc0f57d3ab89c2f46d6e12357","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":84.97,"end":91.13,"speaker":"男1（オーナー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-13","text":"店の売上を上げるために、まず何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:5d34749795b23d23eb8292fbe595a3c92dbe1a7e02ffa9d954a52fe77e1ad02b","audioVersion":"sha256:f8a2c73937a2cea4dabb5e8f72fdb1d475950b1103f0ec055f1126d0da00fd45","timelineVersion":"sha256:64f1ee66ac1d8b3737ee13bc414ec897beea413a811a665cc592935d4fea6013","start":96.97,"end":102.02,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"231d434ccccac12a"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2016.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:question","text":"三番：留学説明会で男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:889818863ae4c9b54677ba74ed0b1e9f746d4847e1202d4fdfb752124afa04a6","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":3.93,"end":9.41,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-0","text":"夏休みに一ヶ月海外で実施する語学研修についてですが、受け入れ先の語学学校を四つ紹介します。こちらのパンフレットをご覧下さい。一番の学校は首都にあって交通も便利なので、授業が終わってからいろいろな活動ができると四つのなかでは最も人気があります。それから二番の学校は町中からはだいぶ離れた静かな場所にあります。周りに娯楽施設がないので、勉強に集中するには最適です。四週間大学の寮で生活します。週末は学校で様々なイベントがあり、地元の友だちもたくさんできますよ。三番の学校も同じく都心から離れていて日本人がほとんどいない地域にあります。ここは滞在期間中、ずっとホームステイができるのが魅力です。最後にこちらの四番の学校は授業が厳しいことで有名です。町の中心部にあって、学校の設備は一番整っています。","textVersion":"sha256:57163401f72fa74587b0726a3c3d54a06217cd32f704d8f98cbd9d2777bd7cdd","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":11.22,"end":81.19,"speaker":"男1（説明者）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-1","text":"どこがいいか迷っちゃうな。","textVersion":"sha256:d0229a3d13f9bd8d029cb7f72aa40f1c2f43f9e0e5f0e0a672414a8dfc1abdcc","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":82.99,"end":85.05,"speaker":"男の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-2","text":"地元の友達ができるのはいいよね。でも、やっぱり一番人気があるところにしようかな。一番人気があるってことは、きっといい学校だよね。","textVersion":"sha256:8d3ed529db06d5d8b90d832c8b2fc6ce568725039c80828d6a81a778957d159a","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":85.42,"end":97.57,"speaker":"女の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-3","text":"そこの学校に留学した人、何人か知ってるけど、日本人が多くて、授業以外は結局日本語で話しちゃうから、思ったより語学力が伸びなかったって言ってたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e730060e3123a842c1678bbd96d5fe6e456ae8877588b7c6c29ba5d5da11a99b","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":97.81,"end":108.6,"speaker":"男の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-4","text":"え、そうなんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:7ded4f4e8d6498f9611084e7f1601d3c23921abc4aab2f52709917d05bdd6028","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":108.8,"end":110.69,"speaker":"女の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-5","text":"僕は一度、その国の家庭でありのままの暮らしを体験してみたかったから、ここかな。現地の人の生活を知ることができるしね。","textVersion":"sha256:a9fb2e35862a5b33b1cba9958ab4e2701d8a6d17e3924012ea855a1e505283c8","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":110.88,"end":119.67,"speaker":"男の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-6","text":"えー、二、三日だったら楽しいかもしれないけど、ずっと他人と一緒だとストレスたまりそう。","textVersion":"sha256:d44593769fbb1cf830a07f36535b676175377c747faebeebee93d973c233d997","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":119.91,"end":126.96,"speaker":"女の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-7","text":"まあ、それも経験だよ。寮だって似てると思うし。","textVersion":"sha256:061c6c5ab4781e70a5a9e74b695c1e7b724772af0fc5cba339351bedf5517e00","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":127.15,"end":130.93,"speaker":"男の学生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-8","text":"そっか。私は行くからにはしっかり勉強できるところがいいな。実力が付かないんじゃ行く意味ないしね、でも気分転換も必要だから、学校帰りにショッピングに行ったり出来るところ。うん、ここにする。","textVersion":"sha256:aada37599e4a5d177de8b5eaab42de858d80c8b624132d4a5012fe20539801e9","audioVersion":"sha256:dd2699dbd5bde4262cabcf4fe9fcf8fff81ae8416748ce8f08b84172d4bf6cfc","timelineVersion":"sha256:077a739a8cc0692cab5178cc76d3c3f34138b153270367163fc79c4e47f440bf","start":131.13,"end":148.83,"speaker":"女の学生"}],"batchVersion":"231d434ccccac12a"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2017.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:question","text":"一番：スポーツクラブで、男の人と受付の人が話しています。男の人はどの会員になりますか。","textVersion":"sha256:3e4094b9c1941810d9806899d3b8751a4ae4892d60c6a7576a7137b26f7b5322","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":3.62,"end":10.1,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-0","text":"あの、こちらに入会したいと思いまして。土日含めて週に何回かプールで泳ぎたいんです。","textVersion":"sha256:4543b54aad0fa9fb54b45abd62f3e8e035685b08cff08867893f8b42dbb1a780","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":13.84,"end":21.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-1","text":"プールのご利用ですね。プールのほかにトレーニングジムのご利用は希望なさいますか。","textVersion":"sha256:38dc48b5c09f43dcc13eb63c5b3b19bfa4ed5d642e2630635f7bc34dd228a23a","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":21.29,"end":27.92,"speaker":"受付"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-2","text":"予算内であれば利用したいですけど、月々の会費は1万円までに抑えたいと思ってます。","textVersion":"sha256:6a5b42737444e7ec21a916c21e7d6d40f347ae650d95206e959dde46426825e6","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":28.74,"end":34.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-3","text":"はい。ご予算に近い会員のタイプは4つございます。まず、ラッキー会員ですと、プールだけでなくトレーニングジムも何曜日でも好きな時にお使いいただけて、会費は1万1000円と大変お得です。それから、シルバー会員もすべての施設を毎日、終日ご利用いただけます。月の会費は1万5000円になってしまいますが、専門の指導員がつきますので、人気のあるプランになっております。","textVersion":"sha256:91a1e96694c8fdf6003d8583860e01539ad7f55db392aba0d567bf15b2088c69","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":34.86,"end":66.94,"speaker":"受付"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-4","text":"うーん、そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:0eeb5ecf052fefd740c1727ed758af8ab617bdca35f5c4797b9f9a4b5f333ca7","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":66.88,"end":69.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-5","text":"プールだけをご利用希望という方には、ブルー会員があります。プールに限ってですが、曜日を問わず好きなだけご利用いただけます。こちらは会費が8000円です。","textVersion":"sha256:a5a155484ccbc99d8fa0d0499bcdd8c2f0c57a2be1a6522ccc704d35abcd5c78","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":69.22,"end":82.06,"speaker":"受付"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-6","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":82.14,"end":82.73,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-7","text":"もしジムをご利用になりたい場合は、1回ごとに1000円でご利用いただけますので、月のご利用が2回以下でしたら、ラッキー会員よりお得ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:77f44a011d4e4c9c579babae1861a8b053ecd35602ce91b6d92c7d386c0f0448","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":83.42,"end":94,"speaker":"受付"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-8","text":"えー、お仕事帰りにご利用される方には、ナイター会員がおすすめです。プールが土日祝日を除く平日の夜8時以降にご利用になれて、7000円です。あ、休日も利用されるんでしたね。","textVersion":"sha256:c0ed5fb6f3ab6cb08e752ef6b39836dd33636ee08026c7fcecfa5c79fea8e5ee","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":95.28,"end":110.82,"speaker":"受付"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-9","text":"はい。うーん、ジムは気が向いたとき、月に1回利用するかしないかだし。じゃ、これでお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:73f936ea7e706d4716ade174ca1a4ca619bfc4ee1c7d226a787db84f934f87ee","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":110.76,"end":120,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-10","text":"男の人はどの会員になりますか。","textVersion":"sha256:e4c1951b5b67e070b628ccefd97d0216fcbaa6b1edb573f46cfe048a6b1bad72","audioVersion":"sha256:e44fc343e0a4e53cb7c99406d16cfe5c4445570daac9d184e770bcf1207ff407","timelineVersion":"sha256:d3b952864b9ecfd8885b4ae839323aaef2999dddb11d2731a5ce5b3040eb15b4","start":127.46,"end":130.81,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"4dcd823a67b8a6fb"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2017.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:question","text":"二番：デパートの会議で上司と社員2人が話しています。屋上を活用するために、どうすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:daa87145fd23f0a4f2e1a98a20cdf0044e238918b34b0a7f4d092658cafcb5aa","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":3.81,"end":9.85,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-0","text":"今日は屋上の活用方法について意見を聞きたいと思います。いまはテーブルといすを置いて、休憩場所として開放していますが、利用者が少ないのが現状です。もっとよい利用方法があればいいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:404a17541f57e44dcdb5d7f7ac520b7f4775fc1ad476e1e50aec6ac9ae5b47a1","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":11.61,"end":26.65,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-1","text":"そうですね。この店は社会人やご高齢者のお客様の割合が多いので、そういった方にゆっくりしてもらえるよう、緑あふれる明るい庭を作ってはどうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:05f5a01277d6d02e8cee5d465351cafdd5379b6d5635e1cc9750599331f57dcf","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":26.93,"end":38.87,"speaker":"男の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-2","text":"うん、明るい庭ね。","textVersion":"sha256:9f2e057bba1c4af4d39ad5a1f9a6d7cb6f9a14f1026ff0d51022c8f00a8fed74","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":39.05,"end":41.06,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-3","text":"わたしは子供の遊び場を作るのがいいと思います。ブランコなど、公園にあるような遊び道具を置いて、うちは親子のお客様の割合が少ないですから、遊び場目当てでそういった方に来てもらえるようになると、売り上げにつながりますし。","textVersion":"sha256:0af5d984039199c851bf1bf4d394d92e0f66cb0261fb1bda2601bc68299cff88","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":41.59,"end":58.8,"speaker":"女の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-4","text":"うーむ、わたしはいま来てくださっているお客様を大切にしたいと思います。あ、カフェを作るのはどうですか。青空の下で飲むコーヒーは格別ですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:e2ffe1c9f0d170d23e5cfad64e5948df5437bec787182f3022b9688e4a218b6b","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":59.01,"end":71.17,"speaker":"男の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-5","text":"なるほど。","textVersion":"sha256:e6060d825a6076f13a47cc304d64491b431764116f93db22e8a3eb419858f2a8","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":71.27,"end":72.27,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-6","text":"悪くはないと思いますが、やっぱり子供を連れたお客様を呼び込めるような活用の仕方がいいんじゃないでしょうか。ライバル店では週末アニメのイベントを開催したりしてますよね。うちも家族で楽しめるイベントを行うのはどうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:aaf52a62f4b3cd9609dc8459d8b59ad21a5e0924313cf0a5cb5dc7cfaa1ab6db","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":72.64,"end":89.86,"speaker":"女の社員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-7","text":"うーん。どれもいい案だと思いますが。そうですね。定期的にイベントを企画実行するのはスタッフの負担が大きすぎますね。それから、12階のレストラン街にはテラスからの眺めを売りにした店がありますから、同じようなことをするのもね。今回は親子連れのお客様の呼びこみが期待できそうなさっきの案をやってみましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:7e4deacb67bd5c128800a22747a2b8627ae6470c9d417df33debabfac95fdd9f","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":90.14,"end":115.95,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-8","text":"屋上を活用するために、どうすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:981abe224ee5ebbbe0d851ea02bb415599f2597f0049d36a2bd5f70cb64bf6d8","audioVersion":"sha256:c2fe56350154c2b2bdcae091f6aa1ed3be33b33ad7c6da376cdbdc77eeb0a622","timelineVersion":"sha256:a96d7aae59b94b96979201b322ff9fc03e02a64c9ab1e5c3c698c0ab222835c3","start":121.82,"end":125.71,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"4dcd823a67b8a6fb"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2017.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3:question","text":"三番：市民センターで女の人がカルチャー講座の説明をしています。","textVersion":"sha256:466b32b5ced25ce4ba7886e9d29eba25f3c42fa0400a3f05386b7e1b610636e7","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","start":33.7,"end":40.52,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-0","text":"来月から新しく始まる講座を4つご紹介します。まず講座1、この講座では、ボールペンや鉛筆で美しい字が書けるようになることを目指します。講師が丁寧に指導しますよ。講座2はファッションの色使い、服、靴、かばんの上手な組み合わせを学んで、ファッション感覚を磨きましょう。講座3は着物教室、着物の選び方、着方はもちろん、着物から洋服への変化の歴史や、和室でのマナーなども学びます。最後の講座4は、海外旅行のための英会話教室、生の英語をたくさん聞いて、語学力をしっかり伸ばします。","textVersion":"sha256:e3752f74cbc6f3778ef5a8736b1c218bad60363de145e221de12e3822fcfa6b3","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","start":42.31,"end":89.22,"speaker":"女の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-1","text":"へえ、いろんな講座があるんだね。どれか受講してみたいな。僕、字が下手だし、字が上手になれるのがいいかな。","textVersion":"sha256:0e8714e96696a6828d002a284dbd7eab32e6232fed5cbd7adc832546d1acea5f","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","start":91.07,"end":100,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-2","text":"でも、いまって、何でも携帯とかパソコンで書くでしょう。たいして役に立たないかもしれないよ。","textVersion":"sha256:4f70c2bacd414ecaf086ac9b0309eb9a2ae9bd970c34a92fc693b18a751f6aba","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","start":100.04,"end":106.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-3","text":"まあ、そうだね。真理子さんは何かよさそうなのがあった？来年留学するって言ってたから、語学の講座？","textVersion":"sha256:c3dc5ce0341d97e57718dcb121978062afce06c0c0295e87929b8ad5239360bd","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","start":107.27,"end":115.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-4","text":"うーん。それは向こうに行ってから学べるし、ここでしなくてもいいよ。それより、留学先で自分の国のことをちゃんと話せるように、何か日本の文化とか、作法が学べる講座があるといいなって思ってたんだ。ちょうどいいのがあったけど、でも話聞いてるうちに、おしゃれについて学べるのもいいかなって。","textVersion":"sha256:ff7622dd87cb05180baf8ffc40405c5adc733971eb8793bc98a532eabfc651d3","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","start":115.42,"end":131.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-5","text":"うーん、僕は服装に自信がないから、それにするよ。","textVersion":"sha256:4ef88dd2ca77f7365c48b036cac9e5fd0f0d909579d18e73ed59fa30a955e0cb","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","start":131.92,"end":136.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-6","text":"そっか。わたしは2つのうちどっちにするか迷うけど、留学に備えられるほうにする。","textVersion":"sha256:9e993c0b993e83f1e26aa0ea75fee59d0165b3fbe82b4518943f94493302894b","audioVersion":"sha256:1784216154c130049cac31b8b3c72abdeb87f6e7cb4b40398329b0427e7a9700","timelineVersion":"sha256:ddcfadee3df4262aa6c6932b332087faf9209d0d498ad6993f8aa98c7ac3ac14","start":136.35,"end":150.12,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"4dcd823a67b8a6fb"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2017.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:question","text":"一番：会社で部長と女の社員が社内行事について話しています。部長は社内行事で何をするといいと言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:428dc5f736ded1a28021ef087749569722ca9eefa38d05c58badc75f5b6ce5c1","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":3.67,"end":10.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-0","text":"島田さん、毎年8月にやってる社内行事の企画、お願いしてあったよね。どうなった？","textVersion":"sha256:12cf3f5bb7860a1aa298e22004bc588893d8e6934ff5a99945285023465b8702","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":12.59,"end":18.74,"speaker":"男（部長）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-1","text":"はい。レストランでの食事会が続いてるから「何か新しいアイディアを」ということでしたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:12297561f0d6c7ca06ff81029bde02c37e95ec916fe5fd489dae4d98877a37c7","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":18.99,"end":25.17,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-2","text":"うん。仕事のことは忘れて社員同士の交流を深めるっていう本来の目的は変えずにね。予算はいつも通り、1人3千円以内で。","textVersion":"sha256:33e01ba0162c9ddd80b583e40df05f3c087cc7ffb8415055fad9abd05d4ddf6b","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":25.4,"end":36.1,"speaker":"男（部長）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-3","text":"はい。まず、バーベキューの案。車で1時間のところにあるアサヒ公園でできます。材料費も予算内で収まりそうですし、自然の中でみんなで食べるのって開放的で会話も盛り上がると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:238cfc0b3d7bcd250833fd01f5f5d06f06bdab463cd429abed2624c5cf5fb4b0","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":36.26,"end":51.39,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-4","text":"車で1時間か・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:eaa2bf3e202dcd4f18a4b94370bcf1c4ea039e56cdbe133ba82e525f50197b90","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":52.04,"end":53.88,"speaker":"男（部長）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-5","text":"はい。あとは体を動かすイベントです。会社の近くにボーリング場ありますよね。団体向けに近くのお店での食事がセットになったプランがあるんです。ボーリングをチーム対抗にしたら普段話さない人との交流も深まるし、一体感も増すと思うんです。ただ、予算オーバーになりますが・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:b1b1644cf858e9bfd4eac7d10db8474e55c1301da3cdfd36151681964ad5d61f","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":54.15,"end":76.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-6","text":"そうか。","textVersion":"sha256:59b55ebd3d334fefa3d9ad52455e119aaaf439dcd50edb85f7050b2666bef1f9","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":76.54,"end":77.77,"speaker":"男（部長）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-7","text":"あと、社内イベントとして地域の清掃活動に参加してる会社もあるみたいです。会社近くの公園でもごみ拾い活動やってますよね。社員同士というよりは社員と地域住民との交流になりますが・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:4cae7040c25819f0c02b6ebc6862fc4c3451ce1f48f705de8b88f7ef1bfe9050","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":78.16,"end":93.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-8","text":"なるほど、それも新しいね。","textVersion":"sha256:bd500ba69458cae6b29bbf743bb3a0ffde051e529ad1183edde461a954166374","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":93.94,"end":97.9,"speaker":"男（部長）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-9","text":"あとはいつもの食事会なんですが、他の店にすれば今までと違った感じになると思うんです。予算内でおいしい料理食べられるお店もありましたし。","textVersion":"sha256:8cefd712830178e628fa0f83a692b2879bbeb49f0d14bc5f82bd762fcc91ab8f","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":98.04,"end":107.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-10","text":"どれも良さそうだね。うーん、でも1度思い切ってやることを変えてみよう。で、予算内でできて、本来の目的に合っているのがいいね。","textVersion":"sha256:5f3f7a26452151eec6c3abb3ad2a5e00aee5bb6b1a08330beb1733a7505c50aa","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":107.95,"end":118.78,"speaker":"男（部長）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-11","text":"部長は社内行事で何をするといいと言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:606bbfcfdf3b24f591a815613744c1b304fada718d402dff85d93285199e7781","audioVersion":"sha256:52f65377c13fe2732de822aa39752d190a55db0dadb93793b8d9d304ef5d5447","timelineVersion":"sha256:9c9f52be6dffe8154c58eef37d943003a0feb7d4e9aa667dfdf3a8aaa5f09b77","start":124.98,"end":129.56,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"d79ee3cf644b82a7"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2017.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:question","text":"二番：会社で先輩と後輩2人が話しています。部長への贈り物はなにになりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:08c313cc7e226e2a602aa2e5131b2125d508b4e02dbe5160a7bc02a4bc272ec1","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":3.68,"end":8.95,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0","text":"部長の退職まであと1ヵ月だね。私たち、入社したころ、部長には特別お世話になったし、お祝いを送ろうって話をしてたけど、どうしようか。確か営業部全体では花束を贈るんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:f1358cbffd99a2cd6e0f46a37883b90d89303970bcb4be17a6fe72c289575d9f","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":10.8,"end":25.22,"speaker":"女1（先輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-1","text":"えぇ、部長、生け花が趣味だっておっしゃってたから花瓶なんてどうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:d049e8296530b700498a071325da0c37895af7fbff765fa434c3ad58b6f62d73","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":25.33,"end":31.66,"speaker":"女2（後輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-2","text":"花瓶ね。喜んでもらえそうだけど、いいものはかなり高いよね。","textVersion":"sha256:1576c899416b7202d78eb74d86aadde789128ee14c1acd52d5cdbe3f0bfde30d","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":31.89,"end":35.78,"speaker":"女1（先輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-3","text":"そしたら、私たちからも花束にしませんか。営業部のとは違うお花で。部長、お花が好きだからたくさんもらっても喜んでいただけると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:06a8e196cd544477b91f2e05eab80ef135a89dbe9f14ae3bd83ecb7ae8eca467","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":35.91,"end":47.11,"speaker":"女2（後輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-4","text":"んー。","textVersion":"sha256:0f048f991e93a8a8a6f6f2ed57170c95c129ba53ec8508b4f8ed12946133f5dc","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":47.22,"end":48.24,"speaker":"女1（先輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-5","text":"でも同じものっていうのは・・・。せっかくなのでずっと使ってもらえるものがいいと思いますけど。","textVersion":"sha256:147f50b9f8f7c5438249b5f7f82e600dcce95c57787691f41632312cddb8b09a","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":48.46,"end":54.51,"speaker":"男（後輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-6","text":"そうだね。","textVersion":"sha256:c85cdfda9a14283043e2de3b9a1404b82d3dd712711392e18ee40f6b395adb04","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":54.55,"end":55.57,"speaker":"女1（先輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-7","text":"部長って時々スーツに合わせてスカーフしてますよね。だから花柄のスカーフとかどうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:3c4514c9266a870f3cfbb7d1e5bd57b46bc90e6fca3e16b964c5bc1ac4ed1bd3","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":55.72,"end":62.66,"speaker":"男（後輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-8","text":"なるほどね。ただ、身に付けるものとなると、よほど好みに合ったものじゃないとね。そういうのが選べるかどうか・・・。","textVersion":"sha256:7e20abeb8886bb293f67a9ac3fa2a007ac5e96693224cedb037353cd2f824191","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":62.7,"end":71.8,"speaker":"女1（先輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-9","text":"じゃ、食器はどうですか。コーヒーカップとか。","textVersion":"sha256:3b600c77d480f7c36b3217084313ddf4223334592854efee7fffb4b9e3c2b66f","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":71.86,"end":74.47,"speaker":"男（後輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-10","text":"それもスカーフと同じで好みがありますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:029e8e5c50c8d488b475674b175ee8a11ed26966d2bec6605dd7ea850f2bb330","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":74.46,"end":78.66,"speaker":"女2（後輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-11","text":"そうだね。何でも難しいんだけど、まぁ、趣味に使ってもらえるものがいいかな。3人で出し合えば、それなりにいいものが買えるよね。長く使ってもらえそうなもの選ぼう。","textVersion":"sha256:be71fe5828b63fb2af621ddcc7796331f41aab1d07cdd6654c9a74dab219069d","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":78.91,"end":90.22,"speaker":"女1（先輩）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-12","text":"部長への贈り物は何になりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:0081a1afbe4df0eefaf75cc2704dcf97f5250846998f76833950c45dbeea4ae5","audioVersion":"sha256:146ecbd2339650c8a7328c273251d4dd0a084da024a4bc978fa2c990ca29d82a","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e155e2f7ede234effec98269a9265da0e55249b097a712b4ffee20fda569703","start":96.04,"end":99.29,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"d79ee3cf644b82a7"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2017.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3:question","text":"三番：ラジオで野球の観戦チケットを紹介しています。","textVersion":"sha256:1f8c3185e13ff1670d61d681cf6c8e345bee8e886c59e5d3fdeab49b4b0c60a9","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","start":3.66,"end":9.19,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-0","text":"今日は夏休みにプロ野球をもっと楽しんでいただけるお得なチケットのお知らせです。スター球場では観戦をより楽しめる特別なチケットを4種類販売しています。1つ目のきらきらチケットは試合前に人気選手と一緒に記念撮影できるチケットです。野球観戦の思い出にいかがでしょう。2つ目のにこにこチケットはお弁当と応援グッズが付いてきます。グッズの中には人気選手のサイン入りボールが入っていますよ。3つ目はグラウンドを見下ろすレストランの窓際からゆっくり観戦できるわくわくチケットです。ご家族やお友達と一緒に食事を楽しみながら応援してみてはいかがでしょうか。4つ目のどきどきチケットはグラウンドに近い前の方の特別席で観戦できるチケットです。こちらもお弁当とドリンク付きです。","textVersion":"sha256:968dbcab31490a30fd8658ed140327bcb71b8c425c466e347d6bada534ab5aef","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","start":11.03,"end":67.15,"speaker":"女1（ラジオ）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-1","text":"うちの父、野球が大好きなんだよ。父の誕生日プレゼント探してたからちょうどいいかも。","textVersion":"sha256:e0f834557ed3a284bc4fc5880b71cacda2a928bc5ac7a547f4b857c48bdd1d87","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","start":69.02,"end":74.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-2","text":"プレゼントなら一緒に写真撮れるのなんていいんじゃない？いい記念になるし。","textVersion":"sha256:ca375fca96b99c6043d77db49be4fe911b7b65967e5e35990e4276128cecce3a","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","start":75.24,"end":78.96,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-3","text":"父は写真を撮られるの苦手だからね。選手のサイン入りボールの方が喜びそうだからそっちにするよ。山田さんは家族でよく見に行くんだよね。みんなで食事しながら見るっていうのも楽しいんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:ed18a8e23ab7bc1eff5a0b1992ad958b96cc45193071eb4125b81badee807cd9","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","start":79.25,"end":94.33,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-4","text":"うん。来月行こうって言ってるんだけど、もっと近くで見たいな。選手たちのプレーを間近で見られるっていうのにしてみる。","textVersion":"sha256:1adb2d3554309757ea269bdc028fb4c0b3a483894bcbf02a672e0ed4a9b946c1","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","start":94.54,"end":102.8,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-5","text":"ボールとか飛んできたりするんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:f2a29e6683e2dbc7231edea6f01685def9917f7b256218acaaf15839b33820ef","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","start":103.21,"end":105.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-6","text":"だったらいいな。","textVersion":"sha256:6e4778e8f8bcf82b0aeb1f567433572a6eef15f8c5f3d7e28a6463c044bcd658","audioVersion":"sha256:228028b4cabf01b7f98314d1a32b961ccce608e317da4b1fad80234f144b3497","timelineVersion":"sha256:72529eaa806d1c2ef10c3c0c9cd0011e3eae9598940f032cc2c7f6585b48c7fd","start":105.23,"end":106.66,"speaker":"女2"}],"batchVersion":"d79ee3cf644b82a7"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2018.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:question","text":"一番：家で男の人と女の人が市のホームページを見ながら、話しています。女の人はどの公園に行きたいと言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:bf7f1b81b9000c769c22e84ca6a8c5bb167c002f78d2ec4d72cc7c238556205a","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":4.02,"end":11.85,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-0","text":"ねぇ、見て。市のホームページに地域の公園が紹介されてるよ。大きな公園いくつかあるみたいだから、今度行ってみない？","textVersion":"sha256:ac79e9394e5e021330cf2f003d632947160418a92a7b4bcfb277835fa4537111","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":13.5,"end":22.45,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-1","text":"うん、引っ越してきて、二週間になるけど、まだどこにも出かけてないもんね。","textVersion":"sha256:c7c64bf077744a1e93c8863fcb221ed63f00fa10683f3f9fe9d452d431d2469d","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":23.02,"end":28.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-2","text":"どんなとこがいい？","textVersion":"sha256:fd27fa69b148ffce974106664004073849f9dfe686c847afb63b518720ae9d83","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":28.69,"end":30.07,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-3","text":"うん。きれいな花が楽しめて、テニスができるとこってないかな。ここから10分ぐらいで行けるとこ。自転車で。","textVersion":"sha256:57f1e72ea330f8edbe171c07881869398ab48764245bdf441b326e76dca6248c","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":30.35,"end":39.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-4","text":"そうだな。東公園なら歩いて10分で行けるよ。一面芝生が広がってて、緑がきれいなんだって、運動施設がないみたいだけど、それから西公園、テニスコートと野球場もあるね。一年中いろんな種類の花も楽しめるって。距離は東公園と同じぐらい。","textVersion":"sha256:28a589ba32b9f64cfe700b3482351cc2f08925778bb0a7d6d883848964d0a7b6","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":40.23,"end":62.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-5","text":"へえ。","textVersion":"sha256:5b4758906dde4833d3f779bdfcf51ff70e042a5bc79b305f0b03b3a0bf9c6fc6","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":62.18,"end":63.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-6","text":"それから、南公園、自転車で10分ぐらいかな。スポーツ施設があって、あ、桜並木がきれいなんだって。ここよさそうじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:081cbc55ea4609f2524df40b1e303042a47b621769d8de0a48f5939f0fda1db4","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":63.16,"end":74.11,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-7","text":"知ってる。そこって桜で有名な公園だよね。今の時期、花見で人がいっぱいなんじゃないかな。","textVersion":"sha256:17014184f5ff545440405f275ba51e139c3c3f5d86bea8884e0d0b5ee75cbbfb","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":74.25,"end":82.51,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-8","text":"うん。あとは北公園。バーベキュー広場やテニスコートが充実してるんだって。春は菜の花、夏はヒマワリが畑一面に咲くらしいよ。ここに行くなら、車だね。","textVersion":"sha256:2475f2c7f6b7a91c34107125d204d89e2f8a6ae306f01f4a31bad089b6f7f43c","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":83.2,"end":95.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-9","text":"う〜ん。やっぱり近い方が行きやすいよね。久しぶりにラケットを振りたいし。花は楽しみたいけど、混雑は避けたいし、そうするとここね。","textVersion":"sha256:b8785e57a72d45592cdc786df47329a098404e33d2a06f5d3ac052d9b2fe8355","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":95.9,"end":109.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-10","text":"女の人はどの公園に行きたいと言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6891d1cbb1dad85d49cefb79ecefce037ab87183ef9ee6552de79637cf430143","audioVersion":"sha256:558c3567dfbd7764cdd1a5edec6f1a6b5c386cf28e250a77322dcf9864d67bb7","timelineVersion":"sha256:01cc45a8fa8d0c7df2920802c43a4a37d3fd73d404d26f9a92b32a4a618f31a3","start":114.84,"end":119.04,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"2113385bd6e7f3f1"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2018.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:question","text":"二番：市役所で上司と職員二人が花火大会の混雑について話しています。職員は問題を解決するためにどうすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:ea233376fd6bd8c694d405dc9a88174d9f07a50f62dbc7490bc7dfafc4ac4b09","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":3.64,"end":11.79,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0","text":"今年で二回目となる花火大会ですが、去年会場から最寄り駅まで終了直後の混雑がひどかったので、何とかしたいんです。何かいい案はありますか。","textVersion":"sha256:82d47f581f26d90bd351a37c3fcd92b75d5f4cc3276070d1c53890af8583d918","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":13.52,"end":26.2,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-1","text":"会場からは少し離れますけど、市役所の屋上からも見られますので、そういった公共施設を開放するのはどうでしょうか。そうすれば見物客の利用する駅が一か所に集中しないと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:4f7c17f14b2ca56c77f5f6b1f07bf261f59c3099348a88622f764562480dd791","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":26.64,"end":39.96,"speaker":"男の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-2","text":"でもこの日は施設の警備まで対応できないと思います。花火のほうで手一杯で、","textVersion":"sha256:3cf332eddfb81c5885decdc9cfb94942b1a83c121b158c3cabf1e26fa958e198","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":40.14,"end":46.12,"speaker":"女の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-3","text":"そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:0c8a4c5f2c92f08c67852072ef9bb153aa531128c142727aa22472ab70294986","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":46.06,"end":47.08,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-4","text":"それが難しいなら、商業施設に協力してもらうのはどうですか。屋上から快適に見られますし。商業施設にとってもお客さんが増えて、いいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:694bd5fa0ef876ad8c912efb90c33cd5ffdf6a3b9038087dd9c64d623f6fb777","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":47.02,"end":57.76,"speaker":"男の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-5","text":"なるほどね。","textVersion":"sha256:807a8b415b59bea2e95ab28a6290c1839e5edc3e9c9a2ae73e4cbad2f7496424","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":57.7,"end":58.88,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-6","text":"でも今から場所をピックアップするのは大変じゃないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:61897a0d1960326c1057ba085e5def2152011875ebd0c9c235996149d3b4367f","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":59.5,"end":63.2,"speaker":"女の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-7","text":"そうか。","textVersion":"sha256:59b55ebd3d334fefa3d9ad52455e119aaaf439dcd50edb85f7050b2666bef1f9","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":63.14,"end":64.02,"speaker":"男の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-8","text":"それより、花火終了後、会場から一気に人が出ていかないように、少し費用がかかりますが、会場で何かイベントを開催してはどうでしょうか。有名人を呼んだりして。","textVersion":"sha256:50996ef2f5546c23da613f2ade63a62d4daa4139c3e1de22d803f4d724ee6239","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":63.96,"end":76.18,"speaker":"女の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-9","text":"イベントね。","textVersion":"sha256:8aa270108e10e3d2e7c1a42968208e37996213c55dccbf39b5f1d8cbcd48338b","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":76.12,"end":77.78,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-10","text":"あと去年は花火大会の最後が盛り上がるように大きな花火をラストで集中的に打ち上げましたが、今年は二部構成にして、盛り上がるところを二つ用意するのはどうですか。最後の打ち上げることになっている花火のうち、半分を前半の最後に持ってくるんです。お子さんがいる家族連れなど、前半を見て会場を後にする人もいると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:4728d96ee2db5309119a92e68b3e2259528a200edd43b6245f9ed47f4b4c44dc","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":78.3,"end":102.95,"speaker":"女の職員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-11","text":"なるほど。やっぱり見物客は近くから見たいでしょうから、場所で対策を取るのは限界があるかもしれません。帰る時間に差ができそうな方法がいいですね。今から予算を増やすのは難しいから、予算に影響しない案でいきましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:0c45f221fcedde35f810303e9a7227e60c7ab97a076f56d5084ec66f11731e22","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":104.76,"end":122.01,"speaker":"上司"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-12","text":"職員は問題を解決するためにどうすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:097b3554c778f5c43b1702f5967613d2bc039099b50a46bbf8681cec6d45b066","audioVersion":"sha256:d7a17a2052998e8d57839c10cd52a69a0bb3eaa0aab305313e14b96e49519a69","timelineVersion":"sha256:3cd737777c0d7663370b4d0e92e090078b3d2d02e2fbfb2c65abbb77a04b86e9","start":127.68,"end":132.8,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"2113385bd6e7f3f1"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:47b74c915de52327f981b0f92a32d1c6b469911c45e24a964828473daa78e6f8","timelineVersion":"sha256:cad24889a8c0b985ec5c164648db606b3207e8fdf84600b19066cc8582de75bc","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2018.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3:question","text":"三番：高校で先生が卒業した先輩たちを紹介しています。","textVersion":"sha256:7a3d45b46f2fabbaa75869f8f9b5eacb0921b35bb0dd11b217fa3b02a77f2406","audioVersion":"sha256:47b74c915de52327f981b0f92a32d1c6b469911c45e24a964828473daa78e6f8","timelineVersion":"sha256:cad24889a8c0b985ec5c164648db606b3207e8fdf84600b19066cc8582de75bc","start":3.72,"end":10.38,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-0","text":"今日は将来の仕事について理解を深めるため、社会で活躍中の四人の先輩の話を、それぞれ分かれて伺います。ご紹介しますので、話を聞きたい先輩のところに移動してください。まず小説家の石川悟さんです。石川さんは趣味で小説を書き始め、大学生の時に最初の本を出版し、小説家としての道を歩き始めました。次は中学で数学の教師をしている林さんです。子供のころからの夢だった教員になって、熱心に子供たちの指導に当たっているそうです。それから、西田さんは留学で身に着けた語学力を生かして、貿易会社の海外事業部で働いています。最後、山内さんは出版社で編集の仕事をしています。忙しいながらも充実した毎日だそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:6b8facf5e1a52f5acf11682650be5807c401b848f1db702c15c21eba183652d6","audioVersion":"sha256:47b74c915de52327f981b0f92a32d1c6b469911c45e24a964828473daa78e6f8","timelineVersion":"sha256:cad24889a8c0b985ec5c164648db606b3207e8fdf84600b19066cc8582de75bc","start":12.24,"end":72.43,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-1","text":"私読書が趣味だから、本とか雑誌を作る仕事に就くのが子供のころからの夢なんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:2ce333d4ce8e0fbd6b523c1d607a710f0f56b1a3d9eabd1fc3c26578cad2c156","audioVersion":"sha256:47b74c915de52327f981b0f92a32d1c6b469911c45e24a964828473daa78e6f8","timelineVersion":"sha256:cad24889a8c0b985ec5c164648db606b3207e8fdf84600b19066cc8582de75bc","start":74.3,"end":80.38,"speaker":"女の生徒"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-2","text":"へえ、読書が趣味なら、小説を書くほうは？","textVersion":"sha256:d249050de2b3d4aebab837139897c64fbf6b2d4d5109878f3d6e7973304e65a3","audioVersion":"sha256:47b74c915de52327f981b0f92a32d1c6b469911c45e24a964828473daa78e6f8","timelineVersion":"sha256:cad24889a8c0b985ec5c164648db606b3207e8fdf84600b19066cc8582de75bc","start":80.53,"end":84.18,"speaker":"男の生徒"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-3","text":"小説家なんて考えたこともなかったけど、それも面白いかも。鈴木君は貿易会社の先輩のところ？去年留学してたよね。語学力を生かした仕事をしたいって言ってたじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:e9b67ceedffbc4beeaeb264c0ef5ab5b97f9f0fedb62c088c6011981c28633de","audioVersion":"sha256:47b74c915de52327f981b0f92a32d1c6b469911c45e24a964828473daa78e6f8","timelineVersion":"sha256:cad24889a8c0b985ec5c164648db606b3207e8fdf84600b19066cc8582de75bc","start":84.39,"end":98.22,"speaker":"女の生徒"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-4","text":"うん、実は留学したての頃は授業についていけなくてね。でもそこで出会った先生のおかげで授業もわかるようになって、語学にも自信を持てるようになったんだ。だから今は教える仕事に就きたいと思ってて、なれるかわかんないけど、実際の仕事の話を聞きに行ってみるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f7a706348e4974105b7a9db342e399a40c481f664d082128e11fe3d860479f47","audioVersion":"sha256:47b74c915de52327f981b0f92a32d1c6b469911c45e24a964828473daa78e6f8","timelineVersion":"sha256:cad24889a8c0b985ec5c164648db606b3207e8fdf84600b19066cc8582de75bc","start":98.43,"end":118.32,"speaker":"男の生徒"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-5","text":"へえ、そうなんだ。私はやっぱり前から憧れている仕事の話を聞きに行くことにするね。","textVersion":"sha256:c06964b463066ebf91211c4e89f1fd9fdb747494db69acb7ca8577f9f9e3ea27","audioVersion":"sha256:47b74c915de52327f981b0f92a32d1c6b469911c45e24a964828473daa78e6f8","timelineVersion":"sha256:cad24889a8c0b985ec5c164648db606b3207e8fdf84600b19066cc8582de75bc","start":118.59,"end":125.18,"speaker":"女の生徒"}],"batchVersion":"2113385bd6e7f3f1"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2018.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:question","text":"一番：旅行代理店で女の人と店の人が話しています。女の人はどこを予約することにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:763bed8d1368338edc6c9694a1c358fa6c9d1d60d6972cd3e395db63e8db77e0","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":3.42,"end":9.83,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-0","text":"来月の12日、13日に森山市に行くので泊まるところを予約したいんですが。森山大学で会議があるので会場に近いところがいいんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:776f20bc8c3f48d5e979bfe9d7d1776776125ea2295ad59cd4fd5431463cb070","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":11.34,"end":22.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-1","text":"来月の12日、13日で森山大学の近くですね。","textVersion":"sha256:abf6e184a4da662c90401bc0da159328f41c43c214fddfbca142cb230e46a343","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":23.25,"end":27.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-2","text":"はい。10,000円くらいであるとうれしいです。","textVersion":"sha256:142604024cde2fff742dab21115a76777a84d91cfcd955091e0fc9a7cb19d554","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":27.61,"end":30.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-3","text":"少々お待ちください。ご希望に合うところは4つあります。1つ目は花旅館。大学へは徒歩5分ぐらいですね。1名様13,000円ですが、温泉があります。","textVersion":"sha256:af37298b8556272b378f93196a0a934bb20a68d0d304ab701224682a5c5d424c","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":31.17,"end":47.47,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-4","text":"あ、森山市って温泉が有名なんですよね？せっかくだから温泉があるところがいいです。","textVersion":"sha256:e0f71dab34c53fcc6e50efe0fdee376848ed74afd3ea0edae8b3c57acc081d36","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":47.86,"end":54.83,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-5","text":"あ、はい。2つ目は緑ホテルです。こちらは大学まではバスで10分ぐらいですが、ホテルの前にバス停があります。こちらも温泉があってお一人9,000円です。","textVersion":"sha256:e91e8ec887161cf1e2cbce36c17e17bd48d526e66a2cae9e2aff720ae05a549a","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":54.78,"end":68.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-6","text":"大学まではバスですか。","textVersion":"sha256:573617a472d958fc86adf962fcdd2d9e8ec2a3d5b3f78d711995c6fb5632a4e6","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":68.85,"end":71.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-7","text":"はい。3つ目はアサヒ旅館です。こちらも大学へはバスで10分ほどです。温泉付きでお一人10,000円です。","textVersion":"sha256:81995f8e641bdbc9fd8dc7d413a6ddaa1384b60698867d251963fa69033adedc","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":71.39,"end":80.98,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-8","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":81.2,"end":82.11,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-9","text":"最後は温泉はありませんが、ホテル森山。こちらは大学まで徒歩5分でお一人8,000円です。","textVersion":"sha256:9c66f080c422b675fe7326bd7c8f8c4e637037f442e635a28f080c82e16010fa","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":82.43,"end":91.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-10","text":"んー、やっぱり温泉がある方がいいな。大学までバスで10分ぐらいならいいか。少しでも安い方がいいからここ、予約お願いできますか。","textVersion":"sha256:852ac80b344e4da523881724e48e8a37982a9fbde6c8f0fda403ed0ffd18733e","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":91.38,"end":105.17,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-11","text":"女の人はどこを予約することにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:392cf4f3b22071dcf438470bfbd2f199445220f5ee21ac5257b0b073462a0eeb","audioVersion":"sha256:9afa2e5b64a678ec04209a99ca0e190aa85b8b5cf5dcb53d5bbf091f02a624c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:252875765d1a40d7de3b6e74863429d629e32054731ff5d5cdbc3bf60f18a10e","start":110.7,"end":114.62,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"972167793dbf40a6"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2018.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:question","text":"二番：地域の合唱サークルのリーダーとメンバーが話しています。このサークルではまず何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:c344485ca6c5bcb9e07bfd905d9408254c5a67ced9f6fdc25443c4dffed4b4d1","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":3.4,"end":9.59,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-0","text":"最近、あまり熱心に練習していない人が多いって一部のメンバーから苦情が出てるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:d785a0e08dbb37bc7213ea4d10a6dabf44767c991d0bc62fb34123c1e6aec8ab","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":11.7,"end":17.94,"speaker":"女1（リーダー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-1","text":"長くやってる人が多いから緊張感がなくなってきてるのかもしれませんね。よく知ってる歌を歌うことが多いですし。","textVersion":"sha256:58ed382ed05c2f9505212273085c9b33e63deaf5c2e7b42a79418aa18d47d257","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":18.4,"end":26.33,"speaker":"男（メンバー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-2","text":"そうですね。んー、活動場所を時々変えてみませんか。ちょっと大きめのホールとかに。多少使用料は上がりますが、音の響きもいいそうですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:55d67b91a9a98a6e6421f193ac3e599dc6c9776f1e1f96b12ed147b0d143509e","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":26.79,"end":39.01,"speaker":"女2（メンバー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-3","text":"そうね。舞台に立ってる感じになるね。今使ってる市民センター、3ヶ月後まで予約してあるからその後からは時々変えてみましょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:b490632c6fc6baf15a711da4e44f8f732824ec777ef5c98eb8bbf9c2eff89d0b","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":39.15,"end":49.88,"speaker":"女1（リーダー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-4","text":"ええ。あと他の合唱サークルと合同練習を計画してみるとか。刺激になって練習に身が入るかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:f4e2efc5e7f06c975a3e0cb95d1ee17b5d00a1564ab8c6923d56babf7491d08b","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":49.82,"end":59.86,"speaker":"女2（メンバー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-5","text":"なるほど。んー、一緒にやってくれるサークルを探すのが大変ね。","textVersion":"sha256:924df4391013ef960993dd4595b419e11548ce20a16df3680e4868e997729a4d","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":60.91,"end":66.16,"speaker":"女1（リーダー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-6","text":"あの、何か目標みたいなものを立てるのはどうですか。今までやってなかったけど、コンサートを企画して私たちの歌を聴いてもらう機会を作るとか。","textVersion":"sha256:b26b3087e4b811c24504915fa0053a589e8386d625eac3020949213b5c857bdb","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":66.92,"end":76.47,"speaker":"男（メンバー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-7","text":"そうね。","textVersion":"sha256:c3f3b3a66f174bfb71c18d3cc03ac791ddb58e0cd459c10228f85941d90134e4","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":76.55,"end":77.43,"speaker":"女1（リーダー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-8","text":"または今までよりちょっと難しい曲にチャレンジするだけでもいいと思います。頑張ろうって気持ちが起きるんじゃないですか。","textVersion":"sha256:fabf0fc494eaf63b42366aeb15d799fe90004301c3659060e6ea0f91b9f63a67","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":77.97,"end":85.36,"speaker":"男（メンバー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-9","text":"コンサートはメンバーのやる気は出そうですが準備が大変ですよね。曲なら今度の練習からでも取り入れられそうですが。","textVersion":"sha256:59854f8992970bbf021b8193a4218ef962e606ea8f94f1cfb9b147af0eb01e82","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":85.3,"end":95.22,"speaker":"女2（メンバー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-10","text":"そうね。コンサートは一度みんなに相談してみましょう。練習の場所を変えるにしても少し先のことになりそうだから、すぐ始められることからやってみましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:8084d6b138637c13fe77e43959d4a3d610ba370c19cdb7ac30fbe93225c58de1","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":95.38,"end":107.94,"speaker":"女1（リーダー）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-11","text":"このサークルではまず何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:1a3f28c9eb44506ec8e112689530e19a3cd04b0b7cd056b041902b9343332fe9","audioVersion":"sha256:ade63e17afe0b07591a9b6f9a7c876e6d28696f829641da36c7c79bf6d454fd1","timelineVersion":"sha256:c49620d955ece02a265fcbb433e440bf59757f544848f91dfa9d84eaa438fff1","start":113.51,"end":117.67,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"972167793dbf40a6"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2018.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:question","text":"三番：ラジオで男の人が話しています。男の人はどのグループのボランティアをしたいと言っていますか。女の人はどのグループのボランティアをしたいと言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:32499c61239b9c35d690c328c678618be2248e71a85f95fa156b33055da7484e","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":3.5,"end":7.95,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0","text":"緑公園ではきれいで過ごしやすい公園を目指して様々な作業をしてくださるボランティアの方を募集します。作業の内容によって4つのグループに分かれています。グループ1は花壇の手入れをします。主に種を蒔いたり、草取りをしたりします。グループ2は木の手入れをします。木の名前を書く板の作成や取り付けなどしていただきます。経験者の方には枝を切る作業もお願いする予定です。グループ3は公園内のごみ拾いや落ち葉掃きなどの清掃が主な作業です。グループ4は公園で行う自然体験教室の手伝いで小学生向けの自然観察会やミニ工作にアシスタントとして参加していただきます。各グループの活動日や時間など詳細はホームページをご覧ください。","textVersion":"sha256:797f8961219aac5e008e2f35b4e56973e3ca06f9e8ef614ba8dc833f7f428d67","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":9.72,"end":68.38,"speaker":"男1（ラジオ）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-1","text":"あの公園、いつもきれいなのはボランティアの人たちのおかげなんだね。私たちもやってみない？","textVersion":"sha256:fec8b3cb8b99af0dcd904c8285191fdf55bc0e81d350e8598af3b0cf45efb6c4","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":70.2,"end":76.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-2","text":"うん、いいね。","textVersion":"sha256:af71cd9cee2d6a28f7ffae864a87cb520387cc6ad63947f2cb6fc34e04cc6236","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":77.21,"end":78.37,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-3","text":"私、子供が好きだから自然体験教室に参加したいけど工作苦手なんだよね。マサオさんは器用だし、工作とかも得意じゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:312162516b24db990a95f1527c62bd34fe6fbf28b970d0b57106f3798d52070e","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":78.84,"end":89.97,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-4","text":"自分がするのは好きだけど子供相手はちょっとね。それよりこの間テレビで植木職人のドキュメンタリーを見て面白いと思ったんだ。名前とかも覚えられるし、そのグループがいいな。","textVersion":"sha256:0ad67ca41a1f455f0bc074ce9301e0ead365b37a94fa0e0cb3d9c3d240251a59","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":90.26,"end":104.08,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-5","text":"私はいつも見てるあのきれいな花壇に何かの形でかかわりたいな。それにしようっと。","textVersion":"sha256:8ff7972908356821b1c92d8d59bce22ee904a3a4ec887b24ddad41995fc76bd0","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":104.49,"end":111.73,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-6","text":"いいんじゃない？掃除は苦手だよね。","textVersion":"sha256:908b5c808481a5a7a3e16b4cc4b0713115da3309f88c184458f100158abed593","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":112.06,"end":114.98,"speaker":"男2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-7","text":"ひどい。","textVersion":"sha256:ec60d2a445cd8ab1b274b1f3dbffbd566db7d5261aca127988241aa56614c6e1","audioVersion":"sha256:e76cc0d0750ee04cb75fc7830c759436c87c483e929cb4f2e85046b0c2dd2dd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:fccf820058e7712ba9e00ab59b73925d0f29d92c67ddc49c82257f2d1540364b","start":115.18,"end":116.34,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"972167793dbf40a6"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2019.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:question","text":"一番：男の留学生と女の学生が話しています。男の留学生はどの体験を選びましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:8303ef43625edb510230c2fe41ff2d067cc26d37d55ad0a1fd5fad88e45dfcd2","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":3.96,"end":9.57,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-0","text":"ねえ、松本さん、松本さんって、観光ガイドのアルバイトをしているよね。","textVersion":"sha256:bce88ab15bc52ffdd14fd18d3d5226b0264e286dfad90f412950b080dc9c9839","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":11.22,"end":16.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-1","text":"うん。","textVersion":"sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":16.9,"end":17.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-2","text":"来週、家族が日本に来るんだけど、何か、日本らしい体験ができるところない？両親の希望は、記念のものが手元に残って、日中は観光したいから、夕方4時以降がいいって、8歳の弟も一緒だから、子どもが飽きないのがいいんだけど","textVersion":"sha256:6c7dbef8524a19ad4cf8be7fdb1b23df7a5be5b6583d97e2ad978b80183dd2b6","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":17.98,"end":36.59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-3","text":"それなら、陶芸教室は？茶碗とか、お皿とか作るの、陶器は焼くのに2・3週間かかるけど、後で国に送ってくれるよ。それから、布を染める教室もお勧め、スカーフを染めるんだけど、日本の伝統的な色を使うから、日本らしいお土産になるし、その日に持ち帰れるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:a185f839e8f6fe452f9da382562e8a7455ed082db201e82fb57243d866c3a37e","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":37.1,"end":59.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-4","text":"弟は工作が得意だから、茶碗とか作るの、好きそうだけど、布はどうかな。前に国でそういうのをやったとき、退屈してた記憶が・・・","textVersion":"sha256:957a1cec63437c07257c1fe85014fc91cfa91c5ff1cb2b89f97e51c22ca2cb37","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":60.44,"end":71.49,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-5","text":"そっか。どっちも4時半開始だけど、陶器を作る教室は、郊外の桜町だから、行くまでに時間かかるんだよね","textVersion":"sha256:9f9f88d0157108a31b23897d026433aff753fce74d119ed143ba4872ba701c88","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":71.87,"end":81.13,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-6","text":"桜町に4時半か、間に合わないだろうな","textVersion":"sha256:ed1f77d4d71b22ed3497c00f256382c2839951c8b41dea2335d48ea8d6371de8","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":81.45,"end":86.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-7","text":"それと、観光センターに行けば、日本料理と、それから茶道の教室も体験できるよ","textVersion":"sha256:ab48f2166174e38f43e2002436819c52a686d5b6754065642f5db54f0a9d2bd0","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":87.04,"end":94.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-8","text":"弟、日本料理、大好きだよ","textVersion":"sha256:68cba8dbf60e9eb7786818ea84c6e6ea440383b8ac01ef0223621996321c4a53","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":94.64,"end":96.91,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-9","text":"だけど、料理は今昼間しかやってないんだ。お寿司とか作れて楽しいし、箸には名前を入れてプレゼントしてくれるから、すごく人気なんだけど、茶道のほうは、夜7時まで、1時間ごとに好きな時間で予約できるよ、お土産に和菓子もらえるけど、食べたら残らないね。四つの教室のどれかするなら、私が予約するよ","textVersion":"sha256:134e1380857bc60e73c2a55eca491675fcd721c9c2d189f58edcf83d276ec431","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":97.36,"end":123.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-10","text":"ありがとう。昼は無理だし、手元に何か残るっていう希望は聞いてあげなきゃ。弟が好みそうなほうだと、時間が心配だけど、まあ、その日だけ少し早く観光を切り上げてもらおう。","textVersion":"sha256:d50c17bca34339fde3a83654464a3c35f238ae0dc5e634f5a0cfe6cb567ee298","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":123.74,"end":138.19,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-11","text":"男の留学生はどの体験を選びましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:e8e7448329cd042cae7aeadc1aa073ae4a5b82605b1c0dac985f563647044e70","audioVersion":"sha256:711fe3b8202c79c51b8dfe200ebeb023893a9e1c95ab1b9b8b14e23510af7851","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eda3893db7f2d8898f98fbb169f0096fc18ecd782619908dc3b608499b06ee1","start":143.9,"end":147.81,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"8d64081ab6c26626"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2019.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:question","text":"二番：食品会社で、部下2人と課長が話しています。三人での打ち合わせの日時はどうなりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:f218e32c426d26de84b4d2f01b077c7ef83a564d6f6b46ff059439b05bad05fb","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":3.72,"end":9.61,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-0","text":"課長、りんさん、すみません。ちょっといいでしょうか。今日3時から1時間ほど、課長とリンさんと私とで、北海道食品店の打ち合わせをすることになっていますが","textVersion":"sha256:51b388a20ba462077ff8c33d918d4e5e37409eec6426a00058b0fe31a3b92a01","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":11.3,"end":24.23,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-1","text":"ええ、中山さん、どうかしました？","textVersion":"sha256:98e11e6790b46f346c55707e3b1b22b9cd581469ea5f782ecdc76e828b015a72","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":24.63,"end":27.36,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-2","text":"あの、明日予定していた青木商事への納品が、急遽先方の都合で、今日になってしまいました。それで、午後一番で青木商事に行かなければならないので、ちょっと3時までに戻るのは厳しいかと、遅くとも、3時半には戻れると思うんですが","textVersion":"sha256:6b524b0b17db4ccd76abc066139e6617ea37b08ed3a00f149b4068dbf40f0219","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":27.84,"end":47.49,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-3","text":"そう、じゃ、打ち合わせ、4時からにしましょうか","textVersion":"sha256:7c8bd69cfd89733be766cc5ea2197ec62058aee97c496ddb8818a489b4672b9d","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":47.83,"end":51.17,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-4","text":"あっ、すみません。4時半からちょっと別件がありまして、15分前には出ないといけないんです。打ち合わせ、明日以降では、遅いでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:dbef899c77ad6d2def3ce0434f8b994d4f87d9ff78984e341cc2d753147058f6","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":51.68,"end":62.03,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-5","text":"それが、わたしが明日から急な出張で、一週間ほど留守にするんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f69667ce5107b324dd8a8147ed9057430284f1d07749201fea7def5f21828531","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":62.5,"end":67.43,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-6","text":"それじゃ、今日中にしないと、1週間近く企画が止まってしまいますね。中山さん、納品の時間って、早められないんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:54079c7989a49322883a4b3690fbdcc0dad3d7196aef68c27e7bd88705f9f44f","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":67.84,"end":77.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-7","text":"日程が一日繰り上がったので、これ以上早めると、準備が間に合いません。それに、先方から納品が遅くならないように言われてますので、後ろにずらすことも・・・","textVersion":"sha256:7d7c705a9d2ecabfb7dabe1559bf878350e82e56251c177af62c5b078578aae8","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":77.58,"end":89.01,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-8","text":"じゃ、元の3時にして、中山さんは社に戻り次第、加わるってことでどう？","textVersion":"sha256:552a3ba42fff5706bd61e55e6dfcedc494ae7597dd1f3e3cfbd666aa1394e8ef","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":89.46,"end":94.54,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-9","text":"はい、中山さんがいない間、わたしの方から、現時点での作業状況とか、中山さんの担当の分もまとめて、課長に報告しておきます。","textVersion":"sha256:72822d6cce728c67e009fc2d0044e51ed7318d3a56ecae690c4635eb77f5de15","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":95.03,"end":104.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-10","text":"助かります","textVersion":"sha256:21143d5e851098733b4a00ecadf169bddc4e6cd0b00688609188f8d00e5edfe6","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":105.1,"end":105.81,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-11","text":"じゃ、そういうことでよろしく","textVersion":"sha256:321c9216932b793b2597fccaa497570de61131b1cb87712205cead787aa5a957","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":106.05,"end":107.74,"speaker":"課長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-12","text":"三人での打ち合わせの日時はどうなりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:d329edeaaee24324060403a8e4548dfc64cb6f38fa069936b8b0867eed3b7a21","audioVersion":"sha256:ea5eed2168cc80c5832d201b14a9254bd133b43403dbdcf2bb7a91581a4c3d31","timelineVersion":"sha256:94e7dfd602484a52434cdb11418fbae2d4e7222097ae70e2af0845e35ab5fe4b","start":113.7,"end":117.42,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"8d64081ab6c26626"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2019.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3:question","text":"三番：ラジオを聞いたあと、男の学生と女の留学生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:7a64ef2fe966762b12a1815cc8b18bfb83255ef28776f65073ef5ef2e47b632c","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","start":3.92,"end":11.11,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-0","text":"毎年各地で開催されるちょっと変わったマラソン大会を四つご紹介します。お米の産地、北町の大会では、給水ポイントで、水だけでなく、おいしいおにぎりが味わえるそうです。ゴールしたときには、お腹いっぱいでしょうね。東町の大会はカレーです。こちらは食べながら走るのではなく、玉ねぎ、人参など、それぞれの畑を回って材料を収穫しながら、ゴールを目指すというものです。材料は持ち帰れるそうですよ。南町では、カメラをもって、海岸沿いの美しいコースを撮影しながら走ります。後で撮った写真のコンテストもあるそうです。最後は西町です。山道を走り、ゴールは山頂のお寺、５００もの段階を登りきったところにあります。これは苦しそうですね。いずれの大会も、ただいま出場者募集中とのことです。","textVersion":"sha256:a8af4aa60a6a8ccc98136d2b9d47bfaa7dd7e71623ecb91938cb3abf0eb8ce29","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","start":12.9,"end":73.35,"speaker":"ラジオ"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-1","text":"ねえ、リンダさん、国に帰る前にどれか出てみたら？いい思い出になると思うよ。","textVersion":"sha256:b0c5834fc1f8d3d902e0c7bc69c59edb8ba310a54eb295a96fad63b2702c7ea0","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","start":75.12,"end":81.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-2","text":"うん、楽しそう。","textVersion":"sha256:015fe52a424bb35c81ae411fe616a90f71e8c838f3769909f04c157851a88341","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","start":81.48,"end":82.99,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-3","text":"リンダさんは、カメラが趣味だから、海岸沿いを走るのがいいんじゃない？走るほうはわからないけど、コンテスト優勝できるかもよ。","textVersion":"sha256:8da855c85794d63301e401a46cab2082d44f7d67b48e7a1c774df4e42ca05b86","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","start":83.44,"end":92.41,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-4","text":"カメラ持って走るなんて、落としたらいやだあ。わたし、足腰に自信があるから、階段を駆け上がるのにする。","textVersion":"sha256:c15304c01fc2aa49452adbb44b0a6bfd2e5bbc43c21152a4828a4ee92086cc92","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","start":93.07,"end":101.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-5","text":"おっ、すごいね。じゃ、僕は野菜を収穫するやつに出てみよう。大会のあとでごちそうするよ。腕に自信があるんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:ac0779761664a1df22561fefd08a8e50d9f87beef46846c41e698bc629401687","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","start":101.41,"end":112.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-6","text":"じゃ、その時は、わたし、お米炊いて待ってるね。","textVersion":"sha256:04b660dc493c65fa37a05faffb52ccedddca48b33233e33b9ed3c7d4c3a1def4","audioVersion":"sha256:3437c82f8c3572b017b5d5fda6930bee2a55a215ed65d4ca89092c5bc4b198f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:87b06a361d3359e92a3746b63646e41a0f6c1426a6a832bf9034a041a815ad70","start":112.54,"end":115.89,"speaker":"女"}],"batchVersion":"8d64081ab6c26626"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2019.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:question","text":"一番：市の体育館の受付で女の人と男の職員が話しています。女の人はどの教室を見学したいと言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4f4fbfea5bf59a7372ce65e3c897c2c75beb0490645261a8bd2c381899d2b86d","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":3.7,"end":11.03,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0","text":"すみません、何か軽い体操でも始めたいと思ってるんですが、こちらでそういう教室はやってますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c385c916bf06d3cee60026240b58e1b09b4a3a3074ff4d2d65bdf5cf773dd397","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":12.6,"end":20.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-1","text":"はい。いろいろありますよ。時間や内容のご希望はございますか。","textVersion":"sha256:496c518334c2439052024fda886781238e0e3669e089f017a0676efff3d6e80c","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":20.1,"end":25.2,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-2","text":"ええと、平日の午前中で、運動が苦手な私でも続けられそうな教室がいいんですけど。通ってらっしゃる他の方とも親しくなれるような雰囲気の。","textVersion":"sha256:504fcd056d27eb182c2d9168968bd6f6c83577526f26370c88eed05112ff21c4","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":25.14,"end":36.79,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-3","text":"そうですね。軽い体操というと、火曜九時半からのボール体操。これは直径50センチぐらいのゴムボールに座って体操をします。","textVersion":"sha256:8ee96da8430de2f6daeefc456a6be516ff123c9ef538c9c9cc315b66754a4ce8","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":39.22,"end":49.55,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-4","text":"ああ。","textVersion":"sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":49.8,"end":50.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-5","text":"それから水曜10時からの柔軟体操。体をゆっくり動かして、手足を伸ばします。こちらのクラスは時々参加者の皆さんで交流会をやってるみたいです。","textVersion":"sha256:5a74f2ec0bc44a81301a1aca055f30e19bf19bade571b18efa8b3c92b6bc78a5","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":50.42,"end":63.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-6","text":"へえ、いいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:1de511d3d2d59905931b3df4f41b689c70ea281b831b087217d56c151c83f719","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":63.49,"end":64.82,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-7","text":"それから、木曜10時からのリズム運動。音楽を流してリズムに合わせた運動をします。仲のいいクラスで、去年の秋には皆さんで近くにハイキングに出かけてましたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:77175c618e4bc45263ad4abcb9dd358d2d719afdc74a07bf38faf7c185e1e797","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":64.76,"end":78.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-8","text":"その教室、この間テレビで紹介してましたよね。音楽に合わせて体操するの、楽しそうでしたけど。皆さん、汗びっしょりでした。","textVersion":"sha256:b0e5a11bade5fadeaa3c9289eb43506b919497b73e0d5b7e6105942aa2cd65b4","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":78.58,"end":88.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-9","text":"あっ、ご覧になったんですね。かなり体を動かすので、いい運動になりますよ。","textVersion":"sha256:7ee2c3f0f0137e7865fd5a1e6b20408a93f9b9c0762010eb8dbc1b24d103f168","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":88.16,"end":94.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-10","text":"あとは、土曜の午前なんですが、筋肉トレーニングもあります。講師からいろんなトレーニング器具の使い方を教わりながら、筋肉を鍛えるクラスです。","textVersion":"sha256:0e8f2e0b2c8d62a8af971aaccc69b2b399a6f676e07a4a74b9a17349d31ec8b9","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":94.84,"end":105.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-11","text":"迷いますね。でも、やっぱり週末はあけておきたいんですよね。あんまり激しい運動だと、できるかどうか自信がないし、教室以外にも仲良くなる機会がある方がいいなあ。えっと、こちらの教室、見学できますか。","textVersion":"sha256:aaff047390ef3344d87a585015b74f8cb8fa059beccd1b931ccd76c829d1f345","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":106.17,"end":123.41,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-12","text":"女の人はどの教室を見学したいと言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:14a6a0250012d83b973d79bbf42a118d21a5ae88557a786a4638fdca1a099fd3","audioVersion":"sha256:a13f1565f1fa2bbc5d57b9310164d493b38a060012f29f45cb7205846aff8550","timelineVersion":"sha256:6d68a200570dc4f849f9c6af2f1deee4aa47403f8bb99885c45deb130a693391","start":128.82,"end":133.35,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"ef3e0cd05f16a177"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2019.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:question","text":"二番：大学で、大学祭の係の学生三人が話しています。問題解決のために、何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:1bf088a7c4a7ad08dc09945c7dafbee1341cdcb0756ed9f93c0e96865fe602e9","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":4.12,"end":10.86,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-0","text":"大学祭まであと一か月だね。去年の参加者のアンケートで、ごみ箱の場所がわかりにくかったっていう声が多かったけど、今年どうしたらいいかまだ決めてなかったね。","textVersion":"sha256:a13f91d36c1adcc408346be9cc2606cc0b29953ebea080044528f48e2994b3a8","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":12.52,"end":24.28,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-1","text":"あちこちにゴミが捨てられてたよね。来場者に配った会場案内のチラシにゴミ箱の場所も書いておいたんだけど、チラシの数が足りなかったかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:d56d68a349777f79bf5d7378b6d57b4d28f4ee5bcf6d67ac31cbc1df277b7b64","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":24.22,"end":35.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-2","text":"チラシは余ってたよ。","textVersion":"sha256:7e907af71896b45fd590eb123f67e68e00fa71b190ecdf78685c7599dcb8bcb8","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":35.9,"end":37.36,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-3","text":"じゃあ、チラシが見にくかったかなあ。もう少し字を大きくして見やすくしたらどうかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:8acf5ad10123067444ba2e724c40e26c861c97e3a4008853cfc5036da7c8a637","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":37.3,"end":44.69,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-4","text":"でも、お客さんは食べ物や荷物を持って移動するわけだよね。チラシまで見ながらって難しいんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:87e91b931c7e66ab2b69fba0ea8e969767e63d13342a38e055693951553e9df0","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":45.42,"end":53.54,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-5","text":"それもそうだね。うーん、去年は、会場内に「ごみ箱はここです」っていう看板も立てたよね。設置場所も問題なさそうだったけど。","textVersion":"sha256:9765c63b2d2709f77595def8d902b05a54ab2b6d07e2179ddc3128853b1afbd0","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":53.48,"end":63.71,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-6","text":"うん。看板の文字も大きくてかなり目立ってたはずなんだけど。","textVersion":"sha256:9bc5763cd9deb1fc4e80b64267fc8e027d08ac6c5d92aef92c3e71a502601d20","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":63.84,"end":68.62,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-7","text":"込んでたからね。行列もあちこちにできてたし。","textVersion":"sha256:d30aaa9a24505859c344dc010fc6c88c82602a59c243ffbaaa8d669e9e8253ae","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":68.56,"end":72.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-8","text":"それで見えにくかったのかもしれないね。それなら、今年はもう少し高さがあるものにしてみようか。目につきやすいように。","textVersion":"sha256:fe2012036215c636163535fe8b885dbd3bb44e81d9323cd524605dbe82eaaf57","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":73.44,"end":81.84,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-9","text":"うん、なるほど。それがいいね。","textVersion":"sha256:28f83cba9a1b9e0fc5983a787219549d94efe0ca5e869c111a49416c63c6f9b1","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":81.78,"end":84.59,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-10","text":"で、チラシは今年はどうする。見てもらえないなら配るのをやめる？","textVersion":"sha256:280bc070f0a583a2166a6de422bc903a02ec338b62fa5cba396403b36a3997ba","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":85.5,"end":90.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-11","text":"見る人は見るから、あったほうがいいと思う。去年ので十分見やすくできてたと思うから、あれを使おう。","textVersion":"sha256:fb67458ff49600c340003c137a6127378fdf0bad84ea8aaeaa1eda2b90dc03a5","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":90.63,"end":98.72,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-12","text":"問題解決のために、何をすることにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:f42301562d156e08cbe258aaeeb9fbd45f56a0e2f341e81adb5db6d728fc4832","audioVersion":"sha256:a678db0048740786d908855866a2e95ee0166f697dfaca48a3b93ab33d5e8108","timelineVersion":"sha256:7c5b5dcd28cc4f7fa803958a2191484c7e50d43178643259f5c07052a585bbdf","start":103.74,"end":107.83,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"ef3e0cd05f16a177"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2019.7.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:question","text":"三番：テレビでアナウンサーが使われなくなった学校の校舎の再活用について話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:1137842b87d3cc0824293d69759ebcca88fe84ccc1830025b5ae6ef0ad8af37d","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":3.72,"end":12.13,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-0","text":"生徒数が減り、廃止になった学校、その校舎の一部を有効活用する取り組みが各地で行われています。今日はその中から四つご紹介します。まず、山の中の小さな学校、東小学校は、今、宿泊施設として活用されています。豊かな自然の中で山歩きや川遊びを楽しめます。","textVersion":"sha256:22e9569ff852c754dfed0045709cac9f9c9d4c8e1e0a2b91e50005ab6aa22c74","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":13.84,"end":39,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-1","text":"二つ目の西田市にある西中学校は、地域のイベントやコンサート、展覧会などに広く使われています。2階は映画館になっていて、昭和時代の雰囲気が残っています。","textVersion":"sha256:402a3d068594a39550022c56a5de2d913a72717af6b1c49c5506390c3107a222","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":38.94,"end":53.34,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-2","text":"それから海に面した南小学校には、手作りのパンやアート作品の店が並んでいます。自分で作ったものを販売したいという若い人が集まってきています。","textVersion":"sha256:ce11d60ef83535c9c44e65e2dfdac7b5ce9e2b61570361039d0f01f71c28a914","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":53.28,"end":66.36,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-3","text":"四つ目の農村地域にある北中学校は食堂になっています。地元でとれた新鮮な野菜をたくさん使ったメニューが人気です。","textVersion":"sha256:d8c3c2a5bd1ddee16943e2444ed493045e3b4550fc0a1ad61a872cd561328383","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":66.3,"end":78.17,"speaker":"女1"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-4","text":"今映ってた学校で、友達が今度、作品を発表するんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:812d550feb30f571e25895112735124630b3e0919837ea19ffc139e0fa59db2a","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":79.86,"end":84.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-5","text":"へえ、友達、何か作って売ってるの？","textVersion":"sha256:00abc665f09a6fff0f6a84a3f36ca9e84ac47722e2a7c7914745d666db879f5e","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":84.12,"end":87.98,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-6","text":"え？ あ、その学校じゃなくて、その友達、自分で映画を撮っててね。見に行くことになってるんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:bf41cfc7f2dfca3390df0e8a46688011d4a21b4e6089af1f3604ad88073279ab","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":87.92,"end":95.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-7","text":"そうなんだ。私は一度でいいから、学校に泊まってみたかったんだよね。今度の夏休みに山登りのサークルのみんなで行ってみない？","textVersion":"sha256:e980784246149e079785e5e30ffee3781bb2d2fe841e64490307d73e8a8b3c38","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":95.94,"end":106.54,"speaker":"女2"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-8","text":"え？ 夜の学校なんて真っ暗で怖そうじゃない？ おいしいごはんを食べるんだったらいつでも喜んで行くけど。","textVersion":"sha256:2f249f03529152e0bb125d0251a3aa797e49f5c7798423a6b3d7fea9d4a8cf0a","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":106.48,"end":114.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-9","text":"今は学校じゃないんだから大丈夫だよ。","textVersion":"sha256:eb9582fc0cd7414bf0ad7062bdbee2e87b727e8c7955627cd78c4ba4f156996b","audioVersion":"sha256:aff85e3604164555a29a5d093432a177b804a366a609bcad1690d05f5a84faa6","timelineVersion":"sha256:e63e982cad214aa8a856329afa7c9578679e5e5c02c2a84879b20310e78378fb","start":114.4,"end":117.51,"speaker":"女2"}],"batchVersion":"ef3e0cd05f16a177"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2020.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:question","text":"一番：レストランで、店長と店員二人が話しています。授賞式に誰が出席することにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:be5c42a2d356ab504856936ff66a22d4e49da6909f33f45c9bd491e44db4a021","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":3.36,"end":7.83,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-0","text":"木村さん、山田さん、この間、地元の野菜を使った料理のコンテストにうちも応募したでしょ。なんと、うちのお店が出したアイディア、優秀賞になったんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:b46a460b34083b9756fe63bb6a0ed7718c87e57f5c8846710d428e68b362d6c5","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":9.46,"end":21.86,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-1","text":"へえ！本当ですか？","textVersion":"sha256:7ba0b9e7bf39e7870750a8099abc63baac8540eb2dec4cb03899c17564c7e7b1","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":22.32,"end":23.84,"speaker":"女の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-2","text":"やったね。僕たち頑張りましたもんね。","textVersion":"sha256:672d6cbb16bea753a4581245d30830f6b5f88dd3567f17be3b1f82c66a3cfc81","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":23.78,"end":27.26,"speaker":"男の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-3","text":"それで、来月の一日に市民ホールで授賞式があるから、考えてくれた二人に是非行って欲しいんだけど。お店の宣伝にもなるし。","textVersion":"sha256:8570cf2895deebe19433e43ddf4857f150fd9777e8c52838b8f4a7fca65f683c","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":27.2,"end":36.92,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-4","text":"いいんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:352a2cbe6f2854515a13cc4322bc589162daf51e1b76a22f65191f95fecfae3a","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":36.86,"end":38.08,"speaker":"女の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-5","text":"お店には私が残るから。","textVersion":"sha256:519d5886a053770cff2c62727a4e99d7720624a838837828ee8ba0611d842945","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":38.02,"end":40.36,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-6","text":"えっ？店長が行かないなんてダメですよ。その時間はお店閉めて、三人で行きませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:5e0cdb6b3916c83c86a439c00d04f6ab709ae4f662a98e7ff7e70684e9b72cba","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":40.3,"end":46.6,"speaker":"男の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-7","text":"うん、じゃあ、せっかくの機会だし、そうしようか。","textVersion":"sha256:8c8e38668633d120782e3815ea58e071b0806bd4399185112f71a54ba17770ff","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":46.54,"end":50.96,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-8","text":"はい。あっ、でも山田さんはその日、業者との打ち合わせが入ってませんでしたか。","textVersion":"sha256:29d89c8b0001bfc7308703d828eb97f60597129ea96ad20aad3ae8c09c92f513","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":50.9,"end":56.64,"speaker":"男の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-9","text":"ああ、そうだった。しかも、その時間しかダメって言われてるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:3a531621535ee9ac26413a3affa3b5e25b701a7d80eff1cf59156f5f9bad9550","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":57.48,"end":62.4,"speaker":"女の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-10","text":"そう。じゃ、山田さん、悪いけど、打ち合わせはお任せしますね。","textVersion":"sha256:eaab89ebac68de9a9110dbcb97c11ccedcce961f9c0bafb775b055138aa8f966","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":62.34,"end":68.48,"speaker":"店長"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-11","text":"分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1c40e26e416cd8038c94fd984884319ba396ccc0bd8171f4d1853de5e44d7861","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":68.96,"end":69.73,"speaker":"女の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-12","text":"じゃあ、店長、授賞式の日はよろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:5216a391b6843143252ff4d5fa8114c5952c02cb8c4944af1d8a71e3b361396d","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":70.12,"end":73.49,"speaker":"男の店員"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-13","text":"授賞式に誰が出席することにしましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:310060f6ce4abc0bd30da3e418365434201b3f5e1f45d1c67baba3e3850484bc","audioVersion":"sha256:fb2e944e5c76a6aa1d69f3cbe95bf189885429fdc225f65d350b11bbab10dc6c","timelineVersion":"sha256:0002320cb90528d1edba1b2234b8d803efc6174cdb11a03292a9bcb3754a141b","start":79,"end":83.03,"speaker":"問題"}],"batchVersion":"335e072a720857e0"},"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","pages":["exam/listening/integrated-comprehension/n2/years/2020.12.html"],"batch":"n2-integrated-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2:question","text":"二番：マラソン大会のボランティア説明会で説明を聞いたあと学生二人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:e50f570ba018517b58fabeea5f90a341baf79db8880a2e562ff03da1a4df73ee","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","start":3.56,"end":10.59,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0","text":"この度は緑山マラソン大会のボランティアへのご応募ありがとうございます。仕事は四種類あります。今から紙を配りますので、希望する仕事の番号に一つ丸をつけて出してください。一番の仕事は道の脇に立って観客がコースに入らないように対応する仕事です。二番の仕事はゴールしたあとの選手にタオルを手渡す仕事です。三番の仕事は当日の通訳です。海外からも選手が大勢参加しますので、その選手たちの案内を手伝っていただきます。四番の仕事は選手用の飲み物のペットボトルを会場に運んでおく仕事です。大会が始まるまでに運び入れていただきます。","textVersion":"sha256:b508914b9476cf167e5fd57a246469bbc06d78f0a38784421a2396c46aedd72f","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","start":12.3,"end":65.27,"speaker":"男（説明者）"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-1","text":"初めてだから、どれがいいか迷っちゃうな。私にできそうなのはタオル配りかな？森田君去年参加したんだよね？何やったの？","textVersion":"sha256:a6966cc915cd3c49f7518b9377d2210d70cbc931e55908779109e17ef5583daa","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","start":67.04,"end":79.61,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-2","text":"観客が入らないようにコースの脇に立ってる係だよ。間近で選手が走ってるのを見られてよかったけど、今回は他のをやってみたいなあ。高橋さんは将来海外で仕事をしたいって言ってたよね？通訳なんていい経験になるんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:88359af2ff758d4c0f79db3fa603616cfc14812669e8a8a0027a402270381fb7","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","start":79.98,"end":98.01,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-3","text":"うん、もちろん興味はあるんだけど、自信がないんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:1c42b06ae00c18860a2a8ea557a6a932313e57237deec20de9bf7306cf5925b7","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","start":98.36,"end":103.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-4","text":"大丈夫だよ。せっかく勉強してるんだから、使ってみないと。","textVersion":"sha256:8f95cbd72801825d85efeb7887d3a578e2da095cec3ad90f1773eb0790a3f179","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","start":104.08,"end":108.15,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-5","text":"そうだね。うん、思い切ってチャレンジしてみる。森田君もいっしょにやらない？","textVersion":"sha256:e952cb12459afee55b86513124241b81711f8050de66f0440b65e95e608323fd","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","start":108.84,"end":114.89,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:integrated-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-6","text":"えー、僕は語学の才能ないから...今回は事前準備の仕事にするよ。先に仕事が終わってるほうが始まってから自由に選手を応援できそうだし。","textVersion":"sha256:4af93cebefb29b8981b64d266064abf16c4ee720674608a03c3979e591d3d63d","audioVersion":"sha256:317bddee5b8f89947d99379dda8698d8a852917a4be942470da0d72404a7be98","timelineVersion":"sha256:8756e997e2f47b4973d339e36f2e8d956980c9b58b92ea3ca65a390f3279ec8f","start":114.76,"end":127.32,"speaker":"男"}],"batchVersion":"335e072a720857e0"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:question","text":"女の人と男の人が玄関で話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:62ce655f323a4488d2af9c8891491c73a880e0c3afd354d7ec2e0d94c1b3f4b3","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":5.65,"end":9.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-0","text":"はーい。","textVersion":"sha256:3ac5833e3cdc3d7f955615613a985e95e8892e2b8b39873204e9d05b8d81480b","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":13.5,"end":14.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-1","text":"こんにちは。","textVersion":"sha256:439e44a82b28f76c2661e4e65537f0f3963df49beaed16276f0938471f86a7d2","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":17.69,"end":18.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-2","text":"あっ、どうもこんにちは。","textVersion":"sha256:bf430224a87f1f7065f126c55e1d71acccca1f2ecea45bfeecf664cb2fedae07","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":18.78,"end":20.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-3","text":"あのう、みかんお好きですか。たくさんもらったんで、よろしければ。","textVersion":"sha256:af97dd06e6787c1895d6c796699faac5ce40c60a21a84253fcc31ae4ee6c5b6b","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":20.99,"end":26.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-4","text":"まあ、みかん。大好きだから、うれしいわ。最近、高いのよ。","textVersion":"sha256:52626060896c729763fef60770f168d08d40384f9ede36ee0d84cc6ba08c3a95","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":26.67,"end":32.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-5","text":"よかった。ただ、ちょっとすっぱいんですけど。もしすっぱいのがお好きじゃなかったら、ジュースにでもしてください。","textVersion":"sha256:c07e0f7d0f28428451fd0ddf5c6c1391fcec95be83b6429a6929bc6e27d72c7c","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":32.04,"end":39.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-6","text":"ジュース？","textVersion":"sha256:bc6c894361c24b1711c8fbb4fff4795f97a7aee909c536e9655f21ca698c0826","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":39.86,"end":40.91,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-7","text":"ええ、絞ったものに少し蜂蜜を加えるんで、ホットでもおいしいですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:f5011f75751320c3911e11e5ba24c90aeb0aff557169aa7c12575a3e53c247d8","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":40.88,"end":46.555,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-8","text":"へえー。おいしそうね。","textVersion":"sha256:a059f28324481fb3221dd05be8632e1c2fcd6285e1ff5dbad9f6a40f9a8b3cd7","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":46.51,"end":48.83,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:1:line-9","text":"男の人は何をしに来ましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:e4346d11e2ec94afae695b5e237f4dcb394780c6bdab172ac73ed7780c9430c9","audioVersion":"sha256:ac42b84bc9d06eb9f0bce914b391e78a2102ba62842f3ae28f7fd95e1cb473bc","timelineVersion":"sha256:d226861ca2f85c161e7ee441c97ea42c74be6b0167f90d11d9d5363d4c9a85cb","start":54.26,"end":57.18,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"c2015d1743177357"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2:question","text":"テレビで医者がインタビューに答えています。","textVersion":"sha256:7fb3a956dd7950c7847bb04b33d4ae89d0b5772a9ff47a25470a0251dd2d3e67","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","start":5.65,"end":9.17,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-0","text":"先生、最近目の不調を訴える人が増えているようですが。","textVersion":"sha256:57d0478a5cbfe965241bdf6ce3b6bcf890f7ad47012a6d7577634e3a98edfe2e","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","start":10.93,"end":15.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-1.segment-0","text":"ええ、そうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:fbb6d1bd296e95242401af080876fd37a02e8433ed3b9befcbdaec907003c063","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","start":16.06,"end":17.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-1.segment-1","text":"現代はテレビやパソコンゲームのように目を疲れさせるのがたくさんありますからね。","textVersion":"sha256:29ea5c23c90f1e4160a7720bbac054f95fef911c81e82c824e09a8412010fd66","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","start":18.45,"end":25.47,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-1.segment-2","text":"楽しいから、つい時間を忘れてしまうんですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:003008e7f0dc2e0e3ba1ddaeca55f10fda52108045d13a9d2018a9b992522c37","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","start":26.26,"end":30.15,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-1.segment-3","text":"でも、目の健康を考えれば、出来る限り目に負担のかからない生活をする必要があります。","textVersion":"sha256:ee184aa29b5d109956a1a4fb3f12cb57bbea8891fd2774bf31312b942765d72f","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","start":30.4,"end":37.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-1.segment-4","text":"たとえば、パソコンを使う時間を決めるとか、暗いところで画面を見ないなど、普段から気をつけることが大切です。","textVersion":"sha256:dbd3126a83651364ae58c048214167c12b3ee73c984c936ad54225fe9735b282","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","start":38.42,"end":47.19,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:2:line-2","text":"医者は何の話をしていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:dabc73eb3d058f9426d56b602d3c3a52a2e33cd5bbe68231f9f6d48cf4a54cbb","audioVersion":"sha256:19a4bc77a97a917f7cb4f6321db38e415b6dbb9a53f6607e97f60311d53d0cf4","timelineVersion":"sha256:6e8f64525adf402e1cead9b5556224b7224f095c988709b6a1f2bdf0b46d913b","start":52.82,"end":55.95,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"c2015d1743177357"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3:question","text":"レポーターが女の人に野菜について聞いています。","textVersion":"sha256:40575dedeaa82617514d7dacf14bfbbfeb37f38ebca55d543553f2a9e2de2649","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","start":5.79,"end":10.18,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-0","text":"こんにちは。こちらのお店でよく野菜を買われるんですか？","textVersion":"sha256:887a4f30f288fae61a9dae8d56b612fbfa65695042a6cf3a6a1daa15aa5e0de8","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","start":11.96,"end":16.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-1","text":"ええ、このお店の野菜は味が濃いんですよ。匂いもね。その野菜らしいしっかりとした匂いがするんの。このトマトの匂いを嗅ぐと、子供のころに畑で取ってその場でかじったその様子まで思い出すんです。","textVersion":"sha256:d156344bea0163aa63447445387991f95db7df415ad96f59e20a595b04c5d45c","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","start":16.55,"end":35,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-2","text":"へえ、そうなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:90b20915d6f60ba963bb45aa4411a7aba57ca30f869888cc426ed72503cc866f","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","start":34.99,"end":37.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-3","text":"最近は野菜独特の匂いとか味が薄くなっていて、食べやすいと思う人もいるんでしょうけど。わたしにはちょっと物足りないんです。その点、このお店の野菜は昔ながらの方法で作られているそうで、味もいいし、安心だし。","textVersion":"sha256:e3982576d3ca5361faa98092375093b6368d555b2be680898cb9bf1fc55fa98d","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","start":37.57,"end":58.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-4","text":"でも、値段はちょっと高めのようですね。","textVersion":"sha256:a98333becf36ccd1f0e29fbfd198f8e88a99e1a187d7c44e3a2cd619e3cb2bf7","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","start":58.97,"end":62.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-5","text":"ええ、でも、こういう野菜らしい野菜を孫にも食べさせたいと思って、つい来てしまうんです。","textVersion":"sha256:e4209ab6ffaf9b608c9adddce1de6aa2e245b2b578f6fb9524a79cb24d0a30e0","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","start":62.33,"end":70.98,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:3:line-6","text":"女の人は野菜について、どう思っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ca1f946488c1e0d80f4a9bce1cc88677e0ea238683dccb503cb67c62e3dbecc0","audioVersion":"sha256:0360ae3406a6c9de6b95618ce779ffadc8f69ec5bd90e6bc68378b06eaf56a62","timelineVersion":"sha256:6855ddda7807288dd3867dcb6e4aca0fb0c66196ef0064e38daf852361f10efd","start":76.46,"end":80.94,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"c2015d1743177357"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a100929abaad8efa9b49a4cf16865a2ce250df8bf2343b1c6f20bd5a4dd74c40","timelineVersion":"sha256:b1f469b4cd2d5be39c03e51120e0dc856fbf82ba0f042ee87633338934a567da","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4:question","text":"テレビでサッカー選手が今シーズンを振り返って話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:56934f15616112cc41a742fe67d0ee2927e24640d6a70ddb5cc9e5bcb2aab7a7","audioVersion":"sha256:a100929abaad8efa9b49a4cf16865a2ce250df8bf2343b1c6f20bd5a4dd74c40","timelineVersion":"sha256:b1f469b4cd2d5be39c03e51120e0dc856fbf82ba0f042ee87633338934a567da","start":5.51,"end":10.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"シーズン前に怪我をして手術を受けたので、今シーズンはずっと回復に向けてトレーニングの毎日でした。","textVersion":"sha256:91d909d16ec164307979eeda12a7860b5a04e864963f3e2c206b9e0acf521088","audioVersion":"sha256:a100929abaad8efa9b49a4cf16865a2ce250df8bf2343b1c6f20bd5a4dd74c40","timelineVersion":"sha256:b1f469b4cd2d5be39c03e51120e0dc856fbf82ba0f042ee87633338934a567da","start":12.42,"end":20.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"テレビなどで仲間やライバルが活躍する姿を見ると、焦りと悔しい思いでいっぱいでした。","textVersion":"sha256:6f28ff03b38e14ad15a4392a62f6a98d6f909c20f0cbee7ffd96d9ccf37f2687","audioVersion":"sha256:a100929abaad8efa9b49a4cf16865a2ce250df8bf2343b1c6f20bd5a4dd74c40","timelineVersion":"sha256:b1f469b4cd2d5be39c03e51120e0dc856fbf82ba0f042ee87633338934a567da","start":21.05,"end":27.65,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"でも、専門的な本を読んだりして、トレーニング方法を客観的に見直すこともできて、それなりに充実していました。","textVersion":"sha256:ec3eba406675e2e0a60b9ed23c07e3fbd5711d1b79919c9a822801ab8739db16","audioVersion":"sha256:a100929abaad8efa9b49a4cf16865a2ce250df8bf2343b1c6f20bd5a4dd74c40","timelineVersion":"sha256:b1f469b4cd2d5be39c03e51120e0dc856fbf82ba0f042ee87633338934a567da","start":28.38,"end":36.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"それに、久しぶりに家族ともゆったりした時間を持つこともできましたね。","textVersion":"sha256:89c3cd6be3f5946c44d9595f9246a08bbaaec349dfa5e73dd8d51571b8853e9d","audioVersion":"sha256:a100929abaad8efa9b49a4cf16865a2ce250df8bf2343b1c6f20bd5a4dd74c40","timelineVersion":"sha256:b1f469b4cd2d5be39c03e51120e0dc856fbf82ba0f042ee87633338934a567da","start":37.38,"end":42.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:4:line-1","text":"この選手は今シーズンはどうだったと言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a03ee94b141986711dc238fb24c73a15e7707b3feadc380d8407221ef4400697","audioVersion":"sha256:a100929abaad8efa9b49a4cf16865a2ce250df8bf2343b1c6f20bd5a4dd74c40","timelineVersion":"sha256:b1f469b4cd2d5be39c03e51120e0dc856fbf82ba0f042ee87633338934a567da","start":47.98,"end":52.38,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"c2015d1743177357"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","examKey":"2011-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:question","text":"会社で男の人と女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:923a9edd0dca3c712ccf93b6b364aee9213becc5ae3ce5f3ca145ad75308e196","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":5.89,"end":9.89,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-0","text":"山田さん、ちょっといいですか。","textVersion":"sha256:362e03deaaeb232b979b1a78eeae55e4925143d8bdb5bc23ad5eef4795aa6c55","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":11.63,"end":13.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-1","text":"はい、部長。","textVersion":"sha256:4d3c0b5e4ca4e112086ee12d89fe0bc188679c5e583d2f57938ffa647dfcd63f","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":14.03,"end":15.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-2","text":"この間話した新しい店のことだけど。実は君をそこの店長にという話が出ているんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:62da0efc28760a5672c1ecf12d2cb98317acbcafd30d440f166e199b546cc372","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":15.69,"end":23.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-3","text":"えっ？","textVersion":"sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":23.93,"end":24.49,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-4","text":"これまでの仕事が高く評価されててね。","textVersion":"sha256:f86cd714a62fb14cdda503b6b820f89c3ef107d3b3b65ccc61dfee0bed6f1ea6","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":24.98,"end":27.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-5","text":"ありがとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":28.04,"end":29.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-6","text":"じゃあ、いいかな。転勤にはなるけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:11e2b71b8e9fd77b8043acacd3cf050a42d6a12cff5ab8a038935695aa69f238","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":29.66,"end":33.15,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-7","text":"あ、あのう、ぜひ行かせていただきたいんですが、ただ、転勤となりますと……","textVersion":"sha256:1384a346720fc6e940544bae67f0dcc72a43000dee5d7885ed3f30b7d5a8897c","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":33.94,"end":41.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-8","text":"うん？","textVersion":"sha256:7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":42.2,"end":42.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-9","text":"あのう、実は、最近母の体調はよくないので、あまり遠く離れるのはちょっと……","textVersion":"sha256:94af285d24355f49520e8b94de78c04fb2c88efb84b32820a945967ceddecf50","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":43.51,"end":51.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-10","text":"ああ、そう？でもせっかくのチャンスだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:59d5b55be7c5436c30d258aa29ea30e84c135a7511027857b1fa99549f5a599f","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":51.53,"end":56.41,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-11","text":"はい。評価していただいたことはたいへんうれしいですし、もし店長になったら、やってみたいことはたくさんあるんですが。申し訳ありません。また、次の機会に声をかけていただけるよう頑張ります。","textVersion":"sha256:01e37a921f6be83675d28e32d9c9527bd31e28ccd751d72fd8f34b330aaa9404","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":56.56,"end":71.79,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-12","text":"そうか。分かった。","textVersion":"sha256:eae18bf013b07e45a29eefcc5cab7aa2e76df73110a80e3ef36f80b3108d7627","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":72.11,"end":73.95,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-07:5:line-13","text":"女の人は転勤についてどう思っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ebb248800edfe4b09960f2b57bfaf9174c42dd07a73e90a8ab8d1ca85b63ab5c","audioVersion":"sha256:0b7a1f342a8733f77754d136596083db44fd4aa564e2e8d7f60e818d6cbdcfcf","timelineVersion":"sha256:2b7dec5079c812de910051f8e99d3fc65f34883644804dfa46b931fb6d7f2f2b","start":79.34,"end":84.01,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"c2015d1743177357"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6afcbe320bb72ef69d9f7ceb26a5d1ef7266111b1ade05e5a62b79981a5d87b3","timelineVersion":"sha256:b899c578b80f4ae8116f14724bd5a1f701ea99044df079a86ca760e97258dcc1","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1:question","text":"テレビで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:9f756bd268921721862260545eaa539d59602c111a0e31b74650bee1a57b2a43","audioVersion":"sha256:6afcbe320bb72ef69d9f7ceb26a5d1ef7266111b1ade05e5a62b79981a5d87b3","timelineVersion":"sha256:b899c578b80f4ae8116f14724bd5a1f701ea99044df079a86ca760e97258dcc1","start":5.43,"end":8.47,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"えー、初めて行く場所にうまくいけない、何度行っても道が覚えられない、などよく道に迷う人がいますね。","textVersion":"sha256:96e08bae5cd2e8d46b1919d0e5353dc795e45459c6e208b44c5d4aa699c48d0e","audioVersion":"sha256:6afcbe320bb72ef69d9f7ceb26a5d1ef7266111b1ade05e5a62b79981a5d87b3","timelineVersion":"sha256:b899c578b80f4ae8116f14724bd5a1f701ea99044df079a86ca760e97258dcc1","start":10.27,"end":19.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"そのような人でも頭の中に地図を描くことにより、大体の方向が分かるようになります。","textVersion":"sha256:dbc259b5277d83c673793e6ccccc4b3bafdada56d859ccaab529554bd5791ef5","audioVersion":"sha256:6afcbe320bb72ef69d9f7ceb26a5d1ef7266111b1ade05e5a62b79981a5d87b3","timelineVersion":"sha256:b899c578b80f4ae8116f14724bd5a1f701ea99044df079a86ca760e97258dcc1","start":20.02,"end":26.78,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"よく道に迷うという方は出かける前によく地図を眺めて、自分が通る道をイメージしてみてはどうでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:39db7f99452783d2840e23ec84d759fd846ab9d106726ac17e2662122b9f8c76","audioVersion":"sha256:6afcbe320bb72ef69d9f7ceb26a5d1ef7266111b1ade05e5a62b79981a5d87b3","timelineVersion":"sha256:b899c578b80f4ae8116f14724bd5a1f701ea99044df079a86ca760e97258dcc1","start":27.53,"end":35.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"また、道の途中にある建物など、目印となる物に注意を払うこともいいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:80c63c29fb24e22357e409d2d7a1dc836d9c64a98f9a4ee847ad2fc9de3f0714","audioVersion":"sha256:6afcbe320bb72ef69d9f7ceb26a5d1ef7266111b1ade05e5a62b79981a5d87b3","timelineVersion":"sha256:b899c578b80f4ae8116f14724bd5a1f701ea99044df079a86ca760e97258dcc1","start":36.69,"end":43.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"最近では道案内の機能がついた携帯電話もあるようですから、それを利用するのもいいかもしれませんね。","textVersion":"sha256:b4a9c5156ff9ccf6430f385df6ad88bc8e31267fadb272f1ad3766608357696e","audioVersion":"sha256:6afcbe320bb72ef69d9f7ceb26a5d1ef7266111b1ade05e5a62b79981a5d87b3","timelineVersion":"sha256:b899c578b80f4ae8116f14724bd5a1f701ea99044df079a86ca760e97258dcc1","start":44.11,"end":51.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:1:line-1","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:6afcbe320bb72ef69d9f7ceb26a5d1ef7266111b1ade05e5a62b79981a5d87b3","timelineVersion":"sha256:b899c578b80f4ae8116f14724bd5a1f701ea99044df079a86ca760e97258dcc1","start":57.12,"end":60.87,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b4c695ffa782d058"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2:question","text":"テレビで専門家が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:fd90239367a7fefb1cebb31112f8215f50b609fdb87886d199ab915bdad033d8","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","start":5.5,"end":8.08,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"わたしは20年ほど日本の家庭の食生活について調査を行ってきているんですが、調査を正確に行い、成功させるためには、次のポイントがあります。","textVersion":"sha256:dc67b821f2eb2e22d08a58ab6939ccd6128cb4fd48705039fd16f75222cb1995","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","start":9.87,"end":23.19,"speaker":"専門家"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"一つ目は協力者の方に必ず食事の写真を取ってもらうことです。","textVersion":"sha256:f2022f86ce738387ddb59316ec5d390d47addab821053ccc536a09dbdb914d25","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","start":24,"end":29.74,"speaker":"専門家"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"アンケートやインタビューだけでは、実態が分からないことがあるので、目に見える形で記録をとってもらいます。","textVersion":"sha256:aab2dd33cef65400ba92e95f051285a0252a6fa6a1268a1e7c0db3bc666b2e92","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","start":30.52,"end":38.34,"speaker":"専門家"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"二つ目は、買い物のレシートを提出してもらうことです。","textVersion":"sha256:b8e655632fc6daa211421ec6332cba2c1da11fed124c3d9d4febd23fe2c41546","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","start":39.04,"end":43.45,"speaker":"専門家"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"そのレシートを見て、自分で料理したのか、あるいはできたものを買ったのか確認します。","textVersion":"sha256:b1e89cdb1b26ecb592c3ceb9ab083edce95a827064aefe1f12ef4ef55a2a7cca","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","start":44.21,"end":51.58,"speaker":"専門家"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-0.segment-5","text":"試行錯誤の結果、このようになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:237f075da9df64e1e03f390848353d405ea9b777368899d3855911722c37e2b3","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","start":52.85,"end":56.29,"speaker":"専門家"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:2:line-1","text":"専門家は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8ab96d1fe3745aad91a577790f0983bae1fdf6856443f4bcdf410effaaf10b43","audioVersion":"sha256:ad6092c9fa5c859ae1cdc641d083da32b645ddf606295a02f9f6324577ed2451","timelineVersion":"sha256:b572a0330d7e2ace224f6c79a8933edcdef739ede6d985db7178ac2386565b75","start":61.86,"end":65.54,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b4c695ffa782d058"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:question","text":"テレビでアナウンサと映画監督が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:1c606e5510b7a696fe6109e1452ad784032bd76ad0bf870e2cfd72916a0a1f75","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":5.47,"end":9.49,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-0","text":"今日は映画監督の田中拓也さんにお話を伺います。","textVersion":"sha256:6edb3da3fb84936348b2b1766d13b7090792d6ccfa63619dd935bfa91285d3ae","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":11.27,"end":16.03,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-1","text":"よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:f45d7ffa6c147b3598ad14b10a7e34ad20a6bdfb0139c448e065cc8112c13fd1","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":15.99,"end":17.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-2","text":"田中さんはお父さまも映画監督でいらっしゃいますが、やはり、その影響で映画監督を目指されたのでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:15c8e0f2049054494099249a3958c114a1420b88acd4ede790300f5e20738298","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":17.79,"end":25.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-3","text":"いや、父と映画の話はほとんどしたことありませんね。","textVersion":"sha256:5b520f377f4eb96cd9fe9a3b5f61569d2a5d03843d495a6aeb431fb7b1bf9532","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":25.97,"end":30.33,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-4","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":30.33,"end":31.515,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-5","text":"ええ、子供のごろからテレビや映画に出演してきたんですが、なんというか、演じるほうよりむしろ作品を作るほうに興味が移ってきたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:771fec57dd5042b2e8ced20eea04dc652ea794d6eb423e4b243cd7f1cd8e4042","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":31.46,"end":42.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-6","text":"そう何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:3a7b8b5c954bf08295da5d3b06e1739329dbfe6a44748ec1758b4a908ea57d5a","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":42.15,"end":43.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-7","text":"そんなときにたまたま俳優仲間と自分の高校の時の話をしていたら、それ面白いね、映画になるよって言われて、やってみようって思ったんです。","textVersion":"sha256:8f9978bdc85eb21836f3c640831c114a935629d8c2dc5ac5ca64d7df5eb9f43a","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":43.91,"end":54.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-8","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":54.5,"end":55.91,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:3:line-9","text":"二人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a225f85181050752d24baa271b384de0d503869b8a5f64a94c761909d8ed5c01","audioVersion":"sha256:39dde95db886036ead4daf40ecebfdb0f8255e5e6144566f129b815ddceb69d7","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf7814b2c24a9eb48db6d1e630ce8f568d72b8cdfb071362fbd0fc1a7b44c29f","start":61.78,"end":64.45,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b4c695ffa782d058"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:question","text":"大学で先生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:d6a40421ebac5e8d454723f86999aae63d59a21b9488cf1eeb448791a0758640","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":5.87,"end":8.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"一般的に人間は油とか脂肪の多い食べ物、たとえば、生クリームたっぷりのケーキや油で揚げた天ぷらをおいしいと感じます。","textVersion":"sha256:c85e5a50fc402e458d925ac96cb8dafaf2e462c95440f103ec71e5bfcced200d","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":10.48,"end":21.31,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"油自体には味も匂いもありません。","textVersion":"sha256:658aa3507eae4275e612925ff8b6db30d2a9af56b4e7b2564e4137be466ac87f","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":22.9,"end":25.84,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"なのに、どうしてなんでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:793f42bf6897eed67e36824ca10be043ac7bc4bea685caa84e63e986310868d5","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":26.35,"end":28.31,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"実は油を多く含んだカロリーの高い食品は口の中を刺激します。","textVersion":"sha256:099d014fa28e828674d6536c77c8f36e858789dbac6c22db3ffd4eb745eb7d23","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":28.48,"end":35.01,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0.segment-4","text":"その刺激が脳に伝わっておいしいと感じます。","textVersion":"sha256:0176d463f7b8ed2f47beedf4ef5118966f185ff3ecb055fef0031a50080e040a","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":35.69,"end":39.23,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0.segment-5","text":"後で説明しますが、油は人間にとって重要な物質です。","textVersion":"sha256:deef1afaca43df88bd07a6542702d8d4343f29be2e6ed9362e0e83f26605f3a5","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":39.93,"end":45.44,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-0.segment-6","text":"だから、油をおいしく感じ、多く取ろうとするのは人間本来の欲求なんです。","textVersion":"sha256:143358a9dc3ff4ed2d8d2594a77d8eebb188da12b739b722be4b0d4ada8c2776","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":46.02,"end":52.19,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:4:line-1","text":"先生は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c9af9e016d3216b539f28fec1ec3917b3c078976b5fdb9bd1891d66d61695d32","audioVersion":"sha256:738f92fb0e11d0d790738e14a9dc86df0511f0214ded958d920e46f1e09dd7ae","timelineVersion":"sha256:b10949dccaead83b6a0cd828325884baf7c20eeb1cc829f073d327537c27bec5","start":57.88,"end":61.45,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b4c695ffa782d058"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5","examKey":"2011-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2011.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3782652b4423613841a1654f5dd0e82bfe71024bad28d5fd9122d9c6a321587f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b4c6e3c393023c17122eba0777ed9e01dd119ecf3fb53c1d6e3ca912f8bfbb7","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2011.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2011-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5:question","text":"テレビで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:42a4897a5b0f10ee451c26231b75f9f2859e299e718a6129f64fb54a8ad88b44","audioVersion":"sha256:3782652b4423613841a1654f5dd0e82bfe71024bad28d5fd9122d9c6a321587f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b4c6e3c393023c17122eba0777ed9e01dd119ecf3fb53c1d6e3ca912f8bfbb7","start":5.56,"end":8.52,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"最近はインターネットで本が買えるので、この先本屋が要らなくなるんじゃないか、なんて言われてますよね。","textVersion":"sha256:0b2851487eec873a30de1e6203ff9da37d7de91e3b881142e66d2216d7f508f5","audioVersion":"sha256:3782652b4423613841a1654f5dd0e82bfe71024bad28d5fd9122d9c6a321587f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b4c6e3c393023c17122eba0777ed9e01dd119ecf3fb53c1d6e3ca912f8bfbb7","start":10.23,"end":18.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"もちろん、はじめからほしい本が決まっていれば、インターネットで検索して買ったほうが早くて便利だと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:60595a871aa2d5df81254538f0a0af8be05543090d3e76cbb792f889d099b718","audioVersion":"sha256:3782652b4423613841a1654f5dd0e82bfe71024bad28d5fd9122d9c6a321587f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b4c6e3c393023c17122eba0777ed9e01dd119ecf3fb53c1d6e3ca912f8bfbb7","start":19.11,"end":27.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"でも、私は結構本屋に行くんです。","textVersion":"sha256:2d80f996e8af58a8273e795d726d12d7f7501d7cd2e259e0173b856f95cb73f7","audioVersion":"sha256:3782652b4423613841a1654f5dd0e82bfe71024bad28d5fd9122d9c6a321587f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b4c6e3c393023c17122eba0777ed9e01dd119ecf3fb53c1d6e3ca912f8bfbb7","start":28,"end":31.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"本屋には特に目当ての本がなくても、表紙や題名なんかに魅力を感じて、その本を手にとって読んでみる、といったように、本との新しい出会いがあるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6adeb5f24ab3cc25480f9de34586d73428b1ca8bba6a147f62c5a2da2132e0fb","audioVersion":"sha256:3782652b4423613841a1654f5dd0e82bfe71024bad28d5fd9122d9c6a321587f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b4c6e3c393023c17122eba0777ed9e01dd119ecf3fb53c1d6e3ca912f8bfbb7","start":32.3,"end":46.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"普段読まない作家の本なんかも、ふと目に触れたりして、そういう本を探すプロセスが好きなんです。","textVersion":"sha256:9ad497bcd685b2eeb6bf57be72757e5c4c44d34699d97224f16af5b30f3a04f7","audioVersion":"sha256:3782652b4423613841a1654f5dd0e82bfe71024bad28d5fd9122d9c6a321587f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b4c6e3c393023c17122eba0777ed9e01dd119ecf3fb53c1d6e3ca912f8bfbb7","start":47.05,"end":55.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2011-12:5:line-1","text":"女の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7e8a32195345cb90500b7129a6f116813d5545b0f07a7f6d9b9c168efbf7ed61","audioVersion":"sha256:3782652b4423613841a1654f5dd0e82bfe71024bad28d5fd9122d9c6a321587f","timelineVersion":"sha256:6b4c6e3c393023c17122eba0777ed9e01dd119ecf3fb53c1d6e3ca912f8bfbb7","start":61.18,"end":65.02,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b4c695ffa782d058"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:dfe57c21a39818111ce5c77498ec02d69c3db1bfbb8cf848393200facc0fa03f","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e2c703f89c4bbf26c7426bcc2584a154a558d019f264ad0ee2b573d0402630d","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1:question","text":"商店街のアナウンスを聞いています。","textVersion":"sha256:61dcd6a9c89f9fd586e7ef02ed4158176f7eb690360643405c8b3895720c6393","audioVersion":"sha256:dfe57c21a39818111ce5c77498ec02d69c3db1bfbb8cf848393200facc0fa03f","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e2c703f89c4bbf26c7426bcc2584a154a558d019f264ad0ee2b573d0402630d","start":5.5,"end":8.56,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"明日予定しておりました桜通りの夏祭りについてお知らせします。","textVersion":"sha256:d4d59fb77381929b5ce3ae47b6202fe78b92ae96680388b8615acdfdef55512f","audioVersion":"sha256:dfe57c21a39818111ce5c77498ec02d69c3db1bfbb8cf848393200facc0fa03f","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e2c703f89c4bbf26c7426bcc2584a154a558d019f264ad0ee2b573d0402630d","start":13.25,"end":18.03,"speaker":"アナウンス"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"天気予報によりますと、現在大きな台風が近づいており、明日は朝から荒れた天気になることが予想されます。","textVersion":"sha256:2f994a918a3a658f4354462566b838cbdb5d203394f48a3688c1dd711c29c7f8","audioVersion":"sha256:dfe57c21a39818111ce5c77498ec02d69c3db1bfbb8cf848393200facc0fa03f","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e2c703f89c4bbf26c7426bcc2584a154a558d019f264ad0ee2b573d0402630d","start":18.6,"end":27.12,"speaker":"アナウンス"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"お店の飾りつけや屋台の設置、それにセールの準備も終わって桜通りは明日を待つばかりですが、お客様の安全が第一ですので、大変残念ですが、来週末に延期することに決定いたしました。","textVersion":"sha256:a8798fa41af47d79505f2d32d6a4681da01f0322a1151d15cd80812dc8325924","audioVersion":"sha256:dfe57c21a39818111ce5c77498ec02d69c3db1bfbb8cf848393200facc0fa03f","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e2c703f89c4bbf26c7426bcc2584a154a558d019f264ad0ee2b573d0402630d","start":27.59,"end":43.99,"speaker":"アナウンス"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"来週には皆さん、お揃いでおいでくださいますようお願いいたします。","textVersion":"sha256:fe5beceb947ba735995d2d616d8238c31d7bc86bdf3e47fffa210dab68b0cfed","audioVersion":"sha256:dfe57c21a39818111ce5c77498ec02d69c3db1bfbb8cf848393200facc0fa03f","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e2c703f89c4bbf26c7426bcc2584a154a558d019f264ad0ee2b573d0402630d","start":44.74,"end":49.42,"speaker":"アナウンス"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:1:line-1","text":"何についてのアナウンスですか。","textVersion":"sha256:cc9b75bfd2578fd331072216a205404f45474f89b38164a630d4cbc8847a03cb","audioVersion":"sha256:dfe57c21a39818111ce5c77498ec02d69c3db1bfbb8cf848393200facc0fa03f","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e2c703f89c4bbf26c7426bcc2584a154a558d019f264ad0ee2b573d0402630d","start":59,"end":61.56,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"2a7014846bcafb49"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ad7dbc4634834ad6efcaf4b624cd5927bfb9ac45117ae86c9d6cdbd872ce507e","timelineVersion":"sha256:1c40e9ce6ac9c61b802027060738cd4489eb832376cf4b2652fec40220dd03cc","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2:question","text":"男の人と女の人が携帯電話について話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:7227e5f896721a9a9a26b5b22e6f4d853a9d8224d3166cd86cb00aee233bc1df","audioVersion":"sha256:ad7dbc4634834ad6efcaf4b624cd5927bfb9ac45117ae86c9d6cdbd872ce507e","timelineVersion":"sha256:1c40e9ce6ac9c61b802027060738cd4489eb832376cf4b2652fec40220dd03cc","start":5.48,"end":10,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-0","text":"あっ、携帯、替えたの？","textVersion":"sha256:adccf1eb08cf415a0145378b09486d578c71adec94b72814854d062bbfb6769d","audioVersion":"sha256:ad7dbc4634834ad6efcaf4b624cd5927bfb9ac45117ae86c9d6cdbd872ce507e","timelineVersion":"sha256:1c40e9ce6ac9c61b802027060738cd4489eb832376cf4b2652fec40220dd03cc","start":11.95,"end":14.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-1","text":"うん、そうなんだ。やっぱり携帯一つで何でもできるっていうほうが便利だなと思って。今までは最低限の機能だけでいいと思ってたんだけどね。これ、インターネットが使えたり、音楽が聞けたり、ほかにもいろいろなことができて便利よ。","textVersion":"sha256:63c9f7c03a029b28d61fdd9d897e7de261652b267b77a9137c81896031b449b8","audioVersion":"sha256:ad7dbc4634834ad6efcaf4b624cd5927bfb9ac45117ae86c9d6cdbd872ce507e","timelineVersion":"sha256:1c40e9ce6ac9c61b802027060738cd4489eb832376cf4b2652fec40220dd03cc","start":14.35,"end":34.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-2","text":"えー、でも機能が多すぎて、大変ってことはない？","textVersion":"sha256:d2517fbfbc0c8e963edf8fd6131b022efd02150b5b1b08c36eec2b49eab83f4f","audioVersion":"sha256:ad7dbc4634834ad6efcaf4b624cd5927bfb9ac45117ae86c9d6cdbd872ce507e","timelineVersion":"sha256:1c40e9ce6ac9c61b802027060738cd4489eb832376cf4b2652fec40220dd03cc","start":34.25,"end":39.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-3","text":"わたしもそう思ってたんだけどね。操作が複雑だと、結局限られた機能しか使わないでしょう。でも、その点、これは違うんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:33792394d6a4fe6e673b98a25d52e5e29ee3c7483d0104fe15fb229d2723641f","audioVersion":"sha256:ad7dbc4634834ad6efcaf4b624cd5927bfb9ac45117ae86c9d6cdbd872ce507e","timelineVersion":"sha256:1c40e9ce6ac9c61b802027060738cd4489eb832376cf4b2652fec40220dd03cc","start":39.26,"end":50.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:2:line-4","text":"女の人はこの携帯電話をどう思っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ac80773ef30144f05d379d26a8faa43143655a58b1b8fd1bb255dfea74556023","audioVersion":"sha256:ad7dbc4634834ad6efcaf4b624cd5927bfb9ac45117ae86c9d6cdbd872ce507e","timelineVersion":"sha256:1c40e9ce6ac9c61b802027060738cd4489eb832376cf4b2652fec40220dd03cc","start":55.54,"end":60.32,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"2a7014846bcafb49"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b8e498362ef868eeaee703ca4d6f60ae8c2319d5bb2e375217b408d670f474c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:5057bda88b0a04c2b2a5f7b56e86279621c4e169455267e60d27dc73afc7fde0","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3:question","text":"留守番電話のメッセージを聞いています。","textVersion":"sha256:d728fe489d5eec5329fd99a3488eec2b119032d6d75e62556d232d78896cd647","audioVersion":"sha256:b8e498362ef868eeaee703ca4d6f60ae8c2319d5bb2e375217b408d670f474c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:5057bda88b0a04c2b2a5f7b56e86279621c4e169455267e60d27dc73afc7fde0","start":5.94,"end":8.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"佐藤です。","textVersion":"sha256:3963b78b5ea9f8cd1644c837ee32111ec2b0bfff63802cb32c2b3b034b83e2c2","audioVersion":"sha256:b8e498362ef868eeaee703ca4d6f60ae8c2319d5bb2e375217b408d670f474c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:5057bda88b0a04c2b2a5f7b56e86279621c4e169455267e60d27dc73afc7fde0","start":13.1,"end":14.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"先日はコンサートにお誘いくださり、ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:80bdc941efa5932be3eb245c437337135a8367f87a35d907dd71b9256c5bda3f","audioVersion":"sha256:b8e498362ef868eeaee703ca4d6f60ae8c2319d5bb2e375217b408d670f474c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:5057bda88b0a04c2b2a5f7b56e86279621c4e169455267e60d27dc73afc7fde0","start":14.55,"end":19.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"来週の土曜日は予定も入っていませんし、何しろクラシックのコンサートは久しぶりですから、できればご一緒させていただきたいのですが、ただ主人のほうはどうも気が進まないようで、クラシックよりは歌謡曲って感じですし。","textVersion":"sha256:a3ee4b60f2d1ea0b36575ef84774ed8779c6e0858071edbb6ce7d12b3a614dca","audioVersion":"sha256:b8e498362ef868eeaee703ca4d6f60ae8c2319d5bb2e375217b408d670f474c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:5057bda88b0a04c2b2a5f7b56e86279621c4e169455267e60d27dc73afc7fde0","start":19.88,"end":41.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"すみません、せっかくのお誘いなので、ご一緒したいんですが、私一人じゃちょっと。","textVersion":"sha256:2f8b9a670325688af5f8f8e54ea600d60ba2ce1cc513f8fc747313389d222645","audioVersion":"sha256:b8e498362ef868eeaee703ca4d6f60ae8c2319d5bb2e375217b408d670f474c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:5057bda88b0a04c2b2a5f7b56e86279621c4e169455267e60d27dc73afc7fde0","start":41.6,"end":48.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"後でもう一度お電話します。","textVersion":"sha256:9bfcfe28adb91b51961195045df1a56371e04bc8a4598bd3ccd8d17431c8a580","audioVersion":"sha256:b8e498362ef868eeaee703ca4d6f60ae8c2319d5bb2e375217b408d670f474c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:5057bda88b0a04c2b2a5f7b56e86279621c4e169455267e60d27dc73afc7fde0","start":49.35,"end":51.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:3:line-1","text":"留守番電話の内容はどのようなことですか。","textVersion":"sha256:46a7eb09d3b0cb0511c33d234948ac6ac6986b7d3caf4109a54aa08c4c41b746","audioVersion":"sha256:b8e498362ef868eeaee703ca4d6f60ae8c2319d5bb2e375217b408d670f474c6","timelineVersion":"sha256:5057bda88b0a04c2b2a5f7b56e86279621c4e169455267e60d27dc73afc7fde0","start":60.2,"end":64.46,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"2a7014846bcafb49"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:question","text":"会社の食堂で女の人と男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:355f68355f18192b8cfd5f3704c6562c1ed59280e77d161263f17a9f0abc9e29","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":5.78,"end":10.41,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-0","text":"ねぇ、昨日内の課で歓迎会あってね。","textVersion":"sha256:a86f102e3b461fe5f09cba20ea1c0fc5790e5b6c96b5c2be40854a8b90825e87","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":14.16,"end":17.375,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-1","text":"ああ、新しい課長の？","textVersion":"sha256:c365472e0fe2e3b3e7b66f464a08c7edb8408233097982120edd71c9e2f05c57","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":17.315,"end":19.41,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-2","text":"うん。で、私、この間課長のこと、無口でちょっと怖いって言ったでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:4003388468588c2d4d5154c4441383d736683edfe6d380ebeebedacdd1e7f229","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":19.36,"end":25.125,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-3","text":"うん、言ってたね。ちょっと暗いんでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:2a777521db620b9949e473abee3530aac2ef75c4be08dd5eabebfba78208d89b","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":25.065,"end":28,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-4","text":"そうだったんだけど、はじめて仕事と関係ない話したら、びっくりしちゃって。","textVersion":"sha256:ba2cfe57cb4e387865635304f28510f2c3d21eaeec34e5b5f47b1b5d1819c02c","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":28.13,"end":33.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-5","text":"へえ、やっぱり仕事中とは違う？","textVersion":"sha256:b23ce44c1aef7a2c6806c327fe2c9e6bfe0ddbf1c0e522491547c0084e6ffb5e","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":33.46,"end":36.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-6","text":"うん、話題も豊富だし、冗談言って笑わせるのもうまいし。","textVersion":"sha256:ff373f0125ff63d9facdd1b467f983d8d1cf0ce1c2bfd12f0f4a5c39a0ef479d","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":36.38,"end":41.21,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-7","text":"そうなんだ。いままでは緊張してたってことかな。","textVersion":"sha256:d2fc266addbae729abb19b90b8ccad9deda6160ecce791b53b9d0d0ed1f8f821","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":41.28,"end":44.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:4:line-8","text":"女の人は課長についてどう思っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0dbea1f879bf916b4b1219493e8890f41346880a9f56277cdf723eb6d6ce7397","audioVersion":"sha256:7bac301c479bc15a6920acaaeddfa9fa6f23d47351f69645e787189773c2452a","timelineVersion":"sha256:ef58245288cd9b3951de5f80ee184a350e0ef21e08c7b27c17a044472eb067ba","start":52.46,"end":56.38,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"2a7014846bcafb49"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5","examKey":"2012-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:acb8ea61422c328395db2b55da0bfa11585303c4226567a6908fc77e6e96e5c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3cd419d9aa9663a39248c589224ba8448888dfc93128a3ebd075befd8f88456","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5:question","text":"電気屋の店員が新しい掃除機について説明しています。","textVersion":"sha256:c9d3e8d6c84ec73ae25f39c5eb2f964d81b66ad509431fc58bb547262aa26ae1","audioVersion":"sha256:acb8ea61422c328395db2b55da0bfa11585303c4226567a6908fc77e6e96e5c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3cd419d9aa9663a39248c589224ba8448888dfc93128a3ebd075befd8f88456","start":5.84,"end":10.76,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"えー、この掃除機は騒音が小さく、テレビを見ている部屋で使っても邪魔になりません。","textVersion":"sha256:c6ba1f9d37feec680e737cd5c2469709ef91e5fd856680a415dace9345e50c65","audioVersion":"sha256:acb8ea61422c328395db2b55da0bfa11585303c4226567a6908fc77e6e96e5c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3cd419d9aa9663a39248c589224ba8448888dfc93128a3ebd075befd8f88456","start":14.7,"end":23.235,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"それに、とても軽く、階段でも楽に持ち運べます。","textVersion":"sha256:c740cd08a2efe547ded8afc342d0b3672134565cdeeb6e255b0227e9754f4278","audioVersion":"sha256:acb8ea61422c328395db2b55da0bfa11585303c4226567a6908fc77e6e96e5c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3cd419d9aa9663a39248c589224ba8448888dfc93128a3ebd075befd8f88456","start":23.175,"end":27.33,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"さらに、この商品の一番素晴らしい点はですね、部屋の空気を汚さないことです。","textVersion":"sha256:86c4e18b66a0e902c6c0d0e1cc70ca5a7e499ca2e64c8d2e736892dcf06fa566","audioVersion":"sha256:acb8ea61422c328395db2b55da0bfa11585303c4226567a6908fc77e6e96e5c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3cd419d9aa9663a39248c589224ba8448888dfc93128a3ebd075befd8f88456","start":28.21,"end":34.45,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"汚れは掃除機の中で、このようにゴミときれいな空気に分けられ、外にはきれいな空気しか出ていきません。","textVersion":"sha256:51d982ff3b3b9501d486bcdf7d6ebb5de7667f5cc90ec591aa087cf8bc92ad14","audioVersion":"sha256:acb8ea61422c328395db2b55da0bfa11585303c4226567a6908fc77e6e96e5c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3cd419d9aa9663a39248c589224ba8448888dfc93128a3ebd075befd8f88456","start":35.11,"end":44.16,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"うーん、今までのものより価格は少し高めですが、赤ちゃんがいるご家庭にもぜひお勧めしたい商品です。","textVersion":"sha256:f2f4dc9143e7e179c28a117ecc96c373eef8a55f07c8e2b7abede65bf03b022a","audioVersion":"sha256:acb8ea61422c328395db2b55da0bfa11585303c4226567a6908fc77e6e96e5c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3cd419d9aa9663a39248c589224ba8448888dfc93128a3ebd075befd8f88456","start":44.7,"end":52.46,"speaker":"店員"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-07:5:line-1","text":"電気屋の店員は主に何について話していましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:608da4370b727e3583ec255bd7022e51640854ad0b95c513bb03e0886050759a","audioVersion":"sha256:acb8ea61422c328395db2b55da0bfa11585303c4226567a6908fc77e6e96e5c7","timelineVersion":"sha256:b3cd419d9aa9663a39248c589224ba8448888dfc93128a3ebd075befd8f88456","start":60,"end":65.28,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"2a7014846bcafb49"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1:question","text":"講演会で医者が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:b34d57bd202471f83fe9f5d9a26919a1815ee5e73615e1bc872eac7332ba8bd0","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","start":5.86,"end":8.29,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"皆さん、毎日笑っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:3ecdf10d1142c85fc70c39c0d122db40de20121d488d1e6171cad8a3153c8e86","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","start":10.1,"end":12.65,"speaker":"医者"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"医学の進歩により笑いのよさがだんだん証明されてきています。","textVersion":"sha256:31549bca61173829b1bb3b8f4d582dc8d4ebf8736b09fa38b4f0a72863c56910","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","start":13.49,"end":18.21,"speaker":"医者"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"笑うことでストレスが減少するということは皆さん聞いたことがあるかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:02246609742f1478253f08301b767d2450559ede56ecbd3363c9580b1bdfa3d0","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","start":18.81,"end":24.09,"speaker":"医者"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"また不思議なことに、楽しいことがなくてもにこにこしているだけで健康にいい効果があるということも分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:a9385ff52b29dc4579c818ebcc7b5602a49d7aabd7892e68df34021b12618354","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","start":24.62,"end":32.45,"speaker":"医者"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"忙しい毎日を送っている現代人に、面白いことなどない日もあるかもしれませんが、運動のつもりで一日一回ぐらい大声で笑ってみることをお勧めします。","textVersion":"sha256:8bb5504041366681fa6c429361896cc732e48b6479a15375cb02c6dc92c94122","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","start":33.23,"end":44.63,"speaker":"医者"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-0.segment-5","text":"私も普段から患者さんに笑ってもらえるよう努力しているんです。","textVersion":"sha256:3bbb8208575720e4431ce430a865c8fab9321835d52312583b080863098e427c","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","start":45.33,"end":50.01,"speaker":"医者"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:1:line-1","text":"医者は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4adc4ece184eac9f1d27e7af2c29a6c09cd428346ad6d231851d9b3413f25dce","audioVersion":"sha256:a000d91a1d70ad125ae9e6df2d56192aab39e7a36e1abe874de77930f0b9a108","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1d07f0e12418bae3c6262a2cbeb14d774a02e25796fae4e8758270d09790efc","start":55.38,"end":59.01,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"912f26bfcd54ef9c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:question","text":"テレビで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:42a4897a5b0f10ee451c26231b75f9f2859e299e718a6129f64fb54a8ad88b44","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":5.65,"end":8.18,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"皆さんは出世魚という言葉を聞いたことがありますか。","textVersion":"sha256:40494c234977a2e5606533014bf4d02a62fac85b476fb67f46780dae529f3564","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":9.92,"end":14.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"出世魚は出世する魚と書きます。","textVersion":"sha256:f1ef7c17c4a8569e39ef8c85ae8d5217a445ae8da92a744d311f47927570792b","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":14.67,"end":17.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"出世するといっても、魚が社長になるわけではありません。","textVersion":"sha256:ab5a64b9df1b99b8c5d9d8f839368017a273404b69e28a58cf8ac737a8ecb4da","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":18.51,"end":22.53,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"成長に応じて名前が変化するためこのように言われています。","textVersion":"sha256:5b7a43059910f8ee4ae17cffc267bcadcd401dd36b73ec5cf17c0f977dda3616","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":23.28,"end":27.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"出世魚にはいろいろ種類があり、代表的なブリという魚は小さい時はワカシと呼ばれ、成長するにつれて、イナダ、ワラサ、ブリと名前を変えます。","textVersion":"sha256:ab38ca17659dacad5b0820e3f6290c568ce144e8d0f5ee1ecf43ef8e36cd41c8","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":28.25,"end":41.19,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0.segment-5","text":"昔、日本人は成長や出世に伴って名前を変える習慣がありました。","textVersion":"sha256:3f9b5bdeccf927581ae04f4bff2eb40b8ecbdaa8acf40e64087bd18eca7b44aa","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":42.22,"end":48.06,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-0.segment-6","text":"魚の場合も同じようだということで、出世魚といわれるようになったのです。","textVersion":"sha256:87df199856ab01b1688bde72cf66d3d8c21fb215c9dd7e7163cfd75353f94cf3","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":48.79,"end":54.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:2:line-1","text":"女の人は主に出世魚の何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:25d7ee3e5ea62ae0132cab5fb070a5844e872de096a78e812edada869631391f","audioVersion":"sha256:5cbe24010d0e5574e826152e05b9eccdec5f7dc888cead30df412d9af546e663","timelineVersion":"sha256:227900d76721d294be8b987b61ed4b5530d5ad6b171c9ca4738289f65ab64218","start":59.68,"end":64.38,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"912f26bfcd54ef9c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6db57e213c427d1ba65d6576fc9ad34ecc7cc556f237aa4d88594637269f2a1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:827ebacd3b144b6364b342e4bb4b40e3ceac8ad67511d745fb3b7811726d4499","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3:question","text":"大学の授業で先生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:1a330a131610dffa65672f76bec088c9290a36417493b33616f90596e6cb5d6e","audioVersion":"sha256:6db57e213c427d1ba65d6576fc9ad34ecc7cc556f237aa4d88594637269f2a1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:827ebacd3b144b6364b342e4bb4b40e3ceac8ad67511d745fb3b7811726d4499","start":4.74,"end":9.15,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"ええ、ある考えが科学的と言えるかどうかを判断する際には慎重でなければなりません。","textVersion":"sha256:ea7373b48399112f91eab09881f70056aac48f93e509e2f8c3695a8ace03ab2d","audioVersion":"sha256:6db57e213c427d1ba65d6576fc9ad34ecc7cc556f237aa4d88594637269f2a1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:827ebacd3b144b6364b342e4bb4b40e3ceac8ad67511d745fb3b7811726d4499","start":10.9,"end":17.75,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"例えば、偶然が重なることには何かの原因やつながりがあるのではないかと考える学者もいますが。","textVersion":"sha256:1e02f4f29e48c5e5fa3a62ca5466fddc2bdae0cebbe0fb1805f9675d460ec916","audioVersion":"sha256:6db57e213c427d1ba65d6576fc9ad34ecc7cc556f237aa4d88594637269f2a1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:827ebacd3b144b6364b342e4bb4b40e3ceac8ad67511d745fb3b7811726d4499","start":18.19,"end":25.89,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"え、これは今の科学では証明されていません。","textVersion":"sha256:692446c4651ddc5e5ddedc77fd21a128e7fd3f86f4ec5ca5862345dd057bf6af","audioVersion":"sha256:6db57e213c427d1ba65d6576fc9ad34ecc7cc556f237aa4d88594637269f2a1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:827ebacd3b144b6364b342e4bb4b40e3ceac8ad67511d745fb3b7811726d4499","start":26.07,"end":29.71,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"しかし、科学技術の進歩により証明される日が来ないとは言い切れません。","textVersion":"sha256:5c5841f8d774814a36afef8c7033d33fa9a6aa393ba921efbcaada6ecad8e3d5","audioVersion":"sha256:6db57e213c427d1ba65d6576fc9ad34ecc7cc556f237aa4d88594637269f2a1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:827ebacd3b144b6364b342e4bb4b40e3ceac8ad67511d745fb3b7811726d4499","start":30.4,"end":35.76,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"その時代の科学で説明できないことはすべて非科学的だといって否定する人もいますが、それは科学的な態度とは呼べないと私は考えています。","textVersion":"sha256:a2533f243a686f9c56ce008fae753be0fe8c9f32ccd59b5f5c793f1f4ba728c4","audioVersion":"sha256:6db57e213c427d1ba65d6576fc9ad34ecc7cc556f237aa4d88594637269f2a1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:827ebacd3b144b6364b342e4bb4b40e3ceac8ad67511d745fb3b7811726d4499","start":36.36,"end":47.7,"speaker":"先生"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:3:line-1","text":"先生は主に何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:9dfa98e2c88d3bdde71fe27cb6b7c17c970a30cd575836380d5f75be65f912a6","audioVersion":"sha256:6db57e213c427d1ba65d6576fc9ad34ecc7cc556f237aa4d88594637269f2a1d","timelineVersion":"sha256:827ebacd3b144b6364b342e4bb4b40e3ceac8ad67511d745fb3b7811726d4499","start":53.24,"end":57.56,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"912f26bfcd54ef9c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","examKey":"2012-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2012.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2012.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2012-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:question","text":"会社で、社長が社員に話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:49b5f4848248bfe3b1185aaa8bd32b9c5da7878488acc58f502fad48eff1ea61","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":5.42,"end":8.81,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"今日は皆さんにお願いがあります。","textVersion":"sha256:523b5274328aa71c6d3246a89bffa63de1465370e89498d07e42753da4f88ba2","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":10.62,"end":13.08,"speaker":"社長"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"ここ一年ほど、わが社の製品の売り上げは伸びていません。","textVersion":"sha256:bb2e80a3a29b227a1ceca2b2b4c0f17346580b2e635b49613704ee8d32fc5a06","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":14.33,"end":18.56,"speaker":"社長"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"ライバルの会社は次々と新製品を売り出し、売り上げを伸ばしています。","textVersion":"sha256:23ac71941841ca17b2dc33a78db8baa9b51e8fb7850c3b22493d88907f10358c","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":19.49,"end":24.69,"speaker":"社長"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"このような状況が続けば、会社の経営にも影響が出かねません。","textVersion":"sha256:e9bf19c62d439efa7e0c12a231d9a4609c4f8ef8963b91d4631d7c76bbb4b9fa","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":25.71,"end":30.57,"speaker":"社長"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0.segment-4","text":"そこで、今回所属する課や仕事内容を問わず、社内全体から新製品の企画を募集することにしました。","textVersion":"sha256:9b60bc5dd795fe4689159b7a99f2a97f88465bfed31c8f82d16eea4b6ca6147a","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":31.4,"end":40.51,"speaker":"社長"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0.segment-5","text":"社員だけではなく、アルバイトの方にも応募してもらいたいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:e305daab8c8509bfad4e66947ecc169557b3a25fa6b012b67a8d29f8992f3392","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":41.4,"end":46.41,"speaker":"社長"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-0.segment-6","text":"これまでにないものを期待していますので、ぜひ積極的に応募してください。","textVersion":"sha256:e37a5b17e3f200c6b8d7709287f1fd4c7fd9db9272891b0e63b7bc6b3c5f0545","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":47.16,"end":52.47,"speaker":"社長"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2012-12:4:line-1","text":"社長は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:d65319bc457b2e61d6bede6b6e03065a730471d63f4ab15d63550011e523e2e9","audioVersion":"sha256:89475ed861d4cf2131dd0af7a2a24b950a464615c1df1a745cb59121855fe52b","timelineVersion":"sha256:f663e6126f2c7962ad0879b90fac976e2e6f6fc27b2765b1592ccd514097f9d7","start":58.04,"end":61.06,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"912f26bfcd54ef9c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:fdb83f83d7170dfb689b80353946f6cdceae740d2c9251b707dc690b1be7bd73","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e3ec91f3f90b1304b4583c57fb848b0a1c95f281b388967a528545de838107c","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1:question","text":"一番：ラジオで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:d3490bf6c6e15d620bc36a647f871046d9546a9af0ad42036347f7fd90ada75d","audioVersion":"sha256:fdb83f83d7170dfb689b80353946f6cdceae740d2c9251b707dc690b1be7bd73","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e3ec91f3f90b1304b4583c57fb848b0a1c95f281b388967a528545de838107c","start":3.63,"end":8.18,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"今週末予定されているコンサートのお知らせです。","textVersion":"sha256:6bdf81d65ef43fd963d6bb0a4404cd2ccb3bc8b17887d6460528d030ee1e919d","audioVersion":"sha256:fdb83f83d7170dfb689b80353946f6cdceae740d2c9251b707dc690b1be7bd73","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e3ec91f3f90b1304b4583c57fb848b0a1c95f281b388967a528545de838107c","start":9.89,"end":13.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"昨年出したCDの売上げが100万枚を記録した小林信吾、コンサートの前売り券はすでに売り切れていますが、会場のステージプランの変更により、座席が増えることになり、新たにチケットが追加販売されました。","textVersion":"sha256:189bc1104fd854c420640429d79459d5c768d3accefd31759637a72f21f6f38c","audioVersion":"sha256:fdb83f83d7170dfb689b80353946f6cdceae740d2c9251b707dc690b1be7bd73","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e3ec91f3f90b1304b4583c57fb848b0a1c95f281b388967a528545de838107c","start":14,"end":29.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"このチケットを10名の方にプレゼントいたします。","textVersion":"sha256:ae832c826419c77db7304f7569c0db944003c5de94e5d73fb4e9173b89c92839","audioVersion":"sha256:fdb83f83d7170dfb689b80353946f6cdceae740d2c9251b707dc690b1be7bd73","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e3ec91f3f90b1304b4583c57fb848b0a1c95f281b388967a528545de838107c","start":30.59,"end":34.01,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"ご希望の方は今すぐお電話ください。","textVersion":"sha256:66d49ef4777291f41fffe0404cf922dc26f23f7b09d43be4f170058ce56d2ae8","audioVersion":"sha256:fdb83f83d7170dfb689b80353946f6cdceae740d2c9251b707dc690b1be7bd73","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e3ec91f3f90b1304b4583c57fb848b0a1c95f281b388967a528545de838107c","start":34.38,"end":37.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:1:line-1","text":"何についてのお知らせですか。","textVersion":"sha256:3f7ae0d464d5abc3f611e00cf0f5d757176adca5f5c5bbacccca74fe41082771","audioVersion":"sha256:fdb83f83d7170dfb689b80353946f6cdceae740d2c9251b707dc690b1be7bd73","timelineVersion":"sha256:8e3ec91f3f90b1304b4583c57fb848b0a1c95f281b388967a528545de838107c","start":42.81,"end":44.95,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"073cfd77ca2fc6e5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:question","text":"二番：電話で男の学生と女の学生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:a4a0573f6459cdffb83c000e7b808d8c6f89aa4219c9deddb7f605fdca442c38","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":3.93,"end":9.65,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-0","text":"あ、もしもし、田中だけど、今ちょっといい？","textVersion":"sha256:f750ff5f9496d700097a762e29584cbdd80190214e9854d6b572e4c49a4c417c","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":11.36,"end":14.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-1","text":"うん、なに？","textVersion":"sha256:477bee3385e3f75b507630e5846282d4091eac8bd9125b3a5252d7739f9cfcf7","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":14.88,"end":16.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-2","text":"今度のゼミ発表のことなんだけど、準備もう終わった？","textVersion":"sha256:b61d4b4117362d78c452a9a190765b2c5dd5dafefb323f22404899148d639a38","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":16.28,"end":19.95,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-3","text":"だいたいね。どうしたの？","textVersion":"sha256:2c7a6593512094aebac7783f2d89c75a5690bd6e9dd4707772e22160accbd393","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":20.06,"end":22.01,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-4","text":"うーん。来週、僕発表なんだけど、その日に就職の面接が入っちゃって。","textVersion":"sha256:2094e273dc0b0d9c32fe7b142dc3ed58b3f37007a5e8f89b618cb0cd6f13ddb3","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":22.03,"end":28.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-5","text":"ええ、大変だね。","textVersion":"sha256:345fc3e9cbbeefeaa22d513b0ff69f95f5275d0497b722904422b7cdd41c86bc","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":28.28,"end":30.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-6","text":"それでね、悪いんだけど、できたら・・・","textVersion":"sha256:2efdd0c3b9f51615f5f1cb680ff18a0dca983818446715d16131736e0150afbe","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":30.24,"end":33.23,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-7","text":"いいよ、代わってあげるよ。どっちが先に発表してもいいんだし。","textVersion":"sha256:0ea3407e179ebbe4442f2cf4ff251952b6f0437e6dc66ed6b83acc7bd7780a14","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":33.25,"end":37.53,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-8","text":"ほんと？よかった。ありがとう。","textVersion":"sha256:0947811c900654f562ab0b9cae2af5886d7ec5dcc84df154ef67806fb4bb8931","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":37.57,"end":39.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-9","text":"うん。じゃ、私たちテーマがちょっと似てるし、お互い発表の内容を確認しない？","textVersion":"sha256:6f908282d9af48e3b0bbd6a44f0c9936bb44a68a5c9790658b2aafcd053b7600","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":40.02,"end":46.25,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-10","text":"いいよ、木曜の昼休みはどう？昼ごはんおごるよ。","textVersion":"sha256:3e3de2fc085dc7504cf923ede4abeed578b54fd0967a15d7b0a6eb97ae5e0dc9","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":46.39,"end":50.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:2:line-11","text":"男の学生は何のために電話しましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:32dbf83d98d11f92e34d0d2e538eb76d9e3706049503aadffe79a6215c6ea306","audioVersion":"sha256:07dc0ffa6afbbfce9e04ed8e7ca416f83c81fa7f37a76956bf72415c899fa022","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ff7faf018f4c233f7174bee0365fc3566522f29a8a5573121252d8cb7a5f625","start":56.19,"end":60.04,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"073cfd77ca2fc6e5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3:question","text":"三番：授業で先生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:7b4aea3f4ce8a7d2e2cf7486d97ca5478b64304207cbbaf0b336069fc4fb157d","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","start":3.72,"end":7.8,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"えー、最近ではインターネットが普及し、子どもからお年寄りまで広く利用されるようになっています。","textVersion":"sha256:2c707c79ea4757090b02b556dfe728c3dd9385dea6238e2c2d7cf4b195139dd4","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","start":9.49,"end":17.07,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"皆さんも勉強に関する調べ物や買い物などによく利用していると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:9b60f3eb7d442da5d9bbbf7ebd1ab483198029490a76668d4ee5ca3f83f83e25","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","start":17.66,"end":23.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"多くの情報を短時間で得ることができるので、大変便利です。","textVersion":"sha256:ceba2b0f9ca407a3ddcb826577eb247585663f06202b40ac8928a32cb850fedd","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","start":23.84,"end":27.73,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"しかし、それらがすべて正しい情報というわけではありません。","textVersion":"sha256:6d7e532d9b871d9f4ee80628d4b89a60096b6487aacc244ea6098feb4c150bc0","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","start":28.25,"end":32.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"パソコンの操作や検索の仕方になれることも必要ですが、正しい情報を見分けること、つまり、選択することがもっとも重要なことです。","textVersion":"sha256:55fa377a349cb842b24bc608fe6aec4e185ccf4bed2ee80cccac9a1321c34afe","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","start":33.34,"end":43.35,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-0.segment-5","text":"この授業では、その具体的な方法について学んでいきましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:d0c3783857b64dcd7ea661684ccdb0730b4ab3c63ad7a5f53a23405c18f8c451","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","start":43.98,"end":47.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:3:line-1","text":"この授業で取り上げる内容はどのようなことですか。","textVersion":"sha256:fffe7a0f1a41f24fd361055e00e4a580a30399d81b031e4108baa76cbaa0bdf2","audioVersion":"sha256:39e2eec8cf1eadf7556b12d7f09e63241120b19c5db0f227fa98555f8acd38a0","timelineVersion":"sha256:3212621a12fb9ac2c1f564ff104db4a242f7f42ea28b693fa15d8e7fe5373ac9","start":53.57,"end":57.66,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"073cfd77ca2fc6e5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:question","text":"四番：テレビでサッカーの選手がインタビューに答えています。","textVersion":"sha256:fe29d35aa0c3d9996884dbf333457055e01d58eb46902d9c80c0024e2911962e","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":3.67,"end":9.77,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-0","text":"今日はサッカー選手の三浦真さんにお越しいただいています。三浦選手、もうすぐ新しいシーズンが始まりますが、いかがですか。","textVersion":"sha256:1d213f0b96e6a4d02fcf252a219b33094d79b126055ee85facc949afca6d7d2e","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":11.5,"end":21.21,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1.segment-0","text":"え、今回、チームのキャプテンに選ばれたんですが、それは決してサッカーが一番うまいからではないと思っています。","textVersion":"sha256:d3032cd14b9e20e9052becef7e38507aa3bc1412828d23dabec1b5a1892bc6ad","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":21.43,"end":28.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1.segment-1","text":"僕よりテクニックがあって、僕よりゲームを組み立てるのがうまい選手はたくさんいますからね。","textVersion":"sha256:23a3b5d1f011d99c456ef82164ca181538d5e89b84d9fafc9f71659b8023bf12","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":28.77,"end":33.87,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1.segment-2","text":"ただ、監督に言われたのは、お前が徹底して戦う姿勢を見せろということでした。","textVersion":"sha256:b509cac267e1a39e59a386b60d2540cd80341c1ee7afaaf7dea3a2db0e087e7e","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":34.35,"end":40.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1.segment-3","text":"たとえば、練習でも試合でも誰よりも、声を出して、誰よりも走る。","textVersion":"sha256:20a220db5f5e5465b6fd693b3d5b659ba997ed85b56b378e8300f7f01f5993bd","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":40.79,"end":45.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1.segment-4","text":"すると、それを見ているチームのみんなはキャプテンが頑張っているんだから自分もって気持ちになりますよね。","textVersion":"sha256:138d912d59ec8302b845ba9af835de00aca67809488e9ca7b6a8d8d66ca01479","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":46.18,"end":52.67,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1.segment-5","text":"そうやって強いチームを作っていく。","textVersion":"sha256:e5d6ad54813fd9be88251637ad96d78fc5d260dc57576b445e3f3a36a6f889a5","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":53,"end":55.42,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-1.segment-6","text":"それこそが僕に課された使命だと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:6af07a8a401f36f09d694134751c2b33c9e0f678cae78576591d26bae77e81d9","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":55.57,"end":58.26,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:4:line-2","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:7903abf77758e282a27ec4444f881d6bf4456356dacff9271fdcc50203ca6c98","timelineVersion":"sha256:c0e18788eba9d9197da0a4ab41f63c45c570b5904154055ab2389fe83e9e95cf","start":63.97,"end":67.4,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"073cfd77ca2fc6e5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","examKey":"2013-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:question","text":"五番：パン屋で男の店員が女の店員に注意しています。","textVersion":"sha256:3c4867d6e2ba7458cf6cbc47ffc895f1ee7bc0bfc809eaf19bbc7c0a40b98e82","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":3.86,"end":10.12,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-0","text":"さっき電話があったんだけど。今日君が配達したお客さんからの苦情だったよ。3時に納品しますって言ってたのに、30分も遅れて持ってたんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:449b8b3072076beaba0631aae93b9ff7080912d92ffa1ec754c14e3d9644a398","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":11.89,"end":22.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-1","text":"はい、すみません。焼けるのが予定よりちょっと遅くなっちゃって。","textVersion":"sha256:c76db4570aca74ed4c821e010f950764d1dcfbb367de308aeed18464ddde5186","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":22.68,"end":27.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-2","text":"最初4時でいいって言われてたのに、3時に配達できるって言っちゃったんでしょ？","textVersion":"sha256:4a2596c2a1fc39b6ce2e04c0737b89b5fac2eeb7a127d07441492061cbe46ffe","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":27.84,"end":32.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-3","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":32.83,"end":33.49,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-4","text":"たとえ3時で大丈夫だと思っても、相手が特に急いでなかったら、少し余裕を持って、3時半に届けますって言っとくんだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:ef669bbf8df412dfc185f17bfb8537406f502c210bd96078180d25086abe3a50","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":33.72,"end":42.71,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-5","text":"はい。早く届けられたら、そのほうがいいと思ってしまって、つい。","textVersion":"sha256:475007ac7fd884768d91905ba5e78724fddd4d1a70436a1cc195131e28ff47f6","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":42.95,"end":48.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-6","text":"逆に3時半って言っておいて、3時10分に納品しても早すぎるって苦情をいうお客さんはいないと思うよ。","textVersion":"sha256:6c91b04ca5010de338d8e272406dc7b1147374f9b187bd5cca35d4b894ea985e","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":48.45,"end":56.24,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-7","text":"そうですね。次からは気をつけます。","textVersion":"sha256:9991c1ad830548079bb579fda4d01d820d8496ab9c81c5c420e00e9c895869ef","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":56.59,"end":59.75,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-07:5:line-8","text":"男の店員は何について注意していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:09d352240f32509dce0f799e61acdbc00116e5f6f3445f5df0de227ef15583a4","audioVersion":"sha256:f3a4587375d162b0c5c23d8b720b83b86cef527f193ab76ac80cf5f0b4042fca","timelineVersion":"sha256:a17f1eb2357341fd51007e462b775c590ad2e1370c0dcceabe4d2c1db72f4679","start":65.46,"end":69.34,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"073cfd77ca2fc6e5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1:question","text":"高校の入学式で校長が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:037d2d228b092af81200c1890a94d50351e3bc46cc1d752f319e40f479b72ca1","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","start":5.61,"end":9.48,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"新入生の皆さん、ご家族の皆さん、入学おめでとうございます。","textVersion":"sha256:12e4472721b4a78153b6e3c5d262e1633d08cf1380e9ed618c4cc59b9765272f","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","start":11.23,"end":16.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"入学式にあたり、私たちの学校について、基本的な考えをお話ししたいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:fa6026b924de4f1c48562648081c0b19dc07b09c17696627056e3305978dee9f","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","start":16.77,"end":23.31,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"本校は、1950年に創立して以来、心の教育を重視してきました。","textVersion":"sha256:7a6500c94a89b09d74d7d17793caf529019d0f1544b14037ce423cd914684dcc","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","start":24.13,"end":30.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"学校は勉強して学力を上げるためだけの場所ではありません。","textVersion":"sha256:09d1d15606329b140fcfb6c28598575df6f5445d13f226d004915d02a9561804","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","start":31.46,"end":35.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"社会生活の中で必要な礼儀作法を身につけることにより、家族や友人を大切にする心を育てていきたいと思っています。","textVersion":"sha256:605874e7d206ffa5c2e77df9d4d1d342283385d54f95f9ee3ae8d849a74070fc","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","start":36.67,"end":46.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-0.segment-5","text":"ご家族も、ぜひご協力よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:44889bbd2c263059f06c30dd47288baf00d25c198f3fb37aff1a2bc252c3640f","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","start":47.5,"end":51.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:1:line-1","text":"校長は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ad82bfcf55f7b4f17b0d64adf6566e0697b1ff9298b5a6a24ab466c73279e61a","audioVersion":"sha256:9ede71281fa03fb9084e73a3bddd368c5f5d81a333c36208673f1fac8f35e7b0","timelineVersion":"sha256:24fba8ce56e75581fbe31a8e30f5f4adb5ef89ba7d3ef026bc46341f254092f7","start":56.89,"end":60.25,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"d152271debe9142b"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:question","text":"女の人と男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:f9dd0f81ebad8fad8458de706343e4d65c92b18ae7650426cd173a090fb129da","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":5.54,"end":8.56,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-0","text":"新しい仕事、どう？","textVersion":"sha256:5f4d3550066046295006f9b1ee08c45cae76b328261383502ee856d3f826969a","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":10.25,"end":12.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-1","text":"うん。だいぶ慣れたけど、けっこう忙しい。前の会社と違って、会議とか出張も多いしね。","textVersion":"sha256:d89fef86617f94e3a50c52dda41d4116c26d077f5cb9e7ad693bd64d74dbd6a7","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":12.33,"end":19,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-2","text":"へえ、じゃあ、疲れるでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:9aac3c2333b606b7fe10b8f8bae559d44f6074ece703397c02ff401dbb56b242","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":19.1,"end":21.93,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-3","text":"うーん。不思議なんだけど、そうでもないんだよ。時間に追われて不規則な生活してるわりにね。やりたい仕事だからかな。","textVersion":"sha256:374ca6238cf7b3bd96893c577e9059d548bbe4747e5116b8ed12ef1ddc00868e","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":21.95,"end":30.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-4","text":"そうなんだ。前の会社にいた時は、ずいぶん悩んでたよね。やりたい仕事をするために、転職するかどうか。","textVersion":"sha256:c42f9529e6fbdae803951eaa08f1fb1afbf693d2839b1e66d24976001d16b675","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":30.39,"end":39.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-5","text":"うん。悩んで決めた仕事だから、後悔しないように、精一杯やろうと思って…。","textVersion":"sha256:03903ff470385caef1219dc2dab7163344b5a020c10a561195c2262d025f0044","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":39.36,"end":44.47,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-6","text":"なんか前よりいきいきしてるね。","textVersion":"sha256:69da192c5ed222a18a76880f1a6d40c5cd6d4013d5ef8945a677fb9b867f774e","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":44.87,"end":47.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-7","text":"うん。やりがいがあるし、この仕事。","textVersion":"sha256:95e54c272a79365c7b3710efdc5982a7a1596406fe3733df3241659a3ab4a280","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":47.67,"end":50.23,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:2:line-8","text":"男の人は新しい仕事について、どう思っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f998ee1e21af2a61c635374cb616fe8d9f45c21d92551e3bd6bbe69f77c4cb9a","audioVersion":"sha256:972d34edaec5ba09341a111a0289fe1f0ebdde3d414245203db09e471a025116","timelineVersion":"sha256:a7fdd1bb1368409a81d9dcedc733ab242563994ef19bcb8625b29d0242fcf66e","start":55.96,"end":60.76,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"d152271debe9142b"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e2be26631974da4b925a4b6d6d91c4bc4f156a422d91f80330bba116acaf5a2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:dd321163547dcee2d94732492639d89d82fc8a1749e9e631a31801d028e2373d","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3:question","text":"ラジオでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:a16b629a540ee67e5f4107e5675489ee03c2533ddbd67e1f07fee194cd9f7b95","audioVersion":"sha256:e2be26631974da4b925a4b6d6d91c4bc4f156a422d91f80330bba116acaf5a2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:dd321163547dcee2d94732492639d89d82fc8a1749e9e631a31801d028e2373d","start":5.6,"end":8.08,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"宇宙という言葉を聞くだけで、ワクワクするという人も多いと思いますが、そのような方に、ぜひ足を運んでいただきたいのが、北山大学宇宙物理学研究場です。","textVersion":"sha256:f24f4bb7f015c73bc7c67b4d5fa32fb68ee05882eee8dbf21838c2d0e054be5b","audioVersion":"sha256:e2be26631974da4b925a4b6d6d91c4bc4f156a422d91f80330bba116acaf5a2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:dd321163547dcee2d94732492639d89d82fc8a1749e9e631a31801d028e2373d","start":9.87,"end":21.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"ここでは、毎月一般の方を対象に、特別講義を行なっています。","textVersion":"sha256:d985d1cee52a709cb13863a44ea89a2f05303c2aa4168072ac181091a5c1c2a5","audioVersion":"sha256:e2be26631974da4b925a4b6d6d91c4bc4f156a422d91f80330bba116acaf5a2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:dd321163547dcee2d94732492639d89d82fc8a1749e9e631a31801d028e2373d","start":22.58,"end":27.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"地球誕生の秘密から、宇宙人は本当にいるのといった話まで、最新の研究成果を取り入れながら、分かりやすく説明しています。","textVersion":"sha256:39c166abf0c3fd68b31913da757d80622d32457cf8a84a978361a48d98f8996e","audioVersion":"sha256:e2be26631974da4b925a4b6d6d91c4bc4f156a422d91f80330bba116acaf5a2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:dd321163547dcee2d94732492639d89d82fc8a1749e9e631a31801d028e2373d","start":28.18,"end":37.97,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"参加は無料ですが、予約制になっています。","textVersion":"sha256:1816e0a64340b8565b49421494cb1e960ddfb56e83897591f7a5c1a9a439689d","audioVersion":"sha256:e2be26631974da4b925a4b6d6d91c4bc4f156a422d91f80330bba116acaf5a2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:dd321163547dcee2d94732492639d89d82fc8a1749e9e631a31801d028e2373d","start":38.74,"end":41.73,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"興味のある方は大学まで、お問い合わせください。","textVersion":"sha256:668d2b1fd215b6bfeec7f921aa901046cb2018abcab5febc8101d941d5949d0b","audioVersion":"sha256:e2be26631974da4b925a4b6d6d91c4bc4f156a422d91f80330bba116acaf5a2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:dd321163547dcee2d94732492639d89d82fc8a1749e9e631a31801d028e2373d","start":42.19,"end":45.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:3:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1673c6b733a690adbb707ef47c46062fdbdcbd22d253b9eaed3d67372d7d4c2a","audioVersion":"sha256:e2be26631974da4b925a4b6d6d91c4bc4f156a422d91f80330bba116acaf5a2d","timelineVersion":"sha256:dd321163547dcee2d94732492639d89d82fc8a1749e9e631a31801d028e2373d","start":51.09,"end":54.46,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"d152271debe9142b"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:867177004ba6414a4df673dcd6bd3e00f5612c3cd009bbebb5874da59f16b778","timelineVersion":"sha256:e26b1cc8aa5cfde69a02775eea8a238a18633bf6fff67094eef85cfac7a72e03","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4:question","text":"テレビでレポーターが山川町について話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:6e67323cb32461a6ada66d050cfcc7d5126b4f478c5796945f08f2686ffc857b","audioVersion":"sha256:867177004ba6414a4df673dcd6bd3e00f5612c3cd009bbebb5874da59f16b778","timelineVersion":"sha256:e26b1cc8aa5cfde69a02775eea8a238a18633bf6fff67094eef85cfac7a72e03","start":5.65,"end":9.84,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"今日は山川町をご紹介します。","textVersion":"sha256:0adaab15007b326dc4ab491878d817c25a2cf11abeb8592682bb6ffdbbcc6ab6","audioVersion":"sha256:867177004ba6414a4df673dcd6bd3e00f5612c3cd009bbebb5874da59f16b778","timelineVersion":"sha256:e26b1cc8aa5cfde69a02775eea8a238a18633bf6fff67094eef85cfac7a72e03","start":11.58,"end":14.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"山川町には東西大学があり、昔から落ち着いた学生の町として有名でした。","textVersion":"sha256:e0eb8becb227f37c9358ad71b1625758be5eb9be38ec3858538f3a4767dbea4e","audioVersion":"sha256:867177004ba6414a4df673dcd6bd3e00f5612c3cd009bbebb5874da59f16b778","timelineVersion":"sha256:e26b1cc8aa5cfde69a02775eea8a238a18633bf6fff67094eef85cfac7a72e03","start":15.08,"end":21.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"ところが今、住宅地として注目を浴びています。","textVersion":"sha256:0e94d2d164d26774f6d3384c6351a36b2f46b67c6a8472a1e9ca9fe9ffeb6d7d","audioVersion":"sha256:867177004ba6414a4df673dcd6bd3e00f5612c3cd009bbebb5874da59f16b778","timelineVersion":"sha256:e26b1cc8aa5cfde69a02775eea8a238a18633bf6fff67094eef85cfac7a72e03","start":22.09,"end":25.81,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"住みやすい町といえば、昔から交通の便利さ、安全、静かさが重視されますが、山川町にはそれに加えて、大学病院もあります。","textVersion":"sha256:51553befaf1d7c56605b72d666b283b39bf58fb29516ade84c16622462ac454f","audioVersion":"sha256:867177004ba6414a4df673dcd6bd3e00f5612c3cd009bbebb5874da59f16b778","timelineVersion":"sha256:e26b1cc8aa5cfde69a02775eea8a238a18633bf6fff67094eef85cfac7a72e03","start":26.58,"end":38.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-0.segment-4","text":"近年の急速な高齢化にともない、病院や公共施設の充実した町に移り住む人が増えているということです。","textVersion":"sha256:eeed95153e1d981142abd180b517edb7907b950d15d3c6c3b00c8a153c9a8463","audioVersion":"sha256:867177004ba6414a4df673dcd6bd3e00f5612c3cd009bbebb5874da59f16b778","timelineVersion":"sha256:e26b1cc8aa5cfde69a02775eea8a238a18633bf6fff67094eef85cfac7a72e03","start":38.86,"end":47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:4:line-1","text":"レポーターは山川町の何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c2ce83578ea0f1a7b2b627fc68935a3bda586654a3d1a1ca3424b8e3738794c4","audioVersion":"sha256:867177004ba6414a4df673dcd6bd3e00f5612c3cd009bbebb5874da59f16b778","timelineVersion":"sha256:e26b1cc8aa5cfde69a02775eea8a238a18633bf6fff67094eef85cfac7a72e03","start":52.74,"end":57.5,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"d152271debe9142b"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","examKey":"2013-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2013.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2013.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2013-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5:question","text":"テレビで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:42a4897a5b0f10ee451c26231b75f9f2859e299e718a6129f64fb54a8ad88b44","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","start":5.4,"end":7.97,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"最近は野菜ジュースがよく売れています。","textVersion":"sha256:fdfaf6bb114caa0aef8b23cc08262665e7ff6410439ac87620e78c465bcc2d2b","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","start":9.76,"end":13.16,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"忙しい現代人にとって、手軽に栄養が取れるということが魅力のようです。","textVersion":"sha256:2646febc8c7f1e5031ac9075611bac1e9d3b314e527a8906f43c65edaa405383","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","start":13.68,"end":19.11,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"ただ、野菜ジュースに頼りすぎるのは好ましくありません。","textVersion":"sha256:5e130e33ce407778911b89f91c483acbba0ddcb698e7fde47dd48a43257423da","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","start":19.41,"end":23.83,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"同じ量の野菜を生で食べるのと野菜ジュースにして取るのでは、ジュースのほうが栄養成分の種類も量も少ないため、ジュースのみでは栄養バランスが偏ってしまう恐れがあります。","textVersion":"sha256:740a17ac266ecf3e66afde18c60a077cfe2d4495247712c48e1a65a190fa29a3","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","start":24.42,"end":38.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"一日に必要な量の野菜を使っても、作る過程で絞ったり、加熱したりすることによって栄養成分は減ってしまいます。","textVersion":"sha256:db893fe2ef32a87d0f4690aa690fd2d59b2f8d5cba3c84ffec90107fd58608b7","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","start":39.42,"end":49.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-0.segment-5","text":"基本的にジュースは補助と考えることが大事でしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:2697a84b4b888ec4595a9c19d906ac0dfe4b4911f0b717ef9dee12d7bc8bef3b","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","start":49.75,"end":54.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2013-12:5:line-1","text":"女の人が伝えたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:436d1966c94dc876c8544dadfcfe2f6942b8e7762f209cbd3ae32bac360502c1","audioVersion":"sha256:ca2f03f775aeac40d7b6b27a70275fd8e6b3783a79302e84d79efa42de87875a","timelineVersion":"sha256:f3a9f98dda3fd5a04a4f3ae3b085b7363114b999f1a52d2a52eb48faaf55c94b","start":59.92,"end":62.67,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"d152271debe9142b"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1:question","text":"留守番電話のメッセージを聞いています。","textVersion":"sha256:d728fe489d5eec5329fd99a3488eec2b119032d6d75e62556d232d78896cd647","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","start":5.52,"end":8.29,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"林さん、高橋です。","textVersion":"sha256:7f82ed3c4d7d5ae2bef06d1d420229d2dcf53761109f31746414be51016824d7","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","start":10.1,"end":11.93,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"来週の市民交流会、外国の料理を作るというイベントなんですが、講師をお願いしていた方が来られなくなってしまったんです。","textVersion":"sha256:3fc31a390b57276209246da0d721a76d52a913f91933eff5ec43105d0e2094b4","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","start":12.37,"end":21.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"それで、代わりの方を探しているんですが、林さんにお願いできないかと思いまして。","textVersion":"sha256:6fce1d79331cf068a10f648a49f5a6a16c1db708b2a6402db0204249333fbb64","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","start":21.35,"end":27.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"林さんが前のパーティーのときに作ってきてくださった料理が、レストランで出されるものみたいにおいしいと、皆さんの間で評判だったので。","textVersion":"sha256:9815efa2c83c2a1c83a753b70d89e88d29b0ba725add649ff37599fe3a80b847","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","start":27.7,"end":36.51,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"急なことで恐縮なんですが、お引き受けいただけないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:8f043a630ed80967096b978a5a8828ae4bc0a11cc56b38145118705e2866fa11","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","start":37.1,"end":41.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-0.segment-5","text":"お返事、お待ちしております。","textVersion":"sha256:2ee400d5b0dea7fe6378882071e64b4f995b2c25d298afe77ae82488cf22b910","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","start":41.48,"end":43.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:1:line-1","text":"女の人が伝えたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:436d1966c94dc876c8544dadfcfe2f6942b8e7762f209cbd3ae32bac360502c1","audioVersion":"sha256:1a2f75162f9e1987225a50c1e9c12cd6c86b2e8e7856de6d50b0aa3ef9cfb6e4","timelineVersion":"sha256:f2b9d5286d616922294686daca02b77aba5ea1d9772642781bb449f95577187a","start":48.43,"end":51.75,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"05cbb4eaaf5e17d2"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2:question","text":"ツアーガイドが城の前で話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:434750ad4e13e6d607fc8b949294971b20f6469227f1f8ba0dd2df4b0fba0fbe","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","start":5.56,"end":9,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"こちらが山田正宗によって建てられた城、山田城です。","textVersion":"sha256:0b4f1f5820db72b6a91229432520721c5b27ea1ac0cb9095d5ff00a4cddcd9e6","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","start":14.72,"end":19.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"皆さま、馬の像がたくさん置かれていることにお気付きでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:000cba10877d75772e6b94242b63d28e050d931aa73049e60928279755426302","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","start":20.72,"end":25.19,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"このお城を作った山田正宗は、馬が好きで、飼っていた馬を大変可愛がっていました。","textVersion":"sha256:a6b1d947e03c0ed1f1ac8a4a1e6f0c574366ea7de05e5f9327e4674dbac5a209","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","start":26.31,"end":33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"あるとき、その馬が正宗を敵から守ったことから、正宗は馬の像を作らせ、城のあちこちに置いたのです。","textVersion":"sha256:ffa62313ee36837b8d0a3a81772c1a339a16d289cfa1d1f3dae93dcf70e79595","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","start":34.33,"end":43.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"特に、城の入り口にある像は、山田正宗が自ら作ったものと言われています。","textVersion":"sha256:f4bc9355c5f1cf8e7a6414c7176190789bdf3380bbf3ab054185b66a394043bf","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","start":44.14,"end":50.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-0.segment-5","text":"正宗は幼い頃から秀才として知られていましたので、この馬の頭を撫でると、賢くなると伝えられています。","textVersion":"sha256:9ab5df4f8fb4c003e5b15a1d9790c2401407562d83b8702c9815b7bd0cc98499","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","start":51.94,"end":60.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:2:line-1","text":"ツアーガイドは主に何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a9379ea0e1e0a826bf38e6993b9857bdc30f1fd737d2ee2ca540ca97be8e147d","audioVersion":"sha256:194cbcf54a4ea7831be55ff15bf047dcfd1d68f364092b06b64677c1a16b770e","timelineVersion":"sha256:94bc89397f2c90d6b69a88ec36ee3ac30c5546d2ad822ee1203a38a630d2f594","start":67.46,"end":72.09,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"05cbb4eaaf5e17d2"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8f62ad99df6d2ab0f4439133db7ba18fef66f5560f14fe15608ac61861801ccd","timelineVersion":"sha256:3a06eaf4e9c2194b7c3fbcdfb116a479e3f82ab138c3550ace755ab51970df86","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3:question","text":"テレビのニュースで、アナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:90f883f7089ff7a52da57ace94db50920dd2d5e04a14440837cb2271f666c6cf","audioVersion":"sha256:8f62ad99df6d2ab0f4439133db7ba18fef66f5560f14fe15608ac61861801ccd","timelineVersion":"sha256:3a06eaf4e9c2194b7c3fbcdfb116a479e3f82ab138c3550ace755ab51970df86","start":5.44,"end":9.03,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"先日、大手不動産会社が住みやすい町の一位から十位を発表しました。","textVersion":"sha256:f9cb155f114af26ed7604b4e17acc4766d846bb6ec90f0fee2ba937f36fc8e55","audioVersion":"sha256:8f62ad99df6d2ab0f4439133db7ba18fef66f5560f14fe15608ac61861801ccd","timelineVersion":"sha256:3a06eaf4e9c2194b7c3fbcdfb116a479e3f82ab138c3550ace755ab51970df86","start":10.77,"end":16.32,"speaker":"アナウンサー"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"調査は教育、医療、安全性などの満足度に関する住民アンケートと教育機関や医療機関の数、主要都市へのアクセスのしやすさなどを評価することによって、行われました。","textVersion":"sha256:410851cfebf0dc3d73472d74242422915d5f713dfc283b488d1b501636eb239d","audioVersion":"sha256:8f62ad99df6d2ab0f4439133db7ba18fef66f5560f14fe15608ac61861801ccd","timelineVersion":"sha256:3a06eaf4e9c2194b7c3fbcdfb116a479e3f82ab138c3550ace755ab51970df86","start":16.61,"end":29.83,"speaker":"アナウンサー"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"その結果、一位は富士川市となりました。","textVersion":"sha256:97cb0d824d9a94a286f0c50f5c8bd4627b4697c6f81a9817489cdc8f78752540","audioVersion":"sha256:8f62ad99df6d2ab0f4439133db7ba18fef66f5560f14fe15608ac61861801ccd","timelineVersion":"sha256:3a06eaf4e9c2194b7c3fbcdfb116a479e3f82ab138c3550ace755ab51970df86","start":30.2,"end":33.17,"speaker":"アナウンサー"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"富士川市は新しいマンションの建設ラッシュで、人口も増加傾向にあります。","textVersion":"sha256:2d1317343fbd76076a0efb6fd48555a1e623eafc674f840ecc603e9c5819880a","audioVersion":"sha256:8f62ad99df6d2ab0f4439133db7ba18fef66f5560f14fe15608ac61861801ccd","timelineVersion":"sha256:3a06eaf4e9c2194b7c3fbcdfb116a479e3f82ab138c3550ace755ab51970df86","start":33.63,"end":38.88,"speaker":"アナウンサー"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"富士川市に住む人は、自分が住む町が選ばれてとても嬉しいと話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:95f78486b36c2e42b9a965f2393d8a44abbac448310ca0879a4652bf76bf7984","audioVersion":"sha256:8f62ad99df6d2ab0f4439133db7ba18fef66f5560f14fe15608ac61861801ccd","timelineVersion":"sha256:3a06eaf4e9c2194b7c3fbcdfb116a479e3f82ab138c3550ace755ab51970df86","start":39.23,"end":44.36,"speaker":"アナウンサー"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:3:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1673c6b733a690adbb707ef47c46062fdbdcbd22d253b9eaed3d67372d7d4c2a","audioVersion":"sha256:8f62ad99df6d2ab0f4439133db7ba18fef66f5560f14fe15608ac61861801ccd","timelineVersion":"sha256:3a06eaf4e9c2194b7c3fbcdfb116a479e3f82ab138c3550ace755ab51970df86","start":50.68,"end":54.28,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"05cbb4eaaf5e17d2"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4:question","text":"ラジオで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:bea3a221e6161ba0820ce1214df6e60533cfcddc023c8e660b12196bf86bc650","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","start":5.54,"end":8.65,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"皆さんは「目で料理を味わう」という言葉を聞いたことがありますか。","textVersion":"sha256:2c5cc6ecbd9dfa97c1a830a01a15b208b6f3da69ff097c367edca0a70fbb61fa","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","start":10.38,"end":15.21,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"本来、料理は舌で味わって食べるものですが、ほんとうに目で味わうことはできるのでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:daa54d30d69d1dc89415c56ba6f59799b09f4fb2ad5718721d5f77bdd16db0d8","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","start":16.12,"end":22.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"実は、見た目と味には関係があるということを証明した実験があります。","textVersion":"sha256:e697f3953c1d86673918964e8696e894a833ae8c20485c5d45b803d5cb840df3","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","start":24,"end":29.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"まったく同じ味のコーヒーを、異なる色の容器に入れて飲んでもらったところ。多くの人が、味が異なると答えました。","textVersion":"sha256:b9ebdfd877c9ee33b67f625330c7b1d06955383c7dc76d633587d4366b82bc5c","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","start":30.35,"end":39.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-0.segment-4","text":"また、色が異なる同じ味のあめを食べてもらったところ、半数以上の人が、味が異なると答えたそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:4bba7bac4c91481f951e8b3d42cc0b09225d5c2612e1e3131716c67be87d0d7a","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","start":40.21,"end":49.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-0.segment-5","text":"おもしろいと思いませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:cffa2b77659e8c4449803ae077fdda8922f32c4987b56e414bcfc2e30fe833f1","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","start":49.69,"end":51.43,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:4:line-1","text":"女の人は主に何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5f5e48d2411cb9ab37fbbd6c791b205ac483cfa3224fbfbd202266ea8876e9b1","audioVersion":"sha256:679f8381f9f8ad4567b447dfb738a44500c34eabb12615f7adf63271724f1c41","timelineVersion":"sha256:eaef3ee2923897a9e37624d493f1436ded587ecd7d6cc831a1766270bea9f710","start":56.38,"end":60.6,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"05cbb4eaaf5e17d2"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","examKey":"2014-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:question","text":"テレビで女のアナウンサーが男の人にインタビューをしています。","textVersion":"sha256:550651d96860c8297ffced6485d9e2809cd0c1d87b38481a97c19f7ec9f34793","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":5.37,"end":10.37,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-0","text":"今日はトマト栽培セットを新たに開発し、発売された中田さんにインタビューします。中田さん、この商品は家庭で手軽にトマトが育てられるということですが、これまでにも、自宅で野菜が育てられるものはあったと思うんですけど。","textVersion":"sha256:1063863cc4e17128c5a5f4d29cfeab4c4db340d669c405251a367cf34fed7233","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":12.08,"end":30.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-1","text":"はい、そうですね。ただ、それらはどんなに手軽と言っても、やっぱり外に出て土をいじったり栄養を与えたり、毎日のように水をやったりしなければならなかったんです。","textVersion":"sha256:2665f8431fe59b9c89c6ddc57ae20a1cbece62281f6f62a93eea22f411827454","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":30.25,"end":44.27,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-2","text":"確かに大変ですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:328102b50de1d81158876eaf9b585a8b5c65be77074073458c78c6ef388b46d5","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":44.64,"end":46.79,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-3","text":"そうなんです。しかしこれは種をまくところから収穫まで全て室内でできるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:26a2bccc33eb9c08f318975e298006c0f6897c9bf092b3be655c6a31d45a39ce","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":46.77,"end":54.07,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-4","text":"えっ？全然外に出さなくてもいいんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:02e512237684fec7d16341794baff73347b90cadc54a706df9d089b2e8c55807","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":54.41,"end":57.97,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-5","text":"ええ。でも日当たりのいいところにおいてください。容器に工夫があって、水は一ヶ月に２、３回やるだけでいいので、とても簡単です。","textVersion":"sha256:a6b4cc3cba504b8d4b9755ca3697c4373646a69f14e39ead809c3a96867f9b00","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":58.09,"end":68.47,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-6","text":"野菜を育てるのには手間がかかるという常識を破った商品ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:b6b4dd1bf946cf45fb962a6c31fef88a4c61f094dae3c0c9b1b2c53207260f19","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":68.96,"end":73.99,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-7","text":"はい、容器の中に土と植物が育つための必要な栄養分が入っていますから、手間いらずですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:4bacce8e81d2eb0af357550bc91a0a7097c7d3c2d63d5c3ee6256e38b388996f","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":74.5,"end":82.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-8","text":"そうですか。これで自宅でいつでも新鮮なトマトが食べられるようになりますね。","textVersion":"sha256:f5cb28016870615662c8a8b606b8fc82c61041b3592f81f3e899d26e25fc0086","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":83.28,"end":90.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-07:5:line-9","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:1e38eb0797340a58d31a65b866cf7c0a92fdead8ad44187e505ebed4c4f8dfc3","timelineVersion":"sha256:de857efea57433c67f9157ab5f3a45631fafe882f2ac57365482d672101b9e18","start":96.46,"end":100.04,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"05cbb4eaaf5e17d2"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1:question","text":"会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:0b10fa121dd0764793c9b735120aefb6d2aa7e50e0403f9342db0cca6224b0f2","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","start":5.27,"end":9.21,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-0","text":"斎藤君、今度の企画ぜひリーダーをやってもらいたいって思っているんだけど、どう、やってみない？","textVersion":"sha256:c982643e00ecada71d31134c3fbea1825854c53a22450b7d9f69e1430296fb25","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","start":10.95,"end":18.27,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-1","text":"僕ですか？そんな僕なんかまだ入社してそんなに経ってないですし、他にもっと相応しい人がいるんじゃないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:8d5c5f693e48676b55452ff2fa2190bfd90290c99aa0f33895cf644a6748623c","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","start":18.47,"end":26.45,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-2","text":"でも、今度の企画はあなたの専門分野に関わることだから、斎藤君の知識がどうしても必要なの。","textVersion":"sha256:5d6415e6454a9fb9497a64ef1b339871f18e1609aa5f34413f31e2475828ef4b","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","start":26.67,"end":34.09,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-3","text":"確かに僕の専門なので知識はある程度はありますが、でも、いきなりリーダーっていうのは…","textVersion":"sha256:d1611a9b66a807dd2e261384edc4aaff49e9f573233d48a460d943cc5b7f33a9","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","start":34.26,"end":40.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-4","text":"せっかくのチャンスじゃない。","textVersion":"sha256:29e29378dcabcccc9927929b7133d9f375648e51e99f7ec27309029777a5df86","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","start":40.82,"end":42.63,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-5","text":"僕、リーダーの仕事を助けたりした経験すらまだないんで、もちろん課長が期待してくださっているのは本当にありがたいと思っていますけど、せめて副リーダーのような立場から始めさせていただけないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:3b26e7d9cfdbdc93ae2eb8bfe3cd730ef25b146cb1d81a6492a056cf4db99bd0","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","start":42.69,"end":56.11,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:1:line-6","text":"男の人が伝えたいのはどのようなことですか。","textVersion":"sha256:395b32c5ccefb5e9bfee16bde3aeb69ae9a7230aadb15c8e6a4f6eada84f3f3d","audioVersion":"sha256:0c58dfbaf8a591c8af64283f51d3cf73bbb49ef4b56f7bf20d4c0e68a0b96fd4","timelineVersion":"sha256:b185ddf7e9d3c0cf6c8577500bf8946f5a2490ea171e9132974e0e178aaa5e09","start":61.9,"end":65.64,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"9680ca9ea603d70e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:33353c298caf55add5677f086380facd89953e73f82de4e0a303d85f42a704ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:fc4a3d60d7de02185b2b24a93a5efd6ddf06a81009c712f00a6fc1a2d46d97a0","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2:question","text":"ラジオで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:0ccf292cc278e347a153fb220db53863294b915454a13e60786dc44ccb1b7d1e","audioVersion":"sha256:33353c298caf55add5677f086380facd89953e73f82de4e0a303d85f42a704ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:fc4a3d60d7de02185b2b24a93a5efd6ddf06a81009c712f00a6fc1a2d46d97a0","start":5.41,"end":8.12,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"先日、プロのゴルフ選手から聞いたんですが、初心者の多くが失敗するとすぐに打ち直そうとしてしまい、その結果、また同じような失敗を繰り返してしまうそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:b820d5344f21e76f1f3129cd2c002ee5f7fb054b2c57ab5daea126de2d5d38a2","audioVersion":"sha256:33353c298caf55add5677f086380facd89953e73f82de4e0a303d85f42a704ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:fc4a3d60d7de02185b2b24a93a5efd6ddf06a81009c712f00a6fc1a2d46d97a0","start":9.91,"end":21.23,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"仕事や日常生活でも同じことが言えるんではないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:b126835813e10ee0e864df8c7207c3b1ba04d3c61fb089e2a1d8a55200e8f9e5","audioVersion":"sha256:33353c298caf55add5677f086380facd89953e73f82de4e0a303d85f42a704ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:fc4a3d60d7de02185b2b24a93a5efd6ddf06a81009c712f00a6fc1a2d46d97a0","start":21.85,"end":25.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"少し気分転換をしてから次の行動に移ればこのようなことは避けることができるかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:8a50437469fda0630c3fa4f5a7178e1139441421c6c3bb3a5a610af585b47a3d","audioVersion":"sha256:33353c298caf55add5677f086380facd89953e73f82de4e0a303d85f42a704ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:fc4a3d60d7de02185b2b24a93a5efd6ddf06a81009c712f00a6fc1a2d46d97a0","start":26.43,"end":33.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"焦りや過度の緊張を持続しないことがポイントになるのでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:95d80344ac431373db7c05425be2550f2acf80f82e764fa2875af8714338d9c6","audioVersion":"sha256:33353c298caf55add5677f086380facd89953e73f82de4e0a303d85f42a704ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:fc4a3d60d7de02185b2b24a93a5efd6ddf06a81009c712f00a6fc1a2d46d97a0","start":33.73,"end":37.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"ぜひ参考にしたいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:b4f3a1c9188159f79fdc914a7b5ab45f4d406d1eb48c7b2fa501e3c30b7955a9","audioVersion":"sha256:33353c298caf55add5677f086380facd89953e73f82de4e0a303d85f42a704ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:fc4a3d60d7de02185b2b24a93a5efd6ddf06a81009c712f00a6fc1a2d46d97a0","start":38.46,"end":40.18,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:2:line-1","text":"男の人が伝えたいことはなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:c1ff1ddfd7618ce3d0021c11c349ac43d2cd0de1295c0cd410b03615248097b9","audioVersion":"sha256:33353c298caf55add5677f086380facd89953e73f82de4e0a303d85f42a704ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:fc4a3d60d7de02185b2b24a93a5efd6ddf06a81009c712f00a6fc1a2d46d97a0","start":45.94,"end":48.8,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"9680ca9ea603d70e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6d55892ee398c4bd23c4ca254eae1a12fa48a89ef30b261132d2d6815b8d9be1","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a240da8004847d8c72022e366e6c4d1a7f87d76fcc0edc497cf1b2239dd93db","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3:question","text":"ラジオで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:bea3a221e6161ba0820ce1214df6e60533cfcddc023c8e660b12196bf86bc650","audioVersion":"sha256:6d55892ee398c4bd23c4ca254eae1a12fa48a89ef30b261132d2d6815b8d9be1","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a240da8004847d8c72022e366e6c4d1a7f87d76fcc0edc497cf1b2239dd93db","start":5.32,"end":7.98,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"最近、元気なお年寄りが増えています。","textVersion":"sha256:5cf02fee4f6d90b7c754e8f716ec6168ce88be433f92758549685b5f3a9160b2","audioVersion":"sha256:6d55892ee398c4bd23c4ca254eae1a12fa48a89ef30b261132d2d6815b8d9be1","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a240da8004847d8c72022e366e6c4d1a7f87d76fcc0edc497cf1b2239dd93db","start":9.74,"end":12.76,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"例えば、みどり市ではお年寄りが道路や川を清掃するなど、地域活動を行なったり、小学校で演奏会を開くといった学校教育の支援に取り組んだり、と様々な活動を行なっています。","textVersion":"sha256:f6e2d69a00db87b48450aa1f767e9d2a7f3a4fa408d54c28ca33e22bb8750ce8","audioVersion":"sha256:6d55892ee398c4bd23c4ca254eae1a12fa48a89ef30b261132d2d6815b8d9be1","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a240da8004847d8c72022e366e6c4d1a7f87d76fcc0edc497cf1b2239dd93db","start":13.26,"end":29.09,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"このような社会貢献が今注目され、各地で始まっています。","textVersion":"sha256:d987a51b2e4eb637824574861ed24b25e6a2194b5099bb15fc681c6cae83e94e","audioVersion":"sha256:6d55892ee398c4bd23c4ca254eae1a12fa48a89ef30b261132d2d6815b8d9be1","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a240da8004847d8c72022e366e6c4d1a7f87d76fcc0edc497cf1b2239dd93db","start":29.77,"end":34.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"定年後に積極的に地域の活動に関わり、住民同士の交流を図ろうというこうした動きは、今後ますます増えていくでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:874ef5cfa85a6581b6e833a362b5fc1073edd32287182c1f695c8a148fceb67d","audioVersion":"sha256:6d55892ee398c4bd23c4ca254eae1a12fa48a89ef30b261132d2d6815b8d9be1","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a240da8004847d8c72022e366e6c4d1a7f87d76fcc0edc497cf1b2239dd93db","start":35.13,"end":44.97,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:3:line-1","text":"女の人はなにについて話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:08e748b174de2aec8fbb55ce42f51baa0d7bdda50827b37df586b36b2b9d5a20","audioVersion":"sha256:6d55892ee398c4bd23c4ca254eae1a12fa48a89ef30b261132d2d6815b8d9be1","timelineVersion":"sha256:6a240da8004847d8c72022e366e6c4d1a7f87d76fcc0edc497cf1b2239dd93db","start":50.84,"end":54.42,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"9680ca9ea603d70e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:20f2072e2318000f7b61a94aeaa32a5b3ecf46a381851d2d322fb19aa3b58de3","timelineVersion":"sha256:43cbc8368fff1f89b6f2311654913853157f8c8808b860d0ea7f8d7bccbca7cd","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4:question","text":"テレビでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:8fdb6969009d3021aa40bc2145c9877906af3b49491bd86948656ad3e20f7644","audioVersion":"sha256:20f2072e2318000f7b61a94aeaa32a5b3ecf46a381851d2d322fb19aa3b58de3","timelineVersion":"sha256:43cbc8368fff1f89b6f2311654913853157f8c8808b860d0ea7f8d7bccbca7cd","start":5.27,"end":7.83,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"最近、自宅で蜂を育てて、蜂蜜をとる人が増えています。","textVersion":"sha256:460a55e863239116df31111c20c52d8997d0089652750783c5d7d2f8c5f41ff9","audioVersion":"sha256:20f2072e2318000f7b61a94aeaa32a5b3ecf46a381851d2d322fb19aa3b58de3","timelineVersion":"sha256:43cbc8368fff1f89b6f2311654913853157f8c8808b860d0ea7f8d7bccbca7cd","start":9.67,"end":14.61,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"蜂はめったに人を刺すことはなく、毎日餌をやる手間もないので、気軽に飼えるそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:2e5a23415a207e05f95b7e3feea3ec0c60680fb07f879ab48b17d0f373e0a128","audioVersion":"sha256:20f2072e2318000f7b61a94aeaa32a5b3ecf46a381851d2d322fb19aa3b58de3","timelineVersion":"sha256:43cbc8368fff1f89b6f2311654913853157f8c8808b860d0ea7f8d7bccbca7cd","start":15.22,"end":21.93,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"しかし、趣味で蜂を飼う人が増えて、近所の人とトラブルになったり、蜂蜜を販売する本業の人が育てている蜂に病気を移したりといった問題も出てきています。","textVersion":"sha256:9bb798b6048f953a02217fb66ef7b7b53a80deee9c4c28704956b0600a96df7d","audioVersion":"sha256:20f2072e2318000f7b61a94aeaa32a5b3ecf46a381851d2d322fb19aa3b58de3","timelineVersion":"sha256:43cbc8368fff1f89b6f2311654913853157f8c8808b860d0ea7f8d7bccbca7cd","start":22.38,"end":34.84,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"飼っている人はもちろん、これから飼おうとしている人もこのようなことがないよう、気をつけることが大切です。","textVersion":"sha256:7defe624aa310ca9a406df468422a0b35f8b3882404e2fe88e98f14ce902ee3c","audioVersion":"sha256:20f2072e2318000f7b61a94aeaa32a5b3ecf46a381851d2d322fb19aa3b58de3","timelineVersion":"sha256:43cbc8368fff1f89b6f2311654913853157f8c8808b860d0ea7f8d7bccbca7cd","start":35.47,"end":42.89,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-0.segment-4","text":"また、このような問題に対処するため、これまでは趣味で蜂を飼う場合に届け出る必要はありませんでしたが、法律が改正され、今後は届けだすことが必要となります。","textVersion":"sha256:38b1c59d61c34b64cf2153c049e31e544897a2ea70fbb7fa58f3fbf62d150998","audioVersion":"sha256:20f2072e2318000f7b61a94aeaa32a5b3ecf46a381851d2d322fb19aa3b58de3","timelineVersion":"sha256:43cbc8368fff1f89b6f2311654913853157f8c8808b860d0ea7f8d7bccbca7cd","start":43.48,"end":55.99,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:4:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1673c6b733a690adbb707ef47c46062fdbdcbd22d253b9eaed3d67372d7d4c2a","audioVersion":"sha256:20f2072e2318000f7b61a94aeaa32a5b3ecf46a381851d2d322fb19aa3b58de3","timelineVersion":"sha256:43cbc8368fff1f89b6f2311654913853157f8c8808b860d0ea7f8d7bccbca7cd","start":61.76,"end":65.36,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"9680ca9ea603d70e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5","examKey":"2014-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2014.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:92a46ace0a01be5d7e17fdee71dadc6356aefd2d4f2154952859d687521b331d","timelineVersion":"sha256:455fdbf70869f408f94ebcec5b313cc7aef2043f75c99239ac3c9be694754cf0","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2014.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2014-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5:question","text":"テレビで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:9f756bd268921721862260545eaa539d59602c111a0e31b74650bee1a57b2a43","audioVersion":"sha256:92a46ace0a01be5d7e17fdee71dadc6356aefd2d4f2154952859d687521b331d","timelineVersion":"sha256:455fdbf70869f408f94ebcec5b313cc7aef2043f75c99239ac3c9be694754cf0","start":5.32,"end":8.33,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"人間の生活には、労働、趣味、消費活動など様々な要素がありますが、労働はほかの要素と異なり、楽しいことばかりではありません。","textVersion":"sha256:dd4eb9828f55910ba9a7dcdf5844c4c47b26b8248762ad76f9afc79db7cc0366","audioVersion":"sha256:92a46ace0a01be5d7e17fdee71dadc6356aefd2d4f2154952859d687521b331d","timelineVersion":"sha256:455fdbf70869f408f94ebcec5b313cc7aef2043f75c99239ac3c9be694754cf0","start":10.07,"end":21.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"それでも人が働くのは単に消費活動や趣味、娯楽を楽しむためにお金が必要だからということだけではありません。","textVersion":"sha256:d796e8c759f4e02f2dc7bbe9a136a90b757055ce069569b774f0a130fef36d88","audioVersion":"sha256:92a46ace0a01be5d7e17fdee71dadc6356aefd2d4f2154952859d687521b331d","timelineVersion":"sha256:455fdbf70869f408f94ebcec5b313cc7aef2043f75c99239ac3c9be694754cf0","start":21.69,"end":30.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"人間は仕事上の目標が達成され、誰かに認められたとき、充実感を得ます。","textVersion":"sha256:57e977869af7af5afa5b80bcc9f79f23381ffc0525c5d69efe5fdbafbbdcfee5","audioVersion":"sha256:92a46ace0a01be5d7e17fdee71dadc6356aefd2d4f2154952859d687521b331d","timelineVersion":"sha256:455fdbf70869f408f94ebcec5b313cc7aef2043f75c99239ac3c9be694754cf0","start":31.28,"end":37.59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"これは人間が生きる上で非常に大きな意味を持ちます。","textVersion":"sha256:b32cb29eea3745493297804bfd6a9862397d2fcd2217b088c7428a7d4cc34599","audioVersion":"sha256:92a46ace0a01be5d7e17fdee71dadc6356aefd2d4f2154952859d687521b331d","timelineVersion":"sha256:455fdbf70869f408f94ebcec5b313cc7aef2043f75c99239ac3c9be694754cf0","start":38.08,"end":42.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"買い物などの消費活動では得難い感覚だからです。","textVersion":"sha256:7e46dc2d114f913bcdad2f2a1a22f71cdb50d1a520ef610a918a6517675c81d0","audioVersion":"sha256:92a46ace0a01be5d7e17fdee71dadc6356aefd2d4f2154952859d687521b331d","timelineVersion":"sha256:455fdbf70869f408f94ebcec5b313cc7aef2043f75c99239ac3c9be694754cf0","start":42.58,"end":46.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2014-12:5:line-1","text":"男の人が伝えたいことはなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:c1ff1ddfd7618ce3d0021c11c349ac43d2cd0de1295c0cd410b03615248097b9","audioVersion":"sha256:92a46ace0a01be5d7e17fdee71dadc6356aefd2d4f2154952859d687521b331d","timelineVersion":"sha256:455fdbf70869f408f94ebcec5b313cc7aef2043f75c99239ac3c9be694754cf0","start":51.94,"end":55.01,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"9680ca9ea603d70e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1:question","text":"ラジオで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:bea3a221e6161ba0820ce1214df6e60533cfcddc023c8e660b12196bf86bc650","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","start":5.63,"end":8.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"もうすっかり秋ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:c73f3af371b74d4081f0816d65d204a816d65253af6d35d1fbea7accbbc4ecde","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","start":12.46,"end":14.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"秋は特に果物がおいしい季節です。","textVersion":"sha256:4776cce990d6912e2157efc7240ddd22eb4661ef986c0c65aec24ceef746a204","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","start":14.69,"end":17.87,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"都会から少し離れて田舎へ行くと、葡萄や梨などを自分で収穫したりして、自然との触れ合いを楽しめる果物農園がたくさんあります。","textVersion":"sha256:f7756a6013c37fd5ea3366811e5aafc901275c980b4607a329eb151633c4fc89","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","start":18.7,"end":28.86,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"果物以外にも、きのこ探しや稲刈りといった収穫体験もあります。","textVersion":"sha256:485d05984631cbc7bc75732af22de338051333a8f22ee91a80fdc5500071a11e","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","start":29.26,"end":34.69,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"最近はにわとり小屋で、まだ温かいたまごを取ったり、海から川に戻ってきた鮭を捕まえるなど、生き物と接することができるツアーもあるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:2b2d803f4b1279d5f2688835a7a47fc4f320ca645af1afd6054d557e270006f2","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","start":35.24,"end":46.4,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-0.segment-5","text":"子供たちはきっと大喜びするんじゃないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:40454996cb56a3d42e2fc857e7bf884727f895f02fd9951dfb95b4c55565f0b7","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","start":47.1,"end":50.51,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:1:line-1","text":"女の人は何について紹介していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ddfcf52191c9f2d2e1d06b8fd4df0eeae3bd2ecedf03a342fc8a927747c4dd22","audioVersion":"sha256:486507f9a0292f9d0847a49474479320d225e16a05fc0e58d4dac6deb6fddbb4","timelineVersion":"sha256:c88ac4f9abe8c5768a19af0119dd278a8e48ce5eabf01c13d29a02000b0c69d1","start":58.25,"end":62.05,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"49427ea6cb91d713"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0d79a15edd99267af75ba29bbceb0f6e1c19e7ef8b4d85227aeaa06e48953b2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:eebf01500ee3d0f9a3cc293f2d9973dd4b85c76120b79dea1388a0c4dd37da7f","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2:question","text":"ラジオで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:bea3a221e6161ba0820ce1214df6e60533cfcddc023c8e660b12196bf86bc650","audioVersion":"sha256:0d79a15edd99267af75ba29bbceb0f6e1c19e7ef8b4d85227aeaa06e48953b2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:eebf01500ee3d0f9a3cc293f2d9973dd4b85c76120b79dea1388a0c4dd37da7f","start":5.55,"end":8.68,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"私、趣味でパンを作ってるんですが、この間、なんとなくいつも使っている小麦粉、新しく出た別のメーカーのものに変えてみたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:ca2e1708a9d0289af99a3ba378e30ef4e47c0927076e479a6e26a8572467bc06","audioVersion":"sha256:0d79a15edd99267af75ba29bbceb0f6e1c19e7ef8b4d85227aeaa06e48953b2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:eebf01500ee3d0f9a3cc293f2d9973dd4b85c76120b79dea1388a0c4dd37da7f","start":10.38,"end":22.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"今までは、一番いいと思ってるメーカーのものがあって、ほかのを使おうなんて思ったこともなかったんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:f16738f94d9d397c336083205d1fba0d7e1c88766bb0161b6b1f11db1c39bffa","audioVersion":"sha256:0d79a15edd99267af75ba29bbceb0f6e1c19e7ef8b4d85227aeaa06e48953b2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:eebf01500ee3d0f9a3cc293f2d9973dd4b85c76120b79dea1388a0c4dd37da7f","start":22.87,"end":30.61,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"そうしたらこれが美味しくて、それで思ったんです。","textVersion":"sha256:5044b447beb2ba9a80046a914400afa46aa7176ed041e79b226632e6a9c0f2d2","audioVersion":"sha256:0d79a15edd99267af75ba29bbceb0f6e1c19e7ef8b4d85227aeaa06e48953b2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:eebf01500ee3d0f9a3cc293f2d9973dd4b85c76120b79dea1388a0c4dd37da7f","start":31.22,"end":35.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"ちゃんとした理由や目的がなくても、とりあえず何か新しいことをやってみることで、世界は広がるんだなって。","textVersion":"sha256:ffe59c52376f35f0a3d9702cd88ba6d74df70d9068fc530979dd97996ee3552b","audioVersion":"sha256:0d79a15edd99267af75ba29bbceb0f6e1c19e7ef8b4d85227aeaa06e48953b2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:eebf01500ee3d0f9a3cc293f2d9973dd4b85c76120b79dea1388a0c4dd37da7f","start":35.82,"end":43.74,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"これが一番って、自分が確信していることがあっても、まあ、それはそれで大事だと思うんですが、それにとらわれすぎないようにしたいと思いました。","textVersion":"sha256:d7d9efbcac4505e715cc0c7ce3e131e771ba3fc42f1e7b6ace59c677dae38d32","audioVersion":"sha256:0d79a15edd99267af75ba29bbceb0f6e1c19e7ef8b4d85227aeaa06e48953b2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:eebf01500ee3d0f9a3cc293f2d9973dd4b85c76120b79dea1388a0c4dd37da7f","start":44.01,"end":54.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:2:line-1","text":"女の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7e8a32195345cb90500b7129a6f116813d5545b0f07a7f6d9b9c168efbf7ed61","audioVersion":"sha256:0d79a15edd99267af75ba29bbceb0f6e1c19e7ef8b4d85227aeaa06e48953b2a","timelineVersion":"sha256:eebf01500ee3d0f9a3cc293f2d9973dd4b85c76120b79dea1388a0c4dd37da7f","start":60.4,"end":63.99,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"49427ea6cb91d713"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7384bcebf2b994f97fb9b5a99e1f5f09c408029e85fd2c45d6623b2ca49ce49e","timelineVersion":"sha256:629f2eddbcc152f9cdfa5fc7f1a02135088bf9d827a14038eff8a87f7898adb7","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3:question","text":"講演会で教育の評論家が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:cc29767b3aca5d3f1540e60e996de1fb3eb10dd85186d93b46c597c549012a16","audioVersion":"sha256:7384bcebf2b994f97fb9b5a99e1f5f09c408029e85fd2c45d6623b2ca49ce49e","timelineVersion":"sha256:629f2eddbcc152f9cdfa5fc7f1a02135088bf9d827a14038eff8a87f7898adb7","start":5.7,"end":9.71,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"近年、小学生が理科に興味を持たなくなる子供の理科離れが進んでいます。","textVersion":"sha256:510d21689df788c9cc3a90e4855dd66861dcb5e7fb400cf0240a93c720955ac9","audioVersion":"sha256:7384bcebf2b994f97fb9b5a99e1f5f09c408029e85fd2c45d6623b2ca49ce49e","timelineVersion":"sha256:629f2eddbcc152f9cdfa5fc7f1a02135088bf9d827a14038eff8a87f7898adb7","start":11.41,"end":18.15,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"その対策として、理科の授業を増やしてはどうかという考えがありますが、果たして、それで問題が解決されるでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:cd343fb51670137fbadcaaa9600ec3b9b083215bd7851e7d0777c48d26138290","audioVersion":"sha256:7384bcebf2b994f97fb9b5a99e1f5f09c408029e85fd2c45d6623b2ca49ce49e","timelineVersion":"sha256:629f2eddbcc152f9cdfa5fc7f1a02135088bf9d827a14038eff8a87f7898adb7","start":19,"end":27.69,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"まずは、深い知識と豊かな経験を備えた現場の指導者を育てることに目を向けるべきだと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:8cddcef378ca8a17136d5a3b91ce1be5c9339a80b425911504504b0a04cfeb94","audioVersion":"sha256:7384bcebf2b994f97fb9b5a99e1f5f09c408029e85fd2c45d6623b2ca49ce49e","timelineVersion":"sha256:629f2eddbcc152f9cdfa5fc7f1a02135088bf9d827a14038eff8a87f7898adb7","start":28.5,"end":36.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"子供たちに理科を好きになってもらおうと、市や町が科学イベントを開催したり、学校で興味を引く実験を行ったりしても、その興味が持続するよう、導ける人がいなくては意味がないのです。","textVersion":"sha256:6723bc748e634e431758096d192f78afe293a3c9015073ab4f31a5c10b368767","audioVersion":"sha256:7384bcebf2b994f97fb9b5a99e1f5f09c408029e85fd2c45d6623b2ca49ce49e","timelineVersion":"sha256:629f2eddbcc152f9cdfa5fc7f1a02135088bf9d827a14038eff8a87f7898adb7","start":37.55,"end":52.35,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:3:line-1","text":"評論家が言いたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:aa3bac6d4e2470affd71d3f3561a68659c023279a5ef0cccc2c797ff0f3ecfd2","audioVersion":"sha256:7384bcebf2b994f97fb9b5a99e1f5f09c408029e85fd2c45d6623b2ca49ce49e","timelineVersion":"sha256:629f2eddbcc152f9cdfa5fc7f1a02135088bf9d827a14038eff8a87f7898adb7","start":58.12,"end":61.24,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"49427ea6cb91d713"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:question","text":"テレビで、男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:348eeeec0abc1963ac8e0ab90aed8ee9509199652f4b183d7e656cec56a78fc2","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":5.67,"end":8.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"私も６５歳を過ぎて、定年を迎え、年金をいただく年になりました。","textVersion":"sha256:651666557149414527723fa219739a817290de418d12d703f0815c8af413d7f5","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":10.49,"end":16.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"妻はまだ働いてるんですけどね。","textVersion":"sha256:f1d50106c8176d0ff227bcf9d449d637680cd1e62b8791692a33112587c7299a","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":17.15,"end":19.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"昔は定年になったら、大好きな趣味、あ、釣りなんですが、釣りを思う存分楽しみたいと思ってたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:2586c43cd00ce157d32075028cb6c21bd9b4aa6b69e6074a5397942ee6c20841","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":19.83,"end":28.73,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"ところが、ある日、仕事で忙しい妻のために、夕飯を作ったら、思った以上に喜んでもらえて、やりがいを感じて、いろいろ作るようになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:e613d5528d5e92572517b4a826a2908c2840c180ae1c0c5183c70a8b0ee9121e","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":29.37,"end":40.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0.segment-4","text":"自分なりにいろんな工夫ができますし、掃除や洗濯だってそうなんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:ca33807a06cc8df2f82ca154a87ad4beb710487cac033082d233bac0b4a60d97","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":41.06,"end":46.99,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0.segment-5","text":"ちょっとした気づきや発見もあって、妻に代わって、張り切ってやってます。","textVersion":"sha256:a7cbba403b499f74044b90c1ac4042ce0d48fb493792d45d5ebbd0083dc88b4e","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":47.42,"end":52.59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-0.segment-6","text":"今では、釣りに出かけても、釣った魚を見て、今晩は何にしようかなと考えるようになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:ba7f066402d837b55b32e5fc6021293a9b962f857ce57d804207c7e820b546c8","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":53.3,"end":59.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:4:line-1","text":"男の人は主に何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:f16c887db7086f07392e5d8979e992aa6380093e77cdb26ce103eee247814493","audioVersion":"sha256:96c4d1098906171b8a311234ef74526bc27f9868def91a55020c45053a140bb8","timelineVersion":"sha256:d933e2b56846c9b4dcc0abd73f0ee0f04eefd440b9002941205d2965f88e55fc","start":65.64,"end":70,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"49427ea6cb91d713"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5","examKey":"2015-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d75a4911a76f339363489219fe0db416f70ace25f97273f2c2ac8403fe584bd7","timelineVersion":"sha256:95862991e6b7da247904e2c60fb616374bdb31dfe943b729b7296733c0bbe23e","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5:question","text":"テレビで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:9f756bd268921721862260545eaa539d59602c111a0e31b74650bee1a57b2a43","audioVersion":"sha256:d75a4911a76f339363489219fe0db416f70ace25f97273f2c2ac8403fe584bd7","timelineVersion":"sha256:95862991e6b7da247904e2c60fb616374bdb31dfe943b729b7296733c0bbe23e","start":5.42,"end":8.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"新学期は電子辞書を買う人も多いと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:79c0687207a00b8701377cdb5c4d8ef6a860636320cfdacde0354974d962fdef","audioVersion":"sha256:d75a4911a76f339363489219fe0db416f70ace25f97273f2c2ac8403fe584bd7","timelineVersion":"sha256:95862991e6b7da247904e2c60fb616374bdb31dfe943b729b7296733c0bbe23e","start":10.26,"end":13.68,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"最近はいろんな機種が店に並んでいますね。","textVersion":"sha256:09302e172f5b0119921cb98995f67be57104cd0f3b934ffe9a75a467b72e576c","audioVersion":"sha256:d75a4911a76f339363489219fe0db416f70ace25f97273f2c2ac8403fe584bd7","timelineVersion":"sha256:95862991e6b7da247904e2c60fb616374bdb31dfe943b729b7296733c0bbe23e","start":13.85,"end":16.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"百科辞典や外国語辞書以外にもいろいろなものが入っていてソフトが充実しています。","textVersion":"sha256:cd882b823a58cf1dabad6ee42daff2945250bcfe22ca6625bb69f8f30cd68f29","audioVersion":"sha256:d75a4911a76f339363489219fe0db416f70ace25f97273f2c2ac8403fe584bd7","timelineVersion":"sha256:95862991e6b7da247904e2c60fb616374bdb31dfe943b729b7296733c0bbe23e","start":17.09,"end":22.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"また、カラーで見られるもの、音声が出るものなど、機能も多様化していますから、どれを買っていいか分からないという人も多いんじゃないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:3ae8c98e5acc74a99486465c8cf55f4c43755459a4dbb6f91dfd9962dc76ba23","audioVersion":"sha256:d75a4911a76f339363489219fe0db416f70ace25f97273f2c2ac8403fe584bd7","timelineVersion":"sha256:95862991e6b7da247904e2c60fb616374bdb31dfe943b729b7296733c0bbe23e","start":23.2,"end":32.41,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"毎年、機能もソフトも新しくなるので、購入するタイミングも難しいんですが、まあ、自分に本当に必要なものは何かよく考えて欲張りすぎず、必要最小限のものに決めるのをお勧めします。","textVersion":"sha256:e05c473db67544474c0a433f0eea07ce07084e4934b33ad01acf143296bf01f6","audioVersion":"sha256:d75a4911a76f339363489219fe0db416f70ace25f97273f2c2ac8403fe584bd7","timelineVersion":"sha256:95862991e6b7da247904e2c60fb616374bdb31dfe943b729b7296733c0bbe23e","start":33,"end":47.16,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-07:5:line-1","text":"男の人は主に電子辞書の何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a40e41e6fa67e12f4850aa92d0b8427d79dcca9d776e7c1f42c971e590f7cbb9","audioVersion":"sha256:d75a4911a76f339363489219fe0db416f70ace25f97273f2c2ac8403fe584bd7","timelineVersion":"sha256:95862991e6b7da247904e2c60fb616374bdb31dfe943b729b7296733c0bbe23e","start":52.8,"end":58.04,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"49427ea6cb91d713"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:0afbccb3c0b1f43153071e62738fa2b752153df3bd6f8f07eab3c6771541126d","timelineVersion":"sha256:77799511fb08d8522204acfede7f2939c764c63a9cd3d6defa7f971372d1ca01","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1:question","text":"ラジオで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:0ccf292cc278e347a153fb220db53863294b915454a13e60786dc44ccb1b7d1e","audioVersion":"sha256:0afbccb3c0b1f43153071e62738fa2b752153df3bd6f8f07eab3c6771541126d","timelineVersion":"sha256:77799511fb08d8522204acfede7f2939c764c63a9cd3d6defa7f971372d1ca01","start":5.34,"end":8.01,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"ええ、近代文学を代表する作家佐藤じゅんですが、実は彼は幼い頃から石の採集に夢中で、石先生と呼ばれるほどだったそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:77d55210f3e6580f5f4097fcdf7bfaded59087c3eae79da653df621023e2c8db","audioVersion":"sha256:0afbccb3c0b1f43153071e62738fa2b752153df3bd6f8f07eab3c6771541126d","timelineVersion":"sha256:77799511fb08d8522204acfede7f2939c764c63a9cd3d6defa7f971372d1ca01","start":9.76,"end":21.51,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"これ、ご存知ない方も多いんじゃないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:3b4a4da004406d873b365fa3359bab632b24228d584e0a318dc0c6d5ab6a7c63","audioVersion":"sha256:0afbccb3c0b1f43153071e62738fa2b752153df3bd6f8f07eab3c6771541126d","timelineVersion":"sha256:77799511fb08d8522204acfede7f2939c764c63a9cd3d6defa7f971372d1ca01","start":22.29,"end":25.12,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"彼は大学で農業を専攻し、卒業後故郷に戻って高校の教師になってからも、石の研究は続けていたそうで、彼がふるさとの川で収集した石のコレクションは今でもふるさとの博物館に残されています。","textVersion":"sha256:38d69b7cd43241f6327ed3ec34f29713d85848c3811ba94b13573d90abfde6d8","audioVersion":"sha256:0afbccb3c0b1f43153071e62738fa2b752153df3bd6f8f07eab3c6771541126d","timelineVersion":"sha256:77799511fb08d8522204acfede7f2939c764c63a9cd3d6defa7f971372d1ca01","start":25.88,"end":42.43,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"彼の作品を読むと、石の名前なんかがよく登場するんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0578972e123179195be4ec1553ac30e8c04c4fe0da214d24365d738a1d0bcaf5","audioVersion":"sha256:0afbccb3c0b1f43153071e62738fa2b752153df3bd6f8f07eab3c6771541126d","timelineVersion":"sha256:77799511fb08d8522204acfede7f2939c764c63a9cd3d6defa7f971372d1ca01","start":43.04,"end":47.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:1:line-1","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:0afbccb3c0b1f43153071e62738fa2b752153df3bd6f8f07eab3c6771541126d","timelineVersion":"sha256:77799511fb08d8522204acfede7f2939c764c63a9cd3d6defa7f971372d1ca01","start":53.38,"end":56.71,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b79024674505a974"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b6c6adae43cdbb2b1bee92b3b59307153fe5b40909b7b5a6535190dbded4d6ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:bc592f5efb880d2f0b4d52781c2f7dc1794d1fd78f21ec731db85d66b6f8b019","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2:question","text":"大学の授業で先生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:1a330a131610dffa65672f76bec088c9290a36417493b33616f90596e6cb5d6e","audioVersion":"sha256:b6c6adae43cdbb2b1bee92b3b59307153fe5b40909b7b5a6535190dbded4d6ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:bc592f5efb880d2f0b4d52781c2f7dc1794d1fd78f21ec731db85d66b6f8b019","start":5.76,"end":8.8,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"日本では主に夏と秋に全国で特色のある大小さまざまな祭りが行われていますが、祭りは単に地域の人々の娯楽というだけでなく、それに参加する人々のつながりも深めてくれます。","textVersion":"sha256:ec6399d36c8ef564a879982f8c84ea96087e28af124db00fd40a7a23eee7e51a","audioVersion":"sha256:b6c6adae43cdbb2b1bee92b3b59307153fe5b40909b7b5a6535190dbded4d6ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:bc592f5efb880d2f0b4d52781c2f7dc1794d1fd78f21ec731db85d66b6f8b019","start":10.57,"end":26.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"規模の大きい祭りでは、観光客が多く訪れ、地域経済にも大きく貢献します。","textVersion":"sha256:a5086dd2c874106497113378eb87c59f32df98499bfc7b73e73e5bc269aa4711","audioVersion":"sha256:b6c6adae43cdbb2b1bee92b3b59307153fe5b40909b7b5a6535190dbded4d6ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:bc592f5efb880d2f0b4d52781c2f7dc1794d1fd78f21ec731db85d66b6f8b019","start":27.28,"end":34.25,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"祭りが行われることによって、その地域の存在を広くアピールできるなど、さまざまな利点が考えられます。","textVersion":"sha256:100bf42336d84727541ceb174fff4f924335f5f80b9a2f2f4c988b712d7558df","audioVersion":"sha256:b6c6adae43cdbb2b1bee92b3b59307153fe5b40909b7b5a6535190dbded4d6ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:bc592f5efb880d2f0b4d52781c2f7dc1794d1fd78f21ec731db85d66b6f8b019","start":34.6,"end":43.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:2:line-1","text":"先生は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c9af9e016d3216b539f28fec1ec3917b3c078976b5fdb9bd1891d66d61695d32","audioVersion":"sha256:b6c6adae43cdbb2b1bee92b3b59307153fe5b40909b7b5a6535190dbded4d6ca","timelineVersion":"sha256:bc592f5efb880d2f0b4d52781c2f7dc1794d1fd78f21ec731db85d66b6f8b019","start":48.97,"end":51.76,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b79024674505a974"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:question","text":"工場でテレビのレポーターが男の人にインタビューをしています。","textVersion":"sha256:252f97751ed6a04bfd8986c8363e49e922c903cc2e2466974aefa282b86f0063","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":5.65,"end":10.95,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-0","text":"今日はニッコリ食品ヨーグルト工場の田中さんにお話を伺います。こちらのニッコリヨーグルト、おいしいと人気ですが、最近蓋の裏にヨーグルトがつかないと評判になっているそうですね。","textVersion":"sha256:4cd738cfa8c542e60f0309e8a9000a70e382396dbd2b84a81f15aa8102e9799e","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":12.7,"end":26.89,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-1","text":"はい、お客様から蓋にヨーグルトがついてしまってもったいないといった声がありまして、それをきっかけに蓋を工夫しました。","textVersion":"sha256:7e1d8fd21c894c42bafb68c312dfa521905132ceedf401846a56095b94c244de","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":26.91,"end":35.84,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-2","text":"どうしてつかないんでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:5c88adcc6f7a042ba8997273c0ab5a4d30b9b9f2bc09c7a7769115821e448676","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":35.89,"end":37.69,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-3","text":"たとえば果物のももを思い出してください。ももの皮には毛がはえていて水がつきにくいですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:809fb13fbcbe1253dc793f20278d475a98015d72db33e67b4e42c5caba46a59a","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":37.98,"end":46.49,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-4","text":"はい。","textVersion":"sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":46.74,"end":47.41,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-5","text":"この仕組みと同じように、蓋の表面にたくさんの細かい突起を作ったというわけなんです。","textVersion":"sha256:de5cc8528881245f6e4229c5dd5420b6618faa9d4f64ac09e32110a77ab719ac","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":47.54,"end":53.57,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-6","text":"なるほど。工夫されてますね。","textVersion":"sha256:c159d553f012d1b700caad8271de77352a56ba19ef7ab8a2a797ca2795923d72","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":53.83,"end":56.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:3:line-7","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:3dd8a8cf41b4a1f28755cf388814e1803b49f62bfd02a22418875cd012ba2ce2","timelineVersion":"sha256:74e06a5eb47fc9d682c517db1bcdbbfa47f069e05bd13f3a2bedd5b2ac622ca0","start":62.72,"end":66.18,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b79024674505a974"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:554a82ca300d7a1c4ec5672a7c2c8412ad66f7e636f9a90aab9f5a1736b3accc","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1e78bc0dd25d9b8f2229c7883b13abe318babab814178726bb29865a5941422","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4:question","text":"テレビで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:9f756bd268921721862260545eaa539d59602c111a0e31b74650bee1a57b2a43","audioVersion":"sha256:554a82ca300d7a1c4ec5672a7c2c8412ad66f7e636f9a90aab9f5a1736b3accc","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1e78bc0dd25d9b8f2229c7883b13abe318babab814178726bb29865a5941422","start":5.62,"end":8.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"皆さんは大勢の前でスピーチしなければならない時など、緊張で心臓がドキドキしてしまう、そんな経験があると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:4d01fbcda440f862e4d48f410e4a5590a6b7a1061e2db74eb6d867db65bc0ad0","audioVersion":"sha256:554a82ca300d7a1c4ec5672a7c2c8412ad66f7e636f9a90aab9f5a1736b3accc","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1e78bc0dd25d9b8f2229c7883b13abe318babab814178726bb29865a5941422","start":9.96,"end":18.63,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"これは自律神経という体のある神経の働きによるものなんです。","textVersion":"sha256:4a5cbf4ac86eec6d4dd3f057d1519e68ae7024a0ad7abb7c4b4c17ba8776e5d0","audioVersion":"sha256:554a82ca300d7a1c4ec5672a7c2c8412ad66f7e636f9a90aab9f5a1736b3accc","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1e78bc0dd25d9b8f2229c7883b13abe318babab814178726bb29865a5941422","start":19.15,"end":24.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"この神経は体のいろいろな機能を活発に働かせたり、鎮めたりする、いわば車のアクセルとブレーキのような働きをしています。","textVersion":"sha256:56604837b6eecf7dceebb26c63dcc8e56467cdc647790b7f1dae6657cad572d9","audioVersion":"sha256:554a82ca300d7a1c4ec5672a7c2c8412ad66f7e636f9a90aab9f5a1736b3accc","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1e78bc0dd25d9b8f2229c7883b13abe318babab814178726bb29865a5941422","start":24.7,"end":33.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"スピーチの時の緊張による心臓の変化は、スピーチという恐ろしいものと戦おうとしてアクセルを踏んだ状態となり、心臓を活発に働かせることによって起こるものなのです。","textVersion":"sha256:f68cc3557175ba999a31bdd153184a9236c311bb563ab439d57345121ad82a99","audioVersion":"sha256:554a82ca300d7a1c4ec5672a7c2c8412ad66f7e636f9a90aab9f5a1736b3accc","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1e78bc0dd25d9b8f2229c7883b13abe318babab814178726bb29865a5941422","start":34.37,"end":46.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:4:line-1","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:554a82ca300d7a1c4ec5672a7c2c8412ad66f7e636f9a90aab9f5a1736b3accc","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1e78bc0dd25d9b8f2229c7883b13abe318babab814178726bb29865a5941422","start":51.98,"end":55.46,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b79024674505a974"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","examKey":"2015-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2015.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2015.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2015-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5:question","text":"テレビでりんご農家の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:b8091a14a90adb21cb211002179772538b14619bbb7637468fdf2d6f921040e6","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","start":5.69,"end":8.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"うちは長年りんごを作っていますが、今年はいつもと比べて天候が悪く収穫がどうなるかなかなか見通しが立たなくて。","textVersion":"sha256:a7d51d44f0bea36e9fd8598603d2ea4105b5846b9786cfec0dede94dc983222b","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","start":10.3,"end":20.35,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"もちろん天候に左右されにくくするために、これまでさまざまな改良を重ねてきましたが、春先は雨がかなり降りましたからね。","textVersion":"sha256:f64ed8760e625f836081252245da08978c78b69ff199715f0a4cf1fc6cc5f157","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","start":21.09,"end":30.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"でもまあ、その後は天候もよく、何とか無事収穫できそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:b8b57a8ccfd98bf2c3365ed37088a5a6aab4fbd2ce6a9b7df8dc501ba59282e3","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","start":31.6,"end":36.67,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"心配したわりには見事に実り、今年は去年を上回りそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:d73cbf3178844a4b747c2ed2828d5e0ab0a8ae8769a9140945ba52c97aa5d2c2","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","start":37.47,"end":42.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"もうまもなく収穫が始まります。","textVersion":"sha256:061958990d92534ebdf0e9311300dc3d52fd68025c14001f6fc6798cce4050ad","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","start":43.17,"end":45.41,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-0.segment-5","text":"心を込めて作ったりんごを多くの方に食べていただきたいと思っています。","textVersion":"sha256:96f0bfc65312d4e010fdf3cdeee800b30fc4d950fb6e5d7e41cc5830ddfbb05a","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","start":45.92,"end":50.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2015-12:5:line-1","text":"りんご農家の人はりんごの何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:74f6ad105e80344b6264ec4efdd328ff24fa0561ea7ca8c1d8f604f8e5a0f79a","audioVersion":"sha256:828e4e4da1974c7508877d7776f15473a625702ef0a2c08f2e97cb0342160c28","timelineVersion":"sha256:3dfacbf8ded83ed34fd75e35777bad11d8d6822aa01d4baaa1d40f67c596c639","start":56.74,"end":61.03,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b79024674505a974"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:87749fe2c89b20b21bf52b9b8402390574d6816f34a6b4c5e665be2f12b2c5d5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a7755faac49bec5e1f7fd615340f661b08e52a5fe5137672df78e7d9b1c58fc","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1:question","text":"講演会で男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:6738913c4cc29abd0632eff1150721277caeb99771272ad6dbfa1d677149033b","audioVersion":"sha256:87749fe2c89b20b21bf52b9b8402390574d6816f34a6b4c5e665be2f12b2c5d5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a7755faac49bec5e1f7fd615340f661b08e52a5fe5137672df78e7d9b1c58fc","start":5.42,"end":8.75,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"皆さんは学校で、ある先生の授業になると決まって眠くなったという経験はありませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:565d504eb946abaa2fea48a322b78e04c47667c73981c801510880d4382630ff","audioVersion":"sha256:87749fe2c89b20b21bf52b9b8402390574d6816f34a6b4c5e665be2f12b2c5d5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a7755faac49bec5e1f7fd615340f661b08e52a5fe5137672df78e7d9b1c58fc","start":10.44,"end":16.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"それはその先生が身振り手振りを効果的に使って話していなかったからかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:35477d580e8813a16d44d79113e5bae5c66bb1372192e11daf562f54e83e7deb","audioVersion":"sha256:87749fe2c89b20b21bf52b9b8402390574d6816f34a6b4c5e665be2f12b2c5d5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a7755faac49bec5e1f7fd615340f661b08e52a5fe5137672df78e7d9b1c58fc","start":17.29,"end":23.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"結婚式でスピーチをする人が緊張のあまり、ただメモを読むように話すのを聞いていると、後になってどんな話だったか覚えていないというのもこれに似ています。","textVersion":"sha256:a647056eb7a30707fea023f3f969a4ce9a77aa1a0b5039238630d0ad0ee3d464","audioVersion":"sha256:87749fe2c89b20b21bf52b9b8402390574d6816f34a6b4c5e665be2f12b2c5d5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a7755faac49bec5e1f7fd615340f661b08e52a5fe5137672df78e7d9b1c58fc","start":24.12,"end":35.5,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"ほかの人に何かを伝えたいと思ったら、常に聞き手の様子を窺いながら、体を使って話すことが大切です。","textVersion":"sha256:7ea6b2e5524171722f9bcd3c75cd44a4df8c45ecd47e8abae4efdbf80b5b546c","audioVersion":"sha256:87749fe2c89b20b21bf52b9b8402390574d6816f34a6b4c5e665be2f12b2c5d5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a7755faac49bec5e1f7fd615340f661b08e52a5fe5137672df78e7d9b1c58fc","start":36.14,"end":43.94,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"そうするだけで相手に聞こうと思わせることができるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1a4cc270efc049bf369eb6778bcd82583745eae93ef575e888c258aaefbc54c3","audioVersion":"sha256:87749fe2c89b20b21bf52b9b8402390574d6816f34a6b4c5e665be2f12b2c5d5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a7755faac49bec5e1f7fd615340f661b08e52a5fe5137672df78e7d9b1c58fc","start":44.23,"end":48.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:1:line-1","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:87749fe2c89b20b21bf52b9b8402390574d6816f34a6b4c5e665be2f12b2c5d5","timelineVersion":"sha256:1a7755faac49bec5e1f7fd615340f661b08e52a5fe5137672df78e7d9b1c58fc","start":53.94,"end":57.43,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"a56f46a98df5728c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9dc396578670093fc3dd935530b0f723beb72964b971a4258fe2a74957ce749c","timelineVersion":"sha256:e98d353f9f7638e10d9f24aacd53b8f494f0450f3f59c7325b7acb337c4fb06d","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2:question","text":"テレビでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:8fdb6969009d3021aa40bc2145c9877906af3b49491bd86948656ad3e20f7644","audioVersion":"sha256:9dc396578670093fc3dd935530b0f723beb72964b971a4258fe2a74957ce749c","timelineVersion":"sha256:e98d353f9f7638e10d9f24aacd53b8f494f0450f3f59c7325b7acb337c4fb06d","start":5.26,"end":7.97,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"山川町といえば、緑茶の生産地として有名ですが、この町では風邪やインフルエンザなどの予防のために、家庭でも学校でも水ではなく緑茶でうがいをしています。","textVersion":"sha256:d1a1671d3822638d8c217f30a9a87eb036dff2a7f96a448416e50531dbddffb7","audioVersion":"sha256:9dc396578670093fc3dd935530b0f723beb72964b971a4258fe2a74957ce749c","timelineVersion":"sha256:e98d353f9f7638e10d9f24aacd53b8f494f0450f3f59c7325b7acb337c4fb06d","start":9.62,"end":23.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"緑茶に含まれる成分がウイルスに効くため市場にでないお茶の葉を地域で有効に利用しているということです。","textVersion":"sha256:0c57c7e051cc0dfa5af8195df65b4f4b1d6df606f237122d13f43ed09bc96c05","audioVersion":"sha256:9dc396578670093fc3dd935530b0f723beb72964b971a4258fe2a74957ce749c","timelineVersion":"sha256:e98d353f9f7638e10d9f24aacd53b8f494f0450f3f59c7325b7acb337c4fb06d","start":24.03,"end":32.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"どんな種類の緑茶でも効果があるそうですから、みなさんも試してみてはいかがでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:b399050b5b17d206cad961a75ee067944ba59b80bb26824e2ac880c90ba7564a","audioVersion":"sha256:9dc396578670093fc3dd935530b0f723beb72964b971a4258fe2a74957ce749c","timelineVersion":"sha256:e98d353f9f7638e10d9f24aacd53b8f494f0450f3f59c7325b7acb337c4fb06d","start":33.24,"end":39.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"私も最近始めたんですけど、一リットル程度作りおきしておくといつでも使えて便利ですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:041b033d8fc4d7e005102d913d9d635a7b774cc4e87a639f69d4237f7e453385","audioVersion":"sha256:9dc396578670093fc3dd935530b0f723beb72964b971a4258fe2a74957ce749c","timelineVersion":"sha256:e98d353f9f7638e10d9f24aacd53b8f494f0450f3f59c7325b7acb337c4fb06d","start":40.05,"end":47.25,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:2:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは主に何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c72ace769c6c58905c28e6856b6de3e6aff9529dd45ef558634d0d8c6c6d4dce","audioVersion":"sha256:9dc396578670093fc3dd935530b0f723beb72964b971a4258fe2a74957ce749c","timelineVersion":"sha256:e98d353f9f7638e10d9f24aacd53b8f494f0450f3f59c7325b7acb337c4fb06d","start":52.96,"end":57.03,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"a56f46a98df5728c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:b1cdadaa21ae29d1bae574b213c9c3c88e8cfa4c480f398adfed825d892552fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e5c35cc50597ae87ffcfd33591b65c9e96fcd5c1b7ff57eb2f8ec594fb6516f","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3:question","text":"講演会でカウンセラーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:c86fbc1b01a59513a57fbfeab4fce8ba9a203e389968a898dc67a3794bf44610","audioVersion":"sha256:b1cdadaa21ae29d1bae574b213c9c3c88e8cfa4c480f398adfed825d892552fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e5c35cc50597ae87ffcfd33591b65c9e96fcd5c1b7ff57eb2f8ec594fb6516f","start":5.43,"end":8.74,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"近年職場での人間関係や長時間労働によってストレスを抱える人が増えていますが、無理を続けたために、対処が遅れ、長期休養を取らざるをえなくなってしまうケースが多く見られます。","textVersion":"sha256:aa3851ef0b761698049b567f2d2c4c1b9dc2ad2396fe5ebbee9bb5ed0128d973","audioVersion":"sha256:b1cdadaa21ae29d1bae574b213c9c3c88e8cfa4c480f398adfed825d892552fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e5c35cc50597ae87ffcfd33591b65c9e96fcd5c1b7ff57eb2f8ec594fb6516f","start":10.36,"end":25.51,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"最初の一歩が早ければ、状態が深刻化するのを防ぐことが出来るのですが、真面目な人ほど一人で悩みを抱えてしまい、カウンセラーのところにやってくる頃には症状が進んでいることも稀ではありません。","textVersion":"sha256:e9f1364a5a425ab5ee23fe74e9680e01b9e71a828c9c16beb7d2598bec9584f2","audioVersion":"sha256:b1cdadaa21ae29d1bae574b213c9c3c88e8cfa4c480f398adfed825d892552fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e5c35cc50597ae87ffcfd33591b65c9e96fcd5c1b7ff57eb2f8ec594fb6516f","start":26.13,"end":41.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"カウンセラーの存在が広く知られるようになった今日でも、相談に来るのに消極的な人が多いのは残念です。","textVersion":"sha256:6170306c642c812979f55632484adb3d5b4d5268feabb9e5bf058ffb744e79ce","audioVersion":"sha256:b1cdadaa21ae29d1bae574b213c9c3c88e8cfa4c480f398adfed825d892552fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e5c35cc50597ae87ffcfd33591b65c9e96fcd5c1b7ff57eb2f8ec594fb6516f","start":41.86,"end":50.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:3:line-1","text":"カウンセラーは主に何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:000de223ad859c3fdb05cc66b8596878b1e97c05cf8c6716f918edd8493a415c","audioVersion":"sha256:b1cdadaa21ae29d1bae574b213c9c3c88e8cfa4c480f398adfed825d892552fa","timelineVersion":"sha256:3e5c35cc50597ae87ffcfd33591b65c9e96fcd5c1b7ff57eb2f8ec594fb6516f","start":56.04,"end":60.2,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"a56f46a98df5728c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4:question","text":"テレビで評論家が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:93b0f78d1688dca439f1199371f6f6574fcc2e587aa69cac370ee65e9b44385d","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","start":5.51,"end":8.11,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"先月政府が発表した調査結果から、一家族あたりの魚の消費量が肉の消費量に追い越されたことが分かりました。","textVersion":"sha256:da05175c7a20811ee70b6d36bd483ff765189df35e44a1fc0dd411ac55552ecb","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","start":9.82,"end":19.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"これは、ここ数年で肉の消費が伸び、それと同時に魚の消費が緩やかに減少したためです。","textVersion":"sha256:c4193c0390eaff8e7a9ad338c690cbb7c030449d3156376013159c3d1919e3c4","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","start":19.88,"end":28.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"肉の消費量については今後も同じ傾向が続くと思われます。","textVersion":"sha256:a2895c4fea4b80d658edd29a845ab1fc97a38798f568aa6ede5ae460a01989e0","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","start":28.82,"end":34.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"一方魚ですが、これまで専門家の間では消費量は減少することはあっても、増加することはないと言われてきました。","textVersion":"sha256:f91139fbc60293a58ce888355bd695d129ae2cba46eae56a6e8469135934989a","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","start":34.62,"end":44.64,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-0.segment-4","text":"しかし、そうではないと私は見ています。","textVersion":"sha256:86380489c8bd06a074f6a435e10d2aad4160029d2c033c4709d305f0bdfa5963","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","start":44.99,"end":48.43,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-0.segment-5","text":"最近では和食の良さが改めて注目されるなど、食に対する意識が変わりつつあるからです。","textVersion":"sha256:6db63ad9f098e7af31458c07b0868b4b7e347d98420de4d47c6a3a36df408134","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","start":48.91,"end":56.93,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:4:line-1","text":"女の人は今後魚と肉の消費量がどう変化すると考えていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:b6ce153b8b0627383f107b1e25fc48c99c2a470c6d4b8fcd01c4c76e538f66f2","audioVersion":"sha256:99e14a5d758a5699c47c90709e8d6fa5d8202b5b57c0bca638980cd78e5a2bc6","timelineVersion":"sha256:c199e146344dfc05e83bbba64f76a7639504ea7aeabab4497f4f61dc1a7ab5b2","start":62.72,"end":69.74,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"a56f46a98df5728c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5","examKey":"2016-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4c32f23573e8a3129beecf35f7abbc3772fb99eb7e6be2be80b26834b410c22e","timelineVersion":"sha256:63186c72780a4c14571532a4d89389c1c668e7b4f276923df065de54b5e27237","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5:question","text":"テレビで専門家が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:fd90239367a7fefb1cebb31112f8215f50b609fdb87886d199ab915bdad033d8","audioVersion":"sha256:4c32f23573e8a3129beecf35f7abbc3772fb99eb7e6be2be80b26834b410c22e","timelineVersion":"sha256:63186c72780a4c14571532a4d89389c1c668e7b4f276923df065de54b5e27237","start":5.28,"end":8.27,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"皆さんは仕事でよい結果を残せるタイプですか、それともなかなかうまくいかないタイプですか。","textVersion":"sha256:a3e9f2b0097ee0b1d5e71ab9390ee84a73716a7e47a31d37c51c4fdab6164a97","audioVersion":"sha256:4c32f23573e8a3129beecf35f7abbc3772fb99eb7e6be2be80b26834b410c22e","timelineVersion":"sha256:63186c72780a4c14571532a4d89389c1c668e7b4f276923df065de54b5e27237","start":9.97,"end":17.85,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"今日は鳥の目と虫の目の話をご紹介します。","textVersion":"sha256:589fd1da6a05c5f738fca22b32d9906ad4b870a8bc4a54cdfb7947fff1db5e7d","audioVersion":"sha256:4c32f23573e8a3129beecf35f7abbc3772fb99eb7e6be2be80b26834b410c22e","timelineVersion":"sha256:63186c72780a4c14571532a4d89389c1c668e7b4f276923df065de54b5e27237","start":18.73,"end":22.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"鳥は高いところから対象を見渡すので近くでは分からない全体像を捉えることができます。","textVersion":"sha256:81b790ff7a9c5afe541334ccbb4365fbff6f2f6389ae79d93b91508d2d5690f4","audioVersion":"sha256:4c32f23573e8a3129beecf35f7abbc3772fb99eb7e6be2be80b26834b410c22e","timelineVersion":"sha256:63186c72780a4c14571532a4d89389c1c668e7b4f276923df065de54b5e27237","start":23.76,"end":30.99,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"一方、虫の目は近くで対象をじっくり見つめるため、対象物の微妙な動きや変化をしることができます。","textVersion":"sha256:f6a15e0244bdb77458632723c353fd1e52daff8f1b71ba1afd82ff23328fa52a","audioVersion":"sha256:4c32f23573e8a3129beecf35f7abbc3772fb99eb7e6be2be80b26834b410c22e","timelineVersion":"sha256:63186c72780a4c14571532a4d89389c1c668e7b4f276923df065de54b5e27237","start":31.44,"end":40.27,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"広い視野で物事を捉え考えることと、物事を細かく観察し分析すること。職場でもこの両方の目を常に意識していればより良い結果が得られるでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:be31994f535a39eb788c05b9754c742923dbfacf7f6b11b1538eca253b6c6ca6","audioVersion":"sha256:4c32f23573e8a3129beecf35f7abbc3772fb99eb7e6be2be80b26834b410c22e","timelineVersion":"sha256:63186c72780a4c14571532a4d89389c1c668e7b4f276923df065de54b5e27237","start":41.46,"end":55.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-07:5:line-1","text":"専門家の話のテーマは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:53d211de13db9d2ba669e0ade16deb67ac5dbe10c872a8d0de3f02f29316745a","audioVersion":"sha256:4c32f23573e8a3129beecf35f7abbc3772fb99eb7e6be2be80b26834b410c22e","timelineVersion":"sha256:63186c72780a4c14571532a4d89389c1c668e7b4f276923df065de54b5e27237","start":61.02,"end":64.25,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"a56f46a98df5728c"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:cb15d64beca08eedd0bf4bb014cfa078a4dec8b1d65426c483ef7f517cd43b4d","timelineVersion":"sha256:d1d2ed64cbb29e3321318aa10d5736701c4e80aca1224c4026bd981953a6b841","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1:question","text":"ラジオで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:0ccf292cc278e347a153fb220db53863294b915454a13e60786dc44ccb1b7d1e","audioVersion":"sha256:cb15d64beca08eedd0bf4bb014cfa078a4dec8b1d65426c483ef7f517cd43b4d","timelineVersion":"sha256:d1d2ed64cbb29e3321318aa10d5736701c4e80aca1224c4026bd981953a6b841","start":5.47,"end":8.44,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"ええ、和紙、伝統的な日本の紙ですね。","textVersion":"sha256:f28b4dfc17d3ba7068c8b47ec800ba606d485675521302dbcfa43dd9888e494e","audioVersion":"sha256:cb15d64beca08eedd0bf4bb014cfa078a4dec8b1d65426c483ef7f517cd43b4d","timelineVersion":"sha256:d1d2ed64cbb29e3321318aa10d5736701c4e80aca1224c4026bd981953a6b841","start":10.21,"end":13.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"その和紙の専門店に最近行ったんですけど、そこにきれいな折り紙の作品が飾ってあったんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:52f43977cebe59eae62bbf2167412b767b920ea581ab3a04ac972aa4cc1d9280","audioVersion":"sha256:cb15d64beca08eedd0bf4bb014cfa078a4dec8b1d65426c483ef7f517cd43b4d","timelineVersion":"sha256:d1d2ed64cbb29e3321318aa10d5736701c4e80aca1224c4026bd981953a6b841","start":13.85,"end":20.06,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"折り紙は千年ほど前、和紙を使って贈り物を美しく包装するために折り方を工夫することから始まったそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:a8038095c8b2bc73c5976ff8b03aa1d0d960886ecc2b344a15737a97609fb7c7","audioVersion":"sha256:cb15d64beca08eedd0bf4bb014cfa078a4dec8b1d65426c483ef7f517cd43b4d","timelineVersion":"sha256:d1d2ed64cbb29e3321318aa10d5736701c4e80aca1224c4026bd981953a6b841","start":20.68,"end":29.23,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"そして、和紙が安く生産されるようになると、一枚の和紙からさまざまな形を生み出す遊びとして、子供たちの間でも人気が出て、折り方の本も出版されるようになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:0911c3b7e2955dc9268ff65e37d3f91cd6865b1c7a49fea8beab9f04b78c27b7","audioVersion":"sha256:cb15d64beca08eedd0bf4bb014cfa078a4dec8b1d65426c483ef7f517cd43b4d","timelineVersion":"sha256:d1d2ed64cbb29e3321318aa10d5736701c4e80aca1224c4026bd981953a6b841","start":30.2,"end":42.44,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"近代になると、幼稚園などの教育現場にも取り入れられ、今も広く親しまれています。","textVersion":"sha256:4e40bdf23bed0ee2c6e22d104d757631dc0bb306c0704bf1d757cc0b48c0646a","audioVersion":"sha256:cb15d64beca08eedd0bf4bb014cfa078a4dec8b1d65426c483ef7f517cd43b4d","timelineVersion":"sha256:d1d2ed64cbb29e3321318aa10d5736701c4e80aca1224c4026bd981953a6b841","start":42.88,"end":49.36,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:1:line-1","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:cb15d64beca08eedd0bf4bb014cfa078a4dec8b1d65426c483ef7f517cd43b4d","timelineVersion":"sha256:d1d2ed64cbb29e3321318aa10d5736701c4e80aca1224c4026bd981953a6b841","start":55.14,"end":58.52,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"eb11a5b408fb31e0"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:4913cebbf6902fa0407abd04b91a7a106d3c30a0540f3a2dfca1cb9f8061aa31","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eb41884b7c518ffae0f443ffeb241497bd8ef4e87ee346ab1662780da1ef06b","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2:question","text":"会社の企画部の会議で、女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:8243e6e02886044110fdad75f68d1dc617636223c338ed05cccaff4c38337721","audioVersion":"sha256:4913cebbf6902fa0407abd04b91a7a106d3c30a0540f3a2dfca1cb9f8061aa31","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eb41884b7c518ffae0f443ffeb241497bd8ef4e87ee346ab1662780da1ef06b","start":5.37,"end":9.68,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"先月、20歳代から50歳代の働く女性を対象に、ストレスと香りに関するアンケート調査を行ったんですが、なんらかのストレスを感じる、と答えた人のほうが、香りを重視してシャンプーを購入していました。","textVersion":"sha256:1fbab8d4717234cbc5fb424a9739bcdc1db686d0df4f5c4d0f7f8d81bb58a1e7","audioVersion":"sha256:4913cebbf6902fa0407abd04b91a7a106d3c30a0540f3a2dfca1cb9f8061aa31","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eb41884b7c518ffae0f443ffeb241497bd8ef4e87ee346ab1662780da1ef06b","start":11.48,"end":27.29,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"ええ、それから以前よりも仕事を持つ女性のストレスが増えているということもわかりました。","textVersion":"sha256:311c6a22e7cba1b80396477a13aced808a43704f4223874c531196718df82c6a","audioVersion":"sha256:4913cebbf6902fa0407abd04b91a7a106d3c30a0540f3a2dfca1cb9f8061aa31","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eb41884b7c518ffae0f443ffeb241497bd8ef4e87ee346ab1662780da1ef06b","start":27.68,"end":34.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"そこで、新しい商品作りには、この結果を取り入れ、リラックス効果の高い香りがするシャンプーという方向で進めていくのがいいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:fb636c821b00fd691f6c5d4b21558404605b34f930d68d5cd58bc16e84719316","audioVersion":"sha256:4913cebbf6902fa0407abd04b91a7a106d3c30a0540f3a2dfca1cb9f8061aa31","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eb41884b7c518ffae0f443ffeb241497bd8ef4e87ee346ab1662780da1ef06b","start":34.51,"end":44.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"ストレス解消を求める働く女性にアピールしていけば、販売数の上昇につながるのではないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:98110d1e0de202872523e7bca70917a6fe229cdbcc9aab0e09a6050e3aeeb26a","audioVersion":"sha256:4913cebbf6902fa0407abd04b91a7a106d3c30a0540f3a2dfca1cb9f8061aa31","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eb41884b7c518ffae0f443ffeb241497bd8ef4e87ee346ab1662780da1ef06b","start":44.93,"end":51.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:2:line-1","text":"女の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7e8a32195345cb90500b7129a6f116813d5545b0f07a7f6d9b9c168efbf7ed61","audioVersion":"sha256:4913cebbf6902fa0407abd04b91a7a106d3c30a0540f3a2dfca1cb9f8061aa31","timelineVersion":"sha256:7eb41884b7c518ffae0f443ffeb241497bd8ef4e87ee346ab1662780da1ef06b","start":57.59,"end":61.09,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"eb11a5b408fb31e0"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:e816b8d803b0b9872dfb5e436ffab26ea8f7c71f0518109636c0780d55a89cb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4d5211b2938377cac4c12578177e335499a22e1b7485bd9377bd5bfd630a4cb","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3:question","text":"子育て教室で、男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:ab157d62444b01c2df42257ec02964f0247de09375d156e0def101bd5ce47dfb","audioVersion":"sha256:e816b8d803b0b9872dfb5e436ffab26ea8f7c71f0518109636c0780d55a89cb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4d5211b2938377cac4c12578177e335499a22e1b7485bd9377bd5bfd630a4cb","start":5.46,"end":8.97,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"この中には初めてお子さんを育てるという方もいらっしゃるでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:6b5cfc7697258d9e45411fcab689774451ff54616dbb2508ae35988c66c7afcc","audioVersion":"sha256:e816b8d803b0b9872dfb5e436ffab26ea8f7c71f0518109636c0780d55a89cb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4d5211b2938377cac4c12578177e335499a22e1b7485bd9377bd5bfd630a4cb","start":10.72,"end":14.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"子どもが成長する過程で、絵本は欠かせないものです。","textVersion":"sha256:f374cdae975e2135a6e6da61ad0f77ecfb2ff496bd3568b571211ff3001e38b1","audioVersion":"sha256:e816b8d803b0b9872dfb5e436ffab26ea8f7c71f0518109636c0780d55a89cb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4d5211b2938377cac4c12578177e335499a22e1b7485bd9377bd5bfd630a4cb","start":15.7,"end":19.46,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"赤ちゃんがまだ、言葉がわからないうちは、ストーリーを理解できないから絵本は無理だと思う方も多いかもしれませんが、始めは色や形や、音のリズムが面白いものなら興味を持つはずです。","textVersion":"sha256:1c74a6761085f4e95fcc038a60b842eacb5cfed4e1e6b3317c271160ce27b952","audioVersion":"sha256:e816b8d803b0b9872dfb5e436ffab26ea8f7c71f0518109636c0780d55a89cb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4d5211b2938377cac4c12578177e335499a22e1b7485bd9377bd5bfd630a4cb","start":20.19,"end":33.89,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"赤ちゃんが成長するにつれて、挨拶や生活のマナーなどが学べるものを取り入れていくといいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:c73ff487d620ea28c562762db2e31ebfb2749954a926bbd32d8ef74a44879cd1","audioVersion":"sha256:e816b8d803b0b9872dfb5e436ffab26ea8f7c71f0518109636c0780d55a89cb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4d5211b2938377cac4c12578177e335499a22e1b7485bd9377bd5bfd630a4cb","start":35.17,"end":42.13,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"さらに理解力が高くなってきたら、わくわく、どきどきするようなストーリーのあるものを親子で一緒に楽しんでみたらいかがでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:91a02aae0ade22747818cb7a46921bf56690b876579823ed392771ac33aae62e","audioVersion":"sha256:e816b8d803b0b9872dfb5e436ffab26ea8f7c71f0518109636c0780d55a89cb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4d5211b2938377cac4c12578177e335499a22e1b7485bd9377bd5bfd630a4cb","start":43.06,"end":52.07,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:3:line-1","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:e816b8d803b0b9872dfb5e436ffab26ea8f7c71f0518109636c0780d55a89cb9","timelineVersion":"sha256:d4d5211b2938377cac4c12578177e335499a22e1b7485bd9377bd5bfd630a4cb","start":57.88,"end":61.23,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"eb11a5b408fb31e0"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a1f07fea2760db6fd1bb36efa749f93a6243319ffacf9276ece674e3dcf4f145","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1350e9b01dd500735d4effcb22f237a28f468ac1fa3dcb433a3a57fd4cd9bbd","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4:question","text":"ラジオで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:bea3a221e6161ba0820ce1214df6e60533cfcddc023c8e660b12196bf86bc650","audioVersion":"sha256:a1f07fea2760db6fd1bb36efa749f93a6243319ffacf9276ece674e3dcf4f145","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1350e9b01dd500735d4effcb22f237a28f468ac1fa3dcb433a3a57fd4cd9bbd","start":5.38,"end":8.05,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"健康のためには毎日の運動が必要だと分かっていても、なかなか続けられない方も多いと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:ba966c6774a5d12479ade083d922f060acd61a00be07232d0a9443f922b145e4","audioVersion":"sha256:a1f07fea2760db6fd1bb36efa749f93a6243319ffacf9276ece674e3dcf4f145","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1350e9b01dd500735d4effcb22f237a28f468ac1fa3dcb433a3a57fd4cd9bbd","start":9.84,"end":18.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"でも、毎日の過ごし方を少し変えるだけで、軽いスポーツをするのと同等の効果が得られるそうなんです。","textVersion":"sha256:2ee28c24fcd48074357e7a437431704138e443665f1962af0fcd9755e6e6767a","audioVersion":"sha256:a1f07fea2760db6fd1bb36efa749f93a6243319ffacf9276ece674e3dcf4f145","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1350e9b01dd500735d4effcb22f237a28f468ac1fa3dcb433a3a57fd4cd9bbd","start":19.52,"end":26.59,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"じっとしている時間を30分減らす。その程度で十分です。","textVersion":"sha256:75a40358d5efd0a9fd4bb9e237b70c1f248a91c22f5a0213d60623216af71f3e","audioVersion":"sha256:a1f07fea2760db6fd1bb36efa749f93a6243319ffacf9276ece674e3dcf4f145","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1350e9b01dd500735d4effcb22f237a28f468ac1fa3dcb433a3a57fd4cd9bbd","start":27.59,"end":32.18,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"これならちょっと気分を変えて、テレビを見る代わりに近所を散歩する。友人と喫茶店で話す代わりにウィンドウショッピングを楽しむなど、日ごろしていることを少し見直すだけで、出来そうですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:b8a15be7fd13bd7c8dca28790e8932d94c87caca1717df4ed91d1f64cda7be6e","audioVersion":"sha256:a1f07fea2760db6fd1bb36efa749f93a6243319ffacf9276ece674e3dcf4f145","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1350e9b01dd500735d4effcb22f237a28f468ac1fa3dcb433a3a57fd4cd9bbd","start":32.99,"end":46.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:4:line-1","text":"女の人は何について紹介していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ddfcf52191c9f2d2e1d06b8fd4df0eeae3bd2ecedf03a342fc8a927747c4dd22","audioVersion":"sha256:a1f07fea2760db6fd1bb36efa749f93a6243319ffacf9276ece674e3dcf4f145","timelineVersion":"sha256:c1350e9b01dd500735d4effcb22f237a28f468ac1fa3dcb433a3a57fd4cd9bbd","start":54.79,"end":58.38,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"eb11a5b408fb31e0"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","examKey":"2016-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2016.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2016.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2016-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:question","text":"小学校で先生が児童の親たちに話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:30b7332df68549da9f35cb448bc6d3918e0fc39600287f56eb5357b425344285","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":5.42,"end":9.67,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"もうすぐ夏休みです。","textVersion":"sha256:1562204045014a82a8978046cff5126f9943437105b37de161210ea2c772d55e","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":11.42,"end":13.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"海水浴や山登りなどいろいろな計画を立てていらっしゃると思います。","textVersion":"sha256:602c25c79680380afb4d6c4e1bf4fb6be5618c2b92d07ccdf070026ccc930d2e","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":13.72,"end":18.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"ただ毎年休みの間に、海や山など出かけた先で怪我をする子供がいます。","textVersion":"sha256:41ed7569f96c43fd3b87790c4cb95221e66e887eb9868dd5b87d4e9bec60f601","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":19.09,"end":25.62,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"楽しい夏休みが台無しにならないよう、遊ぶときのルールを子供と一緒に決めるようにしてください。","textVersion":"sha256:5e699c49746e48ac7e4903a3fc1891e8a62f77614da83937d47d70101650be44","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":26.22,"end":33.15,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"たとえば、海であれば、泳ぐ前に体操をすること、沖に流されないよう、砂浜に近いところで遊ぶことなどを約束するといいでしょう。","textVersion":"sha256:e9e9503e73cbf513cb0ab4c0b6337df9ad01189093c141090e7478f9d4098c06","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":33.7,"end":43.65,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0.segment-5","text":"いずれにしても、大切なことは、ご両親が子供の行動を見守ることです。","textVersion":"sha256:b62e813888ad7867b8009fa09de33b112c533c53aedc681026b5871e6de01ade","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":44.15,"end":49.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-0.segment-6","text":"どうぞよろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:f314a3ca872805d6b85ab19ed92b8cb9a501e580679029debb21b733bab26715","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":50.52,"end":52.39,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2016-12:5:line-1","text":"先生は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:c9af9e016d3216b539f28fec1ec3917b3c078976b5fdb9bd1891d66d61695d32","audioVersion":"sha256:cf80812f8eeaa2f7efd3486276843be8b41b48dd5d7c5e0eaaf1eadd4fa91bef","timelineVersion":"sha256:8d9439675456b2f4de775d2b4ce80c8ee696b71a3810721f75da9fd7cdf3f5d4","start":58.12,"end":61.38,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"eb11a5b408fb31e0"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:question","text":"会社で、女の人と男の人が電話で話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:e54e54877e4765f39fe14cbace2b43aec164c9a4c2fa2ddb98c9ac10faa85b75","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":5.23,"end":10.08,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-0","text":"もしもし、総務の北村です。来週金曜日の３時から予約されている会議室のことなんですが。","textVersion":"sha256:d4097d283317b71c5905aa58a53216994298f9a0bcafcd0a1470554790df5711","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":11.81,"end":19.52,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-1","text":"あっ、はい。","textVersion":"sha256:4e1900035195db95f82e6ff1303b48a4d06cad953f29c4ad1fd717f24d047ea0","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":19.66,"end":20.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-2","text":"さきほどお電話で、人数が１０人に変更になったとご連絡いただきましたよね。","textVersion":"sha256:2fe98d3685e0cae7ca5fb1f95447b6c0d46c4c3d2dfe824f96d3d0511f294953","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":20.83,"end":26.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-3","text":"ええ。","textVersion":"sha256:30224d71f95afa967c387b6513d7bcc534c393cc15c36334b132286ff5d66c36","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":26.57,"end":27.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-4","text":"２０人用の第一会議室をお取りしていましたが、実は同じ日時に２０人で会議室を利用したいという連絡がありまして、その人数が入れるのは一部屋しかないんです。","textVersion":"sha256:bb7dbc40598f5bc9734e11b42bccae61ee11f1686746e074ace3bc30e6ce3519","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":27.52,"end":40.23,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-5","text":"ああ、そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:e61a6cc6a0f662ae70e6611a99d6c3b98385cf5f9dc257fc063f1e93e72618fd","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":40.22,"end":41.95,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-6","text":"１０人用の第二会議室でしたら、空いておりますが。","textVersion":"sha256:0f533e3babfd188a5e458a8c72bbe902ab01264df3504c02d3698a1f58bd8176","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":42.19,"end":46.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-7","text":"じゃ、課長と相談して、折り返し電話します。","textVersion":"sha256:119e546011e6eacb5d9b0d8d6000f917b1c19ac5d7b4298c0a74c082ee38b4ce","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":46.15,"end":49.21,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-8","text":"すみません。この日はほかの時間もすべて会議室が埋まっていますので、よろしくお願いします。","textVersion":"sha256:66ac20d329f982523d7e43e77030a728b7927c25e153a1970b8782e65a7a2823","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":49.28,"end":56.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:1:line-9","text":"女の人が言いたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:ec52b06ffcbbdab6026b54f059304135dd807309e3fae4f705e0098c84e69cc5","audioVersion":"sha256:81b9bdebb2633cec900fd79a7d70601e129c53130c22c384bab70cb99fe0c200","timelineVersion":"sha256:46b2460414968b677114bca613a11db7856d36c6c36c7b79d8cd2e581af16a04","start":61.88,"end":64.9,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6b9db02b6de7168e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:question","text":"中学校の教室で、生徒がスピーチをしています。","textVersion":"sha256:f3cc64c0c5b4e734dd300ca30a51fd808fcc2cf6c122a315e5392afcd5595aa3","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":5.16,"end":9.02,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"私には、好きなものが全く違う友人がいます。","textVersion":"sha256:db24f9b1fda1de4460ad35c1f2e942162d1569431014d1fb4ffed5817e3ee9d2","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":10.88,"end":14.55,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"私が好きなことは読書、彼女は映画です。","textVersion":"sha256:3b3a58dc60d845ca37ab88f63efda29e0ee87876e02a044410e1ed4cfbadd9ec","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":15.17,"end":19.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"勉強でも、私は国語が好きだけど、彼女は数学が得意。","textVersion":"sha256:079854314bff1e1d4a2cbe1a2b8b24c43d82975bbb302f468a3a8834d7a5bffb","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":19.76,"end":24.58,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"こんなふうに全然違うんです。","textVersion":"sha256:62789dc8024362f5c2dd91cb9d306e95e59b8de47c27e1512d43c3f4b55f52ff","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":25.11,"end":27.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"でも、テストの前は、私が国語を教えて、彼女は数学を教えてくれます。","textVersion":"sha256:f9aa1cf6c1d45cf39edddb1a9212297d8a7aa73e8852073ffc5ce3e1b1712275","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":27.82,"end":33.46,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0.segment-5","text":"助け合うことで、一人ではできないことができるようになります。","textVersion":"sha256:88196fca81dd0e3b7ed18c627ce1bfafd4739263555396c9a465e3f666642edb","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":34.09,"end":37.87,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0.segment-6","text":"趣味が同じ友人もいいけれど、違うからこそ、お互いに世界を広げることができる。","textVersion":"sha256:3c87b4a15f3370137a0efd07b03a1a8d5238b72156ab7c4efffcd2fcbf9b2029","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":38.66,"end":44.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-0.segment-7","text":"これは友人同士の話に限らず、周りの人たちとの付き合いすべてに当てはまるかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:547f2bb9c94fa18b83220c8c2fad9a5cb3c89e58e758b711d0a8bece7e3c6a8a","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":45,"end":51.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:2:line-1","text":"生徒が伝えたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:0a1569d4061af0f68e7932ac3c6613ee1103d03fcda2580a33a2bfecf8f8145c","audioVersion":"sha256:a852502cec7a85063f8fc20b80d2a3bfa7662369c70f298ce8df967fc76b0760","timelineVersion":"sha256:1817066b5f954325f2ff32dd0660902923ada5e8e1ead1943e1760c0a0e7e424","start":57.37,"end":60.05,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6b9db02b6de7168e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:02c4742e0731013e955a2735d08075a527ee47c6ff98098e2affbd5cc56d8ba0","timelineVersion":"sha256:0a37c2bcace628473473978b2fdbac1ae2d6678119d61e87a1f16c3a90bd48db","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3:question","text":"テレビでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:8fdb6969009d3021aa40bc2145c9877906af3b49491bd86948656ad3e20f7644","audioVersion":"sha256:02c4742e0731013e955a2735d08075a527ee47c6ff98098e2affbd5cc56d8ba0","timelineVersion":"sha256:0a37c2bcace628473473978b2fdbac1ae2d6678119d61e87a1f16c3a90bd48db","start":5.28,"end":7.89,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"本を読む人が少なくなったといわれていますが、実は図書館については、利用者数が増加傾向にあります。","textVersion":"sha256:d88780f4d4dad64d670513734586ca7a15e148011ddad97a4880218accbbf7e4","audioVersion":"sha256:02c4742e0731013e955a2735d08075a527ee47c6ff98098e2affbd5cc56d8ba0","timelineVersion":"sha256:0a37c2bcace628473473978b2fdbac1ae2d6678119d61e87a1f16c3a90bd48db","start":9.66,"end":17.2,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"図書館としても、今までにはない、いろいろな試みを行っているんです。","textVersion":"sha256:2f7100bebf71bd667a83a63d86c2231e8d4c53ca91bb8267f7cdd0357d50af82","audioVersion":"sha256:02c4742e0731013e955a2735d08075a527ee47c6ff98098e2affbd5cc56d8ba0","timelineVersion":"sha256:0a37c2bcace628473473978b2fdbac1ae2d6678119d61e87a1f16c3a90bd48db","start":17.77,"end":22.41,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"例えば、お茶を飲みながら、本が読めるスペースや利用者同士がおしゃべりできる部屋を作った図書館もあります。","textVersion":"sha256:9aa316c014106fc4e02edc42fb04cde4a46a28881e92fd87c0d5e59f2afefb58","audioVersion":"sha256:02c4742e0731013e955a2735d08075a527ee47c6ff98098e2affbd5cc56d8ba0","timelineVersion":"sha256:0a37c2bcace628473473978b2fdbac1ae2d6678119d61e87a1f16c3a90bd48db","start":22.97,"end":30.62,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"今回の取材の中では、図書館で高齢の利用者と親しくなって、いろいろな話を聞くのが楽しみになり、よく足を運ぶようになったという若者の声も聞かれ、一定の効果をあげていることが伺われます。","textVersion":"sha256:4ec40c1b407f59929e6462a198aedc295c30ac59148bdb6419b9af9828c11214","audioVersion":"sha256:02c4742e0731013e955a2735d08075a527ee47c6ff98098e2affbd5cc56d8ba0","timelineVersion":"sha256:0a37c2bcace628473473978b2fdbac1ae2d6678119d61e87a1f16c3a90bd48db","start":31.73,"end":45.93,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"図書館は静かに本を読むところだというイメージがありましたが、変わってきているようです。","textVersion":"sha256:207ce4444be6aaafb581e7dab027a59d082aabb370a157fc7507e5bddbdd8df7","audioVersion":"sha256:02c4742e0731013e955a2735d08075a527ee47c6ff98098e2affbd5cc56d8ba0","timelineVersion":"sha256:0a37c2bcace628473473978b2fdbac1ae2d6678119d61e87a1f16c3a90bd48db","start":47,"end":52.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:3:line-1","text":"アナウンサーの話のテーマは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:fcfe9880367f819efd032b7ef4e09be98fe89c7a12236acbc9a160207c54c974","audioVersion":"sha256:02c4742e0731013e955a2735d08075a527ee47c6ff98098e2affbd5cc56d8ba0","timelineVersion":"sha256:0a37c2bcace628473473978b2fdbac1ae2d6678119d61e87a1f16c3a90bd48db","start":58.72,"end":61.81,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6b9db02b6de7168e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:fb76efae86c340b048ae143a1ae75a52456602ba01c231e35a1e5fc2b4c04a7c","timelineVersion":"sha256:867677d560cb62a037d65c36795da68b927c2c8a8abdd63a69b364a522e52708","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4:question","text":"町の議会で、町長が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:459c7a23a590501ff8c90bc74f0007d9e192ef8b83be91a58496b41c71df17b1","audioVersion":"sha256:fb76efae86c340b048ae143a1ae75a52456602ba01c231e35a1e5fc2b4c04a7c","timelineVersion":"sha256:867677d560cb62a037d65c36795da68b927c2c8a8abdd63a69b364a522e52708","start":5.27,"end":8.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"来年建設予定の町の総合文化施設ですが、ここには保育所や図書館なども入る予定で、この施設ができると、町民の生活が便利になることは間違いないと思われます。","textVersion":"sha256:77a05374716ecf611c87dd85047e50da1e4a1dfce16acace25ec0e5bc2fc8687","audioVersion":"sha256:fb76efae86c340b048ae143a1ae75a52456602ba01c231e35a1e5fc2b4c04a7c","timelineVersion":"sha256:867677d560cb62a037d65c36795da68b927c2c8a8abdd63a69b364a522e52708","start":10.26,"end":23.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"建設費が高いということから、町民の皆さまの間には反対意見も多くあります。","textVersion":"sha256:ee1f2981b76336ff928dc97cd4949ef9e59cb2c0e4116ba3d06b3bdc3bfbe10d","audioVersion":"sha256:fb76efae86c340b048ae143a1ae75a52456602ba01c231e35a1e5fc2b4c04a7c","timelineVersion":"sha256:867677d560cb62a037d65c36795da68b927c2c8a8abdd63a69b364a522e52708","start":24.33,"end":30.23,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"しかし、子どもからお年寄りまで、みんなが利用できるこのような施設は周辺地域にもない、ユニークなものです。","textVersion":"sha256:ec2b9a2020903b1bcab785e1114c77c24b2b34ed11371c505d31e2d5abea43e9","audioVersion":"sha256:fb76efae86c340b048ae143a1ae75a52456602ba01c231e35a1e5fc2b4c04a7c","timelineVersion":"sha256:867677d560cb62a037d65c36795da68b927c2c8a8abdd63a69b364a522e52708","start":30.73,"end":38.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"建設予定地が駅から遠く、不便だという意見もありますが、この点については、駅からバスを出す可能性などを含めて、今後、検討していきたいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:1f199eb72ec2b5ab692598125c3bd21804e8755ce62a0d52230b6e992816829b","audioVersion":"sha256:fb76efae86c340b048ae143a1ae75a52456602ba01c231e35a1e5fc2b4c04a7c","timelineVersion":"sha256:867677d560cb62a037d65c36795da68b927c2c8a8abdd63a69b364a522e52708","start":39.38,"end":50.33,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:4:line-1","text":"町長は施設の建設について、どういっていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8fa9b4b26b3c263eeef081c4ef25439ff916c130b11806376779733119359099","audioVersion":"sha256:fb76efae86c340b048ae143a1ae75a52456602ba01c231e35a1e5fc2b4c04a7c","timelineVersion":"sha256:867677d560cb62a037d65c36795da68b927c2c8a8abdd63a69b364a522e52708","start":56.11,"end":60.34,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6b9db02b6de7168e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","examKey":"2017-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5:question","text":"ラジオでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:a16b629a540ee67e5f4107e5675489ee03c2533ddbd67e1f07fee194cd9f7b95","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","start":5.25,"end":7.93,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"今日から１２月です。","textVersion":"sha256:957664159ad8bd5303d1621490cb70165732942a901d8895054fe565b4929541","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","start":9.65,"end":11.35,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"年末年始の消費活動は翌年の景気を占う上で、よく注目されます。","textVersion":"sha256:e3ec84442ab3e54eff857de0812cd27d9f65c38316c8253e528e707ae83811f3","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","start":11.72,"end":17.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"今年の後半になり、企業の売り上げは順調に伸びてきているようですが、このまま景気は回復するのでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:ba4ed78253a3cd0ab39bcd5775047847e3ebf83c22736fb3b0e632b83d6dc7aa","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","start":18.02,"end":25.43,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"旅行会社によると、この年末年始の旅行先としては、海外より国内旅行のツアー、中でも、安く手軽に参加できる日帰りツアーに人気が集中しているとのことです。","textVersion":"sha256:5bb03e1970bf6042bea9ae5ff314da0965bc8dc71f9dc437069a448cea83d057","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","start":26.09,"end":39.31,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"大手デパートの調べでは、お歳暮商戦も昨年同様３０００円前後の品が最も売れているということです。","textVersion":"sha256:514dd31318ed7a627f542f8d0f400869c9cdcb9636f9cd7c77b41feb89addec6","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","start":39.77,"end":48.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-0.segment-5","text":"このように、消費者が派手な消費を抑える傾向が見られることから、景気の回復を実感するにはまだ時間がかかると考えられます。","textVersion":"sha256:80c22f32459727a24e03de7c90579f5730a344a100f0a0e3a8f3ffd5d231ee19","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","start":48.47,"end":58.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-07:5:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1673c6b733a690adbb707ef47c46062fdbdcbd22d253b9eaed3d67372d7d4c2a","audioVersion":"sha256:bc79d38b85c85d2cfc3264c69edd1d4efffd718e5bf3c25bc257166b83be160d","timelineVersion":"sha256:669a2024521c9ab8f758c114c13c2083fb294f4758399ca7f7feeef1df39b6f1","start":64.26,"end":67.47,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6b9db02b6de7168e"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:83b3f0632b8f1d2005066445178463d6d62dd89bb82706896be0dd17f39e99ee","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ddbc543f91cd96576da70f3c116f1ab41c4337e329d9d957693c12f8353f3f1","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1:question","text":"地域の講演会で、女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:2de774cf56aff3ff2a8d9d74af093e08a246c55d99fc0bf10872564edea8ac06","audioVersion":"sha256:83b3f0632b8f1d2005066445178463d6d62dd89bb82706896be0dd17f39e99ee","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ddbc543f91cd96576da70f3c116f1ab41c4337e329d9d957693c12f8353f3f1","start":5.26,"end":8.99,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"日本では、ここ数十年の間に、レトルト食品など調理されている食品の普及が進みました。","textVersion":"sha256:735b8c81fb7effa33c38e3271cc88cc9b48793183f7f0fa5f3c702abb46ea676","audioVersion":"sha256:83b3f0632b8f1d2005066445178463d6d62dd89bb82706896be0dd17f39e99ee","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ddbc543f91cd96576da70f3c116f1ab41c4337e329d9d957693c12f8353f3f1","start":10.77,"end":17.54,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"そのような食品の多くは、便利な一方、食べやすく調理されているため、しっかり噛まずに飲み込みがちですが、そのことが現代人の健康にとって、大きなマイナスとなっていると指摘する医師も少なくありません。","textVersion":"sha256:78656e1d5216cb2c2c78364a39632dedcf6e34a40a7bcd6956de98929012ce4c","audioVersion":"sha256:83b3f0632b8f1d2005066445178463d6d62dd89bb82706896be0dd17f39e99ee","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ddbc543f91cd96576da70f3c116f1ab41c4337e329d9d957693c12f8353f3f1","start":18.24,"end":32.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"よく一口30回と言われますが、これを実践すると、心身を健康に保つ、様々な効果が得られることが明らかになっています。","textVersion":"sha256:a073811d25f0f6da761af43be7455b01edd23f896f3bbf7e6a8e9284615f07e4","audioVersion":"sha256:83b3f0632b8f1d2005066445178463d6d62dd89bb82706896be0dd17f39e99ee","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ddbc543f91cd96576da70f3c116f1ab41c4337e329d9d957693c12f8353f3f1","start":34.05,"end":44.28,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:1:line-1","text":"女の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7e8a32195345cb90500b7129a6f116813d5545b0f07a7f6d9b9c168efbf7ed61","audioVersion":"sha256:83b3f0632b8f1d2005066445178463d6d62dd89bb82706896be0dd17f39e99ee","timelineVersion":"sha256:7ddbc543f91cd96576da70f3c116f1ab41c4337e329d9d957693c12f8353f3f1","start":50.15,"end":53.48,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b6f8d5f6705f5ba5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:42d450a9166de1cd1333edddc91e4ad785d7cca4f8c971462d91779a9e03e2e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c4be8816c1206dfc427f318e51fd1e16d9355052bbbe40505df54efb08656995","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2:question","text":"テレビで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:42a4897a5b0f10ee451c26231b75f9f2859e299e718a6129f64fb54a8ad88b44","audioVersion":"sha256:42d450a9166de1cd1333edddc91e4ad785d7cca4f8c971462d91779a9e03e2e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c4be8816c1206dfc427f318e51fd1e16d9355052bbbe40505df54efb08656995","start":5.16,"end":7.74,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"「最近の若者は」という言葉、みなさんも一度は耳にしたことがありませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:5dae60d154d7ce88817a80f71480bfe912b8890e80dab2bca0d2894ed50e170b","audioVersion":"sha256:42d450a9166de1cd1333edddc91e4ad785d7cca4f8c971462d91779a9e03e2e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c4be8816c1206dfc427f318e51fd1e16d9355052bbbe40505df54efb08656995","start":9.52,"end":15.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"現代だけでなく、きっといつの時代でも使われてきた言葉なんでしょうね。","textVersion":"sha256:50fd68cda9bca6971e853330438d10bfaf333d65482bc7734056a4144968d114","audioVersion":"sha256:42d450a9166de1cd1333edddc91e4ad785d7cca4f8c971462d91779a9e03e2e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c4be8816c1206dfc427f318e51fd1e16d9355052bbbe40505df54efb08656995","start":16.01,"end":20.71,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"わたしが１０代の頃も、「礼儀を知らない」、「根気がない」などと言われた記憶があります。","textVersion":"sha256:bed189ca0e2f93a269d17ac4826b09d9e8354911362968247fa77fa49522a9cb","audioVersion":"sha256:42d450a9166de1cd1333edddc91e4ad785d7cca4f8c971462d91779a9e03e2e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c4be8816c1206dfc427f318e51fd1e16d9355052bbbe40505df54efb08656995","start":21.63,"end":27.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"ただ、その若者を教育してきたのは、親の世代だということを忘れてはいけません。","textVersion":"sha256:506cb2d2d9d1ac2e234301023c63b01944e697ff2d8784ab6d63502813eee60a","audioVersion":"sha256:42d450a9166de1cd1333edddc91e4ad785d7cca4f8c971462d91779a9e03e2e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c4be8816c1206dfc427f318e51fd1e16d9355052bbbe40505df54efb08656995","start":28.18,"end":34.03,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"若者がそのように言われるのは、本来手本となるべき大人にも、一因があると思うんです。","textVersion":"sha256:87831cca39cb09a06c27d0e2f5e97c82b9cf78f2b2c04f30e61a916f2ee42cf7","audioVersion":"sha256:42d450a9166de1cd1333edddc91e4ad785d7cca4f8c971462d91779a9e03e2e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c4be8816c1206dfc427f318e51fd1e16d9355052bbbe40505df54efb08656995","start":34.82,"end":41.11,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:2:line-1","text":"女の人が伝えたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:436d1966c94dc876c8544dadfcfe2f6942b8e7762f209cbd3ae32bac360502c1","audioVersion":"sha256:42d450a9166de1cd1333edddc91e4ad785d7cca4f8c971462d91779a9e03e2e3","timelineVersion":"sha256:c4be8816c1206dfc427f318e51fd1e16d9355052bbbe40505df54efb08656995","start":46.9,"end":49.98,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b6f8d5f6705f5ba5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d7568955019be12ddfbcf7b03592cf5e13251a60466ec22e8b9e437b78bdcb5e","timelineVersion":"sha256:5fe670d7c31866e512866f7dd72e4c9af5570ee096f8820b792289198ee6b158","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3:question","text":"心理学の授業で先生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:3e924ebe20f6f5f6e2df5abd2dd1b31abff57905ddc4cf149a8f225ca48f2c1c","audioVersion":"sha256:d7568955019be12ddfbcf7b03592cf5e13251a60466ec22e8b9e437b78bdcb5e","timelineVersion":"sha256:5fe670d7c31866e512866f7dd72e4c9af5570ee096f8820b792289198ee6b158","start":5.31,"end":8.83,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"わたしは子供の時、ストレスに敏感で、不安を感じると、よくお腹が痛くなりました。","textVersion":"sha256:6607f8c33b534b69ab7cddb4ae1cbb0d5eaa84ee37cad49c421b768a0735ee76","audioVersion":"sha256:d7568955019be12ddfbcf7b03592cf5e13251a60466ec22e8b9e437b78bdcb5e","timelineVersion":"sha256:5fe670d7c31866e512866f7dd72e4c9af5570ee096f8820b792289198ee6b158","start":10.55,"end":17.14,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"ある時、母が腹痛が治るという粉薬を病院でもらってきてくれたんですが、それ以降、不安でお腹が痛くなったとき、その薬をジュースに入れて飲むと、腹痛がおさまったんです。","textVersion":"sha256:fba3e0a3a7bf65ba8ea13943a888c9202938ab6075701b2a7af9154527f7634c","audioVersion":"sha256:d7568955019be12ddfbcf7b03592cf5e13251a60466ec22e8b9e437b78bdcb5e","timelineVersion":"sha256:5fe670d7c31866e512866f7dd72e4c9af5570ee096f8820b792289198ee6b158","start":18.1,"end":30.35,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"ところが、中学生になったある日、母が言ったんです。「あれはただの粉砂糖だった。まさかあんなに効くとはね」と。","textVersion":"sha256:469e6994be73d8bf1c83923a5f20ef8369774516003e768c92f500afdabcdc16","audioVersion":"sha256:d7568955019be12ddfbcf7b03592cf5e13251a60466ec22e8b9e437b78bdcb5e","timelineVersion":"sha256:5fe670d7c31866e512866f7dd72e4c9af5570ee096f8820b792289198ee6b158","start":30.94,"end":40.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"それ自体に力はなくても、飲むことで生じる気持ちの変化が実際に体の反応を変え、よく効く薬となっていたんですね。","textVersion":"sha256:18a416d55f8a187ddc8ad776e41717a9f991f2e13fea25e94d1e80cb8bda7f23","audioVersion":"sha256:d7568955019be12ddfbcf7b03592cf5e13251a60466ec22e8b9e437b78bdcb5e","timelineVersion":"sha256:5fe670d7c31866e512866f7dd72e4c9af5570ee096f8820b792289198ee6b158","start":41.49,"end":50.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"今日の授業では、この点をテーマとし、より詳しく見ていきます。","textVersion":"sha256:c21febfa54415ca5728d1804a7408c878837339f6adae801c6670a9e6c57e25d","audioVersion":"sha256:d7568955019be12ddfbcf7b03592cf5e13251a60466ec22e8b9e437b78bdcb5e","timelineVersion":"sha256:5fe670d7c31866e512866f7dd72e4c9af5570ee096f8820b792289198ee6b158","start":51.09,"end":55.48,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:3:line-1","text":"今日の授業のテーマはなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:c13475bd780c92cb34827f9553e45134d34177aeb5e8e0400deecf02156dfc81","audioVersion":"sha256:d7568955019be12ddfbcf7b03592cf5e13251a60466ec22e8b9e437b78bdcb5e","timelineVersion":"sha256:5fe670d7c31866e512866f7dd72e4c9af5570ee096f8820b792289198ee6b158","start":61.24,"end":63.64,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b6f8d5f6705f5ba5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:6ead5f8ac039fe9f869929f8fe4ac3217bd70f4ce51c2bb863a1257c95e36c30","timelineVersion":"sha256:d13b503c42b88268a187a5b69830e91b3ccc720c831d7e1ec517d9d9ee2627e5","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4:question","text":"ラジオでアナウンサーが家計調査の結果について話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:ccc63ab88dd97e884353b6c25cbbc2bf141b8de07361124837d3fea1c411aa7a","audioVersion":"sha256:6ead5f8ac039fe9f869929f8fe4ac3217bd70f4ce51c2bb863a1257c95e36c30","timelineVersion":"sha256:d13b503c42b88268a187a5b69830e91b3ccc720c831d7e1ec517d9d9ee2627e5","start":5.3,"end":10.06,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"先日、政府が家計の収入や支出などを調べた家計調査の結果が発表されました。","textVersion":"sha256:70fc3d1cf318cd5c91d4229a15394ee470c1626f28b666df59582cebac272b1b","audioVersion":"sha256:6ead5f8ac039fe9f869929f8fe4ac3217bd70f4ce51c2bb863a1257c95e36c30","timelineVersion":"sha256:d13b503c42b88268a187a5b69830e91b3ccc720c831d7e1ec517d9d9ee2627e5","start":11.85,"end":18.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"支出のうち、娯楽の費用と食事の費用の項目を見てみると、娯楽費は全項目のうち、増加が最も目立ちました。","textVersion":"sha256:011f443526e98906ce50f38c226a57dc16ef68a0c2176a39d93f94a15b78ef32","audioVersion":"sha256:6ead5f8ac039fe9f869929f8fe4ac3217bd70f4ce51c2bb863a1257c95e36c30","timelineVersion":"sha256:d13b503c42b88268a187a5b69830e91b3ccc720c831d7e1ec517d9d9ee2627e5","start":19.86,"end":29.49,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"これは景気の回復が影響していると考えられます。","textVersion":"sha256:12b01f0264a7ef7857a9586fabcffecc4f01141254344675fbbd794b25b947bc","audioVersion":"sha256:6ead5f8ac039fe9f869929f8fe4ac3217bd70f4ce51c2bb863a1257c95e36c30","timelineVersion":"sha256:d13b503c42b88268a187a5b69830e91b3ccc720c831d7e1ec517d9d9ee2627e5","start":30.31,"end":34.04,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"また昨年度の調査以来、落ち込みを見せていた食費ですが、今回は外食の費用が大きな伸びを見せ、トータルでは、落ち込む以前の水準にまで戻っています。","textVersion":"sha256:4f4292c9084d1e0dce1fc17b6236acacdb5f0ec75f95e80c8a98445a10f25807","audioVersion":"sha256:6ead5f8ac039fe9f869929f8fe4ac3217bd70f4ce51c2bb863a1257c95e36c30","timelineVersion":"sha256:d13b503c42b88268a187a5b69830e91b3ccc720c831d7e1ec517d9d9ee2627e5","start":35.11,"end":47.59,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:4:line-1","text":"今回の家計調査の結果、支出は前回の調査に比べてどうなりましたか。","textVersion":"sha256:2cee3851434942d8053fe428e009839f480d6b7813c31f68d440a39e5e84fcd6","audioVersion":"sha256:6ead5f8ac039fe9f869929f8fe4ac3217bd70f4ce51c2bb863a1257c95e36c30","timelineVersion":"sha256:d13b503c42b88268a187a5b69830e91b3ccc720c831d7e1ec517d9d9ee2627e5","start":53.4,"end":59.45,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b6f8d5f6705f5ba5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5","examKey":"2017-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2017.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:c1e067da3e6c98f95eae5788312c3dc74203bba824347ff7808fbf12a26889cf","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed4007dacb6504e5552a96620f35d5e84c5c68e6b9194dfa6145b0efa3806b3b","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2017.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2017-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5:question","text":"市の集会で、市長が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:dc980790e37d3c3255958e9809452e1d748192614cab8ba1918d2bb17fcd0f38","audioVersion":"sha256:c1e067da3e6c98f95eae5788312c3dc74203bba824347ff7808fbf12a26889cf","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed4007dacb6504e5552a96620f35d5e84c5c68e6b9194dfa6145b0efa3806b3b","start":5.43,"end":8.62,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"ええ、ゴミ処理場建設の今後の方針をお話いたします。","textVersion":"sha256:12307b0c12269f18421aa59ab015907d31bb03abf60f8f0d7ea5d3b4c5ab1956","audioVersion":"sha256:c1e067da3e6c98f95eae5788312c3dc74203bba824347ff7808fbf12a26889cf","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed4007dacb6504e5552a96620f35d5e84c5c68e6b9194dfa6145b0efa3806b3b","start":10.92,"end":15.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"先月の選挙では、処理場建設に反対の立場であった前市長を破ることができ、処理場建設に関して、市民の皆様のご支持をいただけたと思っております。","textVersion":"sha256:c8127f540e63f2f4a75846d007f875bcb02b129cd699faeab748238442b3f306","audioVersion":"sha256:c1e067da3e6c98f95eae5788312c3dc74203bba824347ff7808fbf12a26889cf","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed4007dacb6504e5552a96620f35d5e84c5c68e6b9194dfa6145b0efa3806b3b","start":16.35,"end":28.65,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"ただ、建設をめぐっては、候補地が住宅地に近いことから、一部の住民の方から、環境の悪化を心配し、強い反対の声が上がっており、候補地を見直す判断を致しました。","textVersion":"sha256:44173a3781702f3404eadd04c478a657cd5abbbeeda6bc2dbd598463e3a89dbf","audioVersion":"sha256:c1e067da3e6c98f95eae5788312c3dc74203bba824347ff7808fbf12a26889cf","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed4007dacb6504e5552a96620f35d5e84c5c68e6b9194dfa6145b0efa3806b3b","start":29.42,"end":44.05,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"これに伴い、工事日程に遅れが生じますが、多額な建設費がかかる大事な事業ですので、慎重に進めたいと考えております。","textVersion":"sha256:4103b53d59eeebf4b1622828685d5494be05f4471b55ec0f9378c625a0191b1c","audioVersion":"sha256:c1e067da3e6c98f95eae5788312c3dc74203bba824347ff7808fbf12a26889cf","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed4007dacb6504e5552a96620f35d5e84c5c68e6b9194dfa6145b0efa3806b3b","start":44.64,"end":54.87,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2017-12:5:line-1","text":"市長はゴミ処理場の建設について、どう言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:a9c942662a6821d0b3b5d84cc9aed618cbc9b6297b878665caba85f49723ccf6","audioVersion":"sha256:c1e067da3e6c98f95eae5788312c3dc74203bba824347ff7808fbf12a26889cf","timelineVersion":"sha256:ed4007dacb6504e5552a96620f35d5e84c5c68e6b9194dfa6145b0efa3806b3b","start":60.77,"end":65.56,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"b6f8d5f6705f5ba5"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:df4113d58f3022df3e10038c1fa5024fe9119d3a9f5f45bbd484777ac5308a9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:09fbdfb6864df71b339f4ec893ac6626498702f939cc9dacebc860edd1d37761","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1:question","text":"テレビでレポーターがある鉄道について話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:f7b850987feab09a8dc89c65fac8131826f7347c615e7ac4c68fd14dad0b524d","audioVersion":"sha256:df4113d58f3022df3e10038c1fa5024fe9119d3a9f5f45bbd484777ac5308a9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:09fbdfb6864df71b339f4ec893ac6626498702f939cc9dacebc860edd1d37761","start":5.23,"end":9.4,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"私は今山川鉄道の山川駅に来ています。","textVersion":"sha256:cc64a9c237da28a2b389f1ece4b3877f4246e540a6ffa482304349dc926e3c22","audioVersion":"sha256:df4113d58f3022df3e10038c1fa5024fe9119d3a9f5f45bbd484777ac5308a9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:09fbdfb6864df71b339f4ec893ac6626498702f939cc9dacebc860edd1d37761","start":11.15,"end":15.42,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"屋根のない小さな駅なんですが、可愛らしい列車が一両発車を待っています。","textVersion":"sha256:5ddf0ee50ce24cd7946007b87920ab76c6817e60636ba49cc8c1488e6c580975","audioVersion":"sha256:df4113d58f3022df3e10038c1fa5024fe9119d3a9f5f45bbd484777ac5308a9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:09fbdfb6864df71b339f4ec893ac6626498702f939cc9dacebc860edd1d37761","start":16.23,"end":21.9,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"普段は静かな駅ですが、今日は朝から大変混雑しています。","textVersion":"sha256:1a02a2e5d3f29b9a3af730dbb8c2c90cac0edb3b4a864950d873acb1429202d8","audioVersion":"sha256:df4113d58f3022df3e10038c1fa5024fe9119d3a9f5f45bbd484777ac5308a9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:09fbdfb6864df71b339f4ec893ac6626498702f939cc9dacebc860edd1d37761","start":22.81,"end":27.65,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"この山川鉄道、今日の最終列車の運転を最後に一世紀近くの歴史に幕を下ろすことになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:6009925ced4f11ebf72b1ca2f9bfc9639bb8e16138c1acc1476c588f3ea4c94f","audioVersion":"sha256:df4113d58f3022df3e10038c1fa5024fe9119d3a9f5f45bbd484777ac5308a9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:09fbdfb6864df71b339f4ec893ac6626498702f939cc9dacebc860edd1d37761","start":28.5,"end":36.71,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"沿線にも、その姿を一目見ようとカメラを持った大勢の鉄道ファンや観光客が集まっています。","textVersion":"sha256:590c4f073398eeea4a890c18d5f44453c6e2d9625a1768918e6986d231d7db89","audioVersion":"sha256:df4113d58f3022df3e10038c1fa5024fe9119d3a9f5f45bbd484777ac5308a9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:09fbdfb6864df71b339f4ec893ac6626498702f939cc9dacebc860edd1d37761","start":37.52,"end":45.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:1:line-1","text":"レポーターは山川鉄道の何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:0f6a663cdefc29281654a89547fb89d3f51ac79326fbd1275af5650874484b94","audioVersion":"sha256:df4113d58f3022df3e10038c1fa5024fe9119d3a9f5f45bbd484777ac5308a9f","timelineVersion":"sha256:09fbdfb6864df71b339f4ec893ac6626498702f939cc9dacebc860edd1d37761","start":50.86,"end":55.49,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"27a4db997245f0a6"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:question","text":"テレビでアナウンサーが女の人にインタビューしています。","textVersion":"sha256:75a9ffce5fa903aaccf6d20f66d4c9c83ef04f6d64c08961701c13562ae015aa","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":5.15,"end":9.37,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-0","text":"今日はペットの服を作っている山田みどりさんにお越しいただきました。","textVersion":"sha256:83961ed5944691c6519ef6d6cb962adf51fa1a0e63ef89516cf749a2f328e659","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":11.06,"end":16.09,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-1","text":"よろしくお願いします。今日は飼い犬のしろと一緒に来ました。しろが着ているこの服、私が初めて作った服なんです。","textVersion":"sha256:6a44af2a95ca19c06c8ae1ba8825d1425453b1167ff3a017f9b299b4841f11cb","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":16.2,"end":25.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-2","text":"とっても素敵ですね。でも、おしゃれが目的だったわけじゃないんですよね？","textVersion":"sha256:f024f9534d32d16505f4b487d94f831342679f5bbb9c58a91a9c2b5f14495fc7","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":25.44,"end":30.72,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-3","text":"ええ、しろは気温差に弱く、皮膚が弱い犬で、体調管理のために服が必要なんです。でも、市販の服だとサイズがぴったりとは合わないので、動きにくいんでしょうね。着るのを嫌がって。それなら自分で作ろうと思いまして。やわらかい生地で動きを邪魔しないようなデザインにしたら、しろも嫌がらずに着てくれたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:7fa45eea981cb7a21340116eaba68d0d72533bc40ec7f12fdd9b7838b8e215fb","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":30.78,"end":56.17,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-4","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":56.16,"end":57.48,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-5","text":"何枚か作ってるうちに、いろんな犬の服を作りたくなってきて、インターネットで販売を始めたら、どんどん注文が入ってきたんです。お客様をお待たせしてしまっているのが現状ですが、一着一着心をこめて製作しています。","textVersion":"sha256:b2f1c817d5006cb3fb95de780eca8b759a11fa51bbd990a0b13b6009b148eb4e","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":57.44,"end":73.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-6","text":"しろも愛情に包まれてあたたかそうですね。お話ありがとうございました。","textVersion":"sha256:03c4a12006690ff84d7b55cc76268aa8e5c1806121ea5b8d5e7f8ddbd38f946c","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":73.75,"end":79.52,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:2:line-7","text":"女の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7e8a32195345cb90500b7129a6f116813d5545b0f07a7f6d9b9c168efbf7ed61","audioVersion":"sha256:7e61b28f10fc603cd51ffff8d6a276b0ceb9c47cae3b676e1e91f593c3ea63c8","timelineVersion":"sha256:5603f3e9835f0c12a0e82d2396c59373c8b7a48513a867475c8778f8b49e6684","start":85.34,"end":88.77,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"27a4db997245f0a6"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3:question","text":"ラジオでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:a16b629a540ee67e5f4107e5675489ee03c2533ddbd67e1f07fee194cd9f7b95","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","start":5.28,"end":8.02,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"今日は天気雨の現象があちこちで観察されました。","textVersion":"sha256:1d73d891570598462c6ec79a498eb5458dff2148d293d507d519865cd05885f9","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","start":9.75,"end":14.34,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"空に雲一つなく晴れているのに突然雨が降るというこの現象どのように起きるのか、皆さん案外ご存じないんじゃないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:b5b7f23dcf72a48f88f6aed02fd8124dc61ca1c8de8b166123803b3585fd60ac","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","start":14.9,"end":24.8,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"天気雨は雨の粒が雨雲から落ちた後に雲が消えたり動いたりしたために発生します。","textVersion":"sha256:53b65fc48864fec2892255429f922cc27f992b814f9abe3dca7200b719f4b352","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","start":25.71,"end":32.89,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"雨の粒が強い風で飛ばされて雲から離れたところに降ることで発生する場合もあります。","textVersion":"sha256:b3bca30e8dc95377318255f145f6083193ce87d6cc3071aff1b2778eb6f791e9","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","start":33.28,"end":40.33,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"出来れば、突然の雨は避けたいものですが、雨の粒に日の光が当たるのはきれいですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:85d320cbdbf7d89213421e845cb7eece79dbb7d1839a3c012545edd87d9eef02","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","start":41.34,"end":48.6,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-0.segment-5","text":"同様の現象は冬にも雪で見られるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:0255276fc31b021b8d7c1f0d1548fe0a3117c3d89d8beae3c3276074596cbcf6","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","start":49.03,"end":52.65,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:3:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1673c6b733a690adbb707ef47c46062fdbdcbd22d253b9eaed3d67372d7d4c2a","audioVersion":"sha256:58dbdfb9b92b1c81b77cd525ad028b0033be12a6babfde5560a87ac21e201f86","timelineVersion":"sha256:585c61ce7d523ff6c5ead422ca380a2cfcc090a328ce9d8d53fea0aa8d9f166a","start":58.44,"end":61.64,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"27a4db997245f0a6"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4:question","text":"テレビでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:8fdb6969009d3021aa40bc2145c9877906af3b49491bd86948656ad3e20f7644","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","start":5.27,"end":7.92,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"今、若葉町の中央高校に来ています。","textVersion":"sha256:63abe44798e4c01976b1bcbc7786e7760d646972a6eb4b409688a2d5452f0643","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","start":9.62,"end":12.95,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"去年からこちらの高校の校門の前で記念写真を取ろうという外国人の観光客がたくさん訪れるようになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:d166905cddc35d698c0cb0a6e1d08dc9000416f1aee29f191b62451a186eb955","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","start":13.51,"end":22.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"それは、この高校で映画『青春ストーリー』が撮影されたためです。","textVersion":"sha256:48e1c91f78741f80aa5e4103528e844dd9d347d4c95fd247fb79f46cacf5b47c","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","start":23.1,"end":28.37,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"この映画は１０年前に日本で公開され、大変話題になりました。","textVersion":"sha256:76ad7d0043b0b77d88564ef29bad3311a61e83c2e5eb7b6d05a3d7dc38a12447","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","start":29.12,"end":34.44,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-0.segment-4","text":"この映画に出演していた俳優青木たくやさんが去年別の映画で世界的な映画賞を取ったことで、海外でもこの映画が注目されるようになったんだそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:aa3e589e166c1a7e6ca63dbf17e9b3d36f9881cfb379dfcc09eba8c5e982d9e9","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","start":34.98,"end":46.37,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-0.segment-5","text":"高校だけでなく、町のあちこちにこの映画が撮影された場所があり、ファンに大変人気があるとのことです。","textVersion":"sha256:6ce87429512447c7e22bd2eeaa8560ecf6a82ef7db66c3c9f9e9fc302f01cfce","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","start":47.35,"end":54.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:4:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1673c6b733a690adbb707ef47c46062fdbdcbd22d253b9eaed3d67372d7d4c2a","audioVersion":"sha256:eb2bd47fed5f30c718233e82b8923e8e333ab9fef7b3877c4dd267f7add578f0","timelineVersion":"sha256:fcd73214eecb2d60ae1b231aeec5a003b96641aeba17934f83af00659d0b3e51","start":60.89,"end":63.85,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"27a4db997245f0a6"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5","examKey":"2018-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:9fa7b372b520116f4a0cf27ddb94ec939913a1b5fb11e2080cf6297222005be8","timelineVersion":"sha256:a1019ba3cd923b2aa8e2ee9f20cb6448e168fb7e22c26471dc4e28cc43a1983f","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5:question","text":"町の会議で議員が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:00a96672d494c920a4f3914cbaf0cd295c1cefd048366b1dcfa6d7c89f547cd0","audioVersion":"sha256:9fa7b372b520116f4a0cf27ddb94ec939913a1b5fb11e2080cf6297222005be8","timelineVersion":"sha256:a1019ba3cd923b2aa8e2ee9f20cb6448e168fb7e22c26471dc4e28cc43a1983f","start":5.22,"end":8.47,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"昨年度の調査によると、わが川中町ではだれも住んでいない空家がこの十年で二倍に増えていることが明らかになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:1433c703b45a99204e9d5e827c0073e56d8ec6baf6f26a3896b268fbc32fbc4a","audioVersion":"sha256:9fa7b372b520116f4a0cf27ddb94ec939913a1b5fb11e2080cf6297222005be8","timelineVersion":"sha256:a1019ba3cd923b2aa8e2ee9f20cb6448e168fb7e22c26471dc4e28cc43a1983f","start":10.2,"end":20.45,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"空家の増加は地域の防犯上、深刻な問題です。","textVersion":"sha256:11225b8d213f7b30fe9413dcce89f068f50802b4d024e8560c332a3abcd50895","audioVersion":"sha256:9fa7b372b520116f4a0cf27ddb94ec939913a1b5fb11e2080cf6297222005be8","timelineVersion":"sha256:a1019ba3cd923b2aa8e2ee9f20cb6448e168fb7e22c26471dc4e28cc43a1983f","start":21.12,"end":25.79,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"火災の発見が遅れたり、建物が古くなって崩れたりする危険もあります。","textVersion":"sha256:db6e97e544342ce8b4439d0d35d76b84bd4260e5652bb602d53f0427e32e134b","audioVersion":"sha256:9fa7b372b520116f4a0cf27ddb94ec939913a1b5fb11e2080cf6297222005be8","timelineVersion":"sha256:a1019ba3cd923b2aa8e2ee9f20cb6448e168fb7e22c26471dc4e28cc43a1983f","start":26.28,"end":32.14,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"そうした空家は早急に取り壊すべきだという意見が出ていますが、再生させる道を探るほうがいいのではないでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:0510367aa2d7a14981e6e4b591ce19a157e5bab826e7fd6991c2b0ca9fc38b06","audioVersion":"sha256:9fa7b372b520116f4a0cf27ddb94ec939913a1b5fb11e2080cf6297222005be8","timelineVersion":"sha256:a1019ba3cd923b2aa8e2ee9f20cb6448e168fb7e22c26471dc4e28cc43a1983f","start":32.82,"end":41.64,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"全国の例を調べてみますと自治体が空家を管理し、商業施設として再生させているところもあり、人を呼び込むことにつながっている例もあります。","textVersion":"sha256:0f42556310ee760cb8932e0168a84124c57a451c2e2192f2517149836d1232eb","audioVersion":"sha256:9fa7b372b520116f4a0cf27ddb94ec939913a1b5fb11e2080cf6297222005be8","timelineVersion":"sha256:a1019ba3cd923b2aa8e2ee9f20cb6448e168fb7e22c26471dc4e28cc43a1983f","start":42.07,"end":53.47,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-07:5:line-1","text":"議員が言いたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:99f286a6693c8e7c3484ede5f9df03e5e580581ee236bf408d754bb492346fe1","audioVersion":"sha256:9fa7b372b520116f4a0cf27ddb94ec939913a1b5fb11e2080cf6297222005be8","timelineVersion":"sha256:a1019ba3cd923b2aa8e2ee9f20cb6448e168fb7e22c26471dc4e28cc43a1983f","start":59.23,"end":61.92,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"27a4db997245f0a6"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:question","text":"会社で女の人と男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:0b10fa121dd0764793c9b735120aefb6d2aa7e50e0403f9342db0cca6224b0f2","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":5.51,"end":9.43,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-0","text":"最近パン作るのにこってるんだって？","textVersion":"sha256:7b668fe84ac7265027577b2fbcd40782fa2e79b8e7e3e6cc9dbd096a793bdfe4","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":11.18,"end":14.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-1","text":"うん、パンを作る機械を買ったんだ。材料を入れて、スイッチを押して放っておけば簡単にパンができちゃうんだ。焼き上がったときの香りとか、出来たての味とかたまらないんだよ。","textVersion":"sha256:cd13aac1a0eb7614f8d894effec448b7c6fc9694bf7d8cb57743474b6509bd97","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":14.2,"end":26.96,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-2","text":"へえ、お父さんがパンを作ってくれてお子さんも喜んでるんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:62d9350bcf62625bc94c38c4398f1ea39242aca3f747cdf3c4c96c7ac999ecc9","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":26.95,"end":32.59,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-3","text":"うん、お店のパンみたいなのがいいって言って、あまり食べてくれないんだよね。","textVersion":"sha256:15dc6683d83fedf857b9e66d2b64d091b6d9ae47604ddb4d7e9d4f5a6750d934","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":32.64,"end":37.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-4","text":"奥さんの反応はどう？","textVersion":"sha256:56831d690f154426abc30608621a88bceca08c371d4943ad97f2a18a4d09c46f","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":38.18,"end":39.87,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-5","text":"妻は毎日同じパンだから厭きるって。","textVersion":"sha256:fab0937bd4e8ee60f491b1cfaa46f71b517df2b85dbd1bd60a50759f95d6179c","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":39.92,"end":42.97,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-6","text":"そうなんだ。ごまとかフルーツとか、何かお子さんや奥さんの好きそうなものを入れてみたら食べてもらえるんじゃない？","textVersion":"sha256:c72f5cc0263bd91ea28b2412e318e671e3acb7eac003a711dec3e8a2e30cd22a","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":43.14,"end":52.09,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-7","text":"そうだね。","textVersion":"sha256:c85cdfda9a14283043e2de3b9a1404b82d3dd712711392e18ee40f6b395adb04","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":52.09,"end":53.09,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:1:line-8","text":"男の人は機械で作ったパンについてどう言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:5be4affaa4fcfe54480ffd2d283d715bbf3324dcaccb82623d5534437a240905","audioVersion":"sha256:49dda9d7bd290deaedccac1df2de851c16f5abc687fdd6fb2fca5e99e1de5ea3","timelineVersion":"sha256:04587aae68e4565be9823c7547f521b96bfce8f4d9da2bedfc1304bf60e4df2a","start":59.07,"end":63.84,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"940cd5d777084918"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:question","text":"大学の就職説明会で卒業生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:4f6a57603e241a7739f9d37270b27a1ca3b50c7ea205846d04cda30ed1b85593","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":5.41,"end":9.83,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"皆さん、どんな分野の企業で働きたいと思っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:dd6cb0ed1334a574c2eb9ff46f11caa721994dc1cad72c55ae1a3a3e77b06c97","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":11.62,"end":15.88,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"私は現在保険会社で働いていますが、実は就職活動を始めたときは自動車メーカーを志望していました。","textVersion":"sha256:ccf4e3cc322f23f75fe4de58d2c41b81cc7213b7aaf5f7091656c49f90c68ae7","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":16.45,"end":25.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"誰よりも早く情報を集め、頑張りました。","textVersion":"sha256:3b756d8ea3f86c0db52f6f22c67b034d73bb93d9ca601b61564800be4dc997ff","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":25.6,"end":28.85,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"でも受けた会社は全て不採用でした。","textVersion":"sha256:482ad505bbd4df670c0123f2e34f8982dfe1113a34c0d3135add73bba97cf0e5","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":29.21,"end":32.76,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"それで、それまでまったく考えていなかった会社にも応募してみたら、三社から採用通知をもらえたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:a6511cabd66c0d9a05536ba42a6f0956dc31d4e2bc365fd5b917ec29c540057c","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":33.31,"end":40.59,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0.segment-5","text":"今の仕事は学ぶことも多く、やりがいもあります。","textVersion":"sha256:cf9208ed6fb21e6c518e0fa64c4dbc233d25d8a9e7445df0eb4aab1e31fb6071","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":41.43,"end":44.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0.segment-6","text":"あのとき、自動車メーカー以外の会社に目を向けてみてよかったと思っています。","textVersion":"sha256:956e598e5378a6da09b1d834292647993ef976d881f50a097ea17cbe487bd992","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":45.5,"end":50.83,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-0.segment-7","text":"皆さんも就職活動では範囲を広げたほうが最終的に自分にあった会社が見つかるんじゃないかと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:efaa0d58b1292a03521c5ab0ed58f62218de3b62725a81314a5802ded41d0b82","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":51.58,"end":59.75,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:2:line-1","text":"卒業生は就職活動についてどんなアドバイスをしていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:595f6cc93cd1ef5bff923bcfd485fd5c0899faea8486292eb87e2ca79923687a","audioVersion":"sha256:a0e4258e8472874303e0510f57d70025b2ca3e53e2b6d497224e308e4d65aa0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:68855fafa641dea5ddf5d40377f08619b988c25c697fe37ff9a704e0211b351c","start":65.5,"end":71.09,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"940cd5d777084918"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:65e2c99e3ce1e5f28d2f24e8ea35374d15b909eeb8e19912916c46cb767beaaa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8b66c4f6c4bdc631f0083d36403bc1fcc4ce03262c98bec4cb884fb8a4b90918","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3:question","text":"テレビでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:8fdb6969009d3021aa40bc2145c9877906af3b49491bd86948656ad3e20f7644","audioVersion":"sha256:65e2c99e3ce1e5f28d2f24e8ea35374d15b909eeb8e19912916c46cb767beaaa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8b66c4f6c4bdc631f0083d36403bc1fcc4ce03262c98bec4cb884fb8a4b90918","start":5.83,"end":8.49,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"最近、スーパーの新しい形として小型スーパーが都心に次々と開店しています。","textVersion":"sha256:c1695a98f2c371ed80cd8aae5a013514e2497db11f66b9298f9b5d3e9747e2a9","audioVersion":"sha256:65e2c99e3ce1e5f28d2f24e8ea35374d15b909eeb8e19912916c46cb767beaaa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8b66c4f6c4bdc631f0083d36403bc1fcc4ce03262c98bec4cb884fb8a4b90918","start":10.31,"end":17.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"この種のスーパーは都心を中心に出店されているもので売り場面積がこれまでの平均的なスーパーの五分の一程度となっています。","textVersion":"sha256:075a4ad58c1879fe5712487ed640daf64be9c97b5bb58e774ec4aa1bf496a692","audioVersion":"sha256:65e2c99e3ce1e5f28d2f24e8ea35374d15b909eeb8e19912916c46cb767beaaa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8b66c4f6c4bdc631f0083d36403bc1fcc4ce03262c98bec4cb884fb8a4b90918","start":17.95,"end":27.83,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"売り場では肉や野菜が少量ずつに分けて販売されています。","textVersion":"sha256:e58d7fbf0f880b74d8ce29f568154c84208f6b6ee7b8abd4f0f970fce9a325a5","audioVersion":"sha256:65e2c99e3ce1e5f28d2f24e8ea35374d15b909eeb8e19912916c46cb767beaaa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8b66c4f6c4bdc631f0083d36403bc1fcc4ce03262c98bec4cb884fb8a4b90918","start":28.93,"end":33.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"都心部には高齢者や一人暮らしの人が増加しており、自宅にちかく、少量ずつ商品が買えることから、こうしたスーパーが人気を集めているようです。","textVersion":"sha256:e466159cd20a059953fc3fb105e33fc076a01090dce695b870f19a186809017d","audioVersion":"sha256:65e2c99e3ce1e5f28d2f24e8ea35374d15b909eeb8e19912916c46cb767beaaa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8b66c4f6c4bdc631f0083d36403bc1fcc4ce03262c98bec4cb884fb8a4b90918","start":34.53,"end":45.61,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:3:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何をレポートしていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:48cfa13e57ea16cb2cdf6709ec6938f3a68dce9a9e550d4dff71ee2a24c199f1","audioVersion":"sha256:65e2c99e3ce1e5f28d2f24e8ea35374d15b909eeb8e19912916c46cb767beaaa","timelineVersion":"sha256:8b66c4f6c4bdc631f0083d36403bc1fcc4ce03262c98bec4cb884fb8a4b90918","start":51.43,"end":54.58,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"940cd5d777084918"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:81c09a22a0d3f710cc5293d2012bb0dc8dddf7c541904d8e355edcb655d75260","timelineVersion":"sha256:b2b8e96945b339cb124e1438f78964f768d85b1276b89030e405f5ff860201d7","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4:question","text":"テレビでレポーターが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:469be39a115c23d52db1f3ae9f9f3df32598b0a56544e852b662a5423093ccae","audioVersion":"sha256:81c09a22a0d3f710cc5293d2012bb0dc8dddf7c541904d8e355edcb655d75260","timelineVersion":"sha256:b2b8e96945b339cb124e1438f78964f768d85b1276b89030e405f5ff860201d7","start":5.7,"end":8.24,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-0.segment-0","text":"ここ村上町には以前は雑草が伸び放題の空き地がたくさんありました。","textVersion":"sha256:e372dcd87ac4bf5efef0433d20e513ec33d958098a8b551166c9082d4d46f854","audioVersion":"sha256:81c09a22a0d3f710cc5293d2012bb0dc8dddf7c541904d8e355edcb655d75260","timelineVersion":"sha256:b2b8e96945b339cb124e1438f78964f768d85b1276b89030e405f5ff860201d7","start":9.98,"end":15.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-0.segment-1","text":"そのような土地は手入れをしないと大量の虫が発生しますし、見通しが悪くなって防犯上も良くないといった声もあり、町では数年前から対策が取られてきました。","textVersion":"sha256:ae9af58591a845c3c3f912b1516d7ac7dbf20ed8250b1a26cbc0bcbf8eb4f833","audioVersion":"sha256:81c09a22a0d3f710cc5293d2012bb0dc8dddf7c541904d8e355edcb655d75260","timelineVersion":"sha256:b2b8e96945b339cb124e1438f78964f768d85b1276b89030e405f5ff860201d7","start":16.04,"end":28.53,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-0.segment-2","text":"去年までは農薬を使って手入れをしていたそうですが、薬の害を心配する町の人も多いことから、今年はヤギの力を借りることにしたそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:3853584037649b2c2c3ab8ffd414159e1311e4cb92e7937d6da6945e88978228","audioVersion":"sha256:81c09a22a0d3f710cc5293d2012bb0dc8dddf7c541904d8e355edcb655d75260","timelineVersion":"sha256:b2b8e96945b339cb124e1438f78964f768d85b1276b89030e405f5ff860201d7","start":29.12,"end":39.57,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-0.segment-3","text":"空き地に二三頭を放すと、雑草をきれいに食べてくれ、人体や環境への心配もないと喜ばれていて、今後も継続されるようです。","textVersion":"sha256:c617b07151a6f05634f15a06dd6ecb132bf7be4ae50e8cf72422f52a93f32270","audioVersion":"sha256:81c09a22a0d3f710cc5293d2012bb0dc8dddf7c541904d8e355edcb655d75260","timelineVersion":"sha256:b2b8e96945b339cb124e1438f78964f768d85b1276b89030e405f5ff860201d7","start":40.36,"end":49.5,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:4:line-1","text":"レポーターは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:ea3ae7b80fe74c8d51e0e216eea587a88f8f06d96975f73ceb6fa4190084bbc3","audioVersion":"sha256:81c09a22a0d3f710cc5293d2012bb0dc8dddf7c541904d8e355edcb655d75260","timelineVersion":"sha256:b2b8e96945b339cb124e1438f78964f768d85b1276b89030e405f5ff860201d7","start":55.29,"end":58.52,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"940cd5d777084918"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","examKey":"2018-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2018.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2018.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2018-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5:question","text":"ラジオで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:0ccf292cc278e347a153fb220db53863294b915454a13e60786dc44ccb1b7d1e","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","start":5.56,"end":8.41,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"えー、日本では生活の西洋化が進んで椅子に座ることが増えてあまり正座をしなくなりました。","textVersion":"sha256:49b6a1b2f69a07c48eac485e872fd408597e9e67695a9aba1f27f88cf1b9b132","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","start":10.14,"end":17.53,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"ただ、これがいま見直されつつあるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:656191f5fd8a99a60b733ed26624f330da9f568898df157c7fef312dd14f2041","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","start":18.26,"end":20.86,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"正座はとても健康的な座り方で、姿勢が悪くなりがちな現代人の悩みを解消してくれます。","textVersion":"sha256:f8e396b659e34165e9a9d5d6da1c1acacaa58f778cb3f37acf87e69ad6a07ae2","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","start":21.37,"end":27.82,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"ううん、例えば、体操のような効果があり、首や肩、腰の痛みがよくなるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:392a02a93f16301b7943dbadf410fa76639d5fedbb3e46d6347dbb8c79be4e39","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","start":28.24,"end":34.75,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"また、胃が正常な位置に固定されるため、食べ過ぎることがなく、胃や肌の調子も改善されます。","textVersion":"sha256:fbfa4a163c3e9f5dd1c00ccc98abe5ad38fdfc67fe3995bf2896a0b2c0167030","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","start":35.26,"end":42.04,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-0.segment-5","text":"こうした体の不調に悩み薬を飲んでいた方が、すっかり痛みから解放されたという声も聞かれます。","textVersion":"sha256:9397dd0672ccdb85e19a064fb733173881d1dfc635268bf467dc448f99d269de","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","start":42.64,"end":49.32,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2018-12:5:line-1","text":"男の人が伝えたいことはなんですか。","textVersion":"sha256:c1ff1ddfd7618ce3d0021c11c349ac43d2cd0de1295c0cd410b03615248097b9","audioVersion":"sha256:fa1ee66e2afa412a9509f4c1c433fd82d8c5dcc074f916b88d121ee05ecacf0c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5d84e5159b97004d35ed8ae2ff879d4c650be0b66e42927cda5c373cee0c243e","start":55.11,"end":57.81,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"940cd5d777084918"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:question","text":"就職セミナーで、ある航空会社の社員が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:310a79cfd93eff8aa88009e422b44408ea94ca4d87798e867133c9b9e19f8f5a","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":5.74,"end":10.55,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"私は飛行機の乗務員をしています。","textVersion":"sha256:189266ac35bc879a89dc7eac997f2662806b283c7cdb0352768ff0ad84074e13","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":12.27,"end":15.22,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"機内でお客様が快適で安全に過ごせるように様々な仕事をします。","textVersion":"sha256:ed20398b0b9f8f03249ca84d325ed0686fac6d5801befaae5806833d1c7fed8d","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":16.02,"end":21.77,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"この仕事は飛行機でいろいろな場所に行けて、魅力的だと思われているようで、就職を希望する学生さんが多いのも事実です。","textVersion":"sha256:29cf95c150d21ab658774b9e33bf69163abcc4d303b7eb5147324e323addccfe","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":22.25,"end":30.89,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"ただ、いい面ばかりではありません。","textVersion":"sha256:a4145ed1133446e89f0f5f18cd264593f02883ca6f7c123ee8cc1e8ca904c8f5","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":31.84,"end":34.38,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0.segment-4","text":"お客様の荷物の上げ下ろしのお手伝いや飲み物、食事のサービスなど休む間もないほどです。","textVersion":"sha256:b376507ad5b0c2757c8b56bebe329d10b69ab91343e6203da1a0c76bc0a0386d","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":35.13,"end":42.69,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0.segment-5","text":"また、何かトラブルが起これば、お客様への対応が求められます。","textVersion":"sha256:14bb9930a5589b9c17ae30840108f9cf727a7d05c3d45c962f92d0b792f5b376","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":43.77,"end":48.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-0.segment-6","text":"外からはそういったことはなかなか見えにくいと思いますが。","textVersion":"sha256:0cc42be2d3201d131f1777cf42d56cb63e33f260a6027f59aa1ac43d1f7f97b7","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":49.61,"end":53.71,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:1:line-1","text":"社員は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:914ee7423ea40abc897e98a1ce74477e9450dabab55e9feb42b1277971ac7bc0","audioVersion":"sha256:052845f90c535cafab6c138bba97d70a3dc2db6d3438c821b0eb7390959f59ab","timelineVersion":"sha256:114dfae3e6522b9d7572b074774433c4dc7cf8492a7b5735a8c6731bfe3a286d","start":59.27,"end":62.52,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"839ba93a38732f45"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:d72071cb6489d7564972df819b4e7bc806137c6460c39845b9c8172d2d50c520","timelineVersion":"sha256:dfee8471134ffbce813c979cb6b197be6e60f705e92e204ece86ee5c84f3769a","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2:question","text":"女の人と男の人が男の人が買った車について話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:b2530d62abc37078ad92d0177b291569e178176d6044fbae5381f50396b7b160","audioVersion":"sha256:d72071cb6489d7564972df819b4e7bc806137c6460c39845b9c8172d2d50c520","timelineVersion":"sha256:dfee8471134ffbce813c979cb6b197be6e60f705e92e204ece86ee5c84f3769a","start":5.64,"end":11.38,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-0","text":"最近、新しい車を買ったんだってね。","textVersion":"sha256:61ee6d2c78579ab61ecf3015e2f07d27908d06e98d9b19020b305a9617233a6b","audioVersion":"sha256:d72071cb6489d7564972df819b4e7bc806137c6460c39845b9c8172d2d50c520","timelineVersion":"sha256:dfee8471134ffbce813c979cb6b197be6e60f705e92e204ece86ee5c84f3769a","start":13.16,"end":16.15,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-1","text":"うん、ずっと憧れてた車なんだ。有名なデザイナーがデザインした車で、外見も中も洗練されてて、僕にとっては一流ホテルにいるのと同じような感じなんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:6e7e18bcaf1ffa55ebd6ddea05c7248ca6d38bf6a7bd2533c07a46c4caba4fd7","audioVersion":"sha256:d72071cb6489d7564972df819b4e7bc806137c6460c39845b9c8172d2d50c520","timelineVersion":"sha256:dfee8471134ffbce813c979cb6b197be6e60f705e92e204ece86ee5c84f3769a","start":16.32,"end":28.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-2","text":"へー。","textVersion":"sha256:043e96d54aa9a3279d4bff4ab0e31e88750d2fc8432ed73a39c3e33b12db5385","audioVersion":"sha256:d72071cb6489d7564972df819b4e7bc806137c6460c39845b9c8172d2d50c520","timelineVersion":"sha256:dfee8471134ffbce813c979cb6b197be6e60f705e92e204ece86ee5c84f3769a","start":28.79,"end":29.92,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-3","text":"ただ、買うかどうか最後まで悩む値段だったんだけどね。買ってから驚いたんだけど、乗ってて疲れにくいんだ。視界のよさとか、操作のしやすさとか、運転手の負担を最小限に抑える工夫が効いてて、安全運転にもつながるしね。その意味では安い買い物だったと思うよ。","textVersion":"sha256:34e1cc1bbc4fb10d8dff8a0069ba4079fc7eb76c7aa4702d07da58c8d14cec2c","audioVersion":"sha256:d72071cb6489d7564972df819b4e7bc806137c6460c39845b9c8172d2d50c520","timelineVersion":"sha256:dfee8471134ffbce813c979cb6b197be6e60f705e92e204ece86ee5c84f3769a","start":30,"end":51.22,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:2:line-4","text":"男の人は買った車についてどう言っていますか。","textVersion":"sha256:72f5c68d8bef284ecfaba1e23d7b8d5d61c79369f89b21ba6aa5ca10f563500c","audioVersion":"sha256:d72071cb6489d7564972df819b4e7bc806137c6460c39845b9c8172d2d50c520","timelineVersion":"sha256:dfee8471134ffbce813c979cb6b197be6e60f705e92e204ece86ee5c84f3769a","start":56.77,"end":61.27,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"839ba93a38732f45"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:8d9787026a9a0f3ba58acc1783020186303f5ad7e712b1c1150eeff7642497b8","timelineVersion":"sha256:694b06c1d843a8b0dff9c6a472d4e422cf919b44cdb0855181fd4e18c97d1ef6","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3:question","text":"ラジオで、料理研究家が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:a962e75fcf499dfff8855ffb6981ba22a7f5d90629c31531dbd0b314e6a0f114","audioVersion":"sha256:8d9787026a9a0f3ba58acc1783020186303f5ad7e712b1c1150eeff7642497b8","timelineVersion":"sha256:694b06c1d843a8b0dff9c6a472d4e422cf919b44cdb0855181fd4e18c97d1ef6","start":5.62,"end":8.63,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"料理を作ったら、食べた人に美味しいと言ってほしいとみんな思いますよね。","textVersion":"sha256:3de5a89bf0b101f6a2aadb6c665f4e4841a7fa93716ab53456425bf06dcabfb8","audioVersion":"sha256:8d9787026a9a0f3ba58acc1783020186303f5ad7e712b1c1150eeff7642497b8","timelineVersion":"sha256:694b06c1d843a8b0dff9c6a472d4e422cf919b44cdb0855181fd4e18c97d1ef6","start":10.36,"end":16.1,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"ところが、好みは人それぞれ、その好みを形成するものの一つは子供の頃から毎日食べていた家庭料理の味です。","textVersion":"sha256:2f1a6f85d3686b38997b8bd7d7a9163776a45486da23f30efee42e8207c55f90","audioVersion":"sha256:8d9787026a9a0f3ba58acc1783020186303f5ad7e712b1c1150eeff7642497b8","timelineVersion":"sha256:694b06c1d843a8b0dff9c6a472d4e422cf919b44cdb0855181fd4e18c97d1ef6","start":16.4,"end":26.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"家庭だけでなく、学生時代によく通っていた食堂などの慣れ親しんだ味を美味しいと感じることが多いと言われています。","textVersion":"sha256:1aad68c5447c1445eee4ad3e1382bf1a814058243d9b472cafc9002d151c8aa8","audioVersion":"sha256:8d9787026a9a0f3ba58acc1783020186303f5ad7e712b1c1150eeff7642497b8","timelineVersion":"sha256:694b06c1d843a8b0dff9c6a472d4e422cf919b44cdb0855181fd4e18c97d1ef6","start":26.81,"end":36.07,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"ほかにも暑い地域では、汗をかいて体温を下げる効果のある辛い料理が好まれるといった気候によるものなどもあります。","textVersion":"sha256:14570e661bf384dedabd2cea0a33ac3b8d31442d2aed7848337fd274ccffde6d","audioVersion":"sha256:8d9787026a9a0f3ba58acc1783020186303f5ad7e712b1c1150eeff7642497b8","timelineVersion":"sha256:694b06c1d843a8b0dff9c6a472d4e422cf919b44cdb0855181fd4e18c97d1ef6","start":36.39,"end":46.7,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:3:line-1","text":"料理研究家は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:45f4fdcd54fad3b5fb056ff24ece27fda3ac1db1702bec9a6f0dc7309fa0afd1","audioVersion":"sha256:8d9787026a9a0f3ba58acc1783020186303f5ad7e712b1c1150eeff7642497b8","timelineVersion":"sha256:694b06c1d843a8b0dff9c6a472d4e422cf919b44cdb0855181fd4e18c97d1ef6","start":52.24,"end":56.06,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"839ba93a38732f45"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4:question","text":"テレビで、アナウンサーが作家にインタビューをしています。","textVersion":"sha256:7cf796fc140b5869f49533df50352dfa84b49cfbfda87e88b6f1c76385f1a043","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","start":5.71,"end":9.73,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-0","text":"今日は今話題の作家山田はじめさんにお話を伺います。どうぞ、よろしくお願いいたします。山田さん、最近若い人の読書離れが進んでいると言われていますが。","textVersion":"sha256:e7989a4ec02ce647cc0c47144517388a43e41da308d98fc2f43713230e0beeff","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","start":11.5,"end":25.05,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-1","text":"読書っていうのは人生を豊かにしてくれるので、若い人には本を読んでもらいたいですね。ただ個人的には一年に何冊本を読んだとか、そういうことはそれほど大切ではないと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:8afa364f0307dfb5c7fb110c5ae1cb136c990453b4be9f40b0a9d2b3c0cfb900","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","start":25.69,"end":38.71,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-2","text":"と言いますと。","textVersion":"sha256:8e9ab2c37d6437ad42bea497dcdf02a3a4f9d680f35a8c04c57e361081185c0f","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","start":38.91,"end":40.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-3","text":"わたしは若い頃、好きな本をよく汚れてぼろぼろになるまで読んでましたが、同じ本でも読むたびに違うことを感じて、考えが深まっていったのを覚えています。最近は仕事や人間関係に役立つからといって、実用的な本ばかり宣伝される傾向がありますが、そういう本は何回も読んだりしないですからね。","textVersion":"sha256:7dd8dd2052a75ba6137b8f46065bb60403763fe84bfda499690d25ea04a8109d","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","start":40.2,"end":63.29,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-4","text":"ええ。","textVersion":"sha256:30224d71f95afa967c387b6513d7bcc534c393cc15c36334b132286ff5d66c36","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","start":63.32,"end":64.03,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-5","text":"若い人にも自分が出会った一冊とじっくり向き合ってほしいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:d39288ea848babc04bb9a5c3a3f9effaa61b901f1fe3ab52ec3aa0730a8674bd","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","start":64.57,"end":69.65,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:4:line-6","text":"作家が言いたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:416cd6fc3d2cedf69b1092861fdc4e82d121773146ee035508ead469b39d869b","audioVersion":"sha256:5fea45fa3e837027521d8f24f7c8e12e3bceedc071e885b3201556ef182e7c84","timelineVersion":"sha256:8622647429f4e27545ffe8ea22e793a1112d2d96c634f20bab7e7ac0045491a0","start":75.19,"end":77.73,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"839ba93a38732f45"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5","examKey":"2019-07","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.7-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:1f4a706cc66b927cd8a4441a0ff2a3feebc7400e9c2e2205bc2ff3c415ef8f3e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d816467f72748369b0d18199b8925ea47572272ddcae2951266eeb1959460c9a","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-07.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5:question","text":"学校で校長先生が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:d68e75249558d2a54585ec2f58c194a6e4c58386ac92949a2550abba2e762a2e","audioVersion":"sha256:1f4a706cc66b927cd8a4441a0ff2a3feebc7400e9c2e2205bc2ff3c415ef8f3e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d816467f72748369b0d18199b8925ea47572272ddcae2951266eeb1959460c9a","start":5.68,"end":8.78,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"受験勉強やスポーツの練習など大きな目標に向かっているとき、目標しか見えなくなっていることがあります。","textVersion":"sha256:bb6ed8ab6856506290dbd8c4ae06e46915b24bbf894bc18b1649932b495bae6d","audioVersion":"sha256:1f4a706cc66b927cd8a4441a0ff2a3feebc7400e9c2e2205bc2ff3c415ef8f3e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d816467f72748369b0d18199b8925ea47572272ddcae2951266eeb1959460c9a","start":10.53,"end":18.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"そこに向かう道はつらくても仕方がないといやいや取り組んでいたりしませんか。","textVersion":"sha256:4b73b318f802c509ee0ab398895345cfd215ad2a681e0658d4782a751db4aa83","audioVersion":"sha256:1f4a706cc66b927cd8a4441a0ff2a3feebc7400e9c2e2205bc2ff3c415ef8f3e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d816467f72748369b0d18199b8925ea47572272ddcae2951266eeb1959460c9a","start":19.81,"end":25.13,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"目標を持つことはもちろん大事ですが、ちょっと視点を変えてみましょう。","textVersion":"sha256:a4bd73efaad2b82f7e79fe340cb25584c1c34b843f95d51dedd9316a6ec36742","audioVersion":"sha256:1f4a706cc66b927cd8a4441a0ff2a3feebc7400e9c2e2205bc2ff3c415ef8f3e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d816467f72748369b0d18199b8925ea47572272ddcae2951266eeb1959460c9a","start":25.62,"end":30.85,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"学ぶこと、運動すること自体にも喜びがあり、自分の成長につながるはずです。","textVersion":"sha256:22d3869884f9fc213a0626683c44d3566502abf65c5e2eb05be646d4c40e94ff","audioVersion":"sha256:1f4a706cc66b927cd8a4441a0ff2a3feebc7400e9c2e2205bc2ff3c415ef8f3e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d816467f72748369b0d18199b8925ea47572272ddcae2951266eeb1959460c9a","start":31.51,"end":37.77,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"最終的なゴールは同じでも、そこにたどり着くまでにどう取り組むかによって、得られるものも変わってくるかもしれません。","textVersion":"sha256:85dc3e1ad2a10eda2a360bf05ac1d495cd41b0b8d703587bb455a97232b55d71","audioVersion":"sha256:1f4a706cc66b927cd8a4441a0ff2a3feebc7400e9c2e2205bc2ff3c415ef8f3e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d816467f72748369b0d18199b8925ea47572272ddcae2951266eeb1959460c9a","start":38.97,"end":47.71,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-07:5:line-1","text":"校長先生が伝えたいことはどのようなことですか。","textVersion":"sha256:2d2218b679ef3c2c61dbf8cda84f1de0f85dc8eaaa4f325ebac4a905f87dc22f","audioVersion":"sha256:1f4a706cc66b927cd8a4441a0ff2a3feebc7400e9c2e2205bc2ff3c415ef8f3e","timelineVersion":"sha256:d816467f72748369b0d18199b8925ea47572272ddcae2951266eeb1959460c9a","start":53.21,"end":57.31,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"839ba93a38732f45"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1:question","text":"テレビでレポーターが男の人にインタビューをしています。","textVersion":"sha256:2d75dede675567866480bd20c8bfc2505e685fdb69cc07ab9f8832c0e1ccb050","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","start":5.42,"end":9.88,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-0","text":"私は今アニメのイベント会場に来ています。こちらのイベントを毎年開催している山本さんにお話を伺います。","textVersion":"sha256:22d1b9defe4ceb22619a8c8126183be2be35648fd421fa00b0d462baf9353c9b","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","start":11.77,"end":22.56,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-1.segment-0","text":"このイベントでは新作アニメの紹介やアニメグッズの販売、ゲーム、コンサートなどを行っています。","textVersion":"sha256:5b93aa673fb0b2743e414d939ac3aae3565af8405b86055d09c243f7b0033c95","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","start":23.63,"end":31.38,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-1.segment-1","text":"年に一度のこの機会にぜひ、新たなお気に入りのアニメを見つけたり、ファン同士の交流を深めたりして、皆さんに楽しんでもらいたいと思います。","textVersion":"sha256:3c56e7bbebb202fd4682bf41d3029af85eb6900e229e298772befdaacc6c4962","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","start":32.23,"end":42.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-1.segment-2","text":"日本のアニメは海外でも人気で、アニメファンはもちろんですが、友達にこのイベントに連れて来られて興味を持つようになったという外国の方も多いんです。","textVersion":"sha256:354d75f4061a8c6cc0b432aa5c1eed705a18d0aeefeed6be917d10ae8215e027","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","start":43.58,"end":54.3,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-2","text":"そうですか。","textVersion":"sha256:03bba055aea688e0ec86702122c58c103d48763981f4763bf25a57114c9c4c3f","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","start":54.49,"end":55.61,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-3","text":"アニメを通して、日本のことをもっと知って、好きになってもらいたいので、このイベントがそういうきっかけになるようにと思っています。","textVersion":"sha256:e9a31699506ce5141d58c13d9e87654b8e09cc4e5ac289d1a28cf47962b04993","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","start":56.02,"end":64.55,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:1:line-4","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:7ee4c20c8d746748c3a533fbfa6b39519c33966bbe5341a0297b7b31ed467e42","timelineVersion":"sha256:e8b49b240d9ce7098160ef21d074b2850c306f80633991c38685f862c254b2cd","start":68.4,"end":75.73,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"7b557b710c269479"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:88151b4bcd7fa61e9bd56b28ec8b92c22ea6b89a8ac3cf24a919d9dadc9e3a5c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5038af1c7f8d33f387c9c01eefe52974f8dd4380f8267f38641454b4bdfb2657","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2:question","text":"ラジオで女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:bea3a221e6161ba0820ce1214df6e60533cfcddc023c8e660b12196bf86bc650","audioVersion":"sha256:88151b4bcd7fa61e9bd56b28ec8b92c22ea6b89a8ac3cf24a919d9dadc9e3a5c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5038af1c7f8d33f387c9c01eefe52974f8dd4380f8267f38641454b4bdfb2657","start":5.65,"end":8.56,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"ある高齢者介護施設では、わざと施設内に階段や段差を設置しているそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:91228755d64393c8fd9a10ea22b84d878370b032110a717a9488f2ac744df8e7","audioVersion":"sha256:88151b4bcd7fa61e9bd56b28ec8b92c22ea6b89a8ac3cf24a919d9dadc9e3a5c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5038af1c7f8d33f387c9c01eefe52974f8dd4380f8267f38641454b4bdfb2657","start":10.3,"end":20.12,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"えっと思われるかもしれませんが、あえて不便にすることで、体力や体の機能の低下を防ごうとするものなんです。","textVersion":"sha256:ff7a50168a21a51597a240527fb53c3cb4cc53dac4774aa6be5036b7c373c8df","audioVersion":"sha256:88151b4bcd7fa61e9bd56b28ec8b92c22ea6b89a8ac3cf24a919d9dadc9e3a5c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5038af1c7f8d33f387c9c01eefe52974f8dd4380f8267f38641454b4bdfb2657","start":20.24,"end":28.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"パソコンの普及で漢字が書けなくなったなんてよく聞きますが、昔は何でも手書きで手間はかかるけど、おかげで漢字を忘れずに済んだわけですよね。","textVersion":"sha256:ae55bd1d53a7362f11676ccf2ecc61995537f3b28258b536fb924a93e23774f8","audioVersion":"sha256:88151b4bcd7fa61e9bd56b28ec8b92c22ea6b89a8ac3cf24a919d9dadc9e3a5c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5038af1c7f8d33f387c9c01eefe52974f8dd4380f8267f38641454b4bdfb2657","start":29.44,"end":39.97,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"そういえば、先日うちの掃除機が壊れて、家中ほうきで掃いたんですけど、日ごろの運動不足が解消された気が……これも同じことかなあ。","textVersion":"sha256:cd3b7906fbc277d6b0a042c2e59bc22fdb1260122d1c62e15b586c6a80d605fb","audioVersion":"sha256:88151b4bcd7fa61e9bd56b28ec8b92c22ea6b89a8ac3cf24a919d9dadc9e3a5c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5038af1c7f8d33f387c9c01eefe52974f8dd4380f8267f38641454b4bdfb2657","start":41.23,"end":51.19,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:2:line-1","text":"女の人が言いたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:ec52b06ffcbbdab6026b54f059304135dd807309e3fae4f705e0098c84e69cc5","audioVersion":"sha256:88151b4bcd7fa61e9bd56b28ec8b92c22ea6b89a8ac3cf24a919d9dadc9e3a5c","timelineVersion":"sha256:5038af1c7f8d33f387c9c01eefe52974f8dd4380f8267f38641454b4bdfb2657","start":55.14,"end":62.02,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"7b557b710c269479"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:11d45ea7387bd8c354c9ee7951574ca6c9fccb99b6c6688fc48107b3c5810fb5","timelineVersion":"sha256:0367cb4b348d3931615356d2adec3460b4a3e66df46bf6168c6aa1f3f90a503c","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3:question","text":"テレビで動物園の職員が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:18301ced7134308e4d3bfb4fc4ca73482004bf44c69f93d8cd01d25956183423","audioVersion":"sha256:11d45ea7387bd8c354c9ee7951574ca6c9fccb99b6c6688fc48107b3c5810fb5","timelineVersion":"sha256:0367cb4b348d3931615356d2adec3460b4a3e66df46bf6168c6aa1f3f90a503c","start":5.89,"end":9.43,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"動物園というと、一般的には、遠足やデートなどで訪れるレクリエーションの場というイメージをお持ちかもしれませんが。","textVersion":"sha256:ebd699dd9f25fcf91a5a3d4b5e545ba0f1180bf67619c1b5f2a0ef0534d1cb06","audioVersion":"sha256:11d45ea7387bd8c354c9ee7951574ca6c9fccb99b6c6688fc48107b3c5810fb5","timelineVersion":"sha256:0367cb4b348d3931615356d2adec3460b4a3e66df46bf6168c6aa1f3f90a503c","start":11.16,"end":19.65,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"動物の生態や自然環境について学ぶ機会を提供する場でもあるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:183a5a74414b285b7a65fff95c039b10db29ef6c6a4faa9cb20c61b7bcb73bbb","audioVersion":"sha256:11d45ea7387bd8c354c9ee7951574ca6c9fccb99b6c6688fc48107b3c5810fb5","timelineVersion":"sha256:0367cb4b348d3931615356d2adec3460b4a3e66df46bf6168c6aa1f3f90a503c","start":20.27,"end":25.3,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"また、近年、自然環境の悪化などにより、野生動物の生活範囲が狭くなってきていて、住む場所を失ったり、数が著しく減少してしまったりしている動物たちがいます。","textVersion":"sha256:93e14a750472bc9199f1562c19168b206a511911934aad5e2802a329beb030d4","audioVersion":"sha256:11d45ea7387bd8c354c9ee7951574ca6c9fccb99b6c6688fc48107b3c5810fb5","timelineVersion":"sha256:0367cb4b348d3931615356d2adec3460b4a3e66df46bf6168c6aa1f3f90a503c","start":26.15,"end":39.88,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"動物園には、そうした動物を保護し、守るという一面もあるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:0d4c6b5befabdd81183c5726d071dba20d892742c83bc4532d0e576cdd286720","audioVersion":"sha256:11d45ea7387bd8c354c9ee7951574ca6c9fccb99b6c6688fc48107b3c5810fb5","timelineVersion":"sha256:0367cb4b348d3931615356d2adec3460b4a3e66df46bf6168c6aa1f3f90a503c","start":40.74,"end":45.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:3:line-1","text":"職員は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:4c44831e035ebf49c3b67b56dd10c139c8681541f3745ee556abdc6871164888","audioVersion":"sha256:11d45ea7387bd8c354c9ee7951574ca6c9fccb99b6c6688fc48107b3c5810fb5","timelineVersion":"sha256:0367cb4b348d3931615356d2adec3460b4a3e66df46bf6168c6aa1f3f90a503c","start":47.65,"end":54.64,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"7b557b710c269479"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:82b682dc0f5bcdbbab07810985556f81470f5c44757c12631ed01203a537266d","timelineVersion":"sha256:81d33a1c957df320829c081d951c056143ab27b7875f00baed1367cca5783d06","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4:question","text":"会社で上司と女の人が残業時間を制限することについて話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:6a99fc5ee58fe17b53857022c94043abf0d1cf206b7aa6a23097a6a24bc5029d","audioVersion":"sha256:82b682dc0f5bcdbbab07810985556f81470f5c44757c12631ed01203a537266d","timelineVersion":"sha256:81d33a1c957df320829c081d951c056143ab27b7875f00baed1367cca5783d06","start":4.41,"end":12.35,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-0","text":"中野さん、今社内で残業を週10時間以内に制限するっていう話が出てるんだけど、中野さんはチームリーダとしてどう思う？","textVersion":"sha256:cd8be6c9ee284c4a09f12141779791562767d4a1bcdb5ec1ed5372e7c9af0f74","audioVersion":"sha256:82b682dc0f5bcdbbab07810985556f81470f5c44757c12631ed01203a537266d","timelineVersion":"sha256:81d33a1c957df320829c081d951c056143ab27b7875f00baed1367cca5783d06","start":14.14,"end":23.83,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-1","text":"そうですね。確かに会社全体で無駄な残業をなくすのは必要なことですが、なんでも時間で区切ってしまうというのは。うちは商品開発部という性質上、アイディアを膨らませたり、企画を練ったり退社時間を気にせず、集中したいっていう時がありますから。","textVersion":"sha256:cf148b16af018725d376d59c09ba0b67852771f5069d45c0c83b16b44c9d63f7","audioVersion":"sha256:82b682dc0f5bcdbbab07810985556f81470f5c44757c12631ed01203a537266d","timelineVersion":"sha256:81d33a1c957df320829c081d951c056143ab27b7875f00baed1367cca5783d06","start":24.21,"end":43.32,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-2","text":"現場としては、そうなんだね。","textVersion":"sha256:e08f8231e73c0022302e1a01b465ec6781fa62418613fe7d3ab0bcd56e7bacb1","audioVersion":"sha256:82b682dc0f5bcdbbab07810985556f81470f5c44757c12631ed01203a537266d","timelineVersion":"sha256:81d33a1c957df320829c081d951c056143ab27b7875f00baed1367cca5783d06","start":43.83,"end":46.08,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:4:line-3","text":"女の人が言いたいことは何ですか。","textVersion":"sha256:ec52b06ffcbbdab6026b54f059304135dd807309e3fae4f705e0098c84e69cc5","audioVersion":"sha256:82b682dc0f5bcdbbab07810985556f81470f5c44757c12631ed01203a537266d","timelineVersion":"sha256:81d33a1c957df320829c081d951c056143ab27b7875f00baed1367cca5783d06","start":48.07,"end":54.93,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"7b557b710c269479"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5","examKey":"2019-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2019.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:a18f9093125308a39e256e676f5b1268de40cde97f33dc38e728e102f6a91192","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf80c8ae927152938c53953f50f4a33769e8cf9886256f1558de8f3432f91681","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2019.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2019-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5:question","text":"セミナーで林業の専門家が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:6f4b484d8462571c9ea7b68e16e14387ea1a2d18793120228565962f736834e6","audioVersion":"sha256:a18f9093125308a39e256e676f5b1268de40cde97f33dc38e728e102f6a91192","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf80c8ae927152938c53953f50f4a33769e8cf9886256f1558de8f3432f91681","start":5.5,"end":9.21,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"日本は昔から、木の文化と言われていますが、近年では、木造住宅の建築に、外国の木材が多く使われています。","textVersion":"sha256:8199175a730c61b1284ea39932b7cdcec74e308ace62222a82a2582bbc15df0e","audioVersion":"sha256:a18f9093125308a39e256e676f5b1268de40cde97f33dc38e728e102f6a91192","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf80c8ae927152938c53953f50f4a33769e8cf9886256f1558de8f3432f91681","start":10.98,"end":20.6,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"価格が安く、種類も豊富な輸入木材に、国産が押されているわけです。","textVersion":"sha256:5e2be58adf7dd0bf39ddbf792c01e3806f5424e90fbdf341e54ff9c45a11173f","audioVersion":"sha256:a18f9093125308a39e256e676f5b1268de40cde97f33dc38e728e102f6a91192","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf80c8ae927152938c53953f50f4a33769e8cf9886256f1558de8f3432f91681","start":21.2,"end":26.81,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"しかし、雨が多い日本で育った木は、梅雨の時期や高温で湿度の高い夏でも腐らず、冬の乾燥でも変形しないなど、日本の気候に非常によく合っていて、長く使うことができるんです。","textVersion":"sha256:8d05eeb5d85fc481209b6191869d9d8f38d5ad5a74e8aca83e5fa91344e0c999","audioVersion":"sha256:a18f9093125308a39e256e676f5b1268de40cde97f33dc38e728e102f6a91192","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf80c8ae927152938c53953f50f4a33769e8cf9886256f1558de8f3432f91681","start":27.19,"end":42.34,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"百年前の木造の家だって、手入れすればまだ住めるほどです。","textVersion":"sha256:2c2f4caa7799688dbc81e9c77740ad26884587dd13bb351efac8d2ccde08c396","audioVersion":"sha256:a18f9093125308a39e256e676f5b1268de40cde97f33dc38e728e102f6a91192","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf80c8ae927152938c53953f50f4a33769e8cf9886256f1558de8f3432f91681","start":43.23,"end":48.33,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"もう一度、見直してもらいたいですね。","textVersion":"sha256:741ec8fa6337632c9fcf87d82f510fd6cf2dfb3c30ea4f32b618364597c97914","audioVersion":"sha256:a18f9093125308a39e256e676f5b1268de40cde97f33dc38e728e102f6a91192","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf80c8ae927152938c53953f50f4a33769e8cf9886256f1558de8f3432f91681","start":48.84,"end":51.07,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2019-12:5:line-1","text":"専門家は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:8ab96d1fe3745aad91a577790f0983bae1fdf6856443f4bcdf410effaaf10b43","audioVersion":"sha256:a18f9093125308a39e256e676f5b1268de40cde97f33dc38e728e102f6a91192","timelineVersion":"sha256:bf80c8ae927152938c53953f50f4a33769e8cf9886256f1558de8f3432f91681","start":52.98,"end":60.15,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"7b557b710c269479"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-1.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":1,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-1.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:83b4ccfecbb2dc636b946c12dcd4afd950f1ae14f0412f6e21fa249d833c4fef","timelineVersion":"sha256:794c349da25fc89d8634bbd8bff45a449da1d429f04500d913bf3990c9bc1998","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1:question","text":"テレビでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:8fdb6969009d3021aa40bc2145c9877906af3b49491bd86948656ad3e20f7644","audioVersion":"sha256:83b4ccfecbb2dc636b946c12dcd4afd950f1ae14f0412f6e21fa249d833c4fef","timelineVersion":"sha256:794c349da25fc89d8634bbd8bff45a449da1d429f04500d913bf3990c9bc1998","start":5.3,"end":8.03,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-0.segment-0","text":"北村市では来月『みかんの会』というグループが活動を始めます。","textVersion":"sha256:843b3b94fe608f8bdb972b89646c29afef583e765b6ff98691085b08593ca2e7","audioVersion":"sha256:83b4ccfecbb2dc636b946c12dcd4afd950f1ae14f0412f6e21fa249d833c4fef","timelineVersion":"sha256:794c349da25fc89d8634bbd8bff45a449da1d429f04500d913bf3990c9bc1998","start":9.73,"end":14.66,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-0.segment-1","text":"この会は、住民同士がつながり、交流を深めることを目的に市民が主体的に活動するもので、一人暮らしのお年寄りを訪問するようなボランティア活動をしたり、バザーなどのイベントを企画したりするそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:9dfc4c6c81b50bb7858a63681c10c57062b815a0ed98e788b76c0238b21631fb","audioVersion":"sha256:83b4ccfecbb2dc636b946c12dcd4afd950f1ae14f0412f6e21fa249d833c4fef","timelineVersion":"sha256:794c349da25fc89d8634bbd8bff45a449da1d429f04500d913bf3990c9bc1998","start":15.03,"end":29.03,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-0.segment-2","text":"名前からは「みかんを栽培する会」かなと想像するかもしれませんが、みかんの木はほかの果物に比べて育てやすく、半年あれば収穫できることから、みかんが実るように成果を出したい、という意味をこめて名付けたそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:ee8a10ea166895bed485fa937bc6662dfb1f10eeb4510925b626ae043f8398b7","audioVersion":"sha256:83b4ccfecbb2dc636b946c12dcd4afd950f1ae14f0412f6e21fa249d833c4fef","timelineVersion":"sha256:794c349da25fc89d8634bbd8bff45a449da1d429f04500d913bf3990c9bc1998","start":29.82,"end":46.1,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-0.segment-3","text":"親しみのもてる名前で、今後の活動も楽しみですね。","textVersion":"sha256:cf2486d9da0bc75256ca948d6fbd9a1039a435e6c5cfe76efbab7dc1a2d6f8c2","audioVersion":"sha256:83b4ccfecbb2dc636b946c12dcd4afd950f1ae14f0412f6e21fa249d833c4fef","timelineVersion":"sha256:794c349da25fc89d8634bbd8bff45a449da1d429f04500d913bf3990c9bc1998","start":46.79,"end":50.37,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:1:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1673c6b733a690adbb707ef47c46062fdbdcbd22d253b9eaed3d67372d7d4c2a","audioVersion":"sha256:83b4ccfecbb2dc636b946c12dcd4afd950f1ae14f0412f6e21fa249d833c4fef","timelineVersion":"sha256:794c349da25fc89d8634bbd8bff45a449da1d429f04500d913bf3990c9bc1998","start":56.09,"end":59.51,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6060722edac65281"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-2.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":2,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-2.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:question","text":"講演会で女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:ec07ea825689acbbfa24ff47c5a7b81a5f96cb81916ed7d028d5b9863ddfc30b","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":5.24,"end":8.46,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0.segment-0","text":"私は今は、山にのぼって自然の写真を撮る仕事をしているんですが、もともとは花屋で働いてたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:f564c4cb522fa4604bdd6b1ae2bcc00d501d118f002126d5671748f477b264f5","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":10.25,"end":18.68,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0.segment-1","text":"ある日、通勤の途中、駅に貼られた大きなポスターを見たんですが、それが見たこともない美しい花の写真だったんです。","textVersion":"sha256:a7417f1da528ce19d117233c9b194d901f8d8d9b8118aeed9c0a97be8501cb08","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":19.33,"end":28.72,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0.segment-2","text":"調べたら、外国の山に咲いている珍しい花で、山専門の写真家が撮影したものでした。","textVersion":"sha256:ff3a5da2066a17635e11319281f7c705628412b8ff84ad8ee30a2cb08099a6a0","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":28.93,"end":36.41,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0.segment-3","text":"花屋のわたしが知らない花が、この世界にはたくさんある。","textVersion":"sha256:470cdda1427520414d11d386dd95d110f597ea2f4b0e56c98856cfd69e5d79d5","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":37.15,"end":41.24,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0.segment-4","text":"その事実に気づいて、雷にうたれたようになりました。","textVersion":"sha256:450fa9b3f6499ee2a2c9b6ea24bd7b1402e209a73f7b364028052276809b2488","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":41.75,"end":45.73,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0.segment-5","text":"それで、すぐにその写真家に連絡して、弟子にしてくださいってお願いしたんです。","textVersion":"sha256:95afa4b4f47d6f898c6aa0f8970079302f15d1e378ee4857a602c8150f674476","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":46.68,"end":52.57,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-0.segment-6","text":"どんな苦労が待っているかも知らずに、どうしてもあの花を自分の目で見たいと思った、あの時の気持ちは、今もよく覚えています。","textVersion":"sha256:fc74e777ffca86ecc83a46dccce132035a86a5c07cf8a2c2e9fd95755dfd6a18","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":53.49,"end":63.77,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:2:line-1","text":"女の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7e8a32195345cb90500b7129a6f116813d5545b0f07a7f6d9b9c168efbf7ed61","audioVersion":"sha256:235ebdc1fdfa7a758303e53f465547350101be347d24bfd81dfdba27f08866ce","timelineVersion":"sha256:01b0d4469c46252e2c263352d180b8ef2447f02b82025092e5a45acc42cb90af","start":69.52,"end":72.86,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6060722edac65281"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-3.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":3,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-3.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:dbdaa88a5393058e156ea9069dd5afb6a0ebafb8ee1a061428fe5ff288130190","timelineVersion":"sha256:707eac03f210a8fe6ce7efc04c9c00fefa40c7d3936f0ea559bde80390188940","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3:question","text":"ラジオで男の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:0ccf292cc278e347a153fb220db53863294b915454a13e60786dc44ccb1b7d1e","audioVersion":"sha256:dbdaa88a5393058e156ea9069dd5afb6a0ebafb8ee1a061428fe5ff288130190","timelineVersion":"sha256:707eac03f210a8fe6ce7efc04c9c00fefa40c7d3936f0ea559bde80390188940","start":5.65,"end":8.54,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-0.segment-0","text":"えー、『虹色の僕ら』というアニメ、皆さんはテレビでご覧になったことがあるでしょうか。","textVersion":"sha256:8fef5a6697278ea290be3bcce81ef14370a4e5181a41409cdd89a178d72f9d49","audioVersion":"sha256:dbdaa88a5393058e156ea9069dd5afb6a0ebafb8ee1a061428fe5ff288130190","timelineVersion":"sha256:707eac03f210a8fe6ce7efc04c9c00fefa40c7d3936f0ea559bde80390188940","start":10.26,"end":16.74,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-0.segment-1","text":"このアニメは独特の世界観と予想を裏切るストーリー展開で、多くのファンに支持されていますが、海外でも多くの人のこころをつかみ、評判が高まっているんだそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:ca85358e0c094142cdf18fe59c17e9a401d73fccc9465e657240024c28bd60ab","audioVersion":"sha256:dbdaa88a5393058e156ea9069dd5afb6a0ebafb8ee1a061428fe5ff288130190","timelineVersion":"sha256:707eac03f210a8fe6ce7efc04c9c00fefa40c7d3936f0ea559bde80390188940","start":17.13,"end":29.39,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-0.segment-2","text":"現在、海外の25カ国で放送されていて、原作のマンガも五つの言語に翻訳されています。","textVersion":"sha256:6dc938739dd3fdd610ecf3e3dbc1a00b65cd0915e32e47b86004042ea6d07436","audioVersion":"sha256:dbdaa88a5393058e156ea9069dd5afb6a0ebafb8ee1a061428fe5ff288130190","timelineVersion":"sha256:707eac03f210a8fe6ce7efc04c9c00fefa40c7d3936f0ea559bde80390188940","start":29.86,"end":37.05,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-0.segment-3","text":"昨年、長編アニメとして映画化されましたが、そのDVDの海外での売上も好調だそうです。","textVersion":"sha256:e948083f59562c664b2d6c72635a4a27581181097236e20551eb5e285a15f945","audioVersion":"sha256:dbdaa88a5393058e156ea9069dd5afb6a0ebafb8ee1a061428fe5ff288130190","timelineVersion":"sha256:707eac03f210a8fe6ce7efc04c9c00fefa40c7d3936f0ea559bde80390188940","start":37.58,"end":44.92,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-0.segment-4","text":"日本にとどまらず、世界中でファンを獲得しているようです。","textVersion":"sha256:3aecc9b0f59a930a68be88f15ea59853d0d6505ca1077cb1b67cac9bd1fe7ef0","audioVersion":"sha256:dbdaa88a5393058e156ea9069dd5afb6a0ebafb8ee1a061428fe5ff288130190","timelineVersion":"sha256:707eac03f210a8fe6ce7efc04c9c00fefa40c7d3936f0ea559bde80390188940","start":45.87,"end":49.93,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:3:line-1","text":"男の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:6a567450aa9d4c3eea3f1f4a983ee5ae7387dbd1c20a68f26deb34e384d773ac","audioVersion":"sha256:dbdaa88a5393058e156ea9069dd5afb6a0ebafb8ee1a061428fe5ff288130190","timelineVersion":"sha256:707eac03f210a8fe6ce7efc04c9c00fefa40c7d3936f0ea559bde80390188940","start":55.67,"end":59.2,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6060722edac65281"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-4.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":4,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-4.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:question","text":"会社の食堂で男の人と女の人が話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:154274f2aaf5ebc648b333e955b49916cbd4cdff030c9791048ec4620c67de51","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":5.59,"end":10.2,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-0","text":"あれ、木村さん、今日は魚の定食にしたの。いつもうどんなのに、珍しいね。","textVersion":"sha256:0fb4c214a504c4bba984c529bcd41351d2f676338c94cfbfa0ed541f965b76d0","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":12.12,"end":20.53,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-1","text":"うん、定食だとサラダがついてるから、先週の健康診断の時パンフレットをもらったんだけど、必要な栄養を取るには野菜、一日に350g食べなきゃいけないんだって。","textVersion":"sha256:0defe6a43240c149d9390a3ecd8398bd10657f63b417b6123396a7c691663778","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":20.65,"end":35.08,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-2","text":"え、そんなに。","textVersion":"sha256:1e2928006b9dc6d80539d671975c5c078711415ab4c0e217728f130619d53a7c","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":35.37,"end":36.7,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-3","text":"わたし、全然足りてないなと思って、朝はパンとコーヒーだけだったし、お昼は会社でうどんばっかりだったから、食生活に問題あるなって。","textVersion":"sha256:bf1bb746a9335d44254b815534a21d0a689190737d94f9c8baef93a34c75bae5","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":36.89,"end":48.66,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-4","text":"うーん、たしかにそれだと健康的とは言えないね。","textVersion":"sha256:bc85b4ac342b8a769c96c015e7b969bf768e8d04593999f2ea7ddea8ed8bb7e2","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":49.03,"end":52.925,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-5","text":"うん。夜はもともと家でちゃんとご飯作るようにしてたけど、それだけじゃ、なかなか350gも取れないし。","textVersion":"sha256:cf3d83abc877d52d9ed5ed78cfc7699296969ac99de9de13630b9f9fe472efb4","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":52.87,"end":62.36,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-6","text":"でも、ぼくも似たようなもんかもしれないなあ。野菜はもともとそんなに好きじゃないし。","textVersion":"sha256:25bd720b1e160644b873b77214ff06e058e0e1e4e5296f53632912c066f68d6c","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":62.49,"end":68.58,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-7","text":"あと、朝に野菜ジュースを作って飲むことにしたの。野菜だけだと飲みにくいけど、りんごとか果物も入れるとおいしいんだ。","textVersion":"sha256:b93df9298c116e4a2a162b4154a9dc7147343e7f9cdb6e01e6c4c8928cffbf07","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":69.04,"end":79.02,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-8","text":"へえ、それはいいね。","textVersion":"sha256:5b781e958add349c123beddf7d948f6285e0621d8251687e96d1d2c6c351a392","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":79.05,"end":81.02,"speaker":"男"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:4:line-9","text":"女の人は何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:7e8a32195345cb90500b7129a6f116813d5545b0f07a7f6d9b9c168efbf7ed61","audioVersion":"sha256:531dca8da0aa0c527db15e828479198f9951daaadcf7b745f3b3a331ec92b05e","timelineVersion":"sha256:58422a7cfc88d61814192a46130f559539cd17984f2b0f086012abcf00c2ab7c","start":88.83,"end":92.31,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6060722edac65281"},"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-5.mp3":{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5","examKey":"2020-12","questionNumber":5,"audio":"/exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/assets/audio/2020.12-5.mp3","audioVersion":"sha256:ba31803de7d3a2bbdc315e956c48d2170ca7e07abde872ad2ca62ec3a779a940","timelineVersion":"sha256:69e290f583a376e0dc70db2f325dbea0af14d1e166cbf84fed337e8dbfad982a","pages":["exam/listening/summary-comprehension/n2/years/2020.html"],"batch":"n2-summary-2020-12.js","units":[{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5:question","text":"テレビの天気予報のコーナーでアナウンサーが話しています。","textVersion":"sha256:7d092f6f8704019dcba628d9f3d77fb03f6b88c7ef1d0e0b0822bc4551d6a721","audioVersion":"sha256:ba31803de7d3a2bbdc315e956c48d2170ca7e07abde872ad2ca62ec3a779a940","timelineVersion":"sha256:69e290f583a376e0dc70db2f325dbea0af14d1e166cbf84fed337e8dbfad982a","start":5.54,"end":10.05,"speaker":"题目"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-0.segment-0","text":"子供の頃、雲ってどこからくるのかなって思っていませんでしたか。","textVersion":"sha256:3e742a2818884994b7a5538682fa916bf9370dad53cc4036ce5f7b8ac23e0287","audioVersion":"sha256:ba31803de7d3a2bbdc315e956c48d2170ca7e07abde872ad2ca62ec3a779a940","timelineVersion":"sha256:69e290f583a376e0dc70db2f325dbea0af14d1e166cbf84fed337e8dbfad982a","start":11.76,"end":16.39,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-0.segment-1","text":"雲はあたたかい海水が水蒸気になり、それが冷やされてできたり、森林から発生した水蒸気が空で冷やされてできたりします。","textVersion":"sha256:d1a88679f972625e03a942cd8a07da01d110689cffd9371d8d439181fd0d89df","audioVersion":"sha256:ba31803de7d3a2bbdc315e956c48d2170ca7e07abde872ad2ca62ec3a779a940","timelineVersion":"sha256:69e290f583a376e0dc70db2f325dbea0af14d1e166cbf84fed337e8dbfad982a","start":16.77,"end":26.96,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-0.segment-2","text":"自動車や工場から出る煙と水蒸気が雲になる場合もあります。","textVersion":"sha256:b49783fcc8f2bb2069f4528959c78aacab545c0d77d0d958af2d623f837f1e72","audioVersion":"sha256:ba31803de7d3a2bbdc315e956c48d2170ca7e07abde872ad2ca62ec3a779a940","timelineVersion":"sha256:69e290f583a376e0dc70db2f325dbea0af14d1e166cbf84fed337e8dbfad982a","start":27.66,"end":32.61,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-0.segment-3","text":"また、あたたかい空気と冷たい空気がぶつかった境目にもできます。","textVersion":"sha256:9aa79bb026c04cdc351c5ea44576502d2578d96b05762c1bf2a6b73527c78357","audioVersion":"sha256:ba31803de7d3a2bbdc315e956c48d2170ca7e07abde872ad2ca62ec3a779a940","timelineVersion":"sha256:69e290f583a376e0dc70db2f325dbea0af14d1e166cbf84fed337e8dbfad982a","start":32.94,"end":38.17,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-0.segment-4","text":"雲が絨毯のように広がる美しい景色で有名な観光地がありますが、そのような景色もいくつかの条件のもと、空気が冷やされることで見られるんですよ。","textVersion":"sha256:1d9d08dd0d8bd16b4087a2286c6bb4be9d9dc468de6ae3438991849731b68f46","audioVersion":"sha256:ba31803de7d3a2bbdc315e956c48d2170ca7e07abde872ad2ca62ec3a779a940","timelineVersion":"sha256:69e290f583a376e0dc70db2f325dbea0af14d1e166cbf84fed337e8dbfad982a","start":38.55,"end":50.47,"speaker":"女"},{"questionId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5","unitId":"n2:summary-comprehension:2020-12:5:line-1","text":"アナウンサーは何について話していますか。","textVersion":"sha256:1673c6b733a690adbb707ef47c46062fdbdcbd22d253b9eaed3d67372d7d4c2a","audioVersion":"sha256:ba31803de7d3a2bbdc315e956c48d2170ca7e07abde872ad2ca62ec3a779a940","timelineVersion":"sha256:69e290f583a376e0dc70db2f325dbea0af14d1e166cbf84fed337e8dbfad982a","start":56.19,"end":59.52,"speaker":"問"}],"batchVersion":"6060722edac65281"}},"version":"sha256:1064866060319858a7b2777cb48c4524ce04b21ee766374b1fee87eeae91cae3"};
